1960 Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-95817b1a879dc5f847a0aaefa65f6af3,en,restaurant,"{'label': '1960 Restaurant, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60149, 'lng': 104.18492}","[{'lat': 10.60145, 'lng': 104.18479}]",18904,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-064', 'name': 'International'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25170331'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512236458'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon, Wed-Sun: 11:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T110000', 'duration': 'PT13H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kampot,10.601469,104.18485,25170331,1960 Restaurant,"Passion, tradition, history and creativity fused in the kitchen of 1960 bringing to your plate authentic Cambodian cuisine. There's something for everyone. When you dine at 1960 Restaurant, you will get to enjoy delicious Cambodian cuisine surrounded by a beautiful garden while listening to the most famous voices of the Kingdom. During the 1960’s under the Khmer Rouge, the music scene was thriving, combining pop rock influences and traditional Cambodian music. Many of Cambodia’s traditional recipes have been forgotten and vanished with some of the best musicians… 1960 Restaurant has reopened the old traditional Cambodian cookbooks to put back on the menu some delicious dishes from the past. Located close to the center of Kampot, guests can choose to dine in the outdoor garden or in the indoor area with comfortable sitting. 1960 Restaurant is open everyday for lunch and dinner, and offers private dining and special events.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d25170331-Reviews-1960_Restaurant-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '701 Street', 'city': 'Kampot', 's