333 Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w636s-07a1f56df689422bb8a30846f03daf22,en,guest_house,"{'label': '333 Guesthouse, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.09943, 'lng': 103.19662}","[{'lat': 13.0993, 'lng': 103.1966}]",12289,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3324301'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855536330331'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.099454,103.19663,3324301,333 Guesthouse,"333 Guesthouse is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Battambang, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
As your “home away from home,” the guest house rooms offer air conditioning, a seating area, and a desk, and getting online is easy, with free internet access available.
Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, room service, and a concierge while staying at 333 Guesthouse. In addition, 333 Guesthouse offers an on-site restaurant, which will help make your Battambang trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
Close to some of Battambang's most popular landmarks, such as White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (0.1 mi) and Prasat Sneung (0.7 mi), 333 Guesthouse is a great destination for tourists.
If you like pubs, 333 Guesthouse is conveniently located near Bar Ang Restaurant & Bar, Madison, and Pomme.
If you are interested in exploring Battambang, check out a history museum, such as Mrs. Bun Roeung's Ancient House.
Enjoy your stay in Battambang!
