38-Thirty Eight Food & Drinks,here:pds:place:116w649s-be4c844c5de94fecbc7949d08491c748,en,casual_dining,"{'label': '38-Thirty Eight Food & Drinks, 121203 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ច្បារអំពៅ', 'subdistrict': 'និរោធ', 'postalCode': '121203'}","{'lat': 11.53481, 'lng': 104.95761}","[{'lat': 11.53488, 'lng': 104.95773}]",19719,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85587503838'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.551434,104.92536,2389107,Champei Spa & Salon #38,"Champei Spa and Salon is Operated in November 2006. It is spacious and thoughtfully designed to give each client the utmost relaxation, attention and care. Located in an exclusive area of Phnom Penh, ChamPei Spa and Salon is a perfect escape and well suited to cater to the city's business and professional elites.In May 2007, Champei Spa and Salon was selected as a pioneer spa in Phnom Penh and to participate in ASEAN Health and wellness Exhibition 2007 in Tokyo, Japan. After two years of its operation, Champei Spa and Salon have become an attrative center place for those who enjoy profressional massage and spa. Now, we set up a second branch called Champei II. Our Mission is to offer clients the ultimate place for relaxation and stress relief within serene and hygienic environment.Our staffs are well-trained by qualified trainers who have expertise in massage therapy, physical therapy and beauty care. All of them share with us a holistic vision in natural health",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d2389107-Reviews-Champei_Spa_Salon_38-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '1 #38, St 57, Bkk', 'street2': 'Tuolkork', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '1 #38, St 57, Bkk Tuolkork, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'n