7 Makara Hotel,here:pds:place:116d408k-54466309a0590c7962eeb243696489d7,en,accommodation,"{'label': '7 Makara Hotel, 030402 កំពង់ចាម, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'city': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'district': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'postalCode': '030402'}","{'lat': 11.99824, 'lng': 105.45889}","[{'lat': 11.99817, 'lng': 105.459}]",24326,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1977116'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855426955533'}, {'value': '+855889626667'}]}]",Not Available,Kampong Cham,11.998216,105.45866,1977116,7 Makara Hotel,"Welcome to 7 Makara Hotel, your Kampong Cham “home away from home.” 7 Makara Hotel aims to make your visit as relaxing and enjoyable as possible, which is why so many guests continue to come back year after year.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Wat Nokor (1.3 mi) and Ko Paen Bamboo Bridge (1.4 mi), guests of 7 Makara Hotel can easily experience some of Kampong Cham's most well known attractions.
Free wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at 7 Makara Hotel offer a minibar, a refrigerator, and a kitchenette.
During your stay, take advantage of some of the amenities offered, including a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and room service. Guests of 7 Makara Hotel are also welcome to enjoy a pool and free breakfast, located on site. For travelers arriving by car, free parking is available.
While in Kampong Cham be sure to experience local burritos favorites at Destiny Coffee House.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out The French Tower, which is a popular  amongst tourists.
7 Makara Hotel puts the best of Kampong Cham at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
