8 Elemento,here:pds:place:116aabd1-db56f3e60cae0f894663f6e4c46ca351,en,guest_house,"{'label': '8 Elemento, ក្រុងព្រះសីហនុ-កោះថ្មី, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'street': 'ក្រុងព្រះសីហនុ-កោះថ្មី'}","{'lat': 10.60459, 'lng': 103.52313}","[{'lat': 10.60459, 'lng': 103.52313}]",105444,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1586007'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569242966'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.605527,103.52395,1586007,8 Elemento,"The Cove Beach Bungalows are located right on the Serendipity Beach. 180 Meters to the right, from the pier on Serendipity Beach. The Cove Beach is located over a 60 meter hillside that has natural lush hillside facing the magnificent Serendipity Cove where we are located. We have 8 traditional Khmer style AC new wooden bungalows, 6 AC rooms 1/2 & 3 bed as well as two 3 bedroom apartments. Our final addition is two 4 person dorms. All AC bungalows and AC rooms are located in tropical garden settings and have covered balconies with spectacular ocean views. All rooms are equipped with cool-fans and a cold/hot water shower. The restaurant serves Western & Khmer dishes. We also boast a 25 meter chill deck over our beach side location and an 4 x 6 meter beach bar. Great for cocktails and ice cold beer when you need a retreat from the heat.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d1586007-Reviews-8_Elemento-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Serendipity Beach', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Serendipity Beach, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom