99 Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-a7efd927bd160530e1aa7bbc7561ceaa,en,accommodation,"{'label': '99 Guesthouse, 090701 ខេមរភូមិន្ទ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កោះកុង', 'city': 'ខេមរភូមិន្ទ', 'district': 'ស្មាច់មានជ័យ', 'postalCode': '090701'}","{'lat': 11.61182, 'lng': 102.98408}","[{'lat': 11.61195, 'lng': 102.98411}]",41405,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '700-7400-0292', 'name': 'Wellness Center & Services'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4885481'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855356600999'}, {'value': '+85569900099'}]}]",Not Available,Koh Kong,11.611684,102.98406,4885481,99 Guesthouse,"99 Guesthouse offers basic guestrooms with a private bathroom and free Wi-Fi. Featuring a terrace with seating on its 2nd floor, the guesthouse is a 10-minute walk from the nearest beach. The Bridge of Poa Island and a ferry dock are 500 metres from 99 Guesthouse while the floating village of Peam Krosoap is 6 km away. Ta Tai Beach and waterfall are a 30-minute drive from the property. Each air-conditioned or fan-cooled room provide city views, a flat-screen cable TV and desk. Private bathroom includes a shower, toilet and free toiletries. A safety deposit box and luggage storage is available at the 24-hour reception. The guesthouse has a tour desk and offers ticket services.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1532269-d4885481-Reviews-99_Guesthouse-Koh_Kong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '06 135 St.', 'street2': 'Smach Mean Chey Commune', 'city': 'Koh Kong', 'state': 'Koh Kong Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '09254', 'address_string': '06 135 St. Smach Mean Chey Commune, Koh Kong 09254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Koh Kong', 'location_id': '1532269'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Koh Kong Province', 'location_id': '2366667'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,N