9d Rides Siem Reap,here:pds:place:116w63gg-e1fec9182b793e0b87636fa5e3e3f039,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': '9d Rides Siem Reap, ផ្លូវជាតិ 63, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 63', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35521, 'lng': 103.85357}","[{'lat': 13.35519, 'lng': 103.85371}]",24859,"[{'id': '550-5520-0000', 'name': 'Leisure', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9559809'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855968183109'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.355208,103.85351,9559809,9D Rides Siem Reap,"We are Cambodias first 9D cinema, located on Sivatha Road in China Tang Market. If you are looking for something fun, exciting and something different then this is the right place. We have many rides with different effects: rain, bubbles, snow, fire, smell, smoke, wind, lightning, bum poking seats, moving platform. Come and FEEL what you SEE.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d9559809-Reviews-9D_Rides_Siem_Reap-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sivatha Road', 'street2': 'China Tang Market', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Sivatha Road China Tang Market, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,9d@9drides.com,+855 96 818 3109,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d9559809-9D_Rides_Siem_Reap-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#17 of 51 Fun &amp; Games in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '51', 'ranking': '17'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,6,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '6'}",Not available,6,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d9559809-m66827-Reviews-9D_Rides_Siem_Reap-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'fun_games', 'localized_name': 'Fun & Games'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Fun & Games', 'localized_name': 'Fun & Games', 'categories': [{'name': 'Game & Entertainment Centers', 'localized_name': 'Game & Entertainment Centers'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '1'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '2'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '2'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,32,20
A Nik Palace Hotel,here:pds:place:1169fe79-37b28f39dc7cdec876ff89aff5a0d166,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'A Nik Palace Hotel, ផ្លូវ 123 278, 120109 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទួលទំពូងទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 123', 'postalCode': '120109', 'houseNumber': '278'}","{'lat': 11.53763, 'lng': 104.91734}","[{'lat': 11.53763, 'lng': 104.91747}]",22623,"[{'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523955544'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.555143,104.924164,19686127,Anik Palace Hotel,"Welcome to Anik Palace Hotel which has an appearance of a castle, all guestrooms, and public areas are beautifully designed with a European classical theme in both its interior and exterior. It is superbly located in the glorious city of the Kingdom of Cambodia. The exterior look of the hotel building draws from the history of Cambodia – dating back to the year 1863 when Cambodia was ruled by the French Colony and was only then granted independence in the mid-1900s when Prince Norodom Sihanouk became king. Anik Palace hotel’s exterior concept took inspiration from this event in order to display Cambodia’s history and all the hardships that our country has gone through and what it had overcome. The bricks used for the structure’s exterior design is over 100 years old. Whether you are traveling for business or leisure you will find yourself in one of the best locations in Phnom Penh, with some of the city’s finest dining, shopping, entertainment, and as well as a nearby market venue all within walking distance.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d19686127-Reviews-Anik_Palace_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#14, Street 278', 'street2': 'Sangkat Boeung Keng Kang I', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12302', 'address_string': '#14, Street 278 Sangkat Boeung Keng Kang I, Phnom Penh 12302 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d19686127-Anik_Palace_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#17 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '17'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,256,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '5', '4': '26', '5': '224'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",483,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d19686127-m66827-Reviews-Anik_Palace_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Suites', 'Room service', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Wheelchair access', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Spa', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Dry Cleaning', 'Meeting rooms', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Fitness center', 'Laundry Service', 'Concierge', 'Banquet 