A&A Café & Pub,here:pds:place:116w649g-8722c62c22e844c4853ca069489d0cce,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'A&A Café & Pub, ផ្លូវ ទន្លេមេគង្គ, 121001 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ជ្រោយចង្វារ', 'subdistrict': 'ជ្រោយចង្វារ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ទន្លេមេគង្គ', 'postalCode': '121001'}","{'lat': 11.57196, 'lng': 104.93692}","[{'lat': 11.57208, 'lng': 104.93684}]",72548,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578484881'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://goo.gl/maps/rtVoiuWY1Yk'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.544974,104.9231,6619990,Arthur and Paul (A&P),"First ""men only"" boutique-hotel in the capital of Cambodia. French designed, this modern meeting place is built with noble materials which are designed to create an atmosphere of relaxation and intimacy. Let yourself be transported by its ideal location 2 minutes walk from famous Pasteur Street with many shops and restaurants and 5 minutes by tuk tuk from Central Market, the National Museum, the Royal Palace or Sisowath Quay along the Mekong River. Let yourself be welcomed, pampered, massaged by an exclusively male staff providing highest quality service to the greatest degrees of elegance and discretion. Be enchanted by the poetry or Arthur & Paul which will rhyme your emotions, suit your desires of the day: from poetry to sustenance, from room to room, between SPA, steam baths, Jacuzzi, the natural swimming pool with its long lap pool and of course the restaurant and the bar.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d6619990-Reviews-Arthur_and_Paul_A_P-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '27 Street 71', 'street2': 'BKK1', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '27 Street 71 BKK1, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'loca