ABC-Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w649e-9145c9b5b3db413889c169846af4826d,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'ABC-Cambodia, ផ្លូវ 101 16, 120111 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងត្របែក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 101', 'postalCode': '120111', 'houseNumber': '16'}","{'lat': 11.54135, 'lng': 104.92075}","[{'lat': 11.54122, 'lng': 104.92075}]",6843,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15873841'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85581424789'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://abc-cambodia.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.538156,104.92144,15873841,ABC-Cambodia,"Dutch hosted B&B in Phnom Penh, Cambodia. New super clean rooms with breakfast and free flow coffee and tea. (Air-conditioned, hot shower with power!) For pleasure or business, you can stay in our home and explore the many opportunities Phnom Penh has got to offer. Located in the heart of Phnom Penh, Cambodia. 5 Minute walk to the famous Russian Market. 20 minutes to the Royal Palace. ABC-Cambodia a place to come home to.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d15873841-Reviews-ABC_Cambodia-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'BB15-BB16, St 101', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'BB15-BB16, St 101, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d15873841-ABC_Cambodia-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#32 of 351 Specialty lodging in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '351', 'ranking': '32'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,21,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4