Above US Only Sky Bar & Bungalows,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-572d7e3a11924f7a87f4a11d369c7385,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Above US Only Sky Bar & Bungalows, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.60675, 'lng': 103.52066}","[{'lat': 10.60688, 'lng': 103.52067}]",105161,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1639256'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855884268030', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1000-0001'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011'}]}, {'value': '+855977447350'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.606221,103.52052,1639256,Above Us Only Sky Bar & Bungalows,"Centrally located on Serendipity Beach, Sihanoukville, Cambodia. We have five detached deluxe beachfront bungalows with uninterrupted views of the sea and islands. Our bar serves beer in ice-chilled glasses, as well as an extensive range of the top cocktails we're famed for. Delicious local and Western cuisine can be enjoyed along with ocean views. Our bungalows have hot showers, fridge, fan or air-con, mosquito net, and free Wi-fi. There's also room to stretch out on the balcony for some chilled out days and nights, listening to the sound of the sea just below you.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d1639256-Reviews-Above_Us_Only_Sky_Bar_Bungalows-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Serendipity Beach', 'street2': '40meters From Boat Pier to Islands', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Serendipity Beach 40meters From Boat Pier to Islands, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanou