Absolute Boutique Hotel,here:pds:place:116w63u5-8a08331540ad4b5187f62466a532a05a,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Absolute Boutique Hotel, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36492, 'lng': 103.84785}","[{'lat': 13.36493, 'lng': 103.84785}]",24490,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6525148'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563765508'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.364923,103.84785,6525148,Absolute Boutique Hotel,"Welcome to Absolute Boutique Hotel Nestled in the heart of central Siem Reap, Absolute Boutique Hotel is an ideal spot from which to discover the surroundings. The hotel, which lies 1.5 Km from the city centre and provides accessibility to important attractions and facilities. With its convenient location, the hotel offers easy access to the city's must-see destinations. By Tuk Tuk (the most common form of taxi in Cambodia)it takes you only 3-5 minutes to reach Siem Reap's old market area and famous Pub Street, the most fascinating area of Siem Reap. In particularly we are near the renowned 12th century ruins of Angkor - A renown World Heritage site. At Absolute Boutique Hotel, the excellent service and superior facilities make for an unforgettable stay, comprising three modern spacious rooms, one on-suite and two deluxe in stylish Khmer design and ultimate privacy. While lodging at this wonderful property, guests can enjoy room service, smoking area, tours, 24-hour room service, bar. All guest accommodations feature thoughtful amenities to ensure an unparalleled sense of comfort. The hotel's outdoor pool, garden, fitness centre are ideal places to relax and unwind after a busy day. Whatever your reason for visiting Siem Reap, the Absolute Boutique Hotel is the perfect venue for an exhilarating and exciting break away.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d6525148-Reviews-Absolute_Boutique_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Bakheng St., Svay Dangkum, Central', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Bakheng St., Svay Dangkum, Central, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d6525148-Absolute_Boutique_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#299 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '299'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,5,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '5'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",37,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-