Adan World,here:pds:place:116aabd1-fe64ba5da56b091d2fc24d14812ce940,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Adan World, ផ្លូវ បាខែង, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ បាខែង', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36371, 'lng': 103.85133}","[{'lat': 13.36358, 'lng': 103.85135}]",24325,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6429042'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593633993'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.364132,103.85147,6429042,Adan World,"Adan World is greatest hostel with bed and breakfast. Located in central Siem Reap, just 5 minutes by tuk tuk ride from the Lucky Mall, Old Market, Night Market, and Pub Street. A great place to begin your search…. Get Low Prices!! Cheaper Stay!! Super Safe!! No Worries!!* Free Tax & Service Charge* Free Pick-up & drop-of* Free American Breakfast* Free Tea & Coffee* Free bananas* Free wifi 24 hurs* Free Safety Box* Free Tour/City information* Free City/Temple Map* Free postcards deliveryt* Free local calling phone* 24hrs Security* All Rooms Are Non-Smoking!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d6429042-Reviews-Adan_World-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Psa Gner Street, Ta Poul Village, Svay DongKom', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '855', 'address_string': 'Psa Gner Street, Ta Poul Village, Svay DongKom, Siem Reap 855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d6429042-Adan_World-Siem_R