Adventure Dome Resort,here:pds:place:116w3f5y-d68b5d2e612348ada438e33c07d3e044,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Adventure Dome Resort, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.51049, 'lng': 104.32782}","[{'lat': 10.51049, 'lng': 104.32768}]",3055,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '20094552'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85566645366'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://facebook.com/adventuredomeresort'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.510424,104.32938,20094552,Adventure Dome Resort,"Adventure Dome Resort has a restaurant, bar, a garden and terrace in Phumĭ Krâsăng. A hot tub and a bicycle rental service are available for guests. The accommodation features a 24-hour front desk and room service for guests. The rooms in the resort are fitted with a flat-screen TV. At Adventure Dome Resort, rooms are fitted with air conditioning and a private bathroom. The accommodation offers an American or Asian breakfast. Kep is 3.7 km from Adventure Dome Resort, while Kampot is 20 km from the property. The nearest airport is Sihanoukville International Airport, 76 km from the resort.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d20094552-Reviews-Adventure_Dome_Resort-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Kao Krasang Village', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '22101', 'address_string': 'Kao Krasang Village, Kep 22101 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d20094552-Adventure_Dome_Resort-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_string': '#33 of 71 B