Adventures Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w63u5-7c910f0a24b84d948e00ca748c49c2ea,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Adventures Cambodia, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.38253, 'lng': 103.86125}","[{'lat': 13.38253, 'lng': 103.86125}]",22078,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13951299'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512861610'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://adventurescambodia.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.382534,103.86125,13951299,Adventures Cambodia,"Ready for an amazing trip across beautiful Cambodia? Explore the country's culture, food, and nature with Adventures Cambodia, the original Vespa tour company in Siem Reap! See incredible temples like Angkor Wat and try delicious local food. Our passionate guides, who know Cambodia well, will make sure you have a trip you'll never forget. Each tour is like a story, showing you the best of Cambodia. Why choose Adventures Cambodia? We've been doing this for 10 years and know how to make every tour amazing. We were the first company to offer Vespa tours in Siem Reap, so you can experience Cambodia in a fun and unique way. Your safety and comfort are important to us. We provide excellent service and are the perfect choice for curious travelers!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d13951299-Reviews-Adventures_Cambodia-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Wat Damnak area, Krong Siem Reap', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Wat Damnak area, Krong Siem Reap, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]