Akd School Battambang,here:pds:place:116w633e-31aa7ae41208939a3af7f2819f44e0fd,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Akd School Battambang, 020102 បាណន់, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាណន់', 'district': 'កន្ទីពីរ', 'postalCode': '020102'}","{'lat': 12.95132, 'lng': 103.14148}","[{'lat': 12.95142, 'lng': 103.14159}]",10410,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10039217'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512326784'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://akdproject.com/akd-bike-tours'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,12.951217,103.14135,10039217,AKD School Battambang,"The profit made by AKD Tours is used TO FUND our AKD English School. It’s a wonderful place where underprivileged Cambodian children get the opportunity to build themselves a better future by providing them with free English language classes given by local teachers and foreign volunteers. There is also TUK TUK TOURS (Price = per tuk tuk). Half day tour: morning or afternoon. Full day tour: includes lunch. Tuk Tuk can take up to 7 people: 1 or 2 people: Half day: $15 / Full day: $30. 3 or 4 people: Half day: $20/ Full day: $40. 5, 6 or 7 people: Half day: $25 / Full day: $50. BICYCLE TOURS (Price per person). Half day (morning or afternoon) or full day: both include breakfast & lunch. Half day: Adult: $20 pP. Student ID: $15 pP. Kids 5-17 years old: $10 pP. Full day: Adult: $35 pP. Student ID: $30 pP. Kids 5-17y: $15 pP.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d10039217-Reviews-AKD_School_Battambang-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Battambang Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_