Alicoco Motel & Camping,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-094c1980acad4ef2bcf1034b610de2ec,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Alicoco Motel & Camping, ផ្លូវ 33 អេ, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 33 អេ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.50625, 'lng': 104.29009}","[{'lat': 10.50632, 'lng': 104.28989}]",6555,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+855319559966'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.palmhousekep.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.540632,104.32088,11983529,Alicoco Motel & Camping,"Finding an ideal motel in Kep does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Alicoco Motel & Camping, a nice option for travelers like you.
While staying at Alicoco Motel & Camping, visitors can check out Patio (2.5 mi) and Sothy's Pepper Farm (2.7 mi), some of Kep's top attractions.
The rooms offer air conditioning, a kitchenette, and a desk, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
Alicoco Motel & Camping features room service, 24 hour check-in, and baggage storage. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
Alicoco Motel & Camping looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Kep.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d11983529-Reviews-Alicoco_Motel_Camping-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 33A National road', 'street2': 'Krong Kaeb', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07503', 'address_string': 'No. 33A National road Krong Kaeb, Kep 07503 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d11983529-Alicoco_Motel_Camping-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},20,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d11983529-m66827-Reviews-Alicoco_Motel_Camping-Kep_Kep_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Shuttle Bus Service', 'Room service', 'Free parking', 'Pets Allowed', 'Kitchenette', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Dry Cleaning', 'Laundry Service', 'Air conditioning', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Parking', 'Housekeeping', 'Baggage Storage', 'Bath / Shower', 'Bicycle Rental', 'Bicycles Available', 'Boating', 'Car Hire', '24-Hour Check-in', 'Clothes Rack', 'Desk', 'English', 'Complimentary Toiletries', 'Hiking', 'Horseback Riding', 'Ironing Service', 'Khmer', 'Kitchenware', 'Massage', 'Seating Area', '24-Hour Security', 'Soundproof Rooms', 'Taxi Service', 'Thai']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway',