Alis' House Homestay,here:pds:place:116w63u5-0f05f362846a4acaabdc928e59c8d444,en,hostel,"{'label': ""Alis' House Homestay, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37366, 'lng': 103.86264}","[{'lat': 13.37375, 'lng': 103.86274}]",22681,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13440658'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23394000'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512365344'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://AlisHouseSR.wordpress.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.373692,103.86266,13440658,Alis' House Homestay,"Alis' House is a traditional Khmer home and operates as a homestay with the owner living on site. We have converted our dormitory rooms to group rooms in response to traveler concerns of being in close proximity to others you don't know. These two rooms accommodate groups up to 6 adults each. We also have 2 private double rooms, and a family suite (2 rooms, sleeping 4 adults). Located between downtown/Pub Street and Angkor Wat, and near several night markets, we are near the history and entertainment of Siem Reap but located in a quiet neighborhood, surrounded by resorts and dining options. We excel in helping our guests plan their tours and in connecting them to wonderful experiences at good value. As Cambodia once again opens to foreigners, please join us and let us help you have a wonderful time!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d13440658-Reviews-Alis_House_Homestay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#0140 Mondul 3 Village, Sangkat Sla Kram', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17251', 'address_string': '#0140 Mondul 3 Village, Sangkat Sla Kram, Siem Reap 17251 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d13440658-Alis_House_Homestay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#138 of 449 Specialty lodging in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '449', 'ranking': '138'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,12,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '3', '5': '9'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",48,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d13440658-m66827-Reviews-Alis_House_Homestay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Suites', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Air conditioning', 'Family Rooms', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Kids Activities', 'Airport transportation', 'Refrigerator in room', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Parking', 'Housekeeping', 'Archery Off-site', 'Baggage Storage', 'Bicycle Rental', 'Bicycle Tours', 'Board Games / Puzzles', 'Chapel / Shrine', '24-Hour Check-in', 'English', 'Complimentary Toiletries', 'French', 'Game Room', 'Khmer', 'Kitchenware', 'Private Bathrooms', 'Shared Kitchen', 'Stovetop', 'Tile / Marble Floor', 'Vending Machine', 'Wake Up Service / Alarm Clock', 'Walk-i