Almond Hotel Bassac River,here:pds:place:116w649e-cd5b867e0e44424e9908aa694fa20f94,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Almond Hotel Bassac River, ផ្លូវ សួនទន្លេបាសាក់, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សួនទន្លេបាសាក់', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.54431, 'lng': 104.9335}","[{'lat': 11.54453, 'lng': 104.93356}]",22085,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1182275'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7915650'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523220822'}, {'value': '+85523229922', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.544603,104.93365,7915650,Almond Hotel Bassac River,"The Almond Hotel Bassac River is situated in the heart of Phnom Penh. This boutique business hotel with 40 rooms is located along the banks of the Bassac River, where the Tonle Sap and Mekong River meet. With views of Diamond ""Koh Pich"" Island, the hotel is surrounded by lush gardens, green spaces, and peaceful waterways in the bustling urban center of the capital. Just a 5-minute walk away is Aeon Mall Phnom Penh, the city center’s largest shopping mall. Adding to its appeal is the on-site Sevensea Seafood Restaurant, a favored dining spot for both locals and international guests, offering Chinese-style cuisine, Cambodian specialties, and Japanese sashimi.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d7915650-Reviews-Almond_Hotel_Bassac_River-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'N 2 Next to Rainbow Bridge of Daimond Island', 'street2': 'Sangkat Tonle Bassac, Khan Chamkarmon', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12101', 'address_string': 'N 2 Next to Rainbow Bridge of Da