Alo Bong Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w649g-8b71f30bc07c4368bbbaa7814e151278,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Alo Bong Restaurant, ផ្លូវ 528, 120407 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ទួលគោក', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកក់ទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 528', 'postalCode': '120407'}","{'lat': 11.58061, 'lng': 104.90091}","[{'lat': 11.58074, 'lng': 104.90088}]",4255,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85586808066'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.560255,104.93021,12315921,Bong Bong Bong,"Bong Bong Bong is a very unique bar and street art gallery, in the heart of the trendiest neighborhood in Phnom Penh, you will always feel welcome. Friendly, alternative and arty, you will never see Cambodia the same way if you start you're trip by visiting us. A fresh place to start your night.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d12315921-Reviews-Bong_Bong_Bong-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '82 EO st 244', 'street2': 'Between Street 240 And Street 244, Better Know As Street 240 1/2', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12207', 'address_string': '82 EO st 244 Between Street 240 And Street 244, Better Know As Street 240 1/2, Phnom Penh 12207 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,gallerybongbongbong@gmail.com,+855 10 281 702,http://www.facebook.com/bongbongbongPP/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d12315921-Bong_Bong_Bong-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#5 of 29 Museums in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '29', 'ranking': '5'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/trave