Aloha Ono,here:pds:place:116aabd1-90594dcd959109f0b747682e1a27f92b,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Aloha Ono, ផ្លូវ 1019, 120802 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'សែនសុខ', 'subdistrict': 'ទឹកថ្លា', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 1019', 'postalCode': '120802'}","{'lat': 11.56241, 'lng': 104.87068}","[{'lat': 11.5624, 'lng': 104.87082}]",943,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '101-000', 'name': 'American'}, {'id': '151-000', 'name': 'Hawaiian/Polynesian'}, {'id': '203-000', 'name': 'Japanese'}, {'id': '304-000', 'name': 'Italian'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5484783'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510302405'}]}],"[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sat: 10:30 - 14:00, 17:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T103000', 'duration': 'PT03H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}, {'start': 'T170000', 'duration': 'PT05H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.562412,104.87073,5484783,Aloha Ono,"We are the only one Hawaiian restaurant in Cambodia Phnom penh. We hand-picked menu items from Hawaiian cuisine that the owner found ""Ono!!"" (""Delicious"" in Hawaiian). ""Japanese"" lady run ""Hawaiian"" restaurant in ""Cambodia"". It's sound little bit interesting, isn't it? Hawaiian cuisine was influenced by many cultures, so our menu is International fusion style as well. I hope you will stop by and enjoy our ""Onolicious=Delicious"" menu on the way you go airport to town. Our restaurant is very near from Dara airport hotel and 9 dragon hotel. Also to you can reach only in 10min by tuk tuk to Phnom penh international airport.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d5484783-Reviews-Aloha_Ono-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 16-B St. Northbridge,Sangkat Toeuk Thla', 'street2': 'Khan Sensok', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12101', 'address_string': '# 16-B St. Northbridge,Sangkat Toeuk Thla Khan Sensok, Phnom Penh 12101 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@aloha-ono.com,+855 10 302 405,http://www.aloha-ono.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d5484783-Aloha_Ono-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#272 of 1,983 Places to Eat in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '1983', 'ranking': '272'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,42,"{'1': '1', '2': '2', '3': '2', '4': '5', '5': '32'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",155,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d5484783-m66827-Reviews-Aloha_Ono-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1030'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1400'}}, {'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1700'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1030'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1400'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1700'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1030'}, 'close': {'day': 3, '