Amra Angkor Hotel,here:pds:place:116w63u5-48454b171c804961bdad46b5597b2d80,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Amra Angkor Hotel, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.36033, 'lng': 103.86784}","[{'lat': 13.36032, 'lng': 103.8677}]",23421,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'www': [{'value': 'http://www.amraangkorhotel.com'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.360319,103.867836,7159440,The Amra Angkor Hotel,"Located along national road 06 opposite local market, Samaki Market, within walking distance from Siem Reap River and Royal Residence. The Home Lodge offers outdoor swimming pool, food and beverage outlets with choices of food and drink serving by the swimming pool that makes you feel convenient and private. The simplicity of each room accommodation configured king-sized, twin and triple beds to meet your requirement. With its full facilities including the soft linen and proper air-conditioner will inspire you stay more comfortable. To ensure conveniently, The Home Lodge experienced team provides concierge services, money exchange, VISA and Master cards accepted, medical treatment upon request, on-call massage, high Wi-Fi connection and laundry. Be with us as family member in the heritage land of Angkor enriching culture and civilization. Reach us at the contact bottom to plan your tour in Siem Reap ahead. The flexibility of tour itinerary with the best guaranteed prices. Complementary airport pick up is to reduce your transportation cost.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7159440-Reviews-The_Amra_Angkor_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Road 6, Phum Banteay Chas, Infront of Samaki Market', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '0085