Anachak Angkor Residence,here:pds:place:116w63u5-35cc93048bfd40209926bb3d9d50b0ef,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Anachak Angkor Residence, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37481, 'lng': 103.87116}","[{'lat': 13.37475, 'lng': 103.87129}]",21965,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13455173'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592262688'}, {'value': '+85599888850'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.anachakangkor.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.374781,103.871216,13455173,Anachak Angkor Residence,"Anachak Angkor Residence is an All-Suite luxury hotel. Every suite has balcony, living room with dining area and fully-fitted kitchenette in addition to one or two bedrooms with en-suite. If you enjoy space, this is the hotel for you. The hotel is peacefully situated in the heart of Siem Reap, away from all the noise and smells of the bustling city. This is ever-so obvious when relaxing from the rooftop pool with panoramic views over Siem Reap or working out at the rooftop fitness centre. It’s a real pleasure to have a spacious luxury home-from-home to return to after visiting the world’s number one heritage Landmark in Cambodia, Angkor Wat. The awe-inspiring residence is designed to host discerning travelers in a classic luxury Cambodian town. The hotel is a mere 4.1km from Angkor Wat and 2.8km from downtown Siem Reap.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d13455173-Reviews-Anachak_Angkor_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 60', 'street2': 'Road C220', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17251', 'address_string': 'Street 60 Road C220, Siem Reap 17251 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'na