Anachak Restaurant & Sky Bar,here:pds:place:116w63u5-45b994b837ee44e4b610bd7b05fb8f6c,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Anachak Restaurant & Sky Bar, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37538, 'lng': 103.86972}","[{'lat': 13.37535, 'lng': 103.86985}]",22022,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '101-002', 'name': 'American - Southwestern', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '14045226'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85599808181'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.anachakangkor.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:30 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T063000', 'duration': 'PT14H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.375382,103.86973,14045226,Anachak Restaurant & Sky Bar,"Laze around by the only hotel's rooftop pool sky bar in Siem Reap, a perfect break from a long exhausting day from visiting the temples. The Anachak Rooftop Sky Pool & Bar is nothing short of a fresh, spacious and calm oasis dedicated to style, relaxation and everything that makes life a complete pleasure in a peaceful city.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d14045226-Reviews-Anachak_Restaurant_Sky_Bar-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 60', 'street2': 'C220', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17251', 'address_string': 'Street 60 C220, Siem Reap 17251 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@anachakangkor.com,+855 99 808 181,http://www.anachakangkor.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d14045226-An