Anansaya la Maison,here:pds:place:116w63u5-92aeede013c1cf2e80bad08149523b85,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Anansaya la Maison, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.38078, 'lng': 103.85624}","[{'lat': 13.38091, 'lng': 103.85626}]",22601,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25189994'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516297298'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.anansayalamaison.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.380889,103.85627,25189994,Shintana Saya La Maison,"Shintana Saya La Maison is a brand new hotel managed by Shintana Saya Residence located in the quiet area of Siem Reap, just 8 minutes away from the temple complex. A boutique hotel with just 29 rooms, a silver-tiled swimming pool, a spa, a lounge bar, and an all-day dining restaurant. Each room has either balcony or direct pool access, lush grounds, spacious gardens, and charming Khmer art-deco inspired design. Shintana Saya means “Blissful” in Sanskrit, with suitably describes the refreshing character of our hotel and impressions of our guests when they stay with us. To stay at our hotel is to embark on rich cultures destination experience. Be it in recreating the flavor of the local cuisine, enhancing your well-being through ancient healing arts city of Angkor. Indulge in the joy of the discovery at Shintana Saya La Maison.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g21378065-d25189994-Reviews-Shintana_Saya_La_Maison-Kok_Chak_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 30, Krong Siem Reap', 'street2': '2 Floors', 'city': 'Kok Chak', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17253', 'address_string': 'Street 30, Krong Siem Reap 2 Floors, Kok Chak, Siem Reap 17253 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kok Chak', 'location_id': '21378065'}, {'level': 'Municipalit