Angkor Angel Boutique Villa,here:pds:place:116w63gg-fc3a0372da664606b7e9b4c2ccb51ed9,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Angkor Angel Boutique Villa, 171206 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ជ្រាវ', 'postalCode': '171206'}","{'lat': 13.35454, 'lng': 103.8865}","[{'lat': 13.35446, 'lng': 103.88661}]",131334,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13792681'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512829933'}, {'value': '+85593902266'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.354563,103.88647,13792681,Angkor Angel Boutique Villa,"Villa Phum Khnar is quietly located near popular areas, Angkor park, the pub street, old market and Siem Reap business centre. A delightful blend of traditional Cambodian architecture with contemporary embellishment creates a sense of indulgence and privacy that modernise the space into a comfortable living environment with a balcony overlooking an flower garden and swimming pool.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d13792681-Reviews-Angkor_Angel_Boutique_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Old Bus Station Road', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Old Bus Station Road, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d13792681-Angkor_Angel_Boutique_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#78 of 449 Specialty lodging in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '449', 'ranking': '78'}",4.5,https:/