Angkor Archaeological Park,here:pds:place:116w63ue-923a1f3ed7af2f2998b0ca7ad4d3d923,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Angkor Archaeological Park, ផ្លូវ សៀគ្វីធំ, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សៀគ្វីធំ', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.46349, 'lng': 103.867}","[{'lat': 13.46351, 'lng': 103.86686}]",16407,"[{'id': '300-3000-0025', 'name': 'Historical Monument', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1727839'}]",Not Available,"[{'text': ['Mon: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.463258,103.86838,1727839,Angkor Archaeological Park,"Angkor Wat, the one of the largest religious complexes in the world, and a stunning array of 9th to 13th century temples built by the kings of the Khmer Empire. The Angkor Archaeological Park is breathtaking, and still the principal draw for every visitor to Siem Reap.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d1727839-Reviews-Angkor_Archaeological_Park-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d1727839-Angkor_Archaeological_Park-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#9 of 200 things to do in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '200', 'ranking': '9'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,5126,"{'1': '19