Angkor Art Gallery,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-555f54c41dc1b9c7ce7dd5afb1b7886e,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Angkor Art Gallery, 180403 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បី', 'postalCode': '180403'}","{'lat': 10.62688, 'lng': 103.51147}","[{'lat': 10.62688, 'lng': 103.51147}]",180916,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26628284'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570760627'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.angkorartgallery.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 10:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T100000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Preah Sihanouk,10.626787,103.51155,26628284,Angkor Art Gallery,"Experience Cambodia's rich artistic heritage at Angkor Art Gallery, nestled in the heart of Sihanoukville's prestigious Prince Golden Bay. As the largest gallery in Cambodia, our expansive 5,000 sqf space boasts the world's biggest public collection of traditional and contemporary Cambodian and Southeast Asian art, with over 500 captivating artworks. Here, vibrant colors and intricate brushstrokes converge to transport you into the Kingdom of Wonder's past and present. With its close proximity to the iconic Angkor Wat, the gallery serves as a bridge between the region's rich history and the vibrant creativity of today. Discover the magic of Cambodia through art at Angkor Art Gallery, where wonder meets canvas. Moreover, we offer various art-related activities for both adults and kids right at our gallery, including canvas painting, pouring art, crafts, hunting game and many more.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g325573-d26628284-Reviews-Angkor_Art_Gallery-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 2 Tonu Road', 'street2': 'Prince Mall 3F', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'No. 2 Tonu Road Prince Mall 3F, Sihanoukville Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,angkorartgallerykh@gmail.com,+855 70 760 627,http://www.angkorartgallery.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d26628284-Angkor_Art_Gallery-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g325573-d26628284-m66827-Reviews-Angkor_Art_Gallery-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2200'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 10:00 - 22:00', 'Tuesday: 10:00 - 22:00', 'Wednesday: 10:00 - 22:00', 'Thursday: 10:00 - 22:00', 'Friday: 10:00 - 22:00', 'Saturday: 10:00 - 22:00', 'Sunday: 10:00 - 22:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'shopping', 'localized_name': 'Shopping'}, {'name': 'museums', 'localized_name': 'Museums'}, {'name': 'attractions', 'localized_name': 'Attractions'}]","[{'name': 'Shopping', 'localized_name': 'Shopping', 'categories': [{'name': 'Art Galleries', 'localized_name': 'Art Galleries'}]}, {'name': 'Museums', 'localized_name': 'Museums', 'categories': [{'name'