Angkor Balloon,here:pds:place:116w63u7-b3d48b80473b450bb91283f18ad8ef4f,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Angkor Balloon, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.4136, 'lng': 103.85009}","[{'lat': 13.4136, 'lng': 103.84995}]",20763,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1595144'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592765386'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Fri: 06:00 - 12:30', 'Sat, Sun: 05:30 - 18:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT06H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR'}, {'start': 'T053000', 'duration': 'PT12H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.413685,103.85001,1595144,Angkor Balloon,"Experience Angkor Wat and the temples from above for only USD20! Angkor Balloon is a tethered helium balloon. Open from sunrise to sunset, enjoy the aerials views of Angkor Wat, Phnom Bakheng and West Baray. You may even observe the Tonle Sap Lake and Phnom Khrom. Take amazing pictures and bring home memories that last a lifetime! The helium balloon is attached to a mechanical cable to the ground and ascends to approximately 120m (394 feet) for a 10 minutes ride and can carry up to 20 passengers. Day time: USD20 per adult, USD10 for children below 12 to 6 years old and free for children below 6 years old. Sunrise/sunset: USD25 per adult, USD15 for children below 12 to 6 years old and free for children below 6 years old.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d1595144-Reviews-Angkor_Balloon-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '800 meters from West entrance of Angkor Wat', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17255', 'address_string': '800 meters from West entrance of Angkor Wat, Siem Reap 17255 Ca