Angkor Botanical Garden,here:pds:place:116w63u5-7d874380366a4b7b2e77182f2873820e,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Angkor Botanical Garden, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.38371, 'lng': 103.86309}","[{'lat': 13.38369, 'lng': 103.86323}]",21845,"[{'id': '550-5510-0204', 'name': 'Garden', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '24798777'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517865656'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://web.facebook.com/angkorbotanicalgardenabg'}]}]","[{'text': ['Tue-Sun: 08:00 - 18:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT10H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.383646,103.863106,24798777,Angkor Botanical Garden,"On an area of more than 15 hectares under the support and initiative of His Excellency CHEA Sophara, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction ""Angkor Botanical Garden »This has been expanded and improved with more than 500 species of plants and flowers and tens of thousands of trees waiting to welcome visitors from all over direction. This Park is divided into 5 large gardens with different features, including: -Grocery and Medicinal Garden: There are various medicinal plants and herbs for cooking. -Garden, grass and mixed flowers: Seasonal flowers and grass. - Palm Garden: There are palm trees, palm oil. -Khmer Garden: There are many kinds of fruit plants and small fields. -Angkor Forest and Wildlife Park: There are luxury trees, wildlife and livestock. This Park will be a new place of relaxation and relaxation in the Angkor zone area and also a place to explore. About many species of plants, flowers and wildlife.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d24798777-Reviews-Angkor_Botanical_Garden-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Charles De Gaulle', 'street2': 'In Front SOS School On The Way To Angkor Wat 2min From Kunthabopha Hospital', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17253', 'address_string': 'Charles De Gaulle In Front SOS School On The Way To Angkor Wat 2min From Kunthabopha Hospital, Siem Reap 17253 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,am_chamroeun@hotmail.com,+855 17 865 656,http://web.facebook.com/angkorbotanicalgardenabg/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d24798777-Angkor_Botanical_Garden-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#37 of 200 things to do in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '200', 'ranking': '37'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,53,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '1', '4': '4', '5': '47'}",Not available,184,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d24798777-m66827-Reviews-Angkor_Botanical_Garden-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '1800'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: Closed', 'Tuesday: 08:00 - 18:00', 'Wednesday: 08:00 - 18:00', 'Thursday: 08:00 - 18:00', 'Friday: 08:00 - 18:00', 'Saturday: 08:00 - 18:00', 'Sunday: 08:00 - 18:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'at