Angkor Centre for Conservation of Biodiversity,here:pds:place:116w63vz-8205a1a6becd403eb28b4fcdd1c2a0eb,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Angkor Centre for Conservation of Biodiversity, 170902 បន្ទាយស្រី, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'បន្ទាយស្រី', 'district': 'ឃុនរាម', 'postalCode': '170902'}","{'lat': 13.67824, 'lng': 104.02607}","[{'lat': 13.67823, 'lng': 104.02621}]",17456,"[{'id': '550-5520-0210', 'name': 'Wildlife Refuge', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2639521'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85599604017'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.accb-cambodia.org'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 15:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT07H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.678245,104.02583,2639521,Angkor Centre for Conservation of Biodiversity,"The Angkor Centre for Conservation of Biodiversity (ACCB) is the first nature conservation centre in Cambodia. The ACCB contributes to the conservation of wildlife and biodiversity in Cambodia through wildlife rescue, rehabilitation, release, conservation breeding, environmental education and conservation research. Join us for a pre-booked guided tour of the conservation centre at 9:00 am or 1:30 pm daily, or alternatively contact us to hear more about private tour options. This is the only way to visit the ACCB as we are normally closed to the public. Tour lasts about 2 hours and requires a minimum donation of $5 USD. Please pre-book your tour, and arrive a few minutes early. Late-comers, unfortunately, cannot be accommodated.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d2639521-Reviews-Angkor_Centre_for_Conservation_of_Biodiversity-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Kbal Spean', 'street2': 'Phnom Kulen National Park', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '93054', 'address_string': 'Kbal Spean Phnom Kulen National Park, Siem Reap 93054 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@accb-cambodia.org,+855 99 604 017,http://www.accb-cambodia.org,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d2639521-Angkor_Centre_for_Conservation_of_Biodiversity-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#12 of 200 things to do in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '200', 'ranking': '12'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,306,"{'1': '2', '2': '0', '3': '12', '4': '48', '5': '244'}",Not available,138,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d2639521-m66827-Reviews-Angkor_Centre_for_Conservation_of_Biodiversity-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1500'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1500'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1500'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1500'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1500'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1500'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '1500'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 08:00 - 15:00', 'Tuesday: 08:00 - 15:00', 'Wednesday: 08:00 - 15:00', 'Thursday: 08:00 - 15:00', 'Friday: 08:00 - 15:00', 'Saturday: 08:00 - 15:00', 'Sunday: 08:00 - 15:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'nature_parks', 'localized_name': 'Nature & Parks'}, {'name': 'attractions', 'localized_name': 'Att