Angkor Comfort Hotel,here:pds:place:116w636k-3e2b36a082e64142b258f6588508d510,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Angkor Comfort Hotel, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.09432, 'lng': 103.19846}","[{'lat': 13.09432, 'lng': 103.19847}]",12147,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6589493'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855186669698'}, {'value': '+85577306410'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.angkorcomforthotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.094315,103.19846,6589493,Angkor Comfort Hotel,"Finding an ideal budget friendly hotel in Battambang does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Angkor Comfort Hotel, a nice option for travelers like you.
Rooms at Angkor Comfort Hotel offer air conditioning and a refrigerator providing exceptional comfort and convenience, and guests can go online with free wifi.
A 24 hour front desk, room service, and a concierge are some of the conveniences offered at this hotel. If you are driving to Angkor Comfort Hotel, free parking is available.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Battambang, Angkor Comfort Hotel is located a short distance from White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (0.4 mi) and Ta Dumbong Statue (0.7 mi).
While in Battambang, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Angkor Comfort Hotel, including Jaan Bai Restaurant (0.5 mi), Smokin' Pot (0.3 mi), and Nary Kitchen (0.6 mi).
Should time allow, HUMAN Gallery - Joseba Etxebarria Photography is a popular attraction that is within walking distance.
Angkor Comfort Hotel puts the best of Battambang at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
