Angkor Daily Tours,here:pds:place:116w63u5-c420d67e6eb84852a9b61391bec5300d,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Angkor Daily Tours, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36711, 'lng': 103.84496}","[{'lat': 13.36698, 'lng': 103.84494}]",88314,"[{'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5544780'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855769888847'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.angkordailytours.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.367148,103.84497,5544780,Angkor Daily Tours,"The team at Angkor Daily Tours ''AD Travel'' began leading the tours in 2006 and today we stand as one of the leaders in Cambodian tourism. We offer a vast choice of cultural and specialized tours such as Adventure Tours, Luxury Tours, Family Outings, Charter Tours, Solo Adventures, Cycling Tours, Sightseeing Tours, Bird watching Trips, festival tours, Cooking Classes, Street Food Tours, Buffalo/Ox Cart Trips, Motor Bike Tours, Elephant Forest Tours and Homestay Tours etc. Any kinds of Private Tours you want to experience, we can arrange any type of Private Tours or experience for you! All our tours are specially designed and customized keeping in line with the philosophy of sustainable tourism. We are a team consisting of Professional Guides and Travel Experts with work experienced of over 17 years experience in tourism in Cambodia. We are all like-minded people working towards providing a highly personalized and authentic experience of this exotic country, Cambodia.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d5544780-Reviews-Angkor_Daily_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 