Angkor Dino B&B,here:pds:place:116w63gg-95aea56e63b94bd9aeee9717f9b15eae,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Angkor Dino B&B, ផ្លូវ សម្តេចវិបុលបញ្ញា សុខ អាន, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សម្តេចវិបុលបញ្ញា សុខ អាន', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37616, 'lng': 103.87007}","[{'lat': 13.37603, 'lng': 103.87007}]",21932,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12804831'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27693121'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592306467'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.376319,103.87007,12804831,Angkor Dino B&B,"Angkor Dino B&B is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Siem Reap, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as air conditioning, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the bed and breakfast.
Angkor Dino B&B features a 24 hour front desk, baggage storage, and a coffee shop, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts a pool and an on-site restaurant. If you are driving to Angkor Dino B&B, free parking is available.
Nearby landmarks such as Viti's Tuk Tuk Driver (0.9 mi) and Seng English Speaking Tuk Tuk & Car Driver (1.1 mi) make Angkor Dino B&B a great place to stay when visiting Siem Reap.
If you like steakhouses, Angkor Dino B&B is conveniently located near Grill Wine Cafe, Damnak Steakhouse, and Tell Steak House.
Looking for something to do in Siem Reap? Wat Thmey (Killing Fields) (0.8 mi) is a popular attraction that is within walking distance of Angkor Dino B&B.
Enjoy your stay in Siem Reap!
