Angkor Doors,here:pds:place:116w63u4-e343bddac8c00d1b3b891cc56764de6c,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Angkor Doors, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.38955, 'lng': 103.8389}","[{'lat': 13.38942, 'lng': 103.83888}]",86084,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12030369'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512630611'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.angkordoors.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.389642,103.83892,12030369,Angkor Doors,Angkor Doors is the only tour which explains the intricate stories carved in the doors of Angkor Wat. I've spend many years' studying and researching the various doors around the temples and I'm looking forward to sharing my knowledge with my guests. A professional English speaking Angkor Wat tour guide based in Siem Reap.,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d12030369-Reviews-Angkor_Doors-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@angkordoors.com,+855 12 630 611,http://www.angkordoors.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12030369-Angkor_Doors-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#105 of 1,339 Tours in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1339', 'ranking': '105'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,217,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '1', '4': '6', '5': '209'}",Not available,215,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attr