Angkor Dream Villa,here:pds:place:116aabd1-46cae830929d0a43f1c0d8908bab21c2,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Angkor Dream Villa, ផ្លូវជាតិ 63, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 63', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34315, 'lng': 103.85287}","[{'lat': 13.3431, 'lng': 103.853}]",88033,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1936084'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598870989'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.343167,103.85284,1936084,Angkor Dream Villa,"Angkor Dream Villa is a boutique Bed & Breakfast with 16 guestrooms. Located 20 mins drive from Siem Reap Airport and only 5 to 10 mins from all major bus stations, you can easily explore the Siem Reap town and Angkor Temples! Make yourself comfortable in our King, Double or Twin bedrooms. All rooms feature complimentary WiFi, air conditioning, ceiling fan, private bathroom with hot water, Cable TV, and large openable windows with natural day light. Take a stroll along the river or borrow one of our bikes to explore the Old Market, Night Market and Pub Street.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1936084-Reviews-Angkor_Dream_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Road to Tonle Sap', 'street2': 'Watsvay', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '40001', 'address_string': 'Road to Tonle Sap Watsvay, Siem Reap 40001 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d1936084-Angkor_Dream_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '