Angkor Driver Ravin,here:pds:place:116w63gg-6f1abfd92fc74c0ac2088682302799db,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Angkor Driver Ravin, ផ្លូវ ផ្សាររាត្រីអង្គរ, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ផ្សាររាត្រីអង្គរ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35276, 'lng': 103.85096}","[{'lat': 13.35276, 'lng': 103.85097}]",88261,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10022010'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855967692477'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/Ravin-Angkor-Driver-840725272735239'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.352761,103.85096,10022010,Angkor Driver Ravin,"I'm Ravin and I'm an experienced driver working since 2010 to make people know the beauty of Siem Reap and its surrounding areas. My tours includes the temples close to the city (including the most famous Angkor Wat, Ta Prom, Bayon temple) but also other important attractions such as Floating Village on lake Tonle Sap, Phnom Kulen waterfall, Banteay Sray and much more to make the visitor feel and understand the magnificent of this country and its history.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d10022010-Reviews-Angkor_Driver_Ravin-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,buoravin@gmail.com,+855 96 769 2477,https://www.facebook.com/Ravin-Angkor-Driver-840725272735239/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d10022010-Angkor_Driver_Ravin-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_locatio