Angkor Golden Mountain Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649g-0d903d2db9314acb9b49044c9fd086a0,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Angkor Golden Mountain Hotel, ផ្លូវ 217, 120304 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ប្រាំពីរ មករា', 'subdistrict': 'អូរឫស្សីទី បួន', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 217', 'postalCode': '120304'}","{'lat': 11.56706, 'lng': 104.91862}","[{'lat': 11.56717, 'lng': 104.91854}]",5943,"[{'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8014487'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855236666054'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.566859,104.918785,8014487,Angkor Golden Mountain Hotel,"Angkor Golden Mountain Hotel is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Phnom Penh, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Nearby landmarks such as Champey Academy of Arts (0.6 mi) and Cambodia Post Office (0.7 mi) make Angkor Golden Mountain Hotel a great place to stay when visiting Phnom Penh.
Rooms at Angkor Golden Mountain Hotel offer a flat screen TV, air conditioning, and a refrigerator providing exceptional comfort and convenience, and guests can go online with free wifi.
If you are driving to Angkor Golden Mountain Hotel, free parking is available.
If you like seafood restaurants, Angkor Golden Mountain Hotel is conveniently located near Malis Cambodian Restaurant, Le Broken Plate, and Nesat Seafood House.
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular government buildings such as Supreme Court.
Enjoy your stay in Phnom Penh!
