Angkor Guide Sarak,here:pds:place:116w63u7-1fddc7a695db4cdc8e72996b203f40b6,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Angkor Guide Sarak, 171205 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'នគរធំ', 'postalCode': '171205'}","{'lat': 13.4125, 'lng': 103.8615}","[{'lat': 13.41249, 'lng': 103.8615}]",19849,"[{'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3812556'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569355558'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.angkorguide-sarak.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.4125,103.8615,3812556,Angkor Guide Sarak,"Hello everybody! Welcome to my beautiful country of Cambodia. My name is Sarak, I am an English speaking tour guide and I am the owner of Angkor Guide Sarak. Please contact us for your tour inquiry in Siem Reap, Cambodia. We arrange for a private guiding tour at Angokor Wa. Thanks and see you soon:-)",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d3812556-Reviews-Angkor_Guide_Sarak-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sivatha road', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Sivatha road, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,sarak.ctg@gmail.com,+855 69 355 558,http://www.angkorguide-sarak.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d3812556-Angkor_Guide_Sarak-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#18 of 557 Outdoor Activities in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '557', 'ranking': '18'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66