Angkor Guide Team,here:pds:place:116w63ux-456305fdfeaa52be99ba64f8a30223b7,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Angkor Guide Team, 170905 បន្ទាយស្រី, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'បន្ទាយស្រី', 'district': 'រុនតាឯក', 'postalCode': '170905'}","{'lat': 13.47027, 'lng': 104.04054}","[{'lat': 13.47028, 'lng': 104.0404}]",6896,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10550081'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85589778828'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://angkorguideteam.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.470239,104.04087,10550081,Angkor Guide Team,"Welcome Ladies and Gentlemen!! Angkor Guide Team Day tours - a private tour service - offers specialized tours from 35 highly trained and experienced tourist guides, who are licensed by the Cambodian Ministry of Tourism. In addition to guides, we provide transportation services in the Angkor archaeological area and surrounding sites. Book one of our team to guide you in your exploration of all the sites in the Angkor area and beyond. Our informed and experienced staff can help you immerse yourself in the art, culture, history and architecture of these wonders. All inquiries and requests are welcome. We will address questions carefully and on an individual basis. Independent tourists and groups who wish to organize private tours are welcome. We look forward to discussing our country, its history, and its people with you and will work hard to provide you with the ultimate tour of Cambodia, the Kingdom of Wonders Thank you very much. We look forward to meeting you. +85589778828",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d10550081-Reviews-Angkor_Guide_Team-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Treak village street', 'street2': 'Treak Village,', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17209', 'address_string': 'Treak village street Treak Village,, Siem Reap 17209 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,angkorguideteam@gmail.com,+855 89778828,https://angkorguideteam.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d10550081-Angkor_Guide_Team-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#5 of 129 Boat Tours &amp; Water Sports in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '129', 'ranking': '5'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,680,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '10', '5': '669'}",Not available,773,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d10550081-m66827-Reviews-Angkor_Guide_Team-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2359'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Tuesday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Wednesday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Thursday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Friday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Saturday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Sunday: 00:00 - 23:59']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name':