Angkor Halal Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w63u7-91dd579a25d7437fba57c55796602af9,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Angkor Halal Restaurant, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.4127, 'lng': 103.85395}","[{'lat': 13.41257, 'lng': 103.85395}]",20485,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '209-000', 'name': 'Malaysian'}, {'id': '211-000', 'name': 'Indonesian'}, {'id': '250-000', 'name': 'Middle Eastern'}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13135499'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855313333198'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://angkorhalal.com'}, {'value': 'https://angkorhalal.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Thu, Sat, Sun: 06:00 - 15:00', 'Fri: 06:00 - 11:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT09H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,SA,SU'}, {'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT05H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:FR'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.412717,103.85395,13135499,Angkor Halal Restaurant,"The only Halal restaurant in the Angkor Wat park area. Serving delicious food and drinks for breakfast and lunch. Relax in our garden while enjoying your meal. Our prayer room is open to all with hand-washing and toilet facilities. The menu includes local specialties along with Malay and Indonesian cuisine. We have set menus for groups and families for your convenience. Come and enjoy our friendly service without the drive back to town. No park ticket is required and there is ample parking. Tour groups are most welcome, though we do require tour companies to book at least 24 hours in advance via email or phone.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d13135499-Reviews-Angkor_Halal_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=6682