Angkor Howard Hotel and Convention Center,here:pds:place:116w63u4-577e0e6bd9444d1aa16a2306985a97b2,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Angkor Howard Hotel and Convention Center, 171210 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្រងែ', 'postalCode': '171210'}","{'lat': 13.38156, 'lng': 103.8236}","[{'lat': 13.38163, 'lng': 103.82348}]",86939,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '586862'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563965000', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85577510429'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.angkorhowardhotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.381422,103.823814,586862,Angkor Howard Hotel and Convention Center,"Angkor Howard Hotel and Convention Center is a well-established and respected five-star property in Siem Reap, close to the Siem Reap International Airport and just minutes away from the famous UNESCO World Heritage Site - Angkor Wat. All of room has been recently refurbished and some of which have been totally renovated, it is one of the largest hotels in this famous ancient city. The Gemini Convention Center which can comfortably accommodate 3,500 delegates is also one of the largest MICE facilities in Siem Reap. The hotel carters to leisure, business and meetings group are they FIT or Group travelers. The hotel stands out for its location closed to the airport, its comprehensive range of deluxe facilities and its warm welcoming Khmer staff.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d586862-Reviews-Angkor_Howard_Hotel_and_Convention_Center-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '6 National Road', 'street2': 'Phum Kasekam, Khum Sra Nga', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17000', 'address_string': '6 National Road Phum Kasekam, Khum Sra Nga, Siem Reap 170