Angkor Privilege Resort & Spa,here:pds:place:116w63gu-6fba345ec3034c6eab43c93e8bccbd6a,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Angkor Privilege Resort & Spa, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.3582, 'lng': 103.89722}","[{'lat': 13.35807, 'lng': 103.89726}]",21731,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15518972'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512692525'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://angkorprivilege.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.358205,103.89721,15518972,Angkor Privilege Resort & Spa,"Angkor Privilege Resort & Spa is a newly opened, locally run luxury resort in the quiet, green outskirts of Siem Reap just a few minutes ride from the bustling city Center and the Angkor Archaeological Park. The largest religious monument ever built and the epicenter of one of the most fascinating ancient civilizations, Angkor Wat lies just a few kilometers north from our resort. Experience with us the magic and grandeur of the temples in any season, explore the picturesque countryside and Tonle Sap lake, try local delicacies and after a hard day of sightseeing let yourself be pampered and relax your weary limbs in our luxury spa.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d15518972-Reviews-Angkor_Privilege_Resort_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road 6', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17251', 'address_string': 'National Road 6, Siem Reap 17251 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-