Angkor Ruby Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-8a1f8e16d40c0be4703270520e94ee3b,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Angkor Ruby Guesthouse, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36202, 'lng': 103.85242}","[{'lat': 13.36214, 'lng': 103.85248}]",24382,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2397652'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85590286782'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.362112,103.85246,2397652,Angkor Ruby Guesthouse,"Tom & Jerry guest house is located in Siem Reap, a 5-minute walk from the lively Old Market. It features a restaurant, massage services and rooms with views of the city. Free Wi-Fi in public areas and parking are provided.The non-smoking rooms at Tom & Jerry come with traditional Khmer furnishings. Each is fitted with a cable TV, minibar and private bathroom with shower facilities.Guests can enjoy a relaxing barbecued meal, or spend some quiet time in the library. With a 24-hour front desk, the hotel provides bicycle and car rental services. Ticketing services are available at the tour desk.The restaurant serves a variety of local and Western dishes. Room service is available upon request.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d2397652-Reviews-Angkor_Ruby_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 330 Group 11, Ta Pual Village, Svaydonkom Communce', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'No. 330 Group 11, Ta Pual Village, Svaydonkom Communce, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d2397652-Angkor_Ruby_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#156 of 449 Specialty lodging in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '449', 'ranking': '156'}",3.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.5-66827-5.svg,146,"{'1': '18', '2': '9', '3': '39', '4': '53', '5': '27'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}}",86,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d2397652-m66827-Reviews-Angkor_Ruby_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Shuttle Bus Service', 'Room service', 'Free Internet', 'Restaurant', 'Air conditioning']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'other', 'localized_name': 'Specialty Lodging'}]",Not available,['Budget'],[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '2'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '62'}, {'