Angkor Ruins Guide,here:pds:place:116w63u4-ec1310e96c71abe9cb3a2b5de9e37ae3,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Angkor Ruins Guide, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36081, 'lng': 103.84268}","[{'lat': 13.36094, 'lng': 103.84268}]",87801,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15063373'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855717237277'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://angkorruinsguide.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Wed, Fri-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.360764,103.84268,15063373,Angkor Ruins Guide,"Hello everyone! Thank you very much for accessing "" Angkor ruins guide "". I am ""OLL"" which is Japanese guide of Angkor remains. I would like to introduce not only to the Angkor monuments group but also to the climate and history of Cambodia in our country, the lives of Cambodians, and further the deep connection with Japan. As for this tour, you can feel free to participate as well as group tours, family members, friends, and even one person. When traveling, please use our local tour of "" Angkor ruins guide "" by all means . We will guide you according to your wishes. * I have obtained the official license of the Japanese guide appointed by the Ministry of Tourism of the Cambodian government. We will prepare a special car for our customers, we promise safe and comfortable guidance. We sincerely look forward to meeting you all!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d15063373-Reviews-Angkor_Ruins_Guide-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Re