Angkor Rural Boutique Resort,here:pds:place:116w63uh-def9f71627eb485591a40cfdbc888233,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Angkor Rural Boutique Resort, 170505 ប្រាសាទបាគង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'ប្រាសាទបាគង', 'district': 'កណ្ដែក', 'postalCode': '170505'}","{'lat': 13.3645, 'lng': 103.91468}","[{'lat': 13.36463, 'lng': 103.9147}]",20155,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-2000-0000', 'name': 'Nightlife-Entertainment'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '700-7200-0324', 'name': 'Apartment/Flat Rental'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5788896'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512817616', 'categories': [{'id': '200-2000-0000'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85512986817'}, {'value': '+855977199797', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}, {'id': '700-7200-0324'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/Angkor-Rural-Boutique-Resort-389227517894892', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.364585,103.91469,5788896,Angkor Rural Boutique Resort,"Sustainable and responsible tourism is a widely discussed concept but is seldom put into practice in a developing country like Cambodia. A combination of 5 concepts (Eco-friendly, Rural, Cultural, Natural, and Rescue) makes Angkor Rural Boutique Resort a unique property. To minimize the cutting of new trees recycled wood from old houses has been used throughout the resort and original Khmer architectural accents from the bygone era have been painstakingly restored to preserve and showcase Cambodian architectural heritage. Just 11 km away from downtown, you will find the contrasting worlds between the chaotic city and countryside, we have the desire to promote an authentic eco-friendly retreat for our guests, and our in-house restaurant mostly serves food made out of organic produce sourced from the nearby local villages or grown in our own organic garden. The majority of our staff, are from nearby rural areas and the rest are trainee students looking for a future in the hospitality sector.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d5788896-Reviews-Angkor_Rural_Boutique_Resort-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Chrey Village', 'street2': 'Kandek Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '170505', 'address_string': 'Chrey Village Kandek Commune, Siem Reap 170505 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d5788896-Angkor_Rural_Boutique_Resort-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#20 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '20'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,198,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '2', '4': '13', '5': '182'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'