Angkor Special Tours,here:pds:place:116w63u7-b4a0623b9c37466abdf85a3cdddfc3ea,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Angkor Special Tours, 171205 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'នគរធំ', 'postalCode': '171205'}","{'lat': 13.41322, 'lng': 103.86411}","[{'lat': 13.41321, 'lng': 103.86397}]",19577,"[{'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4509186'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577494459'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.angkorspecialtours.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 05:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T050000', 'duration': 'PT16H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.413233,103.86425,4509186,Angkor Special Tours,"Angkor Special Tours is a local tour operator that specializes in providing a variety of tour services across Cambodia. Our services are customized for visitors who love independent and private tours. We look forward to showing you the timeless temples and tropical jungles steeped in the ancient history and rich culture of Angkor. We specialize in tours of major attractions around Cambodia including tours to local villages. One of our specialties is the Tonle Sap Lake tour, which includes a boat cruise to flooded forests, fishing villages, and a bird-watching sanctuary. Our tour guides are all certified and our drivers are experienced. Air-conditioned transport ensures a comfortable and safe experience for tourists. Our experienced tour guides will personalize each tour according to your interests and preferred pace. Tours are planned to avoid major tour groups. Let us guide you through Cambodia’s most beautiful sites and scenery in comfort. Relax and enjoy a unique journey.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d4509186-Reviews-Angkor_Special_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street2': '#351', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '76', 'address_string': '#351, Siem Reap 76 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,vannakpin99@gmail.com,+855 77 494 459,http://www.angkorspecialtours.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d4509186-Angkor_Special_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#53 of 1,339 Tours in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1339', 'ranking': '53'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,1374,"{'1': '0', '2': '2', '3': '3', '4': '26', '5': '1343'}",Not available,682,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d4509186-m66827-Reviews-Angkor_Special_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2100'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 05:00 - 21:00', 'Tuesday: 05:00 - 21:00', 'Wednesday: 05:00 - 21:00', 'Thursday: 05:00 - 21:00', 'Friday: 05:00 - 21:00', 'Saturday: 05:00 - 21:00', 'Sunday: 05:00 - 21:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'lo