Angkor Street Eats,here:pds:place:116w63gg-32db25e7cf5b6618ddb04a889ef96ada,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Angkor Street Eats, ផ្លូវជាតិ 63, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 63', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34961, 'lng': 103.85261}","[{'lat': 13.34966, 'lng': 103.85248}]",88287,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8798203'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85587686872'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.angkorstreeteats.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.349651,103.8525,8798203,Angkor Street Eats,"Angkor Street Eats operates daily walking food tours in Siem Reap which take you to the very heart of Khmer culture. Our 4 hour tours are filled with exceptional Khmer cuisine, taking you to places beyond any guidebook on a journey of exploration and adventure.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d8798203-Reviews-Angkor_Street_Eats-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@angkorstreeteats.com,+855 87 686 872,http://www.angkorstreeteats.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d8798203-Angkor_Street_Eats-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#15 of 167 Food &amp; Drink in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '167', 'ranking': '15'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,134,"{'1': '2', '2': '1', '3': '1', '4': '10', '5': '120'}",Not available,204,