Angkor Sun Siem Reap Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-7b1515fc3dc90c54f96ff81e8a610c50,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Angkor Sun Siem Reap Hotel, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35002, 'lng': 103.85531}","[{'lat': 13.35007, 'lng': 103.85518}]",88573,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10123202'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569824578'}, {'value': '+855717267730'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.350039,103.85525,10123202,Angkor Sun Siem Reap Hotel,"Angkor Sun is a hostel with homely atmosphere in the heart of the old town of Siem Reap. We offer you friendly stuff, cozy and daily cleaned double-bed rooms and dorms. Our restaurant is open for you 24 hours and you're welcome 24 hours 7 days a week. We provide you Free WiFi all around. Come and join us and have high quality holidays for backpacker prices! Rooms: Enjoy your time in our beautiful double-bed rooms with air-condition and Flatscreen-TV, good standard bathrooms. The dorms are with fan or air condition, up to you what you like. Free WiFi of course. Area: You can find a lot great, local restaurant around, supermarkets are also close. -3 minutes to Pub Street for night-life and dancing -2 minutes to the Night Market, explore local handmade crafts, paintings and wood-work -15 minutes by tuk-tuk to Angkor Wat -5 minutes to Craft-market, see how the locals people work and how they build their crafts Services: We want you to enjoy your days! Let us know if you need help or informations! We provide: -Tuk-Tuk-services -Tour-services -Bus-tickets -Rent a motorbike or a bike How to get here: If you'll come by plane we can organize a Tuk-Tuk to pick you up at the airport. Let us know what time you'll be at the airport. From the airport to here takes 20 minutes.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d10123202-Reviews-Angkor_Sun_Siem_Reap_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sangkat Sala Komreuk', 'street2': 'Road Wat Damnak,Wat Damnak Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': 'Sangkat Sala Komreuk Road Wat Damnak,Wat Damnak Village, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d10123202-Angkor_Sun_Siem_Reap_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#53 of 449 Specialty lodging in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '449', 'ranking': '53'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,82,"{'1': '2', '2': '1', '3': '0', '4': '6', '5': '73'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https