Angkor Temple Guide,here:pds:place:116aabd1-6b18dae171910d34b0a1eadb13929d8d,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Angkor Temple Guide, ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35188, 'lng': 103.85266}","[{'lat': 13.35178, 'lng': 103.85275}]",116600,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}, {'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10520911'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3368052'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592999051'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.angkortempleguide.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Fri: 06:00 - 22:00', 'Sat, Sun: 09:00 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT16H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR'}, {'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT08H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.349127,103.84953,3368052,Angkor Temple Guide,"Dear Ladies and Gentlemen, Angkor Temple Guide (ATG) is a group of senior experienced, professional tour guides who have been guiding visitors to Angkor temples since 1995 and I am Tes Chhaya, a founder and I used to work as a teacher of English in high school in Siem Reap as well. Our services are customized for visitors who love independent and private tours. Please let us arrange your tours in Angkor National Park and beyond, with transportation, tour guides, meals, itinerary and so on. We guarantee the best quality services of reasonable price very informative tour guides with fun and safe trip. Best wishes, Chhaya Tes",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d3368052-Reviews-Angkor_Temple_Guide-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 52', 'street2': 'Vihear Chen village, Svay Dangkum District, Siemreap Province, Cambodia',