Angkor Travel Guide,here:pds:place:116w63gf-412b969e254f7f38cde9ec16ee8f11dd,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Angkor Travel Guide, ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.34169, 'lng': 103.83338}","[{'lat': 13.34156, 'lng': 103.83341}]",86027,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}, {'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23912404'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26813664'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26813678'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27162652'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27707474'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512394898', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85517459498', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85578223944', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85592417796'}, {'value': '+85593566565', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://cambodiaguidebylocal.com', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}]}, {'value': 'http://traveltoinspire.net'}, {'value': 'http://www.angkorwatreiseleiter.de', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}]}, {'value': 'https://angkorsunrise.net', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}]}, {'value': 'https://www.angkorcamadventure.com', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}]}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.341611,103.8334,23912404,Angkor Travel Guide,"Siem Reap Airport Transfer provides taxi services, shuttle service, private transfer to and from Siem Reap Angkor International Airport. It is the main gateway to the city of Siem Reap town, Cambodia, and the famous Angkor Wat temple complex. Airport transfers are a convenient way to travel between the airport and your hotel or any other destination in the city. Pre-booking: To ensure a smooth transfer, it is advisable to pre-book your airport transfer in advance. You can either do this through your hotel or by contacting a local transportation service. Many hotels offer airport transfer services for their guests. Arrival: Upon arrival at Siem Reap International Airport, after clearing immigration and collecting your luggage, proceed to the arrival hall. Meet and greet: At the airport transfer service area, you will find representatives holding signs or placards with the names of passengers. We also arrange the tour services in the whole Cambodia.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d23912404-Reviews-Angkor_Travel_Guide-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@traveltoinspire.net,+855 92 417 796,http://traveltoinspire.net/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d23912404-Angkor_Travel_Guide-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#77 of 129 Boat Tours &amp; Water Sports in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '129', 'ranking': '77'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,1,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '1'}",Not available,34,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d23912404-m66827-Reviews-Angkor_Travel_Guide-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time'