Angkor Visitor,here:pds:place:116aabd1-87557a336d210465f106e11233c9b985,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Angkor Visitor, ផ្លូវជាតិ 63, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 63', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35218, 'lng': 103.85348}","[{'lat': 13.3522, 'lng': 103.85334}]",116648,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2642828'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512381100'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.angkorvisitor.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 05:00 - 20:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T050000', 'duration': 'PT15H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.35218,103.85351,2642828,Angkor Visitor,"Dear value visitor, welcome to Angkor Visitor Tours! My name is Praim Hear. I am a self-employed and licensed English-speaking tour guide and organizer specializing in Angkor Wat and Siem Reap since 2007. I offer private tours, Family tours and group tours to Angkor Wat and historical attractions in the beautiful city of Siem Reap. I offer the most competitive prices on the market and highest quality of service that will create memories of your tip to Cambodia. Less well known destinations include remote temples, floating villages, waterfalls, and even shopping districts. I am very pleased to respond to all your inquiries about your trip to Cambodia and can offer you assistance in your trip planning to all sightseeing options in Siem Reap area. I can easily customize your tour to add value to your overall experience. Customers satisfaction is my top priorities. Let me make your visit to Cambodia unforgettable. Thank you for considering Angkor Visitor. Warmest regards, Praim",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d2642828-Reviews-Angkor_Visitor-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '63 National Road', 'street2': 'Wat Po Banteay Chey Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17000', 'address_string': '63 National Road Wat Po Banteay Chey Village, Siem Reap 17000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,praimangkor@yahoo.com,+855 12 381 100,http://www.angkorvisitor.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d2642828-Angkor_Visitor-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#47 of 1,339 Tours in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1339', 'ranking': '47'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,509,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '13', '5': '494'}",Not available,448,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d2642828-m66827-Reviews-Angkor_Visitor-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2000'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 05:00 - 20:00', 'Tuesday: 05:00 - 20:00', 'Wednesday: 05:00 - 20:00', 'Thursday: 05:00 - 20:00', 'Friday: 05:00 - 20:00', 'Saturday: 05:00 - 20:00', 'Sunday: 05:00 - 20:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}",