Angkor Wat Putt,here:pds:place:116w63gg-7fa2af82bc644511b847059191105298,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Angkor Wat Putt, 171206 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ជ្រាវ', 'postalCode': '171206'}","{'lat': 13.32347, 'lng': 103.87079}","[{'lat': 13.32334, 'lng': 103.87078}]",26528,"[{'id': '550-5520-0000', 'name': 'Leisure', 'primary': True}, {'id': '550-5510-0202', 'name': 'Park-Recreation Area'}, {'id': '550-5520-0207', 'name': 'Amusement Park'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3157529'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512302330'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.angkorwatputt.com'}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '550-5510-0202'}, {'id': '550-5520-0000'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 20:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.323803,103.8708,3157529,Angkor Wat Putt,"Angkor Wat Putt is a fantastic and fun, 14 hole Miniature Golf Course in Siem Reap.Come and knock a ball under and around 9 accurate replicas of the world famous Angkor Temples. Including Angkor Wat, Ta Prohm, Bayon, Banteay Srei, Preah Vihear and the Terrace of the Elephants.Perfect for all the family, young and old. If you need a break from the actual temples to have a bit of fun then do it guilt free. The course is set in a well maintained garden with cooling mist, seating area while food, ice cold beer and soft drink as well as ice cream are available to serve you here. The view of open greenery rice fields surrounded by friendly local villagers and sunset can be watched from the course.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d3157529-Reviews-Angkor_Wat_Putt-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Angkor High School Road', 'street2': 'Veal Village, Sangkat Chreav', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': 'Angkor High School Road Veal Village, Sangkat Chreav, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,angkorwatputt@gmail.com,+855 12 302 330,http://www.angkorwatputt.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d3157529-Angkor_Wat_Putt-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#2 of 51 Fun &amp; Games in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '51', 'ranking': '2'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,887,"{'1': '6', '2': '8', '3': '21', '4': '154', '5': '698'}",Not available,470,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d3157529-m66827-Reviews-Angkor_Wat_Putt-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2000'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 08:00 - 20:00', 'Tuesday: 08:00 - 20:00', 'Wednesday: 08:00 - 20:00', 'Thursday: 08:00 - 20:00', 'Friday: 08:00 - 20:00', 'Saturday: 08:00 - 20:00', 'Sunday: 08:00 - 20:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'fun_games', 'localized_name': 'Fun & Games'}, {'name': 'nature_parks', 'localized_name': 'Nature & Parks'}, {'name': 'attractions', 