Angkor Wildlife & Aquarium,here:pds:place:116w6652-e5562709b73d77297cc540d40d92fcad,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Angkor Wildlife & Aquarium, 170406 សូត្រនិគម, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សូត្រនិគម', 'district': 'ខ្ចាស់', 'postalCode': '170406'}","{'lat': 13.26807, 'lng': 104.06705}","[{'lat': 13.26794, 'lng': 104.06705}]",29045,"[{'id': '550-5520-0208', 'name': 'Zoo', 'primary': True}, {'id': '550-5520-0211', 'name': 'Aquarium'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '24998284'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85581502555'}]}],"[{'categories': [{'id': '550-5520-0211'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT09H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.281931,104.06631,24998284,Angkor Wildlife & Aquarium,"Angkor Wildlife & Aquarium (AWA) is Cambodia’s first wildlife sanctuary and aquarium, just minutes from Siem Reap’s iconic temples. Perfect for families, nature enthusiasts, and curious travellers, AWA offers an unforgettable experience with a free round-trip shuttle service from downtown Siem Reap. Expect to encounter majestic Indochinese tigers, endangered Siamese crocodiles, and a dazzling array of aquatic life as you explore our lush wildlife habitats and state-of-the-art aquarium. Interactive exhibits and guided tours provide fascinating insights into Cambodia’s rich biodiversity and conservation efforts. Whether you’re looking for a fun family day out or a deeper connection with nature, Angkor Wildlife & Aquarium is the must-visit destination in Siem Reap. Hop on our complimentary shuttle and dive into the wonders of Cambodia’s natural world!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d24998284-Reviews-Angkor_Wildlife_Aquarium-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road Number 6a, Phum Kboun, Kum Khchas', 'street2': 'Srok Sotnikom Siem Reap, Cambodia', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '170402', 'address_string': 'National Road Number 6a, Phum Kboun, Kum Khchas Srok Sotnikom Siem Reap, Cambodia, Siem Reap 170402 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,contact@awa-sr.com,+855 81 502 555,http://angkorwildlife.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d24998284-Angkor_Wildlife_Aquarium-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 2 Zoos &amp; Aquariums in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '2', 'ranking': '1'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,53,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '0', '4': '2', '5': '52'}",Not available,179,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d24998284-m66827-Reviews-Angkor_Wildlife_Aquarium-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '1700'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Tuesday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Wednesday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Thursday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Friday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Saturday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Sunday: 08:00 - 17:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name