Angkor Wonder Driver - Day Tours,here:pds:place:116w63gg-5b988bdc3102f7a1f5b0dfa2ce806a83,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Angkor Wonder Driver - Day Tours, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.34551, 'lng': 103.84482}","[{'lat': 13.34558, 'lng': 103.8447}]",87332,"[{'id': '400-4100-0041', 'name': 'Transportation Service', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8870145'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512331664'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://web.facebook.com/angkorwonderdriver'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.345539,103.84476,8870145,Angkor Wonder Driver - Day Tours,"You may have difficulty in exploring Siem Reap with your short scheduled holiday? If you need someone who have a capable of English and skill to drive and suggest your daytime tour details, may be you could contact me! With a very strong commitment as a service provider, I am surely that I would be able to serve you in driving to explore the land of Angkor Wat as per your requirement base on a suitable arrangement to make your wish come true according to my 13 years’ experience in the tourism and hospitality industry. Furthermore you may wish to have your expense is generating to the real local people rather than a business man hence you should book me directly not through the hotel where you are staying neither travel agencies. I am very flexible with what you needs as well as your convenience and I would be able to customize your favorite at glance. I am sure you could only pay for the service that you would have been used.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d8870145-Reviews-Angkor_Wonder_Driver_Day_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17355', 'address_s