Angkor Wonder Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-08837d0218e00ab0a62c9d33e1d850e5,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Angkor Wonder Hotel, ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35125, 'lng': 103.8518}","[{'lat': 13.35114, 'lng': 103.85189}]",88278,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2273495'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512328893'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.351288,103.85177,2273495,Angkor Wonder Hotel,"Angkor Wonder Hostel is in a good location, Near Old Market Area, it is a new hostel decorated with Khmer Art Style. Our staff are friendly and helpful. Pub Street is just a 3 minute walk by Phsar Krom Street. Angkor Wonder Hostel is surrounded by a tropical garden with a depiction of the temple jungle. We have 20 rooms with either Fan or A/C. We offer:* Free Pick Up From Siem Reap Airport, Bus Station or Boat Dock* FREE 24-hr Internet Access (Wifi)* FREE Welcome Drink (On Arrival and check out time)* Room cleaning everyday* FREE Map of Temple & Town* FREE bed linen and towels* FREE book swap* 80 International Satellite TV Channels* Travel and Tour Information* Guest Kitchen Available. Check in at 7:00am as long as you let us know you are arriving early. Check out at 12:00 noon.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d2273495-Reviews-Angkor_Wonder_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#59, Street Phsar Krom', 'street2': 'Vihear Chen Village, Svay Dang Kum', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '855', 'address_string': '#59, Street Phsar Krom Vihear Chen Village, Svay Dang Kum, Siem Reap 855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location