Anik Boutique Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649e-85d08c69807043a595fe93767249da03,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Anik Boutique Hotel, ផ្លូវ សួនទន្លេបាសាក់ 12, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សួនទន្លេបាសាក់', 'postalCode': '120101', 'houseNumber': '12'}","{'lat': 11.54445, 'lng': 104.93337}","[{'lat': 11.54457, 'lng': 104.93342}]",22106,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6401085'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523982174'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.anikhotelgroup.com/anikboutique'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.5447,104.93325,6401085,Anik Boutique Hotel,"Anik Boutique Hotel is a beautiful small castle, nestled in the heart of Phnom Penh City, well know for the capital city of Cambodia. The boutique was built by a businessman who was widely respected in the whole family, ""Anik"" is the name of his wife. With the lady, Anik in mind, the whole property has been created to showcase natural beauty as evident from the landscape featuring intimate gardens. Anik is the only boutique hotel in Cambodia that offer feeling home service. Taken from the inspiration, this is reminiscent of the way a mother like Madam Anik take care of her children and husband.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d6401085-Reviews-Anik_Boutique_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 12, Street Tonle', 'street2': 'Bassac Park, Khan Chamkarmom', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '1111', 'address_string': 'No. 12, Street Tonle Bassac Park, Khan Chamkarmom, Phnom Penh 1111 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d6401085-Anik_Boutique_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#65 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '65'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,127,"{'1': '0', '2': '4', '3': '12', '4': '49', '5': '62'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",109,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d6401085-m66827-Reviews-Anik_Boutique_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Room service', 'Free Internet', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Suites', 'Spa', 'Airport transportation', 'Public Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Minibar', 'Flatscreen TV', 'Breakfast Buffet', 'Free parking', 'Wheelchair access', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Breakfast included', 'Dry Cleaning', 'Meeting rooms', 'Business center', 'Fitness center', 'Laundry Service', 'Concierge', 'Air conditioning', 'Family Rooms', 'Self-Serve Laundry', 'Babysitting', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Safe', 'Private Balcony', 'Breakfast Available', 'Housek