Anik Villa - Rainbow Bridge,here:pds:place:116w649e-b560b7301ce5430388cf9f2b6ec19289,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Anik Villa - Rainbow Bridge, ផ្លូវ សួនទន្លេបាសាក់, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សួនទន្លេបាសាក់', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.54495, 'lng': 104.93301}","[{'lat': 11.54475, 'lng': 104.93294}]",22174,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'www': [{'value': 'http://www.anikboutiquehotels.com'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.555143,104.924164,19686127,Anik Palace Hotel,"Welcome to Anik Palace Hotel which has an appearance of a castle, all guestrooms, and public areas are beautifully designed with a European classical theme in both its interior and exterior. It is superbly located in the glorious city of the Kingdom of Cambodia. The exterior look of the hotel building draws from the history of Cambodia – dating back to the year 1863 when Cambodia was ruled by the French Colony and was only then granted independence in the mid-1900s when Prince Norodom Sihanouk became king. Anik Palace hotel’s exterior concept took inspiration from this event in order to display Cambodia’s history and all the hardships that our country has gone through and what it had overcome. The bricks used for the structure’s exterior design is over 100 years old. Whether you are traveling for business or leisure you will find yourself in one of the best locations in Phnom Penh, with some of the city’s finest dining, shopping, entertainment, and as well as a nearby market venue all within walking distance.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d19686127-Reviews-Anik_Palace_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#14, Street 278', 'street2': 'Sangkat Boeung Keng Kang I', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'p