Anjali by Syphon,here:pds:place:116w63u4-09939c80f51446fb9dd49063b4ac9c38,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Anjali by Syphon, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.37745, 'lng': 103.84239}","[{'lat': 13.37757, 'lng': 103.84246}]",87441,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12672128'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510841121'}, {'value': '+85563965600'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.anjalihotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.377281,103.8426,12672128,Anjali by Syphon,"Indulge in Luxurious Tranquility Anjali by syphon opens its doors to travelers seeking an upscale experience that harmonizes luxury and simplicity, sustainability, and authentic cultural immersion. Since its inception in 2018, Anjali By Syphon Hotel has epitomized its Sanskrit-inspired name, symbolizing a mark of respect, through its steadfast commitment to honoring the environment, and the essence of Cambodian hospitality. With a meticulously curated selection of 29 well-appointed rooms, Anjali By Syphon Hotel beckons guests into a world where every detail is crafted with care, every interaction imbued with warmth, and every moment suffused with tranquility.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12672128-Reviews-Anjali_by_Syphon-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#1705 Korean Friendship Road 30', 'street2': 'Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': '#1705 Korean Friendship Road 30 Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phno