Ankounamatata,here:pds:place:116w3cmj-6a30ec932d074d28a97b63c9ddb63b74,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Ankounamatata, 180405 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'កោះរុង', 'postalCode': '180405'}","{'lat': 10.73267, 'lng': 103.251}","[{'lat': 10.73266, 'lng': 103.25086}]",90368,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11625110'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510352415'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://web.facebook.com/ankounamatatakohrong'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 09:30 - 21:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T093000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Preah Sihanouk,10.732655,103.25118,11625110,Ankounamatata,"Ankounamatata is an alternative arts, music and food paradise. During the day we serve healthy breakfast - the freshest coffee and crepes you'll find on this island For lunch, we present a range of western dishes with daily specials. Our customers particularly enjoy a hot soup with some tortilla In the nights we welcome Djs/musicians, performance artists and travellers to celebrate Koh Rong",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g1808558-d11625110-Reviews-Ankounamatata-Koh_Rong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Koh Rong Street', 'street2': ""Next to Coco's & Island Speed Ferry Pier"", 'city': 'Koh Rong', 'state': 'Koh Kong Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': ""Koh Rong Street Next to Coco's & Island Speed Ferry Pier, Koh Rong Cambodia""}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Koh Rong', 'location_id': '1808558'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Koh Kong Province', 'location_id': '2366667'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,alexandre.badon@gmail.com,+855 10 352 415,http://web.facebook.com/ankounamatatakohrong/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1808558-d1162