"Apartment, Hotel and Guest House",here:pds:place:116w649d-83b10a077fe24ac6ac5a7b6f3dc64ce0,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Apartment, Hotel and Guest House, ផ្លូវ 656, 120406 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ទួលគោក', 'subdistrict': 'ទឹកល្អក់ទី បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 656', 'postalCode': '120406'}","{'lat': 11.55281, 'lng': 104.89002}","[{'lat': 11.5528, 'lng': 104.89002}]",3286,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570541443'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.568394,104.9016,23937125,Luxcity Hotel & Apartment,"Luxcity Hotel & Apartment is a 4-star venue located near Phnom Penh Megamall, offering a convenient and enjoyable stay. With security, quiet surroundings, and proximity to various attractions such as Eden Garden and TK Avenue, it is an ideal choice for both leisure and business travelers. The hotel offers a range of services provided by friendly and professional staff, ensuring a comfortable and pleasant experience. With 166 rooms on 25 floors, it provides all the amenities you need, including high-speed internet, a swimming pool, and a restaurant serving local dishes. Start your day with a delicious continental breakfast and explore the nearby dining options. Don't miss the opportunity to stay at Luxcity Hotel & Apartment, conveniently located near Phnom Penh airport and major attractions in the city.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d23937125-Reviews-Luxcity_Hotel_Apartment-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 118', 'street2': 'Sangkat Mittapheap, Khan 7 Makara', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12252', 'address_string': 'Street 118 Sangkat Mittapheap, Khan 7 Makara, Phnom Penh 12252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,