Apsara Angkor Art Gallery,here:pds:place:116w63gg-1b0692f4d3682686a3afeab6cd674741,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Apsara Angkor Art Gallery, ផ្លូវ 8-ប៉េ អ៊ុយ បេ, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 8-ប៉េ អ៊ុយ បេ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.3549, 'lng': 103.85468}","[{'lat': 13.35479, 'lng': 103.85475}]",226925,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '24921579'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512445969'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100084393973404'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.354805,103.85474,24921579,Apsara Angkor Art Gallery,"hello everybody from Apsara Angkor Art Gallery we are very honored to establish a community of local products for national and international guests to visit and participate, we have selected quality products and amazing art. Other great things like paintings, sculptures, creative materials, clothes, scarves, silk and many other products, there are 28 communities participating . We are honored to establish an communicate that can work together to build this community. Apsara Angkor Art Gallery is an community that unites and collaboration artisans and traders and artists to exhibit together as one Khmer. The orange background of the sun represents the same life on earth as the promotion of our community. Angkor Wat represents Khmer culture and civilization and nationality Yellow Apsara is a symbol of unity and representation of the re-emergence and growth of Khmer art.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d24921579-Reviews-Apsara_Angkor_Art_Gallery-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Pub Street', 'street2': 'Pub Street 2 Thnou ST next to ucare Pharmacy', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': 'Pub 