Apsara Tours Co. LTD.,here:pds:place:116w649e-4e151addfdd4612124ce16a3ac218ea4,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Apsara Tours Co. LTD., ផ្លូវ 254, 120207 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ចតុមុខ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 254', 'postalCode': '120207'}","{'lat': 11.5572, 'lng': 104.92464}","[{'lat': 11.55733, 'lng': 104.9246}]",6704,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11811093'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523216562'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.apsaratours.com.kh'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sat: 08:00 - 17:30'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT09H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.557242,104.92462,11811093,Apsara Tours Co. Ltd.,"Founded in 1990, Apsara Tours is a historical tour operator in Cambodia. Our strong reputation has been gained over time in part thanks to our governing body to this day still unchanged. Specializing in East Asia, we have developed relationships with all the necessary stakeholders in order to offer you the best service possible, whether in Cambodia, Laos, Burma, Thailand or Vietnam. Our range of activities is vast and our team is able to create an extension, a ""tailor-made"" travel, a unique itinerary or brochures that will surely satisfy your customers, but also if you are a private individual. We can guarantee you this thanks to the tens of thousands of services we buy each year (overnight stays, lunchs, dinners, services, transport ...). Finally, our team is able to intervene on all continents because our customers are of all nationalities, we will organize your project in the best way so that you or your customers are always satisfied.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d11811093-Reviews-Apsara_Tours_Co_Ltd-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1'