Aroma Daily Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w63gg-c7d3f354f7d14f739afe188a80ab3380,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Aroma Daily Guesthouse, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35058, 'lng': 103.85537}","[{'lat': 13.35058, 'lng': 103.85537}]",88603,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2044126'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512519136'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.350582,103.85538,2044126,Aroma Daily Guesthouse,"We are a Khmer business that aim to provide you with our excellent services. Our staffs are friendly and have ability to speak English, French, Thai and Japanese. Pay less but get more services like you stay in a more expensive guesthouse because the rooms are clean with private bathroom, shoes, soap, toilet paper and provide a water on arrival day, room cleaning service. My family will give you the best and the most honest advice about your stay in our guesthouse during your vacation in Angkor Wat, Siem Reap, Cambodia.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d2044126-Reviews-Aroma_Daily_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#0141, Wat Domnak Village Old Market / turn right 150m', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': '#0141, Wat Domnak Village Old Market / turn right 150m, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d2044126-Aroma_Daily_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', '