Aroma House,here:pds:place:116aabd1-f9b3ab4485f603ea22bb4dcf05188883,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Aroma House, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.6098, 'lng': 104.18123}","[{'lat': 10.60968, 'lng': 104.18129}]",25832,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '372-000', 'name': 'Mediterranean', 'primary': True}, {'id': '250-000', 'name': 'Middle Eastern'}, {'id': '253-000', 'name': 'Lebanese'}, {'id': '800-077', 'name': 'Vegetarian'}, {'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10753203'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10755201'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578796440'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/aromakampot'}]}]","[{'text': ['Tue-Sun: 11:00 - 21:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T110000', 'duration': 'PT10H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kampot,10.609713,104.18127,10755201,Aroma House,"Offering a new experience in dining for Kampot. All homemade from scratch using organic ingredients as much as possible. We make everything fresh everyday including our own bread, hummus and sauces.. no cans, or off the shelf ingredients. Whether you are vegetarian or meat lover, we have something to dazzle your taste buds. Welcome to Aroma House!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d10755201-Reviews-Aroma_House-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '722 Street', 'street2': 'Mouy Osorphea Village', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': '722 Street Mouy Osorphea Village, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asi