Art Blvd,here:pds:place:116w649e-178e4f0da6c14461890116bbc4398c89,en,Art Museum,"{'label': 'Art Blvd, ផ្លូវ 105, 120104 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 105', 'postalCode': '120104'}","{'lat': 11.55007, 'lng': 104.91924}","[{'lat': 11.55007, 'lng': 104.91934}]",262414,"[{'id': '600-6900-0307', 'name': 'Arts & Crafts Supplies', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85587232168'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.550718,104.93076,1939800,YK Art House,"Welcome to YK Art House, a small hotel in Phnom Penh that is your very special hideaway while travelling through Cambodia’s capital. After a day exploring this bustling city you can retreat to an oasis of tranquility and friendliness. You’ll enjoy our secluded setting, clean accommodation and amenities such as swimming pool, art gallery, pool table, and bar. The rooms are decorated simply and practically, with a desk in each room and good Wifi. Your stay supports Seametrey Children's Village, located an hour away from Phnom Penh.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d1939800-Reviews-YK_Art_House-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '830 13 a Street', 'street2': 'Sangkat Tonle Bassac', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '830 13 a Street Sangkat Tonle Bassac, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d1939800-YK_Art_House-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#3 of 412 B&Bs / Inns in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '412', 'ranking': '3'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/t