Art Shadow Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w63u5-6c0274346fe94b95bda6773ee114bbb7,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Art Shadow Restaurant, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37148, 'lng': 103.86399}","[{'lat': 13.37143, 'lng': 103.86412}]",22760,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-064', 'name': 'International'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15187864'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515407555'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 11:00 - 23:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T110000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.371485,103.86396,15187864,Art Shadow Restaurant,"Art Shadow Restaurant, tucked away in a peaceful garden and verdant tropical trees, is a tranquil place for a unique dining experience in Siem Reap. The restaurant opens for daily lunch and dinner with lots of menu options. Guests will be entertained by cultural tribe dance performance daily from 19:30pm - 20:30pm. Art Shadow Restaurant also offers a wide range of private events and catering services such as birthday party, staff party, romantic dinner, private group lunch or dinner and corporate social events. Our dedicated catering services team will ensure your event and party are great success with lots of joy and fun. The packages can be tailored to suit specific needs and a personal planning service ensures all requirements run smoothly.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d15187864-Reviews-Art_Shadow_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No.207, Ousaphear Street', 'street2': 'Trang Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'No.207, O