Artbomb Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w636k-52af3ceacbd744ecb67d6b8545ad3184,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Artbomb Cambodia, 021402 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ព្រែកព្រះស្ដេច', 'postalCode': '021402'}","{'lat': 13.08431, 'lng': 103.21572}","[{'lat': 13.08418, 'lng': 103.21567}]",245955,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+855969515390'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.artbomb.asia'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.07285,103.21626,8720430,Real Cambodia Tour,Dear all Travellers You want to visit Battambang and Real Cambodia? My name is Savet a former of English teacher from 2010 to 2014 and graduated University in 2013 major of Human Resource Management. Now I work as a tour guide and Tuk Tuk driver base in Battambang. I would like to introduce my unique tour program if you have one day to visit Battambang. What makes us different? - We mix bike tour and Tuk Tuk tour in a day. - We do explore village life by bikes so this is the best way to know Real Cambodia. It is my own village where i was born so i will show you how we live and enjoy cycling around beautiful countryside. - We offer you a local lunch that will be prepared by my wife. - You will have a chance to meet friendly local people and they are so happy to meet you. - We are happy during the tour if you have more questions to ask.,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d8720430-Reviews-Real_Cambodia_Tour-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02201', 'address_string': 'Battambang 02201 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,realcambodiatour@gmail.com,+855 70 854 044,http://realcambodiatour.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d8720430-Real_Cambodia_Tour-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#4 of 39 Outdoor Activities in Battambang', 'geo_location_name': 'Battambang', 'ranking_out_of': '39', 'ranking': '4'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,543,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '1', '4': '7', '5': '534'}",Not available,901,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d8720430-m66827-Reviews-Real_Cambodia_Tour-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '1900'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 08:30 - 19:00', 'Tuesday: 08:30 - 19:00', 'Wednesday: 08:30 - 19:00', 'Thursday: 08:30 - 19:00', 'Friday: 08:30 - 19:00', 'Saturday: 08:30 - 19:00', 'Sunday: 08:30 - 19:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}, {'name': 'outdoor_activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Bike Tours', 'localized_name': 'Bike Tours'}, {'name': 'Cultural Tours', 'localized_name': 'Cultural Tours'}, {'name': 'Historical & Heritage Tours', 'localized_name': 'Historical & Heritage Tours'}, {'name': 'Private Tours',