Arts Cafe,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-39a0f0a707e44d978ee6ee2fd033bab2,en,cafe,"{'label': 'Arts Cafe, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.48675, 'lng': 104.28921}","[{'lat': 10.48675, 'lng': 104.28935}]",311598,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13283498'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516204466'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/artscafekep'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon, Tue, Thu-Sun: 07:30 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T073000', 'duration': 'PT14H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kep,10.486746,104.2892,13283498,Arts Cafe,"Experience a difference with us. Arts Café is here for you, and for our community. A unique boutique and seaside café located at the Crab Market in Kep. The Arts Café offers tailored clothing, bags and accessories as well as traditional Cambodian crafts. We serve a wide variety of excellent coffees, drinks, Cambodian & Western food and vegetarian dishes in addition to Kep’s famous seafood. Arts Café is a fun place for families. We are an extension of Khmer Hands, a vocational training school for local people to develop job skills and a career they love in hospitality or design. We work to inspire our students to do their best for themselves and their guests. We hope this brings you – the best meals – the best coffees – the best service. So we welcome you into that experience, and we thank you for being a part of this training. Enjoy the opportunity to make a difference, for yourself, and for these future professionals.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608456-d13283498-Reviews-Arts_Cafe-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street2': 'Crab Market', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07503', 'address_string': 'Crab Market, Kep 07503 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info.khmerhands@gmail.com,+855 16 204 466,http://www.facebook.com/artscafekep/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d13283498-Arts_Cafe-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_string': '#8 of 65 Places to Eat in Kep', 'geo_location_name': 'Kep', 'ranking_out_of': '65', 'ranking': '8'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,96,"{'1': '3', '2': '2', '3': '7', '4': '18', '5': '66'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",89,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608456-d13283498-m66827-Reviews-Arts_Cafe-Kep_Kep_Province.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0730'}