Arun Rass Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-d81ac1caaae003337aae0fa64ab2e50b,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Arun Rass Guesthouse, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.48327, 'lng': 104.31702}","[{'lat': 10.48337, 'lng': 104.31693}]",6267,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5988153'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517237567'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.kep-arunrass.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.4833,104.317,5988153,Arun Rass Guesthouse,"Finding an ideal family-friendly guest house in Kep does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Arun Rass Guest House, a nice option for travelers like you.
Free wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at Arun Rass Guest House offer air conditioning.
During your stay, take advantage of some of the amenities offered, including a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and room service. Guests of Arun Rass Guest House are also welcome to enjoy an on-site restaurant. For travelers arriving by car, free parking is available.
Close to some of Kep's most popular landmarks, such as Crab Statue (1.3 mi) and Patio (1.4 mi), Arun Rass Guest House is a great destination for tourists.
If you’re looking for a cafe, consider a visit to Kep Coffee, Arts Cafe, or Foods & coffee house, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Arun Rass Guest House.
Should time allow, Jasmine Valley Skate Bowl is a popular attraction that is within walking distance.
Arun Rass Guest House puts the best of Kep at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d5988153-Reviews-Arun_Rass_Guesthouse-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Pepper Road Thmiey Village Prey Thom', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '15000', 'address_string': 'Pepper Road Thmiey Village Prey Thom, Kep 15000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d5988153-Arun_Rass_Guesthouse-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_string': '#17 of 71 B&Bs / Inns in Kep', 'geo_location_name': 'Kep', 'ranking_out_of': '71', 'ranking': '17'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,75,"{'1': '2', '2': '5', '3': '5', '4': '15', '5': '48'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",32,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d5988153-m66