Arunras Hotel,here:pds:place:116httek-3e38f1d5294f04b260695d40d346af46,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Arunras Hotel, 060803 ស្ទឹងសែន, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ធំ', 'city': 'ស្ទឹងសែន', 'district': 'កំពង់រទេះ', 'postalCode': '060803'}","{'lat': 12.71153, 'lng': 104.88856}","[{'lat': 12.7114, 'lng': 104.88858}]",73412,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1580886'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3642327'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85562961294'}]}],Not Available,Kampong Thom,12.711424,104.88858,1580886,Arunras Hotel,"Welcome to Arunras Hotel, your Kampong Thom “home away from home.” Arunras Hotel aims to make your visit as relaxing and enjoyable as possible, which is why so many guests continue to come back year after year.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as air conditioning, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the hotel.
The property also boasts an on-site restaurant, to help make your stay more enjoyable.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the Asian restaurants, including Sambor Village Restaurant and Bar and Kampong Thom Restaurant, all of which are a short distance from Arunras Hotel.
Arunras Hotel puts the best of Kampong Thom at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1024989-d1580886-Reviews-Arunras_Hotel-Kampong_Thom_Kampong_Thom_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '39Eo, Street Sereypheap', 'street2': 'Steung Sen District', 'city': 'Kampong Thom', 'state': 'Kampong Thom Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': '39Eo, Street Sereypheap Steung Sen District, Kampong Thom Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampong Thom', 'location_id': '1024989'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampong Thom Province', 'location_id': '2366663'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1024989-d1580886-Arunras_Hotel-Kampong_Thom_Kampong_Thom_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '1024989', 'ranking_string': '#3 of 7 hotels in Kampong Thom', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampong Thom', 'ranking_out_of': '7', 'ranking': '3'}",3,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.0-66827-5.svg,95,"{'1': '3', '2': '14', '3': '44', '4': '26', '5': '8'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}}",32,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1024989-d1580886-m66827-Reviews-Arunras_Hotel-Kampong_Thom_Kampong_Thom_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Free Internet', 'Free Wifi', 'Internet', 'Restaurant', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Air conditioning', 'Non-smoking hotel']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"['Centrally Located', 'Business']",[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '9'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '30'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '21'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '9'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '17'}]",Not available,Not available,Not available,FALSE,11,5
Arunreas Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-b6097453248c41efb966181bce1ec31d,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Arunreas Restaurant, 070202 ទឹកឈូរ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'ទឹកឈូរ', 'district': 'ជុំក្រៀល', 'postalCode': '070202'}","{'lat': 10.59391, 'lng': 104.19065}","[{'lat': 10.59403, 'lng': 104.19072}]",18000,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512484951'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.601469,104.18485,25170331,1960 Restaurant,"Passion, tradition, history and creativity fused in the kitchen of 1960 bringing to your plate authentic Cambodian cuisine. There's something for everyone. When you dine at 1960 Restaurant, you will get to enjoy delicious Cambodian cuisine surrounded by a beautiful garden while listening to the most famous voices of the Kingdom. During the 1960’s under the Khmer Rouge, the music scene was thriving, combining pop rock influences and traditional Cambodian music. Many of Cambodia’s traditional recipes have been forgotten and vanished with some of the best musicians… 1960 Restaurant has reopened the old traditional Cambodian cookbooks to put back on the menu some delicious dishes from the past. Located close to the center of Kampot, guests can choose to dine in the outdoor garden or in the indoor area with comfortable sitting. 1960 Restaurant is open everyday for lunch and dinner, and offers private dining and special events.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d25170331-Reviews-1960_Restaurant-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '701 Street', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '070805', 'address_string': '701 Street, Kampot 070805 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,+855 12 236 458,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d25170331-1960_Restaurant-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#29 of 174 Places to Eat in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '174', 'ranking': '29'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,23,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '1', '5': '22'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",65,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d25170331-m66827-Reviews-1960_Restaurant-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1700'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1700'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1700'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1700'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '1700'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '1700'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2300'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: Closed', 'Tuesday: 17:00 - 23:00', 'Wednesday: 17:00 - 23:00', 'Thursday: 17:00 - 23:00', 'Friday: 17:00 - 23:00', 'Saturday: 17:00 - 23:00', 'Sunday: 17:00 - 23:00']}","['Dog Friendly', 'Family style', 'Free off-street