Arvi,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-2406acc4a66e55f6ea41f6343fd96387,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Arvi, 070805 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'ត្រើយកោះ', 'postalCode': '070805'}","{'lat': 10.59723, 'lng': 104.17817}","[{'lat': 10.59717, 'lng': 104.17805}]",19404,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-066', 'name': 'Fusion'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '22996570'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578775542'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://amber-kampot.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:00 - 10:00, 12:00 - 14:00, 18:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT04H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}, {'start': 'T120000', 'duration': 'PT02H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}, {'start': 'T180000', 'duration': 'PT04H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kampot,10.597835,104.17951,22996570,Arvi,"Arvi provides a plethora of Khmer and fusion cuisine, all cooked using fresh, local produce by our expert chef. Our Executive Chef Toek Manghout is a self-taught foodie and local to the area. Garnering his experience from waiting tables and working in the kitchen at Phnom Penh’s prestigious Topaz, he elevated his art under the guidance of Chef Pov Sopheak and Master Chef Alain Darc. After runnin",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d22996570-Reviews-Arvi-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Phum Ta Ang', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '13205', 'address_string': 'Phum Ta Ang, Kampot 13205 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', '