Asarita Angkor Resort & Spa,here:pds:place:116aabd1-eb8c5b1b13da04cd698317c01f1457d2,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Asarita Angkor Resort & Spa, អេអេច21, 171210 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្រងែ', 'street': 'អេអេច21', 'postalCode': '171210'}","{'lat': 13.37851, 'lng': 103.83154}","[{'lat': 13.3784, 'lng': 103.83146}]",87292,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8288139'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517674449'}, {'value': '+85589838187'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.37854,103.83155,8288139,Asarita Angkor Resort & Spa,"Asarita Angkor Resort and Bungalows is the features standalone bungalows with a terrace or patio who guests deserved relaxing and located in the City Center of Siem Reap, Cambodia. Just 4km from Cambodia International Airport. And we offering complementary transportation from and to the airport. Spend only 10mn drive to Siem Reap Town such as Pup Street or night market. Especially resort located opposite with Cambodia Cultural Village just walk only 5 minutes. Our resort is perfect choice for your next family, couple or solo traveler. We waited you to offer warm and friendly hospitality. Experience traditional Khmer hospitality discover the true meaning of service with smiles and every possible convenience. Beautiful resort design is tucked quietly, Relaxed with fresh air, surrounded by beautiful garden. All rooms are large and decorated with bamboo Accessories represents nature.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d8288139-Reviews-Asarita_Angkor_Resort_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road 6', 'street2': 'Kruos Village, Opposite of Cambodian Cultural Village, Khum Svay Dangkum', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string