Asean Restaurant,here:pds:place:116httek-86128fbaf50c0359f08ba03cefffa51a,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Asean Restaurant, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.10017, 'lng': 103.20066}","[{'lat': 13.10018, 'lng': 103.20052}]",12698,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510696944'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.101392,103.19863,5121368,Jaan Bai Restaurant,"Jaan Bai is a home for folks who share our love of gatherings around the table, our passion for food and our interest in supporting Cambodian youth. We are focused on the training and professional development of Cambodian youth, with all profits going towards the overall sustainability of CCT. Our cuisine is all about the simplicity of well crafted, nourishing and wholesome recipes. We use seasonal organic produce sourced from our kitchen garden, local farmers and neighbouring markets. This project has been made possible by Vittoria Coffee, Australia. Open 11:00 - 10:00 (kitchen closes at 9:00) Tuesday - Sunday.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g303666-d5121368-Reviews-Jaan_Bai_Restaurant-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Corner 2 Street and 1 1/2 Street', 'street2': 'Near Psar Nat', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'Corner 2 Street and 1 1/2 Street Near Psar Nat, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,jaanbai@cambodianchildrenstrust.org,+855 78 263 144,http://www.facebook.com/cctjaanbai,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d5121368-Jaan_Bai_Restaurant