Asia Voyage Tour,here:pds:place:116w63gg-326a95148f3fa56c49018e721f91958e,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Asia Voyage Tour, វិថី សាលាកម្រើក, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'វិថី សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34235, 'lng': 103.86285}","[{'lat': 13.34227, 'lng': 103.86274}]",115762,"[{'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12240546'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512999944'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.asiavoyagetour.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 05:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T050000', 'duration': 'PT18H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.342349,103.86285,12240546,Asia Voyage Tour,"Asia Voyage Tour company provides outdoor activities and tours to Angkor Park and sites within Siem Reap plus major tourist sites in adjacent provinces. Trips are usually half a day or one day in length and are normally private. We can assist with bookings for join-in tours but we now sub-contract those to a reputable associate. Private packages of up to four days are also available. Our tours visit Cambodia Temples, Tonle Sap Floating Villages and much more. We even offer Bird Watching expeditions. Our transport covers the full spectrum from tuk-tuk, to sedans, to mini-buses. And of course, we have professional qualified guides too.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d12240546-Reviews-Asia_Voyage_Tour-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province'