Asian Koh Kong Hotel,here:pds:place:116w614p-042605e691d744fc998a2b6de7fb96b2,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Asian Koh Kong Hotel, 090701 ខេមរភូមិន្ទ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កោះកុង', 'city': 'ខេមរភូមិន្ទ', 'district': 'ស្មាច់មានជ័យ', 'postalCode': '090701'}","{'lat': 11.61353, 'lng': 102.97926}","[{'lat': 11.61355, 'lng': 102.97912}]",41958,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2184032'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85535936667'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.asiankohkong.com'}]}]",Not Available,Koh Kong,11.613509,102.97933,2184032,Asian Koh Kong Hotel,"See why so many travelers make Asian Koh Kong Hotel their hotel of choice when visiting Koh Kong. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a budget friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer a minibar, air conditioning, and a desk, and you can stay connected during your stay as Asian Koh Kong Hotel offers guests free wifi.
The hotel features a 24 hour front desk, 24 hour check-in, and a concierge. Plus, Asian Koh Kong Hotel offers an on-site restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
If you like pubs, Asian Koh Kong Hotel is conveniently located near Mumma Lucy's Restaurant and Bar and Stevie C's Sports Bar.
Should time allow, Tatai Waterfall is a popular waterfall that is relatively easy to get to.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Asian Koh Kong Hotel as you experience all of the things Koh Kong has to offer.
