.svg', 'value': '4.0'}}",50,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1532269-d2184032-m66827-Reviews-Asian_Koh_Kong_Hotel-Koh_Kong_Koh_Kong_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Air conditioning', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Public Wifi', 'Dry Cleaning', 'Hot Tub', 'Laundry Service', 'Concierge', 'Family Rooms', 'Refrigerator in room', 'Minibar', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Parking', 'Housekeeping', 'Bath / Shower', 'Bottled Water', '24-Hour Check-in', 'Express Check-in / Check-out', 'Coffee Shop', 'Convenience Store', 'Desk', 'English', 'Complimentary Toiletries', '24-Hour Front Desk', 'Khmer', '24-Hour Security', 'Shops']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"['Great View', 'Business']",[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '3'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '34'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '20'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '9'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '8'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,11,9
"Asiban Quay Boutique Hotel, Phnom Penh",here:pds:place:116w649g-1443a6c664ed4158a6e088b0970bb25b,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Asiban Quay Boutique Hotel, Phnom Penh, តីរវិថី ព្រះស៊ីសុវត្ថិ, 120211 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'វត្តភ្នំ', 'street': 'តីរវិថី ព្រះស៊ីសុវត្ថិ', 'postalCode': '120211'}","{'lat': 11.5729, 'lng': 104.92873}","[{'lat': 11.57297, 'lng': 104.92882}]",72923,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+855964817017'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.asiban-hotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.568184,104.93073,15061406,Asiban Quay Boutique Hotel,"""Immerse in the breathtaking view of the sunrise and sunset where the Tonle Sap meets the Mekong River from our balcony rooms overlooking the riverside promenade. We offer unforgettable experiences for every type of traveller, a tourist coming to Cambodia for the first time, a business traveller stopping by regularly for meetings and events or even a couple on your honeymoon in the Kingdom of Wonder. As travelers and regular hotel guests ourselves, we understand the challenges and difficulties faced in finding an ideal hotel to stay in. More so if it's in a country you have never been before. Every traveler brings with them their own high expectations of standards and quality in a hotel and we the owners are no different. I have been traveling regularly to Phnom Penh on a monthly basis for nearly 2 years now. On every trip, I will book different hotels according to my budget. Some hotels were far and in inconvenient locations, some had thin uncomfortable pillows, water leaking from the ceiling and many more unpleasant encounters. As a traveler, I wish to get a room that had good internet connection and wifi that boasted strong signals, refreshing shower with a good heater, cable TV to keep me updated on world news and most importantly, as i wind down, A Good and Comfortable bed to fall asleep at night. And when I need to sweat it out, I could easily access the riverside promenade for a jog or leisurely walk. I also am thrilled at the fact that most F&B outlets are within close proximity.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d15061406-Reviews-Asiban_Quay_Boutique_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#319, Sisowat Quay (Riverside)', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '#319, Sisowat Quay (Riverside), Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d15061406-Asiban_Quay_Boutique_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#201 of 412 B&Bs / Inns in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '412', 'ranking': '201'}",3,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.0-66827-5.svg,7,"{'1': '2', '2': '1', '3': '1', '4': '2', '5': '1'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanline