Aspire Home Stay,here:pds:place:116w63gv-12462d895cd19cf474305a2b3fa11a6c,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Aspire Home Stay, 170505 ប្រាសាទបាគង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'ប្រាសាទបាគង', 'district': 'កណ្ដែក', 'postalCode': '170505'}","{'lat': 13.34793, 'lng': 103.93373}","[{'lat': 13.34795, 'lng': 103.93359}]",20925,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25393710'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512422416'}], 'www': [{'value': 'www.aspirehomestay.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.347656,103.93416,25393710,Aspire Home Stay,"Welcome to Aspire School & Home Stay, welcoming either guest or volunteers. This school and homestay houses 25 kids and is placed in a local village, where you can escape the big city life, yet still with just a 15 minute tuktuk ride come straight back into the city centre. The homestay has a restaurant and offers cooking classes to those interested. The money you pay for your stay will go directly to food for the children and maintaining their home.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d25393710-Reviews-Aspire_Home_Stay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'St. 9', 'street2': 'Prasat Bakong', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'St. 9 Prasat Bakong, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d25393710-Aspire_Home_Stay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#182 of 449 Specialty lodging in