Au Cabaret Vert,here:pds:place:116w636k-21cf032eb9b642ebadb9f805092b740f,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Au Cabaret Vert, 021401 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ទួលតាឯក', 'postalCode': '021401'}","{'lat': 13.0896, 'lng': 103.19025}","[{'lat': 13.08959, 'lng': 103.19011}]",11115,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1744008'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855536562000'}, {'value': '+85592815473'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.aucabaretvert.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.089643,103.19078,1744008,Au Cabaret Vert,"Au Cabaret Vert is known as the Romantic OASIS in Battambang !!! Dedicated to French Poet RIMBAUD, Au Cabaret Vert is a Eco resort hotel with first natural pool in the heart of Battambang. In a charming tropical garden, our villas (each villa is named with a poem of RIMBAUD) with private terrace offer a moment of serenity before discovering the charm of Battambang: authentic handicrafts, gorgeous landscape and exotic countryside.Our team will recommend you the best tours of Battambang.After your day trip, let's order a cocktail at the poolside to watch the sunset, and then enjoy our French and Cambodian fine cuisine.Free Wifi -Private Terrace - Room Service.
Come to Enjoy the French Style : UNIQUE in Battambang !",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d1744008-Reviews-Au_Cabaret_Vert-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Rue 154', 'street2': 'Toul Ta Ek / Okatom 2', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '60000', 'address_string': 'Rue 154 Toul Ta Ek / Okatom 2, Battambang 60000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d1744008-Au_Cabaret_Vert-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#4 of 43 hotels in Battambang', 'geo_location_name': 'Battambang', 'ranking_out_of': '43', 'ranking': '4'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,426,"{'1': '3', '2': '14', '3': '41', '4': '94', '5': '274'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.c