Au Paradis Bleu,here:pds:place:116aabd1-fccf5b4f353f0afdc7535117d8a116cf,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Au Paradis Bleu, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.48304, 'lng': 104.31329}","[{'lat': 10.48292, 'lng': 104.31335}]",6486,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6201185'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855978917049'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://auparadisbleu.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.48312,104.313255,6201185,Au Paradis Bleu,"AU PARADIS BLEU HOTEL is ideally located 5 minutes walk from the center of the city where the central market of Kep, the newly opened night market, many shops and the pier to the island in the rabbit. The hotel is also located 5 minutes by TukTuk to the beach and its many restaurants and 10 minutes of the famous crab market. AU PARADIS BLEU HOTEL offers cozy rooms displaying a contemporary-traditional Cambodian décor with stunning views of the sea, the mountains and different sites in the town of Kep. They feature air conditioning, flat-screen cable TV, mini-fridge, a seating area, a wardrobe and a private bathroom with free toiletries. AU PARADIS BLEU HOTEL offers a 24/24 offers luggage storage and safes. It also offers a bike rental service, bike and a ticket service for traveling. A laundry service is also available for a fee. AU PARADIS BLEU HOTEL also offers a restaurant with a varied menu, mainly on Cambodian specialties, Laotian and Western dishes. A bar offering wide selection of drinks, an outdoor swimming pool suitable for both adults and children, a tropical garden with relaxation area and private parking, secure 24/24 is also available to you. Furthermore you can enjoy free Wi-Fi throughout its premises. AU PARADIS BLEU HOTEL was also well noted for its excellent quality / price in Kep! Customers have more for their money compared to other establishments in the city.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d6201185-Reviews-Au_Paradis_Bleu-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '33A Street', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '2316', 'address_string': '33A Street, Kep 2316 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d6201185-Au_Paradis_Bleu-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_string': '#16 of 71 B&Bs / Inns in Kep', 'geo_location_name': 'Kep', 'ranking_out_of': '71', 'ranking': '16'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,83,"{'1': '4', '2': '2', '3': '10', '4': '20', '5': '47'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",74,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d6201185-m66827-Reviews-Au_Paradis_Ble