Aura Thematic Hostel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-07269642f764090eedefd42e1aed0e33,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Aura Thematic Hostel, ផ្លូវ 19 205A, 120208 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ជ័យជំនះ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 19', 'postalCode': '120208', 'houseNumber': '205A'}","{'lat': 11.56273, 'lng': 104.92837}","[{'lat': 11.56277, 'lng': 104.92849}]",7028,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8274938'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523986211'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.562587,104.92847,8274938,Aura Thematic Hostel,"Relax from your long, hot day in Phnom Penh at Aura Thematic Hostel. Our hostel, located in the heart of Phnom Penh, is a comfortable and beautiful place to stay for a surprisingly affordable price. Our one-of-a-kind hostel features themed rooms, something no one else in Phnom Penh offers. Full amenities include a rooftop lounge, a delicious complimentary breakfast, air conditioning, and much more.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d8274938-Reviews-Aura_Thematic_Hostel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#205A Street 19', 'street2': 'Cross Street Is Samdach Pan Ave', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '#205A Street 19 Cross Street Is Samdach Pan Ave, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d8274938-Aura_Thematic_Hostel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#15 of 351 Specialty lodging in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '351', 'ranking': '15'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/travel