Ayana Journeys,here:pds:place:116w63gg-2872f1b877344512dc7b02c14bd5ea9d,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Ayana Journeys, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34985, 'lng': 103.86091}","[{'lat': 13.3498, 'lng': 103.86104}]",116541,"[{'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10630673'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855883160220'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://ayanajourneys.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Fri: 09:00 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT08H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.349874,103.86085,10630673,Ayana Journeys,"We craft ethical, educational travel experiences, with the belief that travel can enrich the lives of individuals, communities, and the world. Our mission is to contribute to a more peaceful world. We do this by carefully crafting exceptional travel experiences that prioritise new insights through experiential learning; fostering a deeper sense of empathy; widening understanding of global issues; and reflecting on our potential as members of an international community. Our mission: - Provide ethical, engaging, and creative travel experiences that facilitate genuine cross-cultural connection and learning opportunities, inspiring compassion towards fellow human beings. - Utilise responsible travel to promote and support grass-roots community projects and benefit host communities. - Endeavour to be a responsible tourism role model and collaborate with others to innovate and inspire ethical travel best practices.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d10630673-Reviews-Ayana_Journeys-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '0187 Chocolate Road, Wat Damnak Village, S