BNB Hotel,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-9b50f4719d3740eab126261e6c42b9cd,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'BNB Hotel, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.62005, 'lng': 103.52969}","[{'lat': 10.62016, 'lng': 103.52961}]",132262,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516214525'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.instagram.com/bnbhotel.sihanoukville'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.614204,103.5228,7384712,Deluxx Boutique Hotel,"Nestled in the heart of Sihanoukville, near Ochheuteal Beach and the Serendipity area, Deluxx Boutique Hotel and Residence is an ideal choice for those who seek a quiet, intimate, and discreet getaway, yet in walking distance from all the main attractions, Casinos, and nightlife. Equipped with modern and comfortable rooms, a beautiful swimming pool surrounded by a lush green garden, We offer 5-star comfort at a ""value for money"" price. The hotel is tucked away 500 meters from the main (Ekareach) Street, in a quiet neighborhood, down a small dirt road- only 550 meters from the Golden Lion's roundabout and Five Elephants mall, 1.2 km from the market or more than 4 different beaches, and 23 km from the airport. We will book your airport shuttle, and can assist with arranging transportation and flights across the country. please contact us for more information. The hotel is reopening and is in Soft opening mode (Feb 2023) with discounted rates,- Please note that the restaurant is not functioning yet and we don't serve breakfast. Complimentary coffee/tea is available and we are glad to assist with food takeaway from various establishments in town. We are tediously working on our coffee shop and hope to be able to offer our renowned breakfasts by May 2023. Looking forward to having you with us, Deluxx hotel team.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d7384712-Reviews-Deluxx_Boutique_Hotel-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '4 St 1035 Sangkat', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': '4 St 1035 Sangkat, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d7384712-Deluxx_Boutique_Hotel-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#5 of 283 hotels in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out_of': '283', 'ranking': '5'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,418,"{'1': '5', '2': '14', '3': '21', '4': '78', '5': '300'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ra