Baahu Villa,here:pds:place:116w63gg-cc1932da03564abfba1d8c9b1525b3c7,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Baahu Villa, ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35217, 'lng': 103.85301}","[{'lat': 13.35207, 'lng': 103.8531}]",25152,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '19186703'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512403938'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://baahuvilla.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.352183,103.853,19186703,Baahu Villa,"Baahu means in Sanskrit’s word as “arm” which stand for our services, facilities, amenities provided to acquire the comfort, warmth and safety to guests as if they were embraced by arms of their loved ones. Staffs at Baahu Villa are primarily trained about honesty, the main core value of hospitality. Baahu Villa is ideally located in 3 minutes walks away from. Pub Street. Baahu Villa offers an outdoor pool surrounding by a lush tropical garden. A restaurant serves local favorites as well as international dishes, opens for breakfast, lunch. A bar with selection of drinks. Front desk is open 24hrs, there you would feel hassle‐free with any information needed, assistance in any arrangements from temples excursion to ticketing related service. Hotel has cooperated with an outsource Spa service with wide range of quality treatments. Baahu Villa set herself as part of contribution to underprivileged personnel aim to grow skill and experience in Hotel industry through job opportunities.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d19186703-Reviews-Baahu_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#35, Vihearchen Village', 'street2': 'Svaydangkum Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': '#35, Vihearchen Village Svaydangkum Commune, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d19186703-Baahu_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#49 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '49'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,49,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '11', '5': '37'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",130,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d19186703-m66827-Reviews-Baahu_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Free Wifi', 'Air conditioning', 'Pool', 'Free 