Baby Elephant Boutique Hotel,here:pds:place:116w63gg-8badf9530b8146198ab950fa71b0a063,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Baby Elephant Boutique Hotel, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35003, 'lng': 103.84833}","[{'lat': 13.3499, 'lng': 103.8483}]",25666,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}, {'id': '200-2000-0368', 'name': 'Cocktail Lounge'}, {'id': '700-7460-0115', 'name': 'Tourist Information'}, {'id': '800-8600-0182', 'name': 'Swimming Pool'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3836597'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577769126'}], 'mobile': [{'value': '+85577769126'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.babyelephant.asia'}], 'email': [{'value': 'bookings@babyelephant.asia'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT24H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.349997,103.84832,3836597,Baby Elephant Boutique Hotel,"Baby Elephant is an ethically-run boutique hotel, located in a peaceful area not far from Pub Street & Night Market. We provide casual yet premium accommodation & international hotel facilities and services. Baby Elephant is tastefully designed and decorated, clean & features comfortable beds made up with quality linen, safety boxes and more amenities. 24-hr reception, 7 days a week. Relax by our saltwater pool and enjoy a cocktail from the pool bar or eat delicious Cambodian & international cuisine. We are an inclusive, family-friendly, and LGBT-welcoming property offering a dynamic, creative, and nourishing space for guests. Our sustainable and ethical business model is focused on creating opportunities for our team of Cambodian staff, while creating rewarding and memorable experiences for our valued guests. Our highly professional team of local staff will do their very best to make sure you have an amazing stay and make lifetime memories. We look forward to welcoming you.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d3836597-Reviews-Baby_Elephant_Boutique_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '53 Street', 'street2': '#418, Vihear Chin, Svay Dangkum', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': '53 Street #418, Vihear Chin, Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d3836597-Baby_Elephant_Boutique_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#81 of 763 hotels in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '763', 'ranking': '81'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,908,"{'1': '4', '2': '8', '3': '25', '4': '114', '5': '757'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value'