Baca Villa,here:pds:place:116w63u5-6cbd83e349c84649820c40eec010f4b0,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Baca Villa, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36052, 'lng': 103.85738}","[{'lat': 13.36042, 'lng': 103.85747}]",24143,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '583560'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563965328'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.baca-villa.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.360461,103.85745,583560,Baca Villa,"Baca Villa since 2005 in Siem Reap with comfortable rooms is staying just only 10 minutes drive from Angkor Wat and is a short drive to the pub street and shopping center. Our clean, quiet & comfortable rooms make your stay complete. For mediation or a Monk chat visit us. Besides a guesthouse we have a Moringa farm and a Cricket farm.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d583560-Reviews-Baca_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '639, Tavean,Bhom Bay Khum Sala Kamroeuk, Dangkum', 'street2': 'Near Angkor High school', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': '639, Tavean,Bhom Bay Khum Sala Kamroeuk, Dangkum Near Angkor High school, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d583560-Baca_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#220 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '220'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/