Bago Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w3cse-bd5c553fa9fd49448496f9c762f1337a,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Bago Restaurant, 180403 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បី', 'postalCode': '180403'}","{'lat': 10.63714, 'lng': 103.50089}","[{'lat': 10.6371, 'lng': 103.50102}]",101476,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '206-000', 'name': 'Vietnamese'}, {'id': '300-000', 'name': 'European'}, {'id': '304-000', 'name': 'Italian'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2581226'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593570000'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://queencoasia.com/dining'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 01:00, 07:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT18H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Preah Sihanouk,10.637324,103.50099,2581226,BAGO Restaurant,"Go foodie. Go savour an authentic local and international cuisines. Treat yourself to a feast of authentic Cambodian cuisines and western flavours at Queenco Hotel & Casino's BAGO Restaurant and prepare yourself to a great dining experience. The lush restaurant features Khmer, Chinese and Continental cuisines that will truly bring out the foodie in you. The restaurant is set on the beachfront terrace to give our patrons and guests a greater dining experience not to mention an outstanding service provided by our highly trained restaurant staff.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g325573-d2581226-Reviews-BAGO_Restaurant-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '24 Street Vithey Krong Group', 'street2': 'Village 3, District 3', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': '24 Street Vithey Krong Group Village 3, District 3, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Mun