Bali Resort and Apartment,here:pds:place:116w649d-ff35890f9cc94cb38647229c01f8af79,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Bali Resort and Apartment, ផ្លូវ 2004, 120912 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ពោធិ៍សែនជ័យ', 'subdistrict': 'កាកាប', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 2004', 'postalCode': '120912'}","{'lat': 11.55252, 'lng': 104.86222}","[{'lat': 11.55264, 'lng': 104.8622}]",1720,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6278192'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523900999'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://baliresortandhotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.552025,104.86233,6278192,Bali Resort and Apartment,"See why so many travelers make Bali Bali Resort and Hotel their hotel of choice when visiting Phnom Penh. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a budget friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Free wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at Bali Bali Resort and Hotel offer air conditioning.
During your stay, take advantage of some of the amenities offered, including a 24 hour front desk, room service, and baggage storage. Guests of Bali Bali Resort and Hotel are also welcome to enjoy a pool and a lounge, located on site. For travelers arriving by car, free parking is available.
For those interested in checking out Mila Craft Workshop (Rubber stamp and Making Bath Bombs) (2.6 mi) while visiting Phnom Penh, Bali Bali Resort and Hotel is a short distance away.
If you’re looking for an Italian restaurant, consider a visit to Aloha Ono or Brothers' Pizza, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Bali Bali Resort and Hotel.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Central Market, Silver Pagoda, or Royal Railway Station (Phnom Penh), which are popular architectural buildings amongst tourists.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Bali Bali Resort and Hotel as you experience all of the things Phnom Penh has to offer.
