Baliku Culinary and Art at L'Orangerie,here:pds:place:116w649g-12db01801a7f32c227744674d08d8c2f,en,casual_dining,"{'label': ""Baliku Culinary and Art at L'Orangerie, ផ្លូវ សម្តេច ព្រះ សុគន្ធ មានបុណ្យ, 120204 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងរាំង', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សម្តេច ព្រះ សុគន្ធ មានបុណ្យ', 'postalCode': '120204'}","{'lat': 11.56327, 'lng': 104.92011}","[{'lat': 11.56343, 'lng': 104.92006}]",74328,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '211-000', 'name': 'Indonesian'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25279677'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85589990369'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.baliku.co'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sat: 11:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T110000', 'duration': 'PT11H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.563291,104.92013,25279677,Baliku Culinary And Art At L'orangerie,"Baliku means ""My Bali"" We bring you the experience from the enchanted island of Bali, Indonesia to Phnom Penh! From our individual journeys, we bring our recollections of how, as children of the island, we interacted with our parents and grandparents. From our fondest memories, we bring the tradition of gathering together as a family and a community in many Balinese cultural celebrations. From cooking family recipes that have never actually been written down, that pass down from father to son, mother to daughter, we bring you the taste of our land. We hope the ambience at Baliku showcase flavors that accurately reflect Balinese’s heritage.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d25279677-Reviews-Baliku_Culinary_And_Art_At_L_orangerie-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Koh Pich Street,sales Center Ocic,diamond Island', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Koh Pich Street,sales Center Ocic,diamond Island, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,hi@baliku.co,+855 89 990 369,http://www.baliku.co,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d25279677-Baliku_Culinary_And_Art_At_L_orangerie-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#290 of 1,983 Places to Eat in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '1983', 'ranking': '290'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,10,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '10'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",28,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d25279677-m66827-Reviews-Baliku_Culinary_And_Art_At_L_orangerie-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2200'}}], 'weekday_te