Bambu Battambang Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-a84d4c6ab6e9061a0b6ba3c900106c08,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Bambu Battambang Hotel, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09872, 'lng': 103.20433}","[{'lat': 13.09859, 'lng': 103.20431}]",12945,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1848860'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85553953900'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.bambuhotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.098778,103.20434,1848860,Bambu Battambang Hotel,"Bambu Battambang Hotel was opened in September 2010 and has 16 bedrooms arranged in 4 traditionally inspired buildings. When designing the hotel we wanted to combine all that was best in the local Khmer and French colonial architecture whilst providing our guests with maximum comfort and convenience.All rooms have en suite bathrooms, air conditioning, telephone, flat screen cable TV, DVD player with access to our DVD library, iPod docker, mini bar, room safe and private terrace or balcony. Free WiFi is provided around the site and we also have 2 dedicated computer terminals in reception for use by guests.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d1848860-Reviews-Bambu_Battambang_Hotel-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Ko Street', 'street2': 'Romcheak 5, Sangkat Rottanak', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'Ko Street Romcheak 5, Sangkat Rottanak, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g3