Banan Hotel Battambang,here:pds:place:116w636s-9d41dd4f31294fec8c8d13243e8a531f,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Banan Hotel Battambang, 021404 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ចម្ការសំរោង', 'postalCode': '021404'}","{'lat': 13.10701, 'lng': 103.19686}","[{'lat': 13.10707, 'lng': 103.19658}]",12804,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '700-7200-0328', 'name': 'B2B Sales & Services'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598511911'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.bananhotel.doodlekit.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.09149,103.21003,1638785,Banan Hotel,"See why so many travelers make Banan Hotel their inn of choice when visiting Battambang. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a budget friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Nearby landmarks such as Ta Dumbong Statue (0.1 mi) and White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (1.0 mi) make Banan Hotel a great place to stay when visiting Battambang.
Guest rooms offer a minibar, air conditioning, and a refrigerator, and Banan Hotel makes getting online easy as free wifi is available.
You can also take advantage of some of the amenities offered by the inn, including a concierge and room service. As an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
If you’re looking for a barbeque restaurant, consider a visit to Battambang BBQ & Buffet, which is not far from Banan Hotel.
Plus, during your trip, don’t forget to check out some of the popular ancient ruins, such as Prasat Sneung and Ek Phnom.
At Banan Hotel, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Battambang.
