Banana Hotel Resort Siem Reap,here:pds:place:116w63gg-76c378a768724b2092df617d76d3bf76,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Banana Hotel Resort Siem Reap, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34522, 'lng': 103.87151}","[{'lat': 13.34534, 'lng': 103.87157}]",24500,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '19726686'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511605100'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.banana-resort.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.344172,103.87081,12632786,The Embassy Angkor Resort & Spa,"THE EMBASSY RESORT & SPA The Embassy Resort & Spa is located on a quiet side of Siem Reap Town and we managed to create a small Paradise just for you! The resort is built in a style where Khmer architecture meets Western efficiency and is located amidst a green and relaxing environment. Unwind after a hot day at the Temples of Angkor at our extensive pool complex, which lies in front of your room and encircles our Restaurant. A romantic place, especially in the evening when the pool floor is lit up by fiber optics! Our rooms are meticulously designed to give you the greatest comfort, tastefully decorated in Khmer style and perfectly maintained. Our Deluxe Pool Suites even have their own private swimming pool, discretely hidden from other’s eyes….",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12632786-Reviews-The_Embassy_Angkor_Resort_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sangkat Sala Kamreuk', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': 'Sangkat Sala Kamreuk, Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'nam