Bar Ang Restaurant & Bar,here:pds:place:116w636s-49b52feaeb6946baa943ea3da295106e,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Bar Ang Restaurant & Bar, 021409 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'អូរចារ', 'postalCode': '021409'}","{'lat': 13.10592, 'lng': 103.18797}","[{'lat': 13.10592, 'lng': 103.18799}]",11976,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]","[{'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13184590'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515896387'}, {'value': '+85587965087'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://bar-ang.business.site', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}], 'text': ['Mon-Thu: 11:00 - 23:00', 'Fri-Sun: 11:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T110000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH'}, {'start': 'T110000', 'duration': 'PT13H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Battambang,13.105915,103.18797,13184590,Bar Ang Restaurant & Bar,"Bar Ang is an open & airy oasis in the city located on the 2nd floor of our home. The restaurant & small bar make one feel like family immediately. We are not fancy nore think of ourselves as ""5 star"" we simply enjoy what we do and it shows. We serve classic Khmei dishes using organic ingredients from our garden and when possible from friends who farm. Our small menu of curry, amok and burgers offer large satisfying portions. Our cocktails use fresh seasonal fruits. We play eclectic music and encourage solo travelers to chat. We pride ourselves on service and attention to detail as we are hands on management. Battambang Scooter & Motorcycle Rentals, in business for over 15 years, can also be found at BAR ANG. We offer rentals of both automatic and semi automatic units. We provi