Basecamp Kitchen,here:pds:place:116w63gg-a060729870084728b965d6abe83db52b,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Basecamp Kitchen, ផ្លូវ ផ្សារកណ្ដាល, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ផ្សារកណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.357, 'lng': 103.85688}","[{'lat': 13.35687, 'lng': 103.85686}]",24473,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13971606'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570970319'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://basecamp-siemreap.asia'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Wed, Fri-Sun: 11:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T110000', 'duration': 'PT10H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.35693,103.856865,13971606,Basecamp Kitchen,"We opened on 30th of March ,2018 as a Japanese style Cafe and Bar with original Japanese food and Homemade drinks. All of our menu is healthy and original food which Japanese dietician produced. Our Best recommended menu is Original Chicken Curry(It can take 1day's worth of vegetables) and 10 kinds of Vegetable Tapas . We also have homemade Cheese cake and original blend coffee. We have Happy Hour (from 4pm to 7pm ) everyday.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d13971606-Reviews-Basecamp_Kitchen-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '457 Central Market St', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': '457 Central Market St, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,basecamp.siemreap@gmail.com,+855 70 970 319,http://basecamp-siemreap.asia/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d13971606-Basecamp_Kitchen-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#529 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '529'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,8,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '8'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",22,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d13971606-m66827-Reviews-Basecamp_Kitchen-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2100'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 11:00 - 21:00', 'Tuesday: 11:00 - 21:00', 'Wednesday: 11:00 - 21:00', 'Thursday: Closed', 'Friday: 11:00 - 21:00', 'Saturday: 11:00 - 21:00', 'Sunday: 11:00 - 21:00']}","['Free Wifi', 'Serves Alcohol', 'Takeout']","[{'name': 'cafe', 'localized_name': 'Cafe'}]",Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'restaurant', 'localized_name': 'Restaurant'}","[{'name': 'sit_down', 'localized_name': 'Sit down'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name