Battambang Chemin Cycling,here:pds:place:116w636s-2c9ec00260b6ec84c6d78e755e513614,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Battambang Chemin Cycling, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10074, 'lng': 103.19801}","[{'lat': 13.10076, 'lng': 103.19787}]",12496,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '16214461'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516358852'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.chemincycling.tours'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Battambang,13.100736,103.19798,16214461,Battambang Chemin Cycling,"Cycling is the best way to explore Battambang on land. Due to the flat terrain, the going is easy. We were born and raised here, so we know all the unique angle of our country, that travellers cannot explore by their own without us.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d16214461-Reviews-Battambang_Chemin_Cycling-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Pub Street', 'street2': 'Kampong Krabei Village, Svay Por Commune', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02360', 'address_string': 'Pub Street Kampong Krabei Village, Svay Por Commune, Battambang 02360 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,hello@chemincycling.tours,+855 16 358 852,http://www.chemincycling.tours,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d16214461-Battambang_Chemin_Cycling-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666