Battambang Tour by Rich,here:pds:place:116w636s-129bf4d59a3948c590436ddecbcd01b6,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Battambang Tour by Rich, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10126, 'lng': 103.19724}","[{'lat': 13.10124, 'lng': 103.19738}]",12460,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}, {'id': '400-4100-0041', 'name': 'Transportation Service'}, {'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing'}, {'id': '700-7460-0115', 'name': 'Tourist Information'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12226966'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7702618'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512939246', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}, {'id': '400-4100-0041'}, {'id': '700-7400-0133'}]}, {'value': '+85578646162'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://battambangtours.wordpress.com', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}]}, {'value': 'https://battambangtours.wordpress.com', 'categories': [{'id': '700-7460-0115'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}, {'id': '400-4100-0041'}, {'id': '700-7400-0133'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:00 - 23:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT17H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Battambang,13.102414,103.19685,12226966,Battambang Tour By Rich,"Battambang Tour By Rich. Countryside Tour, Sightseeing Tour, Adventure Tour, Things to do in Battambang Cambodia. Mr Rich offer scenic excursions in and around the Battambang Province. Rich is an English-speaking and professional driver.he would love to show you this beautiful country. Come, see, meet, greet and eat with the local Khmer people.he’s very friendly and would love to meet you soon. Please call Rich today. Local experienced driver knows all of the local and other attractions.he specialize in country, scenic tours away from the city life.he specialize in rural counryside tours and special attractions like the Bamboo train.he also do tours for Phnom Sam Pov, Ancient temples, Kam Ping Puoy Reservoir (Killing Dam Lake). Rich Tuk Tuk Tours is the Khmer who cares.he have provided custom Tuk Tuk tours for many years in the Battambang Province within Cambodia. Please contact him. so he can help an experience . He guarantee smiles & promise complete customer satisfaction.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d12226966-Reviews-Battambang_Tour_By_Rich-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Battambang Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,obpengan@gmail.com,+855 12 939 246,http://battambangtravel.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d12226966-Battambang_Tour_By_Rich-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#2 of 23 Transportation in Battambang', 'geo_location_name': 'Battambang', 'ranking_out_of': '23', 'ranking': '2'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,356,"{'1': '2', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '15', '5': '338'}",Not available,240,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d12226966-m66827-Reviews-Battambang_Tour_By_Rich-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open