Battambang Tour by: MR. Vatthana,here:pds:place:116w636k-2fb731299ed73089154dca6fcbf02157,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Battambang Tour by: MR. Vatthana, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.09233, 'lng': 103.19867}","[{'lat': 13.09237, 'lng': 103.1988}]",12052,"[{'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17636202'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515871197'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://battambangtrip.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.092278,103.19851,17636202,Battambang Tour by: Mr. Vatthana,"Hello! Susadie! Welcome to the home of the greate Angkorian culture. My name is Vatthana. I am a native of Cambodia and have lived in Battambang City for 17 years. In my tours not only do I offer transport to the many cultural sites from early Angkorian times to more recent complex historical events, but I also supply an in depth socio-historical and cultural analysis of our most recent and troubled past. Cambodian culture and history is steeped in beauty, complexity and societal upheaval. If you would like your tour to inform, as well as transport you from area",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d17636202-Reviews-Battambang_Tour_by_Mr_Vatthana-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street106', 'street2': 'Street 02', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'Street106 Street 02, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,+855 15 871 197,https: