Bayon Era Hotel,here:pds:place:116w63gu-edb060109f8848a18e7f539398111ea5,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Bayon Era Hotel, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.35716, 'lng': 103.89634}","[{'lat': 13.35729, 'lng': 103.89638}]",21880,"[{'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13199019'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563968288'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.357054,103.89626,13199019,Bayon Era Hotel,"Welcome to Bayon Era, a luxurious 5-Star Hotel designed to follow the theme of “Reliving The Exotic Past of Bayon Temple” and located in Siem Reap, Kingdom of Cambodia which is renowned for the famous Angkor Archaeological Park and home to many of the great cultural experiences that Cambodia has to offer. Located just 20 minutes from the Siem Reap International Airport and less than 10 minutes from Siem Reap’s best shopping, local markets and cultural offerings, Angkor Era is an ideal choice for those who expect the best experience possible from their stay in Cambodia. Siem Reap has so much more to offer than temples, and Bayon Era is the perfect base to explore this exciting city. From the minute you enter our grounds you will feel the luxury that is Angkor Era. Our visually stunning hotel will impress you with its impressive water feature and continue to surprise you with its opulence",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d13199019-Reviews-Bayon_Era_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road No 6, Airport Road', 'street2': 'Knar Village Chreav Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17256', 'address_string': 'National Road No 6, Airport Road Knar Village Chreav Commune,