Bayon Pastry School Coffee Shop,here:pds:place:116aabd1-46c5d594b4350e38f9832a8a837d46cc,en,pastries,"{'label': 'Bayon Pastry School Coffee Shop, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36291, 'lng': 103.85376}","[{'lat': 13.36278, 'lng': 103.85374}]",152786,"[{'id': '600-6300-0244', 'name': 'Bakery & Baked Goods Store', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}, {'id': '100-1100-0331', 'name': 'Tea House'}]","[{'id': '800-069', 'name': 'Pastries', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7805494'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577806229'}, {'value': '+85578907903', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}, {'id': '100-1100-0331'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '600-6300-0244'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sat: 07:00 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT10H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.362983,103.853584,7805494,Bayon Pastry School Coffee Shop,"Bayon Pastry School, a free vocational training for underprivileged women of Cambodia. Located in a peaceful garden in the heart of Siem Reap, our coffee shop offers tasty pastries freshly baked by our students, as well as brunchs, delicious hot and cold coffees, teas and fresh drinks. By enjoying our cakes, you support our action and give the opportunity to young women to come out of poverty. - Enjoy 50% off on our pastries of the week from 4:30PM to 6:00PM -",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d7805494-Reviews-Bayon_Pastry_School_Coffee_Shop-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Taphul Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': 'Taphul Village, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Munic