Bayon Resort and Spa,here:pds:place:116w649s-9d0218731a2b437c8b966fda77878cb0,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Bayon Resort and Spa, ផ្លូវ 628, 121206 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ច្បារអំពៅ', 'subdistrict': 'ព្រែកឯង', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 628', 'postalCode': '121206'}","{'lat': 11.52713, 'lng': 104.98108}","[{'lat': 11.52709, 'lng': 104.98095}]",17703,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3670512'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511333688'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.bayonresort.com/index.php/en'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.527205,104.98125,3670512,Bayon Resort and Spa,"See why so many travelers make Bayon Resort and Spa their small hotel of choice when visiting Phnom Penh. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
The rooms offer air conditioning, a refrigerator, and a minibar, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
Bayon Resort and Spa features a concierge. In addition, as a valued Bayon Resort and Spa guest, you can enjoy a pool and an on-site restaurant that are available on-site.
Given the close proximity to Neak Loeung Bridge (Tsubasa Bridge) (2.6 mi), guests of Bayon Resort and Spa can easily experience one of Phnom Penh's most popular landmarks.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Central Market, Silver Pagoda, or Royal Railway Station (Phnom Penh), which are popular architectural buildings amongst tourists.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Bayon Resort and Spa as you experience all of the things Phnom Penh has to offer.
