Bbii Tel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-fde2622c4e250c24b73afc009bce5430,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Bbii Tel, ផ្លូវ 51, 120102 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 51', 'postalCode': '120102'}","{'lat': 11.54845, 'lng': 104.92705}","[{'lat': 11.54847, 'lng': 104.92725}]",7193,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7697230'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512760808'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.54846,104.92728,7697230,Bbii TEL,"Bbii TEL is a boutique hostel based on the design of Cambodian countryside lifestyle and we recycle the woods that people used them to build their house in rural countryside. Therefore, in order to let people reminisce the traditional way of setting up the house, we design the old piece and rearrange them in the living room of Bbii TEL where everyone can see it. Bbii TEL's rooms are differently in design and bedding. Although we use bunk beds but we try to design in a way that you can have fresh feeling and comfort. Bbii TEL is 1.1 km from Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum and 1.6 km from Royal Palace Phnom Penh. The famous Riverfront Park is 2.7 km away, while Phnom Penh International Airport can be reached with a 9 km drive. Simply furnished, rooms come with air conditioning, a desk and freshly-laundered bedding. Guests have access to either a shared or private bathroom with shower facility. 1. Check in from 12am and check out until 2pm. 2. Cash payment only upon arrival, so please prepare enough cash for your stay. 3. Cancellation policy: At least 1-day advance notice before the arrival date is required. 4. Bbii TEL is a non-smoking boutique hostel. 5. We don't provide any towel or bath products but we do have it in hand if you want to buy. 6. We limit number of guests in the room according the number of the beds. It means if your group book a three-bed room, only three people allows to stay in. No outsider allowed. 7. We don't allow drug or gun. We don't hold any responsibility over anything you do that against the law of the country.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d7697230-Reviews-Bbii_TEL-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 172A St 51, BKK1, PP', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '# 172A St 51, BKK1, PP, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d7697230-Bbii_TEL-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#101 of 351 Specialty lodging in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '351', 'ranking': '101'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,5,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '4'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",36,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d7697230-m66827-Reviews-Bbii_TEL-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Suites', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Air conditioning', 'Non-smoking hotel']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'other', 'localized_name': 'Specialty Lodging'}]",Not available,['Quaint'],[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '1'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '1'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,29,14
Be Happy Guesthouse Siem Reap,here:pds:place:116w63gg-2689103fe47445feb18f2f2e2286134a,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Be Happy Guesthouse Siem Reap, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35002, 'lng': 103.84839}","[{'lat': 13.34989, 'lng': 103.84836}]",25662,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17561791'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17727817'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855967470842'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.be-happy.asia'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.350048,103.8484,17561791,BE Happy Guesthouse Siem Reap,"You can scratch deep beneath the surface in Siem Reap, Cambodia, but you’ll find it’s very rare to encounter historic French-style colonial guesthouses like the newly-opened BE Eco Happy Guesthouse (known as BE Happy Siem Reap). BE Happy is a 12-room gorgeous French colonial building with compact, budget, yet colourful rooms. The little property has been lovingly restored and converted by the founding team behind the award-winning Baby Elephant Boutique Hotel. BE Happy is situated next door to Baby Elephant, on a quiet suburban lane which offers an authentic sense of the Cambodian countryside to guests, while being only a stone's throw from the centre of town. Previously a wing of Baby Elephant, the wing has now become its own entity, BE Happy. Reborn as a cute yet affordable budget accommodation choice with a very special concept. BE Happy offers special long-stay rates, group booking discounts, audio-visual equipment, vegan food at its on-site Born Free Juicery, a gorgeous organic spa, yoga classes, saltwater pool and more. BE Happy Siem Reap offers affordable accommodation with 12 rooms in a historic converted colonial French guest house, with a beautiful external facade, surrounded by plants. The rooms are small with combined toilet-and-shower Asian private bathrooms. BE Happy is located off a quiet lane just a 10-minute walk to town, you’ll enjoy the peaceful quiet while being close to everything. The hotel is situated just 7 kilometres from Angkor Wat, and 20 minutes from the airport. The concept is happiness, or in Khmer language ‘sabai’. At BE Happy the aim is for travellers to feel happy while they travel, and will provide an affordable place to stay longer, including for study tour and other groups. It will also allow for those on a shoestring budget to book in and still enjoy the 24-hour service and facilities that Baby Elephant offers, while taking the time to savour the lifestyle that Siem Reap affords. The hotel provides excellent affordable tour services for valued guests to experience the magical spiritual and cultural experiences like Angkor Wat and other temples, the breathtaking countryside, Tonle Sap lake and Mt Kulen.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g12591811-d17561791-Reviews-BE_Happy_Guesthouse_Siem_Reap-Svay_Dangkum_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '635 Vihearchin Village', 'city': 'Svay Dangkum', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': '635 Vihearchin Village, Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Svay Dangkum', 'location_id': '12591811'}, {'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g12591811-d17561791-BE_Happy_Guesthouse_Siem_Reap-Svay_Dangkum_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '12591811', 'ranking_string': '#6 of 21 B&Bs / Inns in Svay Dangkum', 'geo_location_name': 'Svay Dangkum', 'ranking_out_of': '21', 'ranking': '6'}",5,http