Beach Kep Sovann Village Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-895c87cfd5ba044474cfda7905a1d95b,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Beach Kep Sovann Village Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 33 អេ, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 33 អេ', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.49186, 'lng': 104.32224}","[{'lat': 10.49189, 'lng': 104.32211}]",5157,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7726651'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517355992'}]}],Not Available,Kep,10.49177,104.3227,7726651,Beach Kep Sovann Village Guesthouse,"Beach Kep Sovann Village Guesthouse is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Kep, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Beach Kep Sovann Village Guesthouse is a guest house offering air conditioning in the rooms, and it is easy to stay connected during your stay as free wifi is offered to guests.
The guest house features a 24 hour front desk and express check-in and check-out.
Close to Crab Statue (1.9 mi), a popular Kep landmark, Beach Kep Sovann Village Guesthouse is a great destination for tourists.
While staying in Kep, you can check out a popular barbeque restaurant like The Waterfront Beach Club and Lounge Bar, which is serving up some great dishes.
If you are interested in exploring Kep, check out a park, such as Jasmine Valley Skate Bowl.
Enjoy your stay in Kep!
