Bed & Bedzzz,here:pds:place:116w63gg-75465670d1c06974876849c98aff2213,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Bed & Bedzzz, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.34981, 'lng': 103.84876}","[{'lat': 13.3498, 'lng': 103.84876}]",87912,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '24124650'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '24126377'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85561501001'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/bedandbedzzz'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.356462,103.84846,1443314,The Rose Apple Boutique Bed & Breakfast,"Our little piece of paradise, The Rose Apple, has grown. Now in it's new, charming colonial building with saltwater swimming pool. A 2 min. drive (approximately 1 km West from city center and the old market Phsa Cha) from amazing Siem Reap, you’ll find a little piece of paradise. Amidst this tropic surroundings we set up a wonderful and cozy Bed & Breakfast. Add to that a 6m by 10m saltwater pool, restaurant with airconditioning if needed and mixed with our signature service from the heart. You have what we call our Boutique Bed and Breakfast. Enjoy the refreshing pool with a bite and a chat in our quiet surroundings as you relax and forget the bustling tourism and overwhelming impressions from South-East Asia. It’s your home away from home!We’ve creatively appointed just 11 cozy rooms, providing you the best comfort: quality mattresses & linen, blackout curtains, air-conditioning and fan, free WiFi, LED TV with international channels, ensuite bathroom with hot water rain shower, safety box and roomservice. You have all the privacy you can wish for. Prices include a healthy breakfast, free surround wifi access, pick-up service and a warm heart full of information. For direct bookings we offer free pick-up service on arrival - please inform us your arrival time and transport mode. You let us know how, where and when. We hope to see you soon!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1443314-Reviews-The_Rose_Apple_Boutique_Bed_Breakfast-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sok San road', 'street2': 'Steung Thmei, Svay Dangkum', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Sok San road Steung Thmei, Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d1443314-The_Rose_Apple_Boutique_Bed_Breakfast-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#6 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '6'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,826,"{'1': '3', '2': '1', '3': '12', '4': '106', '5': '704'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, 