Bees Unlimited,here:pds:place:116aabd1-5b5b3d00d140043231cb302af57702ed,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Bees Unlimited, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34771, 'lng': 103.85473}","[{'lat': 13.34767, 'lng': 103.8546}]",116184,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2639538'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512436475'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.beesunlimited.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Fri, Sun: 07:00 - 15:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT08H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.347711,103.85475,2639538,Bees Unlimited,"Discovering Cambodia away from the Temples and the Tourists--Culture and Cuisine (Food, Food, Food!), People, Daily Life, Nature--that's what we're about. And we do it by foot and by tuk tuk--nice and slow. Perfect for adults, and kids alike. Bees Unlimited--Your Temple Tour Alternative: A unique and unforgettable experience, guaranteed!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d2639538-Reviews-Bees_Unlimited-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,dani@beesunlimited.com,+855 12 436 475,http://www.beesunlimited.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d2639538-Bees_Unlimited-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#42 of 557 Outdoor Activities in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Si