Ben Coffee,here:pds:place:116w3gpp-2758e68c26af4418a686c511af955f61,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Ben Coffee, 200701 ស្វាយរៀង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ស្វាយរៀង', 'city': 'ស្វាយរៀង', 'district': 'ស្វាយរៀង', 'postalCode': '200701'}","{'lat': 11.08017, 'lng': 105.79927}","[{'lat': 11.0803, 'lng': 105.79927}]",227853,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85586531354'}]}],Not Available,Svay Rieng,10.768935,106.6941,510884,Saigon Citi Hotel A,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Ho Chi Minh City, Dragon Palace Hotel is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its proximity to great restaurants and attractions, Dragon Palace Hotel makes it easy to enjoy the best of Ho Chi Minh City.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as a flat screen TV, air conditioning, and a minibar, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the hotel.
Dragon Palace Hotel features a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and baggage storage, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts free breakfast. If you are driving to Dragon Palace Hotel, parking is available.
Nearby landmarks such as Pham Ngu Lao Street (0.1 mi) and Benthanh Street Food Market (0.4 mi) make Dragon Palace Hotel a great place to stay when visiting Ho Chi Minh City.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the barbeque restaurants, including Barbecue Garden Restaurant, Quan Ut Ut, and TnT BBQ, all of which are a short distance from Dragon Palace Hotel.
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular art museums such as Artinus 3D Art Museum, Fine Arts Museum, and The Factory Contemporary Arts Centre.
Whether you’re traveling for business, pleasure or both, Dragon Palace Hotel is sure to make your visit to Ho Chi Minh City one worth remembering.
