Best Angkor Guide - Day Tours,here:pds:place:116aabd1-23dfab8ad08a027b38b4bff1fd82f88b,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Best Angkor Guide - Day Tours, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.42521, 'lng': 103.85967}","[{'lat': 13.42509, 'lng': 103.85961}]",19173,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5567760'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512666597'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.bestangkorguide.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.426598,103.85952,5567760,Best Angkor Guide - Day Tours,"Why Travel with us:

1. A group of professional tour guides with many year experiences 
2. Know the best time to visit the temples
3. Know how to avoid the crowded - not only your eyes can see the temples, but let your heart feel it as well.
4. Know good spots for photos & know how to take good photos
5. Support local tour guides/drivers
6. Very reasonable price - no commission paid
7. Make your trip easy, fun & unforgettable
8. We have a strong passion to tell you stories....",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d5567760-Reviews-Best_Angkor_Guide_Day_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17000', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap 17000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,BestAngkorGuide@gmail.com,+855 12 666 597,http://www.bestangkorguide.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d5567760-Best_Angkor_Guide_Day_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#74 of 1,339 Tours in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1339', 'ranking': '74'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,1206,"{'1': '1', '2': '1', '3': '3', '4': '36', '5': '1165'}",Not available,1643,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d5567760-m66827-Reviews-Best_Angkor_Guide_Day_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Private Tours', 'localized_name': 'Private Tours'}, {'name': 'Historical & Heritage Tours', 'localized_name': 'Historical & Heritage Tours'}, {'name': 'Cultural Tours', 'localized_name': 'Cultural Tours'}, {'name': 'Photography Tours', 'localized_name': 'Photography Tours'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '9'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '47