Betelnut Tours,here:pds:place:116aabd1-247c098cbb450901ade4f4e3151f4a7e,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Betelnut Tours, ផ្លូវ 302 26, 120102 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 302', 'postalCode': '120102', 'houseNumber': '26'}","{'lat': 11.55242, 'lng': 104.92323}","[{'lat': 11.55255, 'lng': 104.9232}]",6670,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2263597'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512619924'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://betelnut.tours'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.552897,104.925835,2263597,Betelnut Tours,"Small, personal trips around Phnom Penh. Take a daytrip to the Phnom Tamao Wildife Rescue Center or spend 2 days in the countryside with a homestay, Feed and interact with a variety of rescued and endangerd animals at the rescue center or see some ricefields, go hiking near a waterfall and spend a night at our family farm. Both tours include delicious homecooked meals and everything else you need. The size of the groups is limited, to give you a more personal experience. The area around Phnom Penh is varied and offers many different sights besides temples and Khmer Rouge history that most people associate with Cambodia. We want to show you some of these happy places.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d2263597-Reviews-Betelnut_Tours-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#26, St 302', 'street2': 'Mad Monkey', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': '#26, St 302 Mad Monkey, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,betelnuttours@gmail.com,+855 12 619 924,http://betelnut.tours,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d2263