Bird of Paradise Bungalows,here:pds:place:116aabd1-5f583f42d561040817286e555fa6b41e,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Bird of Paradise Bungalows, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.49076, 'lng': 104.2919}","[{'lat': 10.49089, 'lng': 104.29187}]",7352,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8808404'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85590880413'}]}],Not Available,Kep,10.490847,104.29188,8808404,Bird of Paradise Bungalows,"Bird of Paradise Bungalows offers Khmer style double and twin timber bungalows with thatched roofing and the larger brick air conditioned superior bungalows.They are set in established tropical garden setting. Each bungalow has en suite bathroom, enjoy free WIFI, take breakfast, coffee or drinks in lounge dining area. Enjoy the peace and nature of Bird of Paradise Bungalows",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d8808404-Reviews-Bird_of_Paradise_Bungalows-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Thmey Village, Sangkat Prey tom', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07503', 'address_string': 'Thmey Village, Sangkat Prey tom, Kep 07503 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d8808404-Bird_of_Paradise_Bungalows-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_string': '#3 of 48 Specialty lodging in Kep', 'geo_location_name': 'Kep', 'ranking_out_of': '48', 'ranking': '3'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,105,"{'1': '0', '2': '