Birdies Mini Golf,here:pds:place:116w649s-7ae5ef2746ed3e96fd175ea18f1ac8f0,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Birdies Mini Golf, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.55033, 'lng': 104.94225}","[{'lat': 11.55033, 'lng': 104.94225}]",8738,"[{'id': '550-5520-0000', 'name': 'Leisure', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23955587'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85581310013'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/birdiesminiaturegolf'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Fri: 10:00 - 22:00', 'Sat, Sun: 08:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T100000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR'}, {'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT14H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.550326,104.942245,23955587,Birdies Mini Golf,"Birdies is an amazing 18 holes mini-golf course, which will challenge players of all abilities. 2,500m2 of uniquely designed beautiful garden, lets you spread out and relax. You need about 1 hour to complete the course and once you have finished you and your friends can sit down and relax with a cold one while listening to some chill music. There is also a great selection of food in the park which should make even the most picky eater satisfied. We guarantee fun and laughter at Birdies, and it’s a must visit for those who want to do something a little bit different while visiting Phnom Penh.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d23955587-Reviews-Birdies_Mini_Golf-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Treellion Park, Koh Pich St, Diamond Island.', 'street2': 'Locates Inside Treellion Park, Entrance Next To Koh Pich Fire Station.', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Treellion Park, Koh Pich St, Diamond Island. Locates Inside Treellion Park, Entrance Next To Koh Pich Fire Station., Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,birdies@business-essential.com,+855 81 310 013,http://www.facebook.com/birdiesminiaturegolf,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d23955587-Birdies_Mini_Golf-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#22 of 50 Fun &amp; Games in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '50', 'ranking': '22'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,3,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '0', '5': '2'}",Not available,5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d23955587-m66827-Reviews-Birdies_Mini_Golf-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2200'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 10:00 - 22:00', 'Tuesday: 10:00 - 22:00', 'Wednesday: 10:00 - 22:00', 'Thursday: 10:00 - 22:00', 'Friday: 10:00 - 22:00', 'Saturday: 08:00 - 22:00', 'Sunday: 08:00 - 22:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'fun_games', 'localized_name': 'Fun & Games'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Fun & Games', 'localized_name': 'Fun & Games', 'categories': [{'name': 'Mini Golf', 'localized_name': 'Mini Golf'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localize