Birds Nest 2.0,here:pds:place:116aabd1-9f5d1ea35f8d0deb7164a5aa62d7226e,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Birds Nest 2.0, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60933, 'lng': 104.18084}","[{'lat': 10.60945, 'lng': 104.18078}]",130072,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27991275'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9593181'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85586333801'}, {'value': '+855977062102', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.608003,104.17931,9593181,Birds Nest,Theses are dorm style rooms from $4-7 US with a sitting area and TV. Rooms come with fan or aircon. Also a large rooftop terrace to chill with the birds who are always making there nests to create Birds Nest Soup. There is a bar that serves breakfast lunch and diner. Great location only 40 meters from the river. The Birds Nest was newly renovated in Dec. 2016. Come check us out.,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d9593181-Reviews-Birds_Nest-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Old Market Street', 'street2': 'across from Kepler Books', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Old Market Street across from Kepler Books, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d9593181-Birds_Nest-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#31 of 148 B&Bs / Inns in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranki