Bloom Garden Bed & Breakfast,here:pds:place:116w63u5-ae26c0dbbc6a4badaf460337bf58f6dd,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Bloom Garden Bed & Breakfast, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37501, 'lng': 103.87051}","[{'lat': 13.37488, 'lng': 103.87048}]",21996,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1939825'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570808690'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/bloomgardenbedandbreakfast?_rdc=2&_rdr'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.374949,103.8705,1939825,Bloom Garden Bed & Breakfast,"Bloom Garden Bed & Breakfast: A Gateway to Angkor Wat Angkor Wat is one of the most magnificent and awe-inspiring monuments in the world. Angkor Wat is also a UNESCO World Heritage Site, and a symbol of national pride and identity for Cambodians. However, visiting Angkor Wat can be a daunting and overwhelming task, especially for first-time travelers who may not be familiar with the history, culture, and logistics of the site. That is why staying at Bloom Garden Bed & Breakfast, a cozy and friendly homestay in Siem Reap, can make a big difference in enhancing the experience and enjoyment of exploring Angkor Wat. Bloom Garden Bed & Breakfast is more than just a homestay, it is a gateway to Angkor Wat. It is a place where guests can experience the best of both worlds: the ancient and the modern, the spiritual and the material, the exotic and the familiar. It is a place where guests can connect with the people and the place, and create lasting memories and impressions.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1939825-Reviews-Bloom_Garden_Bed_Breakfast-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Road 60', 'street2': 'Street C220', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '171201', 'address_string': 'Road 60 Street C220, Siem Reap 171201 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d1939825-Bloom_Garden_Bed_Breakfast-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#9 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '9'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,496,"{'1': '0', '2': '3', '3': '10', '4': '76', '5': '407'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",363,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1939825-m66827-Reviews-Bloom_Garden_Bed_Breakfast-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Airport transportation', 'Public Wifi', 'Non-smo