Blue Diamond Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w636s-1bce870eb7444174a230d8ba192c077c,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Blue Diamond Guesthouse, 021404 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ចម្ការសំរោង', 'postalCode': '021404'}","{'lat': 13.11174, 'lng': 103.19642}","[{'lat': 13.11177, 'lng': 103.19627}]",13093,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12611275'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512732711'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/bluediamondguesthousebtb'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.111712,103.196594,12611275,Blue Diamond Guesthouse,"We offer different choices of the room price that range from 3.50$ dorm room include breakfast and free pick up from the bus station or boat port. Blue Diamond Guesthouse is just 10-15min walk from a busy city center and two blocks away from from the river but a great rooftop terrace provides a wide view of the surrounding nature of the residential area. The rooms are spacious and clean, though minimally decorated, and many come with a balcony.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d12611275-Reviews-Blue_Diamond_Guesthouse-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 113 St 507', 'street2': 'Phum Wat Vatleab, Chamcasomron 3', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'No. 113 St 507 Phum Wat Vatleab, Chamcasomron 3, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d12611275-Blue_Diamond_Guesthouse-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '