Blue Dog Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-6946ac8495780122cd7223bd7ec8d305,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Blue Dog Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 282 1, 120102 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 282', 'postalCode': '120102', 'houseNumber': '1'}","{'lat': 11.55477, 'lng': 104.92616}","[{'lat': 11.55491, 'lng': 104.92613}]",6919,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]","[{'id': '800-078', 'name': 'Grill', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1642862'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27517897'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512911010', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}, {'value': '+855236789404'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/TheHHotelPhnomPenh', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.554739,104.92618,1642862,Blue Dog Guesthouse,"The Blue Dog hostel/guesthouse is right in the centre of Phnom Penh's famous Boeung Keng Kang district. That means when you stay with us, you're only minutes from all of the capital's best sights. Ten minutes' walk east and you'll find the Independence Monument, the Royal Palace and the riverside, head a kilometre south and you'll find the Genocide Museum and BKK market. For clean, affordable accommodation, we've 4 private rooms and 3 mixed and 1 female only dorms that back onto a common chill out area and balcony for a lazy afternoon. Our staff speak great English, (even the western ones!) and will always be willing to help you out with a smile.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d1642862-Reviews-Blue_Dog_Guesthouse-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '51 #13, Street', 'street2': 'Beung Keng Kang 1', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '51 #13, Street Beung Keng Kang 1, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d1642862-Blue_Dog_Guesthouse-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#36 of 412 B&Bs / Inns in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '412', 'ranking': '36'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,156,"{'1': '15', '2': '15', '3': '28', '4': '29', '5': '69'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}}",74,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d1642862-m66827-Reviews-Blue_Dog_Guesthouse-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Air conditioning', 'Restaurant', 'Dry Cleaning', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Concierge', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Safe', 'Breakfast A