Blue Indigo Yoga Mekong Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w64ds-39089de42705ef19be4697978ed2b126,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Blue Indigo Yoga Mekong Cambodia, 080211 ខ្សាច់កណ្ដាល, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'ខ្សាច់កណ្ដាល', 'district': 'ពុកឫស្សី', 'postalCode': '080211'}","{'lat': 11.69878, 'lng': 104.96967}","[{'lat': 11.6989, 'lng': 104.96973}]",18551,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25447445'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511346634'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://blueindigoyogacambodia.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kandal,11.698696,104.96929,25447445,Blue Indigo Yoga Mekong Cambodia,"We are a Yoga Alliance International school situated front of Phnom penh, at the edge of Mekong, Cambodia. We hold mindful space for you to learn and deepen your practice of yoga and meditation and provide drop-in classes, retreats, teacher trainings, wellness activities, and workshops. All with experienced and certified teachers in a beautiful green oasis close to downtown Phnom Penh.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d25447445-Reviews-Blue_Indigo_Yoga_Mekong_Cambodia-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Puk Russey Village', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '171202', 'address_string': 'Puk Russey Village, Phnom Penh 171202 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d25447445-Blue_Indigo_Yoga_Mekong_Cambodia-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#100 of 351 Specialty lodging in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '351', 'ranking': '100'}",5,ht