Blue Kiwi Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116d408k-2e95b1a9f4470b7a5435c45708117c81,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Blue Kiwi Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 5, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 5', 'postalCode': '120205'}","{'lat': 11.57064, 'lng': 104.92928}","[{'lat': 11.57051, 'lng': 104.92888}]",7110,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3922415'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577326086'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.570506,104.92886,3922415,Blue Kiwi Guesthouse,"Blue Kiwi is a a 16 room Guesthouse in the heart of Phnom Pehn, offering rooms of various sizes and budgets.All rooms have free WIFI, clean comfortable beds, on suite bathrooms, and Air Con.At the time of writing most rooms have Flat Screen TVs and DVD players and in the near future all rooms will have these items, as well as in room safes.Our Bar/Resturant area is furnished to the highest standards, serving a mix of both European and Asian food with a well stocked bar and friendly english speaking staff is provides a comfortable place to have a bite to eat and a drink before exploring the nearby attractions and night life.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d3922415-Reviews-Blue_Kiwi_Guesthouse-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 13, Sangkat Phsar Kandal I,', 'street2': 'Khan Daun Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Street 13, Sangkat Phsar Kandal I, Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d3922415-Blue_Kiwi_Guesthouse-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#