Blue River Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w636s-c52eb0ec86844460ade767f5012c00d6,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Blue River Guesthouse, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09573, 'lng': 103.20217}","[{'lat': 13.09574, 'lng': 103.20203}]",12572,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11953959'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Battambang,13.09573,103.20221,11953959,Blue River Guesthouse,"Finding an ideal small hotel in Battambang does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Blue River Guesthouse, a nice option for travelers like you.
Close to some of Battambang's most popular landmarks, such as Prasat Sneung (0.4 mi) and White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (0.4 mi), Blue River Guesthouse is a great destination for tourists.
The small hotel offers a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and baggage storage, to make your visit even more pleasant. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to parking.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of Battambang's popular dumplings  restaurants such as Jaan Bai Restaurant, The Lonely Tree Cafe, and lan Chov Khorko Miteanh Chinese Noodle Restaurant, all a short distance from Blue River Guesthouse.
During your visit, be sure to check out HUMAN Gallery - Joseba Etxebarria Photography (0.3 mi), which is a popular attraction within walking distance of the small hotel.
Blue River Guesthouse looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Battambang.
