Blue Sea Oyster,here:pds:place:116httek-0044df49bf6007028a756ee56bdca01f,en,food_market_stall,"{'label': 'Blue Sea Oyster, 120207 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ចតុមុខ', 'postalCode': '120207'}","{'lat': 11.55706, 'lng': 104.93826}","[{'lat': 11.55697, 'lng': 104.93827}]",8171,"[{'id': '100-1000-0004', 'name': 'Food Market/Stall', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '800-075', 'name': 'Seafood', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516988898'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.blueseaoyster.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.564713,104.92717,1145584,Blue Lime,"Blue Lime is a 23-room urban accommodation, with a tropical garden and a large swimming pool. It is located right in the historical center of Phnom Penh, between the National Museum and the Royal Palace. The rooms, garden and pool are modern minimalist in their design and are all covered by a free 5Mb/s WI-FI. Four of the rooms have their own private plunge pool. The bar/restaurant serves food in the garden lounge and one can enjoy its cocktails directly in the pool.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d1145584-Reviews-Blue_Lime-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '19 No. 42, Street 19z ( off to Street', 'street2': 'Off Street 19, Near National Museum', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '19 No. 42, Street 19z ( off to Street Off Street 19, Near National Museum, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d1145584-Blue_Lime-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#46 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name':