Blue Sky Bike Tours,here:pds:place:116w63gg-4bb7f1693e889b86a3f14308554cf068,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Blue Sky Bike Tours, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35207, 'lng': 103.85539}","[{'lat': 13.35194, 'lng': 103.85544}]",116674,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15557496'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569996988'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://blueskybiketour.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT14H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.352055,103.85539,15557496,Blue Sky Bike Tours,"Siem Reap is very arguably one of the most bike friendly cities in Cambodia! It hard to imagine a city that could offer better sightseeing routes by bicycle. However it’s true that there is no route more manageable and scenic than that of our Siem Reap customized bike tour. Most of our tour is enjoyed off the main streets, and instead along easy, bike-friendly stretches of the city. Our aim is to show you Siem Reap in an entertaining and relaxed way, showcasing our city in the best possible manner, getting you off the beaten track! Come and join us, you won’t be disappointed! We offer an honest and reliable service to all our clients. Thank you for your interest in our bike tour! We hope to show you a great time here in Siem Reap - the city of Angkor - very soon!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d15557496-Reviews-Blue_Sky_Bike_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,bookbiketour89@gmail.com,+855 69 996 988,http://blueskybiketour.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d15557496-Blue_Sky_Bike_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#121 of 557 Outdoor Activities in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '557', 'ranking': '121'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,56,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '7', '5': '49'}",Not available,146,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d15557496-m66827-Reviews-Blue_Sky_Bike_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2100'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 07:00 - 21:00', 'Tuesday: 07:00 - 21:00', 'Wednesday: 07:00 - 21:00', 'Thursday: 07:00 - 21:00', 'Friday: 07:00 - 21:00', 'Saturday: 07:00 - 21:00', 'Sunday: 07:00 - 21:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}, {'name': 'outdoor_activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Cultural Tours', 'localized_name': 'Cultural Tours'}, {'name': 'City