Bluefrog Bar Hostel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-e46c107bce5a04f3bcafcf385ee53827,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Bluefrog Bar Hostel, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.62564, 'lng': 104.16437}","[{'lat': 10.62559, 'lng': 104.16424}]",129639,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7916505'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510343451'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.625707,104.16453,7916505,Bluefrog Bar Hostel,"Bluefrog Bar & Hostel is a newly opened bar, restaurant and hostel in Kampot, Cambodia, and is located roughly 2 km out town on Tuek Chhu (Waterfall) road. Currently there are private bungalows, private rooms (twin & double) and a large dorm. The bar and kitchen are open for long hours and there is a massive riverfront deck to enjoy the scenery with a nice meal or cocktail.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d7916505-Reviews-Bluefrog_Bar_Hostel-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Tuek Chhu Rd', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Tuek Chhu Rd, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d7916505-Bluefrog_Bar_Hostel-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#43 of 115 Specialty lodging in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '115', 'ranking': '43'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,12,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '0', '4': '7', '5': '4'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localiz