Bluehome Villa II,here:pds:place:116aabd1-c496950cf65b0453e34c011492247ca9,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Bluehome Villa II, ផ្លូវ សម្តេច ព្រះធម្មលិខិត អ៊ុក, 120208 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ជ័យជំនះ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សម្តេច ព្រះធម្មលិខិត អ៊ុក', 'postalCode': '120208'}","{'lat': 11.56424, 'lng': 104.92759}","[{'lat': 11.56408, 'lng': 104.92766}]",6932,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4886428'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855888181781'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/BlueHomeVilla?fref=nf'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.564155,104.927605,4886428,BlueHome Villa II,"Bluehome Villa II is a nice and gentile Guest House located in the very heart of Phnom Penh. My husband and I have just taken over management (May 2015). We are a young married couple, Rachana and Phearith, who are both native Cambodians and can speak five languages between us: English, Thai, Korean, Japanese and of course Khmer. Staying here, you will enjoy Phnom Penh from a unique location, as we are located just next to the beautiful Royal Palace, the Silver Pagoda and the National Museum. It is also just a five minute walk from the riverside and being located on the edge of the main tourist area, you have the convenience of being close to the action without living amongst the hustle and bustle. We offer single and double rooms, air conditioned and fan rooms. All of the rooms have a private bathroom and television inside. We also serve delicious coffee, offer a laundry service, and will clean your room as often as you wish to make your stay in Phnom Penh as comfortable as possible. The guest house is also situated amongst several friendly local shops and restaurants, and just in front of the patio you can even see a small police station, so you don't have to worry about security either!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d4886428-Reviews-BlueHome_Villa_II-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#7B, Street 184, Daun Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '00855', 'address_string': '#7B, Street 184, Daun Penh, Phnom Penh 00855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d4886428-BlueHome_Villa_II-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#39 of 351 Specialty lodging in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '351', 'ranking': '39'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,67,"{'1': '5', '2': '4', '3': '7', '4': '21', '5': '30'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}}",43,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d4886428-m66827-Reviews-BlueHome_Villa_II-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Internet', 'Free I