Bohemiaz Resort & Spa Kampot,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-377eb458488544809cd04d2e4b3b261b,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Bohemiaz Resort & Spa Kampot, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.59526, 'lng': 104.15498}","[{'lat': 10.59513, 'lng': 104.155}]",21712,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6600173'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515809005'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.595295,104.15497,6600173,Bohemiaz Resort & Spa Kampot,"Bohemiaz resort & spa is the perfect place to relax and rejuvenate. Located only 4km from town it’s the perfect mix of being immersed in the stunning countryside whilst also being close enough to pop in. There is a range of beautiful air-con & fan rooms as well as small 4 person dorms to suit every budget. We have a fantastic new spa complex complete with gym, Jacuzzi, infrared sauna, herbal steam room & private treatment rooms. Entry to the spa is free for all guests staying at Bohemiaz. Our restaurant serves up a mix of western & Khmer food, some healthy like our superfood granola, create your own salad or vegan curries, some naughty like our giant burger or homemade cakes! Our healthy food and drinks have been developed with a nutritionist, we know that making small changes can make a big difference on your health and well being, we have vegetarian, vegan and gluten free options and make our own nut milk. Discounted yoga classes available daily at yoga barn kampot only 200m walk!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d6600173-Reviews-Bohemiaz_Resort_Spa_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Andong Khmer', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Andong Khmer, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 