Boho,here:pds:place:116aabd1-97a1c9e507220db64af31352b08d1f7d,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Boho, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.56895, 'lng': 103.55818}","[{'lat': 10.56902, 'lng': 103.5583}]",85922,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10265849'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85590780993'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/bohocambodia/?ref=bookmarks', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.568954,103.55817,10265849,BOHO,"BOHO is a great value hostel offering 4 spacious and modern dormitories in a good location few minutes walking from the beach. We are located in Otres one of Cambodia’s coast most beautiful beaches, where you can enjoy turquoise water and white sands. Our hostel, in the heart of Otres Village, is 5 minutes walk from the Otres Market (every Saturday night) and few minutes tuktuk driving from the Kerfuffle Jungle party (every Wednesday night) The hostel offers 4 mixed dorms some with fan, some with A/C : Dorm A : 6 beds A/C (can be turned into fan in low season) Dorm B : 6 beds fan Dorm C : 8 beds A/C Dorm D : 10 beds A/C Each dorm has an ensuite bathroom with 2 showers and 1 toilet for your comfort. Everything has been made for customers to enjoy their own space : individual plug, light and locker. Dorms are cleaned daily from 11am to 3pm. A/C is turned off on daytime from 10am to 6pm when most of people are outside. The reception is open from 7am to 11pm everyday (these times can be changed during the rainy season from May to November). Our ticket office provides bus tickets, ferry tickets to the islands and day trips, all of them sold with a free pick up in Boho. Send request before your arrival for more information. Night security guard everyday The kitchen and bar opens from 7am. The kitchen closes at 10pm and pizza at 11pm. We offer a wide range of food (western and asian) and amazing pizzas. Our hostel customers gets a 10% discount on most of our food menu. BOHO is a well decorated bar where people meet and share their travel experience around a drink listening to good music in a great atmosphere. Happy Hours are from 6pm to 9pm. Enjoy our rooftop Don’t miss our amazing Movie Night on the rooftop every Sunday night and our Wanderlust Dinner every Thursday (events are not guaranteed during the rainy season). Don’t think longer, book a bed or come enjoy our amazing food!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d10265849-Reviews-BOHO-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Otres Village', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Otres Village, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d10265849-BOHO-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#12 of 277 Specialty lodging in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out_of': '277', 'ranking': '12'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,80,"{'1': '3', '2': '1', '3': '2', '4': '19', '5': '55'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",76,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d10265849-m66827-Reviews-BOHO-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Air conditioning', 'Airport transportation', 'Fitness center', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Outdoor pool', 'Breakfast Available', 'Housekeeping', 'Baggage Storage', 'Billiards', 'English', 'French', 'Khmer', 'Outdoor Furniture', 'Secured Parking', 'Sun Loungers / Beach Chairs', 'Sun Terrace', 'Yoga Classes']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'other', 'localized_name': 'Specialty Lodging'}]",Not available,"['Trendy', 'Quirky Hotels']",[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '19'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '26'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '28'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,29,15
