Bokor Mountain Lodge,here:pds:place:116aabd1-5e5cfc082946027a5f5be5d2c86fb1d5,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Bokor Mountain Lodge, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60662, 'lng': 104.17948}","[{'lat': 10.60675, 'lng': 104.17943}]",19679,"[{'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23995469'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855975616171'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.bokorlodge.com', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.610682,104.17963,560031,Borey Bokor,"Borey Bokor is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Kampot, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as Borey Bokor offers guests free internet access.
For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
The Old Royal Cinema (0.1 mi), located nearby, makes Borey Bokor a great place to stay for those interested in visiting this popular Kampot landmark.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the Chinese restaurants, including Ecran Noodle and Dumpling House and Kama, all of which are a short distance from Borey Bokor.
Looking to explore? Then look no further than Farm Link (0.6 mi), which is a popular Kampot attraction – and it is conveniently located within walking distance of the hotel.
Enjoy your stay in Kampot!
