Bokre Angkor Hostel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-f0727673119f0bc012962ab906157eb5,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Bokre Angkor Hostel, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36373, 'lng': 103.85233}","[{'lat': 13.36371, 'lng': 103.85233}]",24250,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing'}, {'id': '700-7460-0115', 'name': 'Tourist Information'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1876703'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85585511118'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://bokreangkor.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.363726,103.85233,1876703,Bokre Angkor Hostel,"Bokre Angkor Hostel is a luxurious hostel in Siem Reap offering budget and affordable accommodation. Conveniently located close to the city center, it is just a walk away from Siem Reap's most popular restaurants, bars, and shopping. We offer comfortable rooms and best rates for budget travelers. We provide free WiFi and one-way pick-up service from airport or bus stations by Remourque (also known as Tuk Tuk).",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1876703-Reviews-Bokre_Angkor_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#363, Taphul Village, Svay Dangkum Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': '#363, Taphul Village, Svay Dangkum Commune, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d1876703-Bokre_Angkor_Hostel-Siem