Bong Thom Home Stay,here:pds:place:116w63uv-c008f84df754480faff8a00ad11580e9,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Bong Thom Home Stay, 170901 បន្ទាយស្រី, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'បន្ទាយស្រី', 'district': 'ខ្នារសណ្ដាយ', 'postalCode': '170901'}","{'lat': 13.50977, 'lng': 103.94378}","[{'lat': 13.5099, 'lng': 103.94377}]",6883,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2044171'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512520092'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.bongthomhomestay.com/about-us'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.509054,103.943855,2044171,Bong Thom Home Stay,"Bong Thom Home Stay is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Siem Reap, offering a family-friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Free wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at Bong Thom Home Stay offer a desk, a sofa, and a seating area.
During your stay, take advantage of some of the amenities offered, including a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and a picnic area. Guests of Bong Thom Home Stay are also welcome to enjoy an on-site restaurant. For travelers arriving by car, free parking is available.
If you like Chinese restaurants, Bong Thom Home Stay is conveniently located near Restaurant Bong Thom.
Best of all, Bong Thom Home Stay makes it easy to experience many great Siem Reap attractions like Angkor Wat, Ta Prohm, and Bayon Temple, which are some popular ancient ruins.
Enjoy your stay in Siem Reap!
