Booloom Wine Shop,here:pds:place:116w636s-3cd2789e44bd1ca30fcb9d7aceb5ea18,en,bar_pub,"{'label': 'Booloom Wine Shop, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10046, 'lng': 103.19789}","[{'lat': 13.10047, 'lng': 103.19789}]",12468,"[{'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0065', 'name': 'Winery'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '14970521'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515777050'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://booloomwineshop.business.site'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Fri: 08:00 - 17:30', 'Sat: 08:00 - 12:30'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT09H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR'}, {'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT04H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:SA'}]}]",Battambang,13.362133,103.8557,8484524,Grill Wine Cafe,"Grill Wine Café is the bright new concept of dinning venue, which envisions being the one-stop dining venue to serve your every need. The well-selected breakfast menu ranges from Western to Asian, from traditional to contemporary Khmer cuisine. Its great location makes GWC become the special meeting point that suitable for either your relaxed lunch schedule or quick bite of snacks with refreshing smoothies, frappe, coffee or tea providing an unparalleled dining experience. At Grill Wine Café, dinner is not a simple meal but to feast and celebrate the great dining experience, you cannot miss the grill of world class sausages by International Master Butcher who joined recipes of our head Chef which newly creates the great infusion of Cambodian Amok sausage, curry sausage...and a stunning wine cellar consists of more than one hundred of wines from all over the world.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d8484524-Reviews-Grill_Wine_Cafe-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1'