Boom Coffee,here:pds:place:116w649k-b208d21b93054b76bf146757a774c273,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Boom Coffee, 081105 តាខ្មៅ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'តាខ្មៅ', 'district': 'ព្រែកហូ', 'postalCode': '081105'}","{'lat': 11.46066, 'lng': 104.93238}","[{'lat': 11.46075, 'lng': 104.93238}]",15773,"[{'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512347707'}]}],Not Available,Kandal,11.512054,104.89065,27397630,Burlap Coffee Factory,"Burlap is a woven fabric made from jute plant. The building block of burlap makes it unique, strong, durable and highly versatile; thousands of small but strong fibers represents authenticity, humble and simple but strong and persistence, team work and cooperation, innovation, sustainability, green living and conscious lifestyle that give back to community. De Burlap Café is CAMBODIAN HIGH END ALL-DAY CAFÉ which was born in 2014 in the heart of city. We were the very first European style Café integrated with Asian style cuisine. We would like to bring the best of each part together in harmony. Creating the moment of happiness with excellent. Cup of coffee, great food, good people in ambience environment is our goal. It is fantastic to bring great moment to our customers through their food and drink and make them feel comfortable like home even away from home. Food and beverage are not just only the products but our passion. Our baristas and cooks try their best to craft and serving up",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d27397630-Reviews-Burlap_Coffee_Factory-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Chamkar Doung Street 217', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '\t120501', 'address_string': 'Chamkar Doung Street 217, Phnom Penh \t120501 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]"