Borey Bokor Hotel Branch,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-348fe7c3d7e6404c9fa30ca21733e898,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Borey Bokor Hotel Branch, 070803 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់បាយ', 'postalCode': '070803'}","{'lat': 10.611, 'lng': 104.17998}","[{'lat': 10.61112, 'lng': 104.17992}]",25785,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '560031'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6125131'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511704087'}, {'value': '+855336329168'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.610953,104.18,6125131,Borey Bokor Hotel Branch,"Borey Bokor Hotel Branch is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Kampot, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Free wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at Borey Bokor Hotel Branch offer a refrigerator, a minibar, and air conditioning.
During your stay, take advantage of some of the amenities offered, including a 24 hour front desk, room service, and a concierge. Guests of Borey Bokor Hotel Branch are also welcome to enjoy a pool, located on site. For travelers arriving by car, parking is available.
When you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out Tertulia Restaurant Kampot, Atelier Kampot, and The Fishmarket, which are some seafood restaurants that are popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.
If you are interested in exploring Kampot, check out a historic site, such as The Old Royal Cinema.
Enjoy your stay in Kampot!
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d6125131-Reviews-Borey_Bokor_Hotel_Branch-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'South Kampong Bay Village', 'street2': 'Sangkat Kampong Bay, Behind Canadia Bank', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'South Kampong Bay Village Sangkat Kampong Bay, Behind Canadia Bank, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d6125131-Borey_Bokor_Hotel_Branch-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#89 of 148 B&Bs / Inns in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '148', 'ranking': '89'}",2.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/2.5-66827-5.svg,10,"{'1': '2', '2': '4', '3': '1', '4': '3', '5': '0'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",1,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d6125131-m66827-Reviews-Borey_Bokor_Hotel_Branch-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Kids Activities', 'Room service', 'Free Internet', 'Pets Allowed', 'Airport tra