Borey Chulsa Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-0c8728f596a0441cb226b503821079b0,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Borey Chulsa Guesthouse, ផ្លូវជាតិ 3, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 3', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.61195, 'lng': 104.17163}","[{'lat': 10.61187, 'lng': 104.17174}]",26168,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3324106'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Kampot,10.611966,104.17159,3324106,Borey Chulsa Guesthouse,"Welcome to Borey Chulsa Guesthouse, your Kampot “home away from home.” Borey Chulsa Guesthouse aims to make your visit as relaxing and enjoyable as possible, which is why so many guests continue to come back year after year.
Close to The Old Royal Cinema (0.7 mi), a popular Kampot landmark, Borey Chulsa Guesthouse is a great destination for tourists.
Free wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at Borey Chulsa Guesthouse offer air conditioning and a desk.
During your stay, take advantage of some of the amenities offered, including a concierge.
If you like Asian restaurants, Borey Chulsa Guesthouse is conveniently located near Epic Arts Cafe, Ecran Noodle and Dumpling House, and Rikitikitavi.
If you are interested in exploring Kampot, check out a waterfall, such as Popokvil Waterfall.
Borey Chulsa Guesthouse puts the best of Kampot at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
