Borey Thmey Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w636k-e5daa0ed7f8c432da7deffe8f6ce1541,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Borey Thmey Guesthouse, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.09242, 'lng': 103.19491}","[{'lat': 13.09229, 'lng': 103.19495}]",11709,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3773072'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Battambang,13.09233,103.19494,3773072,Borey Thmey Guesthouse,"See why so many travelers make Borey Thmey Guesthouse their guest house of choice when visiting Battambang. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer a refrigerator and a desk, bringing comfort and convenience to your visit.
While staying at Borey Thmey Guesthouse, visitors can check out Prasat Sneung (0.3 mi) and White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (0.6 mi), some of Battambang's top attractions.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of Battambang's popular crab restaurants such as Jaan Bai Restaurant and White Rose, all a short distance from Borey Thmey Guesthouse.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out HUMAN Gallery - Joseba Etxebarria Photography (0.5 mi), which is a popular attraction amongst tourists, and it is within walking distance.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Borey Thmey Guesthouse as you experience all of the things Battambang has to offer.
