Bou Savy Villa,here:pds:place:116w63gg-5d3425eb06d646e5be4403096cbbe1d1,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Bou Savy Villa, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35884, 'lng': 103.84535}","[{'lat': 13.35884, 'lng': 103.84549}]",25164,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12967065'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512898627'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.bousavyvilla.com/home', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.35884,103.84546,12967065,Bou Savy Villa,"Bou Savy Villa is located in the city center of Siem Reap Angkor and just 15 minutes walk to Pub Street, Old and Night Market. and only 5 minutes walk to Angkor Supermarket. We are 7km way from the Angkor Wat Temple and 7km away from the Siem Reap International Airpot. Beside of Accommodation, we can arrange sight seeing tour and other other activities. We are off the main road , so that is away from the Noise and Dust. Room are big size with well decor .",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12967065-Reviews-Bou_Savy_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Near Sok San Road', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Near Sok San Road, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12967065-Bou_Savy_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#65 of 6