Bread of Life Bed & Breakfast,here:pds:place:116d408k-fcf4b48d7e540529e9533c5f0cbf9eec,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Bread of Life Bed & Breakfast, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.36202, 'lng': 103.86583}","[{'lat': 13.36189, 'lng': 103.86582}]",23417,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '600-6300-0244', 'name': 'Bakery & Baked Goods Store'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515625270'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.355206,103.85461,2023172,For Life Restaurant,"For Life Restaurant is a traditional Cambodian family restaurant , serving the best in Cambodian & Thai food, as well as many international dishes, for those missing their home-country. We cater for vegetarians , and seafood lovers alike, with a wide and varied menu. All our food is made with love, using the freshest locally sourced ingredients , and served with a smile by our attentive wait-staff. We also have super-fresh & cold beer, served in pre-cooled glasses , as well as a large range of international cocktails , spirits , and a great selection of red & white wines. For Life Restaurant caters for all budgets, and is able to deal with group bookings and special occasions.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d2023172-Reviews-For_Life_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'The Lane Close to Ms. Wong', 'street2': 'Mondul 1 Village, Sangakat Svay Dangkum', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'The Lane Close to Ms. Wong Mondul 1 Village, Sangakat Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': '