Breathe Wild,here:pds:place:116w6hrk-ae2ef6f808e65e59ae07c495f343a038,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Breathe Wild, 110404 ពេជ្រាដា, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'មណ្ឌលគីរី', 'city': 'ពេជ្រាដា', 'district': 'ប៊ូស្រា', 'postalCode': '110404'}","{'lat': 12.53675, 'lng': 107.43335}","[{'lat': 12.53675, 'lng': 107.43338}]",145194,"[{'id': '500-5100-0056', 'name': 'Campground', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25327312'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598999821'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://breatheresorts.com'}]}]",Not Available,Mondulkiri,12.573773,107.43262,25327312,Breathe Wild,"Sharing with you the unique experience of Breathe Wild Resort in Mondulkiri, Cambodia. We offer our guests a luxurious stay in customized dome tents with one bedroom and two bunk beds, all including bathrooms and toilets. We’re the only resort located right next to Bousra Waterfall and in the middle of a lush forest ,giving our guests a chance to explore the great outdoors and its beauty. Our guests can enjoy a refreshing dip in our swimming pool or go swimming in the smaller waterfalls on the property. Moreover, we offer a variety of activities such as quad biking, hiking and team building, making us an ideal location for school camps and corporate retreats. We also have a vegetable and coffee plantation, a bar, a restaurant and a mini-mart for all your needs.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g25337892-d25327312-Reviews-Breathe_Wild-Pech_Chreada_Mondulkiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Rd', 'city': 'Pech Chreada', 'state': 'Mondulkiri Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '110404', 'address_string': 'National Rd, Pech Chreada 110404 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Pech Chreada', 'location_id': '25337892'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Mondulkiri Province', 'location_id': '2366669'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not 