Brise de Kep,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-387bc702c1f24384a49c86cd4603df3f,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Brise de Kep, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.47998, 'lng': 104.29359}","[{'lat': 10.47994, 'lng': 104.29372}]",8049,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2063355'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512301017'}]}],Not Available,Kep,10.480058,104.29328,2063355,Brise de Kep,"See why so many travelers make Brise de Kep their guest house of choice when visiting Kep. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a budget friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Close to Patio (2.4 mi), a popular Kep landmark, Brise de Kep is a great destination for tourists.
As your “home away from home,” the guest house rooms offer air conditioning and a desk, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and a sun terrace while staying at Brise de Kep. In addition, Brise de Kep offers an on-site restaurant, which will help make your Kep trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
During your visit, be sure to check out a popular Kep tempura restaurant such as Holy Crab, which is a short distance from Brise de Kep.
Looking to explore? Then look no further than Crab Statue (0.5 mi), which is a popular Kep attraction – and it is conveniently located within walking distance of the guest house.
At Brise de Kep, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Kep.
