Buddhist Foreign Language Association,here:pds:place:116w63u5-6b7a28b661234488a40938b7029ecf6d,en,temple,"{'label': 'Buddhist Foreign Language Association, ផ្លូវជាតិ 6, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 6', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.3667, 'lng': 103.85}","[{'lat': 13.36671, 'lng': 103.85001}]",24185,"[{'id': '700-7200-0269', 'name': 'Organizations and Societies', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3200-0031', 'name': 'Temple'}, {'id': '800-8200-0000', 'name': 'Education Facility'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'www': [{'value': 'https://bflacambodia.wordpress.com'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.349769,103.85854,12272435,Cambodia Bird Guide Association,"Cambodia Bird Guide Association (CBGA) is an NGO in Siem Reap which provides bird watching and eco-tours across Cambodia. We are committed to the preservation of wildlife, nature and developing the livelihoods of people in conservation areas. We work closely with the provincial Department of Environment, in this regard, to raise awareness and educate local people on avian and environmental issues. CBGA tours are led by professional local bird guides to 17 different destinations from Siem Reap, Angkor Wat, Prek Toal, ATT, Koh Ker Beng Mealea, Florican Grassland, Tmatboey, Okoki, Vulture Restaurant, Kratie, Bokor, Phnom Aural, from ½ day to 3-week trip. CBGA was founded in December 2016 by a group of accomplished birdwatchers and conservationists, who collectively have many years of experience, specifically in avian and wildlife preservation. Our organization is dedicated to the protection of the environment and is actively working to make a difference in the Cambodian countryside.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d12272435-Reviews-Cambodia_Bird_Guide_Association-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Salakamreuk Rd', 'street2': 'Wat Damnak Village', '