Bullfrog Adventures Cambodia,here:pds:place:116aabd1-450ebd9d1e3c03112c92ddc98e18bb78,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Bullfrog Adventures Cambodia, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.45469, 'lng': 103.85429}","[{'lat': 13.45483, 'lng': 103.85429}]",18061,"[{'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3681822'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85595727290'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://bullfrogcambodia.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT15H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.453,103.85433,3681822,Camouflage Adventures Cambodia,"The aim of Bullfrog Cambodia is to share the beauty of rural Cambodia as it can be best experienced, by mountain bike. The name Bullfrog indicates our desire to be part of nature without disturbing it. The company's tours offer a profound way to discover local life in an unobtrusive manner. All our tours are adapted for all levels of rider. These introduce another side of Cambodia, a side that most tourists never see.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d3681822-Reviews-Camouflage_Adventures_Cambodia-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#26 St.14 Phum Trang', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '#26 St.14 Phum Trang, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,journey@camouflageadventures.com,+855 95 727 290,http://camouflageadventures.com,https: