Bun Dau Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w63gg-39b048cc2fcf4214b16c4fa392c9b50c,en,food_market_stall,"{'label': 'Bun Dau Restaurant, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35192, 'lng': 103.85498}","[{'lat': 13.35179, 'lng': 103.85503}]",25034,"[{'id': '100-1000-0004', 'name': 'Food Market/Stall', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '206-000', 'name': 'Vietnamese'}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '20154430'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598700070'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/BundauMomtom'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 11:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T110000', 'duration': 'PT10H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.351887,103.85499,20154430,Bun Dau Restaurant,"The one-and-only Bun Dau serves fresh traditional, authentic street snack platters in a modern setting. All of our mouth-watering dishes come with fresh vegetables, rice vermicelli, protein, tofu, and local fresh herbs to create a balanced, delicious meal with our signature dipping sauce. Bun Dau Mam Tom is a popular and rustic snack found across Vietnam and Southeast Asia, distinct because of its “unique” Shrimp Dipping Sauce. The famous dip is prepared with shrimp paste, a big squeeze of calamansi, fresh chili, a bit of sugar and ground peanuts. Sharing one of our large platters is the perfect way to satisfy everyone's tastes. You'll be hooked! All of Cambodia is trying this flavorful dish! Visit our franchise locations in PP, Preah Vihear, Poipet, and Takeo.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d20154430-Reviews-Bun_Dau_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#0302 Wat Damnak Street', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': '#0302 Wat Damnak Street, Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,bundausiemreap@gmail.com,+855 98 700 070,https://www.facebook.com/BundauMomtom/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d20154430-Bun_Dau_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#467 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '467'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,9,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '9'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",17,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d20154430-m66827-Reviews-Bun_Dau_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2100'}}, {