Bunra Cafê,here:pds:place:116d408k-19e51b901c5a0193a9a20c9600e88cb5,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Bunra Cafê, ផ្លូវជាតិ 5, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 5', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.1037, 'lng': 103.20616}","[{'lat': 13.10358, 'lng': 103.2061}]",13412,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512444748'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.103053,103.19991,2094171,Cafe Eden,"Great little cafe right next to the river in Battambang. Run as a social enterprise, the Cafe has a boutique featuring local art, clothing, jewelry. Menu consists of an eclectic mix of owner Anna's international culinary experience paired with Australian Chef Dom execution and imagination. Great little environment, family friendly. Free WIFI and Air Conditioning and wonderful Espresso! Also we have a conference room upstairs for large teams.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g303666-d2094171-Reviews-Cafe_Eden-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'House #89 Group 5, Mapei Outsapeea Village', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'House #89 Group 5, Mapei Outsapeea Village, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,cafeedencambodia@gmail.com,+855 53 731 525,http://www.cafeedencambodia.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d2094171-Cafe_Eden-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#12 of 138 Places to Eat in Battambang', 'geo_location