Bunyong Homestay,here:pds:place:116aabd1-87c6a74f5830035b19c6f10fb1cc03fb,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Bunyong Homestay, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.37806, 'lng': 103.83378}","[{'lat': 13.37803, 'lng': 103.83392}]",87732,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '400-4100-0041', 'name': 'Transportation Service'}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8118215'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577370818'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/Bunyonghomestay', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.378077,103.83366,8118215,Bunyong Homestay,"Bunyong Homestay is an Unique, Traditional Khmer and French colonial style house just only 15 minutes from Siem Reap downtown and Airport. It's located in a very tranquill natural environment with mango trees, organic fruit and vegetable garden and lotus fields. Visitors are welcome to explore the open landscape, walking to a lake full of fish where the local children play, swim and fishing. The Homestay has attractive and clean private bedrooms , bathrooms and balcanies where you can watch the beautiful sunrise and sunset. Each bed is fitted with mosquito net and fan and AC. The experience of staying with an authentic Khmer family should not be missed. We are able to share our daily activities, humble, quiet lives and also enjoy our delicious freshly prepared Khmer food and for the more adventurous we offer our home made beverages such as a special spider and herbal wines. It's our intention, passion, and pleasure to provide a perfect experience of a genuine Khmer life style. We offer more than just accommodation for a visitor to the city of Angkor but provide a unique lifetime experience. An orientation walk is available, with an English Speaking Guide, to show you the local village life and temples. Bun and his Khmer family are unique , inspirational people always happy and smiley. They know this area so well and can provide an unique, unforgettable experience of life, past and present, in Cambodia. With their guidance you can step off the beaten tourist track and travel like a local, getting the best route through the complex city of Angkor and its many Wats. You will be guided through history, walked through the jungle to enjoy the ruins in splendor and relative peace. This is the best way to see the ancient site and ensure that the local communities benefit directly from your visit. Please find us on Facebook at Bunyong Home OR Travel to C.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d8118215-Reviews-Bunyong_Homestay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Group 13', 'street2': 'Phumi Krus, Sangkat Svaydangkum, Wat Patri Road', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12526', 'address_string': 'Group 13 Phumi Krus, Sangkat Svaydangkum, Wat Patri Road, Siem Reap 12526 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d8118215-Bunyong_Homestay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#3 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '3'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,334,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '6', '5': '327'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 