Burly Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-a92cba75208a0955277958e3d61ddc3a,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Burly Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 111 70, 120308 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ប្រាំពីរ មករា', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងព្រលឹត', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 111', 'postalCode': '120308', 'houseNumber': '70'}","{'lat': 11.55691, 'lng': 104.91807}","[{'lat': 11.55692, 'lng': 104.91821}]",6008,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2275223'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515771717'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.55899,104.91814,2275223,Burly Guesthouse,"Finding an ideal guest house in Phnom Penh does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Burly Guesthouse, a nice option for travelers like you.
Rooms at Burly Guesthouse provide a refrigerator, air conditioning, and a desk, and guests can stay connected with free wifi.
In addition, while staying at Burly Guesthouse guests have access to a 24 hour front desk and baggage storage. Need a place to park? Free parking is available at Burly Guesthouse.
While staying at Burly Guesthouse, visitors can check out Wat Langka (0.7 mi) and Champey Academy of Arts (0.7 mi), some of Phnom Penh's top attractions.
When you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out Brooklyn Pizza & Bistro, Sikgaek Korea Restaurant, and Sovanna, which are some barbeque restaurants that are popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum (0.7 mi), Royal Palace (0.9 mi), or Central Market (0.9 mi), which are popular attractions amongst tourists, and they are all within walking distance.
Burly Guesthouse puts the best of Phnom Penh at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
