Butterflies Garden Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w63u5-9b7a02f3abfc48a19713d0ee3abaa7ee,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Butterflies Garden Restaurant, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.36689, 'lng': 103.87736}","[{'lat': 13.36691, 'lng': 103.87722}]",22205,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17551103'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511571771'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.butterflygardenrestaurant.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 09:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.366904,103.87727,17551103,Butterflies Garden Restaurant,"Behind a garden wall lays an oasis of peace. Inside, Many Angkorean butterflies frolic among beautiful flowering plants and fruiting trees at Butterflies Garden Restaurant. Those who enter will hear the gentle sounds of traditional music while enjoying creative tropical cuisine and tall, refreshing drinks.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d17551103-Reviews-Butterflies_Garden_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '500m Northward From Road, 6 Psa Lue', 'street2': 'Chong Koa Sou Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17253', 'address_string': '500m Northward From Road, 6 Psa Lue Chong Koa Sou Village, Siem Reap 17253 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@butterflygardenrestaurant.com,+855 11 571 771,http:/