Butterfly Paradise,here:pds:place:116w63gf-26bb113ff7bf4e73ba2a80e6aee68ff8,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Butterfly Paradise, 171208 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សំបួរ', 'postalCode': '171208'}","{'lat': 13.35066, 'lng': 103.81874}","[{'lat': 13.35074, 'lng': 103.81863}]",27848,"[{'id': '550-5520-0208', 'name': 'Zoo', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15136929'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512558768'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.butterflyparadise.net'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Fri, Sun: 09:00 - 16:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT07H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.350656,103.81874,15136929,Butterfly Paradise,"This attraction was designed and built with the goal of helping the Butterfly Paradise Orphanage and Kantrok Adventist School, become financially independent of donations. Opened to the public on December 25, 2018, Butterfly Paradise gives travellers to Siem Reap a place to relax and immerse themselves in the beauty of the natural world. The garden features,Butterflies, crocodiles, fish, snakes, tortoises, insects, spiders, waterfalls and more all set in a lush flower filled paradise in Siem Reap town. This is a great place for children of all ages. Large fish will massage your feet while you enjoy watching a relaxing waterfall. To escape the heat you can enjoy the air-conditioned cinema or enjoy Vegan food in the Restaurant which looks into the garden. See you there.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d15136929-Reviews-Butterfly_Paradise-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Butterfly Paradise Road', 'street2': 'Turn left 200 meters west of Artbox', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17258', 'address_string': 'Butterfly Paradise Road Turn left 200 meters w