CCC Equestrian Center,here:pds:place:116w649d-0bb10f8eb3df773b4ef79fb1e44fbbd7,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'CCC Equestrian Center, ផ្លូវ 2004, 120802 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'សែនសុខ', 'subdistrict': 'ទឹកថ្លា', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 2004', 'postalCode': '120802'}","{'lat': 11.55128, 'lng': 104.86648}","[{'lat': 11.55115, 'lng': 104.8665}]",1864,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10514221'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10517018'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593885591'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.cambodian-country-club.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 18:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT10H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.551342,104.86648,10514221,CCC Equestrian Center,"If you are passionate about horses and want to learn more about them, you’ve come to the right place! The CCC provides the first and only Equestrian Center in Phnom Penh and we’re equipped with a great team of internationally qualified instructors to teach you. With its 30 horses and ponies housed in a 4000 sqm. Arena, lessons are available on all levels.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d10514221-Reviews-CCC_Equestrian_Center-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 2004, Group 6, Sangkat Toeuk Thla, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12101', 'address_string': 'Street 2004, Group 6, Sangkat Toeuk Thla, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh, Phnom Penh 12101 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@cambodian-country-club.com,+855 93 885 591,http://www.cambodian-country-club.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Use