COURTYARD by Marriott-Siem Reap Resort,here:pds:place:116w63gg-e32bbf5303594aef9b9b5f2df7db8dc8,en,hotel,"{'label': 'COURTYARD by Marriott-Siem Reap Resort, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.3589, 'lng': 103.88134}","[{'lat': 13.35888, 'lng': 103.88152}]",22645,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12406578'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17552828'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563968888'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.358895,103.88134,12406578,Courtyard Siem Reap Resort,"With its modern, award-winning Khmer architecture, sleek decor and forward-thinking amenities, the new Courtyard Siem Reap Resort opens its doors in stunning contrast to the ancient sites of nearby Angkor Archeological Park. As the lobby leads into Cambodia's first Courtyard resort, its chic lounge tempts with sweet and savory delights, innovative tea-tails and cocktails. From the rooftop bar, unique libations are served, with binoculars offered on the observation to take in dramatic views of Angkor Wat. For all-day hotel dining, Lok Lak brings local inspiration to international fare. Beyond, there are stylish rooms and suites where guests can enjoy balcony views, fill the air with music on the Bluetooth® speaker, connect to Wi-Fi, or relax in front of a 43-inch TV. In addition to a saltwater pool and fitness center, serenity awaits at Quan Spa with its traditional Cambodian treatments. The hotel has cooking classes, a kids' club, and 4,400+ square feet of event space.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12406578-Reviews-Courtyard_Siem_Reap_Resort-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No 0609 Road 6A', 'street2': 'Phum Chongkoesou, Khum Slor Kram', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode'