Cafe Khmer Time,here:pds:place:116aabd1-ebb9e2ba5a180c42587702d637a44145,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Cafe Khmer Time, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37258, 'lng': 103.86163}","[{'lat': 13.3726, 'lng': 103.86149}]",22844,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]","[{'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15208185'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4548378'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563964770'}, {'value': '+85592228464'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:00 - 19:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT13H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.372547,103.86181,4548378,Cafe Khmer Time,Cafe Khmer Time(formerly known as Cafe PUKA PUKA)is located next to Angkor Cookies Shop.The orange decor offers a soothing tropical atmosphere inside the cafe. Enjoy our special desserts with their lavish array of Cambodian fruit. Be sure not to miss out our original Mango Shake and Mango Sorbet!Cafe Puka Puka promises you a cozy and relaxing tea time. We use fresh fruit and ice made from water inspected by the authorized inspection agency of Japan. Our ice-cream and sorbet are home-made with no additives.,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d4548378-Reviews-Cafe_Khmer_Time-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Angkor Wat Road', 'street2': 'opposite Sofitel Angkor Phokeethra Hotel', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Angkor Wat Road opposite Sofitel Angkor Phokeethra Hotel, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,sales@angkorcookies.com,+855 92 228 464,http://www.cafekhmertime.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d4548378-Cafe_Khmer_Time-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#252 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '252'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,63,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '7', '4': '25', '5': '31'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}}",64,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d4548378-m66827-Reviews-Cafe_Khmer_Time-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '1900'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 06:00 - 19:00', 'Tuesday: 06:00 - 19:00', 'Wednesday: 06:00 - 19:00', 'Thursday: 06:00 - 19:0