Cafe Lodge Coffee,here:pds:place:116d408k-fa2082f2a5af05589e94c390aedc8904,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Cafe Lodge Coffee, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35243, 'lng': 103.85996}","[{'lat': 13.35256, 'lng': 103.86001}]",24642,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '700-7400-0285', 'name': 'Internet Cafe'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523966737'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.cafelodge.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.345081,103.86034,3909549,Sala Lodges,"Authenticity and contrasts. Dreamt up and designed by South East Asia enthusiasts, Sala Lodges capitalists on its simplicity to create a sense of absolute luxury, ideal for welcoming guests with exacting yet relaxed standards. With an easy convenient location by just 10 minutes walking to attraction areas. The eleven wooden houses on stilts were spotted in villages in the Cambodian countryside, dismantled, transported and beautifully restored to offer the ultimate in comfort to guests. Each house, with its different history and architecture affords Sala Lodges its quality as a unique and intimate hotel. The communal areas provide a slick and contemporary feel to the hotel. The clean, modern lines of the reception, restaurant, bar and swimming pool accentuate the contrast with the traditional houses.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d3909549-Reviews-Sala_Lodges-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No 498 Salakomroeuk', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '00000', 'address_string': 'No 498 Salakomroeuk, Siem Reap 00000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia'