Cambana la Riviere Hotel,here:pds:place:116w636s-67547c1c871ba2a2a3c366e62b5c7d8e,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Cambana la Riviere Hotel, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09972, 'lng': 103.20282}","[{'lat': 13.09959, 'lng': 103.20278}]",12867,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23971988'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570766188'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://cambanalariviere.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.099618,103.20279,23971988,Cambana La Riviere Hotel,Our distinctive and luxurious residence is carefully designed so that our guests will experience a new dimension in comfort and luxury. Here at Cambana La Riviere our philosophy is that we care about your requests and desires. You are staying in a small hotel with an emphasis on personal touch. The fusion architecture of Khmer contemporary adjoining with the sense of French décor also gives the hotel a warm and cozy ambience.,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d23971988-Reviews-Cambana_La_Riviere_Hotel-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 201A, Romchek 5', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '21403', 'address_string': 'Street 201A, Romchek 5, Battambang 21403 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d23971988-Cambana_La_Riviere_Hotel-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#8 of 43 hotels in Battambang', 'geo_location_name': 'Battambang', 'ranking_out_of'