Cambo Angkor Guide,here:pds:place:116aabd1-950e48b2e6a20806e79bf07015bf9c32,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Cambo Angkor Guide, 171205 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'នគរធំ', 'postalCode': '171205'}","{'lat': 13.44129, 'lng': 103.85959}","[{'lat': 13.44116, 'lng': 103.85959}]",18232,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2157680'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512265437'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.camboangkorguide.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Thu, Sat, Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.441544,103.85942,2157680,Cambo Angkor Guide,"Ladies and Gentlemen, my name is Sorm Son and I wish to be your charming Angkor Wat Tour guide. For almost ten years I have been an Official Angor Wat Tour guide and I can help make your stay in Cambodia a fun and wondrous adventure. I am a member of the local Khmer ethnic group and was a Buddhist monk for over eleven years. This background gives me a unique perspective of Cambodian life, which I will be happy to share with you as your Angkor Wat tour guide.My University studies led to a Bachelor in Ed degree in English and I will help with any translation issues that may arise during your stay here in Siem Reap. I am also an expert on the history of the construction of the temples as well as their symbolism. As your Angkor Wat Tour Guide I can help with your special photographs. I will direct you to the best locations and positions. I am also willing to lend a helping hand as necessary.For many, coming to the Angkor Wat area is a lifelong dream and as your Angkor Way Tour Guide I will insure that your dreams are fulfilled during your trip to Wondrous Cambodia.I look forward to meeting you and hope you will let me become your personal Angkor Wat Tour Guide.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d2157680-Reviews-Cambo_Angkor_Guide-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,sonsorm1@gmail.com,+855 12 265 437,http://www.camboangkorguide.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d2157680-Cambo_Angkor_Guide-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#78 of 1,339 Tours in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1339', 'ranking': '78'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,365,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '22', '5': '343'}",Not available,210,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d2157680-m66827-Reviews-Cambo_Angkor_Guide-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2359'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Tuesday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Wednesday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Thursday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Friday: Closed', 'Saturday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Sunday: 00:00 - 23:59']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Cultural Tours', 'localized_name': 'Cultural Tours'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '128'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '23'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '52'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '92'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,31,20
Cambo Cruise,here:pds:place:116d408k-46359b2159b20a8f1ad324359ac2dfda,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Cambo Cruise, ផ្លូវ 1, 120208 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ជ័យជំនះ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 1', 'postalCode': '120208'}","{'lat': 11.56358, 'lng': 104.93404}","[{'lat': 11.56351, 'lng': 104.93393}]",7637,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}, {'id': '700-7400-0140', 'name': 'Boating Services'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8096195'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592290077'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://cambocruise.com'}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 11:30 - 20:30'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T113000', 'duration': 'PT09H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.563793,104.93436,8096195,Cambo Cruise,"Daily lunch and dinner cruise departing at set times from the riverside in Phnom Penh, departing from the Phnom Penh Floating Port. 12:00pm-4:00pm Silk Island Lunch Cruise with guided tour. 5:00pm-7:00pm Sunset Dinner Cruise with live traditional Cambodian music. All you can eat buffet serving fresh, local, organic food on both cruises. Vegetarian and vegan options available. Food prepared on the boat daily. Full bar with cocktails, coffee/espresso, local/import beers, and juices. Bar and kitchen are also open while the boat is in port, outside of normal cruise times. Wooden, traditional Cambodian style boat, with modern equipment, licensed and inspected. Men's and women's toilets. Well trained service staff, first-aid instructed. 12+ staff on the boat at all times to guarantee excellent service. Western owned and operated, 100% Western standards.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d8096195-Reviews-Cambo_Cruise-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12200', 'address_string': 'Phnom Penh 12200 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,cambocruise@icloud.com,+855 92 290 077,http://www.cambocruise.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d8096195-Cambo_Cruise-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#4 of 48 Boat Tours &amp; Water Sports in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '48', 'ranking': '4'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,465,"{'1': '6', '2': '7', '3': '16', '4': '78', '5': '358'}",Not available,300,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d8096195-m66827-Reviews-Cambo_Cruise-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1130'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2030'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1130'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2030'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1130'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2030'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1130'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2030'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1130'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2030'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '1130'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2030'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '1130'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2030'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 11:30 - 20:30', 'Tuesday: 11:30 - 20:30', 'Wednesday: 11:30 - 20:30', 'Thursday: 11:30 - 20:30', 'Friday: 11:30 - 20:30', 'Saturday: 11:30 - 20:30', 'Sunday: 11:30 - 20:30']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'boat_tours_water_sports', 'localized_name': 'Boat Tours & Water Sports'}, {'name': 'outdoor_activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities'}, {'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name':