Cambodia Beach,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-01a01d4eaf6f444984d5230e2ca3dc41,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Cambodia Beach, 180403 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បី', 'postalCode': '180403'}","{'lat': 10.64744, 'lng': 103.52377}","[{'lat': 10.64744, 'lng': 103.52378}]",100766,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569658897'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.629922,103.51076,7095117,Woody's Quads Cambodia,"""KOH RONG'S No.1 OUTDOOR ACTIVITY"" Join us on new specially designed woodland course for our TIME TRIAL EVENT @ ONLY $10 per rider This is an attraction not to be missed !! TOURS FROM $30 PER PERSON Have the exhilarating experience of riding a Quad Bike along woodland dirt tracks & crossing wooden bridges on the beautiful island of Koh Rong. Visit rural homestead's, Dam Skal fishing village and see the amazing vista of Longset Bay Family tours available No experience of riding a Quad Bike is required !! AFTERNOON ADVENTURE ( duration 1 - 1.5 hours) $30 per rider Start Time 4.30 pm NATURE BEACH & TRACKS ( duration 2 - 2.5 hours) $55 per rider Start Time 10.00 am, 1.30 pm & 4.00 pm DAM SKAL ADVENTURE ( duration 3 - 3.5 hours) $75 per rider Start Time 9.30 am & 2.30 pm All tours are fully guided Tour meeting point : Longset Beach Pier",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g1808558-d7095117-Reviews-Woody_s_Quads_Cambodia-Koh_Rong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Koh Rong', 'state': 'Koh Kong Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Koh Rong 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Koh Rong', 'location_id': '1808558'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Koh Kong Province', 'location_id': '2366667'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,woodys.atvs@gmail.