Cambodia Booking Taxi,here:pds:place:116w649e-57ab1927e299220e236c4e07ed0e0115,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Cambodia Booking Taxi, ផ្លូវ 288, 120102 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 288', 'postalCode': '120102'}","{'lat': 11.55428, 'lng': 104.92555}","[{'lat': 11.55416, 'lng': 104.92557}]",6866,"[{'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}, {'id': '400-4100-0041', 'name': 'Transportation Service'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27232019'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577756776'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.cambodiabookingtaxi.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.554329,104.92565,27232019,Cambodia Booking Taxi,"Cambodia Booking Taxi services offer convenient options for individuals or group seeking personalized transportation. These services typically allow customers to schedule various ride types and often provide door-to-door service. You can book us through WhatsApp, Telegram, Email, Facebook Messenger, Line and more. We are enthusiastic about showcasing our homeland and are particularly adept at steering clear of crowded tour groups. We offer daily transfer from Phnom Penh to other cities such as Kampot/Kep, Battambang, Mondulkiri, Sihanoukville, Kratie and Siem Reap (where you can explore attractions like spider, snakes, and Sambor Prei Kuk temples).",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d27232019-Reviews-Cambodia_Booking_Taxi-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'St. 51, Phnom Penh, Cambodia 12302', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12302', 'address_string': 'St. 51, Phnom Penh, Cambodia 1