Cambodia Expeditions,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-76dac8054c8947229720c47bccb9b0fa,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Cambodia Expeditions, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60279, 'lng': 104.18822}","[{'lat': 10.60292, 'lng': 104.18821}]",18633,"[{'id': '700-7200-0274', 'name': 'Rental and Leasing', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4024335'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85586962170'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://cambodia-expeditions.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 09:00 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT08H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kampot,10.602839,104.18822,4024335,Cambodia Expeditions,"We specialise in dirt bike adventures through the heart of Cambodia. In it from the very beginning, we have pioneered and championed the Cambodian motorcycle tour industry since 1998, which today is made up of over 29 motorcycle tour companies . If you want to experience the best riding, witness the authentic Cambodian rural way of life, eat the best food and stay in the best accommodation, then make sure you ride with us.. Our mission is to keep you moving, and let your experience here move you.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g608455-d4024335-Reviews-Cambodia_Expeditions-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Temple Street', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07416', 'address_string': 'Temple Street, Kampot 07416 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,red@cambodia-expeditions.com,+855 86 962 170,http://camb