Cambodia Landmine Museum,here:pds:place:116aabd1-ae146207c3f70da2b024f9480522efc3,en,museum,"{'label': 'Cambodia Landmine Museum, ផ្លូវជាតិ 67, 170901 បន្ទាយស្រី, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'បន្ទាយស្រី', 'district': 'ខ្នារសណ្ដាយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 67', 'postalCode': '170901'}","{'lat': 13.53959, 'lng': 103.94553}","[{'lat': 13.53964, 'lng': 103.94541}]",6819,"[{'id': '300-3100-0000', 'name': 'Museum', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '541872'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512971198'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.cambodialandminemuseum.org'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT09H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.539474,103.94584,541872,Cambodia Landmine Museum,"The Landmine Museum was founded by ex-child soldier Aki Ra as a way to tell the world about the horrors landmines had inflicted on his native Cambodia. He used the proceeds to clear landmines wherever he could find them. In the process of clearing small, remote villages, he began bringing home wounded and orphaned children. These children lived at the museum for over 10 years. Aki Ra also started Cambodian Self-Help Deming, an NGO that clears landmines. Today, Cambodian Self-Help Demining has cleared 9,361,685 square meters of land and 255 minefields. Please join us at the Cambodia Landmine Museum to learn about the history of landmines and what is being done now in Cambodia to clear them.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d541872-Reviews-Cambodia_Landmine_Museum-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '67', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': '67, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Provinc