Cambodia Motorbike Tours,here:pds:place:116w649g-50e6319e24d1c1dbe76b784530366c3e,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Cambodia Motorbike Tours, ផ្លូវ ឧកញ៉ា កេត, 120203 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ឧកញ៉ា កេត', 'postalCode': '120203'}","{'lat': 11.56506, 'lng': 104.92392}","[{'lat': 11.5652, 'lng': 104.92388}]",6527,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13416388'}]",[{'www': [{'value': 'http://www.cammotorbiketours.com'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.565084,104.9239,13416388,Cambodia Motorbike Tours,"Welcome to Cambodia Motorbike Tours. Foundered 2009 by motorcycling philanthropist Jason Thatcher Ranked Top 3 ultimate dirt biking adventures. Quality Fully Supported Tours for riders seeking the ultimate adventure. featured on a number of TV series. Beyond The Map &* Blokeworld TV CMT is partnered with Global Village Housing, gifting over 490 homes to aid the poorest of the poor and renovated 2 schools. Ride the lost trails to Angkor & beyond. Deep in history rich in culture ride jungle trails through the WildWest of Asia. along with excellent overnight stays in the most incredible locations. with the largest quality fleet of bikes in Cambodia. our main fleet being 250-450 Yamaha WR. Proven as the best all-around workhorse for riding Cambodia. Expert local knowledge with High western standards & Qualified medic. support truck & sweep riders/mechanics Join us and like-minded riders for an adventure like no other. check out our latest videos on our homepage and 2023 tour dates",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d13416388-Reviews-Cambodia_Motorbike_Tours-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,cambodiamotorbiketours@gmail.com,+61 468 421 353,http://www.cammotorbiketours.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d13416388-Cambodia_Motorbike_Tours-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#99 of 283 Tours in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '283', 'ranking': '99'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,15,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '15'}",Not available,104,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d13416388-m66827-Reviews-Cambodia_Motorbike_Tours-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2359'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Tuesday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Wednesday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Thursday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Friday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Saturday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Sunday: 00:00 - 23:59']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Motorcycle Tours', 'localized_name': 'Motorcyc