Cambodia Peace Gallery (Cambodia Peace Museum),here:pds:place:116w636h-e9265f5c8df747e3a75e1966a41977db,en,museum,"{'label': 'Cambodia Peace Gallery (Cambodia Peace Museum), ផ្លូវ 155, 021408 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'វត្តគរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 155', 'postalCode': '021408'}","{'lat': 13.04064, 'lng': 103.18886}","[{'lat': 13.04051, 'lng': 103.18891}]",103403,"[{'id': '300-3100-0000', 'name': 'Museum', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3100-0028', 'name': 'History Museum'}, {'id': '800-8200-0000', 'name': 'Education Facility'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15639879'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512764097'}, {'value': '+85592455934', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3100-0000'}, {'id': '800-8200-0000'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.cambodiapeacegallery.org'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.040721,103.18884,15639879,Cambodia Peace Gallery (Cambodia Peace Museum),"The Cambodia Peace Gallery, opened in October 2018, is a new space for learning, sharing and reflecting on Cambodia's journey from war towards peace. Exhibits are focused on how Cambodians worked together to end the war, the recovery process, and working towards reconciliation for the future. Emphasis is given to positive stories of strength, resilience, and overcoming adversities.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d15639879-Reviews-Cambodia_Peace_Gallery_Cambodia_Peace_Museum-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 154, Ksach Poy Village, Wat Kor Commune', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'Street 154, Ksach Poy Village, Wat Kor Commune, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_