Cambodia Photo Tours by Michael Klinkhamer,here:pds:place:116aabd1-adf40c9420ff061d44418426ce48f42b,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Cambodia Photo Tours by Michael Klinkhamer, ផ្លូវ 1, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 1', 'postalCode': '120205'}","{'lat': 11.56933, 'lng': 104.93011}","[{'lat': 11.56937, 'lng': 104.93026}]",7196,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4759247'}]",[{'www': [{'value': 'http://cambodiaphototours.com'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.569402,104.930145,4759247,Cambodia Photo Tours by Michael Klinkhamer,"To make your photography travel tour plans in amazing Cambodia a reality and an unforgettable experience. Our well known private Phnom Penh Photo tours are open again from November 25th, 2024. Bookings are possible for 1/2 day, full days and evening photo walks. Phnom Penh night photo walks after sunset. Also: Longer custom tailored Cambodia 5-7 days or even 12 days of photography safari tours around Cambodia are open for bookings now.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d4759247-Reviews-Cambodia_Photo_Tours_by_Michael_Klinkhamer-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,klinkhamerphoto@gmail.com,+31 6 16662813,http://cambodiaphototours.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d4759247-Cambodia_Photo_Tours_by_Michael_Klinkhamer-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'rank