Cambodia Traditional Wooden House,here:pds:place:116w63gg-d5b7c475671c4443b9339068d3f068d8,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Cambodia Traditional Wooden House, ផ្លូវជាតិ 63, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 63', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.33576, 'lng': 103.85082}","[{'lat': 13.33579, 'lng': 103.85096}]",26702,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12424526'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517650808'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.33577,103.85087,12424526,Cambodia Traditional Wooden House,"A beautiful traditional wooden house in a small village close to Siem Reap. Only 10 minutes by tuktuk to the city centre. The house is 65 years old and very traditional. You will experience the real Cambodian culture. You sleep in the main room of the house, just like traditional Khmer. You get the real Cambodian experience!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12424526-Reviews-Cambodia_Traditional_Wooden_House-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street2': 'Korkranh village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17000', 'address_string': 'Korkranh village, Siem Reap 17000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12424526-Cambodia_Traditional_Wooden_House-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12424526-m66827-Reviews-Cambodia_Traditional_Wooden_House-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.h