Cambodia War Remnant Museum,here:pds:place:116w63u5-56d654e8034d4bfeaa732cf80c03edf5,en,museum,"{'label': 'Cambodia War Remnant Museum, 171205 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'នគរធំ', 'postalCode': '171205'}","{'lat': 13.38744, 'lng': 103.86816}","[{'lat': 13.38731, 'lng': 103.86814}]",21164,"[{'id': '300-3100-0028', 'name': 'History Museum', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3100-0000', 'name': 'Museum'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10158892'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855967757552'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://cambodiawarrem.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 09:00 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT08H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.387533,103.86817,10158892,Cambodia War Remnant Museum,"The War Remnant Museum is a center that provides education/training and support for dozens of at-risk people and landmine survivors. The War Remnant Museum was created so that it might serve as a place of healing for bodies, hearts and minds. We believe that love, support and education and teaching new skills will help secure a better opportunity in life.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d10158892-Reviews-Cambodia_War_Remnant_Museum-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '855 Phum Mondoul III, Sangkat Slorkram Siem Reap, Cambodia', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': '855 Phum Mondoul III, Sangkat Slorkram Siem Reap, Cambodia, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,dorksilong@gmail.com,+855 96 775 7552,http://cambodiawarrem.com/,https://www.tripad