Cambodian Private Tour Guide,here:pds:place:116aabd1-09e8615ec506096943cd9c415bbdddc0,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Cambodian Private Tour Guide, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35492, 'lng': 103.84855}","[{'lat': 13.35491, 'lng': 103.84841}]",88117,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}, {'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '24902668'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3701711'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512998498'}, {'value': '+85570751166', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://cambodia-private-tours.com', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}]}, {'value': 'http://www.angkortempleguides.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT14H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.354271,103.85258,3701711,Cambodian Private Tour Guide,"THE CAMBODIA PRIVATE TOUR GUIDE - DIFFERENCE: On behalf of the Cambodian Tourist Guide of the Kingdom of Cambodia, I wish to extend my warm welcome to all visitors and investors to the Kingdom of Cambodia. Cambodia is a land rich in vibrant culture and historical wonders, transcended only by the warm friendly smiles of Cambodians themselves.With 12 year's tourist guide working experiences and enthusiastic professional tourist guide, I am ready to make your Holiday enjoy and feel satisfied with tours and times in Cambodia. Wonder at magnificent Angkor Wat following my unrivaled crowd avoidance routes, Whether traveling solo, as a couple, family or group leisure top travel specialists to Cambodia all of my private journeys are bespoke with 100% of all profits donated to supporting my family's. I live and work and play here, and so offer you true firsthand experience and know-how to creatively craft unforgettable,bespoke itineraries. Let me show you the real Cambodia, ancient and modern.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d3701711-Reviews-Cambodian_Private_Tour_Guide-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sok San Street', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17253', 'address_string': 'Sok San Street, Siem Reap 17253 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,angkortrail@gmail.com,+855 12 998 498,http://www.angkortempleguides.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d3701711-Cambodian_Private_Tour_Guide-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#435 of 1,339 Tours in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1339', 'ranking': '435'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,54,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '2', '5': '52'}",Not available,92,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d3701711-m66827-Reviews-Cambodian_Private_Tour_Guide-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2100'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 07:00 - 21:00', 'Tuesday: 07