Cambodian Rural Discovery Tours,here:pds:place:116aabd1-9391f1995eaf066be8ee1dba480ab487,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Cambodian Rural Discovery Tours, 100603 ក្រចេះ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ក្រចេះ', 'city': 'ក្រចេះ', 'district': 'ក្រចេះ', 'postalCode': '100603'}","{'lat': 12.49077, 'lng': 106.0165}","[{'lat': 12.49079, 'lng': 106.0165}]",23096,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2392225'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85599834353'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://crdtours.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Fri: 07:30 - 12:00, 14:00 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T073000', 'duration': 'PT04H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR'}, {'start': 'T140000', 'duration': 'PT03H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR'}]}]",Kratie,12.490771,106.0165,2392225,Cambodian Rural Discovery Tours,"Cambodian Rural Discovery Tours (CRDTours) specialises in offering unique travel experiences in the provinces of Kratie and Stung Treng. All funds generated from our tours directly support local communities and environmental conservation. Whether its cycling alongside the iconic Mekong River, living with a local community assisting in conservation projects or savouring local delicacies, each activity booked is making a positive contribution to the places you visit and the locals you meet! Your active participation in rural development initiatives do not only support local communities and CRDTours, but allows for the ongoing support of CRDT Social Enterprises. By booking with us, you know that you are making a positive contribution to the places you visit and the people you meet. We have a number of standard tours and can develop bespoke experiences for groups booking in advance. Contact us for more information.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g729351-d2392225-Reviews-Cambodian_Rural_Discovery_Tours-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '3 Street', 'street2': 'Chreom Village', 'city': 'Kratie', 'state': 'Kratie Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '10109', 'address_string': '3 Street Chreom Village, Kratie 10109 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kratie', 'location_id': '729351'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kratie Province', 'location_id': '2366668'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@crdtours.com,+855 99 834 353,http://crdtours.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g729351-d2392225-Cambodian_Rural_Discovery_Tours-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '729351', 'ranking_string': '#5 of 20 things to do in Kratie', 'geo_location_name': 'Kratie', 'ranking_out_of': '20', 'ranking': '5'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,154,"{'1': '3', '2': '0', '3': '6', '4': '13', '5': '132'}",Not available,268,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g729351-d2392225-m66827-Reviews-Cambodian_Rural_Discovery_Tours-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1200'}}, {'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1400'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1200'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1400'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1200'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1400'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1200'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1400'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1200'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1400'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1700'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 07:30 - 12:00,  14:00 - 17:00', 'Tuesday: 07:30 - 12:00,  14:00 - 17:00', 'Wedne