Cambodian Sun,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-70be478b2a3ba38f0fa0a966fcc3abe5,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Cambodian Sun, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.59878, 'lng': 104.16115}","[{'lat': 10.59891, 'lng': 104.16113}]",21204,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27690769'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593749215'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.609783,104.1833,26088720,Cambodian SUN Guesthouse Kampot,"Family-run guesthouse with four comfortable superior double rooms in a quiet and safe location in Kampot, Kingdom of Cambodia. Only 4 minutes by TukTuk from the city centre. A warm welcome!

Our superior rooms feature a king-size bed, guaranteeing you a restful night&#39;s sleep. The room is equipped with a minibar (extra charge). The air conditioning ensures a pleasant room temperature even on hot days. Numerous other extras, such as a welcome cocktail and two bottles of water free of charge on arrival, as well as a family atmosphere will make your stay pleasant. You have your own bathroom with shower and hot water.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/VacationRentalReview-g608455-d26088720-Cambodian_SUN_Guesthouse_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Kampot Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d26088720-Cambodian_SUN_Guesthouse_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},0,https://www.tripadvisor.com/VacationRentalReview-g608455-d26088720-m66827-Cambodian_SUN_Guesthouse_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'vr', 'localized_name': 'vacation rentals'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,25,6
