Camory Backpackers Hostel,here:pds:place:116w649g-e452398d469e1807a1ec27ab6c35130e,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Camory Backpackers Hostel, ផ្លូវ 1, 120211 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'វត្តភ្នំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 1', 'postalCode': '120211'}","{'lat': 11.57294, 'lng': 104.92867}","[{'lat': 11.57302, 'lng': 104.92878}]",7060,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3965742'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593734443'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.572986,104.92874,3965742,Camory Backpackers Hostel,"Camory Backpackers Hostel is located at the heart of Phom Penh. Located next to Tonle Sap river, it will surely give you the breeze! As Camory is situated along the riverside, most attractions are minutes-away by walking. (Phnom Penh Night Market, Royal Palace, National Museum & the Central Market) Camory Backpackers Hostel is for the budget traveller who wants to experience Cambodia. Let us be part of your memory! As our name means, ""Cambodian Memory"".",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d3965742-Reviews-Camory_Backpackers_Hostel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#167 Sisowath Quay, Sangkat Phsar Kandla 1 Khun Doun Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '85523', 'address_string': '#167 Sisowath Quay, Sangkat Phsar Kandla 1 Khun Doun Penh, Phnom Penh 85523 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d3965742-Camory_Backpackers_Hostel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#24 of 351 Specialty lodging in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '351', 'ranking': '24'}",4.5,https://w