country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Kampot Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d16673776-Candy_Pepper-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},0,https://www.tripadvisor.com/VacationRentalReview-g608455-d16673776-m66827-Candy_Pepper-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'vr', 'localized_name': 'vacation rentals'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,38,6
Capital Battambang Hotel,here:pds:place:116w636s-5b01606c0cce46e7a7b8f679f7aed755,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Capital Battambang Hotel, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10588, 'lng': 103.19691}","[{'lat': 13.10585, 'lng': 103.19678}]",12733,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10721288'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85553953041'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/capitalbattambanghotel/home'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.105872,103.196884,10721288,Capital Battambang Hotel,"If you’re looking for a budget friendly small hotel in Battambang, look no further than Capital Battambang Hotel.
Nearby landmarks such as White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (0.4 mi) and Prasat Sneung (1.1 mi) make Capital Battambang Hotel a great place to stay when visiting Battambang.
Rooms at Capital Battambang Hotel provide air conditioning, and guests can stay connected with free wifi.
In addition, while staying at Capital Battambang Hotel guests have access to a 24 hour front desk and room service. Need a place to park? Free parking is available at Capital Battambang Hotel.
Travelers looking to enjoy some burritos can head to Kinyei Cafe, Green Mango Cafe and Bakery, or Ambrosia Cafe. Otherwise, you may want to check out a barbeque restaurant such as Battambang BBQ & Buffet.
If you are interested in exploring Battambang, check out one of the art galleries, such as HUMAN Gallery - Joseba Etxebarria Photography, ROMCHEIK 5 Art Space, and La Fabrik.
The staff at Capital Battambang Hotel looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
