Capitol 3 Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w649g-16fbed6fa79c447bbab24f8a983aea57,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Capitol 3 Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 111 6, 120308 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ប្រាំពីរ មករា', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងព្រលឹត', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 111', 'postalCode': '120308', 'houseNumber': '6'}","{'lat': 11.56129, 'lng': 104.91823}","[{'lat': 11.56129, 'lng': 104.9181}]",5945,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3535523'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8132276'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512696376'}, {'value': '+85523211027'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.55899,104.91814,3535523,Capitol 3 Guesthouse,"Finding an ideal budget friendly guest house in Phnom Penh does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Capitol 3 Guesthouse, a nice option for travelers like you.
The rooms offer air conditioning, and getting online is possible, as internet access is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
Capitol 3 Guesthouse features a 24 hour front desk, 24 hour check-in, and 24 hour security. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
While staying at Capitol 3 Guesthouse, visitors can check out Wat Langka (0.7 mi) and Champey Academy of Arts (0.7 mi), some of Phnom Penh's top attractions.
When you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out Brooklyn Pizza & Bistro, Sikgaek Korea Restaurant, and Sovanna, which are some barbeque restaurants that are popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum (0.7 mi), Royal Palace (0.9 mi), and Central Market (0.9 mi), some attractions that are a short walk from Capitol 3 Guesthouse.
Capitol 3 Guesthouse puts the best of Phnom Penh at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
