Capitol Tours Bus Company,here:pds:place:11605c61-dbf2bfef8f17b00fb314ccf7e650526c,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Capitol Tours Bus Company, ផ្លូវ 182 14, 120302 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ប្រាំពីរ មករា', 'subdistrict': 'អូរឫស្សីទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 182', 'postalCode': '120302', 'houseNumber': '14'}","{'lat': 11.56272, 'lng': 104.9147}","[{'lat': 11.5626, 'lng': 104.9147}]",5545,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9874672'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523217627'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://capitolkh.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.562183,104.918304,456202,Capitol Guesthouse,"See why so many travelers make Capitol Guesthouse their hotel of choice when visiting Phnom Penh. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a budget friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Rooms at Capitol Guesthouse Hotel provide air conditioning, and guests can stay connected with free wifi.
In addition, while staying at Capitol Guesthouse Hotel guests have access to a 24 hour front desk and baggage storage. You can also enjoy an on-site restaurant.
Close to some of Phnom Penh's most popular landmarks, such as Champey Academy of Arts (0.6 mi) and Wat Ounalom (0.9 mi), Capitol Guesthouse Hotel is a great destination for tourists.
Phnom Penh has plenty of Italian restaurants. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Brooklyn Pizza & Bistro, Piccola Italia Da Luigi, and Oskar Bistro, which are serving up some great dishes.
During your visit, be sure to check out popular attractions like Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum (0.9 mi), Royal Palace (0.8 mi), and Central Market (1.1 mi), which are all within walking distance of the hotel.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Capitol Guesthouse as you experience all of the things Phnom Penh has to offer.
