Cardamom Mountain Resort,here:pds:place:116w613c-165e13e93f84426e9329a1eee1619183,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Cardamom Mountain Resort, 090403 មណ្ឌលសីមា, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កោះកុង', 'city': 'មណ្ឌលសីមា', 'district': 'ទទួលគគីរ', 'postalCode': '090403'}","{'lat': 11.59171, 'lng': 103.06569}","[{'lat': 11.59176, 'lng': 103.06557}]",32254,"[{'id': '500-5100-0056', 'name': 'Campground', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2618103'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592786047'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.cardamommountainresort.com'}]}]",Not Available,Koh Kong,11.591433,103.0663,2618103,Cardamom Mountain Resort,"Our resort is located directly at the boundary of Cardamom Mountain National Park and the jungle and kayak tours start directly from there without transfers. Our activities are mainly jungle trips for one or more days with hamac camp in the jungle, kayak trips in the mangrove national park and bicycle rides all over. The German owner is also chef and provides food according to guests demands, such as sea food or international and german cuisine. High quality matresse are used to suite you and the bangalows are big enough to feel warmly welcome. It is only a 5 minutes walk to refreshing pool on small waterfalls.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1532269-d2618103-Reviews-Cardamom_Mountain_Resort-Koh_Kong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Cardamom Mountains National Park, Smach Mean Chey', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Koh Kong', 'state': 'Koh Kong Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '09000', 'address_string': 'Cardamom Mountains National Park, Smach Mean Chey, Koh Kong 09000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Koh Kong', 'location_id': '1532269'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Koh Kong Province', 'location_id': '2366667'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not availabl