Casa Kep,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-1ee564fd70014c889aaad2d63bf72931,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Casa Kep, ផ្លូវ 33 អេ, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 33 អេ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.4837, 'lng': 104.29381}","[{'lat': 10.48366, 'lng': 104.29368}]",7732,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7690482'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855976194007'}]}],Not Available,Kep,10.48378,104.29485,7690482,Casa Kep Garden Cafe And Guesthouse,"Welcome to Casa Kep, an eco-friendly Garden Cafe and B&B. Our little place is located at the foothills of Kep National Park, a shady place for a gentle hike with lots of opportunities for wildlife spotting. The white sand beach is just a five-minute walk away, and the crab market is a ten-minute stroll.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d7690482-Reviews-Casa_Kep_Garden_Cafe_And_Guesthouse-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Highway 33A', 'street2': 'Near The Beach', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '220202', 'address_string': 'Highway 33A Near The Beach, Kep 220202 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d7690482-Casa_Kep_Garden_Cafe_And_Guesthouse-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_string': '#9 of 71 B&Bs / Inns in Kep', 'geo_location_name': 'Kep', 'ranking_out_of': '71', 'ranking': '9'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,63,"{'1': '0', '2': '2', '3': '0', '4': '8', '5': '