Casa Meridian Residence,here:pds:place:116w649e-59aeb02b953d4e829c9085761319c45e,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Casa Meridian Residence, ផ្លូវ ហាវើដ, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ហាវើដ', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.54717, 'lng': 104.93847}","[{'lat': 11.54709, 'lng': 104.93836}]",22023,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13394381'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523972888'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.somerset.com/cambodia/phnom-penh/casa-meridian-residence/index.html'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.54712,104.93839,13394381,CASA Meridian Residence,"Ideally situated in the up-and-coming residential and retail hub of Diamond Island (Koh Pich), CASA Meridian Residence offers 75 fully-furnished residences on the upper floors of the integrated CASA by Meridian development. With a high-end shopping mall, premium office spaces and wellness facilities at its doorstep, and with the AEON Shopping Mall, international schools, conference and exhibition centres and embassies within minutes' drive, the serviced residence offers unparalleled conveniences to travellers and expatriates who value a balanced lifestyle in the heart of capital Phnom Penh. Residents can choose from a wide range of apartments, from cleverly designed Studio apartments ideal for single executives travelling for business, to sleek and modern One-, Two- or Three-Bedroom apartments that can comfortably accommodate parties of up to six travellers. Every apartment is contemporarily furnished and features well-defined living and dining areas, fully-equipped kitchenettes and m",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d13394381-Reviews-CASA_Meridian_Residence-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 1 Harvard Street', 'street2': 'Diamond Island, Tonle Bass