Cast Away Bungalows,here:pds:place:116w3ckn-60bb16d995494418aa5047a7edf0b2ea,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Cast Away Bungalows, 180405 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'កោះរុង', 'postalCode': '180405'}","{'lat': 10.57545, 'lng': 103.31262}","[{'lat': 10.57557, 'lng': 103.3127}]",112770,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8760614'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855967922148'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.575361,103.31255,8760614,Cast Away Bungalows,"Cast Away is a home away from home for travellers worldwide. Set on the incredible Saracen Bay, Cast Away is the perfect place to relax in beach hammocks, meet new people, enjoy live music and eat delicious food. Play beach frisbee and snorkel by day; swim with the bioluminescent plankton by night — it doesn't get much better than this. Backpackers and solo travellers are very welcome.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g2054864-d8760614-Reviews-Cast_Away_Bungalows-Koh_Rong_Sanloem_Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Saracen Bay', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Saracen Bay, Sihanoukville, Koh Rong Sanloem 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Koh Rong Sanloem', 'location_id': '2054864'}, {'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g2054864-d8760614-Cast_Away_Bungalows-Koh_Rong_Sanloem_Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_