Castle Bayview Resort & Spa,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-3cbd064fb0e1a113edadd19ee6b0dc63,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Castle Bayview Resort & Spa, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.62347, 'lng': 104.16531}","[{'lat': 10.62342, 'lng': 104.16518}]",25483,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25083711'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85585626622'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.castlebayview.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.623466,104.16532,25083711,Castle Bayview Resort & Spa,"Welcome to our resort in Kampot. You will find our resort in Kampot province in south-eastern Cambodia. The property sits on the western bank of the Tuek Chhu river just two kilometres from Kampot town. Boasting a range of accommodation from private pool villas to suites with river views. We are known for the privacy and luxury offered by our private villas and offer high end service and amenities. We are the perfect choice if you are looking or a resort in Kampot. Our Accommodation We offer high end private pool villas and bungalows to discerning domestic and international visitors to Kampot province. As well as our flagship villas we also have a range of spacious rooms and suites available in our hotel building, all offering stunning views over the resort and Kampot river from their balconies.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d25083711-Reviews-Castle_Bayview_Resort_Spa-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Tuek Chhu Road', 'street2': 'Autouch Village', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '70804', 'address_string': 'Tuek Chhu Road Autouch Village, Kampot 70804 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {