Central Pod Capsule Hostel,here:pds:place:116w63gg-2dd6b793090b475abc078d85f3ecdf6d,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Central Pod Capsule Hostel, ផ្លូវជាតិ 63, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 63', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35604, 'lng': 103.85369}","[{'lat': 13.35602, 'lng': 103.85383}]",24781,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17531221'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26226171'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85595840959'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.356043,103.85369,26226171,Central Pod Capsule Hostel,"Located in Siem Reap, a 8-minute walk from King's Road Angkor, Central Pod Capsule Hostel provides rooms with air conditioning. The property is around 6.1 km from Angkor Wat, 1.9 km from Angkor National Museum and 3.1 km from Wat Thmei. The property has a 24-hour front desk, airport transportation, an ATM and free WiFi throughout the property. Popular points of interest near the capsule hotel include Artisans D'Angkor, Preah Ang Chek Preah Ang Chom and Royal Residence. The nearest airport is Siem Reap International Airport, 8 km from Central Pod Capsule Hostel. This is our guests' favorite part of Siem Reap, according to independent reviews.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d26226171-Reviews-Central_Pod_Capsule_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '172A Sivutha Boulevard', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': '172A Sivutha Boulevard, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cam