Chacha Japan,here:pds:place:116w63gg-028d0d4bf91b4997af25d0f7495f49e4,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Chacha Japan, ផ្លូវជាតិ 63, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 63', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35349, 'lng': 103.85365}","[{'lat': 13.35351, 'lng': 103.85351}]",88560,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]","[{'id': '203-000', 'name': 'Japanese', 'primary': True}, {'id': '800-064', 'name': 'International'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12350874'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517530823'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/chacha.japan'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:30 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T083000', 'duration': 'PT12H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.353459,103.85397,12350874,Chacha Japan,"At chacha angkor, we provide original matcha tea from Japan and fruit cuisine with very fresh and delightful Cambodian fruits. Everything we serve at chacha angkor is carefully selected by ourselves. We take pride in serving delightful original matcha and fruit cuisine made with very fresh and safe ingredients in a hygienic kitchen. We assure you that our delightful fruit cuisine will refresh you from the heat! We always do our best to make every customer smile.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d12350874-Reviews-Chacha_Japan-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Ta Prum hotel, St.10 Pokambor,Mondul1, Svay Dangkum', 'street2': 'Behinde National Bank and Ta Prum hotel', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Ta Prum hotel, St.10 Pokambor,Mondul1, Svay Dangkum Behinde National Bank and Ta Prum hotel, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {