Chameleon Bistro & Cocktail Bar,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-3f5f353f3ce44297aeae2c899bfaa168,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Chameleon Bistro & Cocktail Bar, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.607, 'lng': 104.181}","[{'lat': 10.60687, 'lng': 104.18104}]",19546,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-000', 'name': 'European'}, {'id': '370-000', 'name': 'East European'}, {'id': '376-000', 'name': 'Polish'}, {'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15335929'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855962941560'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://chameleon-bistro-coctail-bar.business.site'}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:30 - 21:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T083000', 'duration': 'PT13H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kampot,10.606941,104.181015,15335929,Chameleon Bistro & Cocktail Bar,"The cozy ""CHAMELEON Cocktail Bar & Bistro"" offers refreshing drinks from natural fruit and alcohol cocktails on the basis of a 12-bottle bar. Our vegetarian eclectic cuisine which consists of nutritious breakfasts, surprising dishes of the day for lunch and full-day snacks and appetizers with sophisticated tastes, serves the dishes on the Polish regional, handmade porcelain faience. Great local coffee from the espresso machine may change your day into another adventure. A rich selection of teas can be another reason to drop into the ""CHAMELEON Cocktail Bar & Bistro. Every morning we have fresh bread and cakes form a local Belgian bakery, and our own pastry - we never know what will inspire our cook... All products are brought daily from the local market. We are close to the centre, however, there is a bit quieter here. Come, listen to the music of your choice or confine in ours. Carpe Diem with us!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d15335929-Reviews-Chameleon_Bistro_Cocktail_Bar-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '51 Phoum 1 Ouksophear, Kipling Ln', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': '51 Phoum 1 Ouksophear, Kipling Ln, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,chameleon.bistro@gmail.com,+855 96 294 1560,http://chameleon-bistro-coctail-bar.business.site,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d15335929-Chameleon_Bistro_Cocktail_Bar-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#69 of 174 Places to Eat in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '174', 'ranking': '69'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,8,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '8'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",8,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d15335929-m66827-Reviews-Chameleon_Bistro_Cocktail_Bar-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html#photos,$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2130'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'tim