Champey Restaurant,here:pds:place:116aabd1-e384a041c3040b573daedfc426f896c5,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Champey Restaurant, ផ្លូវ 2 ធ្នូ, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 2 ធ្នូ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35451, 'lng': 103.85519}","[{'lat': 13.35457, 'lng': 103.85531}]",24801,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577566455'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.353878,103.86565,4763222,Champey Villa,"Samros Khmer Villa has 24 large, clean and bright rooms. All rooms come with outdoor swimming pool, free Wi-Fi, hot water, air-conditioning, fridge, cable TV, and more.We're located just a short tuk-tuk ride away from the center of Siem Reap in a very quiet and safe part of the town. We have both single and double rooms available and we have either the standard option or superior option to suit our customers needs. Free bicycle one day per stay.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d4763222-Reviews-Champey_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#166, Street#22 Wat Bo, Sala Kamreouk', 'street2': '(Near Wat Bo primary school)', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': 'kh', 'address_string': '#166, Street#22 Wat Bo, Sala Kamreouk (Near Wat Bo primary school), Siem Reap kh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d4763222-Champey_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297