Channa's Angkor Homestay,here:pds:place:116w63u5-76ffc4b2e0e84ec1b177cb14ba2f1576,en,guest_house,"{'label': ""Channa's Angkor Homestay, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.39, 'lng': 103.8567}","[{'lat': 13.3899, 'lng': 103.85661}]",21862,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2638704'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516757356'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.angkor.dk'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.390031,103.85674,2638704,Channa's Angkor Homestay,"Come and stay with us in our Angkor home and get to know the family. We live inside the Angkor Archaeological Park in lush, pristine surroundings, within walking distance to Angkor Wat and only a ten minutes drive from downtown Siem Reap. We're offering homestay accommodation for visitors to the temples of Angkor and to anyone else who is coming to our hometown whether for business, leisure or to volunteer at one of the numerous humanitarian organizations (NGOs) in the area. Families with smaller children are welcome. Artists and scientists who come here for work will find us very responsive to their needs too. We have a large guest room 4x6m with shared bathroom close by and offer delicious Cambodian/western home cooking at competitive prices. We also have a studio/basic backpacker accommodation for rent.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d2638704-Reviews-Channa_s_Angkor_Homestay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Angkor Archaeological Park', 'street2': 'Trapeang Ses', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Angkor Archaeological Park Trapeang Ses, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province',