Charlie+ Barber Shop,here:pds:place:116w63gg-932d3a2fa1a742bc81767c43b7e2dcd4,en,barber,"{'label': 'Charlie+ Barber Shop, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35728, 'lng': 103.85941}","[{'lat': 13.35715, 'lng': 103.85938}]",89299,"[{'id': '600-6950-0399', 'name': 'Barber', 'primary': True}, {'id': '600-6950-0401', 'name': 'Hair Salon'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855979448000'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.357411,103.85596,8467727,Shop676,"Each unique piece designed and carried by shop676 is brought to life from hours of care, workmanship and a direct collaboration between shop676 and an artisan or craftsman. We therefore support direct trade and aim to pay the craftsman directly and better than if they worked within a fair trade or other organisation by eliminating the waste. Our soft, light natural fiber wears and accessories are",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d8467727-Reviews-Shop676-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '676 Hup Guan Street', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '676 Hup Guan Street, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,shopsixsevensix@gmail.com,+855 31 331 4666,https://www.facebook.com/shop676,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d8467727-Shop676-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#4 of 138 Shopping in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '138', 'ranking': '4'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,198,"{'1': '3', '2': '1', '3': '1', '4'