Cheata Residence,here:pds:place:116w63gu-247bc94e6657487bb5e1b5ef40f2a564,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Cheata Residence, 171206 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ជ្រាវ', 'postalCode': '171206'}","{'lat': 13.34826, 'lng': 103.89746}","[{'lat': 13.34813, 'lng': 103.89745}]",22655,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15522346'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510756898'}, {'value': '+85561416046'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.cheataresidence.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.348241,103.89746,15522346,Cheata Residence,"Cheata Residence is located at Khnar Chass, Chriv Village, Siem Reap, Cambodia. LOCATION: located in the Eastern of downtown Siem Reap; One (1) block from Borei Seang Nam, Chong Keo Sou Bus station. AIRPORT TRANSFERS: Hotel has scheduled door to door pick up service transfers to / from International Airport. Airport is located 13 Km away, 32 Minutes by car / bus. ROOMS: 18 rooms in total, which includes 4 Superior Double with Pool View, 4 Deluxe Twin/Double with Pool View, 8 Suite King with Pool View and 2 Family Suites. Accommodations are with amazing views of the pool. Our premium location is: - 3.5 km from Pub Street - 3.5 km from Old Market - 3 km from King Road - 7 km from Angkor Night Market - 1.5 km from Borey Seang Nam bus station - 30 minutes drives from Siem Reap International Airport - 20 minutes drives to Angkor Wat.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d15522346-Reviews-Cheata_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Khnar Chas Rd', 'street2': 'Khna Village, Chhreav Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17256', 'address_string': 'Khnar Chas Rd Khna Village, Chhreav Commune, Siem Reap 17256 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem