Check Sound Family Karaoke,here:pds:place:116w64up-34e2f95243e84401b96e29d60c876784,en,theatre_music_culture,"{'label': 'Check Sound Family Karaoke, 030404 កំពង់ចាម, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'city': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'district': 'វាលវង់', 'postalCode': '030404'}","{'lat': 11.9816, 'lng': 105.45766}","[{'lat': 11.98151, 'lng': 105.45776}]",25389,"[{'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-2000-0014', 'name': 'Karaoke'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+855962222346'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebok.com/checksound'}]}]",Not Available,Kampong Cham,11.989449,105.46705,11983346,Lbn Asian Hotel,"LBN Asian Hotel is a well-established hospitality establishment known for its exemplary services and dedication to providing a comfortable stay for its guests. Located in a prime location in Kampong Cham, the hotel offers a range of amenities designed to cater to the needs of both business and leisure travellers. One of the notable features of LBN Asian Hotel is its location along of Mekong River, some rooms face to Mekong River and Kizuna Bridge and also each room is meticulously furnished and equipped with modern amenities such as comfortable bedding, Wi-Fi connectivity, and a well-appointed bathroom. The hotel also offers various room categories to suit the preferences and budgets of different guests. The hotel's dining options are also worth highlighting. LBN Asian Hotel boasts a restaurant that serves a delectable of Asian and international cuisines including buffet and ala cart breakfast, lunch and dinner.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g659642-d11983346-Reviews-Lbn_Asian_Hotel-Kampong_Cham_Kampong_Cham_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#11, St. Preah Sihanouk Blvd', 'city': 'Kampong Cham', 'state': 'Kampong Cham Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '#11, St. Preah Sihanouk Blvd, Kampong Cham Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampong