Check-in Cafe and Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w63gg-9417d409e2dc452a8fcf9f1ce20b21e1,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Check-in Cafe and Restaurant, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35186, 'lng': 103.86229}","[{'lat': 13.35172, 'lng': 103.86224}]",24530,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516918817'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.349236,103.85697,11549140,SPOONS Cafe and Restaurant,"Spoons Café and Restaurant is the Social Enterprise, we serve as a training facility and multipurpose space for SPOONS Cambodia Organization (former known as EGBOK) students to gain hands-on experience while providing guests with authentic Cambodian cuisine and hospitality. *All profit from the Café & Restaurant goes entirely towards our hospitality programs in order to help us supporting disadvantaged young adults in Cambodia. **Reservations through phone and email only** Thank you very much for your interest and support our local community. We hope to see you! :))",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d11549140-Reviews-SPOONS_Cafe_and_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '0142, Group 5, Pave Road', 'street2': 'Wat Damnak Village, Salakomreouk Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': '0142, Group 5, Pave Road Wat Damnak Village, Salakomreouk Commune, Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,reservations@spoonscambodia.org,+855 76 277 6667,http://spoonscambodia.org,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d11549