Checkpoint Kampot,here:pds:place:116w3fhd-94ddbd188eba46a19889cad341879cde,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Checkpoint Kampot, 070203 ទឹកឈូរ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'ទឹកឈូរ', 'district': 'កំពង់ក្រែង', 'postalCode': '070203'}","{'lat': 10.64818, 'lng': 104.17239}","[{'lat': 10.64831, 'lng': 104.17245}]",22808,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12120958'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855963134233'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.checkpointkampot.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.648092,104.17234,12120958,Checkpoint Kampot,"Offering a sun terrace and views of the river, checkpoint-kampot is situated in Kampot in the Kampot Province Region, 11 km from Phnom Chisor. Guests can enjoy the on-site restaurant. Free WiFi is provided throughout the property and free private parking is available on site. A terrace or patio are featured in certain rooms. Rooms come with a private bathroom equipped with a shower. You will find room service at the property. An array of activities are offered in the area, such as fishing, canoeing and hiking. This property also has one of the best-rated locations in Kampot! Guests are happier about it compared to other properties in the area. This property is also rated for the best value in Kampot! Guests are getting more for their money when compared to other properties in this city. We speak your language!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d12120958-Reviews-Checkpoint_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Kampong Kreng tekchhuo', 'street2': 'Mak Prang Village', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Kampong Kreng tekchhuo Mak Prang Village, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}