Cheers Cambodia Resort,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-5bd2394948f740659f72af2ebe8f21ea,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Cheers Cambodia Resort, ផ្លូវ កម្មករ, 180403 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ កម្មករ', 'postalCode': '180403'}","{'lat': 10.63034, 'lng': 103.51689}","[{'lat': 10.63023, 'lng': 103.51683}]",102506,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '300-000', 'name': 'European', 'primary': True}, {'id': '101-000', 'name': 'American'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7282442'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855975694813'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.630822,103.51712,7282442,Cheers Cambodia Resort,"Our food is simple, using imported quality products, prepared & cooked by professionals in the cleanest kitchen (anyone is welcome to see before ordering) everything to European standards. All staff trained by an English Chef with 34 years experience. We have a wide choice of drinks, the best food in town & freshly made coffee from our automatic Italian coffee machine which makes each cup freshly",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g325573-d7282442-Reviews-Cheers_Cambodia_Resort-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 129 Street Borey Kamakor, Sangkat 3,, Central - Downtown', 'street2': 'Cheers Cambodia Resort', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': '# 129 Street Borey Kamakor, Sangkat 3,, Central - Downtown Cheers Cambodia Resort, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,contact@cheers-cambodia.com,+855 97 569 4813,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserRev