Chef Nak,here:pds:place:116w64dh-7d278610b154bdbc8e25ac8362ea0e5a,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Chef Nak, 080208 ខ្សាច់កណ្ដាល, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'ខ្សាច់កណ្ដាល', 'district': 'ព្រែកហ្លួង', 'postalCode': '080208'}","{'lat': 11.63758, 'lng': 104.9555}","[{'lat': 11.63745, 'lng': 104.95548}]",65284,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian'}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-066', 'name': 'Fusion'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12981408'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517528041'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.chefnak.com/about-us'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kandal,11.63803,104.955894,12981408,Chef Nak,"By the Mekong river, is my beautiful antique wooden house and vegetable garden where you can enjoy an unforgettable dining experience, explore delicious home-cooked food, learn about our community, hear stories of our local ingredients/dishes and watch a splendid live performance by our local artists. Our beautiful country is rich in arts and culture as exemplified by the glorious temples of Angkor. I greatly enjoy sharing my knowledge with people in many different ways, ranging from cookbooks, cooking classes, and online cooking shows to home dining. Now you have the opportunity to enjoy the ultimate dining experience and to discover the secrets of Cambodian cuisine. You will be surprised to know that our tasty and healthy food is much more than just a combination of ingredients served on plates, bowls, or banana leaves. I serve only one group each time– in groups of 2 to 40 people.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d12981408-Reviews-Chef_Nak-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '080208', 'address_string': 'Phnom Penh 080208 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@chefnak.com,+855 17 528 041,https://www.chefnak.com/about-us,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d12981408-Chef_Nak-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#168 of 1,983 Places to Eat in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '1983', 'ranking': '168'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,27,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '27'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",103,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d12981408-m66827-Reviews-Chef_Nak-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$$$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2359'}