Cheysokha Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w63gg-469633186d4f418fbf14f1831f99c81b,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Cheysokha Guesthouse, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.35915, 'lng': 103.88476}","[{'lat': 13.35915, 'lng': 103.88475}]",22404,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3210808'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517777049'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.359146,103.884766,3210808,Cheysokha Guesthouse,"If you’re looking for a budget friendly small hotel in Siem Reap, look no further than Cheysokha Guesthouse.
Close to some of Siem Reap's most popular landmarks, such as Viti's Tuk Tuk Driver (1.7 mi) and Wat Preah Prom Rath (1.9 mi), Cheysokha Guesthouse is a great destination for tourists.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as a refrigerator and air conditioning, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the small hotel.
Cheysokha Guesthouse features a concierge, to help make your stay more enjoyable.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the French restaurants, including Georges French Restaurant Siem Reap, Olive Cuisine de Saison, and Mango Cuisine, all of which are a short distance from Cheysokha Guesthouse.
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular government buildings such as Royal Residence.
The staff at Cheysokha Guesthouse looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
