Chi Cha Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-7cb72cdbb4e70250467df6d711fd85e3,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Chi Cha Hotel, ផ្លូវ ព្រះអង្គ ឌួង, 120211 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'វត្តភ្នំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ព្រះអង្គ ឌួង', 'postalCode': '120211'}","{'lat': 11.57325, 'lng': 104.9277}","[{'lat': 11.5731, 'lng': 104.92772}]",72949,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '558018'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85581766996'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.573186,104.927704,558018,Chi Cha Hotel,"If you’re looking for a hotel in Phnom Penh, look no further than Chi Cha Hotel.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Sisowath Quay (0.2 mi) and Wat Ounalom (0.4 mi), guests of Chi Cha Hotel can easily experience some of Phnom Penh's most well known attractions.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as Chi Cha Hotel offers guests free wifi.
Plus, Chi Cha Hotel offers a lounge, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day.
If you’re looking for a steakhouse, consider a visit to Digby's Bar & Grill, Cloud9 Skybar, or Samba Brazilian Steakhouse, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Chi Cha Hotel.
During your visit, be sure to check out popular attractions like Royal Palace (0.7 mi) and Cambodia Post Office (0.2 mi), which are all within walking distance of the hotel.
The staff at Chi Cha Hotel looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
