Chi Restaurant & Bar,here:pds:place:116w63u4-3b47f4ee1b394187988447ee2f5bb669,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Chi Restaurant & Bar, អេអេច21, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'អេអេច21', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.37656, 'lng': 103.83382}","[{'lat': 13.37667, 'lng': 103.8339}]",87514,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-064', 'name': 'International'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12010910'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563966788'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://geckodigital.co/vt/anantaraangkor/?ss=scene_chirestaurant'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT16H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.376387,103.83371,12010910,Chi Restaurant & Bar,"Chic, timeless and à la mode, Chi redefines indigenous dining to forge an original culinary concept. Our unique presentation of modern Cambodian cuisine celebrates the country's heritage and intriguing cultural influences. Discover an authentic transformation of traditional local flavours - immersing in a richly emotive experience. 'Chi' derives its name from the Khmer word for 'herb' and indigenous herbs and spices are very much the hero here - flourishing in the resort's garden, plucked fresh each day and woven into a thoughtful menu that fuses local sensibility with contemporary artistry. Savour the freshness of cilantro, the zest of lemongrass and the exotic citrus aroma of kaffir limes. Pique your palate with the spicy depths of turmeric and star anise, the peppery taste of galangal and the milder ginger flavour of fingerroot. Relish dishes that perfectly fuse the nutty edge of taro, the intensity of sweet basil and the tart sweetness of tamarind.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d12010910-Reviews-Chi_Restaurant_Bar-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road no. 6, Khum Svay Dangkom', 'street2': 'Khum Svaydangkum', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'National Road no. 6, Khum Svay Dangkom Khum Svaydangkum, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,angkor@anantara.com,+855 63 966 788,https://geckodigital.co/vt/anantaraangkor/?ss=scene_chirestaurant,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12010910-Chi_Restaurant_Bar-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#32 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '32'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,244,"{'1': '1', '2': '2', '3': '5', '4': '15', '5': '221'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",313,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d12010910-m66827-Reviews-Chi_Restaurant_Bar-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'tim