Chita's Angkor Café,here:pds:place:116w63u5-3b6b8bc4f00740609511e9d3fe7259f9,en,casual_dining,"{'label': ""Chita's Angkor Café, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.36119, 'lng': 103.86105}","[{'lat': 13.36166, 'lng': 103.86116}]",23825,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512411373'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.chitas-cafe.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.36648,103.86004,1908787,Angkor National Museum,"Angkor National Museum - The Legend Revealed During the Golden Era of the Khmer Kingdom, one of the ancient civilizations of this world was being created. It was the origin of Khmer art, culture, and architecture. These great inventions became one of the few wonders of the world that still amaze people throughout generations that still hold a great impact in present Cambodia society. Angkor National Museum takes pride in revealing the royal historical path of this Golden Era of the Khmer Kingdom through state of the art multimedia technology to provide visitors a full pictorial story of the legend for easy comprehension. Angkor National Museum will take its visitors through the journey back in time from the creation to the highest point of Khmer civilization. Through the use of interactive exhibits, visitors will develop a deeper understanding of customs, traditions and different beliefs of the ancient empire.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d1908787-Reviews-Angkor_National_Museum-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No.968 Vithei Charles de Gaulle', 'street2': 'Khrum 6, Phoum Salakanseng', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'No.968 Vithei Charles de Gaulle Khrum 6, Phoum Salakanseng, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Muni