Chochi Garden Guest House,here:pds:place:116aabd1-8f38aa9db709087484bc15e09b821044,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Chochi Garden Guest House, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.60733, 'lng': 103.52166}","[{'lat': 10.60735, 'lng': 103.52152}]",105116,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '200-2000-0368', 'name': 'Cocktail Lounge'}]","[{'id': '304-000', 'name': 'Italian', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7802816'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855962747674'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d7802816-Reviews-Chochi_Garden_Guest_House-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '200-2000-0368'}]}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.607331,103.52162,7802816,Chochi Garden Guest House,"Chochi Garden Guest House is located just 1 minute walking from the beach in a large tropical garden. It has a 24 hour security service. The large welcoming bar and restaurant offer big breakfast, western and Italian food, a large selection of cocktail and some of the best Italian wine. Guest House Manager speak English, French, Spanish, Italian, Japanese and Khmer. For those who wish to stay longer we have AC fully furnished apartments on terrace with kitchenette, bedroom, small living room with sofa bed, bathroom, wifi and 24 hours security guard.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d7802816-Reviews-Chochi_Garden_Guest_House-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Serendipity Beach Road', 'street2': '1 minute from the Pier, next to Holiday Villa Hotel', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Serendipity Beach Road 1 minute from the Pier, next 