Choco L'Art Café,here:pds:place:116w636s-ec54a18811b0452987bd093524191359,en,restaurant,"{'label': ""Choco L'Art Café, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10031, 'lng': 103.19805}","[{'lat': 13.10044, 'lng': 103.19807}]",12472,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}, {'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510661617'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.099339,103.203705,7802351,Romcheik 5 Art Space & Cafe,"ROMCHEIK 5 is nominated in the TOP 10 BEST INDEPENDENT Art spaces in S.E. Asia and N° 1 in Cambodia (The Guardian / November 2017) ! Romcheik 5 is the name of the neighbourhood of Battambang where, in 2012, 4 young artists have established their studios with the help of a donor. In 2015, this space has been extended with the construction of a building sheltering an art gallery and since October 2018 a real Museum with a permanent collection of their best artworks. On rooftop you will find a nice Café with a large scale of foods and drinks .The entrance to the all site is charged 5$ (discount 2 $ 50), to contribute to the maintenance of the premises and the purchase of artist materials.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d7802351-Reviews-Romcheik_5_Art_Space_Cafe-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '201A', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': '201A, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,romcheik5@gmail.com,+855 92 304 210,https://www.facebook.com/countrysideart