Choranay Inn,here:pds:place:116w698e-a005eee5bd3242269dfa4707ea355588,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Choranay Inn, 240504 សំរោង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ឧត្តរមានជ័យ', 'city': 'សំរោង', 'district': 'សំរោង', 'postalCode': '240504'}","{'lat': 14.18185, 'lng': 103.51488}","[{'lat': 14.18185, 'lng': 103.51502}]",32437,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855318193333'}]}],Not Available,Oddar Meanchey,13.359018,103.85241,324851,Robam Inn,"Small family run hotel, opened since 1998. Now under new administration, but still in the same family. The hotel is located in the heart of the city. Green leaves and palms trees are awaiting for you at your arrival. Enjoy our spa or our very discreet swimming pool and yoga classes at one of our facility. Make yourself at home while visiting this mystical city that is Siem Reap. We will be more than happy to welcome you with open arms and answer all your questions. We speak french, english, cambodian and spanish !",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d324851-Reviews-Robam_Inn-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '497 Taphul St.', 'street2': 'Near Asia Plaza', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': '497 Taphul St. Near Asia Plaza, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d324851-Robam_Inn-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#190 of 763 hotels in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '