Classy Hotel & Spa,here:pds:place:116aabd1-5fcdb2a126270d959f6ea2832aea4182,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Classy Hotel & Spa, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09677, 'lng': 103.2003}","[{'lat': 13.09678, 'lng': 103.20016}]",12460,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6126819'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85553952555'}, {'value': '+855768686666'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.classyhotelspa.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.096766,103.20029,6126819,Classy Hotel & Spa,"Finding an ideal charming hotel in Battambang does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Classy Hotel & Spa, a nice option for travelers like you.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (0.3 mi) and Prasat Sneung (0.4 mi), guests of Classy Hotel & Spa can easily experience some of Battambang's most well known attractions.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as a flat screen TV, air conditioning, and a refrigerator, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the hotel.
Classy Hotel & Spa features a concierge, room service, and a rooftop terrace, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts a pool and free breakfast. If you are driving to Classy Hotel & Spa, free parking is available.
Battambang has plenty of cafes. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Choco L'Art Café, Hoc Cafe, and The Lonely Tree Cafe, which are serving up some great dishes.
If you are interested in exploring Battambang, check out one of the art museums, such as ROMCHEIK 5 Art Space and Tep Kao Sol Loeum Lorn Gallery.
Classy Hotel & Spa looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Battambang.
