Comfort Star Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-857bfa14e6be003f6cf59aa9174aa08e,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Comfort Star Hotel, ផ្លូវ 97, 120111 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងត្របែក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 97', 'postalCode': '120111'}","{'lat': 11.53625, 'lng': 104.92293}","[{'lat': 11.53623, 'lng': 104.92279}]",22107,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1190518'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523214371'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.536351,104.923355,1190518,Comfort Star Hotel,"If you’re looking for a budget friendly hotel in Phnom Penh, look no further than Comfort Star Hotel.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Wat Langka (0.9 mi) and Silver Pagoda (1.9 mi), guests of Comfort Star Hotel can easily experience some of Phnom Penh's most well known attractions.
The rooms offer air conditioning and a refrigerator, and getting online is possible, as internet access is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
In addition, as a valued Comfort Star Hotel guest, you can enjoy a lounge that is available on-site. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the seafood restaurants, including Malis Cambodian Restaurant, Le Broken Plate, and Nesat Seafood House, all of which are a short distance from Comfort Star Hotel.
If you’re looking for something to do, Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum (1.0 mi), Central Market (1.0 mi), and Bassac Lane (1.2 mi) are a nice way to spend some time, and they are all within walking distance of Comfort Star Hotel.
The staff at Comfort Star Hotel looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
