Common Grounds Cafe,here:pds:place:116aabd1-44607fdc68b50d7254724bcdc699de71,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Common Grounds Cafe, ផ្លូវ ហាប់ កួន, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ហាប់ កួន', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35722, 'lng': 103.85705}","[{'lat': 13.35721, 'lng': 103.85705}]",24442,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}, {'id': '700-7400-0285', 'name': 'Internet Cafe'}]","[{'id': '101-000', 'name': 'American', 'primary': True}, {'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1541678'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563965687'}, {'value': '+85578969861'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://commongroundscafes.org'}, {'value': 'http://www.commongroundscafe.org', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sat: 07:00 - 20:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT13H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.357222,103.857056,1541678,Common Grounds Cafe,"Common Grounds Cafe is a social enterprise that seeks to create a safe and friendly atmosphere, serving high quality coffee & pastries, delicious Western & Asian food, and providing strong Wi-Fi & cold air conditioning for our guests to enjoy. We believe in empowering potential and giving the poor a working chance through providing opportunities for training and employment. All of our staff receive: vocational training, health coverage, benefits, and fair salaries. We seek to build strong competent people full of character & integrity, and develop future leaders to serve Cambodia in the food and beverage industry. In addition to our main goal of training and developing our staff, we donate 100% of our profit to our parent organization, People For Care & Learning to help fund humanitarian projects throughout Cambodia. Together we are working towards a hopeful Cambodian future!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d1541678-Reviews-Common_Grounds_Cafe-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#719-721 Street 14', 'street2': 'Mundol 1', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': '#719-721 Street 14 Mundol 1, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,commongroundscambodia@gmail.com,+855 78 969 861,http://www.commongroundscafe.org/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d1541678-Common_Grounds_Cafe-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#21 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '21'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,539,"{'1': '3', '2': '14', '3': '25', '4': '83', '5': '414'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",313,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d1541678-m66827-Reviews-Common_Grounds_Cafe-Siem_Reap_Si