Container Office,here:pds:place:116w6499-e3d3c6708ca24d4fa75aca3c44c4cf21,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Container Office, 120909 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ពោធិ៍សែនជ័យ', 'subdistrict': 'ចោមចៅ', 'postalCode': '120909'}","{'lat': 11.5324, 'lng': 104.81481}","[{'lat': 11.53227, 'lng': 104.81484}]",6661,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598947455'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.559166,104.86667,9604106,Giant Ibis Transport,"Giant Ibis Transport takes pride in its name, inspired by the national bird of Cambodia, the Giant Ibis. Since its inception in 2012, the company has been a trustworthy name in the bus industry. They live by their motto ""safe, reliable, responsible"" and strive to provide their customers with exceptional service, always putting passengers' safety and comfort above everything else. Giant Ibis offers a variety of routes within Cambodia and beyond, connecting the Kingdom with neighbouring Thailand and Vietnam. Whether it's a trip to the magnificent Angkor Wat in Siem Reap, the beautiful coastal resort of Sihanoukville, or the charming towns of Kep and Kampot, they have got you covered. They also offer routes from Siem Reap to Bangkok and from Phnom Penh to Ho Chi Minh City.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d9604106-Reviews-Giant_Ibis_Transport-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sivutha Road, Pub Street', 'street2': 'Krong Siem Reap', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12202', 'address_string': 'Sivutha Road, Pub Street Krong Siem Reap, Phnom Penh 12202 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@giantibis.com,+855 96 999 3333,http://www.giantibis.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d9604106-Giant_Ibis_Transport-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#26 of 190 Transportation in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '190', 'ranking': '26'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,2267,"{'1': '232', '2': '130', '3': '221', '4': '632', '5': '1052'}",Not available,719,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d9604106-m66827-Reviews-Giant_Ibis_Transport-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'transportation', 'localized_name': 'Transportation'}, {'name': 'attractions', 'localized_name': 'Attractions'}]","[{'name': 'Transportation', 'localized_name': 'Transportation', 'categories': [{'name': 'Bus Transportation', 'localized_name': 'Bus Transportation'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '36'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '975'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '471'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '209'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '366'}]","[{'award_type': 'Travelers Choice', 'year': '2024', 'images': {'tiny': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2024_L.png', 'small': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2024_L.png', 'large': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2024_L.png'}, 'categories': [], 'display_name': 'Travelers Choice'}, {'award_type': 'Travelers Choice', 'year': '2023', 'images': {'tiny': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png', 'small': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png', 'large': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png'}, 'cate