Container Park,here:pds:place:116w62vt-b3310c0fb8224d768361677e415b6055,en,bar_pub,"{'label': 'Container Park, 010901 ប៉ោយប៉ែត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បន្ទាយមានជ័យ', 'city': 'ប៉ោយប៉ែត', 'district': 'ប៉ោយប៉ែត', 'postalCode': '010901'}","{'lat': 13.65819, 'lng': 102.55704}","[{'lat': 13.6583, 'lng': 102.55711}]",85551,"[{'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517898234'}]}],Not Available,Banteay Meanchey,13.698374,102.506355,9463981,My Room by Sermsub,"MY Room by Sermsub is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Aranyaprathet, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
MY Room by Sermsub offers guests an array of room amenities including a refrigerator, a minibar, and air conditioning, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available.
The small hotel offers a 24 hour front desk, room service, and a coffee shop, to make your visit even more pleasant. The property also features a fitness center and a snack bar. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of the nearby restaurants that are within walking distance of MY Room by Sermsub, such as Yai Taam Vietnamese Restaurant (0.7 mi) or Thip Kitchen (0.7 mi).
Looking to explore? Then look no further than Wat Anu Banpot (0.3 mi), which is a popular Aranyaprathet attraction – and it is conveniently located within walking distance of the small hotel.
Enjoy your stay in Aranyaprathet!
