Convenient Home & Cafe,here:pds:place:116aabd1-fa9b1a3965d101d8de9fae01697ec922,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Convenient Home & Cafe, ផ្លូវជាតិ 63, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 63', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35877, 'lng': 103.8541}","[{'lat': 13.35872, 'lng': 103.85423}]",89568,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10049971'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11833047'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517385559'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.358727,103.8542,11833047,Convenient Home & Cafe,"Convenient Home & Cafe is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Siem Reap, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Siem Reap, Convenient Home & Cafe is located a short distance from Wat Preah Prom Rath (0.3 mi) and Viti's Tuk Tuk Driver (0.7 mi).
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning and a minibar, and you can stay connected during your stay as Convenient Home & Cafe offers guests public wifi.
Plus, Convenient Home & Cafe offers breakfast, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of Siem Reap's popular crab restaurants such as Genevieve's Restaurant, Cuisine Wat Damnak, and Malis Restaurant Siem Reap, all a short distance from Convenient Home & Cafe.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out a government building, such as Royal Residence.
Enjoy your stay in Siem Reap!
