Corner 9 Bassac Boutique Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649e-d2a96be1f61f4de7a9c405225998c6ed,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Corner 9 Bassac Boutique Hotel, ផ្លូវ 308, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 308', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.55314, 'lng': 104.93144}","[{'lat': 11.55303, 'lng': 104.93144}]",59314,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12563970'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523210169'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.corner9boutique.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.553021,104.93144,12563970,Corner 9 Bassac Boutique Hotel,"Looking for a place to stay in Phnom Penh? Then look no further than Corner 9 Bassac Boutique Hotel, a family-friendly small hotel that brings the best of Phnom Penh to your doorstep.
Corner 9 Bassac Boutique Hotel offers guests an array of room amenities including a minibar, air conditioning, and a mosquito net, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available.
The small hotel offers a 24 hour front desk, 24 hour check-in, and baggage storage, to make your visit even more pleasant. The property also features a pool and breakfast. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
While staying at Corner 9 Bassac Boutique Hotel, visitors can check out Bassac Lane (0.1 mi) and Bophana Center (0.8 mi), some of Phnom Penh's top attractions.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of Phnom Penh's popular tapas restaurants such as Romdeng, Friends the Restaurant, and Chinese House, all a short distance from Corner 9 Bassac Boutique Hotel.
Looking to explore? Then look no further than Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum (1.0 mi), Royal Palace (0.7 mi), and Silver Pagoda (0.7 mi), which are some popular Phnom Penh attractions – all conveniently located within walking distance of the small hotel.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Corner 9 Bassac Boutique Hotel as you experience everything Phnom Penh has to offer.
