Couch Potatoes,here:pds:place:116aabd1-ebfed4b622d107f3173e796ac7e12567,en,bar_pub,"{'label': 'Couch Potatoes, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60701, 'lng': 104.18057}","[{'lat': 10.60715, 'lng': 104.18052}]",19589,"[{'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10034809'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593218956'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/Couch-Potatoes-1030330950353172/?fref=ts'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Thu, Sun: 00:00 - 02:00, 17:00 - 24:00', 'Fri: 00:00 - 02:00', 'Sat: 17:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T170000', 'duration': 'PT09H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,SA,SU'}]}]",Kampot,10.607111,104.180534,10034809,Couch Potatoes,"A relaxed and friendly bar showing sports, films and music videos on a 3M large screen. The bar also has 3 other TV's to ensure you don't miss any other important events whilst you watch the main match. There's a large and very comfortable sofa area, bar stools and armchairs to relax in. Well stocked bar and great hosts with a great atmosphere. Kampot's premium sports bar & lounge.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d10034809-Reviews-Couch_Potatoes-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '36 Street 726, number', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': '36 Street 726, number, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,+855 93 218 956,http://www.facebook.com/Couch-Potatoes-1030330950353172/?fref=ts,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d10034809-Couch_Po