Crane Siem Reap,here:pds:place:116w63u5-6427272362ce4605aeaad982aa7969d9,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Crane Siem Reap, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35881, 'lng': 103.85739}","[{'lat': 13.35862, 'lng': 103.85729}]",24285,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '700-7200-0269', 'name': 'Organizations and Societies'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85589675761'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.cranecambodia.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.356936,103.85637,11680558,Crane Cafe,"Crane® is a clubhouse of sorts, a place to hangout, chill, be inspired or inspire. A place to talk film, art, culture, religion, quantum physics or whatever the hell you want. Maybe buy a t-shirt, to feel good about yourself, and look like a million bucks. Or order a coffee & chat more about how you are going to change the developing world with your Western world ideals. Or pop in to talk with some celebrity here working on a film or something of that nature. Whatever the case, Crane® is good vibes, to do whatever you want and feel good doing it. Crane® offers amazing coffee and one-of-kind limited edition t-shirts that even Jay-Z can’t get his hands on or off of. Caps that Iggy Pop would give his left hand to own. Exclusive, knick knacks that knick, or knack never even heard of. Vintage t-shirts that every hipster from Tokyo to Berlin back to Silverlake would die to own. And at the same time Crane® is helping those less fortunate, teaching them a skillset and giving them a place to p",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d11680558-Reviews-Crane_Cafe-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Central Market St', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Central Mark