Crepe N' Roll Pancakes,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-5f81f5c1c6ca608c54614e5d5d4ff9b8,en,restaurant,"{'label': ""Crepe N' Roll Pancakes, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60739, 'lng': 104.1808}","[{'lat': 10.60726, 'lng': 104.18084}]",19584,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '301-000', 'name': 'French'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27434040'}]",[{'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61555770719326'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT13H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kampot,10.607319,104.18082,27434040,Crepe n' Roll Pancakes,"We make sweet and salty pancakes, as “galette complète”. Only with quality ingredients. 100% organic buckwheat or traditional white wheat flour. Real whole cooked ham, cheese Emmental (gruyère), fresh eggs, pepper from Kampot. We also have always fresh strawberry, and whipped cream ready. Enjoy the place in a nice garden with swimming pool right in the very center of Kampot City.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d27434040-Reviews-Crepe_n_Roll_Pancakes-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '37, Street 726', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '070801', 'address_string': '37, Street 726, Kampot 070801 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,crepenroll37@gmail.com,Not available,https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61555770719326,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-