Cyclo Hotel & Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w649g-e7a88ca277164e5ca7c9f3eb44101983,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Cyclo Hotel & Restaurant, ផ្លូវ 172 23, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 172', 'postalCode': '120205', 'houseNumber': '23'}","{'lat': 11.56731, 'lng': 104.92846}","[{'lat': 11.56718, 'lng': 104.92849}]",7015,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523992128'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.566467,104.92604,1221821,Le Cyclo,"Le Cyclo is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Phnom Penh, offering a family-friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as air conditioning, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the hotel.
Le Cyclo features a rooftop terrace, a concierge, and baggage storage, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts a hot tub and a lounge. If you are driving to Le Cyclo Hotel, free parking is available.
While staying at Le Cyclo, visitors can check out Champey Academy of Arts (0.1 mi) and Wat Ounalom (0.3 mi), some of Phnom Penh's top attractions.
Travelers looking to enjoy some tempura can head to The Vegetarian, Hachi, or The Sushi Bar Phnom Penh. Otherwise, you may want to check out a seafood restaurant such as Malis Cambodian Restaurant, Le Broken Plate, or Nesat Seafood House.
If you are interested in exploring Phnom Penh, check out one of the monuments and statues, such as Statue of King Father Norodom Sihanouk, Independence Monument, and Cambodia-Vietnam Friendship Monument.
Enjoy your stay in Phnom Penh!
