D'Vine Cafe and Wine Bar,here:pds:place:116w63gf-ad02f8a06c8d46c6ac16b25c11594f2e,en,casual_dining,"{'label': ""D'Vine Cafe and Wine Bar, 171209 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សៀមរាប', 'postalCode': '171209'}","{'lat': 13.32321, 'lng': 103.8245}","[{'lat': 13.32358, 'lng': 103.82495}]",29608,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517676295'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d6949339-Reviews-D_Vine_Cafe_and_Wine_Bar-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.341611,103.8334,25438586,Boutique Indochine d'Angkor,"Nestled within private gardens, Boutique Indochine d'Angkor offers Angkorian-inspired accommodations away from the hustle and bustling of Siem Reap. It features an outdoor pool and a sun terrace. Guests can enjoy meals at the in-house restaurant or have a drink at the bar. Free WiFi is available throughout the property and there is private parking on site. Pub Street is 0.7 mi from Boutique Indochine d'Angkor, while Angkor Wat is 4.3 mi from the property. The nearest airport is Siem Reap - Angkor International Airport, 5 mi from Boutique Indochine d'Angkor. All air-conditioned rooms have a flat-screen TV. Certain units included a seating area to relax in after a busy day. Some rooms have views of the pool or garden. The rooms are equipped with a private bathroom. For your comfort, you will find bath robes and slippers. Guests can approach the 24-hour front desk for tour arrangements ,ticketing services, laundry service, massage service and all other activities in Siem Reap. Our restaurant serves up a variety of authentic Cambodian dishes as well as Chinese and Asian cuisine.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g12591811-d25438586-Reviews-Boutique_Indochine_d_Angkor-Svay_Dangkum_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'BBU Road', 'street2': 'Vihear Chen Village', 'city': 'Svay Dangkum', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'BBU Road Vihear Chen Village, Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Svay Dangkum', 'location_id': '12591811'}, {'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g12591811-d25438586-Boutique_Indochine_d_Angkor-Svay_Dangkum_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '12591811', 'ranking_string': '#7 of 21 B&Bs / Inns in Svay Dangkum', 'geo_location_name': 'Svay Dangkum', 'ranking_out_of': '21', 'ranking': '7'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,15,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '2', '5': '11'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image