D.I Residence,here:pds:place:116w649e-e918dc0f7d3d4370abf67a9bb0bf37a1,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'D.I Residence, ផ្លូវ សុភមង្គល, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សុភមង្គល', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.55075, 'lng': 104.93936}","[{'lat': 11.55086, 'lng': 104.9392}]",74446,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13416014'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510655198'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/DIresidence'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.550812,104.939285,13416014,D.I Residence,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Phnom Penh, D.I Residence is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its proximity to great restaurants and attractions, D.I Residence makes it easy to enjoy the best of Phnom Penh.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as D.I Residence offers guests free wifi.
The guest house features a 24 hour front desk and baggage storage. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Champey Academy of Arts (1.3 mi) and Bophana Center (1.3 mi), guests of D.I Residence can easily experience some of Phnom Penh's most well known attractions.
Phnom Penh has plenty of southwestern restaurants. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Cocina Cartel, Lone Star Saloon, and Slla Sky Bar & Restaurant, which are serving up some great dishes.
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular castles such as Royal Palace.
D.I Residence is sure to make your visit to Phnom Penh one worth remembering.
