DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence,here:pds:place:116aabd1-175057b72fdc0182120cb7ca56a8f22f,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.3805, 'lng': 103.84906}","[{'lat': 13.38037, 'lng': 103.84904}]",87129,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11094412'}]",[{'www': [{'value': 'http://www.ddgresidence.com'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.38052,103.84907,11094412,DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence,"See why so many travelers make DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence their hotel of choice when visiting Siem Reap. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a charming setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Rooms at DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence offer air conditioning, a refrigerator, and a minibar providing exceptional comfort and convenience.
Room service is one of the conveniences offered at this hotel. Breakfast will also help to make your stay even more special. If you are driving to DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence, free parking is available.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Seng English Speaking Tuk Tuk & Car Driver (0.7 mi) and Friendly Tuk Tuk Driver (1.0 mi), guests of DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence can easily experience some of Siem Reap's most well known attractions.
If you like steakhouses, DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence is conveniently located near Grill Wine Cafe, Damnak Steakhouse, and Tell Steak House.
If you’re looking for something to do, Wat Thmey (Killing Fields) (0.8 mi) is a nice way to spend some time, and it is within walking distance of DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence as you experience all of the things Siem Reap has to offer.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d11094412-Reviews-DDG_Retreat_Siem_Reap_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Pub Street 45', 'street2': 'Teaksen Tboung Village Sangkat Kouk Chak next to Phasaar Daem Kralanh market', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17253', 'address_string': 'Pub Street 45 Teaksen Tboung Village Sangkat Kouk Chak next to Phasaar Daem Kralanh market, Siem Reap 17253 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d11094412-DDG_Retreat_Siem_Reap_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#308 of 763 hotels in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '763', 'ranking': '308'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,48,"{'1': '3', '2': '1', '3': '1', '4': '4', '5': '39'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",30,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d11094412-m66827-Reviews-DDG_Retreat_Siem_Reap_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Breakfast included', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Microwave', 'Poolside Bar', 'Room service', 'Free parking', 'Airport transportation', 'Laundry Service', 'Air conditioning', 'Refrigerator in room', 'Minibar', 'Breakfast Available']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"['Trendy', 'Quaint']",[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '11'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '10'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '17'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '9'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,11,20
DJ Guesthouse & Lounge,here:pds:place:116aabd1-b190ccf9ac0f052e7c752e0b346afdd8,en,hostel,"{'label': 'DJ Guesthouse & Lounge, ផ្លូវ 29 17B, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 29', 'postalCode': '120101', 'houseNumber': '17B'}","{'lat': 11.55355, 'lng': 104.92954}","[{'lat': 11.55354, 'lng': 104.92965}]",7308,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10833149'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515777107'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.553178,104.92961,10833149,DJ Guesthouse & Lounge,"Atmosphere and Location Bring along your guitar, or just use ours at DJ Guesthouse & Lounge, the only music themed hostel in Phnom Penh. With only 15 beds, it has a cozy feel to it where you can easily get to know other travelers and get more personalized customer service. We are centrally located, close to the nightlife on street 308 and Basaac Lane where you will find micro-bars with fantastic craft cocktails and no shortage of great food. Site-seeing is easy as we are steps from Independence monument and a short tuk tuk away from the Genocide museum, National Museum, and Riverside. The Canadian owner, Jennifer, or her friendly Khmer staff will be happy to help you arrange bus tickets, tuk tuk rides, or tours. Bar Our funky bar is also popular with expats living in Phnom Penh, especially during popular weekly events such as open mic and music trivia. Be sure to try one of our great value musical cocktails such as the Jackson 5 or Pink Floyd. Great specials during happy hour from 4pm-7pm daily. If you ever feel like busting into karaoke, our equipment is always ready! Rooms We offer comfortable rooms with A/C and an ensuite bathroom even in our dorms, at backpacker budget friendly prices. Hot water, bed sheets, towels, lockers, soap, shampoo and wifi all come standard. Best of all, you will find DJ Guesthouse & Lounge is always squeaky clean as we have the best cleaner in Cambodia. We look forward to welcoming you to DJ Guesthouse & Lounge soon!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d10833149-Reviews-DJ_Guesthouse_Lounge-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '29 17b Street', 'street2': 'Tonle Basaac', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12101', 'address_string': '29 17b Street Tonle Basaac, Phnom Penh 12101 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d10833149-DJ_Guesthouse_Lounge-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#36 of 351 Specialty lodging in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '351', 'ranking': '36'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,34,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '2', '4': '8', '5': '23'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img