DJ's Tuk Tuk Tours,here:pds:place:116w636k-2c237532af4944292011889e09a0672f,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': ""DJ's Tuk Tuk Tours, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09419, 'lng': 103.20047}","[{'lat': 13.09415, 'lng': 103.20034}]",12326,"[{'id': '400-4100-0041', 'name': 'Transportation Service', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10404024'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570362054'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/DJstuktuktour'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT18H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Battambang,13.09425,103.20067,10404024,Dj's Tuk Tuk Tours,"Half Day Tour: 16USD - Includes the scenic bamboo railway, killing cave and Wat Phnom Sampeau. Full Day Tour: 22USD - Includes all sights of the half day tour and Wat Ek Phnom or Wat Bannan and the beautiful countryside. 2 Day Tour: 35USD - Includes all sights of the half day tour and Wat Ek Phnom, Wat Bannan and a tour of the Battambang city. There is small charge of for the bamboo train and temples",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d10404024-Reviews-Dj_s_Tuk_Tuk_Tours-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Battambang Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,djstuktuk@gmail.com,+855 12 255 989,http://www.facebook.com/DJstuktuktour,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d10404024-Dj_s_Tuk_Tuk_Tours-Battambang_Battambang_Province.htm