Dadana Floral Boutique,here:pds:place:116d408k-7a6cbbf8669701b94f60241391ab16d0,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Dadana Floral Boutique, ផ្លូវ 1, 120211 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'វត្តភ្នំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 1', 'postalCode': '120211'}","{'lat': 11.57289, 'lng': 104.92871}","[{'lat': 11.57297, 'lng': 104.92882}]",72925,"[{'id': '600-6900-0355', 'name': 'Florist', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '600-6900-0000', 'name': 'Consumer Goods'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511963333'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.dadana.net'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.564697,104.92725,6940089,Okay Boutique Hotel,"In the center of Cambodia's historic city of Phnom Penh, Okay Boutique Hotel offers comfort, elegant, captivating and smoothing accommodation of international standard to leisure and business travelers alike. The Boutique-style Hotel is just a stone's throw away from the city's cultural and restaurant and sky-bar (mini-bar) hubs, local markets and other sights of interest. Okay Boutique Hotel is also situated a short distance away from Royal Palace of the Kingdom of Cambodia, National Museum and the Royal University of Fine Art. Within the palace compound are the coronation hall; the entrance, which houses an open-air theater for the Royal Dance Troupe, and a balcony for Royal appearances; an open-air pavilion often used for entertaining and viewing of the King's movies; and the King's private residence, which houses a collection of Cambodian artwork from artists around the world, and his office, where he actively pursues Royal duties. At our Boutique Hotel, spacious guestrooms with rich colors and textures that reflect traditional Cambodia architecture are categorized into Superior, Deluxe, Premier Deluxe, Executive Suite, Okay Suite, and Family Suite. All guestrooms are fully air-conditioned, come complete with their own balcony affording spectacular view of the city and boast separate bathtub and shower facilities. Our boutique hotel style offers a relaxed respite as a perfect complement to your visit to historic Phnom Penh. The Okay Boutique Hotel is associated with a single Khmer modernized-mixed civilization decoration renowned for its art and architecture. The modern legacy was part of its official name, has its height of the 13 floor established in the year of 2012. As the principles of religion governed the concept and execution of all Khmer art and architecture, an appreciation of Angkor and its civilization is enhanced by an understanding of the religious of the Khmers. The owner of the Okay Boutique Hotel was dedicated to Vishnu who is the supreme God in the Vaishnavism tradition of Hinduism and venerated as one of the five primary forms of God. This standing stone statue has eight arms and the head of Buddha. When the Okay Boutique Hotel became a Buddhist temple, the head of Vishnu was replaced with the head of Buddha. In the impression of the Okay Boutique Hotel has a specific basic color - green for the trees, light brown for the building, blackish grey for the stones. What the owner likes in these statues is the contrast between the dark monochromatic body of the statute and the bright colors on the clothes and the parasol. The bright colors really stood out from the whole setting!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d6940089-Reviews-Okay_Boutique_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#174, Street 19z, Sangkat Cheychumnas', 'street2': 'Khan Daun Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '93002', 'address_string': '#174, Street 19z, Sangkat Cheychumnas Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh 93002 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor