Dairy Queen Takhmao,here:pds:place:116w649k-6ab54d91b22602b5598197b977f03f59,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Dairy Queen Takhmao, ផ្លូវជាតិ 21, 081104 តាខ្មៅ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'តាខ្មៅ', 'district': 'តាខ្មៅ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 21', 'postalCode': '081104'}","{'lat': 11.47984, 'lng': 104.94567}","[{'lat': 11.47984, 'lng': 104.94567}]",15887,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '800-063', 'name': 'Ice Cream', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26322790'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598982506'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 09:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kandal,11.479759,104.94552,26322790,Dairy Queen Takhmao,"Existing for more than 70 years, today Dairy Queen is the best soft serve Ice Cream Parlor in the world with almost 700 outlets! With unique fashionable products such as Oreo Blizzard served upside side, Delicious Hotdog and refreshing drinks, Dairy Queen offers sharable treats and smiles! And in order to be memorable, the tasting experience has to be perfect for you; that’s why we select only the highest quality ingredients to create the one of a kind taste made fresh for you, the way you like it.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g729355-d26322790-Reviews-Dairy_Queen_Takhmao-Ta_Khmau_Kandal_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 21, 200', 'street2': '200m from Circle', 'city': 'Ta Khmau', 'state': 'Kandal Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'No. 21, 200 200m from Circle, Ta Khmau Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Ta Khmau', 'location_id': '729355'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kandal Province', 'location_id': '2366665'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,+855 98 982 506,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/User