Daly Hotel,here:pds:place:116httek-44d4bcfdb2c108df138f98679f799a74,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Daly Hotel, 030402 កំពង់ចាម, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'city': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'district': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'postalCode': '030402'}","{'lat': 11.99044, 'lng': 105.46661}","[{'lat': 11.99044, 'lng': 105.4666}]",25520,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4886415'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577757957'}]}],Not Available,Kampong Cham,11.99044,105.46661,4886415,Daly Hotel,"See why so many travelers make Daly Hotel their hotel of choice when visiting Kampong Cham. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a family-friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Given the close proximity to Wat Nokor (2.0 mi), guests of Daly Hotel can easily experience one of Kampong Cham's most popular landmarks.
Rooms at Daly Hotel offer a minibar, air conditioning, and a refrigerator providing exceptional comfort and convenience, and guests can go online with free wifi.
A 24 hour front desk, room service, and a coffee shop are some of the conveniences offered at this hotel. An on-site restaurant will also help to make your stay even more special. If you are driving to Daly Hotel, free parking is available.
Kampong Cham has plenty of cafes. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Destiny Coffee House and K2 Seafood Buffer Restaurant, which are serving up some great dishes.
Should time allow, Ko Paen Bamboo Bridge and The French Tower are some popular attractions that are within walking distance.
At Daly Hotel, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Kampong Cham.
