Damnak Phnom Krom Homestay,here:pds:place:116w63gd-97090b45399182dec736840761363859,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Damnak Phnom Krom Homestay, ផ្លូវជាតិ 63, 171209 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សៀមរាប', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 63', 'postalCode': '171209'}","{'lat': 13.30071, 'lng': 103.84273}","[{'lat': 13.30059, 'lng': 103.8428}]",85293,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26767915'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512436869'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/Damnak.Phnom.Krom.Homestay', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.30077,103.84269,26767915,Damnak Phnom Krom Homestay,"Damnak Phnom Krom, inspired by the beautiful lotus farm it stands on, is conveniently located just outside Siem Reap with quick access to popular attractions like Pub Street (2.5km), Old Market, and the floating villages. Damnak Phnom Krom also offers inclusive four-person tours of Angkor Wat’s sunrise and sunset daily. Our goal is to provide not only a clean and beautiful home but also a personalized experience of beautiful Siem Reap. Free pick up and drop off from local bus stations. Damnak Phnom Krom is family-owned, which means we are happy to provide visitors with suggestions on tours, attractions, and the best of Siem Reap. Damnak Phnom Krom is also set apart by our free transportation to tour locations such as Angkor Wat, Pub Street, and many other popular attractions of Siem Reap upon Request.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d26767915-Reviews-Damnak_Phnom_Krom_Homestay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 63 No. 403', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '171209', 'address_string': 'Street 63 No. 403, Siem Reap 171209 Cambodia'}","[{'lev