Darica Resort,here:pds:place:116aabd1-c418c424f5410a769332052c23b854e6,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Darica Resort, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.499, 'lng': 104.29163}","[{'lat': 10.49887, 'lng': 104.29165}]",6822,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7117704'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512990998'}]}],Not Available,Kep,10.499255,104.29158,7117704,Darica Resort,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Kep, Darica Resort is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its family-friendly environment and proximity to great restaurants and attractions, Darica Resort makes it easy to enjoy the best of Kep.
Guest rooms offer a refrigerator and air conditioning, and Darica Resort makes getting online easy as free wifi is available.
You can also take advantage of some of the amenities offered by the guest house, including a sun terrace and baggage storage. In addition, guests can enjoy a pool and free breakfast during their visit. As an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
Close to some of Kep's most popular landmarks, such as Crab Statue (1.6 mi) and Patio (2.0 mi), Darica Resort is a great destination for tourists.
While in Kep be sure to experience local crab favorites at Sailing Club, Kimly Restaurant, or Holy Crab.
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular parks such as Jasmine Valley Skate Bowl.
Darica Resort is sure to make your visit to Kep one worth remembering.
