David Angkor Guide - Private Tours,here:pds:place:116aabd1-88e93ae0dd0009e3100fad992ffcae6f,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'David Angkor Guide - Private Tours, 171205 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'នគរធំ', 'postalCode': '171205'}","{'lat': 13.43995, 'lng': 103.85897}","[{'lat': 13.44008, 'lng': 103.85897}]",18364,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1807045'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512996300'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://davidangkorguide.blogspot.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.439867,103.85896,1807045,David Angkor Guide - Private Tours,"David Angkor Guide- Private Tours is a professional licensed Travel Agency to provide interesting daily tours privately to Angkor Archaeological complex and other interesting sites in Cambodia. Sovann (David) was a former high School Teacher of English language for ten years and graduated the bachelor of tourism. David, Ratanak and colleagues are a Group of senior experienced, professional, friendly, licensed Angkor Tour Guides and have been working as tour guides for many years! We are a team who works together to offer you exciting memorable guiding services during your visit in Cambodia!!We will tailor suggested itinerary at your requests!!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d1807045-Reviews-David_Angkor_Guide_Private_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Wat Damnak', 'street2': 'Sala Komroeuk Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Wat Damnak Sala Komroeuk Commune, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/P