"Daysun,Tapas Bar & Restaurant",here:pds:place:116w649e-2770f94bd2344c42ab94f8cb2d1ad247,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Daysun,Tapas Bar & Restaurant, ផ្លូវ 432 38, 120111 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងត្របែក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 432', 'postalCode': '120111', 'houseNumber': '38'}","{'lat': 11.54164, 'lng': 104.91868}","[{'lat': 11.54173, 'lng': 104.91867}]",22863,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855762200200'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.552064,104.9235,4597090,Digby's Bar & Grill,"At Digby's, we aspire for quality, character and excellence in all that we do. Digby's is more than just a cafe, we are a place where people meet to shop, eat, do business, laugh and relax. We start from scratch each day to prepare our menu, choosing raw ingredients carefully, supporting local farms, selecting best suppliers, and searching for the best meats, serving the best coffee and tea. We purchase all our fresh seafood ourselves through our quality purveyor and work cooperatively with local fishermen and farmers. All vegetables are either certified organic (by CORAA) or chemical-free, priority goes to local farmers whenever we can. We also use only filtered water for drinking water and ice. In the morning, our bakery bakes all our pastries, cakes and bread with passion and care using fresh quality ingredients. Perfect over a cup of coffee or a pot of Gryphon Tea.  To ensure highest standards, our kitchen staff is all tested for HIV, Hepatitis, Typhoid, Tuberculosis and are free from them. All staff are also trained in HACCP standards in food handling. We support NGOs such as Friend's International, PSE in recruiting and staffing their graduated students to train them further in their career in the kitchen as well as our service staff. We strive for perfect service taking babysteps in carefully training staff for higher levels of service, and we hope that our friendly and energetic atmosphere enriches every experience. Guests can choose between sitting indoors and shopping at our specialty grocery for home or office or dining outdoors at our green-wall pavilion.  Come and enjoy with us.... Bon Appetit!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d4597090-Reviews-Digby_s_Bar_Grill-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 197 Street 63 (cross St 306) BKK1 Khan Chamkarmorn', 'street2': 'Cross Street 306', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '# 197 Street 63 (cross St 306) BKK1 Khan Chamkarmorn Cross Street 306, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@dnakcompany.com,+855 77 772 326,http://www.dnakcompany.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d4597090-Digby_s_Bar_Grill-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#110 of 1,983 Places to Eat in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '1983', 'ranking': '110'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,305,"{'1': '8', '2': '13', '3': '42', '4': '102', '5': '140'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'loc