Delapree Art Gallery,here:pds:place:116aabd1-86e84924498309f7473cfc747adf115b,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Delapree Art Gallery, ផ្លូវ 2 ធ្នូ, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 2 ធ្នូ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35479, 'lng': 103.85535}","[{'lat': 13.35473, 'lng': 103.85523}]",226879,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2100155'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512928057'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.stefhappygallery.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.354756,103.85529,2100155,Delapree Art Gallery,"his very unique small art gallery presents creations of Stephane Delapree (Stef), a French born Canadian artist. Trough his Happy painting, the celebrated artist Stef, has made a singular contribution to avant-garde Cambodian art. The childlike innocence and clarity which infuse his paintings make them popular both to art-world sophisticates in search an authentic vision and a wide range of art lovers. His clients included Royalties, diplomats, other luminaries and discerning travellers from all around the world; and many tourists who love to bring back home Stef's happy Cambodia merchandisings.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d2100155-Reviews-Delapree_Art_Gallery-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '363 Sisowath Quay', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': '363 Sisowath Quay, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,sdelapree@gmail.com,+855 12 928 057,http://www.stefhappygallery.com,https://www.tripadvisor.co