Delux Villa,here:pds:place:116w636s-5ba15566fb044cfebc10a756c166a1ae,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Delux Villa, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10053, 'lng': 103.19525}","[{'lat': 13.1005, 'lng': 103.19539}]",12237,"[{'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]","[{'id': '800-061', 'name': 'Breakfast', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3569048'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517703839'}, {'value': '+85577336373'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.100571,103.19502,3569048,Delux Villa,"To meet customers' demands, our De Lux Villa has carefully selected the modern style, which shows the real creativity of young Khmers, and is intended to show the world this exquisitely skillful decorative achievement of Khmer pride which is located in the northwest region (Battambang province), following the charming Angkor City of the Kingdom of Cambodia. De Lux Villa is a new and unique masterpiece as well as the first of its type to be built in the territory of Battambang. It is only now, at the of 2012, that De Lux Villa has been designed, changing (the style) from an ancient wooden house to a furnished concrete house, drawing the favour of customers in this modern time. De Lux Villa wants to show the Khmer tradition that has existed since ancient times, which is also the unique and wonderful inheritance left by our ancestors. Operation 24-hour front desk and Daily housekeeping included in the room rate, all room come with Private bathroom for each unit.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d3569048-Reviews-Delux_Villa-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 4, phum 20 Uksaphea', 'street2': 'Sangkat Svay Pao', 'city': '