Destiny Café,here:pds:place:116aabd1-377f46e5fd0a07d7ff95447d50ea485d,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Destiny Café, 010901 ប៉ោយប៉ែត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បន្ទាយមានជ័យ', 'city': 'ប៉ោយប៉ែត', 'district': 'ប៉ោយប៉ែត', 'postalCode': '010901'}","{'lat': 13.65133, 'lng': 102.56572}","[{'lat': 13.65125, 'lng': 102.56583}]",84712,"[{'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2706316'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577762586'}]}],"[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1100-0010'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:30 - 18:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T063000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Banteay Meanchey,13.6515,102.56551,2706316,Destiny Cafe,"Destiny Cafe is a social enterprise supporting Cambodian Hope Organization, a Christian NGO which works with communities in and around Poipet. Our mission is to strengthen the quality of life of disadvantaged rural people and cultivate hope for the future through planting churches, providing education to vulnerable children, and running other projects. Our commitment is to bring you the best service and highest quality food. We offer a comfortable environment for you to enjoy your cup of coffee, along with delicious Khmer and western dishes.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g674568-d2706316-Reviews-Destiny_Cafe-Poipet_Banteay_Meanchey_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Highway 5', 'city': 'Poipet', 'state': 'Banteay Meanchey Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '855', 'address_string': 'National Highway 5, Poipet 855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Poipet', 'location_id': '674568'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Banteay Meanchey Province', 'location_id': '1074270'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,mj.rosa@yahoo.com,+855 77 762 5