Deva Cafe,here:pds:place:116aabd1-7da8d47a5c96058a33a6d51bde868f4b,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Deva Cafe, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.61873, 'lng': 104.16722}","[{'lat': 10.61868, 'lng': 104.16709}]",25799,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '800-066', 'name': 'Fusion', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9553739'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512276621'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://devacafe.org'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon, Wed-Sun: 08:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT13H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kampot,10.618718,104.1672,9553739,Deva Cafe,"Deva serves Vegan Khmer Cuisine, Healthy Smoothies and Juices, and Vegan Breakfasts. Deva is a Social Enterprise of the Banteay Srey Project and offers training and excellent employment experience to young Khmer women. The delicious menu features the best of local Kampot ingredients and many items are picked fresh from Deva's own organic garden. There is a juice bar downstairs for seating with a nice breezy loft above overlooking the road.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d9553739-Reviews-Deva_Cafe-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '33 Tuek Chhu Rd', 'street2': 'Next door to Banyan Tree', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': '33 Tuek Chhu Rd Next door to Banyan Tree, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,banteaysreyproject@gmail.com,+855 12 276 621,http://devacafe.org,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d9553739-Deva_Cafe-