Devatas Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w63vj-dd1eb03cf5ce4cd8a8f779993eba3841,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Devatas Restaurant, ផ្លូវជាតិ 67, 170901 បន្ទាយស្រី, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'បន្ទាយស្រី', 'district': 'ខ្នារសណ្ដាយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 67', 'postalCode': '170901'}","{'lat': 13.54477, 'lng': 103.94619}","[{'lat': 13.54476, 'lng': 103.94633}]",6935,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12861038'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511292142'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.devatas-restaurant.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 10:30 - 16:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T103000', 'duration': 'PT05H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.544784,103.94611,12861038,Devatas Restaurant,"Devatas Restaurant offers you a restful lunch experience only minutes from Banteay Srei temple. The restaurant comprises several kiosks with traditional thatch roofing set amidst tropical gardens. A lake is situated in front of the restaurant and provides an ever-changing vista. Our dishes feature authentic Khmer cuisine based on traditional recipes. Devatas Restaurant is located in Banteay Srey, 500 meters from the Cambodian Landmine Museum. Access is direct from the main road to the Banteay Srey temple. Our menu has several vegetarian options and most of our fresh produce is biological and home grown in our vegetable garden.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d12861038-Reviews-Devatas_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 67, Khum Khnar Snday, Banteay Srey', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17301', 'address_string': 'Street 67, Khum Khnar Snday, Banteay Srey, Siem Reap 17301 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@devatas-restaurant.com,+855 11 292 142,http://www.devatas-restaurant.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12861038-Devatas_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#243 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '243'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,35,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '4', '5': '31'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",46,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d12861038-m66827-Reviews-Devatas_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1030'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1600'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1030'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1600'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1030'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1600'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1030'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1600'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1030'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1600'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '1030'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1600'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '1030'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '1600'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 10:30 - 16:00', 'Tuesday: 10:30 - 16:00', 'Wednesday: 10:30 - 16:00', 'Thursday: 10:30 - 16:00', 