Dialogue,here:pds:place:116w63gg-ee75596fa35d4c739639317121f58610,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Dialogue, វិថី វត្តបូ, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'វិថី វត្តបូ', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.3539, 'lng': 103.85863}","[{'lat': 13.35385, 'lng': 103.85876}]",24610,"[{'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '18961258'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578631989'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT18H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.353889,103.85865,18961258,Dialogue,"Dialogue brings together two key concepts. In the mornings and afternoon, we serve speciality coffee from around the world, alongside light bites & desserts. In the evenings we transition into a bar which serves craft beer, cocktails and wine from around the world.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d18961258-Reviews-Dialogue-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 27 Siem Reap', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': 'Street 27 Siem Reap, Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,dialoguesr@gmail.com,+855 78 631 989,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d18961258-Dialogue-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#134 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '134'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/tr