Diamond Mondulkiri Resort,here:pds:place:116w6hnx-c996044ea00249ea8fa9e765a8a5d51d,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Diamond Mondulkiri Resort, 110504 សែនមនោរម្យ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'មណ្ឌលគីរី', 'city': 'សែនមនោរម្យ', 'district': 'រមនា', 'postalCode': '110504'}","{'lat': 12.43437, 'lng': 107.18795}","[{'lat': 12.4345, 'lng': 107.18792}]",120844,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8675053'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515672222', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85566517777'}]}]",Not Available,Mondulkiri,12.433707,107.188126,8675053,Diamond Mondulkiri Resort,"Finding an ideal resort in Sen Monorom does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Diamond Mondulkiri Resort, a nice option for travelers like you.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as Diamond Mondulkiri Resort offers guests free wifi.
The resort features a 24 hour front desk, a sun terrace, and baggage storage. Plus, Diamond Mondulkiri Resort offers a pool and a lounge, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
When you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out Pizza Mondulkiri, which is an Italian restaurant that is popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Bousra Waterfall or Dakdam Waterfall, which are popular waterfalls amongst tourists.
Diamond Mondulkiri Resort puts the best of Sen Monorom at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
