Dinart,here:pds:place:116aabd1-1e6ce5284f68066a0cb41b77ee4b8553,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Dinart, ផ្លូវ 19, 120206 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 19', 'postalCode': '120206'}","{'lat': 11.56703, 'lng': 104.92688}","[{'lat': 11.56696, 'lng': 104.92669}]",6843,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8641873'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517931900'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/dinartcambodia'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 09:00 - 18:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT09H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.567029,104.926834,8641873,Dinart,"DinArt Gallery features the work of contemporary Khmer artist. His signature Apsara images are widely known within Cambodia and in Europe, the USA and Australia. Paintings are available for purchase and he can also organise framing or packaging if the buyer needs to travel. He also does commission pieces if you would like a particular subject painted. Looking for that special travel keepsake, a gift for someone special or if you are leaving Cambodia and want a little piece of Cambodia to go with you? Then perhaps a piece of his art is just the thing for you. He has paintings ranging from 30cm x 30cm on canvas, Postcard A5 size, that you can pack in a suitcase, up to large pieces 2 metres by 2 metres or bigger than that he can put in a tube for safe delivery.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d8641873-Reviews-Dinart-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '19 #126, Street', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '19 #126, Street, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,dinart30@gmail.com,+855 17 931 900,http://www.facebook.com/dinartcambodia,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d8641873-Dinart-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#22 of 164 things to do in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '164', 'ranking': '22'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,65,"{'1': '1', '2': '1', '3': '2', '4': '4', '5': '57'}",Not available,113,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d8641873-m66827-Reviews-Dinart-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '1800'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 09:00 - 18:00', 'Tuesday: 09:00 - 18:00', 'Wednesday: 09:00 - 18:00', 'Thursday: 09:00 - 18:00', 'Friday: 09:00 - 18:00', 'Saturday: 09:00 - 18:00', 'Sunday: 09:00 - 18:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'shopping', 'localized_name': 'Shopping'}, {'name': 'museums', 'localized_name': 'Museums'}, {'name': 'attractions', 'localized_name': 'Attractions'}]","[{'name': 'Shopping', 'localized_name': 'Shopping', 'categories': [{'name': 'Art Galleries', 'localized_name': 'Art Galleries'}]}, {'name': 'Museums', 'localized_name': 'Museums', 'categories': [{'name': 'Art Galleries', 'localized_name': 'Art Galleries'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': '