Dinosaurs Alive,here:pds:place:116w649g-fe4b048b45c847659cec084dee75b723,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Dinosaurs Alive, 121001 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ជ្រោយចង្វារ', 'subdistrict': 'ជ្រោយចង្វារ', 'postalCode': '121001'}","{'lat': 11.59398, 'lng': 104.92689}","[{'lat': 11.59402, 'lng': 104.92676}]",7433,"[{'id': '550-5520-0207', 'name': 'Amusement Park', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '20318222'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855712228855'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/dinosaursalivekh'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 09:00 - 19:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT10H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.593988,104.92685,20318222,Dinosaurs Alive,"As one of the projects run by OCIC Company, Dinosaurs Alive is the first biggest dinosaur theme park in Cambodia that will be opening in 2020. Our park covers more than 25,000 sqm of land which provides a half-day trip for visitors of all ages. Our mission is to provide guests a memorable experience at our park through the discovery of dinosaurs while connecting them with nature & history.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d20318222-Reviews-Dinosaurs_Alive-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Along the OCIC Boulevard of Chroy Changvar, City', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12110', 'address_string': 'Along the OCIC Boulevard of Chroy Changvar, City, Phnom Penh 12110 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info.dinosaursalive@gmail.com,+855 71 222 8855,https://www.facebook.com/dinosaursalivekh/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d20318222-Dinosaurs_Alive-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_