Dirtbike Expeditions,here:pds:place:116w636s-9e547cb0b91d6021e1122b1797ca6a46,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Dirtbike Expeditions, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10058, 'lng': 103.19802}","[{'lat': 13.10045, 'lng': 103.198}]",99228,"[{'id': '550-5510-0379', 'name': 'Outdoor Service', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8770234'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510828189'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://dirtbikeexpeditions.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.100519,103.19801,8770234,Dirtbike Expeditions,"Dirtbike Expeditions offer a truly unparalleled and remarkable journey that can take you off the beaten track and into some of the most isolated and remarkable destinations. You will explore unknown terrain, experience breathtaking views, discover hidden gems, and uncover stories in places that have remained untouched by many. With our experienced guide, you can traverse rugged terrain, cross rivers and streams, scale steep cliffside paths, and experience cultures that are inaccessible to most travelers. There is no doubt that this type of expedition will provide you with an unforgettable experience that will be remembered for years to come.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d8770234-Reviews-Dirtbike_Expeditions-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@dirtbikeexpeditions.com,+855 10 828 189,http://dirtbikeexpeditions.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d8770234-Dirtbike_Expeditions-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#32 of 554 Outdoor Activities in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '554', 'ranking': '32'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,260,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '12', '5': '248'}",Not available,306,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d8770234-m66827-Reviews-Dirtbike_Expeditions-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}, {'name': 'outdoor_activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Cultural Tours', 'localized_name': 'Cultural Tours'}, {'name': '4WD, ATV & Off-Road Tours', 'localized_name': '4WD, ATV & Off-Road Tours'}, {'name': 'Motorcycle Tours', 'localized_name': 'Motorcycle Tours'}, {'name': 'Bike Tours', 'localized_name': 'Bike Tours'}]}, {'name': 'Outdoor Activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities', 'categories': [{'name': 'Other Outdoor Activities', 'localized_name': 'Other Outdoor Activities'}, {'name': '4WD, ATV & Off-Road Tours', 'localized_name': '4WD, ATV & Off-Road Tours'}, {'name': 'Bike Tours', 'localized_name': 'Bike Tours'}]}]",Not available,[],Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,FALSE,32,1
Discova,here:pds:place:116w63uv-89ebb939b6616a309fd90e1cf1cf1fce,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Discova, ផ្លូវជាតិ 67, 170901 បន្ទាយស្រី, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'បន្ទាយស្រី', 'district': 'ខ្នារសណ្ដាយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 67', 'postalCode': '170901'}","{'lat': 13.52003, 'lng': 103.94195}","[{'lat': 13.52003, 'lng': 103.94181}]",6940,"[{'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12005796'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563965760'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.discova.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.520028,103.94216,12005796,Discova,"Discova is your team of global destination management specialists. We’re here to put people in touch with travel - and not necessarily in the ways they might be used to. Working globally and living locally, we go the extra mile to connect people and places with a world of possibilities. We are the experts in our destinations with 95% of our people being locals. The Discova team are passionate about delivering truly amazing and innovative experiences, from simple airport transfers to multi-day high touch cultural experiences and everything else in between. Operating across 14 countries throughout Asia, Mexico, Latin America, and the Caribbean, Discova delivers a wide range of specialist services including ground transfers, accommodation, large group touring (GIT), independent traveller journeys (FIT), MICE, and educational travel.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d12005796-Reviews-Discova-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,cambodia@discova.com,+855 63 965 760,http://www.discova.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12005796-Discova-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#12 of 557 Outdoor Activities in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '557', 'ranking': '12'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,1995,"{'1': '5', '2': '3', '3': '1', '4': '44', '5': '1942'}",Not available,1371,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d12005796-m66827-Reviews-Discova-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}, {'name': 'outdoor_activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Cultural Tours', 'localized_name': 'Cultural Tours'}, {'name': 'Multi-day Tours', 'localized_name': 'Multi-day Tours'}, {'name': 'Sightseeing Tours', 'localized_name': 'Sightseeing Tours'}, {'name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours', 'localized_name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours'}, {'name': 'Historical & Heritage Tours', 'localized_name': 'Historical & Heritage Tours'}]}, {'name': 'Outdoor Activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities', 'categories': [{'name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours', 'localized_name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '28'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '784'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '132'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '326'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '480'}