Discover Battambang with Samol Tuk-Tuk & Motorbike Tours,here:pds:place:116w6364-0259e8feb4fee65316975349eef46354,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Discover Battambang with Samol Tuk-Tuk & Motorbike Tours, 020106 បាណន់, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាណន់', 'district': 'ភ្នំសំពៅ', 'postalCode': '020106'}","{'lat': 13.02484, 'lng': 103.10164}","[{'lat': 13.02497, 'lng': 103.1016}]",1368,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8353185'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593737304'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.battambangtourswithsamol.wordpress.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 19:30'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT12H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Battambang,13.023894,103.10009,8353185,Discover Battambang with Samol Tuk-Tuk & Motorbike Tours,"Hello! My name is Samol, I am 37years old and from Battambang, Cambodia. I have a degree in Management and Tourism and am currently a local guide! I speak English and a little French. To afford my studies and daily living expenses, I have decided to create a permanent tour operation. If you are looking to tour Battambang I offer tuk-tuk, motorbike and guide services. With over 10 years of experience guiding travelers I have a wealth of knowledge that I would love to share with you! Let me educate you on my home town and show you some of Battambang's best sites. ""Unique travelers, unique guide--seeing is believing""",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d8353185-Reviews-Discover_Battambang_with_Samol_Tuk_Tuk_Motorbike_Tours-Battambang_Battambang_Prov.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Number 1', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Number 1, Battambang Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'l