rs', 'categories': [{'name': 'Private Tours', 'localized_name': 'Private Tours'}, {'name': 'Cultural Tours', 'localized_name': 'Cultural Tours'}, {'name': 'Historical & Heritage Tours', 'localized_name': 'Historical & Heritage Tours'}, {'name': 'Bike Tours', 'localized_name': 'Bike Tours'}, {'name': 'City Tours', 'localized_name': 'City Tours'}]}, {'name': 'Outdoor Activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities', 'categories': [{'name': 'Bike Tours', 'localized_name': 'Bike Tours'}]}]",Not available,Not available,"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '196'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '96'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '30'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '128'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,31,1
Ditar House,here:pds:place:116w636k-cbc91ccea20149669a876e9c1ef38e9c,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Ditar House, ផ្លូវជាតិ 57, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 57', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.08597, 'lng': 103.19875}","[{'lat': 13.08607, 'lng': 103.19866}]",11716,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10518067'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Battambang,13.086016,103.1987,10518067,Ditar House,"Ditar House is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Battambang, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Prasat Sneung (0.3 mi) and Ta Dumbong Statue (0.7 mi), guests of Ditar House can easily experience some of Battambang's most well known attractions.
The guest house features a 24 hour front desk, and you can stay connected during your stay as Ditar House offers guests free wifi. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
If you’re looking for a Mediterranean restaurant, consider a visit to La Casa Battambang, which is not far from Ditar House.
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular art museums such as ROMCHEIK 5 Art Space and Tep Kao Sol Loeum Lorn Gallery.
Enjoy your stay in Battambang!
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d10518067-Reviews-Ditar_House-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 149, 455, Kameakor Village', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'Street 149, 455, Kameakor Village, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d10518067-Ditar_House-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},0,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d10518067-m66827-Reviews-Ditar_House-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Kids Activities', 'Free parking', 'Free Wifi', 'Business center', 'Housekeeping', 'Bicycles Available', 'Evening Entertainment', '24-Hour Front Desk', 'Shared Lounge / TV Area']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'bb', 'localized_name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,25,1
Dive Inn Sky Bar,here:pds:place:116w3cse-8d21ec72b12b1525fd0ff4180fabe5c7,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Dive Inn Sky Bar, 180401 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'លេខមួយ', 'postalCode': '180401'}","{'lat': 10.66651, 'lng': 103.52482}","[{'lat': 10.66639, 'lng': 103.52487}]",90681,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27745223'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85568781958'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.cambodiadiving.academy/accomodation'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.666482,103.524826,27745223,Dive Inn Sky Bar,"Welcome to Sky Sports Bar & Inn, your ultimate getaway destination! Perched with panoramic sea views, our vibrant sports bar offers an electrifying atmosphere to catch all your favorite games. Savor an array of local and Western culinary delights crafted by our expert chefs, ensuring a memorable dining experience. Our accommodations cater to all preferences, featuring cozy dorms for budget travelers and luxurious deluxe rooms for those seeking extra comfort. Each room is designed with modern amenities to provide a relaxing retreat after a day of adventure. For those arriving by car, we offer ample off-road parking, ensuring convenience and peace of mind. Whether you're here to unwind by the sea, indulge in delicious food, or enjoy the thrill of the game, Sky Sports Bar & Inn promises an unforgettable stay. Join us and experience the perfect blend of relaxation and excitement!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d27745223-Reviews-Dive_Inn_Sky_Bar-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '987 Tomnub Rolork Road', 'street2': 'Mondul Bei', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '1800', 'address_string': '987 Tomnub Rolork Road Mondul Bei, Sihanoukville 1800 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d27745223-Dive_Inn_Sky_Bar-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},17,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d27745223-m66827-Reviews-Dive_Inn_Sky_Bar-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Beachfront', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Pets Allowed', 'Free Wifi', 'Rooftop Bar', 'Rooftop Terrace', '24-Hour Check-in', 'Diving', 'First Aid Kit', 'Fishing', '24-Hour Security', 'Secured Parking', 'Beach Access']",Not available,Base Hostels,Base Hostels,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'other', 'localized_name': 'Specialty Lodging'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,29,15
Divers Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-6f2dfa0ae09100b33ac19ae09788c36c,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Divers Hotel, 180403 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បី', 'postalCode': '180403'}","{'lat': 10.63402, 'lng': 103.5046}","[{'lat': 10.634, 'lng': 103.50473}]",101882,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1937557'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85534934725', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}, {'value': '+855885869874'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.634013,103.50466,1937557,Divers Hotel,"Divers Hotel is located in a prime location in Sihanoukville, we offer excellent rooms fully equipped so that you do not feel too disoriented. Guests have access to cable TV and the Internet that will let you stay in touch with the outside world. All rooms are equipped with air conditioning, a bathroom with hot water, fridge, fan, etc.​ Le Divers Hotel est situe dans un emplacement privilegie, nous vous offrons d'excellentes chambres entierement equipees afin que vous ne vous sentiez pas trop depayses. Nos clients ont acces a la television par cable et Internet qui vous permettra de rester en contact avec votre monde exterieur. Toutes les chambres sont equipees de la climatisation, d'une salle de bain avec eau chaude, refrigerateur, ventilateur, etc.​",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d1937557-Reviews-Divers_Hotel-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '3 Group3 Village3 Sangkat', 'street2': 'Victory Hill', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': '3 Group3 Village3 Sangkat Victory Hill, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukvi