Divers Inn Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-84cc84481c64090ab06033ff8e7627ce,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Divers Inn Guesthouse, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.60792, 'lng': 103.52302}","[{'lat': 10.60801, 'lng': 103.52312}]",90051,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11908968'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12136096'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855977232626'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.607906,103.52302,11908968,Divers Inn Guesthouse,"The Divers Inn is located in the heart of the Serendipity Beach area, the tourist district in Sihanoukville. We offer cosy budget rooms designed in a scuba diving theme. Its just 2 minutes by walk to the beach and offers sea-view from the terraces.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d11908968-Reviews-Divers_Inn_Guesthouse-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 500 Ochheuteal Street', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'No. 500 Ochheuteal Street, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d11908968-Divers_Inn_Guesthouse-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#153 of 277 Specialty lodging in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out