Dna Star Vegas Resort,here:pds:place:116w62vt-29d5ed433c4c476eb6fde7eaf3c3f813,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Dna Star Vegas Resort, 010901 ប៉ោយប៉ែត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បន្ទាយមានជ័យ', 'city': 'ប៉ោយប៉ែត', 'district': 'ប៉ោយប៉ែត', 'postalCode': '010901'}","{'lat': 13.66519, 'lng': 102.55446}","[{'lat': 13.66557, 'lng': 102.55544}]",51804,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855613298288'}]}],Not Available,Banteay Meanchey,13.663043,102.55222,4951978,DNA Star Vegas Resort,"For travelers who want to take in the sights and sounds of Ou Chrov, DNA Star Vegas is the perfect choice. With its location just from the city center and from the airport, this 3-star property attracts numerous travelers each year. With its convenient location, the property offers easy access to the city's must-see destinations. Take advantage of a wealth of unrivaled services and amenities at this Ou Chrov property. While lodging at this wonderful property, guests can enjoy 24-hour room service, 24-hour security, convenience store, daily housekeeping, gift/souvenir shop. Guests can choose from 337 rooms, all of which exude an atmosphere of total peace and harmony. Recreational facilities available at the property include fitness center, massage, pool (kids), billiards, garden. Discover an engaging blend of professional service and a wide array of features at DNA Star Vegas.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g674568-d4951978-Reviews-DNA_Star_Vegas_Resort-Poipet_Banteay_Meanchey_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Phum Kbal Spean', 'city': 'Poipet', 'state': 'Banteay Meanchey Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '01407', 'address_string': 'Phum Kbal Spean, Poipet 01407 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Poipet', 'location_id': '674568'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Banteay Meanchey Province', 'location_id': 