Doctor Coffee,here:pds:place:116w649g-8bdfe36bd8f5449c8b4ce208ef3f31df,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Doctor Coffee, 081105 តាខ្មៅ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'តាខ្មៅ', 'district': 'ព្រែកហូ', 'postalCode': '081105'}","{'lat': 11.45538, 'lng': 104.932}","[{'lat': 11.45525, 'lng': 104.932}]",15506,"[{'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569811869'}]}],Not Available,Kandal,11.512054,104.89065,27397630,Burlap Coffee Factory,"Burlap is a woven fabric made from jute plant. The building block of burlap makes it unique, strong, durable and highly versatile; thousands of small but strong fibers represents authenticity, humble and simple but strong and persistence, team work and cooperation, innovation, sustainability, green living and conscious lifestyle that give back to community. De Burlap Café is CAMBODIAN HIGH END ALL-DAY CAFÉ which was born in 2014 in the heart of city. We were the very first European style Café integrated with Asian style cuisine. We would like to bring the best of each part together in harmony. Creating the moment of happiness with excellent. Cup of coffee, great food, good people in ambience environment is our goal. It is fantastic to bring great moment to our customers through their food and drink and make them feel comfortable like home even away from home. Food and beverage are not just only the products but our passion. Our baristas and cooks try their best to craft and serving up",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d27397630-Reviews-Burlap_Coffee_Factory-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Chamkar Doung Street 217', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '\t120501', 'address_string': 'Chamkar Doung Street 217, Phnom Penh \t120501 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,burlapcoffeefactory@gmail.com,+855 86 451 555,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d27397630-Burlap_Coffee_Factory-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#499 of 1,983 Places to Eat in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '1983', 'ranking': '499'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,4,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '4'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",97,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d27397630-m66827-Reviews-Burlap_Coffee_Factory-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2030'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2030'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2030'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2030'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2030'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2030'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2030'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 06:00 - 20:30', 'Tuesday: 06:00 - 20:30', 'Wednesday: 06:00 - 20:30', 'Thursday: 06:00 - 20:30', 'Friday: 06:00 - 20:30', 'Saturday: 06:00 - 20:30', 'Sunday: 06:00 - 20:30']}","['Accepts Credit Cards', 'Accepts Mastercard', 'Accepts Visa', 'Delivery', 'Family style', 'Free Wifi', 'Non-smoking restaurants', 'Outdoor Seating', 'Parking Available', 'Private Dining', 'Reservations', 'Serves Alcohol', 'Takeout', 'Television', 'Wine and Beer']","[{'name': 'asian', 'localized_name': 'Asian'}, {'name': 'cambodian', 'localized_name': 'Cambodian'}, {'name': 'dining_bars', 'localized_name': 'Dining bars'}, {'name': 'pub', 'localized_name': 'Pub'}, {'name': 'diner', 'localized_name': 'Diner'}]",Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'restaurant', 'localized_name': 'Restaurant'}","[{'name': 'sit_down', 'localized_name': 'Sit down'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '4'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,21,7
Dodo Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w649g-35e8a87713694b90b1a47c274e58c877,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Dodo Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ ព្រះសុធាវង្ស, 120210 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ស្រះចក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ព្រះសុធាវង្ស', 'postalCode': '120210'}","{'lat': 11.57841, 'lng': 104.92363}","[{'lat': 11.57828, 'lng': 104.9237}]",6593,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6594565'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523999912'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://dodoguesthouse.wordpress.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.578677,104.92337,6594565,DoDo Guesthouse,"See why so many travelers make DoDo Guesthouse their guest house of choice when visiting Phnom Penh. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a family-friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Sisowath Quay (0.9 mi) and Wat Ounalom (1.0 mi), guests of DoDo Guesthouse can easily experience some of Phnom Penh's most well known attractions.
The rooms offer a flat screen TV, a refrigerator, and air conditioning, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
DoDo Guesthouse features a 24 hour front desk, room service, and baggage storage. In addition, as a valued DoDo Guesthouse guest, you can enjoy a lounge that is available on-site. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to parking.
If you like Mediterranean restaurants, DoDo Guesthouse is conveniently located near Casablanca restaurant, Terrazza, and Il Forno.
If you’re looking for something to do, Royal Palace (1.2 mi) and Cambodia Post Office (0.5 mi) are a nice way to spend some time, and they are all within walking distance of DoDo Guesthouse.
At DoDo Guesthouse, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Phnom Penh.
