Dolphin Kayaking Adventures,here:pds:place:116w65rh-51ad30f29494285a6e3c7e72a9b42962,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Dolphin Kayaking Adventures, 100603 ក្រចេះ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ក្រចេះ', 'city': 'ក្រចេះ', 'district': 'ក្រចេះ', 'postalCode': '100603'}","{'lat': 12.48456, 'lng': 106.01676}","[{'lat': 12.48461, 'lng': 106.01689}]",161569,"[{'id': '800-8600-0197', 'name': 'Sports Activities', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}, {'id': '550-5510-0379', 'name': 'Outdoor Service'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13657068'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855887998039'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://dolphinkayaking.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kratie,12.4846,106.01686,13657068,Dolphin Kayaking Adventures,"Dolphin Kayaking Adventures brings you to see Mekong freshwater Irrawaddy dolphins at Kampi, Kratie, Cambodia which is the world best place to encounter such rare mammals. Go Kayak with Lucky, born and grew up in the area, familiar with the river currents/eddies as well as safety/rescue procedures. It’ll be your best day to observe wildlife. Kayaking is the most Exo-friendly way to view freshwater",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g729351-d13657068-Reviews-Dolphin_Kayaking_Adventures-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Kratie', 'state': 'Kratie Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Kratie Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kratie', 'location_id': '729351'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kratie Province', 'location_id': '2366668'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,dolphinkayaking@gmail.com,+855 88 799 8039,http://dolphinkayaking.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g729351-d13657068-Dolphin_Kayaking_Adventures-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '729351', 'ranking_string': '#2 of 20 things to do in Kratie', 'geo_location_name': 'Kratie', 'ranking_