Domnak Monorom,here:pds:place:116w646z-b3c98854dd0c384081644c9ff51e80ba,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Domnak Monorom, 080810 ពញាឮ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'ពញាឮ', 'district': 'ទំនប់ធំ', 'postalCode': '080810'}","{'lat': 11.74609, 'lng': 104.7393}","[{'lat': 11.74622, 'lng': 104.7393}]",51082,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]","[{'id': '800-078', 'name': 'Grill', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian'}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25302766'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598999138'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://web.facebook.com/domnakmonorom/?_rdc=1&_rdr'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 20:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT13H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kandal,11.746078,104.7393,25302766,Domnak Monorom,"We present traditional Cambodian style food and services as well as traditional picturesque exhibitions of Cambodian buildings and artifacts, giving visitors an insight of Cambodian culture and customs. Domnak Monorom is a restaurant at the base of Oudong Mountain, Cambodia. It is located on road no. 51, six kilometres from the national road no. 5 and five kilometres from Odong Market. The Domnak Monorom was constructed in 2022 and opened to the public on 8th April 2022. It covers a total area of two hectares. The Domnak Monorom is considered as tourist place among Cambodians and foreigners.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g469400-d25302766-Reviews-Domnak_Monorom-Udong_Kandal_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Trapeang Putrea Village', 'city': 'Udong', 'state': 'Kandal Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': 'Trapeang Putrea Village, Udong 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Udon