Dream Butterfly Garden Boutique Villa,here:pds:place:116w63gg-46a674793c0942d8b0c407df70816358,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Dream Butterfly Garden Boutique Villa, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35365, 'lng': 103.84478}","[{'lat': 13.35377, 'lng': 103.84483}]",25626,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10333409'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570533518'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.353686,103.844795,10333409,Dream Butterfly Garden Boutique Villa,"Finding an ideal family-friendly bed and breakfast in Siem Reap does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Dream Butterfly Garden Boutique Villa, a nice option for travelers like you.
Close to some of Siem Reap's most popular landmarks, such as The Happy Ranch Horse Farm (0.3 mi) and Wat Preah Prom Rath (0.8 mi), Dream Butterfly Garden Boutique Villa is a great destination for tourists.
Rooms at Dream Butterfly Garden Boutique Villa offer air conditioning providing exceptional comfort and convenience, and guests can go online with free wifi.
Free breakfast will also help to make your stay even more special.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of Siem Reap's popular falafel restaurants such as Sister Srey Cafe, Atmosphere Siem Reap, and The Siem Reap Food Co-op, all a short distance from Dream Butterfly Garden Boutique Villa.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out a government building, such as Royal Residence.
Dream Butterfly Garden Boutique Villa looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Siem Reap.
