Duck Coffee,here:pds:place:116w62cs-6218cb9b84f54d0792f32b2da41cc227,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Duck Coffee, 230103 សាលាក្រៅ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បៃលិន', 'city': 'សាលាក្រៅ', 'district': 'ស្ទឹងកាច់', 'postalCode': '230103'}","{'lat': 12.93047, 'lng': 102.50311}","[{'lat': 12.93055, 'lng': 102.503}]",66065,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855888539168'}]}],Not Available,Pailin,12.035557,102.29308,505166,Koh Chang Cliff Beach Resort,"Cliff face, private beach and tropical greenery surrounds this tranquil and homey 3* resort. There are 2 pools, and the cliff-top infinity pool hosts an amazing sunset view point! Several room types are dotted amongst the trees to suit everyone; from large bungalows on the flat, to a range of private cliff top rooms and villas, perfect for romantic getaway or honeymoon. A glimpse of paradise, this resort is also a home away from home!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g580110-d505166-Reviews-Koh_Chang_Cliff_Beach_Resort-Ko_Chang_Trat_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '36/4 Kai Bae Beach', 'street2': 'Ko Chang District', 'city': 'Ko Chang', 'state': 'Trat Province', 'country': 'Thailand', 'postalcode': '23170', 'address_string': '36/4 Kai Bae Beach Ko Chang District, Ko Chang 23170 Thailand'}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Ko Chang', 'location_id': '580110'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Trat Province', 'location_id': '2099338'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Thailand', 'location_id': '293915'}]",Asia/Bangkok,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g580110-d505166-Koh_Chang_Cliff_Beach_Resort-Ko_Chang_Trat_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '580110', 'ranking_string': '#40 of 90 hotels in Ko Chang', 'geo_location_name': 'Ko Chang', 'ranking_out_of': '90', 'ranking': '40'}",3.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/i