Dv Angkor Villa,here:pds:place:116aabd1-2f25393ca8e906eb2143e1a11a6f03cc,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Dv Angkor Villa, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.36711, 'lng': 103.86167}","[{'lat': 13.36724, 'lng': 103.86169}]",23288,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10683539'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855979623232'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.366805,103.86162,10683539,DV Angkor Villa,"Located along the Charles de Gaulle strip en route to Angkor Wat, DV Angkor Villa offers accommodation in Siem Reap. Guests can enjoy meals at the in-house restaurant or have a drink at the bar. Free WiFi is available throughout the property. It is 300 m to the Angkor National Museum, while the vibrant Pub Street and Old Market are 1.7 km away. Angkor Wat is 5 km from DV Angkor Villa. The nearest airport, Siem Reap - Angkor International Airport is 7 km from the property. DV Angkor Villa offers complimentary airport pickup services. Air-conditioned rooms are fitted with a flat-screen cable TV and a safe. Some rooms have a seating area to relax in after a busy day. Every room is equipped with a private bathroom. For your comfort, you will find slippers and free toiletries. Guests can approach the 24-hour front desk for currency exchange, tour arrangements and ticketing services. This is our guests' favourite part of Siem Reap, according to independent reviews. Welcome to DV Angkor.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d10683539-Reviews-DV_Angkor_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street2': 'Group 4, Mondul Bei Village, Slakram Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': 'Group 4, Mondul Bei Village, Slakram Commune, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d10683539-DV_Angkor_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#162 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '162'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,37,"{'1': '2', '2': '0', '3': '4', '4': '9', '5': '22'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",65,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d10683539-m66827-Reviews-DV_Angkor_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Microwave', 'Refrigerator in room', 'Shuttle Bus Service', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking'