Dy Dy,here:pds:place:116w648f-4a9929e0d2c949dda06777797b50c265,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Dy Dy, 080315 កណ្ដាលស្ទឹង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'កណ្ដាលស្ទឹង', 'district': 'សៀមរាប', 'postalCode': '080315'}","{'lat': 11.40124, 'lng': 104.86699}","[{'lat': 11.40137, 'lng': 104.86629}]",20574,"[{'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570576044'}]}],Not Available,Kandal,11.546839,104.93398,2416996,Hachi,"Hachi, where Japanese culinary finesse meets impeccable hospitality. Under the guidance of Chef Louiz, our menu features an array of sushi and sashimi delights, signature dishes like Umami Toast, Wagyu Hambagu and authentic Japanese Curry. Indulge in our modern izakaya-style offerings, from Ippin to Donburi Bowls, all crafted with the freshest ingredients worldwide and with utmost care. Our serene dining rooms offer a tranquil setting to savour exceptional meals and forge meaningful connections. At Hachi, we’re devoted to delivering not just fine dining but unforgettable moments.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d2416996-Reviews-Hachi-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '26 Sothearos Blvd Sofitel Phnom Penh Phokeethra', 'street2': 'Sofitel Phnom Penh Phokeethra', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12101', 'address_string': '26 Sothearos Blvd Sofitel Phnom Penh Phokeethra Sofitel Phnom Penh Phokeethra, Phnom Penh 12101 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,h6526@sofitel.com,+855 23 999 200,http://www.sofitel-phnompenh-phokeethra.com/restaurants-bars/hachi/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d2416996-Hachi-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#62 of 1,983 Places to Eat in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Pen