Dyvith Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649f-c16d06e555cc4ccdac797ff3564d7c5a,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Dyvith Hotel, ផ្លូវ 1011, 120801 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'សែនសុខ', 'subdistrict': 'ភ្នំពេញថ្មី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 1011', 'postalCode': '120801'}","{'lat': 11.58532, 'lng': 104.87442}","[{'lat': 11.58524, 'lng': 104.87444}]",2243,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10819912'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523977773'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://dyvithhotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.58532,104.87442,10819912,Dyvith Hotel,"See why so many travelers make Dyvith Hotel their hotel of choice when visiting Phnom Penh. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a family-friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Dyvith Hotel offers guests an array of room amenities including air conditioning and a minibar, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available.
The hotel offers room service, to make your visit even more pleasant. The property also features a pool and free breakfast. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Wat Phnom (1.5 mi) and Mila Craft Workshop (Rubber stamp and Making Bath Bombs) (1.6 mi), guests of Dyvith Hotel can easily experience some of Phnom Penh's most well known attractions.
While in Phnom Penh, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Dyvith Hotel, including Tokyo cafe (0.9 mi), The Shop Toul Kork - Garden Cafe, Bakery & Restaurant (1.2 mi), and Ocean Prime Steakhouse (1.2 mi).
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular architectural buildings such as Central Market, Silver Pagoda, and Royal Railway Station (Phnom Penh).
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Dyvith Hotel as you experience all of the things Phnom Penh has to offer.
