Easy Glamp,here:pds:place:116w3ckp-54a6308939db4798a3eee2f6c01d8281,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Easy Glamp, 180405 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'កោះរុង', 'postalCode': '180405'}","{'lat': 10.57216, 'lng': 103.32028}","[{'lat': 10.57203, 'lng': 103.32024}]",111920,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17592754'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855975193349'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.572113,103.320274,17592754,Easy Glamp,"Come and join us for the best vibes while staying in unique accommodation at Easy Glamp! Located on Koh Rong Sanloem in the laid back Saracen Bay district, Easy Glamp offers simple accommodation surrounded by beautiful jungle gardens. Step off the ferry at Soon Noeng pier and you will find our bar/reception, where you can cool off with a refreshing beer or cocktail before we lead you to our peaceful accommodation, set back from the beach along an enchanting jungle footpath. Laid out among luscious tropical plants and trees we can offer you a range of accommodation including; private rooms, a grass roofed dorm or you could really style it up in one of our canvas glamping tents. All are fan cooled, have garden views and share bathroom facilities. How you spend your days here is up to you, as long as you enjoy relaxing! You can hang out at base taking in the surrounding wildlife, which includes hornbills and plentiful butterflies. You can also head down to the bar for drinks!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g2054864-d17592754-Reviews-Easy_Glamp-Koh_Rong_Sanloem_Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Saracen Bay Beach Krong Preah Sihanoukm', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '09000', 'address_string': 'Saracen Bay Beach Krong Preah Sihanoukm, Sihanoukville, Koh Rong Sanloem 09000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Koh Rong Sanloem', 'location_id': '2054864'}, {'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g2054864-d17592754-Easy_Glamp-Koh_Rong_Sanloem_Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '2054864', 'ranking_string': '#24 of 80 Specialty lodging in Koh Rong Sanloem', 'geo_location_name': 'Koh Rong Sanloem', 'ranking_out_of': '80', 'ranking': '24'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,11,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '2', '5': '8'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}}",36,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g2054864-d17592754-m66827-Reviews-Easy_Glamp-Koh_Rong_Sanloem_Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Beachfront', 'Beach Access']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'other', 'localized_name': 'Specialty Lodging'}]",Not available,"['Quaint', 'Trendy']",[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '4'}, {'name