Echo Entertainment,here:pds:place:116w649g-dee4d6e4d1b1479bb612404d73d210f2,en,Nightlife-Entertainment,"{'label': 'Echo Entertainment, 120204 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងរាំង', 'postalCode': '120204'}","{'lat': 11.56569, 'lng': 104.92198}","[{'lat': 11.56575, 'lng': 104.92197}]",6313,"[{'id': '200-2000-0014', 'name': 'Karaoke', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510940230'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.569975,104.92728,8682142,Pride of Phnom Penh (POPP),"Brand new gay-friendly bijou music bar in a great location near the Riverside. One of the most stylish bars in Phnom Penh, with entertainment shows every Friday and Saturday, featuring local singers, fit young men and ladyboy dancers.The beer is cheap (Tiger draft only $1.50 for 2 glasses) and there's a good range of cocktails. Great place to chill and to meet new friends.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d8682142-Reviews-Pride_of_Phnom_Penh_POPP-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '60, Street 15', 'street2': 'between Streets 136 and 144', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '60, Street 15 between Streets 136 and 144, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,pridepop7@gmail.com,+855 89 433 363,http://www.prideofphnompenh.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d8682142-Pride_of_Phnom_Penh_POPP-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#24 of 71 Food &amp; Drink in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '71', 'ranking': '24'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,15,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '14'}",Not available,5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractio