Eco Villa Siemreap,here:pds:place:116w63u4-344fc5e37e98455982674a5e66baa623,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Eco Villa Siemreap, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.37683, 'lng': 103.84106}","[{'lat': 13.3766, 'lng': 103.84101}]",87505,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570222446'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://eco-villa-siemreap.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.371719,103.85408,3799909,Saem Siemreap Hotel,"Saem Siemreap Hotel is equipped with premium room amenities and facilities and services, according to Hotel Five Star Standard. Its elegant and unique Khmer architecture is boosted with cool and fresh air, flower fragrance and a salt-water pool at the center. Every service point is just a few steps away to give its residents perfect convenience in a relaxed atmosphere.This hotel is a newly opened 78-room luxury property just 5 minutes from the national museum, night market and pub streets and about 7 km drive from the airport and the Angkor UNESCO Heritage Site. It is designed and professionally operated to provide its residents excellence in care and hospitality.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d3799909-Reviews-Saem_Siemreap_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Krom 6', 'street2': 'Phoum Sala Kanseng', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Krom 6 Phoum Sala Kanseng, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.trip