Eco-Home Siem Reap,here:pds:place:116aabd1-2e1167e685c10e2e9c7ce5e19c262321,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Eco-Home Siem Reap, វិថី សាលាកម្រើក, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'វិថី សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34381, 'lng': 103.86165}","[{'lat': 13.34374, 'lng': 103.86153}]",204663,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '400-4100-0041', 'name': 'Transportation Service'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8774368'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593585864'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/Teachers-Home-Siem-Reap-970219646383182', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.343763,103.86156,8774368,Eco-Home Siem Reap,"At Eco-Home, we focus on providing great hospitality services with the highest levels of customer satisfaction, we are promoting the Eco-friendly place for our travelers who pass by Siem Reap, and we are educating our local people and the work about how we care our planet for now and the future - we will do everything we can to meet your expectations. Three unique things we do for our guests and family are: 1. Fresh homegrown vegetable 2. No plastic use (Free Drinking Water) 3. Eco-Friendly Place, we grow more trees around house *And more Eco- Friendly projects in the future With a variety of offerings to choose from, we're sure you'll be happy working with us. We hope to see you soon. Staying with us, you feel like home, have many good friends. Also please be informed, we do not have any staff, only our family members help to make this great accommodation possible for everyone.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d8774368-Reviews-Eco_Home_Siem_Reap-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Salakamreuk Road', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'coun