Ecole D'Hotellerie Et de Tourisme Paul Dubrule,here:pds:place:116aabd1-54ac64a774ea0f572b7c123e10a7d9b7,en,accommodation,"{'label': ""Ecole D'Hotellerie Et de Tourisme Paul Dubrule, អេអេច21, 171210 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្រងែ', 'street': 'អេអេច21', 'postalCode': '171210'}","{'lat': 13.38337, 'lng': 103.82365}","[{'lat': 13.38326, 'lng': 103.82358}]",86738,"[{'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1594006'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85595219994'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://ecolepauldubrule.org'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.383941,103.82403,1594006,Ecole d'Hotellerie et de Tourisme Paul Dubrule,"Paul Dubrule inaugurated the school on October 24th, 2002 after an eight-month-long bicycle trip from Fontainebleau, France to Siem Reap, Cambodia. As a co-founder of the Accor Hotel Group, Mr. Dubrule believes that excellent training and stringent qualifications are the keys to the future of young Cambodians. The aim of the Ecole Paul Dubrule is to prepare its students for dynamic careers in the hospitality and tourism industries by providing them with an appropriate curriculum adapted from international standards, under the watchful tutelage of trained professionals. Located in Siem Reap, near the temples of Angkor Wat, the school is professionally equipped to offer its students a realistic working hotel and restaurant environment in which to learn and hone their skills. We have 4 practice rooms in our school. Come enjoy this amazing experience with our students!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1594006-Reviews-Ecole_d_Hotellerie_et_de_Tourisme_Paul_Dubrule-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Route Nationale 6', 'street2': 'La Glacière', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Route N