Elephant Blanc Resort,here:pds:place:116w649s-eda53696e93c4394bb8da6b636e4e203,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Elephant Blanc Resort, ផ្លូវជាតិ 1 212, 121206 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ច្បារអំពៅ', 'subdistrict': 'ព្រែកឯង', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 1', 'postalCode': '121206', 'houseNumber': '212'}","{'lat': 11.53324, 'lng': 104.9855}","[{'lat': 11.53316, 'lng': 104.98551}]",18104,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5484471'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855974893000'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.elephantblancresort.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.533868,104.9852,5484471,Elephant Blanc Resort,"Elephant Blanc Resort is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Phnom Penh, offering a romantic environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Rooms at Elephant Blanc Resort offer air conditioning, a minibar, and a refrigerator providing exceptional comfort and convenience, and guests can go online with free wifi.
24 hour check-in, baggage storage, and 24 hour security are some of the conveniences offered at this small hotel. A pool and a poolside bar will also help to make your stay even more special. If you are driving to Elephant Blanc Resort, parking is available.
While staying at Elephant Blanc Resort, visitors can check out Neak Loeung Bridge (Tsubasa Bridge) (2.8 mi), which is a popular Phnom Penh attraction.
Should time allow, Central Market, Silver Pagoda, and Royal Railway Station (Phnom Penh) are some popular architectural buildings that are relatively easy to get to.
Enjoy your stay in Phnom Penh!
