Em Riem Artist & Designer,here:pds:place:116w649g-4047a0285930435f95cd6bdf9f1dab51,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Em Riem Artist & Designer, ផ្លូវ សម្តេច ព្រះ សុគន្ធ មានបុណ្យ, 120203 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សម្តេច ព្រះ សុគន្ធ មានបុណ្យ', 'postalCode': '120203'}","{'lat': 11.56498, 'lng': 104.9248}","[{'lat': 11.56478, 'lng': 104.92485}]",6624,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592764836'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.565629,104.92761,6432277,The Artist Residence,"The Artist Residence is an intimate residence ideally situated for those looking for a safe quiet space in the heart of bustling Phnom Penh. Set in a converted shop house with touches that evoke the period building's original French 1960s ambiance, Artist Residence is a cozy haven for those who want to relax yet be within walking distance of many Phnom Penh's best restaurants, cafes, eateries and local markets. Nestled on a quiet leafy street between the National Museum and The University of Fine Arts, Artist Residence is a few walk to the Royal Palace, the Riverside as well as Wat Botum and Wat Ounalom, two of Phnom Penh’s most venerable pagodas.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d6432277-Reviews-The_Artist_Residence-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#69, Street 178, Sangkat Chey Chumnas Khan Daun Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12206', 'address_string': '#69, Street 178, Sangkat Chey Chumnas Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh 12206 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d6432277-The_Artist_Residence-Phnom_Penh.html?m=668