Emerald BB Battambang Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-633c6600b3250afee0509421a0e6b68f,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Emerald BB Battambang Hotel, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09668, 'lng': 103.20288}","[{'lat': 13.09655, 'lng': 103.20286}]",12693,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6948190'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577474789'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/emeraldbbhotel', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.096698,103.20288,6948190,Emerald BB Battambang Hotel,"Well-positioned in east river bank, 10 minutes walk from city center, Comfortable beds, Rooms with balcony, start from $16.00 Only 10 minutes walk from the lively Riverside Night Market, shopping center, museum, historical colonial buildings, Emerald BB Battambang Hotel provides charming accommodation in Battambang. Rooms are well-appointed and furnished with a balcony. comfortable beds, Free WiFi is available throughout the hotel. All rooms feature classic Cambodian-style décor. Each is fitted with a cable TV, a mini-fridge and air conditioning. They also have an attached bathroom with heated showers. Staff at Emerald BB Battambang Hotel can assist you with travel arrangements and excursions. Other amenities include a 24-hour front desk, traditional massages. You can also hire the car and bicycle rentals to explore the area. Local Cambodian-style meals can be enjoyed at the on-site restaurant.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d6948190-Reviews-Emerald_BB_Battambang_Hotel-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '207 St Rattanak Village And Commune', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'coun