Empress Angkor Resort & Spa,here:pds:place:116w63u4-ee588dc0969b41b9952fb81cfdead8df,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Empress Angkor Resort & Spa, អេអេច21, 171210 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្រងែ', 'street': 'អេអេច21', 'postalCode': '171210'}","{'lat': 13.37939, 'lng': 103.83014}","[{'lat': 13.37927, 'lng': 103.83007}]",87191,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4827405'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '572957'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515512888', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}, {'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}, {'value': '+85563963999'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.empressangkor.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}, {'value': 'http://www.empressresidence.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}, {'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.380011,103.83049,572957,Empress Angkor Resort & Spa,"Planning a trip, anniversary or romantic holiday? Our Hotel offers you a chance to take a step back in time, where life moves at a much slower pace and the atmosphere is one of calm and peace. Relax and enjoy a getaway with each other in Siem Reap, the ancient City of Cambodia and the Angkor Wat Temples the most subdued and magical CityEmpress Angkor Hotel is a luxurious hotel offering 208 lavishly furnished rooms and wide range of facilities such as in-house spa, gym, outdoor swimming pool and Jacuzzi etc.Furthermore, each room is elegantly appointed rooms and suites are complemented by the finest personalities to make this one of Empress Angkor Hotel'best accommodation experiences. Air-Conditioning, bathropes, slippers and full list of in-room features one comes to expect of a true convenient hotel. Our premium floor offer stunning view across the city and tropical landscape view.The in-house restaurants serve a wide selection of Khmer and international dishes.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d572957-Reviews-Empress_Angkor_Resort_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '888 National Road 6', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '855', 'address_string': '888 National Road 6, Siem Reap 855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d572957-Empress_Angkor_Resort_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#163 of 763 hotels in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '763', 'ranking': '163'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,582,"{'1': '11', '2': '25', '3': '79', '4': '213', '5': '254'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_n