En Hostel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-fdecd028406e07ca083c31a833b7b32c,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'En Hostel, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35946, 'lng': 103.86234}","[{'lat': 13.3595, 'lng': 103.86221}]",23879,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10465638'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855975868808'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://en-hostel.com/en'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.359467,103.86232,10465638,En Hostel,"If you’re looking for a budget friendly guest house in Siem Reap, look no further than En Hostel.
Nearby landmarks such as Wat Preah Prom Rath (0.5 mi) and Viti's Tuk Tuk Driver (0.5 mi) make En Hostel a great place to stay when visiting Siem Reap.
En Hostel is a budget friendly guest house offering air conditioning and a refrigerator in the rooms, and it is easy to stay connected during your stay as free wifi is offered to guests.
Plus, guests can enjoy a hot tub and free breakfast, which have made this a popular choice among travelers visiting Siem Reap.
When you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out Paper Tiger Eatery (Le Tigre de Papier), The Red Piano, and Mamma Shop, which are some Italian restaurants that are popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.
Looking to explore? Then look no further than Pub Street (0.6 mi), which is a popular Siem Reap attraction – and it is conveniently located within walking distance of the guest house.
The staff at En Hostel looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
