Enkosa BNB Wooden House,here:pds:place:116aabd1-d15d4918b068006d1983c699858dea97,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Enkosa BNB Wooden House, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.3702, 'lng': 103.86584}","[{'lat': 13.37033, 'lng': 103.86587}]",22731,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8869452'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512926391', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}, {'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}, {'value': '+85512933715'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.enkosabnb.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.370235,103.86527,8869452,Enkosa BnB Wooden House,"Ms Rathana and Mr Sovann are ready to give a warm welcome to their Enkosa BnB Traditional Wooden House. The House is centrally located, very close to the river, providing stylish boutique Bed and Breakfast Siem Reap accommodation. This beautiful traditional old Cambodian wooden building was brought from the countryside to Siem Reap and rebuilt. The property is set in a quiet private residential area, with garden, outdoor swimming pool and bar/dining area. The house has four discrete bedrooms (with external lockable doors) and is therefore suited to a loose-knit group or an extended family. The whole house may be booked or individual rooms may be booked. All the bedrooms have been refurbished to a high standard, including most modern conveniences, amenities and an en-suite shower room. The owners manage the property and also advise and assist guests with tours, and transport arrangement. The owners also, provide optional lunches and dinners, customised to guest requirements.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d8869452-Reviews-Enkosa_BnB_Wooden_House-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'s