Enocafe,here:pds:place:116aabd1-2889d31fc471075ba7ac90d9777d436b,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Enocafe, 180405 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'កោះរុង', 'postalCode': '180405'}","{'lat': 10.66599, 'lng': 103.27286}","[{'lat': 10.66611, 'lng': 103.27292}]",97473,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]","[{'id': '300-000', 'name': 'European', 'primary': True}, {'id': '304-000', 'name': 'Italian'}, {'id': '372-000', 'name': 'Mediterranean'}, {'id': '800-057', 'name': 'Pizza'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15072026'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855967781209', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}]}, {'value': '+855968871352'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/enocafekohrong/?ref=br_rs'}, {'value': 'https://www.tripadvisor.it/Restaurant_Review-g325573-d7340616-Reviews-Enocafe-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}]}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 11:30 - 21:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T113000', 'duration': 'PT10H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Preah Sihanouk,10.665844,103.27276,15072026,Enocafe,"After 5 years experience in Sihanoukville, we are ready to open our second restaurant in Cambodia, our italian culinary traditions come to Koh Rong island. Our restaurant have 2 floors with 34 seats to enjoy our delicacies... Come to experience the Italian Flavour on the Island. Authentic Italian Sandwich Home Made Fresh Pasta Real italian Pizza Original Hand Made Piadina Delicious Salad&Bruschetta International Wine of Selection 20 Different Kind Of Coffee Nespresso Machine Home Made Daily Cake and Fresh Croissant Huge English Breakfast",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g1808558-d15072026-Revi