Epic Arts Cafe,here:pds:place:116aabd1-ff39103d8264040d4422552e2e88b8bf,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Epic Arts Cafe, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60844, 'lng': 104.18063}","[{'lat': 10.60843, 'lng': 104.18063}]",19650,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592922069'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.607424,104.184166,1540304,Epic Arts Cafe,"'Every person counts!' Epic Arts Café is a thriving social enterprise, with 100% of the profits funding our charity. We believe that, together, we can build a society where every person counts. Founded in 2006, our Café is an inclusive workplace, serving a amazing breakfast and a flavour-packed lunch. In our Creations Shop upstairs you'll find artisanal souvenirs and gifts with a purpose, handmade by our students. Your support will help our disabled students not only learn the arts but become part of a supportive community that believes they can achieve, whatever their ability. Thank you for choosing to support Epic Arts!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d1540304-Reviews-Epic_Arts_Cafe-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 730, Sanath Village', 'street2': 'Central Territory', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Street 730, Sanath Village Central Territory, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,cafestaff@epicarts.org.uk,+855 92 922 069,http://epicarts.org.uk/programme/epic-cafe/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d1540304-Epic_Arts_Cafe-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_loc