Ey Louk Bay Phnom Meas,here:pds:place:116w3csk-3c7bf6228a084fa586df6c7391d5f59b,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Ey Louk Bay Phnom Meas, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.61657, 'lng': 103.54082}","[{'lat': 10.61655, 'lng': 103.54081}]",48053,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570247773'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.622354,103.5419,23356615,Mango Taxi Cambodia,"Leading airport transfer and taxi company in Cambodia. For over five years we have been providing excellent transport services. We are able to arrange a private driver for your trip, overseeing a tour or transfer from the airport in Cambodia. Our experienced chauffeurs will meet you holding a nameplate, will assist you with your luggage, and carefully ride to your destination. As well our company can arrange any kind of luxury transfers - limousine, private speed boat transfer or helicopter flight in Cambodia.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d23356615-Reviews-Mango_Taxi_Cambodia-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,support@mangotaxi.asia,+855 88 802 1888,http://mangotaxi.asia/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d23356615-Mango_Taxi_Cambodia-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#2 of 190 Transportation in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '190', 'ranking': '2'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,379,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '4', '5': '375'}",Not available,99,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g29