Fairfield by Marriott-Phnom Penh,here:pds:place:116w649g-cd637da55fb68f510623aaa01be71200,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Fairfield by Marriott-Phnom Penh, មហាវិថី សហព័ន្ធរុស្ស៊ី, 120401 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ទួលគោក', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារដេប៉ូទី មួយ', 'street': 'មហាវិថី សហព័ន្ធរុស្ស៊ី', 'postalCode': '120401'}","{'lat': 11.5702, 'lng': 104.90281}","[{'lat': 11.57006, 'lng': 104.90286}]",4228,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining'}]","[{'id': '800-064', 'name': 'International', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855236268888'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.570162,104.90301,25325074,Fairfield By Marriott Phnom Penh,"Fairfield by Marriott Phnom Penh, renowned for its exceptional hospitality, offers an ideal destination for both business and leisure travelers. Located in the vibrant heart of Phnom Penh, our hotel is 8km from the international airport and near key attractions like Wat Phnom Temple, the National Museum and the Royal Palace. Guests can enjoy elegantly designed guestrooms with mobile workspaces, 55-inch cable TVs, complimentary Wi-Fi and bathrooms with rain showers. The hotel also boasts an infinity pool, a 24-hour fitness center, an All Day Dining restaurant and a rooftop Sky-Bar on the 44-45th floors - one of the highest in Phnom Penh.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d25325074-Reviews-Fairfield_By_Marriott_Phnom_Penh-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Russian Federation Blvd, 10 Village Sangkat Phsar Depou 3, Khan Toulkouk', 'street2': 'Village Sangkat Phsar Depou 3', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12304', 'address_string': 'Russian Federation Blvd, 10 Village Sangkat Phsar Depou 3, Khan Toulkouk Village Sangkat Phsar Depou 3, Phnom Penh 12304 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}