Family Batcave Homestay,here:pds:place:116w6364-624855220e4247d1acd50af5aa80e727,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Family Batcave Homestay, 020106 បាណន់, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាណន់', 'district': 'ភ្នំសំពៅ', 'postalCode': '020106'}","{'lat': 13.02721, 'lng': 103.10292}","[{'lat': 13.02719, 'lng': 103.10278}]",1097,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15219304'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517790977'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/FamilyBatcaveHomestay', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.027371,103.10378,15219304,Family Batcave Homestay,"Bat Cave Home Stay is a simple, affordable, and very cozy accommodation located 13 km from Battambang town and surrounded by acres of tropical greenery. Here we will provide you with shared bathrooms with hot and cold water, as well as Khmer bath towels. From your private balcony and from all the rooms, you can enjoy a beautiful view of a rice field. A fan and mosquito net are included as well. The Bat Cave in Phnom Sampue is 500 meters from our homestay. The famous Bamboo Train and Banana Temple are approximately 9 km from us, and Psar Nar is 13 km. You can use the bicycles for free. We offer complimentary pickup services from the bus and boat stations.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d15219304-Reviews-Family_Batcave_Homestay-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Road Number 57', 'street2': 'Sampov Kaeut Village, Phnum Sampov Commune, Banan District', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02256', 'address_string': 'Road Number 57 Sampov Kaeut Village, Phnum Sampov Commune, Banan District, Battambang 02256 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Provi