Family Cooking,here:pds:place:116w649d-b8c4ecccc98e4e7ab9273f1e126db507,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Family Cooking, 081104 តាខ្មៅ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'តាខ្មៅ', 'district': 'តាខ្មៅ', 'postalCode': '081104'}","{'lat': 11.48181, 'lng': 104.94955}","[{'lat': 11.48181, 'lng': 104.94956}]",15721,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855969227775'}]}],Not Available,Kandal,11.555969,104.93074,15132814,Banana Cooking Class,"Guests who hunger to learn about Khmer cuisine can enroll in our half or full-day cooking class. Start the morning by exploring a local market where you will experience the hustle and bustle and absorb the flavor of a typical Cambodian market, and return to kickoff your culinary experience.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d15132814-Reviews-Banana_Cooking_Class-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#1/ 4b, St. 21 Abdul Carime', 'street2': '#1/ 4b', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12301', 'address_string': '#1/ 4b, St. 21 Abdul Carime #1/ 4b, Phnom Penh 12301 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,contact@bananacookingclass.com,+855 12 666 345,http://www.bananacookingclass.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d15132814-Banana_Cooking_Class-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 49 Classes &amp; Workshops in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '49', 'ranking': '1'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,192,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '1', '4': '7', '5': '183'}",Not available,68,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d15132814-m66827-Reviews-Banana_Cooking