Family Hostel Siem Reap,here:pds:place:116w63u5-5acf2570b26e827942ac99cc436b92bc,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Family Hostel Siem Reap, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.37366, 'lng': 103.84448}","[{'lat': 13.3736, 'lng': 103.84458}]",24067,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512252210'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.372141,103.845375,13817892,Family Hostel SIEM REAP,"We are a Malaysian Khmer family owned Hostel who believes in providing top quality customer service and value for money. Family Hostel is located in a tranquil area and has a secured surroundings. Wi-Fi is free and accessible throughout the property. Family Hostel Siem Reap features an outdoor swimming pool, sun terrace, garden and shared lounge area to watch online movies on TV. There is a restaurant on-site that serves Khmer, Malaysian and Western food - all meals are homemade and affordable. We have two private suites with queen bed and three dorm rooms with four or six bunk beds. All rooms include a private bathroom and wardrobe - some rooms have a balcony and other have a pool view. The area is popular for cycling, and bike hire is available at the accommodation. We are happy to assist with any information about the area as well as booking tours (Angkor Wat temples, floating village, Kulen waterfall, ...)",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d13817892-Reviews-Family_Hostel_SIEM_REAP-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Rd no 6', 'street2': 'Salakanseng Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'National Rd no 6 Salakanseng Village, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Si