Family's Guest House,here:pds:place:116w636k-604f5954e75b4638948d1c57559b51c9,en,guest_house,"{'label': ""Family's Guest House, 021401 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ទួលតាឯក', 'postalCode': '021401'}","{'lat': 13.08939, 'lng': 103.19162}","[{'lat': 13.08939, 'lng': 103.19161}]",11229,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13371637'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570297954'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.089392,103.19161,13371637,Family's Guest House,"Located in the heart of Battambang, about a 3-minute drive by Tuk Tuk from the city center, Moloppor Villa offers courtyard-style accommodations with a shared kitchen and a garden with outdoor seating area. Free WiFi access is available at the property. Featuring traditional Khmer architecture, rooms and suite at Family's Guest House are equipped with a flat-screen TV, a DVD player and a mini-bar. The private bathrooms have a separate bathtub and walk-in shower. Guests can enjoy meals at the restaurant by the swimming pool. ATM and coffee shops can be found nearby. The property offers complimentary pick-up services from the bus or train stations. Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport is 99 mi from the property. This property is also rated for the best value in Battambang! Guests are getting more for their money when compared to other properties in this city. We speak your language!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d13371637-Reviews-Family_s_Guest_House-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road 57 O Ta Kom Pir, Toul Ta Ek', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'National Road 57 O Ta Kom Pir, Toul Ta Ek, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province