Fancy Guest House,here:pds:place:116w649g-b22e954201e04ff4bcd837bae6e95c34,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Fancy Guest House, ផ្លូវ 15, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 15', 'postalCode': '120205'}","{'lat': 11.56858, 'lng': 104.92742}","[{'lat': 11.56862, 'lng': 104.92755}]",6902,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '887153'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523211829'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/Fancy-Guest-house-457369511429501'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.568592,104.92746,887153,Fancy Guest House,"Finding an ideal family-friendly guest house in Phnom Penh does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Fancy Guest House, a nice option for travelers like you.
Free wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at Fancy Guest House Hotel offer a minibar, air conditioning, and a refrigerator.
Close to some of Phnom Penh's most popular landmarks, such as Wat Ounalom (0.2 mi) and Sisowath Quay (0.2 mi), Fancy Guest House Hotel is a great destination for tourists.
While in Phnom Penh be sure to experience local oyster favorites at Romdeng, Topaz, or Oskar Bistro.
Should time allow, Royal Palace is a popular attraction that is within walking distance.
Fancy Guest House puts the best of Phnom Penh at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
