Farmhouse Smiling Gecko,here:pds:place:116w647s-58f271cf4c15419f85eadebe272e45cb,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Farmhouse Smiling Gecko, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា'}","{'lat': 11.87833, 'lng': 104.60923}","[{'lat': 11.87833, 'lng': 104.60923}]",32085,"[{'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17674860'}]",[{'www': [{'value': 'https://www.farmhouse-smilinggecko.com'}]}],Not Available,Kampong Chhnang,11.891103,104.59003,10303135,Farmhouse Resort & Spa,"Enjoying holidays or just a few days off in a luxury setting and at the same time supporting some of the poorest people in Asia is no discrepancy, it is the promise of the Farmhouse Resort & Spa. By staying at the Farmhouse Resort & Spa, you support the sustainable Smiling Gecko cluster project and contribute to its success. Located in the countryside about 65 km north of Phnom Penh, the Farmhouse Resort & Spa is surrounded by paddy fields and rolling hills. Our boutique bungalow resort is a training hotel and part of the holistic social organization Smiling Gecko. The resort is located in the very heart of the agricultural area of the project. Embedded in the Smiling Gecko Campus, the park-like resort is a place of tranquility where the essence of Cambodia can be perfectly experienced. The Farmhouse Resort & Spa has 24 tastefully furnished rooms in bungalows build in a classic Khmer style and 10 suites in bungalows with a more contemporary touch. All rooms have air conditioning and are very spacious with additional features such as fully equipped terraces.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g23483770-d10303135-Reviews-Farmhouse_Resort_Spa-Khum_Tbaeng_Khpos_Sameakki_Mean_Chey_District_Kampong_Chhnang_.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Sameakki Mean Chey District', 'state': 'Kampong Chhnang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '04455', 'address_string': 'Sameakki Mean Chey District 04455 Cambodia'}","[{'