Feel at Home Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w649e-d63249d1cca64738ad3ca0a30ce37bd5,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Feel at Home Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 29 17, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 29', 'postalCode': '120101', 'houseNumber': '17'}","{'lat': 11.55361, 'lng': 104.92952}","[{'lat': 11.5536, 'lng': 104.92966}]",74713,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7676246'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523223849'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.553508,104.92959,7676246,Feel at Home Guesthouse,"Welcome to Feel at Home Guesthouse, your Phnom Penh “home away from home.” Feel at Home Guesthouse aims to make your visit as relaxing and enjoyable as possible, which is why so many guests continue to come back year after year.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Phnom Penh, Feel at Home Guesthouse is located a short distance from Bassac Lane (0.1 mi) and Silver Pagoda (0.6 mi).
Rooms at Feel at Home Guesthouse provide air conditioning, and guests can stay connected with free wifi.
In addition, while staying at Feel at Home Guesthouse guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and baggage storage. You can also enjoy a lounge. Need a place to park? Free parking is available at Feel at Home Guesthouse.
Phnom Penh has plenty of Mediterranean restaurants. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Casablanca restaurant, Terrazza, and Il Forno, which are serving up some great dishes.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum (0.9 mi), Royal Palace (0.7 mi), or Central Market (1.2 mi), which are popular attractions amongst tourists, and they are all within walking distance.
Feel at Home Guesthouse puts the best of Phnom Penh at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
