First Cycling Tour,here:pds:place:116w636s-43cd4209eede7416aa30446b67a7b29c,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'First Cycling Tour, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.1006, 'lng': 103.19871}","[{'lat': 13.10058, 'lng': 103.19885}]",12550,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13336173'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515984780'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/go2cycling'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:30 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T073000', 'duration': 'PT13H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Battambang,13.100585,103.19881,13336173,First Cycling Tour,"First Cycling Tour Agency offers bicycle and walking tours in the city of Battambang – founded by Raksa Soy and Rida Phin in 2017. Growing up in Battambang, both Raksa and Rida attended the University of Battambang. After graduating, both decided to start the First Cycling Tour to provide tourists with information on cultural, historical and contemporary heritage in their beloved city. Our aim is to help and share with all of the visitors our beautiful and interesting places in Battambang. Battambang is a beautiful city in Cambodia. There are many rich aspects of the Khmer culture. There are many beautiful places, architecture, colorful markets, nice view of temples, fishing villages, beautiful landscapes and fields of rural villages. First Cycling Tour is not just a tour company but a place where we help young students to gain experience by working in our shop. We welcome students who have a dream and passion to own their own business. Here, we share our knowledge and experience.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d13336173-Reviews-First_Cycling_Tour-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'s