Fish Island Bungalows,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-f48e1e522eb04323bca0224049881e71,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Fish Island Bungalows, 070805 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'ត្រើយកោះ', 'postalCode': '070805'}","{'lat': 10.59899, 'lng': 104.17733}","[{'lat': 10.59893, 'lng': 104.17721}]",19561,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]","[{'id': '800-075', 'name': 'Seafood', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12989379'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512539267'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.booking.com/hotel/kh/fish-island-bungalows.html', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.599124,104.177635,12989379,Fish Island Bungalows,"Finding an ideal romantic inn in Kampot does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Fish Island Bungalows, a nice option for travelers like you.
While staying at Fish Island Bungalows, visitors can check out The Old Royal Cinema (0.7 mi), which is a popular Kampot attraction.
As your “home away from home,” the inn rooms offer a mosquito net, a desk, and a seating area, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and currency exchange while staying at Fish Island Bungalows. In addition, Fish Island Bungalows offers an on-site restaurant, which will help make your Kampot trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
While in Kampot, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Fish Island Bungalows, including Rusty Keyhole (0.6 mi), Epic Arts Cafe (0.7 mi), and bARACA restaurant (0.6 mi).
Should time allow, Farm Link is a popular attraction that is within walking distance.
Fish Island Bungalows looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Kampot.
