Five Rose Siem Reap Hostel,here:pds:place:116w63u5-00de906372ef539c06b919c4ecc25f11,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Five Rose Siem Reap Hostel, វិថី វត្តបូ, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'វិថី វត្តបូ', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35955, 'lng': 103.86131}","[{'lat': 13.3596, 'lng': 103.86118}]",23944,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '19736812'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593232651'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.359483,103.86149,19736812,Five Rose Siem Reap Hostel,"Peacefully situated in the Wat Bo district of Siem Reap, Five Rose Siem Reap Hostel is just 10 minutes walk away from downtown Siem Reap. Wat Bo road, featuring cafes and mini-marts is just one minute walk away. A range of other guest houses and backpacker accommodation are nextdoor, providing instant friends and a source of personal experiences and sightseeing advice. The hostel boats a modest swimming pool in a pleasant environment. The hostel also has a cafe and bar with snooker table, which is a great place to hang-out and chill. Chat to the hostel staff, who will be happy to advise you on sightseeing and arrange bicycle rental, tours and tickets. The hostel offers twin, double, triple and family rooms.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d19736812-Reviews-Five_Rose_Siem_Reap_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#0566,Street 20, Banteay Chas Village, Sangkat Slorkram', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17251', 'address_string': '#0566,Street 20, Banteay Chas Village, Sangkat Slorkram, Siem Reap 17251 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d19736812-Five_Rose_Siem_Reap_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#151 of 449 Specialty lodging in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '449', 'ranking': '151'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,7,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '7'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",30,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d19736812-m66827-Reviews-Five_Rose_Siem_Reap_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Free Wifi', 'Breakfast included', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Concierge', 'Air conditioning', 'Flatscreen TV', 'Outdoor pool', 'Free airport transportation', 'Housekeeping', 'Baggage Storage', 'Bicycle Rental', 'Bottled Water', 'Cable / Satellite TV', 'Clothes Rack', 'Currency Exchange', 'Desk', 'English', 'Free Public Parking Nearby', 'Complimentary Toiletries', '24-Hour Front Desk', 'Khmer', 'Outdoor Dining Area', 'Outdoor Furni