Fizz Cocktail Bar,here:pds:place:11656cd5-22a9b32db073f934da08b0e0c1689d04,en,Cocktail Lounge,"{'label': 'Fizz Cocktail Bar, ផ្លូវ 155 8, 120109 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទួលទំពូងទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 155', 'postalCode': '120109', 'houseNumber': '8'}","{'lat': 11.54151, 'lng': 104.91543}","[{'lat': 11.54151, 'lng': 104.91529}]",6317,"[{'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '14199054'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592237550'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/fizzpp'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.559746,104.93392,25745646,Voodoo Boulevard Cocktail Bar,"Voodoo Boulevard is a high-end yet casual Cocktail and Tapas Lounge located in the quiet neighbourhood of Wat Botum, right behind the Royal Palace and a stone throw away from bustling Bassac Lane. Specialised in Cocktails, you will also find here a wide range of craft beers and premium wines, and a tantalizing selection of Asian/Italian fusion tapas. Hidden behind a curtain of tropical plants, you'll discover an intriguing cocktail den boasting an usual interior design with indoor and outdoor spaces. Come and dive with us in a maelstrom of liquid spells and incantations!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d25745646-Reviews-Voodoo_Boulevard_Cocktail_Bar-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '8E0 Long Nget St. 258', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '120204', 'address_string': '8E0 Long Nget St. 258, Phnom Penh 120204 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,voodooblvrd@gmail.com,+855 88 764 7306,https://www.facebook.com/VoodooBoulevard/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d25745646-Voodoo_Boulevard_Cocktail_Bar-Phnom_Penh.ht