For Arts' Sake,here:pds:place:116w648f-a19efe4f11274a0dbac27f6a0944b41b,en,gallery,"{'label': ""For Arts' Sake, 080315 កណ្ដាលស្ទឹង, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'កណ្ដាលស្ទឹង', 'district': 'សៀមរាប', 'postalCode': '080315'}","{'lat': 11.39961, 'lng': 104.86603}","[{'lat': 11.39962, 'lng': 104.86544}]",18712,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517620016'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://anicca-thaddeus.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kandal,11.550718,104.93076,1939800,YK Art House,"Welcome to YK Art House, a small hotel in Phnom Penh that is your very special hideaway while travelling through Cambodia’s capital. After a day exploring this bustling city you can retreat to an oasis of tranquility and friendliness. You’ll enjoy our secluded setting, clean accommodation and amenities such as swimming pool, art gallery, pool table, and bar. The rooms are decorated simply and practically, with a desk in each room and good Wifi. Your stay supports Seametrey Children's Village, located an hour away from Phnom Penh.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d1939800-Reviews-YK_Art_House-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '830 13 a Street', 'street2': 'Sangkat Tonle Bassac', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '830 13 a Street Sangkat Tonle Bassac, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d1939800-YK_Art_House-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#3 of 412 B&Bs / Inns in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '412', 'ranking': '3'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5