G&Z Poolside Plan B Hostel & Conference,here:pds:place:116w63gg-8d0566a1fdad42628d669a09c3747816,en,hostel,"{'label': 'G&Z Poolside Plan B Hostel & Conference, ផ្លូវ 7 មករ, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 7 មករ', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35196, 'lng': 103.85869}","[{'lat': 13.35209, 'lng': 103.85874}]",24770,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+8551798392000'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.gzpoolsidehostel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.354482,103.85787,6920090,G&Z Urban Hotel,"GZ Urban Hotel is located in the heart of the city, 21 Siem Reap hotel rooms are modern rooms and suites with a balcony, which is within a safe and short walking distance to the Old French Quarters where restaurants, bars and curio shops abound. It is also a mere 15-minute drive to the Siem Reap International Airport. Elements of a perfect hide-away await discerning holiday-makers with outdoor swimming pool, a poolside bar, a coffee shop/café, and a snack bar/deli are onsite, treatments by our Massage, as well as diverse Cooking-Class possibilities for discovering Siem Reap, courtesy of the Concierge.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d6920090-Reviews-G_Z_Urban_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Achar Sva Street', 'street2': 'City Center', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '855', 'address_string': 'Achar Sva Street City Center, Siem Reap 855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d6920