GBT 3 Guest House,here:pds:place:116aabd1-0ccc367c084a007f4ef6ea265395a8bf,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'GBT 3 Guest House, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.60661, 'lng': 103.52231}","[{'lat': 10.60674, 'lng': 103.52234}]",105207,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1566295'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516777818'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.606346,103.52225,1566295,GBT 3 Guest House,"See why so many travelers make GBT 3 Guest House their guest house of choice when visiting Sihanoukville. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a budget friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Sihanoukville, Gst 3 Guest House Hotel is located a short distance from CJ Outlet and Jewelry Center (1.1 mi) and Wat Leu Temple (2.0 mi).
Rooms at GBT 3 Guest House provide air conditioning and a fireplace, and guests can stay connected with free wifi.
In addition, while staying at GBT 3 Guest House guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, room service, and baggage storage. You can also enjoy a sauna and an on-site restaurant. Need a place to park? Parking is available at Gst 3 Guest House Hotel.
While staying in Sihanoukville, you can check out a popular southwestern restaurant like Garden Bar, which is serving up some great dishes.
Looking to explore? Then look no further than Wat Krom Temple, which is a popular Sihanoukville ancient ruins – and it is conveniently located a short distance from the guest house.
At GBT 3 Guest House, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Sihanoukville.
