GZ Eden Privilege Resort & Spa,here:pds:place:116aabd1-abf771e37dd60d6db1df68545510847a,en,hotel,"{'label': 'GZ Eden Privilege Resort & Spa, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.37906, 'lng': 103.85754}","[{'lat': 13.37893, 'lng': 103.85751}]",22635,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1932604'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517392000'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.gzedenprivilegeresort.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.379254,103.85757,1932604,GZ Eden Privilege Resort & Spa,"GZ Eden Privilege Resort & Spa has a unique design concept comprising of French and Khmer elements so as to convey a truly one of a kind luxurious Cambodian hotel experience The design of the hotel took over one year while the architect, interior designer and owner worked closely together to ensure there was a tremendous focus on attention to detail, this is clearly evident throughout the hotel. The core values of the hotel are providing guests with the highest quality personalized service, unique and sensational dining experiences as well as a peaceful, quiet and relaxing environment.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1932604-Reviews-GZ_Eden_Privilege_Resort_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '115, Group 7 Benoit Street', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '1200', 'address_string': '115, Group 7 Benoit Street, Siem Reap 1200 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d1932604-GZ_Eden_Privilege