GZ Plan B Hostel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-e6f0103e268c0d34f27aaad9e1362a1f,en,hostel,"{'label': 'GZ Plan B Hostel, ផ្លូវ 7 មករ, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 7 មករ', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35199, 'lng': 103.85862}","[{'lat': 13.35212, 'lng': 103.85867}]",24773,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '817089'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+8551798392000'}, {'value': '+85563964660'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.352096,103.858665,817089,GZ Plan B Hostel,"GZ Plan B hostel features free bikes, a shared lounge and a sun terrace with swimming pool and continental breakfast in Siem Reap Central area. Among the facilities of this property are a restaurant, a 24-hour front desk and room service, along with free WiFi. The accommodation offers entertainment staff and a concierge service. You can play billiards at the hostel. Siem Reap is 1.4 km from GZ Plan B hostel. The nearest airport is Siem Reap - Angkor International Airport, 13 km from the accommodation.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d817089-Reviews-GZ_Plan_B_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '7 Makara Street', 'street2': 'Near the corner of Wot Bo Road and High School Road', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': '7 Makara Street Near the corner of Wot Bo Road and High School Road, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d817089-GZ_Plan_B_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.ht