Gallops Riverside Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-4da63c87e7520e981b0935e982cc2467,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Gallops Riverside Hotel, តីរវិថី ព្រះស៊ីសុវត្ថិ, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'តីរវិថី ព្រះស៊ីសុវត្ថិ', 'postalCode': '120205'}","{'lat': 11.57272, 'lng': 104.92885}","[{'lat': 11.5728, 'lng': 104.92896}]",72934,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11927523'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578776400'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/gallopsriversidehotel'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.572755,104.92891,11927523,Gallops Riverside Hotel,"Finding an ideal budget friendly hotel in Phnom Penh does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Gallops Riverside Hotel, a nice option for travelers like you.
The rooms offer a refrigerator, a kitchenette, and air conditioning, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
Gallops Riverside Hotel features a 24 hour front desk, 24 hour check-in, and room service. In addition, as a valued Gallops Riverside Hotel guest, you can enjoy a lounge that is available on-site. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to parking.
While staying at Gallops Riverside Hotel, visitors can check out Sisowath Quay (0.2 mi) and Wat Ounalom (0.3 mi), some of Phnom Penh's top attractions.
While in Phnom Penh be sure to experience local burritos favorites at Feel Good Cafe, Connecting Hands Training Cafe, or Cocina Cartel.
If you are interested in exploring Phnom Penh, check out some of the nearby attractions, such as Royal Palace (0.6 mi) and Cambodia Post Office (0.3 mi), all of which are within walking distance of Gallops Riverside Hotel.
Gallops Riverside Hotel puts the best of Phnom Penh at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
