Ganesha Family Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-831d82e4e9430a19ee92c1ef7f1578f4,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Ganesha Family Guesthouse, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.1008, 'lng': 103.19874}","[{'lat': 13.10078, 'lng': 103.19889}]",12565,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '400-4100-0041', 'name': 'Transportation Service'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4225019'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592135570'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.100789,103.19881,4225019,Ganesha Family Guesthouse,"Ganesha is situated in the Hart of Battambang Town on the quiet traditional street 1.5! Close to the main Market. Attachted with restaurant and bar with pool table kicker table and boardgames. We have created a different special atmosphere for our Guest that you will not find very often in Cambodia! Our Rooms and Dorms are comfortable clean and well ventilated! Dorms are only for 5 people, 4 clean Bathroom for 10 people! Room's private bathroom! Cold at night! Sitting area on both floors! Ganesha is about meeting people and to exchange experience! Our goals are making Ganesha Guest more aware of the way they are travelling and to learn more about Cambodia. We are not running this guesthouse only to get positive reviews! If you like to learn more about Cambodia, have a new experience speak with people and get lost sometime in a beautiful countryside. Have a great anventure!!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d4225019-Reviews-Ganesha_Family_Guesthouse-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '1.5 Street', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': '1.5 Street, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d4225019-Ganesha_Family_Guesthouse-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#8 of 43 Specialty lodging in Battambang', 'geo_location_name': 'Battambang', 'ranking_out_of': '43', 'ranking': '8'}",3.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.5-66827-5.svg,168,"{'1': '17', '2': '16', '3': '17', '4': '69', '5': '49'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",58,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d4225019-m66827-Reviews-Ganesha_Family_Guesthouse-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Free Internet', 'Airport transportation', 'Paid Wifi', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Breakfast Available', 'Baggage Storage', 'Board Games / Puzzles', 'Currency Exchange', 'Darts', 'English', 'Free Public Parking Nearby', 'Khmer', ""Kids' Meals"", 'Newspaper', 'Outdoor Furniture', 'Street Parking', 'Wine / Champagne']",Not available,Base Hostels,Base Hostels,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'other', 'localized_name': 'Specialty Lodging'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '49'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '44'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '11'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '45'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,11,1
Ganesha Kampot,here:pds:place:116httek-e6f7eb756c980b4f004d9d66c4cf8ac7,en,bar_pub,"{'label': 'Ganesha Kampot, 070203 ទឹកឈូរ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'ទឹកឈូរ', 'district': 'កំពង់ក្រែង', 'postalCode': '070203'}","{'lat': 10.64062, 'lng': 104.17705}","[{'lat': 10.64049, 'lng': 104.17704}]",21742,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592724612'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://ganeshakampot.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.646146,104.1772,1739878,Ganesha Kampot Resort,"Ganesha Kampot has been designed with your spatial experience in mind.. We are an unusually low density guesthouse, of just 9 private units and 4 rooms, spread across 4 hectare, amid rich mangrove and tropical gardens. We welcome you to create unique memories in our hidden paradise, away from the high density and hustle of Asian cities.. Off of the beaten track, your experience starts upon an adventurous transit to Ganesha Kampot, taking a ride through breathtaking scenery, rice paddies and the beautiful surrounding mountains. We are located in Kampot Province, we are on the outskirts of Kampot city center, close enough to cycle, grab a tuk tuk or take the 10 minute drive. We welcome people who seek to immerse themselves in the culture and feel of an authentic Cambodia. Ganesha Kampot offers the perfect serene location for yoga, meditation, photography, reading or the simple luxury of granting yourself time and space, for you! Gaze at the crystal clear Milky Way on the balcony of your very own Tribal Hut in the garden, or enjoy the stunning 360 panoramic views from the top of The Tower. Wander in the incredible tropical garden, take a lazy boat ride down the river drift along in our traditional Khmer canoe or explore the beautiful Kampot countryside on one of our mountain bikes. During your stay here we are happy to introduce you to the extensive choice of outdoor activities, as well as directing you to our favourite local businesses in Kampot. Our restaurant offers both local Khmer cuisine, and Western dishes, all lovingly and expertly prepared by our amazing kitchen staff. We have a large menu for vegans and vegetarians and our staff would be happy to cater for your dietary requirements. Our bar also offers a wide selection of natural fruit drinks as well as cocktails, wines and spirits. Your inimitable stay in the heart of the Kingdom of Cambodia awaits at Ganesha Kampot... See you soon! The Ganesha Family",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d1739878-Reviews-Ganesha_Kampot_Resort-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Kompeng Kreang Village', 'street2': 'Wat Tuk Well', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Kompeng Kreang Village Wat Tuk Well, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d1739878-Ganesha_Kampot_Resort-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#4 of 115 Specialty lodging in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '115', 'ranking': '4'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,308,"{'1': '0', '2': '5', '3': '14', '4': '46', '5': '243'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value