Garden Village Guesthouse & Pool Bar,here:pds:place:116w63gg-fcf5d788be5445fca5ac611625c2738a,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Garden Village Guesthouse & Pool Bar, ច្រកផ្លូវ ហ្វាំងគី, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ច្រកផ្លូវ ហ្វាំងគី', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.3551, 'lng': 103.85006}","[{'lat': 13.3551, 'lng': 103.85006}]",88275,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '609834'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517297777'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/Garden-Village-Pool-Bar-Hostel-802329156486401', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.355282,103.8497,609834,Garden Village Guesthouse & Pool Bar,"Garden Village is the BEST place to meet friends from all over the world in Siem Reap. A picturesque hostel set in lush tropical gardens & near major attractions, Pub Street, Night Market & the awe-inspiring Angkor Wat temples which can be easily visited with the help of our friendly staff & tour desk. Garden Village is affordable with a great selection of rooms to cater for any budget starting from $3.50 deluxe dorms with A/C & en-suite to our luxurious Khmer style bungalow suites at $27 with free WIFI throughout the hostel. Our restaurant & pool bar are open 24/7 & serve a variety of delicious Khmer & Western favorites at amazing prices. We have a large pool, swim up bar with Jacuzzi and basketball hoop. Our hostel is large enough for you to feel free to party or relax with activities such as volleyball court, sand football pitch, slack-lines, pool table, beer pong, movie room & much more. There's always something to keep you entertained!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d609834-Reviews-Garden_Village_Guesthouse_Pool_Bar-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 434, Sok San Street', 'street2': 'Svaydangkum Commune, Stung Thmey Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': '# 434, Sok San Street Svaydangkum Commune, Stung Thmey Village, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d609834-Garden_Village_Guesthouse_Pool_Bar-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#53 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '53'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,884,"{'1': '88', '2': '73', '3': '105', '4': '222', '5': '396'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}}",358,https://www.tripadv