Garden of Desire Jewellery (Phnom Penh),here:pds:place:116w649g-b111592364deddadfefd235c2567f041,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Garden of Desire Jewellery (Phnom Penh), ផ្លូវ 240 52b, 120207 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ចតុមុខ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 240', 'postalCode': '120207', 'houseNumber': '52b'}","{'lat': 11.56019, 'lng': 104.92841}","[{'lat': 11.56007, 'lng': 104.92846}]",7061,"[{'id': '600-6900-0103', 'name': 'Gift, Antique & Art', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '14029208'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511351887'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://gardenofdesire-asia.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 10:00 - 18:30'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T100000', 'duration': 'PT08H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.559669,104.92783,14029208,Garden of Desire Jewellery (Phnom Penh),"Garden of Desire | Contemporary Silver Jewellery (Phnom Penh) located at 52B Oknha Chhun St. (240). Founded in 2008 by award winning designer Ly Pisith, Garden of Desire is a gallery of creative jewellery designs with an established style. The jewellery line incorporates unique shapes and textures in the seasonal collections. Consisting of a wide range of materials from 955 Fine Silver, 925 Sterling Silver and semi-precious stones, these handcrafted silver jewellery pieces exude an impeccable elegant style. Our shops are located in Phnom Penh and Siem Reap.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d14029208-Reviews-Garden_of_Desire_Jewellery_Phnom_Penh-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '52B Oknha Chhun St. 240', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '52B Oknha Chhun St. 240, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'loca