Gardenhotel,here:pds:place:116w3gqz-07293d53957b46069341783f3052f468,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Gardenhotel, 200802 បាវិត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ស្វាយរៀង', 'city': 'បាវិត', 'district': 'បាវិត', 'postalCode': '200802'}","{'lat': 11.05703, 'lng': 106.10525}","[{'lat': 11.05703, 'lng': 106.10516}]",30444,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855977013207'}]}],Not Available,Svay Rieng,11.557676,104.929436,794810,The Kabiki,"After opening our famous Pavilion boutique hotel, we realised, as people with family ourselves, that Phnom Penh needed a resort that was family orientated and child friendly. The historic colonial house we found on Oknha Peich Street with its 3500m2 of surrounding land was perfect. Caring, friendly staff, lots of nature for children to explore, the Kabiki is a place to relax, take a swim and lounge in the sun between days exploring Phnom Penh and the nearby attractions of the Royal Palace, Wat Botum and the riverside. We planted over 500 native trees, many of which we've placed name tags on so you can identify them yourselves.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d794810-Reviews-The_Kabiki-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '264 22 Street', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '264 22 Street, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d794810-The_Kabiki-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#37 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '37'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/rat