Gekko Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-367c3a2b16e6a50db737857fb58c97cb,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Gekko Guesthouse, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.60863, 'lng': 103.52441}","[{'lat': 10.60854, 'lng': 103.52431}]",105026,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2314413'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85534934149'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.608697,103.52448,2314413,Gekko Guesthouse,"We are a familiar, clean and quiet guesthouse under Khmer/Swiss Management. We have 10 Villa-Rooms and 6 Bungalow Rooms. Located on Ochheuteal Beach. One of the most popular beaches in the area. We are offering you high class rooms for your convenience, surrounded by nightlife in the number one entertainment area of Sihanoukville. Our team is happy to treat you with the Khmer charm and service.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d2314413-Reviews-Gekko_Guesthouse-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '23 Tola St', 'street2': 'Group 15, Mondul 4', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': '23 Tola St Group 15, Mondul 4, Sihanoukville Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d2314413-Gekko_Guesthouse-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#126 of 304 B&Bs / Inns in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out_of': '304', 'ranking': '126'}",4,https://www.tripadvi