Gelato and Coffee Lab,here:pds:place:116aabd1-9ce011faccfd0e970956d6608c2ab334,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Gelato and Coffee Lab, ផ្លូវ 11, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 11', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35422, 'lng': 103.85421}","[{'lat': 13.35428, 'lng': 103.85433}]",88648,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]","[{'id': '800-063', 'name': 'Ice Cream', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7354116'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85585757590'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/gelatolabsiemreap'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 09:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT14H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.354189,103.85413,7354116,Gelato and Coffee Lab,"Gelato Lab is a unique new addition to the bustling center of Siem Reap. Located close to Old Market and Pub Street, we offer a refreshing break from the busy streets. Our traditional homemade gelato is made from fresh whole milk, imported from Thailand and slow-churned to perfection. Our sorbet is created with natural cane sugar and never contains preservatives or additives. We have both an in-house and a premium blend of coffee, all natural and imported from Thailand and Sumatra. Our famous chocolate gelato contains 70% dark Venezuelan chocolate for the richest flavor. And for anyone seeking a sweet kick to start the party, try our coffee cocktails. We proudly use the highest quality machinery available to create the best coffee and gelato in Siem Reap. All of our ingredients are natural, organic, and fresh.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d7354116-Reviews-Gelato_and_Coffee_Lab-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Alley West', 'street2': 'Between Sivatha Rd and Street 11', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '855', 'address_string': 'Alley West Between Sivatha Rd and Street 11, Siem Reap 855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,edoardo.todaro@gmail.com,+855 85 757 590,http://www.facebook.com/gelatolabsiemreap/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d7354116-Gelato_and_Coffee_Lab-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#47 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '47'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,1197,"{'1': '4', '2': '8', '3': '16', '4': '183', '5': '986'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",458,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d7354116-m66827-Reviews-Gelato_and_Coffee_Lab-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2330'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2330'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2330'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0900'}, 'close'