Get Cambodia Guide,here:pds:place:116w63gg-30f82ef85b6cbd8805f25859f7dcfcc8,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Get Cambodia Guide, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35636, 'lng': 103.84848}","[{'lat': 13.35636, 'lng': 103.84834}]",88174,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '24035146'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512566869'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.getcambodiaguide.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.356356,103.848366,24035146,Get Cambodia Guide,"Get Cambodia Guide (GCG) is committed to providing the best tour guides, proficient in a wide variety of languages, and experienced drivers for all kinds of Cambodian tours. GCG takes sightseeing to the next level! Our passion for sharing Cambodia and its culture prompted GCG to be founded. Our mission is to provide our insights and knowledge so you can gain a better understanding and appreciation of the sights and sounds you are experiencing.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g12591811-d24035146-Reviews-Get_Cambodia_Guide-Svay_Dangkum_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Rose Apple', 'city': 'Svay Dangkum', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Rose Apple, Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Svay Dangkum', 'location_id': '12591811'}, {'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@getcambodiaguide.com,+855 12 566 869,http://www.getcambodiaguide.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g12591811-d24035146-Get_Cambodia_Guide-Svay_Dangkum_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.htm