Giovanni,here:pds:place:116w649e-17e6571d381ad286c3163196badbcb0d,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Giovanni, ផ្លូវ 430, 120112 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារដើមថ្កូវ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 430', 'postalCode': '120112'}","{'lat': 11.52819, 'lng': 104.91729}","[{'lat': 11.52812, 'lng': 104.91724}]",7287,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25312152'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855966057369'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Fri: 09:30 - 17:30'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T093000', 'duration': 'PT08H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.528154,104.91731,25312152,giovanni,"Art supplies, stationery, gallery, contemporary art paintings for sale, graphic design As a gallery, you can exhibit your works on the walls and easels (free rental) inside and outside the store. 10$ per day (In the first solo exhibition we opened, we exhibited about 30 works ranging in size from SM Hall to No.100). Phone. 0966 057 369 070 236 236 099 236 236 យ៉ូវ៉ានី ការផ្គត់ផ្គង់សិល្បៈ សម្ភារៈការិយាល័យ វិចិត្រសាល ការលក់គំនូរសិល្បៈសហសម័យ ការរចនាក្រាហ្វិក giovanni(ジョバンニ) 画材・文具・ギャラリー・現代アートの販売・ポスターやパンフレット、本の表紙などのデザインデータ制作 ギャラリーは、１日１０＄。店内と店外の壁やイーゼル（貸出し無料）に作品を展示できます。オープン記念の個展ではSMホールから１００号までのサイズを３０点ほど展示しました 山梨県甲府市にあります㈱大宣堂印刷のプノンペン支店です。 内戦で孤児になった方々が働く場所 スタッフやお客様がアートや印刷物のデザインに触れ・作品をつくり・展示し 画材や文具、様々なジャンルのアート作品を販売するお店です。",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d25312152-Reviews-Giovanni-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '11A Street 430,Phum 1,Sangkat Phsar Deumtkov', 'street2': 'Street 430 Street 510', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '11A Street 430,Phum 1,Sangkat Phsar Deumtkov Street 430 Street 510, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'l