Golden Bayon Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w63u5-f5b7f7a75d3c971b6f37222c025b35a3,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Golden Bayon Guesthouse, វិថី វត្តបូ, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'វិថី វត្តបូ', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35997, 'lng': 103.86119}","[{'lat': 13.35992, 'lng': 103.86132}]",23917,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3636364'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517221919'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.goldenbayonguesthouse.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.359961,103.86121,3636364,Golden Bayon Guesthouse,"Golden Bayon Guesthouse has 15 new rooms air condition bathroom with hot water TV + Cable mini bar in the room. Our location very close the old market only 10 minute walking and 3 minute by tuk tuk and all so our service will be provide the breakfast, tea coffee, WIFI in the room and lobby also. Bus boat tickets, laundry, bicycle rental, tour guide arrangement.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d3636364-Reviews-Golden_Bayon_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Wat Bo 264', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Wat Bo 264, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d3636364-Golden_Bayon_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#412 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '412'}",3.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/im