Golden Citadel Hotel Siem Reap,here:pds:place:116w63u5-9ca2679cd5414a8789be61129e902194,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Golden Citadel Hotel Siem Reap, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36539, 'lng': 103.85247}","[{'lat': 13.36539, 'lng': 103.85233}]",24105,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12569366'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855767097788'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/golden.citadel.hotel'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.36538,103.85238,12569366,Golden Citadel Hotel Siem Reap,"Offering an outdoor swimming pool, Golden Citadel Hotel Siem Reap offers accommodations in Siem Reap. Guests can enjoy a meal at the restaurant or a drink at the bar. Free WiFi is available throughout the property. It is 2.6 km to the vibrant Pub Street and Old Market. Angkor National Museum and the Royal Residence are 2 km from the property. Angkor Wat is 8 km away. The nearest airport, Siem Reap - Angkor International Airport is 8 km from the property. The property offers complimentary airport pickups and shuttle services to the city centre. Every room at this hotel is air conditioned and comes with a flat-screen TV. Certain units include a seating area for your convenience. You will find a kettle in the room. The rooms have a private bathroom fitted with a bath. Extras include bathrobes and slippers.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12569366-Reviews-Golden_Citadel_Hotel_Siem_Reap-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road No.6', 'street2': 'Banteay Chas Village, Slorkram Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17251', 'address_string': 'National Road No.6 Banteay Chas Village, Slorkram Commune, Siem Reap 17251 Cambodia'}","[{'level'