Golden Palace Hotel,here:pds:place:116w636e-5bad86ed0e8d4d70881ed441e9e1324b,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Golden Palace Hotel, 021409 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'អូរចារ', 'postalCode': '021409'}","{'lat': 13.0996, 'lng': 103.16252}","[{'lat': 13.09973, 'lng': 103.16252}]",9486,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1474582'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85553953901'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.098864,103.1625,1474582,Golden Palace Hotel,"See why so many travelers make Golden Palace Hotel their small hotel of choice when visiting Battambang. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a budget friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
The rooms offer air conditioning, a minibar, and a refrigerator, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
In addition, as a valued Golden Palace Hotel guest, you can enjoy an on-site restaurant that is available on-site. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to parking.
Nearby landmarks such as White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (2.4 mi) and Prasat Sneung (2.6 mi) make Golden Palace Hotel a great place to stay when visiting Battambang.
If you like cafes, Golden Palace Hotel is conveniently located near Choco L'Art Café, Hoc Cafe, and The Lonely Tree Cafe.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Golden Palace Hotel as you experience all of the things Battambang has to offer.
