Golden Rooster Hotel,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-3ce124dde57c4569b8bacef37c592753,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Golden Rooster Hotel, 180403 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បី', 'postalCode': '180403'}","{'lat': 10.63371, 'lng': 103.50443}","[{'lat': 10.63365, 'lng': 103.50455}]",101913,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2414878'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855979128692'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.633689,103.50447,2414878,Golden Rooster Hotel,"Comfortable and tranquil bed and breakfast. The hotel is in walking distance from Victory Beach and Hawaii Beach. 10 Minutes away from the city market. There are a few casinos and remarkable pagodas in the area. Each room has stunning views of the sea and islands. The rooms are equipped with A/C, cable TV, refrigerator, safe, electric kettle and tea/coffee. 24 Hr reception, free Wi-Fi and parking. To your entertainment there is a swimming pool and two bars are located within the hotel. You can enjoy refreshments and soft drinks at the pool bar or in the lobby bar. Friendly welcoming staff can help you organize your trip to any place of interest for you and book boat trips, tours to the islands, tickets to various destination and much more.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d2414878-Reviews-Golden_Rooster_Hotel-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Group 26, Village 3, Sangkat 3', 'street2': 'Mittakpheap', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': 'KH 855', 'address_string': 'Group 26, Village 3, Sangkat 3 Mittakpheap, Sihanoukville KH 855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_