Golden Sand Hotel,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-f5f1ad84841344688d4b7747c13c4c7b,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Golden Sand Hotel, 180403 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បី', 'postalCode': '180403'}","{'lat': 10.63323, 'lng': 103.50008}","[{'lat': 10.63335, 'lng': 103.50014}]",101892,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+855975589173'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://prediksi369.com'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.608481,103.52498,644628,Golden Sand Hotel,"Golden Sand Hotel is located just a few minutes away from Ochheuteal Beach of Sihanoukville Cambodia. Recently awarded the status one of the ""Most Beautiful Bays of the World."" We have all of the facilities to make your stay memorable and comfortable. Our 134 elegantly appointed rooms and suites are beautifully furnished with wooden furniture and equipped with all amenities you would expect to find in a fine hotel. With a restaurant serving Khmer, Chinese and continental cuisines, a large swimming pool and function halls with the capacity to accommodate from 50 to 180 guests. Our helpful and friendly staff will pay special attention to details. We welcome you to come and spend your holidays with us and let us make your vacation a memorable occasion.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d644628-Reviews-Golden_Sand_Hotel-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'St. 23 Tola, Modol 4', 'street2': 'Khan Mittapheap', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'St. 23 Tola, Modol 4 Khan Mittapheap, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d644628-Golden_Sand_Hotel-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#60 of 283 hotels in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out_of': '283', 'ranking': '60'}",3.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.5-66827-5.svg,356,"{'1': '37', '2': '51', '3': '100', '4': '121', '5': '47'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}}",252,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d644628-m66827-Reviews-Golden_Sand_Hotel-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Restaurant', 'Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Casino', 'Meeting rooms', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Air conditioning', 'Safe', 'Breakfast Buffet', 'Outdoor pool', 'Kids Activities', 'Shuttle Bus Service', 'Suites', 'Room service', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Breakfast included', 'Hot Tub', 'Business center', 