Nearby landmarks such as Wat Leu Temple (1.3 mi) and CJ Outlet and Jewelry Center (2.0 mi) make Golden Sea Hotel & Casino a great place to stay when visiting Sihanoukville.
As your “home away from home,” the hotel rooms offer a minibar and air conditioning, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
Guests have access to a concierge and room service while staying at Golden Sea Hotel & Casino. In addition, Golden Sea Hotel & Casino offers a pool and free breakfast, which will help make your Sihanoukville trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
While in Sihanoukville be sure to experience local lobster favorites at Outback Bar & Bistro or Cabbage Garden Restaurant.
If you’re looking for something to do, Wat Krom Temple (1.0 mi) is a nice way to spend some time, and it is within walking distance of Golden Sea Hotel & Casino.
At Golden Sea Hotel & Casino, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Sihanoukville.
