Grand Elevation Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649e-7ba93189b962412a85ea47afdf09274f,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Grand Elevation Hotel, មហាវិថី សម្តេច សុធារស, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'មហាវិថី សម្តេច សុធារស', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.55265, 'lng': 104.93243}","[{'lat': 11.55269, 'lng': 104.93225}]",59195,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '14961369'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523900906'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.grandelevationhotel.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}, {'value': 'https://www.grandelevationhotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.552663,104.9323,14961369,Grand Elevation Hotel,"Grand Elevation Hotel is situated in Phnom Penh and features a shared lounge. Popular points of interest nearby include Aeon Mall and Diamond Island Convention and Exhibition Center. The accommodation features a 24-hour front desk, airport transfers, a business centre and free WiFi. All units in the hotel are fitted with a flat-screen TV with satellite channels. Each room includes a private bathroom. A à la carte, Full English/Irish or American breakfast is available each morning at the property. Guests can enjoy a meal at the in-house restaurant, which serves a variety of Asian and American dishes and also offers dairy-free options. Chaktomouk Hall is 1.1 km from Grand Elevation Hotel, while Royal Palace Phnom Penh is 1.2 km from the property. Phnom Penh International Airport is 10 km away. Chamkar Mon is a great choice for travellers interested in restaurants, food and culture.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d14961369-Reviews-Grand_Elevation_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Samdach Sothearos Blvd.', 'street2': 'House 128G6 G7 G8 , Tonle