Grand View Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-1f3c62f648870718e6dfac131c064dc2,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Grand View Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 86, 120210 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ស្រះចក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 86', 'postalCode': '120210'}","{'lat': 11.57737, 'lng': 104.91511}","[{'lat': 11.57741, 'lng': 104.91524}]",5659,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '21503094'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '456205'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523430766'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.577263,104.91512,456205,Grand View Guesthouse,"See why so many travelers make Grand View Guest House their inn of choice when visiting Phnom Penh. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a budget friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Close to some of Phnom Penh's most popular landmarks, such as Sisowath Quay (1.1 mi) and Champey Academy of Arts (1.2 mi), Grand View Guest House Hotel is a great destination for tourists.
In addition, while staying at Grand View Guest House guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, currency exchange, and outdoor furniture, and you can stay connected with free wifi. You can also enjoy an on-site restaurant while staying at Grand View Guest House.
Phnom Penh has plenty of seafood restaurants. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Malis Cambodian Restaurant, Le Broken Plate, and Nesat Seafood House, which are serving up some great dishes.
During your visit, be sure to check out Cambodia Post Office (0.7 mi), which is a popular attraction within walking distance of the inn.
At Grand View Guest House, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Phnom Penh.
