Grand XL Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649f-3a80e5f3dd3d40a6acce358bb6a0d34e,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Grand XL Hotel, ផ្លូវ 353 47, 120407 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ទួលគោក', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកក់ទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 353', 'postalCode': '120407', 'houseNumber': '47'}","{'lat': 11.58754, 'lng': 104.8989}","[{'lat': 11.58746, 'lng': 104.89879}]",75065,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9798052'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523880271'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.grandxlhotels.com/contact'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.589823,104.8972,9798052,Grand Xl Hotel,"See why so many travelers make Grand Xl Hotel their hotel of choice when visiting Phnom Penh. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, a refrigerator, and a seating area, and you can stay connected during your stay as Grand Xl Hotel offers guests free wifi.
The hotel features a 24 hour front desk, 24 hour check-in, and room service. Plus, Grand Xl Hotel offers an on-site restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
Close to some of Phnom Penh's most popular landmarks, such as Al-Serkal Mosque (1.4 mi) and Royal Railway Station (Phnom Penh) (1.8 mi), Grand Xl Hotel is a great destination for tourists.
If you’re looking for a wine bar, consider a visit to Khema Pasteur, Bouchon wine bar, or Angkor India Restaurant, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Grand Xl Hotel.
If you’re looking for something to do, Wat Phnom (0.2 mi), Mila Craft Workshop (Rubber stamp and Making Bath Bombs) (1.2 mi), and Sincere Motors Limited. (0.4 mi) are a nice way to spend some time, and they are all within walking distance of Grand Xl Hotel.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Grand Xl Hotel as you experience all of the things Phnom Penh has to offer.
