Green House Guest House,here:pds:place:116w6hnz-d0d1475b03264f3992fae3afa6d34293,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Green House Guest House, ផ្លូវជាតិ 76, 110502 សែនមនោរម្យ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'មណ្ឌលគីរី', 'city': 'សែនមនោរម្យ', 'district': 'សុខដុម', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 76', 'postalCode': '110502'}","{'lat': 12.45649, 'lng': 107.18686}","[{'lat': 12.45649, 'lng': 107.187}]",40844,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3598769'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517905659'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.greenhouse-tour.blogspot.com'}]}]",Not Available,Mondulkiri,12.456492,107.18654,3598769,Green House Guest House,"Welcome to Green House. We are a hotel, restaurant and accommodation in the heart of Sen Monorom and we look forward to welcoming you! We have 50 clean, modern rooms available for a range of people - from the budget backpacker to the luxury. Just up round the corner from our accommodation (which is staffed 24/7) we have a laid back restaurant and bar serving Khmer and Western food and a fully stocked bar with Happy Hour and cocktails every day. We also offer a comprehensive tour and travel agency, able to organise at short notice anything from jungle treks to home stays in tribal villages. We also partner with the NGO Elephant Valley and can offer volunteer placements here. Our service is personal, friendly and laid back and we strive to be the best we can - offering you a wonderful Cambodian experience. We look forward to welcoming you to Sen Momorom!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1893367-d3598769-Reviews-Green_House_Guest_House-Sen_Monorom_Mondulkiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '74 Street', 'city': 'Sen Monorom', 'state': 'Mondulkiri Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '11202', 'address_string': '74 Street, Sen Monorom 11202 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Sen Monorom', 'location_id': '1893367'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Mondulkiri Province', 'location_id': '2366669'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1893367-d3598769-Green_House_Guest_House-Sen_Monorom_Mondulkiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '1893367', 'ranking_string': '#5 of 28 B&Bs / Inns in Sen Monorom', 'geo_location_name': 'Sen Monorom', 'ranking_out_of': '28', 'ranking': '5'}",3.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.5-66827-5.svg,86,"{'1': '7', '2': '5', '3': '20', '4': '41', '5': '13'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}}",31,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1893367-d3598769-m66827-Reviews-Green_House_Guest_House-Sen_Monorom_Mondulkiri_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Free Internet', 'Internet', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'bb', 'localized_name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"['Family', 'Great View']",[],"[{'name'