Green Life Cottage,here:pds:place:116w63gg-911a1d2707c24716a90df7571e714581,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Green Life Cottage, 171206 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ជ្រាវ', 'postalCode': '171206'}","{'lat': 13.32593, 'lng': 103.88142}","[{'lat': 13.3259, 'lng': 103.88155}]",135630,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12653094'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85587399106'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.325915,103.88145,12653094,Green Life Cottage,"Green Life Cottage offers pet-friendly accommodations in Siem Reap. Free WiFi is provided and free private parking is available on site. Each room at this family stay is air conditioned and features a flat-screen TV. Some rooms have a sitting area where you can relax. A terrace or balcony are featured in certain rooms. Each room comes with a private bathroom. For your comfort, you will find slippers and a hairdryer. There is a 24-hour front desk at the property. The nearest airport is Angkor International Airport, 11.3 km from the property. This property also has one of the top-rated locations in Siem Reap! Guests are happier about it compared to other properties in the area.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12653094-Reviews-Green_Life_Cottage-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Tolaka Street', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Tolaka Street, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12653094-Green_Life_Cottage-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap