Green Mango Bungalows,here:pds:place:116w3fhd-7e97164dc5bf4efab5013a7d60dac6b5,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Green Mango Bungalows, 070203 ទឹកឈូរ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'ទឹកឈូរ', 'district': 'កំពង់ក្រែង', 'postalCode': '070203'}","{'lat': 10.67215, 'lng': 104.16571}","[{'lat': 10.6722, 'lng': 104.16584}]",21248,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17756714'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85567244540'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.67213,104.16565,17756714,Green Mango Bungalows,"Green mango Bungalows is a family run business listing situated right on the Tuek Chuu river facing west overlooking to Bokor mountain range. Our Bungalows are nestled amongst a garden setting, and over the river, with balconies on every room. The large river deck is equipped with a restaurant and comfortable bar serving local beer, spirits, and cocktails till late. All staff speak English, and Khmer language.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d17756714-Reviews-Green_Mango_Bungalows-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Village Ordnung Chimern', 'street2': 'Commune Kampong Kreng', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07403', 'address_string': 'Village Ordnung Chimern Commune Kampong Kreng, Kampot 07403 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d17756714-Green_Mango_Bungalows-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#34 of 115 Specialty lodging in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '115', 'ran