Green Ocean Lodge Koh Rong,here:pds:place:116w3ckw-f5747267f8e543b9b18954d18f23c389,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Green Ocean Lodge Koh Rong, 180405 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'កោះរុង', 'postalCode': '180405'}","{'lat': 10.66591, 'lng': 103.27301}","[{'lat': 10.66604, 'lng': 103.27307}]",97481,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7690929'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515364949'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/GreenOceanLodge/about', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.665581,103.272835,7690929,Green Ocean Lodge Koh Rong,"Situated on Koh Touch village in Koh Rong Island, Green Ocean Koh Rong offers simple accommodation with free Wi-Fi access throughout the property. There is a shared balcony and terrace with hammock to relax. Fan cooled rooms come with tiled flooring, clothes rack, safety box, and mosquito net. Rooms include basic private bathroom with cold-shower facilities and towels. Housekeeping service is free of charge every second day upon request. At Green Ocean Koh Rong, an array of activities such as daily boat tour, canoeing, cycling, diving, snorkeling, and zip lining can be arranged. Staff can also provide general information about the island, maps, and assist with ticketing service. There is a badminton, Frisbee, and volleyball free of access for guests, as well as snorkel masks for rent. There is cash out service on-site.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1808558-d7690929-Reviews-Green_Ocean_Lodge_Koh_Rong-Koh_Rong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Koh Tui', 'city': 'Koh Rong', 'state': 'Koh Kong Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Koh Tui, Koh Rong Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Koh Rong', 'location_id': '1808558'}, {'level