Green Pasture Inn,here:pds:place:116d408k-ccda14bdb92a05c676a06924d1435262,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Green Pasture Inn, ផ្លូវ 450, 120109 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទួលទំពូងទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 450', 'postalCode': '120109'}","{'lat': 11.53985, 'lng': 104.9144}","[{'lat': 11.53996, 'lng': 104.91439}]",6307,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '400-4100-0041', 'name': 'Transportation Service'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6409731'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510300620'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.53993,104.91439,6409731,Green Pasture Inn,"Welcome to Green Pasture Inn! Green Pasture Inn is a guesthouse aimed for short-stay budget travellers, backpackers, NGO staff and Missionaries. We are especially suitable for those looking for more atmospheric and authentic Cambodia accommodation. The guesthouse is within 5 minutes walking distance to the famous Russian Market, which is the best place for souvenirs and local food.Thank you for your interest in Green Pasture Inn. As you spend your time here, you are helping provide a positive work opportunity for our staff, as well as supporting many other community development projects throughout Cambodia. We appreciate your business and look forward to hosting you during your upcoming trip.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d6409731-Reviews-Green_Pasture_Inn-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'House 10, Street 450', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'House 10, Street 450, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d6409731-Green