Guia Espanol de Angkor,here:pds:place:116w63gv-6233d12fea823ea85e4b6d0dd21d1675,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Guia Espanol de Angkor, 170501 ប្រាសាទបាគង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'ប្រាសាទបាគង', 'district': 'បាគង', 'postalCode': '170501'}","{'lat': 13.34622, 'lng': 103.97592}","[{'lat': 13.34635, 'lng': 103.97595}]",19867,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12412195'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592988963'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.guiaespanolenangkor.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.346046,103.97587,12412195,Guia Espanol de Angkor,"Kay Mien is the owner of ""Guia Espanol en Angkor"" or Spanish Speaking Tour Guide. He's been providing tours of Angkor Wat and other temples in Siem Reap province such as Bayon, Ta Prohm, Koh Ker, Beng Mealea, Preah Vihear, Roluos Group and more for many years. He's been speaking and performing Spanish tours of the Angkor complex for a number of years.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d12412195-Reviews-Guia_Espanol_de_Angkor-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,mienguide2007@yahoo.com,+855 92 988 963,http://www.guiaespanolenangkor.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12412195-Guia_Espanol_de_Angkor-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#260 of 1,339 Tours in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1339', 'ranking': '260'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.s