Guo Bin Motel,here:pds:place:116w649f-24963f3523d04b81a4090fbd9f130f26,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Guo Bin Motel, មហាវិថី សហព័ន្ធរូស្សី, 120912 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ពោធិ៍សែនជ័យ', 'subdistrict': 'កាកាប', 'street': 'មហាវិថី សហព័ន្ធរូស្សី', 'postalCode': '120912'}","{'lat': 11.56362, 'lng': 104.86243}","[{'lat': 11.56362, 'lng': 104.86233}]",506,"[{'id': '500-5000-0054', 'name': 'Motel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8723214'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523890561'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.563683,104.862274,8723214,Guo Bin Motel,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Phnom Penh, Guo Bin Motel is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its proximity to great restaurants, Guo Bin Motel makes it easy to enjoy the best of Phnom Penh.
Rooms at Guo Bin Motel provide a flat screen TV, air conditioning, and a desk, and guests can stay connected with free wifi.
Given the close proximity to Mila Craft Workshop (Rubber stamp and Making Bath Bombs) (2.3 mi), guests of Guo Bin Motel can easily experience one of Phnom Penh's most popular landmarks.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of the nearby restaurants that are within walking distance of Guo Bin Motel, such as Aloha Ono (0.6 mi), Craft Peace Cafe (1.2 mi), or Northern Vina Cafe (0.6 mi).
If you are interested in exploring Phnom Penh, check out a castle, such as Royal Palace.
Guo Bin Motel is sure to make your visit to Phnom Penh one worth remembering.
