Hacienda,here:pds:place:116w3csh-1b0d521edeb044f19928d230c6b7bc66,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Hacienda, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.56813, 'lng': 103.56014}","[{'lat': 10.56807, 'lng': 103.56002}]",85704,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3783700'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570814643'}, {'value': '+855975870812'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/haciendaotres', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.568423,103.560684,3783700,Hacienda,"Hacienda is located in Otres Village – a scenic up and coming area 1-2km inland from Otres Beach with an estuary, lakes and abundant greenery. A night market, fishing lakes and paintball are just some of the activities available. Stunning Otres Beach is only a 5 minute walk from Hacienda. It is one of Cambodia’s cleanest and most beautiful beaches and offers lots of water activities, island hopping, great food and night life for all to enjoy - from live acoustic music to electronic parties. Hacienda has a bar and restaurant overlooking gardens and a lovely lake. Our food is cheap, filling and delicious, and our bar is a late night haven where backpackers and expats alike appreciate good stories, great music and loads of bargain Jagermeister shots! Every customer receives a Jaegershot upon arrival. Above the bar and restaurant is a massive movie and games lounge with thousands of new and classic movies and TV series. We are also hosting a Mario Kart Tournament every Sunday with four controllers on a Wii Console. Guests intending to stay a couple of days get stuck for months on end (longterm deals can be arranged). Our accommodation options from high to low end are listed below. All bungalows have fans and mosquito nets. Dorms all have fans and storage lockers. 2 Ensuite Bungalows with fan and double bed and private balcony 4 share bathroom Bungalows with fan an either twin or double be and private balcony 10 bed VIP dorm with fan each bed 10 bed Favela dorm which is free of charge after the first night Directions: If you are coming to us from Sihanoukville City or Serendipity Beach, get a tuk tuk or moto taxi and ask to be taken to Otres Village, Hacienda, opposite the Otres Market. If you are taking your own transport or walking from the Otres beach area go 1 kilometer past Otres 1 in the direction of Otres 2 and then turn left down the sealed road into Otres Village. Once in Otres Village turn right through a large metal gate and follow the Hacienda signs. If you or your moto/tuk tuk driver get lost on the way ask for directions from any local or give us a phone call so we can point you in the right direction. Hostel Conditions: 1. Check in is from 1pm and check out until 12 noon. 2. Cash (USD or KHR) payment only upon arrival. 3. Cancellation policy: At least a 2-day advance notice before the arrival date is required. 4. Age restriction: Hacienda is not suitable for children. No guests under the age of 16 will be checked in. 5. Our reception is open from 8am to at least 10pm every day. 6. Hacienda can be noisy at night time due to our bar and events held in Otres Village. 7. We have a dog and two cats who freely traverse the property. Any people with serious animal allergies should not stay here. 8. No outside pets are welcome. 9. Any guests who break Cambodian law will be evicted immediately and reported to the police.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d3783700-Reviews-Hacienda-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Otres Village, opposite Otres Market', 'street2': 'Sangkat 4, Sihanoukville', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Otres Village, opposite Otres Market Sangkat 4, Sihanoukville, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d3783700-Hacienda-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#3 of 277 Specialty lodging in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out_of': '277', 'ranking': '3'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,158,"{'1': '0', '2': '4', '3': '6', '4': '19', '5': '129'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",67,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d3783700-m66827-Reviews-Hacienda-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi',