Hanchey Bamboo Resort,here:pds:place:116w64ur-24f6107d1df7460e9dd68a2c7856fc95,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Hanchey Bamboo Resort, 031008 ស្ទឹងត្រង់, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'city': 'ស្ទឹងត្រង់', 'district': 'ព្រែកបាក់', 'postalCode': '031008'}","{'lat': 12.17021, 'lng': 105.51703}","[{'lat': 12.17021, 'lng': 105.51689}]",26035,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15277613'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855762542440'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.hancheybambooresort.org', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kampong Cham,12.169888,105.518425,15277613,Hanchey Bamboo Resort,"Hanchey Bamboo Resort is a unique hidden gem, nestled in the quiet countryside 20 km from the city of Kampong Cham and overlooking the Mekong River. The resort offers a unique opportunity to practice Yoga and Meditation while enjoying the peace and tranquility of the Cambodian countryside. We cooperate with local NGO, Buddhism for Social Development Action (BSDA), providing training and work experience opportunities for disadvantage youth from the region through our Hospitality Training Centre. Our rates include a la carte-breakfast, dinner with three choices, use of swimming pool, complementary bikes as well as yoga and meditation classes. For our day visitors, Bamboo Restaurant offers delicious and locally sourced Khmer and Western dishes as well as refreshing drinks. We are looking forward to hosting you at our resort in the future.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g25410057-d15277613-Reviews-Hanchey_Bamboo_Resort-Preaek_Bak_Kampong_Cham_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Preaek Bak', 'state': 'Kampong Cham Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '03108', 'address_string': 'Preaek Bak 03108 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Preaek Bak', 'location_id': '25410057'}, {'lev