Hang Mean Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-914cbc83c3dc4d85a7545d74830bfeaa,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Hang Mean Guesthouse, 070803 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់បាយ', 'postalCode': '070803'}","{'lat': 10.61431, 'lng': 104.17865}","[{'lat': 10.61419, 'lng': 104.17871}]",20129,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12385369'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Kampot,10.614444,104.17857,12385369,Hang Mean Guesthouse,"Finding an ideal guest house in Kampot does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Hang Mean Guesthouse, a nice option for travelers like you.
Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk and baggage storage while staying at Hang Mean Guesthouse. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
When you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out Couch Potatoes, Laundry Cafe, and Gulyas Bar & Hungarian Kitchen, which are some pubs that are popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.
Should time allow, Farm Link is a popular attraction that is within walking distance.
Hang Mean Guesthouse looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Kampot.
