Happy Pancho's,here:pds:place:116w63u5-d8ee9a6b50c9411ab1ebe83975515497,en,casual_dining,"{'label': ""Happy Pancho's, ច្រកផ្លូវ ហ្វាំងគី, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ច្រកផ្លូវ ហ្វាំងគី', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35665, 'lng': 103.85061}","[{'lat': 13.35667, 'lng': 103.85047}]",24954,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '800-078', 'name': 'Grill', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85587789267'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://happypanchos.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.355082,103.85023,10109330,Happy Pancho's,"Family-run Mexican restaurant just off Sok San Road (short walk from pub street, behind Angkor Night market) with years of experience cooking Mexican food. Offers fish tacos ($1.50), burritos, nachos, chimichangas and all your Mexican favourites as well as authentic Khmer cooking and some great homemade pizzas to keep everyone happy! 50 cents beer all night and the best frozen margaritas!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d10109330-Reviews-Happy_Pancho_s-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Funky Lane, Siem Reap', 'street2': 'Opposite Garden Village Guesthouse', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Funky Lane, Siem Reap Opposite Garden Village Guesthouse, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,happypanchossiemreap@gmail.com,+855 95 755 486,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d10109330-Happy_Pancho_s-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#437 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Re