Happy Villa Battambang,here:pds:place:116w636k-ce89bc394eca4c35ad2b6ba614a989bf,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Happy Villa Battambang, 021402 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ព្រែកព្រះស្ដេច', 'postalCode': '021402'}","{'lat': 13.08529, 'lng': 103.21553}","[{'lat': 13.08533, 'lng': 103.2154}]",13322,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11911040'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855883833690'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.085304,103.21549,11911040,Happy Villa Battambang,"Looking for a place to stay in Battambang? Then look no further than Happy Villa Battambang, a hotel that brings the best of Battambang to your doorstep.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer a minibar, a kitchenette, and a seating area, bringing comfort and convenience to your visit.
The hotel features room service. Plus, Happy Villa Battambang offers an on-site restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Battambang, Happy Villa Battambang is located a short distance from White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (1.6 mi) and Battambang Crocodile Farm (2.3 mi).
Travelers looking to enjoy some bibimbap  can head to Cafe Eden. Otherwise, you may want to check out an Asian restaurant such as Jaan Bai Restaurant, Smokin' Pot, or Nary Kitchen.
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular ancient ruins such as Prasat Sneung and Ek Phnom.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Happy Villa Battambang as you experience everything Battambang has to offer.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d11911040-Reviews-Happy_Villa_Battambang-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '714 Street', 'street2': 'House Number 631', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': '714 Street House Number 631, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d11911040-Happy_Villa_Battambang-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#25 of 43 hotels in Battambang', 'geo_location_name': 'Battambang', 'ranking_out_of': '43', 'ranking': '25'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,7,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '1', '4': '2', '5': '3'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",16,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d11911040-m66827-Reviews-Happy_Villa_Battambang-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Kids Activities', 'Room service', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Kitchenette', 'Airport transportation', 'Shuttle Bus Service', 'Minibar', 'Bath / Shower', 'English', 'Iron', 'Mosquito Net', 'Romanian', 'Seating Area', 'Wake Up Service / Alarm Clock', 'Washing Machine']",Not available,Not available,