Happy Zone Hostel,here:pds:place:116w63gg-d4c6e0db609f4236924b280f7ea6b7af,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Happy Zone Hostel, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35586, 'lng': 103.85657}","[{'lat': 13.35583, 'lng': 103.8567}]",24590,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10696577'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598609567'}, {'value': '+85599270000', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0000'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.happyzonehostel.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.355844,103.85665,10696577,Happy Zone Hostel,"HAPPY ZONE has 19 spacious rooms with Aircon and hot shower. All rooms has window and receive good natural light. We're located on Pub Street extension, Siem Reap's famous zone - Old Market area: Pub Street, Night Markets, west of Siem Reap river, Super Markets, and other shopping centers. We're about 20 minutes drive from Siem Reap International Airport and Angkor Complex and 10 to 15 minutes drive from city's bus station. Please spend your time with us while visiting Siem Reap and the great temples in the area. We're your friends in Siem Reap, Cambodia",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d10696577-Reviews-Happy_Zone_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 251, Little Pub Street', 'street2': 'Old Market Area', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '13755', 'address_string': '# 251, Little Pub Street Old Market Area, Siem Reap 13755 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province'