Hay Zana Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w649e-251b7c48341c4978a000541d8752a097,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Hay Zana Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 370, 120102 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 370', 'postalCode': '120102'}","{'lat': 11.54789, 'lng': 104.92459}","[{'lat': 11.54775, 'lng': 104.92461}]",6958,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6911077'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855236768666'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.547778,104.92452,6911077,Hay Zana Guesthouse,"Hay Zana Guesthouse is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Phnom Penh, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
While staying at Hay Zana Guesthouse, visitors can check out Wat Langka (0.5 mi) and Bassac Lane (0.5 mi), some of Phnom Penh's top attractions.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, bringing comfort and convenience to your visit.
The guest house features a concierge.
Travelers looking to enjoy some dim sum can head to La Coupole, Sam Doo, or Yi Sang Restaurant Sothearos. Otherwise, you may want to check out an Italian restaurant such as Brooklyn Pizza & Bistro, Piccola Italia Da Luigi, or Oskar Bistro.
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular parks such as Royal Palace Park.
Enjoy your stay in Phnom Penh!
