"Hclub Nightclub, Restaurant & Bar",here:pds:place:116w649e-934160fce54c460b85cd6dcc16a621b5,en,Night Club,"{'label': 'Hclub Nightclub, Restaurant & Bar, ផ្លូវ 308 12c, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 308', 'postalCode': '120101', 'houseNumber': '12c'}","{'lat': 11.55322, 'lng': 104.93094}","[{'lat': 11.55304, 'lng': 104.93094}]",7465,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '300-000', 'name': 'European'}, {'id': '304-000', 'name': 'Italian'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '20349536'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26830188'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855979781110'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.hclubcambodia.com'}, {'value': 'www.hclubcambodia.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 04:00, 17:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T170000', 'duration': 'PT11H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.552983,104.930176,20349536,"HClub Nightclub, Restaurant & Bar","HClub Restaurant & Bar Situated in the heart of the infamous Street 308 - further down the notorious Bassac Lane, HCLUB Bar & Restaurant offers a fine dining experience notable for its top notch quality and service. The venue’s mouth-watering dishes, exceptional drinks, friendly staff, comforting music, and an exquisite open atmosphere always guarantee a perfect vibe! Our international menu of servings curated by high-end chefs and bartenders have proven to leave you speechless and refreshed. Come enjoy at HClub Restaurant & Bar and have your expectations exceeded - a great time awaits!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d20349536-Reviews-HClub_Nightclub_Restaurant_Bar-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 12C Street 308, Nea