Helen Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w63gg-c7df7c4609294f468c5e4c8dcf922b4d,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Helen Guesthouse, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35928, 'lng': 103.862}","[{'lat': 13.35924, 'lng': 103.86213}]",23918,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563768696'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.helenguesthouse.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.35216,103.86105,1949072,Sweet Dreams Guesthouse,"Sweet Dreams is a local family run guesthouse located in Siem Reap just 1km away from the city centre. We offer 24-hour security and friendly 24-hour English speaking reception. We have a big selection of affordable rooms ranging from basic rooms, standard rooms, and deluxe rooms with air-conditioning and cable TV. We also have a restaurant serving delicious food from 6am to 11pm. We have two areas for relaxation: one large terrace in the cool shade of the palm trees and one lounge area with a TV and DVD player, plus free DVDs to watch. There is also a free book exchange. We have two computers with internet access provided free of charge. Our staff are very knowledgeable about the area and are happy to arrange tours, transport and guides as required. Or we can just give you tips on the local area if you prefer to do your own thing. Additional services available include: laundry - $1/kg, free pick-up from airport, boat or bus station in Siem Reap, and coming soon bicycle rental will be available for $1/day. We look forward to meeting you. Nini, family and staff.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1949072-Reviews-Sweet_Dreams_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#0126 Wat Bo Street', 'street2': 'Salakamreuk', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap 