Heng Heng Guesthouse and Restuarant,here:pds:place:116w65rh-0dd53097b76e45768e865b7d00f0c22f,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Heng Heng Guesthouse and Restuarant, 100603 ក្រចេះ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ក្រចេះ', 'city': 'ក្រចេះ', 'district': 'ក្រចេះ', 'postalCode': '100603'}","{'lat': 12.48368, 'lng': 106.01737}","[{'lat': 12.4838, 'lng': 106.01732}]",23781,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2089960'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855978908111'}]}],Not Available,Kratie,12.483739,106.01736,2089960,Heng Heng Guesthouse And Restuarant,"Looking for a place to stay in Kratie ? Then look no further than Heng Heng Guesthouse And Restuarant, a budget friendly guest house that brings the best of Kratie  to your doorstep.
Heng Heng Guesthouse And Restuarant offers guests an array of room amenities including a desk and a seating area, and getting online is possible, as internet access is available.
The guest house offers a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and baggage storage, to make your visit even more pleasant. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to parking.
Given the close proximity to Phnom Sombok (2.0 mi), guests of Heng Heng Guesthouse And Restuarant can easily experience one of Kratie's most popular landmarks.
While in Kratie , you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Heng Heng Guesthouse And Restuarant, including Le Tonlé Restaurant and Guesthouse (0.5 mi), Sorya Cafe (0.4 mi), and Tokae Restaurant (0.1 mi).
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Heng Heng Guesthouse And Restuarant as you experience everything Kratie  has to offer.
