Heng Sambath Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-e57d21fb91db46ffa8db5bc31745eba8,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Heng Sambath Guesthouse, 070802 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'ក្រាំងអំពិល', 'postalCode': '070802'}","{'lat': 10.61389, 'lng': 104.18209}","[{'lat': 10.61391, 'lng': 104.18195}]",25391,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5517368'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Kampot,10.613904,104.182,5517368,Heng Sambath Guesthouse,"If you’re looking for a budget friendly small hotel in Kampot, look no further than Heng Sambath Guesthouse.
As your “home away from home,” the small hotel rooms offer air conditioning and a desk, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, room service, and currency exchange while staying at Heng Sambath Guesthouse. And, as an added convenience, there is parking available to guests.
While in Kampot be sure to experience local shrimp favorites at Rusty Keyhole or Veronica's Kitchen.
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular historic sites such as The Old Royal Cinema.
The staff at Heng Sambath Guesthouse looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
