Here Be Dragons,here:pds:place:116w636k-a3247517dad04c918f2c1388ebda7dfb,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Here Be Dragons, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09423, 'lng': 103.20046}","[{'lat': 13.09419, 'lng': 103.20033}]",12327,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3634032'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85589264895'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://herebedragonsbattambang.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.094242,103.2005,3634032,Here Be Dragons,"Battambang's backpacker hangout, on the banks of the Sangker River. Swap stories with other travellers at our late-night bar over a cheap cocktail or an ice-cold beer. Or, if you just want to relax after the bustle of Bangkok or Siem Reap, kick back in a hammock in our beautiful garden or chill on our rooftop. We serve Khmer and some Western food, and a great Full English breakfast. We have yoga classes 3 times a week and theme nights (pub quiz, open mic, cocktail party, movie night). We also have board games and a book swap - all you need to relax and have a good time :)",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d3634032-Reviews-Here_Be_Dragons-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Near Wat Sangker', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'Near Wat Sangker, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d3634032-Here_Be_Dragons-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'rank