Hi-Land Hotel,here:pds:place:116httek-f007bc4fa55400135d854637b10b0c8d,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Hi-Land Hotel, ផ្លូវ 10 ប៊, 120802 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'សែនសុខ', 'subdistrict': 'ទឹកថ្លា', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 10 ប៊', 'postalCode': '120802'}","{'lat': 11.55873, 'lng': 104.88702}","[{'lat': 11.55848, 'lng': 104.88698}]",2699,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523999877'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.hilandhotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.560859,104.88915,2480776,Hi-Land Hotel,"Welcome to Hi-Land Hotel, your Phnom Penh “home away from home.” Hi-Land Hotel aims to make your visit as relaxing and enjoyable as possible, which is why so many guests continue to come back year after year.
While staying at Hi-Land Hotel, visitors can check out Central Market (1.9 mi) and Wat Langka (2.1 mi), some of Phnom Penh's top attractions.
Guest rooms offer air conditioning, a minibar, and a refrigerator, and Hi-Land Hotel makes getting online easy as free wifi is available.
You can also take advantage of some of the amenities offered by the hotel, including a concierge, room service, and a coffee shop. In addition, guests can enjoy an on-site restaurant during their visit. As an added convenience, there is parking available to guests.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the Italian restaurants, including Brooklyn Pizza & Bistro, Piccola Italia Da Luigi, and Oskar Bistro, all of which are a short distance from Hi-Land Hotel.
Should time allow, Mila Craft Workshop (Rubber stamp and Making Bath Bombs) is a popular attraction that is within walking distance.
Hi-Land Hotel puts the best of Phnom Penh at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
