Hidden Cambodia Adventure Tours (Art Tours and Cycling Adventures.),here:pds:place:116d408k-748ec1f988aa028efe8ba011ef07ab74,en,tourist-attraction,"{'label': 'Hidden Cambodia Adventure Tours, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37664, 'lng': 103.86494}","[{'lat': 13.37677, 'lng': 103.86495}]",22269,"[{'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}, {'id': '400-4100-0041', 'name': 'Transportation Service'}, {'id': '550-5510-0379', 'name': 'Outdoor Service'}, {'id': '700-7460-0115', 'name': 'Tourist Information'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '951727'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512369087', 'categories': [{'id': '700-7460-0115'}]}, {'value': '+85512655201', 'categories': [{'id': '700-7400-0133'}, {'id': '700-7460-0115'}]}, {'value': '+85512934412'}, {'value': '+85592315002', 'categories': [{'id': '400-4100-0041'}]}, {'value': '+85598457262', 'categories': [{'id': '700-7400-0133'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.hiddencambodia.com', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}, {'id': '550-5510-0379'}, {'id': '700-7400-0133'}, {'id': '700-7460-0115'}]}, {'value': 'http://www.jayavarmanadventurer.com', 'categories': [{'id': '700-7400-0133'}]}, {'value': 'https://angkoradventuretransportation.000webhostapp.com', 'categories': [{'id': '400-4100-0041'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}, {'id': '550-5510-0379'}, {'id': '700-7400-0133'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:00 - 19:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT13H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.376668,103.86494,951727,Hidden Cambodia Adventure Tours,"Est in 2001, this award wining Irish Cambodian company blazed the way for adventure day & multi-day tours throughout the country. We welcome learners to experienced offriders for dual sport, endure & dirt bike training motorbike tours with Honda XR250, Yamaha WR250 & KTM 4600 motorbikes. An experienced team. Land cruiser & Lexus 4WD vehicles ( self drive or be driven) Busses & minibuses to hand picked rural areas of interest. Kulen Mt, Preah Vihear, Koh Ker & Preah Khan remain popular . We introduced smaller 125CC Honda Dream motorbike tours in 2017. We offer trekking & remote tent camping near temple ruins & tour to eco tourism communities such as Chi Phat, Cardamom Mts . Corporate retreats, stags & humanitarian packages, tailor made are popular. Our stilted wooden property, Koh Ker Jungle Lodge Homestay, in Koh Ker Village , Preah Vihear Province supports the community & hosts many of our guests for exciting overnight tours. Tours throughout the Kingdom. Committed to Excellence.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d951727-Reviews-Hidden_Cambodia_Adventure_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Cheas Road, Phum Trang Village, Slokram', 'street2': 'Road to Angkor, turn onto Route 60, near Le Méridien Angkor', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17000', 'address_string': 'Cheas Road, Phum Trang Village, Slokram Road to Angkor, turn onto Route 60, near Le Méridien Angkor, Siem Reap 17000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,hiddencambodia@yahoo.com,+855 12 934 412,http://www.hiddencambodia.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d951727-Hidden_Cambodia_Adventure_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#44 of 557 Outdoor Activities in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '557', 'ranking': '44'}",5,https://www.trip