High Sky Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-8bb7e6e204dd0a1853bb583527eb7ea8,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'High Sky Hotel, 121001 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ជ្រោយចង្វារ', 'subdistrict': 'ជ្រោយចង្វារ', 'postalCode': '121001'}","{'lat': 11.6016, 'lng': 104.93261}","[{'lat': 11.60171, 'lng': 104.93253}]",69998,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3773048'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523966111'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.60154,104.93263,3773048,High Sky Hotel,"If you’re looking for a luxury hotel in Phnom Penh, look no further than High Sky Hotel.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Phnom Penh, High Sky Hotel is located a short distance from Cambodia Post Office (1.9 mi) and Al-Serkal Mosque (2.0 mi).
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as High Sky Hotel offers guests free wifi.
The hotel features a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and room service. Plus, High Sky Hotel offers a pool and an on-site restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of Phnom Penh's popular tapas restaurants such as Romdeng, Friends the Restaurant, and Chinese House, all a short distance from High Sky Hotel.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Darussalam Mosque (Masjid Darussalam) (1.1 mi), which is a popular attraction amongst tourists, and it is within walking distance.
The staff at High Sky Hotel looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d3773048-Reviews-High_Sky_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road 6A', 'street2': 'Kean Klieng', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'National Road 6A Kean Klieng, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d3773048-High_Sky_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#280 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '280'}",3,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.0-66827-5.svg,42,"{'1': '6', '2': '9', '3': '9', '4': '7', '5': '11'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}}",71,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d3773048-m66827-Reviews-High_Sky_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Restaurant', 'Air con