Hok Tour Guide,here:pds:place:116w63gu-ca0697525cc9e6d036287d5685e8ffe8,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Hok Tour Guide, ផ្លូវ ជាស៊ីម, 171206 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ជ្រាវ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ជាស៊ីម', 'postalCode': '171206'}","{'lat': 13.3415, 'lng': 103.88752}","[{'lat': 13.34137, 'lng': 103.88751}]",116207,"[{'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12711943'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512429333'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.hoktourguide.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.341392,103.88751,12711943,Hok Cambodia Journeys,"Hello! My name is Mr. Heng Seng Hok, and I am the founder of Hok Cambodia Journeys. I am a fully qualified English tour guide in Cambodia with 22 years of experience in the tourism industry, including roles as a tourist taxi driver and tour guide. I specialize in organizing tours and sightseeing in Cambodia, particularly in the Siem Reap Angkor region. 

My expertise includes guiding you through Siem Reap Angkor and other provinces that are worth visiting. In addition to the temples, there are many other things to explore, such as local villages, markets, street food, home dinners, and the floating village. Cambodia is a country rich in culture, history, and tradition. Many travelers wish to venture beyond the glory of the temples to discover our captivating Kingdom.

Hok Cambodia Journeys provides tours in English for your wonderful holiday. We are flexible and reliable tour guides, with honest and friendly drivers and comfortable, safe transportation and excellent Hotels.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d12711943-Reviews-Hok_Cambodia_Journeys-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Chea Sim Road', 'street2': 'Chea Sim Road', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Chea Sim Road Chea Sim Road, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,hokadventuretour@gmail.com,+855 12 429 333,http://www.hokcambodiajourneys.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12711943-Hok_Cambodia_Journeys-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#79 of 557 Outdoor Activities in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '557', 'ranking': '79'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,84,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '3', '5': '81'}",Not available,199,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d12711943-m66827-Reviews-Hok_Cambodia_Journeys-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '23