Holiday Poipet,here:pds:place:116w62vt-9467758156fe40f88a14c92da38daf16,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Holiday Poipet, 010901 ប៉ោយប៉ែត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បន្ទាយមានជ័យ', 'city': 'ប៉ោយប៉ែត', 'district': 'ប៉ោយប៉ែត', 'postalCode': '010901'}","{'lat': 13.66121, 'lng': 102.55033}","[{'lat': 13.66129, 'lng': 102.55022}]",52275,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8696325'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855892012828'}]}],Not Available,Banteay Meanchey,13.660787,102.55031,8696325,Holiday Poipet,"See why so many travelers make Holiday Poipet their boutique hotel of choice when visiting Poipet. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
As your “home away from home,” the boutique hotel rooms offer air conditioning, a refrigerator, and a minibar.
Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and room service while staying at Holiday Poipet. In addition, Holiday Poipet offers a hot tub and a lounge, which will help make your Poipet trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is parking available to guests.
While staying in Poipet, you can check out a popular cafe like Palm Coffee, which is serving up some great dishes.
At Holiday Poipet, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Poipet.
