Home Stone Resort,here:pds:place:116w6367-73136d664d7c45fcb5af1847cf992cf7,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Home Stone Resort, ផ្លូវជាតិ 57, 021408 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'វត្តគរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 57', 'postalCode': '021408'}","{'lat': 13.07851, 'lng': 103.18177}","[{'lat': 13.0786, 'lng': 103.18167}]",9702,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '14064467'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '14915437'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85585959588'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://homestoneresort.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.078501,103.181786,14064467,Home Stone Resort,"Located in Battambang, Home Stone Resort offers a garden. Located around 2.9 km from Borey Thmey Mall, the resort with free WiFi is also 3.2 km away from Riverside Nights Market. Guests can enjoy Cambodian dishes at the restaurant or have a drink at the bar. All guest rooms features air conditioning, a flat-screen TV with satellite channels, a fridge, a coffee machine, a bath, free toiletries and a desk. All rooms have a private bathroom, while some feature a pool view. At the resort, rooms are equipped with a seating area. Home Stone Resort has an outdoor pool. The accommodation offers a business center for guest use. Battambang Museum is 3.4 km from Home Stone Resort, while Colonial Buildings is 3.5 km from the property.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d14064467-Reviews-Home_Stone_Resort-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Road Natinal 10', 'street2': 'Damnak Luong Village, Sangkat Wat Ko', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'Road Natinal 10 Damnak Luong Village, Sangkat Wat Ko, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[