Home Store & Cafe,here:pds:place:116w63u5-fdadf154157946aa999a8a6830c18012,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Home Store & Cafe, ផ្លូវជាតិ 6, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 6', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.3667, 'lng': 103.85}","[{'lat': 13.36671, 'lng': 103.85001}]",24185,"[{'id': '600-6300-0066', 'name': 'Grocery', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining'}, {'id': '700-7400-0285', 'name': 'Internet Cafe'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512776250'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.354952,103.85435,10150811,SALASUSU Store,"SUSU is an ethical fashion brand produced at SALASUSU Community Factory in Kchass village Cambodia. 'SUSU' is the Cambodian word for 'encourage' and 'SALA' means 'school'. Producers come to our factory everyday to create beautiful products, as well as develop their life skills through our training programs. We use the unique Cambodian material 'rush' in our products which is handwoven and dyed at our Community Factory. Everyday a lot of 'SUSU’ can be heard in our small factory as producers’ journeys move forward towards a brighter future. We hope our products, filled with their bravery, encourage your own special journey.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d10150811-Reviews-SALASUSU_Store-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '3-4 Street Street 11', 'street2': 'Krong', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '63000', 'address_string': '3-4 Street Street 11 Krong, Siem Reap 63000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,enterprise@salasusu.com,+855 16 808 712,http://salasusuenterprise.c