Homeland Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-78dd9559b3da0485fdc0a3e1f849fecb,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Homeland Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 304 15, 120104 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 304', 'postalCode': '120104', 'houseNumber': '15'}","{'lat': 11.55167, 'lng': 104.91942}","[{'lat': 11.55153, 'lng': 104.91943}]",6293,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4107203'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523987698'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.5516,104.91985,4107203,Homeland Guesthouse,"Homeland Guesthouse is budget guesthouse located in city center, 5 minutes walk to Toul Sleng Museum. It featuring free WiFi throughout the property, Homeland Guesthouse offers accommodations in Phnom Penh. Free private parking is available on site. The rooms include a flat-screen TV with cable channels. Certain rooms have a sitting area where you can relax. Each room comes with a private bathroom. For your comfort, you will find slippers and free toiletries. You will find a 24-hour front desk at the property. The guesthouse also provides car rental. The nearest airport is Pochentong Airport, 8 km from the property. Chamkar Mon is a great choice for travelers interested in culture, food and friendly locals.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d4107203-Reviews-Homeland_Guesthouse-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 15, Street 304, Beung Keng Kang II', 'street2': 'Khan Chamcarmon,', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12303', 'address_string': 'No. 15, Street 304, Beung Keng Kang II Khan Chamcarmon,, Phnom Penh 12303 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https