Hong Phann Guest House,here:pds:place:116w649g-86f6407050d64970bc9e73d8b7600cad,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Hong Phann Guest House, ផ្លូវ សុក ហុក, 120308 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ប្រាំពីរ មករា', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងព្រលឹត', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សុក ហុក', 'postalCode': '120308'}","{'lat': 11.56106, 'lng': 104.9187}","[{'lat': 11.56105, 'lng': 104.91856}]",5999,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8306606'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85599937402'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.hongphann-gh.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.561065,104.9185,8306606,Hong Phann Guest house,"Welcome to Hong Phann Guest house, your Phnom Penh “home away from home.” Hong Phann Guest house aims to make your visit as relaxing and enjoyable as possible, which is why so many guests continue to come back year after year.
Close to some of Phnom Penh's most popular landmarks, such as Champey Academy of Arts (0.6 mi) and Wat Langka (0.8 mi), Hong Phann Guest house is a great destination for tourists.
Hong Phann Guest house is a budget friendly guest house offering air conditioning and a desk in the rooms, and it is easy to stay connected during your stay as free wifi is offered to guests.
The guest house features a 24 hour front desk, 24 hour check-in, and room service. Plus, guests can enjoy an on-site restaurant, which has made this a popular choice among travelers visiting Phnom Penh. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
Phnom Penh has plenty of Mediterranean restaurants. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Casablanca restaurant, Terrazza, and Il Forno, which are serving up some great dishes.
Phnom Penh is also home to Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum, a popular history museum that is not too far from Hong Phann Guest house.
Hong Phann Guest house puts the best of Phnom Penh at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
