Hostel Boeung Kak,here:pds:place:116w649g-f3d972fc64914b8db5a44c69881dab18,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Hostel Boeung Kak, ផ្លូវ 86, 120210 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ស្រះចក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 86', 'postalCode': '120210'}","{'lat': 11.5785, 'lng': 104.91497}","[{'lat': 11.57851, 'lng': 104.91509}]",5669,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512345678'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.58211,104.90751,24160219,One More Restaurant (Boeung Kak),"Since its establishment in 2008, One More Restaurant has been providing authentic and delicious Khmer cuisines with high standard and quality. With the incredible support from our loyal patrons and their trust on our memorable flavors, hospital services, and family friendly facilities, One More Restaurant has expanded our presence by adding a new restaurant to offer our cuisines to more customers. We would like to proudly introduce a brand new restaurant building completed with elegant and unique architecture and surrounded with greenery. With a passion to preserve and promote Khmer cuisines, we commit to continuing our offer of tasteful dishes and high standard hospitality.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d24160219-Reviews-One_More_Restaurant_Boeung_Kak-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'One More Boeung Kak: #37, Street 315, Sangkat Beoung Kak', 'street2': 'Khan Daun Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12101', 'address_string': 'One More Boeung Kak: #37, Street 315, Sangkat Beoung Kak Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh 12101 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,sales@onemorerestaurant.com,+855 23 888 222,http://www.onemorerestau