Hotel Cara,here:pds:place:116w649g-ec4675a9dabf4e1cb011da99720916b9,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Hotel Cara, មហាវិថី ព្រះនរោត្តម, 120210 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ស្រះចក', 'street': 'មហាវិថី ព្រះនរោត្តម', 'postalCode': '120210'}","{'lat': 11.58068, 'lng': 104.91974}","[{'lat': 11.5808, 'lng': 104.91994}]",72713,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0054', 'name': 'Motel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '479813'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '669571'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523426773', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}, {'value': '+85523430066'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.casahotel.net', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.580887,104.91981,669571,Hotel Cara,"Hotel Cara features 48 newly refurbished of uniquely designed rooms with meticulously crafted furniture made from local Ratanakkiri wood and pine wood offering private balconies overlooking the bustling urban metropolis, family suite and modern amenities to fit all your needs. Our hotel is strategically located in the heart of Phnom Penh, just a few minutes from the riverside nightlife and eclectic cuisine of Sisowath Quay, the historic Central Market, modern shopping centers, and the elegant Royal Palace. Hotel Cara is the perfect accommodation, whether you are exploring Cambodia’s rich culture or seeking a safe haven for business.Friendliness is not just in our name, it’s our philosophy. Welcome to Hotel Cara!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d669571-Reviews-Hotel_Cara-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 18, Street 47 & 84', 'street2': 'Sangkat Srass Chork, Khanh Doun Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'No. 18, Street 47 & 84 Sangkat Srass Chork, Khanh Doun Penh, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}