Hotel Emion Phnom Penh,here:pds:place:116w649g-e72d8bb14d8444aebb7cad89e88d069a,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Hotel Emion Phnom Penh, តីរវិថី ព្រះស៊ីសុវត្ថិ, 120207 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ចតុមុខ', 'street': 'តីរវិថី ព្រះស៊ីសុវត្ថិ', 'postalCode': '120207'}","{'lat': 11.56014, 'lng': 104.93495}","[{'lat': 11.56014, 'lng': 104.93509}]",59173,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '14789065'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523227227'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.hotel-emion-phnompenh.com/en'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.560142,104.93497,14789065,Hotel Emion Phnom Penh,"Hotel Emion Phnom Penh is a luxury hotel located center of Phnom Penh, the capital city of Cambodia, near by The Mekong River and Tonle Sap River. The hotel is 19 stories above ground and 240 rooms. All rooms are equipped with kitchen, bathroom with washroom, separate toilet and washlet. On the 19th floor on the top floor you will find a breakfast room with river views in front of you, a fitness gym where you can refresh during your stay, and a kids room where children can play with confidence. In addition, you can enjoy the resort feeling in the infinity pool with pool bar. In the vicinity of the hotel, facilities such as the largest shopping mall in Cambodia, downtown area and restaurants are all located, making it suitable for sightseeing and business use. The hotel is about 50 minutes drive away from the airport.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d14789065-Reviews-Hotel_Emion_Phnom_Penh-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '192 Preah Sisowath Quay', 'street2': 'Sangkat Chaktomuk, Daun Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12207', 'address_string': '192 Preah Sisowath Quay Sangkat Chaktomuk, Daun Penh, Phnom Penh 12207 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', '