Hotel Indochine,here:pds:place:116w649g-1fb7d8f5e68944cbacb9caae91d1fc86,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Hotel Indochine, តីរវិថី ព្រះស៊ីសុវត្ថិ, 120210 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ស្រះចក', 'street': 'តីរវិថី ព្រះស៊ីសុវត្ថិ', 'postalCode': '120210'}","{'lat': 11.57783, 'lng': 104.92474}","[{'lat': 11.57784, 'lng': 104.92475}]",72688,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1227724'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523427292'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.57783,104.92474,1227724,Hotel Indochine,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Phnom Penh, Hotel Indochine is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its budget friendly environment and proximity to great restaurants and attractions, Hotel Indochine makes it easy to enjoy the best of Phnom Penh.
Guest rooms offer air conditioning, and Hotel Indochine makes getting online easy as free wifi is available.
While staying at Hotel Indochine, visitors can check out Sisowath Quay (0.6 mi) and Wat Ounalom (0.8 mi), some of Phnom Penh's top attractions.
While in Phnom Penh be sure to experience local lobster favorites at Malis Cambodian Restaurant, Bopha Phnom Penh - Titanic Restaurant, or Khema Pasteur.
If you are interested in exploring Phnom Penh, check out one of the monuments and statues, such as Statue of King Father Norodom Sihanouk, Independence Monument, and Cambodia-Vietnam Friendship Monument.
Whether you’re traveling for business, pleasure or both, Hotel Indochine is sure to make your visit to Phnom Penh one worth remembering.
