Hotel KVL,here:pds:place:116w649g-06a9d7c9d384b27d3159a286d2eb7faa,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Hotel KVL, ផ្លូវ 1, 120208 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ជ័យជំនះ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 1', 'postalCode': '120208'}","{'lat': 11.56666, 'lng': 104.93165}","[{'lat': 11.56673, 'lng': 104.93177}]",111133,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '24096757'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523936333'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.hotelkvl.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.566719,104.93175,24096757,Hotel KVL,"Hôtel KVL, Located next to the Royal Palace with river view rooms & suites overlooking the Tonle Sap and Mekong and city view rooms include those overlooking the palace garden and National Museum. We are the perfect base for a stay in the heart of Phnom Penh, immersing you in the flair, lifestyle, fun, adventure, and vibrancy of urban life, including refreshing sunrise walks along the riverfront promenade. ‍ Up by KVL offering the most intimate rooftop riverview experience in town (best place to see any fireworks and Water Festival Celebration). Skylight offers a yummy breakfast (including a Vietnamese Pho Bo to try) and lunch set menu (ideal for those here on business, and wishing to dine with clients you are visiting). The Alchemist for a quiet coffee and croissant, and co-working space The ATOM are all designed to connect; so that you enjoy fabulous cuisine, great experiences, and an atmosphere that aims to inspire new conversations and fresh ideas. ‍ Our guest rooms & suites are the perfect blend of comfort, style, and functionality, all designed with the needs and desires of the modern traveler in mind. ‍ Hôtel KVL is inspired by worldly adventures and delivers uncompromising quality in all elements, including sustainability. Gests can now enjoy our purified water program (plastic bottles have been removed from all rooms). In June 2023, voted by Travel & Leisure readership as #7 City Hotel in Cambodia, a wonderful accolade that recognizes the warmth of hospitality from our dedicated associates' engagement with our guests and the fabulous features of the hotel (including Frette linen/toweling, TWG tea, & L'Occitane bathroom amenities) . In September 2023, Prestige recognized us as #2 New Business Hotel in Phnom Penh, thank you to our regular corporate travelers! Our electric tuk-tuk team will also escort you to your spots of interest around the area, including to Vattanac Capital Lifestyle Park where we have our Vertical Fitness Center (complimentary access to guests, including Zumba, yoga, and spinning studio). Also at the Lifestyle Park is our Eleven Degrees Brewpub air-conditioned venue offering a growing range of craft beers (the latest one being All Night Long, our coffee stout) brewed onsite plus live sport, DJ Sessions, Games and live music options. In addition to the above, Vattanac Golf Resort, Phnom Penh's premier golfing venue offering 36 holes plus a driving range is 30 minutes from the hotel and we offer exclusive Stay & Play options. When in Phnom Penh, our wonderful team can assist you in exploring the fabulous food scene (we are getting great reviews from a breakfast and/or dinner tour we have access to), some great art galleries and boutiques, plus the Wats to see! Hôtel KVL, Designed to Connect.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d24096757-Reviews-Hotel_KVL-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '379 Preah Sisowath Quay', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '379 Preah Sisowath Quay, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d24096757-Hotel_KVL-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#9 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '9'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,94,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '4', '5': '89'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",225,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d24096757-m66827-Reviews-Hotel_KVL-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Restaurant', 'Rooftop Bar', 'Suites', 'Room service', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Free Wifi', 'Dry Cleaning', 'Meeting rooms', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Business center', 'Laundry Service', 'Concierge', 'Air conditioning', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Safe', 'Rooftop Terrace', 'Breakfast Available', 'Housekeeping', 'Bath / Shower', 'Free Public Parking Nearby', 'Shuttle Bus Service', 'Free parking', 'Wheelchair access', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Breakfast included', 'Fitness center', 'Minibar', 'Flatscreen TV', 'Breakfast Buffet', 'Parking', 'Facilities for Disabled Guests', 'Adults Only', 'Aerobics