Hotel Rattanak,here:pds:place:116w636s-5a10d2659a9944fc95c51fd0598a3570,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Hotel Rattanak, ផ្លូវជាតិ 5, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 5', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10719, 'lng': 103.19579}","[{'lat': 13.10706, 'lng': 103.19576}]",12725,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '649971'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Battambang,13.10715,103.195786,649971,Hotel Rattanak,"Hotel Rattanak is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Battambang, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Hotel Rattanak offers guests an array of room amenities including air conditioning, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available.
The hotel offers a concierge, to make your visit even more pleasant. The property also features an on-site restaurant.
While staying at Hotel Rattanak, visitors can check out White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (0.5 mi) and Battambang Crocodile Farm (1.1 mi), some of Battambang's top attractions.
While in Battambang, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Hotel Rattanak, including Jaan Bai Restaurant (0.4 mi), Smokin' Pot (0.6 mi), and Nary Kitchen (0.3 mi).
Best of all, Hotel Rattanak makes it easy to experience many great Battambang attractions like ROMCHEIK 5 Art Space and Tep Kao Sol Loeum Lorn Gallery, which are some popular art museums.
Enjoy your stay in Battambang!
