Hotel de la Renaissance,here:pds:place:116w63u4-f834fcc798b242098d37e0f497b1012a,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Hotel de la Renaissance, 171210 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្រងែ', 'postalCode': '171210'}","{'lat': 13.37947, 'lng': 103.8255}","[{'lat': 13.37941, 'lng': 103.82561}]",87174,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15242972'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563961001'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/larenaissancehotel'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.379426,103.82557,15242972,Hotel De la Renaissance,"Hotel de la Renaissance located in the city of Siem Reap, the Kingdom of Cambodia, is the perfect base to explore and experience this famous historical city, the hotel is situated only nine kilometers away from world heritage site of Angkor Wat Temple, and three and half kilometers from Siem Reap International Airport. Hotel de la Renaissance all room are fully-equipped and decked out in stunning Khmer style. Hotel has a business center, Internet access and faxing on site facilities include a fitness center, Swimming pool and Restaurant, Bar, Spa, Massager and Currency exchange 24 hour- Security and daily Housekeeping, The Tour desk can arrange such activities mountain biking and cultural show. The city center, vibrant and rich in history, is a Ten-minute driver form the hotel. A lot of restaurant can be found in Siem reap within walking distance or a Romork ride and only Nine minutes to Siem reap downtown including pub street, Shopping, Angkor Night Market local Restaurant and bar and other nearby local attraction in Siem reap. For guest traveling to Siem reap, Hotel de la renaissance is the perfect venue to spent and unforgeable stay in Siem reap.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d15242972-Reviews-Hotel_De_la_Renaissance-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"