Hour Kheang Guest House,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-7fea114319b2460e9024d48c1d3b8247,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Hour Kheang Guest House, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.59778, 'lng': 104.18725}","[{'lat': 10.59774, 'lng': 104.18712}]",18507,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2513749'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855889979989'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.597761,104.18724,2513749,Hour Kheang Guest House,"Finding an ideal budget friendly guest house in Kampot does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Hour Kheang Guest House, a nice option for travelers like you.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Kampot, Hour Kheang Guest House is located a short distance from The Old Royal Cinema (0.9 mi) and Farm Link (1.5 mi).
Guest rooms offer air conditioning and a desk, and Hour Kheang Guest House makes getting online easy as free wifi is available.
You can also take advantage of some of the amenities offered by the guest house, including a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and room service. In addition, guests can enjoy an on-site restaurant during their visit. As an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
During your visit, be sure to check out a popular Kampot tapas restaurant such as Deva Cafe, which is a short distance from Hour Kheang Guest House.
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular history museums such as Kampot Museum.
Hour Kheang Guest House looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Kampot.
