Human Gallery - Joseba Etxebarria Photography,here:pds:place:116w636s-ba2803dd772847a58d0e200a0f68973a,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Human Gallery - Joseba Etxebarria Photography, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10113, 'lng': 103.19835}","[{'lat': 13.10111, 'lng': 103.19849}]",248607,"[{'id': '300-3100-0029', 'name': 'Art Museum', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12524046'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855962840426'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.josebaetxebarria.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sat: 09:00 - 13:00, 15:00 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT04H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}, {'start': 'T150000', 'duration': 'PT02H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}]}]",Battambang,13.10111,103.19846,12524046,Human Gallery - Joseba Etxebarria Photography,"In 2015 the humanitarian photographer Joseba Etxebarria settles in Battambang, Cambodia, aware of his degree of responsibility towards the ""voiceless"". Convinced that he has the necessary tools to create a space with the power to inspire change, in June 2017 he founded Human Gallery in the city of Battambang, a magical place where he shares his work, as well as the human stories that there is behind Human Gallery collects many of the photographs that Joseba took during his world tour for Human Rights (2010-2022). * 20% of the sale of the photographs exhibited in the gallery, or on the web, is used to cover the education of the children who are beneficiaries of our children's project ""Wings for the future"".",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d12524046-Reviews-Human_Gallery_Joseba_Etxebarria_Photography-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 2', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'Street 2, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,joseba.k.etxebarria@gmail.com,+855 96 284 0426,http://www.josebaetxebarria.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d12524046-Human_Gallery_Joseba_Etxebarria_Photography-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 35 things to do in Battambang', 'geo_location_name': 'Battambang', 'ranking_out_of': '35', 'ranking': '1'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,336,"{'1': '2', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '4', '5': '330'}",Not available,111,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d12524046-m66827-Reviews-Human_Gallery_Joseba_Etxebarria_Photography-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1300'}}, {'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1500'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1300'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1500'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1300'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1500'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1300'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1500'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1300'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1500'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1300'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '1500'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': 