Iki Iki Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-9833454b3cef07952324c690b6b28ccf,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Iki Iki Guesthouse, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36583, 'lng': 103.8545}","[{'lat': 13.36577, 'lng': 103.85462}]",23919,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3749351'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512614678'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.365776,103.85459,3749351,Iki Iki Guesthouse,"Iki Iki Guesthouse is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Siem Reap, offering a family-friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
As your “home away from home,” the guest house rooms offer air conditioning, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and room service while staying at Iki Iki Guesthouse. In addition, Iki Iki Guesthouse offers an on-site restaurant, which will help make your Siem Reap trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
Close to some of Siem Reap's most popular landmarks, such as Seng English Speaking Tuk Tuk & Car Driver (0.4 mi) and Viti's Tuk Tuk Driver (0.4 mi), Iki Iki Guesthouse is a great destination for tourists.
While in Siem Reap, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Iki Iki Guesthouse, including Chanrey Tree (0.7 mi), Genevieve's Restaurant (1.2 mi), and Cuisine Wat Damnak (1.2 mi).
Best of all, Iki Iki Guesthouse makes it easy to experience many great Siem Reap attractions like Angkor Artwork E&T Stocker, Theam's House, and Jayav Art, which are some popular art galleries.
Enjoy your stay in Siem Reap!
