Illuma Tapas & Lounge,here:pds:place:116w649g-781defeb2942469c9d0899781c61a6f3,en,Lodging,"{'label': 'Illuma Tapas & Lounge, ផ្លូវ 55, 120207 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ចតុមុខ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 55', 'postalCode': '120207'}","{'lat': 11.55915, 'lng': 104.92383}","[{'lat': 11.55918, 'lng': 104.92396}]",6582,"[{'id': '200-2000-0368', 'name': 'Cocktail Lounge', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515200822'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.57434,104.92769,24123068,El Tapas,"Our signature restaurant El Tapas serves the city’s best Spanish food. Our Valencian chef and his team prepare exceptional Iberian cuisine with a contemporary twist at the restaurant's open kitchen and Josper grill. Fine wines, Spanish-inspired craft cocktails and our house sangria, as well as our resident DJ are sure to keep the evening going, any night of the week. A semi-private room is available for functions and special events.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d24123068-Reviews-El_Tapas-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Preah Sisowath Quay (river Side)', 'street2': '#379', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': 'Preah Sisowath Quay (river Side) #379, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,eltapas@hotelkvl.com,+855 88 893 6662,http://www.hotelkvl.com/dining/el-tapas,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d24123068-El_Tapas-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#425 of 1,983 Places to Eat in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '1983', 'ranking': '425'}",4.5,https://www.tripa