In Asia Travel,here:pds:place:116w63gg-8bbf24a086a6e7ab3ec227f939a9d6ff,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'In Asia Travel, ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35454, 'lng': 103.84834}","[{'lat': 13.35467, 'lng': 103.84833}]",88079,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8801221'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855888850561'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://inasiatravel.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT14H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.35465,103.84833,8801221,In Asia Travel,"In Asia Travel is a Tour Operator specialised in tour in Southeast Asia and Central Asia, fully licensed by the Ministry of Commerce and the Ministry of Tourism, offering personalised and bespoke travel experiences to ensure your every need is met. Taking care of all the relevant details, we focus on your satisfaction, the quality of services provided and a responsible and ethical attitude towards the local people, culture and nature. We respect local people, traditions and cultures. On our multi-country tours, as well as on one- and multi-day stays, we guarantee a unique and engaging travel experience. We create ethically sustainable travel for the territories we visit and for the travellers who choose In Asia Travel. We firmly believe in valuing the financial investment each of you make in travelling and we are committed to ensure that your experience is unforgettable and smooth, regardless of your tour style and budget.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d8801221-Reviews-In_Asia_Travel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sok San Road, 1', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'st