Indra Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649f-99576cc582e103c0289288e8370581a8,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Indra Hotel, ផ្លូវ 592 95, 120408 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ទួលគោក', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកក់ទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 592', 'postalCode': '120408', 'houseNumber': '95'}","{'lat': 11.58015, 'lng': 104.88906}","[{'lat': 11.58009, 'lng': 104.88897}]",3045,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23024586'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516889066'}], 'www': [{'value': 'www.indrahotel.asia'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.578835,104.89001,23024586,Indra Hotel,"A modern, yet elegant well-furnished hotel snuggled just 15-minutes away from the airport, Indra Hotel offers an embellishment of serenity, fitness, well-being and convenience. The hotel is fitted with a café on the ground floor, a fully equipped fitness center, a saltwater pool, and a fine dining restaurant overlooking the cityscapes. The contemporary room’s functional layout is carefully designed for your convenience and comfortability. The hidden gem nestled in the business district of Toul Kork with a green and environmental-friendly atmosphere. Shopping malls and restaurants are within walking distances or only a 5-minute drive away. Travelers can reach Wat Phnom, Night Market, Royal Palace, or National Museum with just less than 15 minutes drive.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d23024586-Reviews-Indra_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 95 Street 592, Toul Kork', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '# 95 Street 592, Toul Kork, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvis