Ino Guesthouse and Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w649d-17c1e251f62e492d9ff5a720174dbdc8,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Ino Guesthouse and Restaurant, ផ្លូវ 2004, 120802 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'សែនសុខ', 'subdistrict': 'ទឹកថ្លា', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 2004', 'postalCode': '120802'}","{'lat': 11.55205, 'lng': 104.87692}","[{'lat': 11.55227, 'lng': 104.87689}]",2249,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '600-6300-0066', 'name': 'Grocery'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855978252421'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.557861,104.87104,7085397,Asean Guesthouse,"Asean Guesthouse is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Phnom Penh, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Phnom Penh, Asean Guesthouse is located a short distance from Mila Craft Workshop (Rubber stamp and Making Bath Bombs) (1.9 mi) and Wat Phnom (3.0 mi).
Rooms at Asean Guesthouse provide a minibar, air conditioning, and a refrigerator.
When you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out Luigi Ristorante, Aloha Ono, and Brothers' Pizza, which are some Italian restaurants that are popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.
Should time allow, Din Art Gallery, Lotus Space, and Bong Bong Bong are some popular art galleries that are relatively easy to get to.
Enjoy your stay in Phnom Penh!
