Inter City Hostel Siemreap,here:pds:place:116w63gg-5800bd7b43ef4da89ddd24bc3ac5d07d,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Inter City Hostel Siemreap, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35336, 'lng': 103.86055}","[{'lat': 13.35323, 'lng': 103.86052}]",24522,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563963961'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.intercityhostel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.363545,103.86083,297390,Siem Reap,"When the morning light washes over the overgrown temples and ruins of Angkor Wat, a simple Siem Reap sunrise becomes a profound event. The ancient structures are contained within one of the largest religious complexes in the world. The complex and the 12th century Angkor Thom royal city are considered the main reasons to visit Siem Reap. Get a lesson in national history at the Cambodian Cultural Village, and a lesson in bargaining at the Angkor Night Market, a bonanza of  shopping stalls, food vendors, and bars.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Tourism-g297390-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province-Vacations.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '', 'street2': '', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Tourism-g297390-m66827-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province-Vacations.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'geographic', 'localized_name': 'Geographic'}","[{'name': 'municipality', 'localized_name': 'Municipality'}]",Not available,Not available,[],Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,FALSE,29,20
International Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-16a3d2c631320ac1205757384d9d0767,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'International Hotel, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.1015, 'lng': 103.19841}","[{'lat': 13.10148, 'lng': 103.19855}]",12579,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3320099'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85553953999'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.101497,103.19845,3320099,International Hotel,"Finding an ideal romantic small hotel in Battambang does not have to be difficult. Welcome to International Hotel, a nice option for travelers like you.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Battambang, International Hotel is located a short distance from White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (0.1 mi) and Ta Dumbong Statue (1.0 mi).
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, a refrigerator, and a minibar, and you can stay connected during your stay as International Hotel offers guests free wifi.
The small hotel features a 24 hour front desk, room service, and a concierge. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the cafes, including Choco L'Art Café, Hoc Cafe, and Kinyei Cafe, all of which are a short distance from International Hotel.
If you are interested in exploring Battambang, check out one of the ancient ruins, such as Prasat Sneung and Ek Phnom.
International Hotel looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Battambang.
