Invito Resort,here:pds:place:116aabd1-0e6ec82e939103cda7c56d39af23e755,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Invito Resort, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.60839, 'lng': 103.52182}","[{'lat': 10.60841, 'lng': 103.52168}]",105003,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7108618'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85566387791'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/InvitoResort', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.608402,103.52177,7108618,Invito Resort,"If you’re looking for a budget friendly guest house in Sihanoukville, look no further than Invito Resort.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as CJ Outlet and Jewelry Center (1.0 mi) and Wat Krom Temple (1.6 mi), guests of Invito Resort can easily experience some of Sihanoukville's most well known attractions.
Invito Resort features a 24 hour front desk and room service. Plus, guests can enjoy a pool and breakfast, which have made this a popular choice among travelers visiting Sihanoukville. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
If you’re looking for a sushi restaurant, consider a visit to Sushi×Bar SHIN Sihanoukville, Samurai Japanese Restaurant & Bar, or Japanese Restaurant Yuyutei, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Invito Resort.
Sihanoukville is also home to Kbal Chhay Waterfall, a popular waterfall that is not too far from Invito Resort.
The staff at Invito Resort looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d7108618-Reviews-Invito_Resort-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '502 Serendipity Beach Road', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': '502 Serendipity Beach Road, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d7108618-Invito_Resort-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#114 of 304 B&Bs / Inns in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out_of': '304', 'ranking': '114'}",3,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.0-66827-5.svg,85,"{'1': '19', '2': '9', '3': '17', '4': '14', '5': '26'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss2.5.svg', 'value': '2.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss2.5.svg', 'value': '2.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.