Island Boys Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3ckw-28ea3c1fb5684ac5992cbf07e8e1af9e,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Island Boys Guesthouse, 180405 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'កោះរុង', 'postalCode': '180405'}","{'lat': 10.6663, 'lng': 103.27318}","[{'lat': 10.66636, 'lng': 103.27306}]",97436,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7043667'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570240154'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.kohrongislandboys.com'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.666303,103.27317,7043667,Island Boys Guesthouse,"Koh Rong Island Boys is the backpacker central of Koh Rong. We're right in the middle of the action, between the 2 major piers. We are a social/party hostel, so we're the place to be to meet people from around the world and get the best advice for your time staying here. If you're looking for a basic dorm or cheap room, we're for you. If you're looking for a more quite/romantic getaway, hop off the pier and have a cocktail with us, and we'll give you honest advice as to where the best place for you to stay is! Our BBQ is the best value meal on the island (6pm-10pm), and we have a new menu for day time snacks and breakfast (Aug 2016). Koh Rong is developing fast, but still years behind Thai or Vietnamese islands, so don't expect A/C, ATM's, tuk tuks, or fast internet!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1808558-d7043667-Reviews-Island_Boys_Guesthouse-Koh_Rong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Koh Tui Village', 'city': 'Koh Rong', 'state': 'Koh Kong Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18205', 'address_string': 'Koh Tui Village, Koh Rong 18205 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Koh Rong', 'location_id': '1808558'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Koh Kong Province', 'location_id': '2366667'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': 