Istar Cambodia,here:pds:place:116d408k-87ce1aa5b9ec071e76da3fb0bf92a4f2,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Istar Cambodia, ផ្លូវជាតិ 72, 250507 ពញាក្រែក, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ត្បូងឃ្មុំ', 'city': 'ពញាក្រែក', 'district': 'ត្រពាំងផ្លុង', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 72', 'postalCode': '250507'}","{'lat': 11.67596, 'lng': 105.97211}","[{'lat': 11.67764, 'lng': 105.97001}]",112593,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '206-000', 'name': 'Vietnamese', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855762111213'}]}],Not Available,Tboung Khmum,11.55442,104.91584,578020,Golden Bridge Hotel,"Looking for a place to stay in Phnom Penh? Then look no further than Golden Bridge Hotel, a budget friendly guest house that brings the best of Phnom Penh to your doorstep.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning and a desk, and you can stay connected during your stay as Golden Bridge Hotel offers guests free wifi.
While staying at Golden Bridge Hotel, visitors can check out Wat Langka (0.4 mi) and Bassac Lane (0.9 mi), some of Phnom Penh's top attractions.
If you’re looking for a seafood restaurant, consider a visit to Malis Cambodian Restaurant, Le Broken Plate, or Nesat Seafood House, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Golden Bridge Hotel.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum (0.4 mi), Royal Palace (1.2 mi), or Central Market (0.5 mi), which are popular attractions amongst tourists, and they are all within walking distance.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Golden Bridge Hotel as you experience everything Phnom Penh has to offer.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d578020-Reviews-Golden_Bridge_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '274 Preah Sihanouk Blvd', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '274 Preah Sihanouk Blvd, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d578020-Golden_Bridge_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#114 of 412 B&Bs / Inns in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '412', 'ranking': '114'}",3.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.5-66827-5.svg,25,"{'1': '2', '2': '2', '3': '4', '4': '13', '5': '4'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}}",7,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d578020-m66827-Reviews-Golden_Bridge_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Free Internet', 'W