J&R Waffle Bar,here:pds:place:116w63gg-e7fc1a864d604c11a1755706a177c271,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'J&R Waffle Bar, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35299, 'lng': 103.86154}","[{'lat': 13.35312, 'lng': 103.86154}]",24485,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598473165'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.362454,103.85785,10679072,J7 Angkor Hotel,"When it comes to hotels, location is everything, and the new 5-star J7 Hotel has the perfect location in Siem Reap right next to the Royal Residence, across the street from the tranquil and leafy Royal Gardens, a few minutes' walk to the riverside, 15 minutes drive to the world famous Angkor Archaeological Park with its' jewel in the crown, the temple of Angkor Wat. Balancing high standards of comfort and personalized service with an excellent location, the brand new luxury J7 Hotel uniquely fuses a modern and luxurious environment for guests complemented by a full range of modern amenities. All 90 rooms lavishly featured with large en-suite bathrooms and bathtubs and all rooms are non-smoking room to cater for your comfort. It also offers a range of facilities including meeting spaces, gymnasium with sauna and steam rooms, and outdoor swimming pool with Jacuzzi located at the swimming pool, all-day dining experience and fantastic Moringa Wellness Spa for your unwinding pleasure.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g12591811-d10679072-Reviews-J7_Angkor_Hotel-Svay_Dangkum_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '6 Road', 'street2': 'Next to Royal Residence', 'city': 'Svay Dangkum', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17257', 'address_string': '6 Road Next to Royal Residence, Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap 17257 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Svay Dan