Janora Residence,here:pds:place:116w649f-5256883d3a9d4fb4b85f319fdf5d8380,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Janora Residence, ផ្លូវ 299 13, 120408 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ទួលគោក', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកក់ទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 299', 'postalCode': '120408', 'houseNumber': '13'}","{'lat': 11.57663, 'lng': 104.89633}","[{'lat': 11.57668, 'lng': 104.89646}]",3646,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5505890'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517926969'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.bolyno.com.kh/janora'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.576647,104.89658,5505890,Janora Residence,"Looking for a place to stay in Phnom Penh? Then look no further than Janora Residence, a guest house that brings the best of Phnom Penh to your doorstep.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as air conditioning and a minibar, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the guest house.
Janora Residence features room service, to help make your stay more enjoyable.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Phnom Penh, Janora Residence is located a short distance from Cambodia Post Office (2.0 mi) and Champey Academy of Arts (2.2 mi).
When you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out Brooklyn Pizza & Bistro, Piccola Italia Da Luigi, and Oskar Bistro, which are some Italian restaurants that are popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.
Phnom Penh is also known for some great architectural buildings, including Central Market, Silver Pagoda, and Royal Railway Station (Phnom Penh), which are not too far from Janora Residence.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Janora Residence as you experience everything Phnom Penh has to offer.
