Jasmine Family Hostel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-a2e7fe24c2f80e2bb86a64c4529f8b19,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Jasmine Family Hostel, អេអេច21, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'អេអេច21', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36515, 'lng': 103.8529}","[{'lat': 13.36516, 'lng': 103.85291}]",24092,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1626194'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563760697'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.jasminelodge.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.364449,103.85321,485138,Jasmine Lodge,"Jasmine Lodge offers an in door restaurant, an outdoor swimming pool and rooms with a balcony and free internet access. The hotel also provides a free parking. Jasmine is a 10-minute walk from Old Market and a 10-minute drive from Siem Reap International Airport. Simply furnished rooms are equipped with air conditioning and a fan. They also come with a private bathroom, along with slippers. Jasmine Lodge’s restaurant offers local Khmer and European dishes. Free coffee and tea are available at selected times. Alternatively, room service is provided.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d485138-Reviews-Jasmine_Lodge-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road N 6', 'street2': '307 Taphul Village, Svay Dongkum Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '855', 'address_string': 'National Road N 6 307 Taphul Village, Svay Dongkum Commune, Siem Reap 855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d485138-Jasmi