Jasmine Garden Villa,here:pds:place:116w63gg-add03e685f064047ac4c18bb8a0bb2df,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Jasmine Garden Villa, ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35429, 'lng': 103.84776}","[{'lat': 13.3544, 'lng': 103.84768}]",88011,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2336998'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855635550019'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.353942,103.848,2336998,Jasmine Garden Villa,"Jasmine Garden Villa is tropical garden in downtown of Siem Reap with Khmer style furniture, just a simple and peaceful place for your holiday. Close to Market, Restaurant and Pub Street Area. 5 minutes walking to Central Market, Old Market, Pub Street, Night Market, Siem Reap River and Artisan D' Angkor. Walk in the tropical garden complete with palm trees and fish ponds. Relax on the balconies and watch the sun go down.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d2336998-Reviews-Jasmine_Garden_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sok San Street, Phum Steung Thmey, Sangkat Svay Dangkum', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17000', 'address_string': 'Sok San Street, Phum Steung Thmey, Sangkat Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap 17000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d2336998-Jasmine_Garden_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_strin