"Jasmine Lodge, Siem Reap",here:pds:place:116w63u5-8dfe155b95dd45c6b3b6e0b19b609a99,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Jasmine Lodge, Siem Reap, អេអេច21, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'អេអេច21', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36509, 'lng': 103.85327}","[{'lat': 13.36498, 'lng': 103.8532}]",24070,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2646725'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '485138'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512530843', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}, {'value': '+85512784980', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}, {'value': '+85563760697'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.jasminelodge.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055'}, {'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.364449,103.85321,485138,Jasmine Lodge,"Jasmine Lodge offers an in door restaurant, an outdoor swimming pool and rooms with a balcony and free internet access. The hotel also provides a free parking. Jasmine is a 10-minute walk from Old Market and a 10-minute drive from Siem Reap International Airport. Simply furnished rooms are equipped with air conditioning and a fan. They also come with a private bathroom, along with slippers. Jasmine Lodge’s restaurant offers local Khmer and European dishes. Free coffee and tea are available at selected times. Alternatively, room service is provided.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d485138-Reviews-Jasmine_Lodge-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road N 6', 'street2': '307 Taphul Village, Svay Don