Jin Cha Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w649g-800698e6baf446efbfb23470975d99b3,en,food_market_stall,"{'label': 'Jin Cha Cambodia, ផ្លូវ 233, 120402 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ទួលគោក', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារដេប៉ូទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 233', 'postalCode': '120402'}","{'lat': 11.56599, 'lng': 104.90215}","[{'lat': 11.56599, 'lng': 104.90215}]",4154,"[{'id': '100-1000-0004', 'name': 'Food Market/Stall', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0000', 'name': 'Coffee/Tea'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516333365'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.563291,104.92013,293940,Phnom Penh,"Budget-minded travelers will appreciate Phnom Penh's reasonably priced hotel rooms. Explore the city's temples, palaces, and the remnants of its French colonial history. Just outside the city, the The Killing Fields (Choeung Ek) are a reminder of Cambodia's tragic past-- a somber contrast to the booming city of today.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Tourism-g293940-Phnom_Penh-Vacations.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '', 'street2': '', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Tourism-g293940-m66827-Phnom_Penh-Vacations.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'geographic', 'localized_name': 'Geographic'}","[{'name': 'city', 'localized_name': 'City'}]",Not available,Not available,[],Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,FALSE,23,14
Jing du Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649g-ae1fff7083684d95bf50725b7b163c9e,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Jing du Hotel, ផ្លូវ 258, 120207 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ចតុមុខ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 258', 'postalCode': '120207'}","{'lat': 11.55961, 'lng': 104.93462}","[{'lat': 11.55974, 'lng': 104.93462}]",59190,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '19267016'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855963589973'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.jingduhotel.asia'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.559563,104.93462,19267016,Jing Du Hotel,"Situated in Riverfront, JING DU Hotel Phnom Penh is the perfect place to experience Phnom Penh and its surroundings. JING DU Hotel is just 10 km away from Phnom Penh International Airport. With its convenient location, the hotel offers easy access to the city's must-see destinations. Housed in a modern white building, JING DU Hotel is just 600 metres away from Royal Palace Phnom Penh. It is also 1.7 km away from Riverfront Park and 2 km away from Wat Phnom. JING DU Hotel Phnom Penh features an outdoor swimming pool and a private restaurant.Free WiFi access is offered throughout the hotel.Elegant rooms feature classic Modern-style décor. A minibar, air conditioning and a seating area are included. Bathroom facilities are en suite and come with a hairdryer and free toiletries. The hotel’s 24-hour front desk can assist you with luggage storage, travel arrangements and free parking facilities. Traditional massages can be arranged and drinks can be enjoyed while you relax at the sun terrace.Traditional Cambodian-style meals will be served at the in-house restaurant.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d19267016-Reviews-Jing_Du_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Long Nget St., Corner of Sisowath Road, Street, 258 463', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12207', 'address_string': 'Long Nget St., Corner of Sisowath Road, Street, 258 463, Phnom Penh 12207 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d19267016-Jing_Du_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#225 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '225'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,3,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '2', '5': '1'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}}",36,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d19267016-m66827-Reviews-Jing_Du_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Spa', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Breakfast included', 'Suites', 'Room service', 'Airport transportation', 'Dry Cleaning', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Concierge', 'Air conditioning', 'Smoking rooms available', 'Minibar', 'Safe', 'Flatscreen TV', 'Rooftop Terrace', 'Private Balcony', 'Housekeeping', 'ATM On Site', 'Bathrobes', 'Bottled Water', 'Cable / Satellite TV', 'Car Hire', '24-Hour Check-in', 'Chinese', 'Clothes Dryer', 'Currency Exchange', 'Desk', 'Doorperson', 'Electric Kettle', 'English', 'Foot Massage', '24-Hour Front Desk', 'Hair Dryer', 'Hand Massage', '