Jireh Cafe,here:pds:place:116w636k-7f85034ec2694b0288b53c5a2a17108d,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Jireh Cafe, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.09568, 'lng': 103.19831}","[{'lat': 13.09565, 'lng': 103.19845}]",12214,"[{'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '600-6300-0244', 'name': 'Bakery & Baked Goods Store'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '101-000', 'name': 'American'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3753172'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510667999'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/CafeJirehBattambang/?ref=hl', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sat: 07:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT14H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}]}]",Battambang,13.095659,103.19839,3753172,Jireh Cafe,"We welcome everyone! Our vision (what we hope to be and achieve)We wish to help Cambodian students to become opinion leaders in future with profits that we make. Currently we have several students working with us as our scholars. They work and study hard to learn different cultures, languages and manners so that they can pass what they have learnt to the locals. We teach them how to work together as a team and how to serve.Our mission (What we are here for)We aim to touch and enhance the lives of people through our Christian culur of quality care and service. Also with our enthusiasm, team work and values, we offer the best possible drinks and food.Our values (What underlies our way of doing things)Respect, integrity, compassion, justice and innovation. Your patronage and ongoing support of the caféJireh is very much appreciated.Functions at caféJirehSpecial occasion coming up? Want to have it at a venue that will go that bit extra in customer service and presentation to ensure that your experience will be one to remember? At café jireh, with luxurious service, wonderful company and a relaxed atmosphere, it is a recipe for a memorable birthday parties, anniversary or special events. caféJireh caters for events if up to 20 people. Bookings necessary.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g303666-d3753172-Reviews-Jireh_Cafe-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Road No 1, Krobey Village', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02360', 'address_string': 'Road No 1, Krobey Village, Battambang 02360 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,cafejirehbtb@gmail.com,+855 10 667 999,http://www.facebook.com/CafeJirehBattambang/?ref=hl,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d3753172-Jireh_Cafe-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#27 of 138 Places to Eat in Battambang', 'geo_location_name': 'Battambang', 'ranking_out_of': '138', 'ranking': '27'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,63,"{'1': '1', '2': '2', '3': '4', '4': '10', '5': '46'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_va