Joe & Boy Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w614p-2d51531ebe90444a89a6d4ac0c89fec9,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Joe & Boy Restaurant, 090701 ខេមរភូមិន្ទ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កោះកុង', 'city': 'ខេមរភូមិន្ទ', 'district': 'ស្មាច់មានជ័យ', 'postalCode': '090701'}","{'lat': 11.61215, 'lng': 102.98316}","[{'lat': 11.61213, 'lng': 102.98316}]",41511,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85586548135'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://joeandboyrestaurant18.blogspot.com'}]}]",Not Available,Koh Kong,12.000245,102.29946,945724,Little Eden Bungalows & Restaurant,"Little Eden Bungalows & Restaurant welcomes guests to enjoy the chilled and rustic atmosphere on the hillside near lonely beach. Our bungalows are spacious with comfortable beds, hot shower, safety box, mosquito net, fan and a private bathroom and all have a balcony with a hammock perfect for lazy hazy days, our A/C Cottages offer you a bit more Luxury, they are more spacious and have a fridge and Cable TV too. Our restaurant serves mouth watering Thai and Western food, or you can just hang out with a Singha or two! Take a walk down the hill and through the village and you are at lonely beach! The Penthouse is something special, no a/c but has also a thatched roof to keep it cool, a spacious room for couples, a small group or a small family.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g580110-d945724-Reviews-Little_Eden_Bungalows_Restaurant-Ko_Chang_Trat_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '4/47 Moo 1 Soi 3 Lonely Beach, Koh Chang South', 'street2': 'Koh Chang, Trat', 'city': 'Ko Chang', 'state': 'Trat Province', 'country': 'Thailand', 'postalcode': '23170', 'address_string': '4/47 Moo 1 Soi 3 Lonely Beach, Koh Chang South Koh Chang, Trat, Ko Chang 23170 Thailand'}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Ko Chang', 'location_id': '580110'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Trat Province', 'location_id': '2099338'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Thailand', 'location_id': '293915'}]",Asia/Bangkok,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g580110-d945724-Little_Eden_Bungalows_Restaurant-Ko_Chang_Trat_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '580110', 'ranking_string': '#6 of 196 Specialty lodging in Ko Chang', 'geo_location_name': 'Ko Chang', 'ranking_out_of': '196', 'ranking': '6'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,285,"{'1': '5', '2': '8', '3': '10', '4': '58', '5': '204'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",210,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g580110-d945724-m66827-Reviews-Little_Eden_Bungalows_Restaurant-Ko_Chang_Trat_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Restaurant', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Free parking', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Safe', 'Housekeeping', 'Bath / Shower', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Breakfast Available', 'Board Games / Puzzles', 'Car Hire', 'Clothes Rack', 'English', 'Complimentary Toiletries', 'Mosquito Net', 'Thai', 'Beach A