Johnny Walker's Bar and Rooms,here:pds:place:116w3cse-b1b05ac070bd4f31ba52be97121ba738,en,hotel,"{'label': ""Johnny Walker's Bar and Rooms, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា'}","{'lat': 10.6349, 'lng': 103.50475}","[{'lat': 10.6349, 'lng': 103.50475}]",101788,"[{'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6400703'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855978044703'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://johnnywalkerscambodia.blogspot.com'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.634896,103.50474,6400703,Johnny Walker's Bar and Rooms,"Finding an ideal inn in Sihanoukville does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Johnny Walker's Bar and Rooms, a nice option for travelers like you.
Guest rooms offer air conditioning, and Johnny Walker's Bar and Rooms makes getting online easy as free wifi is available.
Close to CJ Outlet and Jewelry Center (1.8 mi), a popular Sihanoukville landmark, Johnny Walker's Bar and Rooms is a great destination for tourists.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the sushi restaurants, including Sushi×Bar SHIN Sihanoukville, Samurai Japanese Restaurant & Bar, and ONAMI Japanese Restaurant, all of which are a short distance from Johnny Walker's Bar and Rooms.
Sihanoukville is also home to Otres Art Studio, a popular art gallery that is not too far from Johnny Walker's Bar and Rooms.
Johnny Walker's Bar and Rooms puts the best of Sihanoukville at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d6400703-Reviews-Johnny_Walker_s_Bar_and_Rooms-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '358 Ekareach Street, Victory Hill', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': '358 Ekareach Street, Victory Hill, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d6400703-Johnny_Walker_s_Bar_and_Rooms-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},0,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d6400703-m66827-Reviews-Johnny_Walker_s_Bar_and_Rooms-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Internet', 'Shuttle Bus Service', 'Free Internet', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Laundry Service', 'Air conditioning']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'bb', 'localized_name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,30,15
Jolie Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w64up-5604721a51414386bbd571a7b2893c43,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Jolie Guesthouse, 030402 កំពង់ចាម, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'city': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'district': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'postalCode': '030402'}","{'lat': 11.99156, 'lng': 105.46111}","[{'lat': 11.99149, 'lng': 105.46123}]",24972,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12698329'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Kampong Cham,11.991535,105.46115,12698329,Jolie Guesthouse,"Finding an ideal guest house in Kampong Cham does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Jolie Guesthouse, a nice option for travelers like you.
While staying at Jolie Guesthouse, visitors can check out Wat Nokor (1.6 mi), which is a popular Kampong Cham attraction.
Rooms at Jolie Guesthouse provide air conditioning and a minibar.
If you’re looking for a French restaurant, consider a visit to Destiny Coffee House, which is not far from Jolie Guesthouse.
If you’re looking for something to do, Ko Paen Bamboo Bridge (0.9 mi) and The French Tower (1.1 mi) are a nice way to spend some time, and they are all within walking distance of Jolie Guesthouse.
Jolie Guesthouse looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Kampong Cham.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g659642-d12698329-Reviews-Jolie_Guesthouse-Kampong_Cham_Kampong_Cham_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Soriyavoroman 2, 7th Village', 'city': 'Kampong Cham', 'state': 'Kampong Cham Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Soriyavoroman 2, 7th Village, Kampong Cham Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampong Cham', 'location_id': '659642'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampong Cham Province', 'location_id': '2366656'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g659642-d12698329-Jolie_Guesthouse-Kampong_Cham_Kampong_Cham_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},0,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g659642-d12698329-m66827-Reviews-Jolie_Guesthouse-Kampong_Cham_Kampong_Cham_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Air conditioning', 'Minibar', 'Bath / Shower', 'English', 'Complimentary Toiletries', 'Seating Area']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'bb', 'localized_name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,25,2
