Jungle Republic,here:pds:place:116w3ckn-786a657b7a0e47e7ace561217944a3d2,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Jungle Republic, 180405 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'កោះរុង', 'postalCode': '180405'}","{'lat': 10.57657, 'lng': 103.31112}","[{'lat': 10.57668, 'lng': 103.31121}]",112939,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12705673'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855885505613'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/junglerepublickrs'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.574682,103.30746,12981996,Jungle Republic,"Jungle Republic is a shadowy backpacker oasis at the heart of Koh Rong Sanloem. We provide simple, clean, budget accommodation for all tired travelers. Private rooms, dorms, tents and hammocks are available. Try one of our fresh fruit shakes or enjoy a meal at our jungle restaurant – seriously, our chef is amazing. Stretch out on a hammock and relax in the shade, listen to the sounds of nature and admire some of the wildlife. In the nighttime the jungle comes alive and when the moon is full, so does our sound system. Think face paint, fire show, international DJ’s, a crazy crew of locals and worldly travelers and, of course, tequila. Wait, what? We meant customers, awesome backpackers from all over the world. You included. But don’t worry, if you happen to stumble upon us at a different phase of the moon, our daily events will have you going coconuts. The fun we serve for free.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g2054864-d12981996-Reviews-Jungle_Republic-Koh_Rong_Sanloem_Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street2': '5min walk on the way to Lazy Beach', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': '5min walk on the way to Lazy Beach, Sihanoukville, Koh Rong Sanloem 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Koh Rong Sanloem', 'location_id': '2054864'}, {'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,junglerepublickrs@gmail.com,+855 15 387 766,http://www.jungle-republic.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g2054864-d12981996-Jungle_Republic-Koh_Rong_Sanloem_Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '2054864', 'ranking_string': '#15 of 19 things to do in Koh Rong Sanloem', 'geo_location_name': 'Koh Rong Sanloem', 'ranking_out_of': '19', 'ranking': '15'}",3.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.5-66827-5.svg,9,"{'1': '1', '2': '1', '3': '2', '4': '2', '5': '3'}",Not available,23,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g2054864-d12981996-m66827-Reviews-Jungle_Republic-Koh_Rong_Sanloem_Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '0200'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '0200'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '0200'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '0200'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '0200'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '0200'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '0200'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 08:00 - 02:00', 'Tuesday: 08:00 - 02:00', 'Wednesday: 08:00 - 02:00', 'Thursday: 08:00 - 02:00', 'Friday: 08:00 - 02:00', 'Saturday: 08:00 - 02:00', 'Sunday: 08:00 - 02:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'nightlife', 'localized_name': 'Nightlife'}, {'name': 'fun_games', 'localized_name': 'Fun & Games