K&K Cafe Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w6685-f65bfa5533f34554b0c06dadc4fbfbee,en,coffee,"{'label': 'K&K Cafe Cambodia, 060801 ស្ទឹងសែន, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ធំ', 'city': 'ស្ទឹងសែន', 'district': 'ដំរីជាន់ខ្លា', 'postalCode': '060801'}","{'lat': 12.68995, 'lng': 104.89801}","[{'lat': 12.68977, 'lng': 104.89768}]",19463,"[{'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop', 'primary': True}, {'id': '700-7400-0141', 'name': 'Business Services'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85595663335'}]}],Not Available,Kampong Thom,12.711424,104.88858,1580886,Arunras Hotel,"Welcome to Arunras Hotel, your Kampong Thom “home away from home.” Arunras Hotel aims to make your visit as relaxing and enjoyable as possible, which is why so many guests continue to come back year after year.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as air conditioning, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the hotel.
The property also boasts an on-site restaurant, to help make your stay more enjoyable.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the Asian restaurants, including Sambor Village Restaurant and Bar and Kampong Thom Restaurant, all of which are a short distance from Arunras Hotel.
Arunras Hotel puts the best of Kampong Thom at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
