K9 Riverside Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-886082e5090b0610c76e48bd044b9809,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'K9 Riverside Hotel, ផ្លូវ សុភមង្គល, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សុភមង្គល', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.55068, 'lng': 104.93932}","[{'lat': 11.55079, 'lng': 104.93916}]",22291,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7234832'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523950009'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.550789,104.93915,7234832,K9 Riverside Hotel,"Only 2.8 km from the lively Riverfront Park, K9 Riverside Hotel is housed in a beautiful Cambodian-style building. It offers free WiFi access and a 24-hour front desk. The accommodation is centrally located just 1.7 km from Royal Palace Phnom Penh. Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum is 2.4 km away while Phnom Penh International Airport is 10 km away. Rooms are modern and tastefully furnished. Each is fitted with air conditioning, a laptop safe and a flat-screen TV offering cable channels. There is also a clean en suite bathroom equipped with plush bathrobes and a hairdryer. Guests can enjoy a cup of tea while relaxing at the outdoor terrace. Amenities include luggage storage, free parking facilities, bicycle rental services and laundry/ironing services. An airport transfer can be arranged for a small fee. The on-site restaurant at K9 Riverside Hotel will serve a delectable spread of both Asian and Western cuisines. Chamkar Mon is a great choice for travellers interested in culture, food and friendly locals. Couples particularly like the location — they rated it 8 for a two-person trip. This property is also rated for the best value in Phnom Penh! Guests are getting more for their money when compared to other properties in this city. We speak your language!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d7234832-Reviews-K9_Riverside_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'A9 La srine Koh Pich', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12101', 'address_string': 'A9 La srine Koh Pich, Phnom Penh 12101 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d7234832-K9_Riverside_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#203 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '203'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,15,"{'1': '1', '2': '2', '3': '1', '4': '1', '5': '10'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",147,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d7234832-m66827-Reviews-K9_Riverside_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html#ph