KNN Resort Mondulkiri,here:pds:place:116w6hnz-fac19b0ef101d641c891da291d7b0dda,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'KNN Resort Mondulkiri, 110504 សែនមនោរម្យ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'មណ្ឌលគីរី', 'city': 'សែនមនោរម្យ', 'district': 'រមនា', 'postalCode': '110504'}","{'lat': 12.43867, 'lng': 107.21593}","[{'lat': 12.43854, 'lng': 107.2159}]",123698,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23840139'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855978554710'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.knnresort.com'}]}]",Not Available,Mondulkiri,12.439049,107.21601,23840139,Knn Resort Mondulkiri,"+ WELCOME KNN RESORT KNN Resort is the first real 5-star resort in Krong Saen Monourom, Mondulkiri start it's operation in 2021 with 24 Private Villa and 18 Luxury Private Pool Villa consisted of 60 Rooms & Suite. Resort located on the top hills overlook to a greenery mountain view and natural lake Before established KNN Resort we remained 15 Years in hotel and hospitality industry which make us much confidence to provide a luxury treated and guarantee on our partner and clients satisfaction. With our completed hotel facilities we can offer you the best prices and one stop convenience service + WELCOME KNN RESTUARANT Top Restaurant in Mondulkiri KN&N Restaurant and Lounge located in Krong Saen Monourom build different on your expectation. All of our menu items are inspired by Khmer cuisine and have been created by our head chef. OUTDOOR Large open space top hill view with a greenery and cold windy for nicely breathing MEETING ROOM Consist of 3 VIP Meeting rooms and open door conference hall with total of 300Pax capacity INDOOR LUXURY art décor contemporary mixing with Khmer and Western style making feel of Royal Treat COFFEE A unique blench at top level different taste. We use the latest Italy coffee machine ""Victoria Arduino""",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1893367-d23840139-Reviews-Knn_Resort_Mondulkiri-Sen_Monorom_Mondulkiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Sen Monorom', 'state': 'Mondulkiri Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '110501', 'address_string': 'Sen Monorom 110501 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Sen Monorom', 'location_id': '1893367'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Mondulkiri Province', 'location_id': '2366669'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1893367-d23840139-Knn_Resort_Mondulkiri-Sen_Monorom_Mondulkiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '1893367', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 23 hotels in Sen Monorom', 'geo_location_name': 'Sen Monorom', 'ranking_out_of': '23', 'ranking': '1'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,73,"{'1': '4', '2': '1', '3': '1', '4': '5', '5': '62'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",142,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1893367-d23840139-m66827-Reviews-Knn_Resort_Mondulkiri-Sen_Monorom_Mondulkiri_Province.