KT Hotel,here:pds:place:116w614p-9aa1c81d3be5462eb3d47ef650f13712,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'KT Hotel, 090701 ខេមរភូមិន្ទ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កោះកុង', 'city': 'ខេមរភូមិន្ទ', 'district': 'ស្មាច់មានជ័យ', 'postalCode': '090701'}","{'lat': 11.6153, 'lng': 102.98445}","[{'lat': 11.61531, 'lng': 102.98445}]",41443,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3786598'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855975553656'}]}],Not Available,Koh Kong,11.6153,102.98445,3786598,KT Hotel,"If you’re looking for a budget friendly small hotel in Koh Kong, look no further than KT Hotel.
The rooms offer a minibar, and getting online is possible, as public wifi is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
KT Hotel features room service. In addition, as a valued KT Hotel guest, you can enjoy an on-site restaurant that is available on-site.
Koh Kong has plenty of Asian restaurants. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Fat Sam's Restaurant and Bar, Cafe Laurent, and wood house, which are serving up some great dishes.
Should time allow, Tatai Waterfall is a popular waterfall that is relatively easy to get to.
The staff at KT Hotel looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1532269-d3786598-Reviews-KT_Hotel-Koh_Kong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Village 1, Smach Meanchey', 'city': 'Koh Kong', 'state': 'Koh Kong Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '09000', 'address_string': 'Village 1, Smach Meanchey, Koh Kong 09000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Koh Kong', 'location_id': '1532269'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Koh Kong Province', 'location_id': '2366667'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1532269-d3786598-KT_Hotel-Koh_Kong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},0,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1532269-d3786598-m66827-Reviews-KT_Hotel-Koh_Kong_Koh_Kong_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Room service', 'Restaurant', 'Public Wifi', 'Dry Cleaning', 'Laundry Service', 'Family Rooms', 'Minibar']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'bb', 'localized_name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,11,9
