Kafu Hostel & Pool,here:pds:place:116w63gg-b61ec07cfc0e4baabe771cfbb79dbe12,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Kafu Hostel & Pool, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35723, 'lng': 103.85168}","[{'lat': 13.35736, 'lng': 103.85172}]",24828,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13006000'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563964077'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.kafu-hostel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.357182,103.851654,13006000,Kafu Hostel & Pool,"Featuring a terrace and free WiFi, Kafu Hostel & Pool is set in Siem Reap, a 3-minute walk from Pub Street. Boasting a 24-hour front desk, this property also provides guests with a restaurant. King's Road Angkor is 500 metres away. Guest rooms at the hostel are equipped with a seating area. Featuring a shared bathroom, rooms at Kafu Hostel & Pool also boast a city view. An asian, continental or american breakfast is available daily at the property. The accommodation offers an outdoor pool. You can play billiards at Kafu Hostel & Pool. Angkor Wat is 7 km from the hostel. The nearest airport is Siem Reap - Angkor International Airport, 8 km from Kafu Hostel & Pool.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d13006000-Reviews-Kafu_Hostel_Pool-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 261, Group 2', 'street2': 'Stoeung Thmey Village, Sangkat Svay Dangkum', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': '# 261, Group 2 Stoeung Thmey Village, Sangkat Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not