Kamasutra,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-0b34117477df453eb6b8fb3704d47ed4,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Kamasutra, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60842, 'lng': 104.17889}","[{'lat': 10.60854, 'lng': 104.17883}]",19821,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11779824'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Kampot,10.608505,104.17885,11779824,Kamasutra,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Kampot, Kamasutra is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its proximity to great restaurants and attractions, Kamasutra makes it easy to enjoy the best of Kampot.
Kamasutra features room service, a sun terrace, and express check-in and check-out, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts an on-site restaurant. If you are driving to Kamasutra, free parking is available.
While staying at Kamasutra, visitors can check out The Old Royal Cinema (0.2 mi), which is a popular Kampot attraction.
While in Kampot, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Kamasutra, including Rusty Keyhole (0.0 mi), Epic Arts Cafe (0.1 mi), and bARACA restaurant (0.1 mi).
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Farm Link (0.6 mi), which is a popular attraction amongst tourists, and it is within walking distance.
Kamasutra is sure to make your visit to Kampot one worth remembering.
