Kameng Leng,here:pds:place:116w63vm-fc3e0b452ee9edb093d3d5b1f3452156,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Kameng Leng, 170901 បន្ទាយស្រី, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'បន្ទាយស្រី', 'district': 'ខ្នារសណ្ដាយ', 'postalCode': '170901'}","{'lat': 13.60404, 'lng': 103.96717}","[{'lat': 13.60416, 'lng': 103.96723}]",9999,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '101-000', 'name': 'American'}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-066', 'name': 'Fusion'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25273952'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855969880184'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://web.facebook.com/kamengleng'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Wed, Fri-Sun: 09:00 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT08H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.603101,103.96661,25273952,Kameng Leng,"A Restaurant & Playground based in Wat Bo, Siem Reap. Our playground is inspired by real life, designed especially for 0 to 5 year olds, where you will find our stunning bamboo structures and a carefully selected range of beautiful wooden toys and educational games. Our food and drinks are made with local fresh ingredients, non-processed, chemical-free… and always with love! Almost every element on our menu is homemade - including our tomato sauce, mayonnaise & our delicious chocolate sauce! Healthy and happy food is at the heart of our thoughtfully created menu, along with regular events and meetups that all the family can enjoy!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d25273952-Reviews-Kameng_Leng-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'House No. 67 Banteay Chas Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '171209', 'address_string': 'House No. 67 Banteay Chas Village, Siem Reap 171209 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,+855 96 988 0184,https://web.facebook.com/kamengleng,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d25273952-Kameng_Leng-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#487 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '487'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,5,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '5'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",14,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d25273952-m66827-Reviews-Kameng_Leng-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1600'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0900'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '1600'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: Closed', 'Tuesday: Closed', 'Wednesday: Closed', 'Thursday: Closed', 'Friday: Closed', 'Saturday: 09:00 - 16:00', 'Sunday: 09:00 - 16:00']}","['Cash Only', 'Delivery', 'Digital Payments', 'Family style', 'Free off-street parking', 'Free Wifi', 'Highchairs Available', 'Non-smoking restaurants', 'Outdoor Seating', 'Parking Available', 'Playgrounds', 'Seating', 'Street Parking', 'Table Service', 'Wheelchair Accessible']","[{'name': 'american', 'local