Kampheakroath Bungalows,here:pds:place:116w3fh4-1b7f7824fe59be1cded9364b7048d60e,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Kampheakroath Bungalows, 070805 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'ត្រើយកោះ', 'postalCode': '070805'}","{'lat': 10.56908, 'lng': 104.17449}","[{'lat': 10.56921, 'lng': 104.17447}]",18882,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26432617'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516890403'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/kampheakroath', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.569115,104.17449,26432617,Kampheakroath Bungalows,"Featuring lake views, Kampheakroath Bungalows provides accommodation with balcony, around 6.7 km from Kampot Pagoda. This property offers access to a terrace, free private parking and free WiFi. Boasting family rooms, this property also provides guests with a year-round outdoor pool. Overlooking the mountain, units in this guest house are accessible via private entrance and fitted with a flat-screen TV and a private bathroom with a shower and slippers. A microwave, a toaster and fridge are also provided, as well as a kettle. Guests can enjoy a meal at an outdoor dining area and later warm themselves up in their unit's fireplace. Continental and Full English/Irish breakfast options with warm dishes, local specialities and fresh pastries are available daily at the guest house. A bar can be found on-site. Guests can also relax in the garden. Kampot Provincial Museum is 8.3 km from Kampheakroath Bungalows, while Kampot Train Station is 9.4 km away. The nearest airport is Sihanouk International Airport, 86 km from the accommodation.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d26432617-Reviews-Kampheakroath_Bungalows-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Beoung Tapream Village', 'street2': 'Truykoh Communce', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Beoung Tapream Village Truykoh Communce, Kampot Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d26432617-Kampheakroath_Bungalows-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#55 of 115 Specialty lodging in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '115', 'ranking': '55'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,1,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '1'}",{},2,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d26432617-m66827-Reviews-Kampheakroath_Bungalows-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Suites', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Pets Allowed', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Business center', 'Air conditioning', 'Family Rooms', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Safe', 'Flatscreen TV', 'Kids pool', 'Outdoor pool', 'Private Pools', 'Breakfast Available', 'Parking', 'Housekeeping', 'Kids Stay Free', 'Additional Bathroom', 'Allergy-free Room', 'Baggage Storage', 'Bath / Shower', 'Bathrobes', 'BBQ Facilities', 'Blackout Curtains', 'Bottled Water', 'Bridal Suite', 'Cable / Satellite TV', 'Car Hire', ""Children's Television Networks"", 'Clothes Rack', 'Coffee Shop', 'Coffee / Tea Maker', 'Currency Exchange', 'Desk', 'Dining Area', 'English', 'First Aid Kit', 'Fishing', 'Free Private Parking Nearby', 'Free Public Parking Nearby', 'Complimentary Toiletries', 'Free Wired Internet in the Business Center', 'French', '24-Hour Front Desk', 'Karaoke', 'Khmer', ""Kids' Meals"", 'Kid-Friendly Buffet', 'Landmark View', 'M