Kampot Coco Guest House,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-7018b40405f3d0de478385d596492dd1,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Kampot Coco Guest House, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.60657, 'lng': 104.17476}","[{'lat': 10.60663, 'lng': 104.17488}]",105831,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '24986524'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570720320'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://kampot-coco-guest-house.business.site', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.606555,104.174736,24986524,Kampot Coco Guest House,"Kampot Coco Guest House is located near Entanou Bridge, just a 3 minute walk to most popular of French colonial architecture building and Kampot Old Market. It offers ultimate comfort with a range of modern amenities each room comes with air conditioning, a desk, a flat-screen smart TV, fee high speed Wifi, a private bathroom, a comfortable bed, everything you need for a pleasant stay. The accommodation provides a 24-hours service front desk. The nearest airport is Sihanoukville International Airport just 80 km. Kampot Coco Guest house offers room service, business Center and currency exchange, all the offering to make your stayed feel at home with the services and hospitality at Kampot Coco Guest House.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d24986524-Reviews-Kampot_Coco_Guest_House-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Thvi Kang Tboung Village', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '070804', 'address_string': 'Thvi Kang Tboung Village, Kampot 070804 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Coun