Kampot Jungle Village,here:pds:place:116w3fhd-4f32ab87cf2f4595ab1d471a94be63b1,en,bar_pub,"{'label': 'Kampot Jungle Village, 070208 ទឹកឈូរ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'ទឹកឈូរ', 'district': 'ម៉ាក់ប្រាង', 'postalCode': '070208'}","{'lat': 10.64812, 'lng': 104.15359}","[{'lat': 10.64826, 'lng': 104.15389}]",24354,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510343451'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.kampotjungle.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.652739,104.16718,6091983,Eden Eco Village,"A true Eco Resort, Eden offers riverside accommodation in an ethnic Cham village 5 km from kampot town. Natural bungalows feature large doors which open to a view of river and mountains and a swimming deck built over the river itself. Guests can enjoy incredible organic Khmer cuisine and locally inspired cocktails on their own private deck or in our relaxing common areas. All bungalows use bright solar lighting and have en-suite eco toilets. There is plenty to discover in the village and maps are available for detailed self guided bicycle tours. Free Kayaks, Morning Yoga classes, bicycles, swim tubes, and fishing tackle!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d6091983-Reviews-Eden_Eco_Village-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Mak Prang', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Mak Prang, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d6091983-Eden_Eco_Village-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#10 of 115 Specialty lodging in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '115', 'ranking': '10'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,174,"{'1': '4', '2': '9', '3': '23', '4': '38', '5': '100'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",392,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d6091983-m66827-Reviews-Eden_Eco_Village-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Room service', 'Free Internet', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Free Wifi', 'Safe', 'Lazy River', 'Breakfast Available', 'Bath / Shower', 'Canoeing', 'Mosquito Net', 'Kids Activities', 'Pets Allowed', 'Wifi', 'Laundry Service', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Private Balcony', 'Parking', 'Housekeeping', 'Bicycle Rental', 'Bicycle Tours', 'Bicycles Available', 'Boating', 'Bottled Water', 'Breakfast in the Room', 'Clothes Rack', 'English', 'Fishing', 'Complimentary Welcome Drink', 'Hiking', 'Khmer', 'Mountain View', 'Seating Area', 'Shared Loun