Kampot River Residence,here:pds:place:116w3fhd-06f9f653014d4b5d98cb699347f98ebb,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Kampot River Residence, 070203 ទឹកឈូរ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'ទឹកឈូរ', 'district': 'កំពង់ក្រែង', 'postalCode': '070203'}","{'lat': 10.63695, 'lng': 104.17105}","[{'lat': 10.63684, 'lng': 104.17099}]",23898,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85589389168'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://kampotriverresidence.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.634313,104.17019,12863086,Kampot River Residence,"Showcasing a terrace and views of the mountains, Kampot River Residence is located in Kampot in the region of Kampot Province, just 4.3 km from Kampot Pagoda. Guests can enjoy the on-site bar. Free WiFi is available throughout the property and free private parking is available on site. Each room at this hotel is air conditioned and features a flat-screen TV. Some units have a sitting area where you can relax. You will find a kettle in the room. All rooms are equipped with a private bathroom. Extras include slippers and free toiletries.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g21367060-d12863086-Reviews-Kampot_River_Residence-Kampong_Kraeng_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Kampong Kraeng', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07403', 'address_string': 'Kampong Kraeng 07403 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampong Kraeng', 'location_id': '21367060'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g21367060-d12863086-Kampot_River_Residence-Kampong_Kraeng_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '21367060', 'ranking_string': '#4 of 6 B&Bs / Inns in Kampong