Kampot Sunny Hotel,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-621aedf4ea2159c67406fe103a987ee2,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Kampot Sunny Hotel, 070803 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់បាយ', 'postalCode': '070803'}","{'lat': 10.61286, 'lng': 104.18057}","[{'lat': 10.6128, 'lng': 104.18045}]",25574,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23765648'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85587760760'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.kampotsunnyhotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.612829,104.18051,23765648,Kampot Sunny Hotel,"Located in Kampot, 2.4 km from Kampot Pagoda, Sunny Hotel Kampot features a garden and views of the city. This 3-star hotel offers a tour desk. The property provides a 24-hour front desk, a shared lounge and currency exchange for guests. At the hotel each room comes with air conditioning, a desk, a balcony with a river view, a private bathroom, a flat-screen TV, bed linen and towels. Sunny Hotel Kampot has certain rooms with mountain views, and all rooms are equipped with an electric tea pot. Guest rooms include a safety deposit box. Kampot Night Market is a 2-minute walk from the accommodation, while Kampot Provincial Museum is 1.1 km away. The nearest airport is Sihanoukville International Airport, 59.5 km from Sunny Hotel Kampot.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d23765648-Reviews-Kampot_Sunny_Hotel-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Road 718, 701', 'street2': 'Kampongbay Khangtbong', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '13205', 'address_string': 'Road 718, 701 Kampongbay Khangtbong, Kampot 13205 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d23765648-Kampot_Sunny_Hotel-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#34 of 88 hotels in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '88', 'ranking': '34'}",3,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.0-66827-5.svg,7,"{'1': '2', '2': '0', '3': '2', '4': '1', '5': '2'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss2.5.svg', 'value': '2.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss2.5.svg', 'value': '2.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}}",36,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d23765648-m66827-Reviews-Kampot_Sunny_Hotel-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Suites', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Spa', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Breakfast included', 'Meeting rooms', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Fitness center', 'Concierge', 'Banquet Room', 'Air conditioning', 'Family Rooms', 'Self-Serve Laundry', 'Refrigerator in room', 'Conference Facilities', 'Safe', 'Flatscreen TV', 'Breakfast Buffet', 'Private Balcony', 'Breakfast Available', 'Parking', 'Housekeeping', 'Bath / Shower', 'Bathrobes', 'Bicycle Rental', 'Bi