Kanitha Boutique Villa,here:pds:place:116aabd1-5644fb10a47b0cf89ebdcc79295d8243,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Kanitha Boutique Villa, អេអេច21, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'អេអេច21', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.37434, 'lng': 103.83742}","[{'lat': 13.37445, 'lng': 103.83749}]",87911,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3198100'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512891308', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85563968189'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.374126,103.837296,3198100,Kanitha Boutique Villa,"Looking for a place to stay in Siem Reap? Then look no further than Kanitha Boutique Villa, a charming guest house that brings the best of Siem Reap to your doorstep.
Free wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at Kanitha Boutique Villa offer air conditioning and a minibar.
During your stay, take advantage of some of the amenities offered, including room service and a concierge. Guests of Kanitha Boutique Villa are also welcome to enjoy a pool and free breakfast, located on site. For travelers arriving by car, free parking is available.
Close to some of Siem Reap's most popular landmarks, such as Angkor Cab (0.5 mi) and ArtBox (0.9 mi), Kanitha Boutique Villa is a great destination for tourists.
If you’re looking for a Mediterranean restaurant, consider a visit to Olive Cuisine de Saison, Atmosphere Siem Reap, or Elia Greek Kitchen, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Kanitha Boutique Villa.
If you’re looking for something to do, Friendly Tuk Tuk Driver (0.7 mi) and War Museum Cambodia (1.0 mi) are a nice way to spend some time, and they are all within walking distance of Kanitha Boutique Villa.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Kanitha Boutique Villa as you experience everything Siem Reap has to offer.
