Karma Traders Kampot,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-fcd2a1dec16a4bbbb452c0af9fb1f8c2,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Karma Traders Kampot, 070203 ទឹកឈូរ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'ទឹកឈូរ', 'district': 'កំពង់ក្រែង', 'postalCode': '070203'}","{'lat': 10.62275, 'lng': 104.17227}","[{'lat': 10.62279, 'lng': 104.1724}]",129394,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12161966'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '24039154'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516556504'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/karmatraderskampot'}, {'value': 'https://www.karmatraderskampot.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.622763,104.1723,12161966,Karma Traders Kampot,"Your home away from home. Karma Traders is located in a quiet area about 1.5kms from the center of town. We offer a refreshing swimming pool with bar, family dinners, rooftop bar/restaurant with views of Bokor National Park, cinema room, ping pong table, and 5x free WiFi networks throughout the property. Our rooftop cocktail bar has stunning sunrise and sunset views, with breakfast, lunch and dinner served daily. Happy hour 5-7pm everyday, enjoy 25% off all alcohol. Don't miss our live music nights every Tuesday and pub quiz every Sunday evenings. We can organise all ongoing travel, scooter rental, local recommendations and can offer advice on planning your journey. Whatever you need, our friendly fleet of staff are here to help!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d12161966-Reviews-Karma_Traders_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Red Road', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '85533', 'address_string': 'Red Road, Kampot 85533 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d12161966-Karma_Traders_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#5 of 115 Specialty lodging in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '115', 'ranking': '5'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,168,"{'1': '2', '2': '5', '3': '3', '4': '11', '5': '147'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",93,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d12161966-m66827-Reviews-Karma_Traders_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Rooftop Bar', 'Evening Entertainment', 'Free parking', 'Pets Allowed', 'Air conditioning', 'Family Rooms', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Rooftop Terrace', 'Breakfast Available', 'Baggage Storage', 'Board Games / Puzzles', 'Clothes Rack', 'English', 'First Aid Kit', 'Happy Hour', 'Khmer', 'Outdoor Dini