Karmakazi,here:pds:place:116w3csh-3cf4e36fe629503202e91356d156a33d,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Karmakazi, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.57863, 'lng': 103.54765}","[{'lat': 10.57855, 'lng': 103.54754}]",87126,"[{'id': '800-8600-0197', 'name': 'Sports Activities', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12441933'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855977055202'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://karmakazi.guru'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 09:00 - 19:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT10H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Preah Sihanouk,10.578619,103.54765,12441933,Karmakazi,"Explore the marine life found on the islands coral reefs which include more than 600 hundred species such as angel fish, butterfly fish, parrot fish, puffer fish, seahorses and much more, amid Samloem’s breathtaking island on this land to water based snorkelling adventure lead by island specialists with an english speaking instructor and Khmer captain on-board a traditional long tail boat.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g2054864-d12441933-Reviews-Karmakazi-Koh_Rong_Sanloem_Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Saracen Bay', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Saracen Bay, Sihanoukville, Koh Rong Sanloem 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Koh Rong Sanloem', 'location_id': '2054864'}, {'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,bookings@karmakazi.guru,+855 97 705 5