Keanthay Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116d408k-57cca4fba2f10f4745cfd177339d2f9c,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Keanthay Guesthouse, ផ្លូវជាតិ 57, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 57', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.08493, 'lng': 103.1967}","[{'lat': 13.0848, 'lng': 103.19672}]",11465,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6000819'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592777666'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/keanthay.guesthouse'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.085047,103.196686,6000819,Keanthay Guesthouse,"Located in Battambang, KeanThay Guesthouse is an affordable property with free Wi-Fi access at all areas. Rooms are clean, comfortable and cooled with air conditioning. Guests can also relax by the rooftop terrace.Situated along Sangke Lake, the guesthouse is located 1 km from Riverside Night Market and 1.1 km from Battambang Museum.Rooms here will provide you with a flat-screen TV with cable channels. There is also a minibar and a writing table. The attached bathrooms come with free toiletries and bath towels.At KeanThay Guesthouse, you will find a 24-hour front desk with a peaceful garden. The property offers luggage storage and free parking space. Shuttle services are available at a surcharge.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d6000819-Reviews-Keanthay_Guesthouse-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#G03 Street 153 Kamakor Commune', 'street2': 'Svaypor District', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': '#G03 Street 153 Kamakor Commune Svaypor District, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {