Kep Coffee,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-ebad9b1bd3dd4557afe5cb86f5bd3572,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Kep Coffee, ផ្លូវ 33 អេ, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 33 អេ', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.48024, 'lng': 104.31469}","[{'lat': 10.48037, 'lng': 104.31465}]",6683,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}, {'id': '600-6300-0245', 'name': 'Sweet Shop'}]","[{'id': '102-000', 'name': 'Mexican', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6780967'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855972607472'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/KepCoffee', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}], 'text': ['Tue-Sun: 07:00 - 18:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT11H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kep,10.480131,104.31472,6780967,Kep Coffee,"We are a family friendly small Cafe that has been open since May 12th 2014. We are on Road 33A, on a gravel road next to the Sokimex gas station and close to the Rabbit Island Pier. We are open from 7am till 6pm Tuesdays to Sundays and Closed Mondays. We love making homemade sweets. We serve breakfast and lunch with a few items like omelettes, Grilled sandwiches, big beef burger and pizzas.Veggie lovers welcome. We are also known for our sweets like cinnamon rolls, chocolate chip cookies, chocolate cakes and banana bread.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608456-d6780967-Reviews-Kep_Coffee-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '33A Road', 'street2': 'Behind Sokimex Petrol Station', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '22101', 'address_string': '33A Road Behind Sokimex Petrol Station, Kep 22101 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'nam