Kep Eden,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-7a48cf01c1bc46a3b3e8f31bd138965f,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Kep Eden, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.49242, 'lng': 104.29022}","[{'lat': 10.49256, 'lng': 104.2902}]",7378,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17433966'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85586946157'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://kep-eden.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.49243,104.29022,17433966,Kep Eden,"Kep Eden welcomes you to Kep, in the south of Cambodia, in the heart of an extraordinary region by its history and its environment. Our resort is located right by the sea, close to the crab market. We offer a ""zen"" space that will allow you to fully enjoy your stay here in Kep. Kep Eden vous accueille a Kep, au sud du Cambodge, au coeur d’une region extraordinaire par son histoire et son environn",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d17433966-Reviews-Kep_Eden-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '33A Road', 'street2': 'Phum Thmey, Sangkat Prey Thom', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07503', 'address_string': '33A Road Phum Thmey, Sangkat Prey Thom, Kep 07503 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d17433966-Kep_Eden-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_string': '#20 of 71 B&Bs / Inns in Kep', 'geo_location_name': 'Kep', 'ranking_out_of': '71', 'ranking': '20'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,21,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '0', '4': '4', '5': '16