Kep Kiri Resort,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-a6c3e0e13bea181c9c3cbd56f50316f9,en,holiday_park,"{'label': 'Kep Kiri Resort, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.49737, 'lng': 104.31264}","[{'lat': 10.49747, 'lng': 104.31255}]",133384,"[{'id': '500-5100-0059', 'name': 'Holiday Park', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25103118'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85585916289'}]}],Not Available,Kep,10.497199,104.312805,25103118,Kep Kiri Resort,"Kep Kiri Resort nestles at the base of the mountains in Kep Province, offering a cool mountain breeze with a view of the ocean. When you visit Kep, enjoy our modern take on traditional Khmer design, hang out by the pool, or relax with a drink from the sky bar.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d25103118-Reviews-Kep_Kiri_Resort-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '2330 St', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '220101', 'address_string': '2330 St, Kep 220101 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d25103118-Kep_Kiri_Resort-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_string': '#18 of 48 Specialty lodging in Kep', 'geo_location_name': 'Kep', 'ranking_out_of': '48', 'ranking': '18'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,4,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '4'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/travele