Kep Lodge Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-d011e57f5cb04b7fb147ac02634aeceb,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Kep Lodge Restaurant, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.49686, 'lng': 104.31825}","[{'lat': 10.49695, 'lng': 104.31835}]",4896,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '800-057', 'name': 'Pizza', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian'}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '300-000', 'name': 'European'}, {'id': '304-000', 'name': 'Italian'}, {'id': '310-000', 'name': 'Swiss'}, {'id': '800-066', 'name': 'Fusion'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4154371'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592435330'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.keplodge.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.496721,104.3181,4154371,Kep Lodge Restaurant,"The Kep Lodge restaurant provides you with a nice mix of popular Khmer dishes like Lok Lak and Amok, but also our popular Khmer BBQ with meat or seafood, prepared on your table. For all the cheese lovers/cravers we also offer you Swiss cheese Fondu, Raclette all year round. Other Swiss dishes include Roesti (with sausages, beef or bacon etc), Kaeseschnitte, Spatzli. For our younger guests we do further prepare piazzas, a very tasty cheese burger or home made french fries. Various salads, pasta or soups are prepared for vegetarians. En guata = Please enjoy your meal!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608456-d4154371-Reviews-Kep_Lodge_Restaurant-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Pepper Street 1', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '15000', 'address_string': 'Pepper Street 1, Kep 15000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phn