Kep Malibu Bungalows. Cambodge,here:pds:place:116d408k-ce54163068e00b3a0044bc6f0408f0ab,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Kep Malibu Bungalows. Cambodge, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.47996, 'lng': 104.30801}","[{'lat': 10.47996, 'lng': 104.30802}]",7081,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'www': [{'value': 'http://www.malibuestatesbungalows.com'}]}],Not Available,Kep,10.490768,104.29382,7625520,Kep Bungalows,"Featuring an outdoor pool, Le Kep Bungalows offers peaceful and comfortable accommodation with free WiFi access in the guestrooms. It has a 24-hour front desk, free parking space on site and lush green gardens. Fitted with a balcony, air-conditioned rooms and bungalows include a desk, clothes rack, a minibar and a flat-screen TV. The attached bathroom has towels and shower facility.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d7625520-Reviews-Kep_Bungalows-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 33 A Thmey Village, Prey Thom Commune, Crab Market', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07503', 'address_string': '# 33 A Thmey Village, Prey Thom Commune, Crab Market, Kep 07503 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d7625520-Kep_Bungalows-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_string': '#21 of 71 B&Bs / Inns in Kep', 'geo_location_name': 'Kep', 'ranking_out_of': '71', 'ranking': '21'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,128,"{'1': '15', '2': '7', '