Kep Sur Mer Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-37153afbac344f8ea018bb375aefc55a,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Kep Sur Mer Restaurant, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.48707, 'lng': 104.2892}","[{'lat': 10.48708, 'lng': 104.28934}]",7843,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-075', 'name': 'Seafood'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12316915'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855973677745'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/KEP-SUR-MER-Restaurant-828804827152151', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 10:30 - 22:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T103000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kep,10.487056,104.28912,12316915,KEP SUR MER Restaurant,"KEP SUR MER Restaurant (Formally The Democrat Restaurant) is located at The Crab Market offering fresh seafood, veggie and meat dishes. Great Seafood, Western Food, Asian Food, BBQ, Daily HAPPY HOURS from 5.00 pm until 7.00 pm During the Sunset All the Cocktails Half Price (only $ 2.00)! The Staffs can Speak English. The Chef is Fantastic More than 12 years Experiences. Don't forget to be here when you are in Kep, Try the Best Crab Cake for Start and Great Crab Amok for Main. KEP SUR MER Restaurant is offering: Free Tuk Tuk Pick up & return transport from your Kep area guesthouse, Free delivery in the Kep area. KEP SUR MER also can arranger private Dinner as a group with BBQ or Set Menu It located at very Famous Crab Market, Kep, Cambodia But cooking Class not available any more.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608456-d12316915-Reviews-KEP_SUR_MER_Restaurant-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '33a', 'street2': 'Waterfront Crab Market', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07503', 'address_string': '33a Waterfront Crab Market, Kep 07503 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,cheamsamoeun@gmail.com,+855 97 367 7745,http://www.facebook.com/KEP-SUR-MER-Restaurant-828804827152151/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d12316915-KEP_SUR_MER_Restaurant-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_string': '#3 of 65 Places to Eat in Kep', 'geo_location_name': 'Kep', 'ranking_out_of': '65', 'ranking': '3'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,194,"{'1': '3', '2': '3', '3': '6', '4': '35', '5': '147'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",177,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608456-d12316915-m66827-Reviews-KEP_SUR_MER_Restaurant-Kep_Kep_Province.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1030'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2230'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1030'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2230'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1030'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2230'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1030