Kepa Cabana,here:pds:place:116aabd1-a47c1768c7b30612ff6dc889871cfb6f,fr,restaurant,"{'label': 'Kepa Cabana, ផ្លូវ 33 អេ, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 33 អេ', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.48423, 'lng': 104.3193}","[{'lat': 10.48433, 'lng': 104.31921}]",6060,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]","[{'id': '101-003', 'name': 'American-Barbecue', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855714333742'}]}],Not Available,Kep,10.600741,104.17033,8487069,Kampot Cabana,"Kampot Cabana features rustic wooden bungalows built over the river, amidst calming greenery. Free WiFi is available in public areas. Located in Cambodia’s Andung Khmer Village, Kampot Cabana is 1.5 km from the city centre. The guesthouse provides motorbike rentals. Tuk-Tuk tours and bus tickets can be arranged at the reception desk. Each bungalow is fan-cooled, and comes with a mosquito net. Bathroom and toilet facilities are shared. Laundry facilities are available. Kampot Cabana serves food and drinks at the bar from 07:30 to 21:00. Guests can also enjoy views of the sunset from the terrace.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d8487069-Reviews-Kampot_Cabana-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Andung Khmer Village', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Andung Khmer Village, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d8487069-Kampot_Cabana-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_s