Kepmandou Lounge-Bar,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-361f4256ce8840318bbc1c375b03db94,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Kepmandou Lounge-Bar, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.48361, 'lng': 104.31982}","[{'lat': 10.48351, 'lng': 104.31973}]",6098,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3568289'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855977958723'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/kepmandou.loungebar?ref=tn_tnmn'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.483558,104.31978,3568289,Kepmandou Lounge-Bar,"Located in the Old Casino Kep (Cambodia southeast) along the South China Sea.Boasting stunning views of the Gulf of Siam and its islands, Kep National Park, the restaurant is a Kepmandou associative guesthouse-lounge-bar, instead of socio-cultural events (concerts, movies, poker, pool table, playstation). Partner associations School for All EFA-Os Knea Chaul Rean Taing, AS Kep.Shop offers T-shirts, postcards, Kampot pepper, etc.. Benefits are paid in full at the School Ayravady regarding the T-shirts and postcards.Discover the region, share experiences and exchange ideas with teachers around the school Ayravady daily specials prepared by our chef Konthy!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d3568289-Reviews-Kepmandou_Lounge_Bar-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Rue du Vieux Casino', 'street2': 'Psar Kep', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '9833', 'address_string': 'Rue du Vieux Casino Psar Kep, Kep 9833 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d3568289-Kep