Khavi Villa,here:pds:place:116aabd1-0507580c8b23032b6db4947676f5fb8d,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Khavi Villa, ផ្លូវ 258, 120207 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ចតុមុខ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 258', 'postalCode': '120207'}","{'lat': 11.55962, 'lng': 104.93386}","[{'lat': 11.55975, 'lng': 104.93386}]",73897,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6534524'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523220182'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.559679,104.93386,6534524,KhaVi Villa,"Khavi Villa is a small Villa Hotel well situated in the historic part of Phnom Penh, near the Royal Palace and close the Riverfront called Quay Sisowath.The Villa will provide you with an outdoor swimming pool, bar and restaurant on a floral terrace. Rooms are well equiped, with flat screen TV, air conditionning, refrigerator with mini bar, electric kettle, private bathroom with large shower and on each floor you will enjoy the view of the swimming pool and the patio from a big balcony on which you can get drinks at any time.At Khavi Villa you will find airport shuttle, and a lot of suggestions for visiting Phnom Penh with Wat Phnom, Tuol Sleng, Russian and Central Market and the surroundings like the Killings Fields, and to continue easily your trip in Cambodia.All the team will be at his best to be sure you will enjoy your stay at Khavi Villa.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d6534524-Reviews-KhaVi_Villa-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#12 St. 258, Chaktomuk, Khan Daun Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '#12 St. 258, Chaktomuk, Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 