Khayangan Beach Club,here:pds:place:116w3csk-c362bad83580400d9fd8b2ba24ff1a36,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Khayangan Beach Club, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.6049, 'lng': 103.56462}","[{'lat': 10.6049, 'lng': 103.56462}]",47261,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '201-000', 'name': 'Chinese'}, {'id': '211-000', 'name': 'Indonesian'}, {'id': '300-000', 'name': 'European'}, {'id': '304-000', 'name': 'Italian'}, {'id': '372-000', 'name': 'Mediterranean'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26869890'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855763578402'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Thu: 10:00 - 12:00', 'Fri: 10:00 - 24:00', 'Sat: 00:00 - 02:00, 10:00 - 24:00', 'Sun: 00:00 - 02:00, 10:00 - 12:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T100000', 'duration': 'PT02H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,SU'}, {'start': 'T100000', 'duration': 'PT16H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:FR,SA'}]}]",Preah Sihanouk,10.604902,103.56461,26869890,Khayangan Beach Club,"The biggest Beach Club concept in Sihanoukville, Cambodia ‘Swim, eat, sip, and relax in any way you desire’ Nestled in the coastal charm of Sihanoukville, Cambodia, Khayangan Beach Club stands as a premier destination for those seeking a perfect blend of leisure and luxury. Boasting a collection of five exquisite Food and Beverage outlets, Khayangan Beach Club invites you to indulge in a culinary journey like no other. Whether it's on our artificial beach, in our infinity pool, on a daybed, under the shade of swaying palms, or at one of our restaurants, you are invited to swim, eat, sip, and relax in any way you desire. Soak in the vibrant atmosphere as you enjoy an extensive offering of comfort food and variety of cocktails with live entertainment.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/