Khemra Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-552c63fbcaed4d43ae6905a5406b6385,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Khemra Guesthouse, 070803 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់បាយ', 'postalCode': '070803'}","{'lat': 10.61434, 'lng': 104.17985}","[{'lat': 10.61428, 'lng': 104.17973}]",20013,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2530175'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577789736'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.614393,104.17996,2530175,Khemra Guesthouse,"See why so many travelers make Khemra Guesthouse their guest house of choice when visiting Kampot. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a family-friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
While staying at Khemra Guesthouse, visitors can check out The Old Royal Cinema (0.4 mi), which is a popular Kampot attraction.
Free wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at Khemra Guesthouse offer air conditioning, a seating area, and a desk.
During your stay, take advantage of some of the amenities offered, including a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and room service. For travelers arriving by car, free parking is available.
