Khmer Camelot Resort,here:pds:place:116w3cuu-5004b702e56f4c06b1fc4c020209bf49,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Khmer Camelot Resort, អេអេច123, 180111 ព្រៃនប់, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រៃនប់', 'district': 'ទឹកល្អក់', 'street': 'អេអេច123', 'postalCode': '180111'}","{'lat': 10.70119, 'lng': 103.89662}","[{'lat': 10.70119, 'lng': 103.89661}]",25730,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4841383'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855973765860'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.70119,103.89662,4841383,Khmer Camelot Resort,"Finding an ideal small hotel in Sihanoukville does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Khmer Camelot Resort, a nice option for travelers like you.
As your “home away from home,” the small hotel rooms offer air conditioning, a kitchenette, and a desk, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, 24 hour check-in, and baggage storage while staying at Khmer Camelot Resort. In addition, Khmer Camelot Resort offers a pool and an on-site restaurant, which will help make your Sihanoukville trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is parking available to guests.
Travelers looking for a place to eat close to Khmer Camelot Resort can head to Sophary Restaurant (0.0 mi) or Aquapool'Co (0.0 mi), all of which are within walking distance.
Khmer Camelot Resort puts the best of Sihanoukville at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
