Khmer House Bungalow,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-96619e16dd0343f4aa5c26e0bd8d4b93,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Khmer House Bungalow, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.48466, 'lng': 104.31195}","[{'lat': 10.48475, 'lng': 104.31205}]",6409,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855973677745'}]}],Not Available,Kep,10.494533,104.29512,6490209,Khmer Hands Bungalows,"Khmer Hands is a unique combination of guest house and arts training center offering traditional bungalow style accommodations with both garden and mountain views, while also providing local impoverish youth with hospitality and arts training; helping them to secure safe and rewarding employment. Guests enjoy true Cambodian culture, and bring valuable experience to the youth in training. The Khmer Hands restaurant provides wonderful ocean views, traditional Khmer food, local favourites, and a selection of western dishes. Clothing, bags, and jewelry handmade by the students and their instructor is also available in the Khmer Hands boutique. Please come and join us.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d6490209-Reviews-Khmer_Hands_Bungalows-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Phum Thmey, Prey Thom', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Phum Thmey, Prey Thom, Kep Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d6490209-Khmer_Hands_Bungalows-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 71 B&Bs / Inns in Kep', 'geo_location_name': 'Kep', 'ranking_out_o