Khmer Kids Art Gallery,here:pds:place:116aabd1-b05429a835fe0164bc66093093747d17,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Khmer Kids Art Gallery, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34869, 'lng': 103.85679}","[{'lat': 13.34873, 'lng': 103.85666}]",226210,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4399282'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517223370'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.348639,103.85674,4399282,Khmer Kids Art Gallery & Art workshop,"Small Art School is a non-profit organization that provides free art education to underprivileged children in Cambodia. The school was founded by Tomoko Kasahara and her team of dedicated educators. Our mission is to empower Khmer children through creativity and education. The school's programs and activities help students to develop their artistic talents, broaden their knowledge, and build confidence. The school's Art Studio is open to the public and sells artwork created by students. The profits from artwork sales are shared as follows: 50% to the individual artist or their affiliated organization 30% to the Art Studio to cover operational costs 20% to Small Art School to support its educational activities Small Art School is a valuable resource for underprivileged children in Cambodia. The school's programs and activities help students to develop their creativity, confidence, and skills. If you are interested in supporting Small Art School, you can donate or purchase artwork.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d4399282-Reviews-Khmer_Kids_Art_Gallery_Art_workshop-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '45 Bamboo Street', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '93184', 'address_string': '45 Bamboo Street, Siem Reap 93184 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Munic