Khmer Moringa Manufacturing,here:pds:place:116httek-f256ff7bb655043ba567c35c5bdf894c,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Khmer Moringa Manufacturing, 120803 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'សែនសុខ', 'subdistrict': 'ខ្មួញ', 'postalCode': '120803'}","{'lat': 11.63255, 'lng': 104.84767}","[{'lat': 11.63268, 'lng': 104.84765}]",72749,"[{'id': '600-6300-0066', 'name': 'Grocery', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517669227'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.khmermoringa.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.589344,104.85253,13199181,Samathi Lake Resort,"We have created a complete oasis for you to come and relax, rejuvenate mind and body and leave us feeling completely amazing! Our lovely team is here to take care of you and make you feel fantastic, simply enjoying morning gym session by the lake, relaxing by the pool, sampling some fantastic food from our on-site restaurant, or indulging in one of our amazing spa treatments. The accommodation at Samathi Lake Resort ranges from standard room to one of our fantastic superior suites, all rooms have queen sized beds & en-suites. Our deluxe balcony rooms, family suites and lakeside suites come with air-conditioning as standard. All accommodation has been lovingly designed with plenty of attention to detail to provide maximum comfort. Use of all facilities are included in the price.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d13199181-Reviews-Samathi_Lake_Resort-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '37, Street 2011', 'street2': 'Phnom Penh Thmey', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '37, Street 2011 Phnom Penh Thmey, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not availabl