 'Board Games / Puzzles', 'Boating', 'Books, DVDs, Music for Children', 'Breakfast in the Room', 'Car Hire', 'Express Check-in / Check-out', 'English', 'Fishing', 'Fitness / Spa Locker Rooms', 'Foot Massage', 'Complimentary Toiletries', 'French', 'Full Body Massage', 'Hand Massage', 'Head Massage', 'Ironing Service', 'Khmer', 'Manicure', 'Massage', 'Neck Massage', 'Outdoor Dining Area', 'Outdoor Furniture', 'Pedicure', 'Pool / Beach Towels', 'Pool View', 'Pool with View', 'Salon', 'Secured Parking', 'Sofa', 'Special Diet Menus', 'Street Parking', 'Sun Loungers / Beach Chairs', 'Sun Terrace', 'Sun Umbrellas', 'Taxi Service', 'Umbrella', 'Wardrobe / Closet', 'Wine / Champagne']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'other', 'localized_name': 'Specialty Lodging'}]",Not available,"['Charming', 'Quaint']",[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '10'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '21'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '7'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '9'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,20,14
Khmer Nokor Puppetry,here:pds:place:116w63vm-e357b6f304b1460db8f9cd14452ef88d,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Khmer Nokor Puppetry, 080315 កណ្ដាលស្ទឹង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'កណ្ដាលស្ទឹង', 'district': 'សៀមរាប', 'postalCode': '080315'}","{'lat': 11.40124, 'lng': 104.86699}","[{'lat': 11.40137, 'lng': 104.86629}]",18532,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'www': [{'value': 'http://www.khmernokorpuppetry.com'}]}],Not Available,Kandal,11.566492,104.91911,456209,Pacific Hotel Phnom Penh,"The Pacific Hotel is the first explorer themed concept hotel in the centre of Phnom Penh’s exciting business district. Experience a stay in a hotel where the elements of design and service are tailored to keep you relaxed while walking you through the untold history of Cambodia. Journey through every province in our corridors, which serves as an interactive museum, while being treated like a VIP with our impeccable service for value. The Pacific Ocean derived its name for its specific use of being pacific, meaning “peaceful” or “characterised by calmness”. The Pacific Hotel serves the same purpose. It is an ocean for you to peacefully float on as you explore the beautiful aspects of Cambodian culture and history for the first time just as Ferdinand Magellan first explored the Pacific Ocean in 1520.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d456209-Reviews-Pacific_Hotel_Phnom_Penh-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 234 Monivong Boulevard', 'street2': 'Sangkat Phsar Thmei 2', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '# 234 Monivong Boulevard Sangkat Phsar Thmei 2, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not availab