Khmer Ways - Moto Adventures Day Tours,here:pds:place:116aabd1-1ef97c54bc61088c1d2f3e7644085c06,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Khmer Ways - Moto Adventures Day Tours, ផ្លូវ 204, 170905 បន្ទាយស្រី, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'បន្ទាយស្រី', 'district': 'រុនតាឯក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 204', 'postalCode': '170905'}","{'lat': 13.46006, 'lng': 103.99606}","[{'lat': 13.46012, 'lng': 103.99593}]",7023,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1832230'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85589946832'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.khmerways.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.460089,103.996,1832230,Khmer Ways - Moto Adventures Day Tours,"KHMER WAYS MOTO ADVENTURES - Discover Cambodia by Moto. We strongly believe that the best way to discover a country is the way of the locals. In Cambodia the Khmers' major means of transportation is by moto (Honda Dream 125cc), enabling them and us to reach the remote beauties of the real Cambodia. Join us to follow the Khmers on their trails through rice fields, bamboo groves and jungle towards hidden villages, ancient temples and breathtaking views.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d1832230-Reviews-Khmer_Ways_Moto_Adventures_Day_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'River road', 'street2': 'Wat Svay Village, Salakumreuk Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'River road Wat Svay Village, Salakumreuk Commune, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cam