Khmer Wills,here:pds:place:116w63gg-55659abc64084511b76a9dd195319898,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Khmer Wills, ផ្លូវ ផ្សារកណ្ដាល, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ផ្សារកណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35733, 'lng': 103.85483}","[{'lat': 13.3572, 'lng': 103.85481}]",24592,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510267640'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvrkWzS79yI4wiBpKWoOhaQ'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.357471,103.84578,13131460,Khmer Mansion Residence,"Khmer Mansion Residence is located in the center of Siem Reap, about 6min walking distance from the famous Pub Street. Rooms are designed and fitted with a private balcony and bathtub. Khmer Mansion Residence is chargeable of airport shuttle services and the property also features an indoor pool and free high speed WiFi access is available throughout the property. The General Manager Mr. NEY Vichet is willing to help Cambodian by providing good opportunities and professional training to fresh graduation generation and working in hotel. they can earn money to support their family and school. “Your Stay, Your Help” The distance from Khmer Mansion Residence is 10min drive from the famous world heritage - Angkor Wat. Angkor Night Market is 6min away, while NEW Siem Reap Angkor International Airport is 1hrs away which is access easily by car. Rooms are stylish and fully air-conditioned. Amenities include a dining table, a 47 smart flat screen TV, tea/coffee making facilities.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g12591811-d13131460-Reviews-Khmer_Mansion_Residence-Svay_Dangkum_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sok San Road', 'street2': 'Steung Thmei Village', 'city': 'Svay Dangkum', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Sok San Road Steung Thmei Village, Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Svay Dangkum', 'location_id': '12591811'}, {'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g12591811-d13131460-Khmer_Mansion_Residence-Svay_Dangkum_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '12591811', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 53 hotels in Svay Dangkum', 'geo_location_name': 'Svay Dangkum', 'ranking_out_of': '53', 'ranking': '1'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,1535,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '2', '4': '21', '5': '1512'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",2868,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g12591811-d13131460-m668