Kids Park Siem Reap,here:pds:place:116w63u5-afe01f83e2084e2db71c5de7deda009d,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Kids Park Siem Reap, អេអេច21, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'អេអេច21', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.3659, 'lng': 103.85196}","[{'lat': 13.36579, 'lng': 103.85189}]",24102,"[{'id': '550-5520-0000', 'name': 'Leisure', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523901362'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.kidscityasia.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.358416,103.853874,568118,Park Hyatt Siem Reap,"Park Hyatt Siem Reap is a luxury hotel in Siem Reap that embraces guests with comfort and opulence in each of its 104 luxurious, elegant and spacious rooms and suites. A luxurious home away from home that is strategically located in the heart of the city center, this stylish contemporary retreat adorned with Cambodian art is near the airport, the renowned 12th century ruins of Angkor Wat temple and just a five-minute leisurely walk to the local nightlife scene, Siem Reap Pub Street. Guests are welcomed by warm and inviting five-star service and world-class hospitality. It features sumptuous French and authentic Cambodian food at The Dining Room, refreshing drinks at The Living Room and a delectable array of desserts and light fare at The Glasshouse Deli-Patisserie. For utmost relaxation and rejuvenation, the hotel has two stunning swimming pools and a selection of invigorating massages and treatments at The Spa. T+L 2024 Asia's Best City Hotel - No.4 World's Best Hotel.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g12591811-d568118-Reviews-Park_Hyatt_Siem_Reap-Svay_Dangkum_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sivutha Boulevard', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Svay Dangkum', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Sivutha Boulevard, Svay Dangkum, Siem 