Kim Guest House,here:pds:place:116w649g-344600582e6c487ba353e02da3bf4f16,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Kim Guest House, ផ្លូវ 125 7, 120308 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ប្រាំពីរ មករា', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងព្រលឹត', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 125', 'postalCode': '120308', 'houseNumber': '7'}","{'lat': 11.56129, 'lng': 104.91652}","[{'lat': 11.56129, 'lng': 104.91666}]",5761,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2347098'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523213067'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.557765,104.91675,2347098,Kim Guest House,"If you’re looking for a budget friendly guest house in Phnom Penh, look no further than Kim Guest House.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Phnom Penh, Kim Guest House is located a short distance from Wat Langka (0.6 mi) and Champey Academy of Arts (0.9 mi).
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer a refrigerator and air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as Kim Guest House offers guests free wifi.
The guest house features a 24 hour front desk and 24 hour check-in. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
While in Phnom Penh be sure to experience local fish and chips favorites at FCC Phnom Penh Restaurant & Bar, Daughters of Cambodia Visitor Centre Café, or Jars of Clay.
Best of all, Kim Guest House makes it easy to experience some great Phnom Penh attractions like Royal Palace Park, which is a popular park.
The staff at Kim Guest House looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
