Kim Seng Thai Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649g-13ab52ce1974482f9cfdeb5d497c3eee,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Kim Seng Thai Hotel, 120706 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ឫស្សីកែវ', 'subdistrict': 'ទួលសង្កែ', 'postalCode': '120706'}","{'lat': 11.59173, 'lng': 104.91677}","[{'lat': 11.59186, 'lng': 104.9168}]",71859,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523723012'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.kimsengthaihotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.566869,104.91991,13237643,Sin Hak Seng Hotel,"Finding an ideal small hotel in Phnom Penh does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Sin Hak Seng Hotel, a nice option for travelers like you.
Sin Hak Seng Hotel is a small hotel offering a flat screen TV, air conditioning, and a refrigerator in the rooms, and it is easy to stay connected during your stay as free wifi is offered to guests.
The small hotel features baggage storage. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Phnom Penh, Sin Hak Seng Hotel is located a short distance from Champey Academy of Arts (0.5 mi) and Cambodia Post Office (0.7 mi).
While in Phnom Penh be sure to experience local crab favorites at Romdeng, Malis Cambodian Restaurant, or Khmer Surin.
Plus, during your trip, don’t forget to check out some of the popular art galleries, such as Din Art Gallery, Lotus Space, and Bong Bong Bong.
Sin Hak Seng Hotel puts the best of Phnom Penh at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
