Kimleng Sang Photography & Tour,here:pds:place:116w63u4-2f3abf3bfdcbdabbd3a2b62edf99d5dc,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Kimleng Sang Photography & Tour, 171211 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ទឹកវិល', 'postalCode': '171211'}","{'lat': 13.40139, 'lng': 103.81532}","[{'lat': 13.40139, 'lng': 103.8153}]",87107,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3488123'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512772029'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://kimlengsang.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.401391,103.815315,3488123,Kimleng Sang Photography & Tour,"I like to take my guests away from the crowds to experience the real Cambodia with my Photography Tours through my eyes . I was born in Takeo Province, along the boarder with Vietnam. Takeo is sometimes referred to as 'the cradle of the Khmer civilization.' In 2000, I moved to Siem Reap where I began work as a tuk-tuk driver. Over time, I met many professional photographers from around the world, people who were seeking something other than the well-worn tourist trails. With a growing curiosity in the activities and work of these photographers, I began to photograph myself. Since 2005, I have had a number of Western tutors, and have gone on to establish myself as a well-known photographer in Siem Reap Province. I have developed a series of tours through Angkor (Siem Reap), Battambang, Kampot, Sihanoukville and Phnom Penh. I have experience of other areas in Cambodia if you wish to see more of my country I can offer transport by tuk-tuk or my air conditioned car.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d3488123-Reviews-Kimleng_Sang_Photography_Tour-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Phum Sandan', 'street2': 'Sandan Village, Tuek vil Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17710', 'address_string': 'Phum Sandan Sandan Village, Tuek vil Commune, Siem Reap 17710 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,kimlengsang@hotmail.com,+855 12 772 029,http://kimlengsang.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d3488123-Kimleng_Sang_Photography_Tour-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#86 of 1,339 Tours in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1339', 'ranking': '86'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,237,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '6', '5': '230'}",Not available,392,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d3488123-m66827-Reviews-Kimleng_Sang_Photography_Tour-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Photography Tours', 'localized_name': 'Photography Tours'}, {'name': 'Sightseeing Tours', 'localized_name': 'Sightseeing Tours'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '3'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '78'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '56'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '27'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '46'}]","[{'award_type': 'Travelers Choice', 'year': '2023', 'images': {'tiny': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png', 'small': 'https://static.tacdn.co