King Cafe,here:pds:place:116w636s-b91f751bbfb145cbbaa3cf05bc77e32c,en,coffee,"{'label': 'King Cafe, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09938, 'lng': 103.20059}","[{'lat': 13.09939, 'lng': 103.20045}]",12644,"[{'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855966662221'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.099279,103.20056,2229691,King Fy Hotel,"Located in Battambang's historic city centre, King Fy Hotel offers modern rooms with the latest conveniences - air-con, free Wi-Fi, 32"" Flat Screen TV with satellite channels. Free pick up from the dock, bus stations, and shuttles to the shopping areas. Rooms appointed to the highest standards with private balcony & views of the Sangke River. A safe, minibar, and writing desk are included. Bathrooms have a rain shower or spa bathtub. The hotel is on the Sangke river in the historic centre near Wat Kandal and Wat Pacha and the Museum. Guests can rent a bicycle, or have us arrange a tour to the surrounding pagodas and temples in the spectacular countryside. The hotel has spa treatments, a mini-mart & souvenir shop, laundry services, a conference centre - currency can be exchanged. Our Coriander Restaurant specialises in Asian and European cuisine. Beautiful sunset views and cocktails can be enjoyed at our Terrestrial Lounge.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d2229691-Reviews-King_Fy_Hotel-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '306 Street 155', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '314', 'address_string': '306 Street 155, Battambang 314 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'C