King Gold Hotel,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-ecba9f8beec0421e924d526db41cc99e,en,hotel,"{'label': 'King Gold Hotel, ផ្លូវ កម្មករ, 180403 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ កម្មករ', 'postalCode': '180403'}","{'lat': 10.63015, 'lng': 103.51699}","[{'lat': 10.63015, 'lng': 103.51699}]",48863,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1932388'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855346333925'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.63015,103.51699,1932388,King Gold Hotel,"If you’re looking for a budget friendly small hotel in Sihanoukville, look no further than King Gold Hotel.
Nearby landmarks such as CJ Outlet and Jewelry Center (0.9 mi) and Wat Krom Temple (1.1 mi) make King Gold Hotel a great place to stay when visiting Sihanoukville.
As your “home away from home,” the small hotel rooms offer a refrigerator, a kitchenette, and air conditioning, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, room service, and a concierge while staying at King Gold Hotel. In addition, King Gold Hotel offers a pool, which will help make your Sihanoukville trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
While visiting Sihanoukville, you may want to try some bangers and mash at one of the nearby restaurants, such as The Big Easy.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out a waterfall, such as Kbal Chhay Waterfall.
The staff at King Gold Hotel looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
