King Grand Boutique Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-8994e5b702ef05b0e501fce7e6db65f1,en,hotel,"{'label': 'King Grand Boutique Hotel, ផ្លូវ 258, 120207 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ចតុមុខ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 258', 'postalCode': '120207'}","{'lat': 11.55962, 'lng': 104.93357}","[{'lat': 11.55975, 'lng': 104.93357}]",59300,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2178716'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523215848'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.kinggrandboutiquehotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.559635,104.93356,2178716,King Grand Boutique Hotel,"King Grand Boutique Hotel is a sanctuary for tourists and corporate guests who expect excellent hospitality and friendly service. Whether you're on business or pleasure, the King Grand Boutique Hotel is a luxurious haven, elegantly furnished to provide you with a comfortable stay. You can enjoy a wide range of facilities and traditional Cambodian hospitality in King Grand Boutique Hotel. Experience ultimate luxury and bask in the splendor of elegance at the King Grand Boutique Hotel, the perfect base to explore the legendary Phnom Penh City and undiscovered treasures in Cambodia. It is located in the heart of the city where you can walk to anywhere in a minute.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d2178716-Reviews-King_Grand_Boutique_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No 18 , Street 258', 'street2': 'Sang Kat Chak Tomuk , Khan Daun Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'No 18 , Street 258 Sang Kat Chak Tomuk , Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not ava