Knai Bang Chatt,here:pds:place:116w3f5w-cc76353953f3451795dddb5af796239d,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Knai Bang Chatt, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.49198, 'lng': 104.28952}","[{'lat': 10.49198, 'lng': 104.28966}]",7468,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1070018'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512349742'}, {'value': '+85536210310', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85578333684', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.knaibangchatt.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.492188,104.28944,1070018,Knai Bang Chatt Resort,"Serene and pure, Knai Bang Chatt, an exquisite lifestyle resort, will enchant you. Located in Kep, right on the southern east coastline of Cambodia, the resort gives you a blend of privacy, serenity and exclusivity. Three renovated villas built in the 1960s by protégés of Vann Molyvann, a pupil of the world renowned Le Corbusier, are extraordinary historical landmarks you can now experience as your very own private home.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d1070018-Reviews-Knai_Bang_Chatt_Resort-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Phum Thmey', 'street2': 'Sangkat Prey Thom', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '908', 'address_string': 'Phum Thmey Sangkat Prey Thom, Kep 908 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d1070018-Knai_Bang_Chatt_Resort-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_strin