Koh Ker Temple,here:pds:place:116w66qw-edd7a13b8295442fbff189f9bff80812,en,temple,"{'label': 'Koh Ker Temple, គូលែន, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះវិហារ', 'city': 'គូលែន', 'district': 'គូលែនត្បូង'}","{'lat': 13.81852, 'lng': 104.68268}","[{'lat': 13.81852, 'lng': 104.68268}]",80173,"[{'id': '300-3200-0031', 'name': 'Temple', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,Not Available,Not Available,Not Available,Preah Vihear,13.376668,103.86494,951727,Hidden Cambodia Adventure Tours,"Est in 2001, this award wining Irish Cambodian company blazed the way for adventure day & multi-day tours throughout the country. We welcome learners to experienced offriders for dual sport, endure & dirt bike training motorbike tours with Honda XR250, Yamaha WR250 & KTM 4600 motorbikes. An experienced team. Land cruiser & Lexus 4WD vehicles ( self drive or be driven) Busses & minibuses to hand picked rural areas of interest. Kulen Mt, Preah Vihear, Koh Ker & Preah Khan remain popular . We introduced smaller 125CC Honda Dream motorbike tours in 2017. We offer trekking & remote tent camping near temple ruins & tour to eco tourism communities such as Chi Phat, Cardamom Mts . Corporate retreats, stags & humanitarian packages, tailor made are popular. Our stilted wooden property, Koh Ker Jungle Lodge Homestay, in Koh Ker Village , Preah Vihear Province supports the community & hosts many of our guests for exciting overnight tours. Tours throughout the Kingdom. Committed to Excellence.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d951727-Reviews-Hidden_Cambodia_Adventure_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Cheas Road, Phum Trang Village, Slokram', 'street2': 'Road to Angkor, turn onto Route 60, near Le Méridien Angkor', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17000', 'address_string': 'Cheas Road, Phum Trang Village, Slokram Road to Angkor, turn onto Route 60, near Le Méridien Angkor, Siem Reap 17000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,hiddencambodia@yahoo.com,+855 12 934 412,http://www.hiddencambodia.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d951727-Hidden_Cambodia_Adventure_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#44 of 557 Outdoor Activities in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '557', 'ranking': '44'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,366,"{'1': '1', '2': '4', '3': '3', '4': '28', '5': '330'}",Not available,580,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d951727-m66827-Reviews-Hidden_Cambodia_Adventure_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1900'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '1900'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 06:00 - 19:00', 'Tuesday: 06:00 - 19:00', 'Wednesday: 06:00 - 19:00', 'Thursday: 06:00 - 19:00', 'Friday: 06:00 - 19:00', 'Saturday: 06:00 - 19:00', 'Sunday: 06:00 - 19:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}, {'name':