Koh Ker Temples Garden Hotel and Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w66mf-2c5090fbb50743f7a283de6b524070a9,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Koh Ker Temples Garden Hotel and Restaurant, ផ្លូវជាតិ 64, 130406 គូលែន, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះវិហារ', 'city': 'គូលែន', 'district': 'ស្រយង់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 64', 'postalCode': '130406'}","{'lat': 13.6846, 'lng': 104.53089}","[{'lat': 13.68467, 'lng': 104.53077}]",109918,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '20096126'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578709420'}]}],Not Available,Preah Vihear,13.684212,104.53176,20096126,Koh Ker Temples Garden Hotel and Restaurant,"Koh Ker Temples Garden Hotel & Restaurant 1h45 Siem Reap, 10min Koh Ker Temple, 1h30 Sra Aem (road to Preah Vihear Temple) in Preah Vihear province. RN64 km75: coming from Siem Reap, visit along the road Banteay Srey Temple, Kulen mountains, Beng Mealea Temple; continuing RN64, go to Preah Vihear, Mekong river, Mondulkiri, Laos or back to floating villages on Tonle Sap lake. In our hotel in Koh Ker countryside, you will find nature, culture and comfort: NATURE: our hotel is located in Srayang village countryside, 1h45 Siem Reap. Walk through the pepper, cassava, rubber tree farms. With 4WD, visit Kulen Promtep Wildlife Sanctuary (largest protected area in Cambodia with maybe koupreys, asian water buffalo, and birds and giant ibises). Also with 4WD, go to Po Damnak Pagoda and Temple or Be Treed Adventures. Do not miss the sunset from our hotel. CULTURE: visit absolutely Preah Vihear Temple and Koh Ker archeological area in a 2-3 day tour. We can organize your trip and visits for individuals or small group. COMFORT 4 *: king or twin large bedrooms with air con-wifi-smart tv-private bathroom-terrace, and salt water pool, restaurant with khmer and western food, beverages, very good breakfast, flower garden. Enjoy the pool and relax.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g20101663-d20096126-Reviews-Koh_Ker_Temples_Garden_Hotel_and_Restaurant-Srayang_Preah_Vihear_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '110km RN64 - Km75', 'street2': '2km South Srayang - 8km Koh Ker Temple', 'city': 'Srayang', 'state': 'Preah Vihear Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '13256', 'address_string': '110km RN64 - Km75 2km South Srayang - 8km Koh Ker Temple, Srayang 13256 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Srayang', 'location_id': '20101663'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Preah Vihear Province', 'location_id': '1125878'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g20101663-d20096126-Koh_Ker_Temples_Garden_Hotel_and_Restaurant-Srayang_Preah_Vihear_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '20101663', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 2 hotels in Srayang', 'geo_location_name': 'Srayang', 'ranking_out_of': '2', 'ranking': '1'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,7,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '2', '5': '4'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",15,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g20101663-d20096126-m66827-Reviews-Koh_Ker_Temples_Garden_Hotel_and_Restaurant-Srayang_Preah_Vihear_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Room service', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Breakfast included', 'Business center', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laund