Koh Kong City Hotel,here:pds:place:116w614p-3ff5060d5bc34b62976ca33fc3c2f6d9,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Koh Kong City Hotel, 090701 ខេមរភូមិន្ទ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កោះកុង', 'city': 'ខេមរភូមិន្ទ', 'district': 'ស្មាច់មានជ័យ', 'postalCode': '090701'}","{'lat': 11.61323, 'lng': 102.97891}","[{'lat': 11.61321, 'lng': 102.97905}]",41988,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4509526'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85535936777'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://kkcthotel.netkhmer.com'}]}]",Not Available,Koh Kong,11.613255,102.97881,4509526,Koh Kong City Hotel,"Welcome to Koh Kong City Hotel, your Koh Kong “home away from home.” Koh Kong City Hotel aims to make your visit as relaxing and enjoyable as possible, which is why so many guests continue to come back year after year.
The rooms offer a refrigerator and air conditioning, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
Koh Kong City Hotel features a 24 hour front desk, a coffee shop, and shops. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
While in Koh Kong, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Koh Kong City Hotel, including Fat Sam's Restaurant and Bar (0.4 mi), Cafe Laurent (0.0 mi), and wood house (0.3 mi).
Koh Kong is also home to Tatai Waterfall, a popular waterfall that is not too far from Koh Kong City Hotel.
Koh Kong City Hotel puts the best of Koh Kong at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
