Koh Kong Island Resort,here:pds:place:116w614p-52674c9de3254fc6a48e4ade30c430e2,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Koh Kong Island Resort, 090701 ខេមរភូមិន្ទ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កោះកុង', 'city': 'ខេមរភូមិន្ទ', 'district': 'ស្មាច់មានជ័យ', 'postalCode': '090701'}","{'lat': 11.61167, 'lng': 102.98292}","[{'lat': 11.61167, 'lng': 102.98292}]",41526,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3673198'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855977558988'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.kohkongisland.net'}]}]",Not Available,Koh Kong,11.61167,102.98292,3673198,Koh Kong Island Resort,"Set on a virgin island, our resort currently offers 6 comfortable wooden bungalows with AC all facing the sea and 6 more basic ones. An hour away by speed boat from Koh kong city, you will be delighted to discover the area with Asia's biggest mangrove forest, sea dolphins and sunsets that will mesmerize you. Boats leave from Koh Kong Bay Hotel at 8.30am and come back at 4.30pm to the mainland. Private smaller speedboats are also available at almost the same price if later than the hours shown above. Guests who wish to leave earlier will have to arrange a boat at their discretion.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1532269-d3673198-Reviews-Koh_Kong_Island_Resort-Koh_Kong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Prek Koh Por', 'city': 'Koh Kong', 'state': 'Koh Kong Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '09000', 'address_string': 'Prek Koh Por, Koh Kong 09000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Koh Kong', 'location_id': '1532269'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Koh Kong Province', 'location_id': '2366667'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1532269-d3673198-Koh_Kong_Island_Resort-Koh_Kong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_l