Koh Pich Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-e098d4995b0b009524c0a1609414b8c4,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Koh Pich Hotel, 090701 ខេមរភូមិន្ទ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កោះកុង', 'city': 'ខេមរភូមិន្ទ', 'district': 'ស្មាច់មានជ័យ', 'postalCode': '090701'}","{'lat': 11.61749, 'lng': 102.98101}","[{'lat': 11.6174, 'lng': 102.98111}]",41860,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3314279'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516358889'}]}],Not Available,Koh Kong,11.6175,102.981,3314279,Koh Pich Hotel,"Finding an ideal small hotel in Koh Kong does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Koh Pich Hotel, a nice option for travelers like you.
Rooms at Koh Pich Hotel provide air conditioning and a desk, and guests can stay connected with free wifi.
In addition, while staying at Koh Pich Hotel guests have access to a concierge and room service. Need a place to park? Parking is available at Koh Pich Hotel.
If you like Indian restaurants, Koh Pich Hotel is conveniently located near Whisper Bar.
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular waterfalls such as Tatai Waterfall.
Koh Pich Hotel looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Koh Kong.
