Koh Rong Dive Center,here:pds:place:116w3ckw-261f7aa4f8974cf1a8480dff91cbe137,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Koh Rong Dive Center, 180405 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'កោះរុង', 'postalCode': '180405'}","{'lat': 10.66892, 'lng': 103.27495}","[{'lat': 10.66895, 'lng': 103.27482}]",97128,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}, {'id': '300-3000-0023', 'name': 'Tourist Attraction'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House'}, {'id': '800-8600-0316', 'name': 'Diving Center'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2017725'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27862823'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3606997'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5989847'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592748899', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85593407825', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}, {'value': '+85593482820', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0023'}]}, {'value': '+855965607362'}, {'value': '+855969548599', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://paradise-bungalows.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}, {'value': 'http://www.kohrongdivecenter.com', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}, {'id': '800-8600-0316'}]}, {'value': 'http://www.kohrongisland.org', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0023'}]}, {'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100075430617171&mibextid=zbwkwl', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:00 - 10:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT04H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}, {'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 20:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Preah Sihanouk,10.665956,103.273384,3606997,Koh Rong Dive Center,"Koh Rong Dive Center, opened at the beginning of 2012, offering a range of scuba diving services. Padi courses, from Open Water Diver to Dive Master, Try Dives or DSD (Discover Scuba Diving) for unqualified divers and Fun Dives for qualified divers and night dives. Our center is run by Western staff and employs qualified PADI professionals from around the world. The main purpose of the dive center is to offer great customer service to all divers certified or not in a safe and professional environment. We also have a major interest in the development of the island, running as an Eco-Friendly Center and also supporting the local islanders and participating in beach and reef clean-ups. The center also employs local village staff giving them employment to support them and their families and the opportunity of training and education at no cost to them. Contact us now and start your scuba diving adventure.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g1808558-d3606997-Reviews-Koh_Rong_Dive_Center-Koh_Rong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Koh Touch Village', 'street2': 'Middle Jetty opposite CoCos bar and restaurant', 'city': 'Koh Rong', 'state': 'Koh Kong Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Koh Touch Village Middle Jetty opposite CoCos bar and restaurant, Koh Rong Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Koh Rong', 'location_id': '1808558'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Koh Kong Province', 'location_id': '2366667'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@kohrongdivecenter.com,+855 96 560 7362,http://www.kohrongdivecenter.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1808558-d3606997-Koh_Rong_Dive_Center-Koh_Rong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66