Koh Rong Ocean View,here:pds:place:116w3ckw-421d6de97dc44abdb7c0d7b7a4816da5,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Koh Rong Ocean View, 180405 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'កោះរុង', 'postalCode': '180405'}","{'lat': 10.66929, 'lng': 103.27428}","[{'lat': 10.66916, 'lng': 103.27427}]",97093,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12272110'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569633123'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/kohrongoceanviewbungalow'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.669282,103.27428,12272110,Koh Rong Ocean View,"Looking for a place to stay in Koh Rong? Then look no further than Koh Rong Ocean View Bungalow, a budget friendly small hotel that brings the best of Koh Rong to your doorstep.
Free wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at Koh Rong Ocean View Bungalow offer air conditioning.
If you are looking for a good Indian restaurant, you may want to check out Shanti Shanti Restaurant while staying at Koh Rong Ocean View Bungalow.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Koh Rong (0.1 mi), which is a popular attraction amongst tourists, and it is within walking distance.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Koh Rong Ocean View Bungalow as you experience everything Koh Rong has to offer.
