Kriss Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116d408k-750081be47e4048ae1a14ee46b5c0231,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Kriss Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 111 34, 120308 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ប្រាំពីរ មករា', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងព្រលឹត', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 111', 'postalCode': '120308', 'houseNumber': '34'}","{'lat': 11.56192, 'lng': 104.91822}","[{'lat': 11.56192, 'lng': 104.91809}]",5936,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1771062'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515888777'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://krissguesthouse.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.559151,104.91796,1771062,Kriss Guesthouse,"See why so many travelers make Kriss Guesthouse their guest house of choice when visiting Phnom Penh. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a budget friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer a desk, and you can stay connected during your stay as Kriss Guesthouse offers guests free wifi.
The guest house features a 24 hour front desk and baggage storage. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Wat Langka (0.7 mi) and Champey Academy of Arts (0.7 mi), guests of Kriss Guesthouse can easily experience some of Phnom Penh's most well known attractions.
Travelers looking to enjoy some oyster can head to Romdeng, Topaz, or Oskar Bistro. Otherwise, you may want to check out a seafood restaurant such as Malis Cambodian Restaurant, Le Broken Plate, or Nesat Seafood House.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum (0.7 mi), Royal Palace (0.9 mi), or Central Market (0.9 mi), which are popular attractions amongst tourists, and they are all within walking distance.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Kriss Guesthouse as you experience all of the things Phnom Penh has to offer.
