Kwest Restaurant,here:pds:place:116aabd1-dfbfd7741a5a05b3784797434f5ebc1d,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Kwest Restaurant, ផ្លូវ តេជោដំឌិន, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ តេជោដំឌិន', 'postalCode': '120205'}","{'lat': 11.569, 'lng': 104.93012}","[{'lat': 11.56887, 'lng': 104.93015}]",73214,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523214747'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.562296,104.93378,12977789,Mealea Restaurant,"Discover culinary perfection at Mealea Restaurant, where our chef and dedicated team craft and invite you on a gastronomic voyage spanning Cambodian heirlooms, signature Asian dishes, and vibrant Western cuisine. Housed within the meticulously restored 80-year-old French colonial building, once the command center of the French army commander in Cambodia. With its ornate columns and stunning traditional tiles, this historic venue creates an ambiance that sets the stage for an unforgettable gastronomic journey. Whether you're starting your day with a wholesome breakfast, enjoying a leisurely lunch, or savoring a sumptuous dinner, each meal is crafted to perfection. From the finest ingredients to impeccable service, Mealea ensures that every dining experience is a journey of culinary delight and satisfaction. Our sophisticated design is crafted to suit various preferences. Whether you yearn for an outdoor, cozy indoor gallery dining atmosphere or the exclusive ambiance of a private room.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d12977789-Reviews-Mealea_Restaurant-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 44B St. 240 Sothearos Blvd', 'street2': 'Chey Chumneas', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '# 44B St. 240 Sothearos Blvd Chey Chumneas, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,fbd@palacegatepp.com,+855 23 900 074,https://www.facebook.com/MealeaRestaurant/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d12977789-Mealea_Restaurant-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#26 of 1,983 Places to Eat in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '1983', 'ranking': '26'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,374,"{'1': '5', '2': '4', '3': '5', '4': '27', '5': '333'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",489,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d12977789-m66827-Reviews-Mealea_Restaurant-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0630'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0630'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0630'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0630'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0630'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0630'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0630'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2300'}}]