LCS Hotel & Apartment,here:pds:place:116w649g-bc214ad26c964ceb8f25da1ec341670d,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'LCS Hotel & Apartment, តីរវិថី ព្រះស៊ីសុវត្ថិ 13, 120210 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ស្រះចក', 'street': 'តីរវិថី ព្រះស៊ីសុវត្ថិ', 'postalCode': '120210', 'houseNumber': '13'}","{'lat': 11.58433, 'lng': 104.91996}","[{'lat': 11.5844, 'lng': 104.92007}]",72358,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13906566'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523724999'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/lcshotel'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.581925,104.921265,13906566,LCS Hotel & Apartment,"Welcome to LCS Hotel & Apartments, the newest addition to Phnom Penh’s luxury hotel market. Situated 10.2 km from Phnom Penh International Airport, this stylish 4-Star hotel sits on the city’s riverside, with views across the Tonle Sap River to Chroy Changvar. With an elegant building design which combines the beauty of French colonial architecture with the functionality of modern design, LCS Hotel & Apartment is an iconic addition to Phnom Penh’s riverside. That winning combination continues inside, where traditional dark wood flooring, wall paneling, and in some places ceilings, are offset by opulent furnishings in all common areas to provide a warm and welcoming ambience for our guests. The bedrooms feature those same rich wood floorings with neutral wall colors and the very best in comfortable furnishings to ensure you feel at home during your stay. Within walking distance of the iconic Wat Phnom which gave its name to this capital of the Kingdom of Wonder.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d13906566-Reviews-LCS_Hotel_Apartment-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Preah Sisowath Quay #10, St. Sisowath Quay Blvd', 'street2': 'Village 13, Sangkat Srah Chak, Khan Daun