LOTUS & Silk Farm Siem Reap,here:pds:place:116w63uk-aae95dfd09520e2ccc98aae7cf7bd104,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'LOTUS & Silk Farm Siem Reap, 171205 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'នគរធំ', 'postalCode': '171205'}","{'lat': 13.41807, 'lng': 103.89474}","[{'lat': 13.41794, 'lng': 103.89479}]",16725,"[{'id': '800-8200-0361', 'name': 'Fine Arts', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '19859248'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592529001'}], 'www': [{'value': 'www.lotusfarm.org'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 18:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT10H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.41796,103.89478,19859248,Lotus Silk Farm,"Where Tradition Meets Sustainability. Nestled in the heart of Siem Reap, Cambodia, the Lotus Silk Farm is a haven for those seeking an immersive cultural experience while contributing to a meaningful cause. Founded in 2003, this social enterprise is dedicated to preserving traditional Cambodian craftsmanship and empowering local women through sustainable textile production.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d19859248-Reviews-Lotus_Silk_Farm-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '9 Road 63', 'street2': 'Phnom Krom', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17000', 'address_string': '9 Road 63 Phnom Krom, Siem Reap 17000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,contact@lotussilkfarm.com,+855 92 529 001,http://www.lotussilkfarm.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d19859248-Lotus_Silk_