LOTUS Space,here:pds:place:116w649g-21441e33300144633b2d0b14e492d842,en,gallery,"{'label': 'LOTUS Space, ផ្លូវ តេជោដំឌិន, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ តេជោដំឌិន', 'postalCode': '120205'}","{'lat': 11.5664, 'lng': 104.92919}","[{'lat': 11.56644, 'lng': 104.92932}]",7096,"[{'id': '600-6900-0103', 'name': 'Gift, Antique & Art', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13558441'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512406916'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/LotusSpaceCambodia'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 07:00, 09:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT22H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.566434,104.92928,13558441,Lotus Space,Lotus Space is a sales outlet in Phnom Penh that offers a very select choice of contemporary jewelry and original ceramics. Ceramics showcased are Khmer cultural inspired and the contemporary jewellery are created by French and Cambodian designers. All our jewels are completely hand-made in Cambodia with best quality silver and with semi-precious stones. They all can be produced in gold.,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d13558441-Reviews-Lotus_Space-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Preah Ang Eng St13', 'street2': 'Near National Museum, on the same street than Friends Restaurant', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12204', 'address_string': 'Preah Ang Eng St13 Near National Museum, on the same street than Friends Restaurant, Phnom Penh 12204 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,lotusspacecambodia@yahoo.com,+855 12 406 916,https://www.face