LV Travel,here:pds:place:116w63gg-ec62f7ec5a548d000f6b9d72040f6451,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'LV Travel, 171206 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ជ្រាវ', 'postalCode': '171206'}","{'lat': 13.32504, 'lng': 103.87416}","[{'lat': 13.32492, 'lng': 103.8741}]",114116,"[{'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27878137'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512784968'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/reallifecambodiatour?mibextid=zbwkwl'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sat: 08:00 - 18:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT10H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.317666,103.85373,10718108,Angkor Wat Travel Tour,"Our goal at Angkor Wat Travel Tours is to provide you with an exceptional service and perfect experience; so you can experience Cambodia in an unforgettable way and make memories that’ll last a lifetime. Founded in 2016, Angkor Wat Travel Tours is a locally-run tour operator with years of experience in the travel industry. We have a wide range of tour packages to Cambodia, from Angkor Wat tours to quad bike adventures and delightful Cambodian cooking classes. We are always looking for new ways to create meaningful and authentic travel experiences that will always be a part of your life. We focus on delivering authentic, affordable tours without compromising on quality. Our expert guides are extremely knowledgeable about the attractions in Cambodia, as well as hidden gems and local stories that’ll give you a better in-depth understanding of Cambodia. They are also experienced in avoiding crowds, heat and taking great photographs.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d10718108-Reviews-Angkor_Wat_Travel_Tour-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Wat Damnak Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': 'Wat Damnak Village, Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,yyuna2406@gmail.com,+855 96 333 3215,http://angkorwattraveltours.com/tour-booking,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d10718108-Angkor_Wat_Travel_Tour-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#190 of 1,339 Tours in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1339', 'ranking': '190'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,10627,"{'1': '5', '2': '3', '3': '11', '4': '179', '5': '10429'}",Not available,241,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d10718108-m66827-Reviews-Angkor_Wat_Travel_Tour-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2200'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 08:00 - 22:00', 'Tuesday: 08:00 - 22:00', 'Wednesday: 08:00 - 22:00', 'Thursday: 08:00 - 22:00', 'Friday: 08:00 - 22:00', 'Saturday: 08:00 - 22:00', 'Sunday: 08:00 - 22:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sight