La A Seven Fresh Flower Decor and Whole Sale,here:pds:place:116w636s-b0c7879dfdbb4264b9d23219987e689c,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'La A Seven Fresh Flower Decor and Whole Sale, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10348, 'lng': 103.19725}","[{'lat': 13.10349, 'lng': 103.19732}]",12604,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]",Not available,Not Available,Not Available,Not Available,Battambang,13.103723,103.20129,11876328,La Pizza,"We serve French starters such as black or green ""tapenade"" (if you like olives), eggplant caviar, tuna spread and ""anchoiade""(if you like anchovies). Our starters go well with a cocktail or glass of wine (red, white or ""rosé""). You can also enjoy classic and original wood-fired pizzas, and salads. And if that's not enough, try our home made sorbets, pana-cottas, crème brûlée or Spicy chocolate mousse ! Happy Hour is 5-7 pm",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g303666-d11876328-Reviews-La_Pizza-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '59 Street 159 Rattanak Village', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': '59 Street 159 Rattanak Village, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,lapizzabattambang@gmail.com,+855 96 360 7417,http://www.facebook.com/La-Pizza-Battambang-372749233069622/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d11876328-La_Pizza-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#4 of 138 Places to Eat in Battambang', 'geo_location_name': 'Battamban