La Croisette Bistro & Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w649g-bdd085c82de74c3c8d8cbb33d390a76d,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'La Croisette Bistro & Restaurant, តីរវិថី ព្រះស៊ីសុវត្ថិ, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'តីរវិថី ព្រះស៊ីសុវត្ថិ', 'postalCode': '120205'}","{'lat': 11.57045, 'lng': 104.92984}","[{'lat': 11.57048, 'lng': 104.92992}]",73092,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '300-000', 'name': 'European', 'primary': True}, {'id': '372-000', 'name': 'Mediterranean'}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523220554'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.570533,104.92982,1595898,La Croisette,"La Croisette was founded in 1997 as one of the first restaurants in the Cambodian capital following the catastrophic Khmer Rouge regime and the turmoil of the 80s and 90s. Originally a French restaurant, La Croisette since then has not only been offering some of the best hospitality in town, but turned into an institution along the famous promenade lining the Tonle Sap river and the Mekong. European-managed and with a friendly team, we offer Mediterranean specialties as well as a large choice of modern and classic European and Asian dishes. Our breakfasts are legendary - please enjoy the view from our first-floor, green The Garden terrace or our air-conditioned indoor spaces. We look forward to welcoming you.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d1595898-Reviews-La_Croisette-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '241 Sisowath Quay', 'street2': 'Corner of street 144', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '241 Sisowath Quay Corner of street 144, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@lacroisettekh.com,+855 23 220 554,http://www.lacroisettekh.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d1595898-La_Croisette-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#75 of 1,983 Places to Eat in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '1983', 'ranking': '75'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,642,"{'1': '16', '2': '38', '3': '92', '4': '246', '5': '250'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}}",244,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d1595898-m66827-Reviews-La_Croisette-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '0000'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '0000'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '0000'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '0000'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '0000'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '0000'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '0000'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 08:00 - 00:00', 'Tuesday: 08:00 - 00:00', 'Wednesday: 08:00 - 00:00', 'Thursday: 08:00 - 00:00', 'Friday: 08:00 - 00:00', 'Saturday: 08:00 - 00:00', 'Sunday: 08:00 - 00: