La Fortress Boutique Hotel,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-ca67652a1eb049e29fe022bb296adb83,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'La Fortress Boutique Hotel, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.49239, 'lng': 104.31839}","[{'lat': 10.49229, 'lng': 104.31849}]",5308,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11953673'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570367775'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.la-fortress.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.492416,104.317986,11953673,La Fortress Boutique Hotel,"Finding an ideal boutique hotel in Kep does not have to be difficult. Welcome to La Fortress Boutique Hotel, a nice option for travelers like you.
La Fortress Boutique Hotel features a 24 hour front desk, room service, and a sun terrace. Plus, guests can enjoy a pool and an on-site restaurant, which have made this a popular choice among travelers visiting Kep. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
While staying at La Fortress Boutique Hotel, visitors can check out Crab Statue (1.7 mi), which is a popular Kep attraction.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of Kep's popular crab restaurants such as Sailing Club, Kimly Restaurant, and Holy Crab, all a short distance from La Fortress Boutique Hotel.
During your visit, be sure to check out popular attractions like Patio (0.8 mi) and Jasmine Valley Skate Bowl (0.8 mi), which are all within walking distance of the hotel.
La Fortress Boutique Hotel puts the best of Kep at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
