La Maison Borann Boutique Hotel,here:pds:place:116w63u5-57250268763145ee9fe5d2d9c7ce4f65,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'La Maison Borann Boutique Hotel, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.37211, 'lng': 103.84554}","[{'lat': 13.3721, 'lng': 103.84555}]",24103,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6867473'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512233819'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.372109,103.84554,6867473,La Maison Borann Boutique Hotel,"La Maison Borann is a Khmer Family owned and run Boutique Hotel. Thanks to our extended living experience in France and the United-Kingdom, we will be able to bring you the best of both worlds by offering you Khmer hospitality at a European standard. Escape the hustle and bustle of travel by staying at La Maison Borann. We have got two nice and cozy villas offering the service and hospitality of a Maison d'Hotes, with the comfort and facilities of a Boutique Hotel. We are situated on the edge of busy Siem Reap, not far off Road #6 towards the airport, in a quiet residential area with local shops, bars, restaurants, laundry and a small shopping center. We are about 10 minutes car or tuk-tuk ride from the airport and from the heart of Siem Reap, with its famous Old Market, lively Pub Street, Riverside and French Quarter and only 15 minutes from the Angkor Temples UNESCO World Heritage Site. You will be able to unwind in our outdoor saltwater pool or at the restaurant with a bar overlooking the inner garden, where you can enjoy snacks or relax with a drink. According to your wishes, we will serve you Cambodian or Western cuisine, simple but tasty. We look forward to greeting you with a cool welcome drink and a refreshing towel upon arrival. With any stay, we provide a free one-way pick up service from the airport, bus station or boat station. We kindly request our guests to inform us when booking a room or at least 24 hours in advance if you would like to make use of this service.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d6867473-Reviews-La_Maison_Borann_Boutique_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Airport Road', 'street2': 'National Route 6, Salah Kanseng, Sangkat Svay Dangkom', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Airport Road National Route 6, Salah Kanseng, Sangkat Svay Dangkom, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d6867473-La_Maison_Borann_Boutique_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#229 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '229'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,11,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '2', '5': '9'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localize