La Rose Boutique Hotel & Spa,here:pds:place:116w649e-4e947c0e1c8d44c39c36de19c4d5ec4f,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'La Rose Boutique Hotel & Spa, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.55201, 'lng': 104.93172}","[{'lat': 11.55214, 'lng': 104.93174}]",59249,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '700-7400-0292', 'name': 'Wellness Center & Services'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523211130'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.larose.com.kh'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.548036,104.928444,3637673,La Rose Boutique Hotel & Spa,"Combining attributes of contemporary design and touches of French Indochina blended with practical comfort reflective of the urban lifestyle, La Rose Boutique is comprised of 10 luxurious rooms. Each room meets the standard of a luxurious boutique hotel. What is even better, La Rose Boutique & Spa is only a 5-minute walk from the significant Independence Monument, the Late King Father Status, the Royal Palace and the National Museum, to name just a few. What's more, the boutique offers an unlimited access to its partnered outdoor swimming pool with complimentary transfer to and from hotel to the pool.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d3637673-Reviews-La_Rose_Boutique_Hotel_Spa-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 164B Norodom Boulevard', 'street2': 'Sangkat Tonle Bassac, Khan Chamkamorn', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12101', 'address_string': '# 164B Norodom Boulevard Sangkat Tonle Bassac, Khan Chamkamorn, Phnom Penh 12101 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://