La Villa Battambang,here:pds:place:116w636s-5a597ccfa74e4c2faabf70ea04d9afe4,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'La Villa Battambang, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09847, 'lng': 103.20049}","[{'lat': 13.09849, 'lng': 103.20035}]",12579,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '629837'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85553730151'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.lavilla-battambang.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.09846,103.20066,629837,La Villa Battambang,"La Villa Battambang is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Battambang, offering a romantic environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Nearby landmarks such as White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (0.2 mi) and Ta Dumbong Statue (0.8 mi) make La Villa Battambang Hotel a great place to stay when visiting Battambang.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as a flat screen TV, air conditioning, and a minibar, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the guest house.
The property also boasts a pool and free breakfast, to help make your stay more enjoyable.
While in Battambang, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from La Villa Battambang Hotel, including Jaan Bai Restaurant (0.2 mi), Smokin' Pot (0.1 mi), and Nary Kitchen (0.4 mi).
If you are interested in exploring Battambang, check out one of the ancient ruins, such as Prasat Sneung and Ek Phnom.
Enjoy your stay in Battambang!
