Ladear Privilege Rooms,here:pds:place:116w63gg-3519898003ee40e0bd2a8e1d0f1d5aaa,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Ladear Privilege Rooms, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.35902, 'lng': 103.88397}","[{'lat': 13.35908, 'lng': 103.88367}]",22466,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563963070'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.ladearprivilege.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.351709,103.863235,11712694,Ladear Privilege Rooms,"The Ladear Angkor Boutique Hotel is the best ideal place for those looking for the private stay and exclusive service. It is located in the quiet area and walking distance to Siem Reap town, pub street, shopping area and 7 min drive to temple complex. It is about 10 min walk to Pub Street and center Siem Reap market, city hall and supermarket, and it is also 10 min drive to Angkor Temple and point of interest tourist places. Ladear offers the luxury accommodation and facilities in the Siem Reap town and designed by Khmer well-known architect, the room and suite are very nice decor in the relaxed atmosphere, all rooms and suites have balcony overlooking the pool, with sitting area, writing desk and walk-in rain shower. We offer exclusive service and our well trained staff will make your stay more memorable.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d11712694-Reviews-Ladear_Privilege_Rooms-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 0270 7 Street 27, Wat Bo Road, Phum Wat Bo', 'street2': 'Khum Salakamroeuk', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17547', 'address_string': 'No. 0270 7 Street 27, Wat Bo Road, Phum Wat Bo Khum Salakamroeuk, Siem Reap 17547 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'locatio