 service', 'Free parking', 'Wheelchair access', 'Breakfast included', 'Dry Cleaning', 'Meeting rooms', 'Golf course', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Family Rooms', 'Smoking rooms available', 'Minibar', 'Babysitting', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Breakfast Available', 'Free airport transportation']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"['Trendy', 'Family']",[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '28'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '9'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '14'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '12'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,11,20
Ladybug Guest House,here:pds:place:116d408k-336db0bc4d0401762d253044a686bca1,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Ladybug Guest House, ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35419, 'lng': 103.8522}","[{'lat': 13.35432, 'lng': 103.85224}]",88447,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3198536'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577229999'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.ladybugguesthouse.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.353801,103.85209,3198536,Ladybug Guest House,"Welcome to Ladybug Guest House, your Siem Reap “home away from home.” Ladybug Guest House aims to make your visit as relaxing and enjoyable as possible, which is why so many guests continue to come back year after year.
Nearby landmarks such as Wat Preah Prom Rath (0.4 mi) and The Happy Ranch Horse Farm (0.8 mi) make Ladybug Guest House a great place to stay when visiting Siem Reap.
The rooms offer air conditioning, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
In addition, as a valued Ladybug Guest House guest, you can enjoy an on-site restaurant that is available on-site. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
If you’re looking for a Mediterranean restaurant, consider a visit to Olive Cuisine de Saison, Atmosphere Siem Reap, or Elia Greek Kitchen, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Ladybug Guest House.
If you’re looking for something to do, Pub Street (0.2 mi) is a nice way to spend some time, and it is within walking distance of Ladybug Guest House.
Ladybug Guest House puts the best of Siem Reap at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
