Landscape Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-e8499a669a6f02dd669b11a57e128892,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Landscape Hotel, តីរវិថី ព្រះស៊ីសុវត្ថិ, 120207 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ចតុមុខ', 'street': 'តីរវិថី ព្រះស៊ីសុវត្ថិ', 'postalCode': '120207'}","{'lat': 11.56002, 'lng': 104.93494}","[{'lat': 11.56001, 'lng': 104.93508}]",59170,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1950692'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523223325'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.560024,104.934845,1950692,Landscape Hotel,"Perfectly located in the heart of Phnom Penh is this property which surrounds all the major markets within the contemporary environment. All the stylish guestrooms available at Landscape Hotel are spacious, fully furnished, and designed to meet the comfort of the guests, all reflecting magnificent atmosphere. The mini bar offers a great selection of drinks like cocktails as well as hot and cold beverages with the addition of a comfortable and luxurious stay. Landscape Hotel is suited for all customers who wish to take a break from their busy schedules and explore Phnom Penh within serenity and a friendly environment.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d1950692-Reviews-Landscape_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '443 Street: 258, Sang Kat Chat Tomuk', 'street2': 'Khan Duan Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '443 Street: 258, Sang Kat Chat Tomuk Khan Duan Penh, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d1950692-Landscape_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'r