Lava Restaurant,here:pds:place:116aabd1-2ccb4ead215506bdfc3215fdafa4ede6,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Lava Restaurant, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37134, 'lng': 103.86424}","[{'lat': 13.37139, 'lng': 103.86411}]",22753,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-064', 'name': 'International'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7284326'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512249106'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 22:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT15H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.37124,103.8645,7284326,LAVA Restaurant,"Lava is a sizzling concept specializing in the hot plate technique where food is served with a heated surface, gradually changing the flavors, doneness, texture and experience of the food while it is being eaten. Serving hot plates of Cambodian, Chinese and oriental Asian favorites, the restaurant also offers choices of innovative international fusion dishes. Located in the upper floor of an airy, alfresco Khmer wooden house, the 60-seater Lava overlooks the Siem Reap River and a lush green river promenade, making it a prime spot for lunch or dinner.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d7284326-Reviews-LAVA_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 0123', 'street2': 'No. 0123, Trang Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '1710', 'address_string': 'No. 0123 No. 0123, Trang Village, Siem Reap 1710 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name'