Le Gout Restaurant & Cafe,here:pds:place:116w63gg-83cec00cfdf447f9affd069cc04eb265,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Le Gout Restaurant & Cafe, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35128, 'lng': 103.85375}","[{'lat': 13.35128, 'lng': 103.85361}]",25175,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512997093'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://legoutkhmer.com/index.php'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.351285,103.85384,8743298,Le Gout Khmer Restaurant,"Elegantly set along the Siem Reap River, in Watdamnak Village, Le Gout Khmer Restaurant is just only one minute walk from the very frequent and popular venues of Night Markets, Old Market and the Pub Street. With wooden architectural design and green focus, Le Gout Khmer Restaurant serves you good selection of authentic Khmer-food dishes. Le Gout Khmer is an emerging restaurant with an evolution.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d8743298-Reviews-Le_Gout_Khmer_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 368, Group 13, Watdamnak Village, Salakamroeuk', 'street2': '#368, Group 13, Watdamnak Village, Salakamroeuk', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12202', 'address_string': 'No. 368, Group 13, Watdamnak Village, Salakamroeuk #368, Group 13, Watdamnak Village, Salakamroeuk, Siem Reap 12202 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,booking@legoutkhmer.com,+855 77 505 087,http://www.legoutkhmer.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/U