"Le Jardin - Garden Restaurant & Ice Cream, Oasis in the Heart of the City",here:pds:place:116w649e-7dc6f57aeff54d0888eccaea33e8d6a9,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Le Jardin - Garden Restaurant & Ice Cream, Oasis in the Heart of the City, ផ្លូវ 360 16, 120102 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 360', 'postalCode': '120102', 'houseNumber': '16'}","{'lat': 11.54853, 'lng': 104.92645}","[{'lat': 11.5488, 'lng': 104.92641}]",7128,"[{'id': '550-5520-0000', 'name': 'Leisure', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '372-000', 'name': 'Mediterranean', 'primary': True}, {'id': '800-063', 'name': 'Ice Cream'}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511723399'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.559497,104.92454,11794278,Hops Craft Beer Garden & Restaurants,"Hops Craft Beer Garden & Restaurant in Phnom Penh's vibrant Boeung Keng Kang (BKK) district features a classy craft brewery, a restaurant with a beautiful beer garden, an art lounge, private rooms, terraces and a sports bar with high-end billiard tables and electronic darts. The premises are designed in a contemporary urban architectural style. Unique in Cambodia - our beer is 100% natural and our beer is produced following highest German brewing standards. Also visit Hops ""Villa"" in Tuol Kork (TK) district, our latest outlet set around a renovated art-deco villa with generous garden seating shaded by trees. Here too, we offer the full Hops menu and craft beer selection.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d11794278-Reviews-Hops_Craft_Beer_Garden_Restaurants-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No.17 Street 228', 'street2': 'Corner Street 51', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12211', 'address_string': 'No.17 Street 228 Corner Street 51, Phnom Penh 12211 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phno