Le Jardin des Delices,here:pds:place:116aabd1-66f977e9591308a1a9d06b6e791bf278,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Le Jardin des Delices, 171210 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្រងែ', 'postalCode': '171210'}","{'lat': 13.38484, 'lng': 103.82417}","[{'lat': 13.38497, 'lng': 103.82413}]",86575,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '300-000', 'name': 'European'}, {'id': '301-000', 'name': 'French'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1509288'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85589629398'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://ecolepauldubrule.org/training-restaurant'}]}]","[{'text': ['Tue-Fri: 12:00 - 14:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T120000', 'duration': 'PT02H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:TU,WE,TH,FR'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.384523,103.82405,1509288,Le Jardin des Delices,"Le Jardin des Délices is the training restaurant of l'École d'Hôtellerie et de Tourisme Paul Dubrule. Only a 10-minute tuk-tuk ride from Siem Reap town and 5 minutes from the airport on National Road 6. Allure your senses to a unique experience: sample delicious flavors from Asia and Western delicacies in the tranquil setting of an exotic garden. Enjoy being indulged by our attentive students and their unforgettable smiles. Western and Asian set menu choices, prepared and served by our students, supported by their teachers. Your dining experience will actively contribute to our students’ career development and journey towards becoming proud, capable professionals in their chosen field. The perfect spot for your first experience in Siem Reap or a farewell lunch before your departure.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d1509288-Reviews-Le_Jardin_des_Delices-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National road 6', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '93113', 'address_string': 'National road 6, Siem Reap 93113 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,reservation@ecolepauldubrule.org,+855 89 629 398,http://ecolepauldubrule.org/training-restaurant/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d1509288-Le_Jardin_des_Delices-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#287 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '287'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,35,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '8', '5': '27'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",78,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d1509288-m66827-Reviews-Le_Jardin_des_Delices-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1200'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1400'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1200'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1400'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1200'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1400'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1200'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1400'}}], 'weekday_text': [