Le Kree Downtown Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649d-788122410f0a62cedfd810b16c7a5e98,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Le Kree Downtown Hotel, 120802 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'សែនសុខ', 'subdistrict': 'ទឹកថ្លា', 'postalCode': '120802'}","{'lat': 11.54958, 'lng': 104.86573}","[{'lat': 11.54971, 'lng': 104.86572}]",2043,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '21355979'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85586886618'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.lekreehotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.549555,104.86573,21355979,Le Kree Downtown Hotel,"Welcome to Le Kree Downtown Hotel, where exceptional hospitality meets unparalleled comfort, positioning us as one of the premier hotels in Phnom Penh. Situated in a tranquil urban neighborhood, our hotel provides a peaceful retreat amidst the vibrant energy of the city. With a prime location near Phnom Penh International Airport, Le Kree Downtown Hotel ensures a seamless travel experience for all guests. Whether you are here for business or leisure, our hotel offers easy access to Phnom Penh’s most famous tourist attractions, promising a memorable and enriching visit. Experience the perfect combination of luxury, comfort, and convenience at Le Kree Downtown Hotel—your ultimate destination for a distinguished stay in Phnom Penh.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d21355979-Reviews-Le_Kree_Downtown_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 1177, St. Down Town', 'street2': ""Sangkat Ou Baek K'am, Khan Sen Sok"", 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '120805', 'address_string': ""No. 1177, St. Down Town Sangkat Ou Baek K'am, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh 120805 Cambodia""}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,N