Le Relais de Chhlong,here:pds:place:116w65me-29ad244a44e542f6a109d5c13a6c81a7,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Le Relais de Chhlong, ផ្លូវ 308, 100101 ឆ្លូង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ក្រចេះ', 'city': 'ឆ្លូង', 'district': 'ឆ្លូង', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 308', 'postalCode': '100101'}","{'lat': 12.25403, 'lng': 105.97217}","[{'lat': 12.2539, 'lng': 105.97213}]",120904,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13509169'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512347309'}, {'value': '+855882725653'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/lerelaisdechhlong', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kratie,12.254251,105.97224,13509169,Le Relais de Chhlong,"Beautifully restored & expanded to its former glory “Le Relais de Chhlong” was built in 1916 as a Customs House, directly overlooking the Mekong. Marvel at the colonial details which have been painstakingly repaired, to offer you the most comfortable accommodation and dining. The hotel is located in Chhlong, 30 minutes drive from/to Kratie; 3.5 hours from Southern Laos or Phnom Penh and 5 Hours from Saigon. Offering 10 Suites with air-conditioning, with Luxury King Beds, private Living room, Wifi, Private Terrace and Cable TV. A Glistening Swimming pool with Sun Umbrellas, and Wooden House Restaurant with views over the Mekong. Visit the many fruit trees with rare butterflies and birds in the garden, or enjoy relaxing in the colonial living quarters at your own leisure. A fine selection of wines by the glass or beers & juices; Dinner is served until 830pm and Lunch until 3pm. Wednesdays we offer Khmer BBQ for all our residents, and outside guests by reservation only. Boat Cruises can be arranged, for Sunset or to Visit the Dolphins and Bicycles are available for Hire to cycle to the Colonial Market.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g729351-d13509169-Reviews-Le_Relais_de_Chhlong-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Road 308', 'street2': 'Chhlong', 'city': 'Kratie', 'state': 'Kratie Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '92103', 'address_string': 'Road 308 Chhlong, Kratie 92103 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kratie', 'location_id': '729351'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kratie Province', 'location_id': '2366668'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g729351-d13509169-Le_Relais_de_Chhlong-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '729351', 'ranking_string': '#3 of 8 hotels in Kratie', 'geo_location_name': 'Kratie', 'ranking_out_of': '8', 'ranking': '3'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,79,"{'1': '2', '2': '2', '3': '4', '4': '10', '5': '61'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",176,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g729351-d13509169-m66827-Reviews-Le_Relais_de_Chhlong-Kratie_Kratie_Provin