Le Rit's Guest House,here:pds:place:116w649g-da3d75aaad0a4720b9c4e0eca0e67d2e,en,guest_house,"{'label': ""Le Rit's Guest House, ផ្លូវ 240 71, 120207 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ចតុមុខ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 240', 'postalCode': '120207', 'houseNumber': '71'}","{'lat': 11.55999, 'lng': 104.92788}","[{'lat': 11.55984, 'lng': 104.92794}]",7006,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1649023'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523213160'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.nyemo.com/guesthouse'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.55857,104.92382,1649023,Le Rit's Guest House,"Finding an ideal romantic guest house in Phnom Penh does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Le Rit's Guest House, a nice option for travelers like you.
The guest house features room service, and you can stay connected during your stay as Le Rit`s Guest House Hotel offers guests free wifi. Plus, Le Rit`s Guest House Hotel offers an on-site restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day.
While staying at Le Rit`s Guest House Hotel, visitors can check out Champey Academy of Arts (0.5 mi) and Bassac Lane (0.6 mi), some of Phnom Penh's top attractions.
While in Phnom Penh, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Le Rit's Guest House, including Eclipse Sky Bar (0.3 mi), Romdeng (0.4 mi), and Friends the Restaurant (0.7 mi).
Best of all, Le Rit's Guest House makes it easy to experience many great Phnom Penh attractions like Din Art Gallery, Lotus Space, and Bong Bong Bong, which are some popular art galleries.
Le Rit's Guest House puts the best of Phnom Penh at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
