Le Tonle,here:pds:place:116aabd1-3ebe6b2648a50207778b5a4ed440e029,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Le Tonle, 100603 ក្រចេះ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ក្រចេះ', 'city': 'ក្រចេះ', 'district': 'ក្រចេះ', 'postalCode': '100603'}","{'lat': 12.49089, 'lng': 106.01627}","[{'lat': 12.49076, 'lng': 106.01629}]",114052,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '100-1100-0000', 'name': 'Coffee/Tea'}, {'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25342696'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6200477'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855975558686'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://letonle.org', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kratie,12.492876,106.015884,6200477,Le Tonle,"Le Tonle Guesthouse and Restaurant is a social enterprise under the umbrella of the Cambodian Rural Development Team (CRDT) NGO, every dining experience at Le Tonle goes beyond simply satisfying your taste buds. It's an opportunity to contribute to charitable efforts aimed at uplifting communities along the Mekong in North-east Cambodia. At Le Tonle, we believe that culinary experiences can be more than just pleasure for our guests; they can also be a means of supporting local community development. Our restaurant offers not only European cuisine in a unique setting but also principles of charity and social responsibility. Every dining experience at Le Tonle is not just a delicious meal but also an opportunity to contribute to charitable efforts. We actively support the development of local communities and strive to ensure that every guest can be part of this noble mission. Come to Le Tonle, where taste meets goodness and join us in our vision for community development!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g729351-d6200477-Reviews-Le_Tonle-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street Preah Somramrith - River Road', 'street2': 'Psar Veng Village', 'city': 'Kratie', 'state': 'Kratie Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '10109', 'address_string': 'Street Preah Somramrith - River Road Psar Veng Village, Kratie 10109 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kratie', 'location_id': '729351'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kratie Province', 'location_id': '2366668'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g729351-d6200477-Le_Tonle-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '729351', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 8 hotels in Kratie', 'geo_location_name': 'Kratie', 'ranking_out_of': '8', 'ranking': '1'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,344,"{'1': '5', '2': '6', '3': '20', '4': '91', '5': '222'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",200,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g729351-d6200477-m66827-Reviews-Le_Tonle-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Free Inte