Le Tonlé Restaurant and Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-847bf0a5933309907d30c37cd886e23f,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Le Tonlé Restaurant and Guesthouse, 100603 ក្រចេះ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ក្រចេះ', 'city': 'ក្រចេះ', 'district': 'ក្រចេះ', 'postalCode': '100603'}","{'lat': 12.49065, 'lng': 106.01648}","[{'lat': 12.49078, 'lng': 106.01646}]",114083,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-064', 'name': 'International'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7136401'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85595261448'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.letonle.org'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:30 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T063000', 'duration': 'PT15H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kratie,12.490747,106.01646,7136401,Le Tonle Restaurant and Guesthouse,"Friendly, cozy and comfortable, Le Tonle offers the best restaurants and guesthouse in Kratie. Founded in 2007, Le Tonle functions as a Tourism Training Center to increase the capacities of vulnerable youth from Northeast Cambodia. Enjoying a meal in our restaurant will directly support our young trainees. The restaurants offer a selection of traditional Khmer and Western cuisine. Our young, friendly trainees are more than happy to serve you and practice their English!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g729351-d7136401-Reviews-Le_Tonle_Restaurant_and_Guesthouse-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Preah Soramarith Quay , Near by Koh Trong Ferry Port', 'city': 'Kratie', 'state': 'Kratie Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '100603', 'address_string': 'Preah Soramarith Quay , Near by Koh Trong Ferry Port, Kratie 100603 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kratie', 'location_id': '729351'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kratie Province', 'location_id':