Le Water Villa,here:pds:place:116w63gg-4e6a3a67a8a64033a560a61788ffadda,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Le Water Villa, ផ្លូវ ហាប់ កួន, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ហាប់ កួន', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35752, 'lng': 103.85596}","[{'lat': 13.35739, 'lng': 103.85594}]",24495,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '18995566'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598456668'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/lewatervillasiemreap', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.35748,103.85596,18995566,Le Water Villa,"Le Water Villa is one of the most popular Villa in Siem Reap, it is located in heart of Siem Reap city only 3 minutes walk to pub street, night market. Our villa has 15 rooms with air conditioned rooms. All rooms have private en suite bathroom with all rooms having hot showers and cable t.v. Free internet, Free WIFI and Free mini fridge in rooms to all of our customers. We also have the elegant coffee shop nearby to our hotel. You can have breakfast, lunch, dinner and also enjoy with the good coffees and various soft drinks. We also arrange the tour package, plane/bus/boat tickets, and most of the activities in Siem Reap, Angkor Wat , Cambodia.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d18995566-Reviews-Le_Water_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Hup Guan Street', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': 'Hup Guan Street, Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id'