Leap Viraksa Hotel,here:pds:place:116httek-265c637e222d04236411749b1a3c7bee,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Leap Viraksa Hotel, ផ្លូវ 223, 030404 កំពង់ចាម, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'city': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'district': 'វាលវង់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 223', 'postalCode': '030404'}","{'lat': 11.98569, 'lng': 105.46093}","[{'lat': 11.98578, 'lng': 105.46082}]",25367,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2421825'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85542941239'}]}],Not Available,Kampong Cham,11.985654,105.460976,2421825,Leap Viraksa Hotel,"See why so many travelers make Leap Viraksa Hotel their small hotel of choice when visiting Kampong Cham. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
While staying at Leap Viraksa Hotel, visitors can check out Wat Nokor (1.8 mi), which is a popular Kampong Cham attraction.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as a minibar, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the small hotel.
Leap Viraksa Hotel features a 24 hour front desk, room service, and a convenience store, to help make your stay more enjoyable. If you are driving to Leap Viraksa Hotel, free parking is available.
Travelers looking to enjoy some burritos can head to Destiny Coffee House. Otherwise, you may want to check out an Asian restaurant such as Smile Restaurant, Bamboo Cafe, or Mekong Crossing.
If you are interested in exploring Kampong Cham, check out a , such as The French Tower.
At Leap Viraksa Hotel, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Kampong Cham.
