Lemon Tree,here:pds:place:116aabd1-8f373afa94970a057db5e13a91e659e9,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Lemon Tree, ផ្លូវ 308 8B, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 308', 'postalCode': '120101', 'houseNumber': '8B'}","{'lat': 11.55322, 'lng': 104.93094}","[{'lat': 11.55304, 'lng': 104.93094}]",23048,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515315300'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.555496,104.93093,7256922,Banana Tree Restaurant,"Dinner with daily Apsara dance show!!! Indulge your taste buds at our ground floor restaurant serving fine Khmer cuisine with a contemporary twist and a variety of international and Western classics. Try some traditional Cambodian fare prepared by our experienced local chefs or opt for something more familiar. Our menu intends to dazzle and delight with every bite. For a truly memorable experience we have devised a few extra special activities for you to consider during your stay with us. Not only do we offer cooking and massage classes, but also we give you several other options to make your trip more cultural, more romantic or simply more enjoyable. Have dinner while being entertained by a traditional Apsara dance troupe, which is sure to please all your senses. Wine, dine and delight your loved one over a romantic violin dinner. Any day can be a day to celebrate love. Host an exclusive cocktail party with friends, clients or colleagues and enjoy an unforgettable evening and exceptional service. Or host an informative workshop on the topic of your choosing geared toward our in-house guests and the general public. Please note the following activities do incur an additional charge.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d7256922-Reviews-Banana_Tree_Restaurant-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 4B Street 21, Chamkarmon', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12101', 'address_string': '# 4B Street 21, Chamkarmon, Phnom Penh 12101 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,restaurant@bananatreerestaurant.com,+855 12 940 304,http://bananatreerestaurant.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d7256922-Banana_Tree_Restaurant-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#83 of 1,983 Places to Eat in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '1983', 'ranking': '83'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,190,"{'1': '3', '2': '5', '3': '15', '4': '46', '5': '121'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",160,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d7256922-m66827-Reviews-Banana_Tree_Restaurant-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 't