Lemongrass Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w636s-7d28b15680cb45d7be1ce5846a84f3a5,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Lemongrass Restaurant, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10253, 'lng': 103.19687}","[{'lat': 13.1024, 'lng': 103.19685}]",12509,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '300-000', 'name': 'European'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13119233'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569935907'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/pg/Lemongrass-Restaurant-431069647265756'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT15H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Battambang,13.102571,103.19688,13119233,Lemongrass Restaurant,Make your meal count. Dining at Lemongrass Restaurant is an easy and delicious way to contribute to the personal and educational development of underserved Cambodian young adults. Spoons cafe serves as a training facility and multipurpose space for Battambang students to gain hands-on experience while providing guests with authentic Cambodian cuisine and hospitality.,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g303666-d13119233-Reviews-Lemongrass_Restaurant-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street2': 'Level 4 @ Royal Hotel', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'Level 4 @ Royal Hotel, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,+855 69 935 907,https://www.face