Leng Seng na Hotel,here:pds:place:116httek-0d3c7615d3aa0059271f5dcc0b98a16f,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Leng Seng na Hotel, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.08485, 'lng': 103.19918}","[{'lat': 13.08498, 'lng': 103.19922}]",11700,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8547228'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8723200'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512530295'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.084858,103.199295,8723200,Leng Seng Na Hotel,"Looking for a place to stay in Battambang? Then look no further than Leng Seng Na Hotel, a small hotel that brings the best of Battambang to your doorstep.
Rooms at Leng Seng Na Hotel provide air conditioning, and guests can stay connected with free wifi.
In addition, while staying at Leng Seng Na Hotel guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, room service, and a concierge. Need a place to park? Free parking is available at Leng Seng Na Hotel.
Close to some of Battambang's most popular landmarks, such as Prasat Sneung (0.4 mi) and Ta Dumbong Statue (0.7 mi), Leng Seng Na Hotel is a great destination for tourists.
During your visit, be sure to check out a popular Battambang bibimbap  restaurant such as Cafe Eden, which is a short distance from Leng Seng Na Hotel.
If you are interested in exploring Battambang, check out one of the art museums, such as ROMCHEIK 5 Art Space and Tep Kao Sol Loeum Lorn Gallery.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Leng Seng Na Hotel as you experience everything Battambang has to offer.
