Leo Pump Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w649e-578d1b2034b2468ca6098cc38e19821a,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Leo Pump Cambodia, ផ្លូវ 488 26A, 120112 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារដើមថ្កូវ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 488', 'postalCode': '120112', 'houseNumber': '26A'}","{'lat': 11.53351, 'lng': 104.91661}","[{'lat': 11.53362, 'lng': 104.91654}]",6882,"[{'id': '700-7400-0151', 'name': 'Utilities', 'primary': True}, {'id': '550-5520-0357', 'name': 'Water Park'}, {'id': '700-7200-0277', 'name': 'Specialty Trade Contractors'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'www': [{'value': 'http://www.leopumpcambodia.com'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.538942,104.91603,2408799,Daughters of Cambodia Visitor Centre,"Daughters of Cambodia is a social enterprise empowering victims of trafficking to leave the sex industry through alternative employment. At the Daughters Visitor Centre, visitors can gain insight into the endemic of trafficking that is ravaging Cambodia while learning more about what Daughters is doing to stop it. Moreover, visitors can actually participate in our work by frequenting one of the two social enterprise businesses housed at the Visitor Centre — our fair-trade shop and women's spa — all of which provide former victims of trafficking with the vital income and skills to build thriving lives for themselves outside the horrors of the sex industry. To see a list of the spa's services, find the Daughters of Cambodia Visitor Centre on Facebook. If you have a large party, please call ahead of time to allow us to better accommodate you.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d2408799-Reviews-Daughters_of_Cambodia_Visitor_Centre-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#63, Street 456, Toul Tompoung', 'street2': 'near Russian Market', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': '#63, Street 456, Toul Tompoung near Russian Market, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,office@daughtersofcambodia.org,+855 77 657 678,http://daughtersofcambodia.org,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d2408799-Daughters_of_Cambodia_Visitor_Centre-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 3 Traveler Resources in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '3', 'ranking': '1'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,1062,"{'1': '1', '2': '12', '3': '41', '4': '245', '5': '763'}",Not available,259,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d2408799-m66827-Reviews-Daughters_of_Cambodia_Visitor_Centre-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1700'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 08:30 - 17:00', 'Tuesday: 08:30 - 17:00', 'Wednesday: 08:30 - 17:00', 'Thursday: 08:30 - 17:00', 'Friday: 08:30 - 17:00', 'Saturday: 08:30 - 17:00', 'Sunday: Closed']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'traveler_resources', 'localized_name': 'Traveler Resources'}, {'name': 'shopping', 'localized_name': 'Shopping'}, {'name': 'attractions', 'localized_name': 'Attractions'}]","[{'name': 'Shopping', 'localized_name': 'Shopping', 'categories': [{'name': 'Gift & Specialty Shops', 'localized_name': 'Gift & Specialty Shops'}]}, {'name': 'Traveler Resources', 'localized_name': 'Traveler Resources', 'categories': [{'name': 'Visitor Centers', 'localized_name': 'Visitor Centers'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '20'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '345'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '167'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '125'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '269'}]","[{'award_type': 'Travelers Choice', 'year': '2024', 'images': {'tiny': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2024_L.png', 'small': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2024_L.png', 'large': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2024_L.png'}, 'categories': [], 'display_name': 'Travelers Choice'}, {'award_type': 'Travelers Choice', 'year': '2023', 'images': {'tiny': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png', 'small': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png', 'large': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png'}, 'categories': [], 'display_name': 'Travelers Choice'}]",Not available,Not available,FALSE,32,14
Les Cocktails Restaurant & Lounge,here:pds:place:116httek-37ae145d189d037f4c5e8fd66ade8cba,en,Cocktail Lounge,"{'label': 'Les Cocktails Restaurant & Lounge, 120801 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'សែនសុខ', 'subdistrict': 'ភ្នំពេញថ្មី', 'postalCode': '120801'}","{'lat': 11.60027, 'lng': 104.88476}","[{'lat': 11.60015, 'lng': 104.8847}]",4249,"[{'id': '200-2000-0368', 'name': 'Cocktail Lounge', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85586646566'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.576119,104.91809,2364281,Restaurant Le Royal,"Phnom Penh’s most elegant dining room Restaurant Le Royal has completed an inspirational refurbishment. The makeover has breathed new vitality and comfort into this stylish fine dining restaurant while maintaining the elegant ambiance for which it is renowned. Be the first to experience our newly enhanced Restaurant Le Royal, Phnom Penh's favourite weekend destination to enjoy conversation with friends and family over fabulous wining and dining offerings, and the only restaurant that serves Royal Khmer cuisine. This ancient Royal Khmer cuisine has been handed down to Raffles Hotel Le Royal by the decree of the Royal Palace. The finest ingredients are carefully blended to create a distinct, exhilarating and elegant gastronomic experience. It is an exceptional, magical, memorable place - timeless yet completely of its time. 2 Private rooms are available on request.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d2364281-Reviews-Restaurant_Le_Royal-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '92 Rukhak Vithei Daun Penh', 'street2': 'Sangkat Wat Phnom', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12202', 'address_string': '92 Rukhak Vithei Daun Penh Sangkat Wat Phnom, Phnom Penh 12202 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': '