Les Parigots Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-c0d74f7f68b0003b67dd55f91e0fbbbf,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Les Parigots Guesthouse, វិថី វត្តបូ, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'វិថី វត្តបូ', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.36069, 'lng': 103.8618}","[{'lat': 13.36074, 'lng': 103.86167}]",23813,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7648061'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855636789222'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.360635,103.86192,7648061,Les Parigots Guesthouse,"Les Parigots Guesthouse is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Siem Reap, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as Les Parigots Guesthouse offers guests free wifi.
The guest house features a 24 hour front desk.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Viti's Tuk Tuk Driver (0.4 mi) and Wat Preah Prom Rath (0.5 mi), guests of Les Parigots Guesthouse can easily experience some of Siem Reap's most well known attractions.
If you’re looking for a cafe, consider a visit to Spoons, Fresh Fruit Factory, or Miss Wong Cocktail Bar, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Les Parigots Guesthouse.
Best of all, Les Parigots Guesthouse makes it easy to experience many great Siem Reap attractions like Banteay Samre, Banteay Kdei, and Ta Som, which are some popular architectural buildings.
Enjoy your stay in Siem Reap!
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7648061-Reviews-Les_Parigots_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'along National Road No 6, east of Koh Ker Traffic', 'street2': 'Near Royal Residence', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17355', 'address_string': 'along National Road No 6, east of Koh Ker Traffic Near Royal Residence, Siem Reap 17355 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d7648061-Les_Parigots_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#283 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '283'}",3.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.5-66827-5.svg,62,"{'1': '11', '2': '4', '3': '11', '4': '25', '5': '11'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanlin