Level Up Cafe & Eatery,here:pds:place:116w63gg-46bd073bc89a6dc344ca3e9a0edd1ae7,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Level Up Cafe & Eatery, ច្រកផ្លូវ ហ្វាំងគី, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ច្រកផ្លូវ ហ្វាំងគី', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35738, 'lng': 103.85073}","[{'lat': 13.3574, 'lng': 103.85059}]",88443,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '101-000', 'name': 'American'}, {'id': '201-000', 'name': 'Chinese'}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25249059'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512475268'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 16:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT09H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.357388,103.850655,25249059,Level Up Cafe & Eatery,"Choosing to dine at Level Up Café & Eatery is a healthy and awesome choice as we let you savor the distinctive flavours of the region with local ingredients. Our chef prepares various menu options such as Vegetarian, Vegan options, Asian and Western food. From traditional dishes to international, you could have a taste of a little bit of everything. We strongly value freshness of the ingredients we use and we hope to offer a healthy lifestyle through our food while still enjoying the flavourful and filling taste. Opening daily for breakfast, brunch and lunch! :)) All dishes are inspired by seasonal local ingredients, which can be found in the provinces of Cambodia. We welcome you with open arms during your visit to Siem Reap.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d25249059-Reviews-Level_Up_Cafe_Eatery-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Funky Ln', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'c