Lion Tours Adventure,here:pds:place:116w63u6-83fc1083e1fce820eeb068e327e33a58,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Lion Tours Adventure, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.41284, 'lng': 103.84083}","[{'lat': 13.41271, 'lng': 103.84083}]",21632,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25181212'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25184726'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512297609'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://liontouradventures.blogspot.com'}, {'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/naturaladventuretrip'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.412826,103.84083,25181212,Lion Tours Adventure,"My name is Lon Lev and I have been a tour guide and translator in Siem Reap since 2008. I love sharing my knowledge of Cambodia's ancient and recent history with visitors from all over the globe. I passed my language exam at the Ministry of Tourism in 2008 and went on to study English at Build Bright University from 2009 to 2012. I was Tour Leader with Explore Travel Company, based in the United Kingdom, from 2016 to 2020.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g2366676-d25181212-Reviews-Lion_Tours_Adventure-Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,liontouradventure@gmail.com,+855 12 297 609,http://liontouradventures.blogspot.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g2366676-d25181212-Lion_Tours_Adventure-Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id':