Lodestar Hostel Siem Reap,here:pds:place:116w63gg-d1553bf49ebf4c15b9167806eb4f8502,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Lodestar Hostel Siem Reap, ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35147, 'lng': 103.8521}","[{'lat': 13.35136, 'lng': 103.85219}]",88317,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15213122'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512221672'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://lodestarhostel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.351495,103.852066,15213122,Lodestar Hostel Siem Reap,"Lodestar Hostel Siem Reap (former Channel Angkor Hostel) provides comfortable and clean guestrooms with high-speed free WiFi, high-quality mattress even in dormitory beds. Guests can take rest in an outdoor swimming pool and an exotic poolside bar with various drinks including local beers and cocktails. The property is within a 5-minute walk of Pub Street and 500 metres of King's Road Angkor. A continental breakfast is available each morning at the property and the restaurant serves Asian dishes for the lunch and dinner as well.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d15213122-Reviews-Lodestar_Hostel_Siem_Reap-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '059 Psah Kraoum Rd', 'street2': 'Vihear Chen', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': '059 Psah Kraoum Rd Vihear Chen, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d15213122-Lodestar_Hostel_Siem_Reap