Lok Lak,here:pds:place:116w63gg-4b45e1f4b70f42c29a044297350a4841,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Lok Lak, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35812, 'lng': 103.8813}","[{'lat': 13.35811, 'lng': 103.88144}]",22717,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-064', 'name': 'International'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15028409'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563968888'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.marriott.com/hotels/hotel-information/restaurant/repcy-courtyard-siem-reap-resort'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT16H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.358144,103.88117,15028409,Lok Lak,"Our all-day-dining restaurant, Lok Lak, offers an integration of modern cuisine with a commitment to heirloom, seasonal, and sustainable products taking the edge and flavour of authentic Khmer while combining them with pristine local products and vegetables. Lok Lak also creates and customizes the perfect ""market to table"" locally sourced and organic menu to fit your gathering and dietary needs be it over breakfast, lunch, or dinner.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d15028409-Reviews-Lok_Lak-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No 0609 Road 6A', 'street2': 'Courtyard by Marriott Siem Reap, Phum Chongkoesou, Khum Slor Kram', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17251', 'address_string': 'No 0609 Road 6A Courtyard by Marriott Siem Reap, Phum Chongkoesou, Khum Slor Kram, Siem Reap 17251 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': '