Lom Lam Eco Village Homestay,here:pds:place:116aabd1-152b4e4d446506e8adfeb68af1c9581f,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Lom Lam Eco Village Homestay, 170506 ប្រាសាទបាគង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'ប្រាសាទបាគង', 'district': 'មានជ័យ', 'postalCode': '170506'}","{'lat': 13.29776, 'lng': 104.00389}","[{'lat': 13.29783, 'lng': 104.00377}]",24987,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10745186'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512656662'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://lomlameco.weebly.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.297777,104.00386,10745186,Lom Lam Eco Village Homestay,"*22km far from Siem reap town. Homestay with one private room for 2-3 person and dormitory space with 5 bed. *Free Cambodian breakfast and optional local dinner by reasonal price. *We can arrange Angkor temple or Tonlesap floating village tuktuk tour. *Village tour with English speaking village guide or any kind of study tour in village also available. Tour price start from $10 half day. We can take you to see local market, crocodiles farm and rice field or floating village ( Kompong fluk ) .",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d10745186-Reviews-Lom_Lam_Eco_Village_Homestay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Banteay Russay Village', 'street2': 'Mean Cheay Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Banteay Russay Village Mean Cheay Commune, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d10745186-Lom_Lam_Eco_Village_Homestay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '