Long Beach Resort Koh Rong,here:pds:place:116w3cmj-88109ea9762e41aebec0d0c064b618d9,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Long Beach Resort Koh Rong, 180405 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'កោះរុង', 'postalCode': '180405'}","{'lat': 10.72938, 'lng': 103.2536}","[{'lat': 10.72949, 'lng': 103.25352}]",90695,"[{'id': '500-5100-0056', 'name': 'Campground', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13171604'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85585311161'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.kohrongloveresort.com'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.728165,103.25445,13171604,Long Beach Resort Koh Rong,"We like to welcome you to our Cambodian eco resort located near Sok San Village. You will enjoy your own private beach, dense and luscious rain-forest, and locally sourced organic food in an earthy haven built with nature, rather than destructing it. You will stay in a spacious and tall butterfly tent, equipped with electricity, a side table, a fan, and an incredible ergonomic mattress! Linen, basic toiletries and towels are included. You will have your own little patio, surrounded by native plants. The peaceful environment, sounds of nature, and our pleasure cooking with high standard organic food will make your stay in paradise unforgettable.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d13171604-Reviews-Long_Beach_Resort_Koh_Rong-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sok San Village, Koh Rong commune', 'street2': 'Sok San village, Sangkat Koh Rong', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Sok San Village, Koh Rong commune Sok San village, Sangkat Koh Rong, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d13171604-Long_Beach_Resort_Koh_Rong-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#64 of 277 Specialty lodging in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out_of': '277', 'ranking': '64'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,12,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '2', '4': '2', '5': '7'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}}",219,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d13171604-m66827-Reviews-Long_Beach_Resort_Koh_Rong-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Beachfront', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Public Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Banquet Room', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Conference Facilities', 'Beach Access', 'Pets Allowed', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Meeting rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Concierge', 'Family Rooms', 'Babysitting', 'Private Beaches', 'Breakfast Available', 'Housekeeping', 'Baggage Storage', 'BBQ Facilities', 'Boating', 'Bottled Water', 'Canoeing', 'Car Hire', '24-Hour Check-in', 'Coffee Shop', 'Currency Exchange', 'English', 'Entertainment Staff', 'Fireplace', 'Fishing', '24-Hour Front Desk', 'Hiking', 'Khmer', ""Kids' Meals"", 'Kid-Friendly Buffet', ""Kids' Outdoor Play Equipment"", 'Massage Chair', 'Open-air Bath', 'Outdoor Fireplace', 'Outdoor Furniture', 'Picnic Area', '24-Hour Security', 'Snorkeling', 'Sun Terrace', 'Walking Tours', 'Wine / Champagne', 'Yoga Classes']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'other', 'localized_name': 'Specialty Lodging'}]",Not available,"['Family', 'Quaint']",[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '2'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '5'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '4'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,11,15
Long Bunhor,here:pds:place:116w648f-b72d89a1e2004f7a9af452f859e8416e,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Long Bunhor, 080315 កណ្ដាលស្ទឹង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'កណ្ដាលស្ទឹង', 'district': 'សៀមរាប', 'postalCode': '080315'}","{'lat': 11.40124, 'lng': 104.86699}","[{'lat': 11.40137, 'lng': 104.86629}]",46631,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512576805'}]}],Not Available,Kandal,10.480137,104.31554,2530056,Long Villa Inn,"Welcome to Long Villa Inn, your Kep “home away from home.” Long Villa Inn aims to make your visit as relaxing and enjoyable as possible, which is why so many guests continue to come back year after year.
Close to Patio (1.6 mi), a popular Kep landmark, Long Villa Inn is a great destination for tourists.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as Long Villa Inn offers guests free wifi.
The small hotel features a concierge and room service. Plus, Long Villa Inn offers an on-site restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the Asian restaurants, including Sailing Club, Kimly Restaurant, and Holy Crab, all of which are a short distance from Long Villa Inn.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out a park, such as Jasmine Valley Skate Bowl.
Long Villa Inn puts the best of Kep at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
