Long Lin House,here:pds:place:116w649g-dc8a3f4e5717438bbc147017d2d749cf,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Long Lin House, ផ្លូវ 19, 120206 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 19', 'postalCode': '120206'}","{'lat': 11.56696, 'lng': 104.92692}","[{'lat': 11.56688, 'lng': 104.92672}]",6847,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]","[{'id': '311-034', 'name': 'Spanish - Tapas', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2085168'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523992412'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/LongLin-House-923603234357134', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.56665,104.9268,2085168,Long Lin House,"If you’re looking for a budget friendly guest house in Phnom Penh, look no further than Long Lin House.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Champey Academy of Arts (0.1 mi) and Wat Ounalom (0.2 mi), guests of Long Lin House can easily experience some of Phnom Penh's most well known attractions.
Free internet access is offered to guests, and rooms at Long Lin House offer air conditioning.
During your stay, take advantage of some of the amenities offered, including a 24 hour front desk, room service, and baggage storage. Guests of Long Lin House are also welcome to enjoy a lounge, located on site. For travelers arriving by car, free parking is available.
When you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out Cousin's Burger & Coffee, Daughters of Cambodia Visitor Centre Café, and Backyard Cafe, which are some cafes that are popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.
Should time allow, Royal Palace is a popular attraction that is within walking distance.
The staff at Long Lin House looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d2085168-Reviews-Long_Lin_House-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '19 159 Street', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '19 159 Street, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d2085168-Long_Lin_House-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#118 of 412 B&Bs / Inns in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '412', 'ranking': '118'}",3,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.0-66827-5.svg,91,"{'1': '12', '2': '12', '3': '27', '4': '25', '5': '15'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}}",13,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d2085168-m66827-Reviews-Long_Lin_House-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Internet', 'Shuttle