Long Live Angkor Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w63u5-5d8b6ab3d3454cbc9587bd051dd6997d,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Long Live Angkor Guesthouse, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36354, 'lng': 103.85485}","[{'lat': 13.36359, 'lng': 103.85472}]",24079,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '20950126'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4132700'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563761923'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.36328,103.85474,4132700,Long Live Angkor Guesthouse,"Looking for a place to stay in Siem Reap? Then look no further than Long Live Angkor Guesthouse, a guest house that brings the best of Siem Reap to your doorstep.
Guest rooms offer a refrigerator and a desk, and Long Live Angkor Guesthouse makes getting online easy as free wifi is available.
You can also take advantage of some of the amenities offered by the guest house, including room service. In addition, guests can enjoy an on-site restaurant during their visit. As an added convenience, there is parking available to guests.
Close to some of Siem Reap's most popular landmarks, such as Viti's Tuk Tuk Driver (0.4 mi) and Seng English Speaking Tuk Tuk & Car Driver (0.6 mi), Long Live Angkor Guesthouse is a great destination for tourists.
While visiting Siem Reap, you may want to try some shrimp at one of the nearby restaurants, such as Chanrey Tree, Khmer Kitchen Restaurant, or Bugs Cafe.
Plus, during your trip, don’t forget to check out some of the popular architectural buildings, such as Banteay Samre, Banteay Kdei, and Ta Som.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Long Live Angkor Guesthouse as you experience everything Siem Reap has to offer.
