Long Villa Inn,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-94b04a6b1a7242148ca8df8807d2b9c2,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Long Villa Inn, ផ្លូវ 33 អេ, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 33 អេ', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.48051, 'lng': 104.31526}","[{'lat': 10.48062, 'lng': 104.31518}]",6628,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2530056'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855885555978'}]}],Not Available,Kep,10.480137,104.31554,2530056,Long Villa Inn,"Welcome to Long Villa Inn, your Kep “home away from home.” Long Villa Inn aims to make your visit as relaxing and enjoyable as possible, which is why so many guests continue to come back year after year.
Close to Patio (1.6 mi), a popular Kep landmark, Long Villa Inn is a great destination for tourists.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as Long Villa Inn offers guests free wifi.
The small hotel features a concierge and room service. Plus, Long Villa Inn offers an on-site restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the Asian restaurants, including Sailing Club, Kimly Restaurant, and Holy Crab, all of which are a short distance from Long Villa Inn.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out a park, such as Jasmine Valley Skate Bowl.
Long Villa Inn puts the best of Kep at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d2530056-Reviews-Long_Villa_Inn-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 33A, Sangkat', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Street 33A, Sangkat, Kep Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d2530056-Long_Villa_Inn-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_string': '#41 of 71 B&Bs / Inns in Kep', 'geo_location_name': 'Kep', 'ranking_out_of': '71', 'ranking': '41'}",3.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.5-66827-5.svg,16,"{'1': '1', '2': '5', '3': '1', '4': '5', '5': '4'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}}",14,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d2530056-m66827-Reviews-Long_Villa_Inn-Kep_Kep_Province.