Look Up Cafe Inn,here:pds:place:116w63u5-2808c85031e4da06b1c5e6da90074381,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Look Up Cafe Inn, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.36356, 'lng': 103.86079}","[{'lat': 13.36351, 'lng': 103.86092}]",23646,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25430224'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517669027'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/lookupcafeinn?mibextid=lqqj4d&wtsid=rdr_0t3pjdu4utfki2m8p'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.363545,103.86083,25430224,LOOK UP Cafe Inn,"LOOK UP CAFE INN is a youth hostel hotel that can accommodate 36 people. All the beds are custom-made from all wood, and each bed is equipped with warm lights, sockets and curtains. We hope to provide guests with privacy and comfort while struggling to make friends. . We have a comfortable and beautiful coffee shop with a Hong Kong-style restaurant with a semi-private kitchen on the first floor, which can meet the needs of each guest for three meals a day and leisure. We also have robot services.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d25430224-Reviews-LOOK_UP_Cafe_Inn-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 22, Wat Bo Road, Sangkat Sala Kamreuk', 'street2': 'Street 22', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': 'Street 22, Wat Bo Road, Sangkat Sala Kamreuk Street 22, Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d25430224-LOOK_UP_Cafe_Inn-Siem_Reap_Siem_Rea