Lovesg Cafe,here:pds:place:116aabd1-ae555e5569f603305d0e57dab79527c0,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Lovesg Cafe, 081104 តាខ្មៅ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'តាខ្មៅ', 'district': 'តាខ្មៅ', 'postalCode': '081104'}","{'lat': 11.47419, 'lng': 104.94959}","[{'lat': 11.47425, 'lng': 104.94971}]",15153,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0007', 'name': 'Cafeteria'}, {'id': '100-1000-0009', 'name': 'Fast Food'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '101-000', 'name': 'American'}, {'id': '257-000', 'name': 'Singaporean'}, {'id': '800-050', 'name': 'Fast Food'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7222774'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85587335535'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/Lovesgcafe/timeline', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1000-0009'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1000-0009'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}], 'text': ['Mon, Tue, Thu-Sat: 11:30 - 20:00', 'Wed: 16:00 - 20:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T113000', 'duration': 'PT08H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,TH,FR,SA'}, {'start': 'T160000', 'duration': 'PT04H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:WE'}]}]",Kandal,11.474195,104.94961,7222774,LoveSG Cafe,"LoveSG cafe is the social enterprise arm of Generation Acts Club International in Ta Khmau, Cambodia. It was set up in August 2014, with the objective of helping Cambodian youth to develop life skills, positive values and entrepreneurial potential. Generation Acts Club International (GACI) was birthed from a dynamic vision to discover and develop the seed of greatness in our youth. It was established in Singapore in 2002 and has spread across the globe to continents in South America and Southeast Asia. GACI believes that sharing life is better than living life alone; living life is better than staying alive; and investing life is better than owning life. To that end, we work to impact our communities and beyond by developing the altruistic and entrepreneurial potential of our youths. We look forward to welcoming you at LoveSG cafe today!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g729355-d7222774-Reviews-LoveSG_Cafe-Ta_Khmau_Kandal_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '201 G48, St', 'street2': 'Opposite Westland International School', 'city': 'Ta Khmau', 'state': 'Kandal Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '08251', 'address_string': '201 G48, St Opposite Westland International School, Ta Khmau 08251 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Ta Khmau', 'location_id': '729355'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kandal Province', 'location_id': '2366665'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,lovesgcafe@gmail.com,+855 87 335 535,http://www.facebook.com/Lovesgcafe/timeline,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g729355-d7222774-LoveSG_Cafe-Ta_Khmau_Kandal_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '729355', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 9 Places to Eat in Ta Khmau', 'geo_location_name': 'Ta Khmau', 'ranking_out_of': '9', 'ranking': '1'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,12,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '1', '5': '10'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",29,https:/