Lub D Cambodia Siem Reap,here:pds:place:116w63gg-26586588a6844f1fb534cf0569af128d,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Lub D Cambodia Siem Reap, ផ្លូវ 7 មករ, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 7 មករ', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34905, 'lng': 103.86717}","[{'lat': 13.34892, 'lng': 103.86712}]",24445,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12641525'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563968900'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://lubd.com/destination/cambodia-siem-reap'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.348942,103.86713,12641525,Lub d Cambodia Siem Reap,"The , largest and most modern hostel in the center of Siem Reap! Just a 5 minute walk to the famous Pub Street, and even less time to walk to the Siem Reap River and Old Market.Voted the best Hostel in Cambodia in 2019, 2nd place in Best Large hostel worldwide and 6th in best female Hostel in the world. thanks to an amazing design, atmosphere and facilities that have to be seen to be believed. The Khmer chic inspired property design includes a swimming pool with swim up pool bar, outdoor poolside lounging area, pool table and games, loads of guest activities including cycling trips and pub crawls, an Adventure Travel Co tour desk, Garage Society co-working space, and all-day dining at the PumpHouse. The entire property has free Wi-Fi, 24-hour reception service, baggage storage and a self-service laundry. All rooms are accessible by a lift, and there is even a cool down room to relax in the lobby!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12641525-Reviews-Lub_d_Cambodia_Siem_Reap-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '7 Makara Street', 'street2': 'Wat Bo Village Sangkat Sala Kamroeuk, 7', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': '7 Makara S