Phnom Sombok (2.6 mi), located nearby, makes Luck Life World Hotel a great place to stay for those interested in visiting this popular Kratie  landmark.
The rooms offer a refrigerator and air conditioning, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
Luck Life World Hotel features a concierge.
If you are looking for a good cafe, you may want to check out Sorya Cafe while staying at Luck Life World Hotel.
At Luck Life World Hotel, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Kratie .
