Lucky Kitchen Cooking Class,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-d32aee67f4810fcd4129e5b50d2bd0d6,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Lucky Kitchen Cooking Class, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.62023, 'lng': 104.16127}","[{'lat': 10.62036, 'lng': 104.1613}]",22124,"[{'id': '800-8200-0295', 'name': 'Training & Development', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15748518'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510261391'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://web.facebook.com/luckykitchenkampot'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sat: 10:00 - 14:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T100000', 'duration': 'PT04H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}]}]",Kampot,10.61999,104.16122,15748518,Lucky Kitchen Cooking Class,"Hello, my name is Sophia from Lucky Kitchen Cooking Class & Sophia’s Kitchen Kampot.
To begin our cooking class, we meet each other at 10:00AM near the market. We visit the market, make shopping together and after we take one TukTuk to my rooftop.
We start cooking class and begin to prepare the food. For one cooking class session, the group can choose 3 meals and 1 dessert.

You decide if you want with meat or only vegetarian food, also you can ask for a specific plate of your choice…
Fresh lime juice and tea are free of course.

Price is 22$/person.
One option: cook with seafood cost 27$ per person.
Please choose the meals you want to cook, thanks you and please contact me by WhatsApp or Telegram if possible.
My phone number is +85510261391
Sophia NOV",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g608455-d15748518-Reviews-Lucky_Kitchen_Cooking_Class-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Kampot Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,gauthier_treu@hotmail.com,+855 10 261 391,http://web.facebook.com/luckykitchenkampot,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d15748518-Lucky_Kitchen_Cooking_Class-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 6 Food &amp; Drink in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '6', 'ranking': '1'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,22,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '21'}",Not available,220,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g608455-d15748518-m66827-Reviews-Lucky_Kitchen_Cooking_Class-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1400'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1400'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1400'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1400'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1400'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1400'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 10:00 - 14:00', 'Tuesday: 10:00 - 14:00', 'Wednesday: 10:00 - 14:00', 'Thursday: 10:00 - 14:00', 'Friday: 10:00 - 14:00', 'Saturday: 10:00 - 14:00', 'Sunday: Closed']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'food_drink', 'localized_name': 'Food & Drink'}, {'name': 'clas