Lucky Ruby Border Casino,here:pds:place:116w3gq4-b34ac9ddae07448e945b933b3470c875,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Lucky Ruby Border Casino, 200202 កំពង់រោទិ៍, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ស្វាយរៀង', 'city': 'កំពង់រោទិ៍', 'district': 'ញរ', 'postalCode': '200202'}","{'lat': 10.91916, 'lng': 105.93929}","[{'lat': 10.91906, 'lng': 105.93938}]",28235,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8687353'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855979388889'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://ruby89.com'}]}]",Not Available,Svay Rieng,10.919209,105.93925,8687353,Lucky Ruby Border Casino,"Lucky Ruby Border Casino is located at Prey Vor, Svay Rieng Province of Cambodia. Our location is uniquely positioned as we are only 3 hours away from Phnom Penh, less than an hour should you be coming from Bavet, and only 2.5 hours if you are traveling from Ho Chi Minh City in Vietnam. Currently, we have a total of 63 HOTEL ROOMS and more will be built as we expand. Our border casino is not just a typical casino that just caters to gambling activities as we have a whole range of other facilities that would be able to benefit every member of society. Our facilities include our SAUNA, TRADITIONAL KHMER MASSAGE, CASINO RESTAURANT, SKY BAR, KARAOKE (KTV), GYM, DISCO, ASIAN BEER GARDEN and the latest addition, our very own LUCKY RUBY MART & CAFE. Our casino and all facilities are legally licensed and we welcome you to Lucky Ruby to experience what we can offer to bring you that relaxation you need as we strongly believe that when you’re happy; we’re happy!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g8405649-d8687353-Reviews-Lucky_Ruby_Border_Casino-Svay_Rieng_Svay_Rieng_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Prey Vor-Moc Hoa Border, Au Village, Thmei Commune, Kampong Rou District, Svay Rieng Province, Cambodia.', 'city': 'Svay Rieng', 'state': 'Svay Rieng Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '2