Ly Heng BBQ & Soup Doung,here:pds:place:116httek-78ead02b7c8606e63d2285e0b8bcece4,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Ly Heng BBQ & Soup Doung, ផ្លូវ 2005, 120912 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ពោធិ៍សែនជ័យ', 'subdistrict': 'កាកាប', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 2005', 'postalCode': '120912'}","{'lat': 11.56352, 'lng': 104.85578}","[{'lat': 11.56351, 'lng': 104.85558}]",1025,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '800-080', 'name': 'Soup', 'primary': True}, {'id': '800-078', 'name': 'Grill'}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512204554'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.568774,104.87091,13228869,Heng Long Hotel,"Finding an ideal guest house in Phnom Penh does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Heng Long Hotel, a nice option for travelers like you.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Mila Craft Workshop (Rubber stamp and Making Bath Bombs) (1.6 mi) and Wat Phnom (2.5 mi), guests of Heng Long Hotel can easily experience some of Phnom Penh's most well known attractions.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as a refrigerator, a minibar, and air conditioning, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the guest house.
Heng Long Hotel features baggage storage, to help make your stay more enjoyable. If you are driving to Heng Long Hotel, free parking is available.
If you’re looking for a French restaurant, consider a visit to Vinissimo - Bar a Vin, Cerise's Bakery & Coffee, or Mille Crepes Story, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Heng Long Hotel.
If you are interested in exploring Phnom Penh, check out a history museum, such as Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum.
Heng Long Hotel looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Phnom Penh.
