Ly Heng Chhay Hotel,here:pds:place:116w62vt-77c012389bfa4250813f10541beda092,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Ly Heng Chhay Hotel, 010901 ប៉ោយប៉ែត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បន្ទាយមានជ័យ', 'city': 'ប៉ោយប៉ែត', 'district': 'ប៉ោយប៉ែត', 'postalCode': '010901'}","{'lat': 13.65338, 'lng': 102.56282}","[{'lat': 13.65346, 'lng': 102.56271}]",84964,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2361716'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85554967136'}]}],Not Available,Banteay Meanchey,13.6534,102.56277,2361716,Ly Heng Chhay Hotel,"Welcome to Ly Heng Chhay Hotel, your Poipet “home away from home.” Ly Heng Chhay Hotel aims to make your visit as relaxing and enjoyable as possible, which is why so many guests continue to come back year after year.
Guest rooms offer air conditioning, and Ly Heng Chhay Hotel makes getting online easy as free wifi is available.
You can also take advantage of some of the amenities offered by the small hotel, including room service. In addition, guests can enjoy a hot tub and an on-site restaurant during their visit.
Travelers looking for cafes can head to Palm Coffee.
Ly Heng Chhay Hotel puts the best of Poipet at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
