Ly Monaco Hotel,here:pds:place:116w63jr-10c6f81d045f418cbef6fcf5e1f68dc1,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Ly Monaco Hotel, 010804 សិរីសោភ័ណ្ឌ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បន្ទាយមានជ័យ', 'city': 'សិរីសោភ័ណ្ឌ', 'district': 'អូរអំបិល', 'postalCode': '010804'}","{'lat': 13.58616, 'lng': 102.97118}","[{'lat': 13.5861, 'lng': 102.9713}]",62698,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8675067'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510999015'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.lymonaco.com'}]}]",Not Available,Banteay Meanchey,13.586204,102.9711,8675067,Ly Monaco Hotel,"Ly Monaco Hotel is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Sisophon, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer a minibar and air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as Ly Monaco Hotel offers guests free wifi.
The small hotel features a 24 hour front desk. Plus, Ly Monaco Hotel offers an on-site restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
When you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out Kim Heng, which is an Asian restaurant that is popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.
Enjoy your stay in Sisophon!
