Lyon D'or,here:pds:place:116aabd1-83b159dac3d7021ec42069a87c0b48fb,en,hotel,"{'label': ""Lyon D'or, ផ្លូវ ព្រះអង្គ ឌួង 14, 120211 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'វត្តភ្នំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ព្រះអង្គ ឌួង', 'postalCode': '120211', 'houseNumber': '14'}","{'lat': 11.57284, 'lng': 104.9269}","[{'lat': 11.57297, 'lng': 104.92688}]",6867,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '558225'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523217710'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.lyondorkh.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.573086,104.92811,558225,Lyon d'Or,"See why so many travelers make Lyon d'Or their hotel of choice when visiting Phnom Penh. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a budget friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
While staying at Lyon d'Or, visitors can check out Sisowath Quay (0.2 mi) and Wat Ounalom (0.4 mi), some of Phnom Penh's top attractions.
Rooms at Lyon d'Or provide air conditioning, a minibar, and a refrigerator, and guests can stay connected with free wifi.
In addition, while staying at Lyon d'Or guests have access to room service. You can also enjoy a lounge.
If you’re looking for a Mediterranean restaurant, consider a visit to Casablanca restaurant, Terrazza, or Il Forno, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Lyon d'Or.
During your visit, be sure to check out popular attractions like Royal Palace (0.7 mi) and Cambodia Post Office (0.2 mi), which are all within walking distance of the hotel.
At Lyon d'Or, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Phnom Penh.
