M9 Kirirom Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649g-5c200fc2fec8b623823693c3a307dd4e,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'M9 Kirirom Hotel, ផ្លូវ 1, 120211 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'វត្តភ្នំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 1', 'postalCode': '120211'}","{'lat': 11.57683, 'lng': 104.92579}","[{'lat': 11.57674, 'lng': 104.92568}]",72721,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26308781'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598411899'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.m9kiriromhotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.577065,104.92609,26308781,M9 Kirirom Hotel,"M9 Kirirom Hotel - Riverside, located in Phnom Penh along the Tonle Sap River, offers a 24-hour front desk and free WiFi. Air-conditioned rooms include a desk, kettle, minibar, safety deposit box, flat-screen TV, and a private bathroom with a shower. Some units feature balconies with river views. Bed linen, towels, and toiletries are provided. The hotel is within walking distance of Wat Phnom, the Night Market, the Central Market, the Royal Palace, and the National Museum. The Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum is 1.5 km away, and Aeon Mall Phnom Penh is 1.8 km away. The restaurant serves Khmer, Asian, and international cuisine; staff members speak Khmer, English, and Chinese. Solo, couples, and family travelers highly rate the location at 9.5. M9 Kirirom Hotel Phnom Penh warmly welcomes bookings from all valued clients.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d26308781-Reviews-M9_Kirirom_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '13 Preah Sisowath Quay', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '120211', 'address_string': '13 Preah Sisowath Quay, Phnom Penh 120211 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not avai