MGC Asian Traditional Textiles Museum,here:pds:place:116w63u5-93a9300a06bf41a1a04337b8334a8916,en,museum,"{'label': 'MGC Asian Traditional Textiles Museum, 60m, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201', 'houseNumber': '60m'}","{'lat': 13.37532, 'lng': 103.88023}","[{'lat': 13.37589, 'lng': 103.88022}]",21283,"[{'id': '300-3100-0000', 'name': 'Museum', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'core'}, 'id': '1232151637'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10268767'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563765571'}, {'value': '+85563765573'}, {'value': '+85563765574'}], 'email': [{'value': 'mgcattm@gmail.com'}, {'value': 'mgcattmadmn@gmail.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.375409,103.88029,10268767,MGC Asian Traditional Textiles Museum,"Museum showcases costumes, fabrics traditional and contemporary trends. Museum also explains about the cultural relations between the two rivers Ganga and Mekong through the textiles. There are picture narrative describing myths and traditionals, also in a do it myself corner the visitors can feel, touch and understanding the processes of making textiles.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d10268767-Reviews-MGC_Asian_Traditional_Textiles_Museum-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '60m Avenue', 'street2': 'Boeung Daun Pa, Sangkat Slorkram', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': '60m Avenue Boeung Daun Pa, Sangkat Slorkram, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,imgcttm@gmail.com,+855 63 765 574,http://www.mgcattmuseum.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d10268767-MGC_Asian_Traditional_Textiles_Museum-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#66 of 200 things to do in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '200', 'ranking': '66'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,29,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '1', '4': '8', '5': '19'}",Not available,39,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d10268767-m66827-Reviews-MGC_Asian_Traditional_Textiles_Museum-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'museums', 'localized_name': 'Museums'}, {'name': 'attractions', 'localized_name': 'Attractions'}]","[{'name': 'Museums', 'localized_name': 'Museums', 'categories': [{'name': 'Specialty Museums', 'localized_name': 'Specialty Museums'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '7'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '5'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '4'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '7'}]","[{'award_type': 'Travelers Choice', 'year': '2024', 'images': {'tiny': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2024_L.png', 'small': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2024_L.png', 'large': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2024_L.png'}, 'categories': [], 'display_name': 'Travelers Choice'}]",Not available,Not available,FALSE,34,20
