MR Cafe,here:pds:place:116w63u5-e1933b34d92747628ae7082e38f3ea8b,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'MR Cafe, ផ្លូវ 7 មករ, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 7 មករ', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35104, 'lng': 103.86184}","[{'lat': 13.35093, 'lng': 103.8618}]",24631,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569999936'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.35216,103.86105,17388922,Mr Lucky Tuk Tuk Service,"I'm local to Siem Reap, English speaking, reliable, safety conscious and fully Covid-19 vax'd. I offer tours by Tuk Tuk and SUV and transport across Cambodia. As Angkor Wat is the pinnacle of site seeing in Siem Reap, I will tell you interesting historical information about the temples before exploring inside even though I am not a formal registered tour guide. I also have more in-depth information books available if you like. I offer suggested tour options for the Angkor Wat complex, as well as tour options for many other sites around Siem Reap, surrounding areas including Battambang and Preah Vihear areas. You can also customise your own tour to suit your interests, or book a hassle free all inclusive package where I have done all the planning for you. TukTuk is the ideal way to travel in hot humid weather, or take the SUV with air conditioning. I also supply unlimited safe drinking water throughout your tour time. I look forward to you touring with me. Lucky.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d17388922-Reviews-Mr_Lucky_Tuk_Tuk_Service-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap