MR. 5 Cafe,here:pds:place:116w649e-c2de7536c5f346a295fb74f1ae889b4b,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'MR. 5 Cafe, ផ្លូវ 480, 120606 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'មានជ័យ', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងទំពុន', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 480', 'postalCode': '120606'}","{'lat': 11.5343, 'lng': 104.91311}","[{'lat': 11.53442, 'lng': 104.91305}]",22659,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578628999'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.mr5cafe.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.527145,104.91167,10066546,Mr. C's Cambodia Transport,"100% safe and reliable transport and tours. Fluent in English. Minivan that seats 12 people comfortably. Can also organise tuk tuk tours. Visit the Royal Palace, National Museum, Genocide Museum, Killing Fields, markets and much more. Or head out of the city to see the sights including Angkor Wat. Great knowledge of all tourist destinations.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d10066546-Reviews-Mr_C_s_Cambodia_Transport-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,mail@mrc-cambodiatransport.com,+855 89 363 990,http://www.mrc-cambodiatransport.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d10066546-Mr_C_s_Cambodia_Transport-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#44 of 190 Transportation in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '190', 'ranking': '44'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,49,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '48'}",Not available,193,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d10066546-m66827-Reviews-Mr_C_s_Cambodia_T