"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '2', '4': '2', '5': '101'}",Not available,144,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d11638015-m66827-Reviews-Mr_Lizy_Tuk_Tuk_Tours-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'attractions', 'localized_name': 'Attractions'}, {'name': 'transportation', 'localized_name': 'Transportation'}, {'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Cultural Tours', 'localized_name': 'Cultural Tours'}, {'name': 'Sightseeing Tours', 'localized_name': 'Sightseeing Tours'}, {'name': 'Historical & Heritage Tours', 'localized_name': 'Historical & Heritage Tours'}]}, {'name': 'Transportation', 'localized_name': 'Transportation', 'categories': [{'name': 'Taxis & Shuttles', 'localized_name': 'Taxis & Shuttles'}]}]",Not available,[],Not available,"[{'award_type': 'Travelers Choice', 'year': '2023', 'images': {'tiny': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png', 'small': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png', 'large': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png'}, 'categories': [], 'display_name': 'Travelers Choice'}]",Not available,Not available,FALSE,31,1
MR. Lucky's Tuk Tuk,here:pds:place:116w66j1-8600c1e2b463ec38d9fc25de5e12b6c7,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': ""MR. Lucky's Tuk Tuk, 204, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'street': '204'}","{'lat': 13.5689, 'lng': 104.10806}","[{'lat': 13.5689, 'lng': 104.10806}]",12173,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9791901'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515505500'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/MR-LUCKYs-Tuk-Tuk-135431003146992/timeline'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.568901,104.10806,9791901,MR. LUCKY's Tuk Tuk,"Hello, my name is Mr lucky . I have been working many hotel as Receptionist and i am a Tuk Tuk driver in Siem Reap taking my customers to see the local attractions and Temples of Angkor for many years. I have a comfortable, modern tuk tuk and am ready to help make your visit to my home town and province in Cambodia a happy and enjoyable one! I have been a tuk-tuk driver for over 6 years now and in that time have done hundreds of tours to Angkor Wat and the surrounding Angkor temples. There are over 100 temples and monuments from the Angkor period (covering 3000 square kilometres) around Siem Reap. Luckily a number of the best ones are reasonably close together, meaning you can see anywhere between 5-15 of these over a period of 1, 2 or 3 days (or even longer, if you have time) with the help of some transport. Siem Reap and Angkor are great places to use tuk-tuks (unlike, say Bangkok), because the distances between the temples are large (several kilometres sometimes, so it can get exhausting if you opt to cycle and then need some more energy to climb up and down the temples, pretending to be Indiana Jones!). Also, the roads here are in good condition - straight and flat. And the breeze from driving along keeps you cool (it gets hot here). Much better than being stuck on a tour bus. Also, there is little traffic on the roads between the temples. So, if you have never been on a tuk-tuk, this is the place to try it! I’ll drop you off at the best temples, tell some history of temple and you take as long or as short a time as you want at each one and I’ll be waiting for you at the entrance to take you to the next one. It’s that simple.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d9791901-Reviews-MR_LUCKY_s_Tuk_Tuk-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,somnang_mom@yahoo.com,+855 15 505 500,https://www.facebook.com/MR-LUCKYs-Tuk-Tuk-135431003146992/timeline,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d9791901-MR_LUCKY_s_Tuk_Tuk-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#180 of 754 Transportation in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '754', 'ranking': '180'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,33,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '1', '5': '32'}",Not available,26,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d9791901-m66827-Reviews-MR_LUCKY_s_Tuk_Tuk-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'transportation', 'localized_name': 'Transportation'}, {'name': 'attractions', 'localized_name': 'Attractions'}]","[{'name': 'Transportation', 'localized_name': 'Transportation', 'categories': [{'name': 'Taxis & Shuttles', 'localized_name': 'Taxis & Shuttles'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'va