MR. Tour Battambang,here:pds:place:116w636s-6ccc0e46eeefd14a53e2809e8db5cee5,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'MR. Tour Battambang, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10104, 'lng': 103.19879}","[{'lat': 13.10102, 'lng': 103.19892}]",12584,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13975130'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85590894454'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://mrtourcambodia.wixsite.com/site'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Fri: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR'}]}]",Battambang,13.101048,103.19876,13975130,Mr. Tour Battambang,Mr Tour Battambang is a tour company founded by Rysa in 2019. We provide bicycle tours around Battambang and you will be able to explore both the city and the countryside. Our mission is to help poor Cambodian children by breaking the cycle of poverty through education. We will fund their studies and help their families by using money from the tour. Your participation with Mr Tour Battambang will support many poor children and their future. Our experienced and friendly guides are recognised by the Cambodian Ministry of Tourism.,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d13975130-Reviews-Mr_Tour_Battambang-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02351', 'address_string': 'Battambang 02351 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,mrtourbattambang@gmail.com,+855 90 894 454,http://mrtourcambodia.wixsite.com/site,htt