Machim Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w63u5-7228e8e8fd394fe0b466e6c3ab7fb078,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Machim Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ សម្តេចវិបុលបញ្ញា សុខ អាន, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សម្តេចវិបុលបញ្ញា សុខ អាន', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37592, 'lng': 103.86357}","[{'lat': 13.37605, 'lng': 103.86359}]",22429,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10501377'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85586957771'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.375714,103.86355,10501377,Machim Guesthouse,"Machim Guesthouse is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Siem Reap, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
While staying at Machim Guesthouse, visitors can check out Viti's Tuk Tuk Driver (0.7 mi) and Seng English Speaking Tuk Tuk & Car Driver (0.7 mi), some of Siem Reap's top attractions.
As your “home away from home,” the hotel rooms offer a flat screen TV, air conditioning, and a desk, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk while staying at Machim Guesthouse. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
Travelers looking to enjoy some lobster can head to Viroth's Restaurant, Nest Angkor Cafe Bar, or Madame Butterfly. Otherwise, you may want to check out an Italian restaurant such as Paper Tiger Eatery (Le Tigre de Papier), The Red Piano, or Mamma Shop.
Siem Reap is also home to The Victory Gate, a popular  that is not too far from Machim Guesthouse.
Enjoy your stay in Siem Reap!
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d10501377-Reviews-Machim_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '60m #B20-21, Street', 'street2': 'Spean Neak, Mondul 3 Village, Sangkart Slorkram', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': '60m #B20-21, Street Spean Neak, Mondul 3 Village, Sangkart Slorkram, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d10501377-Machim_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},0,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d10501377-m66827-Reviews-Machim_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Free parking', 'Free Wifi', 'Laundry Service', 'Air conditioning', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Flatscreen TV', 'Housekeeping', 'Bath / Shower', 'Chinese', 'Desk', 'English', 'French', '24-Hour Front Desk', 'Ironing Service', 'Khmer']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,11,20
