Mad Monkey Hostel Kampot,here:pds:place:116aabd1-614a504bd99c0726c82ccc7cd2d26d41,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Mad Monkey Hostel Kampot, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60074, 'lng': 104.18321}","[{'lat': 10.60061, 'lng': 104.18322}]",19042,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '101-000', 'name': 'American'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '14937690'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '19260136'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6584394'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855968726525', 'categories': [{'id': '200-2000-0011'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}, {'value': '+855968729525'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.madmonkeyhostels.com/kampot', 'categories': [{'id': '200-2000-0011'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}, {'value': 'https://www.madmonkeyhostels.com/kampot', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT17H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kampot,10.600998,104.18321,6584394,Mad Monkey Hostel Kampot,"Mad Monkey Kampot is the perfect home base for your Kampot adventures. We offer a wide range of exciting tours and outings - motorbike through the countryside, explore Bokor Mountain or take a day trip to Kep! Our massive swimming pool is the perfect spot for a lazy Kampot afternoon and the Rooftop Bar is easily the best place in Kampot to watch the sunset. We have a range of clean, spacious private rooms and dorm rooms. All dorm beds feature an oversized, super-comfy mattress with their own personal reading light, power outlet, and secure locker. Mad Monkey is just a 7 minute walk from the centre of town. We are a a socially responsible hostel, so your stay will benefit the local community. We can't wait to see you here!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d6584394-Reviews-Mad_Monkey_Hostel_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Riverside Road, Near The Aquatic Center And The Fish Market, Sungkat Kompong Kandal', 'street2': 'Sovansakor Village', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '13205', 'address_string': 'Riverside Road, Near The Aquatic Center And The Fish Market, Sungkat Kompong Kandal Sovansakor Village, Kampot 13205 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d6584394-Mad_Monkey_Hostel_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#2 of 115 Specialty lodging in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '115', 'ranking': '2'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,1162,"{'1': '13', '2': '23', '3': '52', '4': '131', '5': '943'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service',