Mad Monkey Phnom Penh,here:pds:place:116aabd1-f86dddb4d5f2063d714e91ff707fac34,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Mad Monkey Phnom Penh, ផ្លូវ 302, 120102 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 302', 'postalCode': '120102'}","{'lat': 11.5531, 'lng': 104.92618}","[{'lat': 11.55299, 'lng': 104.9262}]",6963,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2165177'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523901556'}, {'value': '+85523987091'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://madmonkeyhostels.com/phnompenh', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.553117,104.926025,2165177,Mad Monkey Phnom Penh,"Kickstart your Cambodia adventures at Mad Monkey Phnom Penh! Located in the heart of the popular BKK1 district, Mad Monkey Phnom Penh is the original Mad Monkey. Enjoy our beer garden, bar & restaurant, swimming pool, and massive spread of tours and events. Mad Monkey Phnom Penh is the perfect place to meet other travelers and explore the capital city’s rich culture and vibrant nightlife. The brand new Mad Monkey Phnom Penh is the biggest hostel in town, with the capacity to host up to 150 guests. It's located right at the center of the city with both, hostel-style dormitory accommodation as well as beautiful private rooms. The design centers on elements from old Indochina, inspiring you with cool deco and vintage art, adding a hint of mystery and adventure to the experience. Come, join the madness.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d2165177-Reviews-Mad_Monkey_Phnom_Penh-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 30-32 Street 242, Sangkat Chaktomuk, Khan Daun Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12200', 'address_string': 'No. 30-32 Street 242, Sangkat Chaktomuk, Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh 12200 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d2165177-Mad_Monkey_Phnom_Penh-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#3 of 351 Specialty lodging in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '351', 'ranking': '3'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,2288,"{'1': '44', '2': '61', '3': '161', '4': '455', '5': '1567'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",536,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d2165177-m66827-Reviews-Mad_Monkey_Phnom_Penh-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Bar/Lounge', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Pool', 'Restaurant', 'Public Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Air conditioning', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Safe', 'Rooftop Terrace', 'Adult pool', 'Outdoor pool', 'Baggage Stora