Mad Monkey Rooftop Sunset Bar Kampot,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-d878c056e564272bb74e92d467017c5d,en,bar_pub,"{'label': 'Mad Monkey Rooftop Sunset Bar Kampot, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60075, 'lng': 104.18323}","[{'lat': 10.60062, 'lng': 104.18324}]",19041,"[{'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9785924'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Kampot,10.600885,104.18322,9785924,Mad Monkey Rooftop Sunset Bar Kampot,"The Rooftop Bar at the Mad Monkey Hostel Kampot boasts a 360 degree view overlooking Kampot, Bokor Mountain, Phu Quoc Island(Vietnam), and the surrounding mountainsides. The best sunsets in Kampot can be viewed as the sun sets behind Bokor Mountain and all of the pinks, purples, and oranges of the clouds reflect off of the Kampot River below. Downstairs, we have a full restaurant, bar, and pool.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g608455-d9785924-Reviews-Mad_Monkey_Rooftop_Sunset_Bar_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Riverside Road', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '1821', 'address_string': 'Riverside Road, Kampot 1821 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,kampot@madmonkeyhostels.com,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d9785924-Mad_Monkey_Rooftop_Sunset_Bar_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#3 of 13 Nightlife in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '13', 'ranking': '3'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg