Mad Monkey Siem Reap,here:pds:place:116aabd1-cd5d7e2314f60b582be198907956be3a,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Mad Monkey Siem Reap, ផ្លូវជាតិ 63, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 63', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35923, 'lng': 103.85431}","[{'lat': 13.35917, 'lng': 103.85444}]",24472,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3229258'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593888203'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://madmonkeyhostels.com/siem-reap'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.359302,103.85414,3229258,Mad Monkey Siem Reap,"The best way to experience the magical Temple Town is the Mad Monkey way. The iconic Mad Monkey Siem Reap sits at the heart of the city and features a variety of room types, an awesome pool, and an incredible bar and restaurant with local and western food. Mad Monkey team can't wait to bring you to the famous Angkor Wat temples and show you a truly authentic side of Cambodia. Once you've topped yourself up with history and culture, we'll lead the way to the colorful Night Market and infamous Pub Street, where you'll dance the night away. You'll meet fun travelers from around the world and create memories that will last a lifetime!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d3229258-Reviews-Mad_Monkey_Siem_Reap-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Rose Apple Road', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12402', 'address_string': 'Rose Apple Road, Siem Reap 12402 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserRevi