Maison557,here:pds:place:116aabd1-bbd1ac6980080198fd440c0c3de674c0,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Maison557, វិថី វត្តបូ, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'វិថី វត្តបូ', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.3544, 'lng': 103.85915}","[{'lat': 13.35445, 'lng': 103.85902}]",24531,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3491883'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510340240'}, {'value': '+85589280830'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.maison557.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.354656,103.85916,3491883,Maison557,"Welcome to Maison557, a 1950s-inspired bed and breakfast in Siem Reap, Cambodia. Nestled in a lush tropical garden in the vibrant Wat Bo neighborhood, ranked 3rd coolest in the world by TimeOut Magazine in 2022, our guest rooms and private suites offer a tranquil oasis. Maison557 blends traditional Cambodian aesthetics with modern amenities, providing a serene environment with a pool and lush gardens. Our attentive team organizes visits to Angkor Wat, secures seats for the Phare Circus, and arranges excursions to Kulen Elephants and local attractions. Maison557 is your ideal base to explore Siem Reap's history, culture, and vibrant nightlife. Experience exceptional service and comfort at Maison557 Bed and Breakfast. Book your stay today!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d3491883-Reviews-Maison557-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#557, Wat Bo Street, Group 12', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '93136', 'address_string': '#557, Wat Bo Street, Group 12, Siem Reap 93136 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '236667