"Makara Bungalow, Ocheurteal Beach",here:pds:place:116w3cs7-00cedd8508d34523bf49f7c68942d899,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Makara Bungalow, Ocheurteal Beach, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.60127, 'lng': 103.53081}","[{'lat': 10.60105, 'lng': 103.531}]",180881,"[{'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '550-5510-0205', 'name': 'Beach'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85585486268'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.601272,103.53093,3420303,Makara Bungalows,"Finding an ideal family-friendly small hotel in Sihanoukville does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Makara Bungalows, a nice option for travelers like you.
As your “home away from home,” the small hotel rooms offer air conditioning and a refrigerator, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk and room service while staying at Makara Bungalows. In addition, Makara Bungalows offers a pool and an on-site restaurant, which will help make your Sihanoukville trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
Close to some of Sihanoukville's most popular landmarks, such as CJ Outlet and Jewelry Center (1.4 mi) and Wat Krom Temple (2.4 mi), Makara Bungalows is a great destination for tourists.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the French restaurants, including Dune, Manoha, and Froggies Crepes & Tapas, all of which are a short distance from Makara Bungalows.
If you are interested in exploring Sihanoukville, check out a waterfall, such as Kbal Chhay Waterfall.
Makara Bungalows puts the best of Sihanoukville at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d3420303-Reviews-Makara_Bungalows-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Preah Lumhei Phumin Street', 'street2': 'Ochheuteal Beach', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Preah Lumhei Phumin Street Ochheuteal Beach, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d3420303-Makara_Bungalows-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#34 of 304 B&Bs / Inns in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out_of': '304', 'ranking': '34'}",3.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.5-66827-5.svg,147,"{'1': '12', '2': '12', '3': '22', '4': '56', '5': '45'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url'