Man' Groove,here:pds:place:116w3fh7-f61b35a6bf4e4afbafa26d0452a3ce99,en,guest_house,"{'label': ""Man' Groove, ផ្លូវជាតិ 33, 070215 ទឹកឈូរ, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'ទឹកឈូរ', 'district': 'ត្រពាំងសង្កែ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 33', 'postalCode': '070215'}","{'lat': 10.60526, 'lng': 104.23271}","[{'lat': 10.60542, 'lng': 104.23286}]",14499,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17723520'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855964910589'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.mangrooveguesthouse.com/en-us'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.60489,104.23287,8683808,Man'Groove Kampot,"If you’re looking for a quaint guest house in Kampot, look no further than Man'Groove Guesthouse.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as air conditioning, a desk, and a mosquito net, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the guest house.
Man'Groove Guesthouse features room service and outdoor furniture, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts an on-site restaurant. If you are driving to Man'Groove Guesthouse, free parking is available.
Should time allow, The Old Royal Cinema is a popular historic site that is relatively easy to get to.
The staff at Man'Groove Guesthouse looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
