Mana Tower Hotel / Apartment,here:pds:place:116w6490-c952111a498844ada9880a96762f1e61,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Mana Tower Hotel / Apartment, 120505 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដង្កោរ', 'subdistrict': 'ក្រាំងពង្រ', 'postalCode': '120505'}","{'lat': 11.43356, 'lng': 104.80537}","[{'lat': 11.4336, 'lng': 104.8055}]",58513,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570545868'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://mana-tower-hotel-apartment.business.site'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.43186,104.80259,456214,Tonle Sap Hotel,"Tonle Sap Guesthouse is a clean, affordable, well-kept, western owned guesthouse situated just 50 Metres from the Riverfront with Wat Phnom, The Central Market, The Post Office and Siem Reap Ferries and Buses all nearby. There are 14 rooms ranging from $18 - $40 a night. Open 24 Hrs • Great International Cuisine • Fully Air-Conditioned • Slate 9 Ball Table • Projector and 42"" LCD Screen • Major Sporting Events shown Live • Huge selection of Spirits • Friendly Staff • Several other Bars in the Street.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d456214-Reviews-Tonle_Sap_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '4-6E0, Street 104', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': '4-6E0, Street 104, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d456214-Tonle_Sap_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#131 of 412 B&Bs / Inns in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '412', 'ranking': '131'}",3.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.5-