Mane Colonial Classic,here:pds:place:116w63u5-824baa239b194aec820d03a8085cb144,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Mane Colonial Classic, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37579, 'lng': 103.86251}","[{'lat': 13.37566, 'lng': 103.86249}]",22519,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15673365'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563219999'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.manecolonialclassic.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.375794,103.86259,15673365,Mane Colonial Classic,"Almost a century from 1863 to 1953, Cambodia was under the French Protectorate, Mane Colonial Classic in Siem Reap province takes inspiration from these times past with an intimate hotel built in the elegant colonial style of the period and mixes Khmer traditional decor with modern styling sensibilities. Guests have 5 styles to choose according to their mood, preference and personality. Individually styled, each room is decorated with unique hand-crafted furniture and highlighting luxurious Khmer silk. The decorative accessories and furnishings reflect Khmer culture and traditions and are also made from the highest quality materials such as luxury woods, antiques, silks, and unique artworks.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d15673365-Reviews-Mane_Colonial_Classic-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Charles De Gaulle Boulevard', 'street2': 'Mondul 3 Village, Slakram Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': 'Charles De Gaulle Boulevard Mondul 3 Village, Slakram Commune, Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_