Mane Hariharalaya,here:pds:place:116w63gv-1ea34d5fe2c24ad18209bd87e0533020,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Mane Hariharalaya, 170505 ប្រាសាទបាគង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'ប្រាសាទបាគង', 'district': 'កណ្ដែក', 'postalCode': '170505'}","{'lat': 13.3405, 'lng': 103.94123}","[{'lat': 13.34051, 'lng': 103.94109}]",21415,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17786115'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563211777'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.manehariharalaya.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.3405,103.94123,17786115,Mane Hariharalaya,"Inspired by history and culture, Mane Hariharalaya – or “The home of gods Harihara” – set within 80,000 square meters surrounds with old trees, lakes and rice paddies – is a 5-star resort that beautifully captures the Khmer Traditional Houses while offering every modern luxury, echoing the ancient city of the Khmer Empire near the ruins of royal temples of Bakong, Preah Ko and Lolei.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d17786115-Reviews-Mane_Hariharalaya-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Mane Hariharalaya Road', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': 'Mane Hariharalaya Road, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d17786115-Mane_Hariharalaya-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#39 of 763 hotels in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '763', 'ranking': '39'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/