Mane la Residence,here:pds:place:116w649e-591e86d810df4a6cb443b86b0a3b1d87,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Mane la Residence, ផ្លូវ 101, 120802 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'សែនសុខ', 'subdistrict': 'ទឹកថ្លា', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 101', 'postalCode': '120802'}","{'lat': 11.5643, 'lng': 104.87814}","[{'lat': 11.5643, 'lng': 104.87827}]",1584,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12004436'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855975522222'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.manelaresidence.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.564304,104.87832,12004436,Mane La Residence,"Mane La Résidence is a unique contemporary luxury boutique hotel that mix Khmer traditional decor with modern styling sensibilities. There are 7 rooms reflecting 3 styles to choose from inspired by different stylistic periods. Guests have the choice to choose according to their mood, preference and personality. Individually styled, each room is decorated with unique hand-crafted furniture and highlighting luxurious Khmer silk. The decorative accessories and furnishings reflect Khmer culture and traditions and are also made from the highest quality materials such as luxury woods, silks, and unique artworks. The bathroom is hand-made of luxurious tiles and designs. All rooms are fully equipped with modern amenities that today’s travellers might require. What’s more, the old and modern fashion of luxury cars at the scene will ease our business travellers to fulfil their works in the busy city of Phnom Penh at present.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d12004436-Reviews-Mane_La_Residence-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '999 #901c, Street No.1 St., Borey Tokyo', 'street2': 'Sangkat Teuk Thlar, Khan Sen Sok', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12102', 'address_string': '999 #901c, Street No.1 St., Borey Tokyo Sangkat Teuk Thlar, Khan Sen Sok, Phnom Penh 12102 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d12004436-Mane_La_Residence-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#107 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '107'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,47,"{'1': '0', '2': '2', '3': '2', '4': '7', '5': '36'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",116,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d12004436-m66827-Reviews-Mane_La_Residence-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Internet', 'Suites', 'Free Internet', 'Restaurant', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Breakfast included', 'Meeting rooms', 'Hot Tub', 'Concierge', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Self-Serve Laundry', 'Refrigerator in room', 'Confe