Mango Taxi Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w3csk-c8cd00e983ff71295e17b3d26e9e4175,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Mango Taxi Cambodia, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.62231, 'lng': 103.54199}","[{'lat': 10.62236, 'lng': 103.54186}]",88150,"[{'id': '400-4100-0041', 'name': 'Transportation Service', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23356615'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855888021888'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://mangotaxi.asia'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Preah Sihanouk,10.622354,103.5419,23356615,Mango Taxi Cambodia,"Leading airport transfer and taxi company in Cambodia. For over five years we have been providing excellent transport services. We are able to arrange a private driver for your trip, overseeing a tour or transfer from the airport in Cambodia. Our experienced chauffeurs will meet you holding a nameplate, will assist you with your luggage, and carefully ride to your destination. As well our company can arrange any kind of luxury transfers - limousine, private speed boat transfer or helicopter flight in Cambodia.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d23356615-Reviews-Mango_Taxi_Cambodia-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,support@mangotaxi.asia,+855 88 802 1888,http://mangotaxi.asia/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d23356615-Mango_Taxi_Cambodia-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string'