Mangrove Sanctuary Resort,here:pds:place:116w611z-fd789e44e9d34ada835821a91655b819,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Mangrove Sanctuary Resort, 090703 ខេមរភូមិន្ទ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កោះកុង', 'city': 'ខេមរភូមិន្ទ', 'district': 'ស្ទឹងវែង', 'postalCode': '090703'}","{'lat': 11.56191, 'lng': 102.99523}","[{'lat': 11.56192, 'lng': 102.99537}]",39473,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12563602'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12969808'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855886356666'}, {'value': '+855974110808', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/mangrovesanctuaryresortkoskong', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Koh Kong,11.5619,102.995,12563602,Mangrove Sanctuary Resort,"Located on the outer ring of the largest mangrove of south-east Asia, all the bungalows are private, built on stilts, surrounded by water and trees and connected by wood path. Large bungalows offering a bay window with a magnificent view, king size beds, air-cond. & hot water,mini bar, private back patio overlooking the mangrove and WIFI. Our famous restaurant is specialized in seafood and the splendid ""swimming-pool island"" is waiting for you! Our tour boat will take you to visit the amazing 280km2 mangrove or the remote Koh Kong island and its virgins beaches... A wonderful surprising place to experience a relaxing exotic night.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1532269-d12563602-Reviews-Mangrove_Sanctuary_Resort-Koh_Kong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Krasaop National Park Road', 'city': 'Koh Kong', 'state': 'Koh Kong Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '09000', 'address_string': 'Krasaop National Park Road, Koh Kong 09000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Koh Kong', 'location_id': '1532269'}, {'leve