Maniltoa,here:pds:place:116w3f5v-eb671d12cd5c6455207c68dc0a801445,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Maniltoa, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.51721, 'lng': 104.29679}","[{'lat': 10.51708, 'lng': 104.29681}]",5397,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25774620'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512210287'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/maniltoaresortrestaurant'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.517139,104.2968,25774620,Maniltoa,"Maniltoa Resort is a quiet green oasis in Kep. A large pool with kids area surrounded by a beautiful 3 acres garden where our 18 bungalows are displayed. We offer double and twin rooms fully equipped with air conditioned, private bathroom and private terrasse in every one of them. Our chef and his team will prepare for you, all day long, your favorite dishes, from our different menus. We put upfront local products and bring you diversity on our menus ""A la carte"" for lunch and dinner, ""All day"" from 7am till late. Looking forward to see you at Maniltoa, to sublime your stay in Kep for few days, to try our creative menus or drinks & nibbles around the pool.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d25774620-Reviews-Maniltoa-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Road 33A, sangkat Prey Thum', 'street2': 'Kong Kraeb', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '22102', 'address_string': 'Road 33A, sangkat Prey Thum Kong Kraeb, Kep 22102 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d25774620-Maniltoa-Kep_Kep_Province.ht