Mao Tuktuk,here:pds:place:116w63u7-dab5a296884d0c7e31a2fdcedc08342a,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Mao Tuktuk, 171205 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'នគរធំ', 'postalCode': '171205'}","{'lat': 13.4119, 'lng': 103.86423}","[{'lat': 13.4119, 'lng': 103.86409}]",19659,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10726821'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85590350460'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/maotuktuksiemreap'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 05:00 - 19:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T050000', 'duration': 'PT14H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.411899,103.864136,10726821,Mao TukTuk,"I am a TukTuk driver providing professional guide services for Angkor Wat and more. Unlike other tuktuk drivers who drop you off at a temple and wait in their tuktuks, I will personally take you around the temples, explain the history and show you Angkor Wat, Siem Reap, & more! You can create your own itinerary or I will suggest the best places to see as my hours are very flexible! One of my customers also gifted me a camera, and I have been practicing so I will take cool photos of you free of charge :) You can check my FB: MaoTukTukSiemReap",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d10726821-Reviews-Mao_TukTuk-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,maokhvan@gmail.com,+855 90 350 460,http://www.facebook.com/maotuktuksiemreap,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d10726821-