Mar Yu Guest House,here:pds:place:116aabd1-8af4fcce1cd90211a22935cff2fd9436,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Mar Yu Guest House, អេអេច21, 171210 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្រងែ', 'street': 'អេអេច21', 'postalCode': '171210'}","{'lat': 13.38404, 'lng': 103.8217}","[{'lat': 13.38415, 'lng': 103.82177}]",86847,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7224877'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592320710'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.maryu-guesthouse.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.383973,103.82165,7224877,Mar Yu Guest House,"Mar Yu Guest House is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Siem Reap, offering a family-friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
While staying at Mar Yu Guest House, visitors can check out ArtBox (1.5 mi) and Angkor Cab (1.6 mi), some of Siem Reap's top attractions.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as a flat screen TV, air conditioning, and a desk, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the guest house.
Mar Yu Guest House features a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and room service, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts an on-site restaurant. If you are driving to Mar Yu Guest House, free parking is available.
If you like seafood restaurants, Mar Yu Guest House is conveniently located near Sam Khmer Noodles - Nom Banh Chok, Samuth Kheav BBQ, and Ashia Lounge.
If you are interested in exploring Siem Reap, check out a government building, such as Royal Residence.
Enjoy your stay in Siem Reap!
