Marirath Boutique Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-79214a1473360a1c56f2e1b419cbe21b,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Marirath Boutique Hotel, ផ្លូវ សម្តេចវិបុលបញ្ញា សុខ អាន, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សម្តេចវិបុលបញ្ញា សុខ អាន', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.36456, 'lng': 103.87923}","[{'lat': 13.36456, 'lng': 103.87937}]",22282,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1017524'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25112164'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517955985'}, {'value': '+85577448002'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.marirathboutique.com'}, {'value': 'https://www.pavillon-orient.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.364561,103.87906,25112164,Marirath Boutique Hotel,"Nestled in Siem Reap City center in quiet atmosphere surrounded by lush tropical garden , Marirath Boutique Hotel 18 well-appointed spacious rooms and is the place for relaxing. Its design and decor blends the finest Khmer and Simi-French Colonial in balanced harmony offering you the retreat whilst ensuring you are provided the comfort and convenience during your stay. Located a mere 10 minutes drive from the famed Angkor Archeological Park which hosts the renowned UNESCO World Heritage site and within a short distance from Old Market and Pub Street. Marirath Boutique Hotel makes commuting from one destination to another an absolute breeze.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d25112164-Reviews-Marirath_Boutique_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Apsara Rd', 'street2': 'Chong Kaosou Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17251', 'address_string': 'Apsara Rd Chong Kaosou Village, Siem Reap 17251 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d25112164-Marirath_Boutique_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#116 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '116'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,21,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '2', '5': '18'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",85,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d25112164-m66827-Reviews-Marirath_Boutique_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Restaurant', 'Free Wifi', 'Air conditioning', 'Pool', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Breakfast included', 'Hot Tub', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Private Balcony', 'Outdoor pool', 'Parking', 'Bath / Shower', 'Bathrobes', 'Bottled Water', '24-Hour Check-in', 'Express Check-in / Check-out', 'Clothes Rack', 'English', '24-Hour Front Desk', 'Pool View', 'Pool with View', 'Private Bathrooms', 'Private Check-in / Check-out', '24-Hour Security', 'Secured Parking', 'Street Parking']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hot