Marketing,here:pds:place:116w67rn-9011b34df3194a1eac42f06ea6a939e4,en,history_museum,"{'label': 'Marketing, 190504 ស្ទឹងត្រែង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ស្ទឹងត្រែង', 'city': 'ស្ទឹងត្រែង', 'district': 'សាមគ្គី', 'postalCode': '190504'}","{'lat': 13.90901, 'lng': 106.10454}","[{'lat': 13.90914, 'lng': 106.10451}]",168743,"[{'id': '300-3100-0028', 'name': 'History Museum', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+855972318234'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://khmervillage.com'}]}]",Not Available,Stung Treng,12.490747,106.01646,7136401,Le Tonle Restaurant and Guesthouse,"Friendly, cozy and comfortable, Le Tonle offers the best restaurants and guesthouse in Kratie. Founded in 2007, Le Tonle functions as a Tourism Training Center to increase the capacities of vulnerable youth from Northeast Cambodia. Enjoying a meal in our restaurant will directly support our young trainees. The restaurants offer a selection of traditional Khmer and Western cuisine. Our young, friendly trainees are more than happy to serve you and practice their English!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g729351-d7136401-Reviews-Le_Tonle_Restaurant_and_Guesthouse-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Preah Soramarith Quay , Near by Koh Trong Ferry Port', 'city': 'Kratie', 'state': 'Kratie Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '100603', 'address_string': 'Preah Soramarith Quay , Near by Koh Trong Ferry Port, Kratie 100603 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kratie', 'location_id': '729351'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kratie Province', 'location_id': '2366668'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@letonle.org,+855 77 558 227,http://www.letonle.org/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g729351-d7136401-Le_Tonle_Restaurant_and_Guesthouse-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '729351', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 17 Places to E