Masala House,here:pds:place:116w636s-daf9746c555547e794b062f8aa005a60,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Masala House, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10021, 'lng': 103.19792}","[{'lat': 13.10023, 'lng': 103.19778}]",12455,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '202-000', 'name': 'Indian', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85586996160'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.100818,103.19644,1749351,Lux Guest house,"Lux Guesthouse is a modern luxury guest house which has high quality standard service with the unique Khmer hospitality you expect and deserve. Our fully modernized property which just opened on April 2009 comes with all the usual amenities as well as unlimited water, free bikes, free internet, free pickup. It is only a 5 minute walk to the Central Market and by bike, it is less than 2 minutes. Of course, tuk tuks are always an option as well. Run by Khmer family, it is a friendly place with a warm, cozy atmosphere and it will provide you with a memorable experience of Khmer hospitality .",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d1749351-Reviews-Lux_Guest_house-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 79 Street 102, Phum 20uksaphea, Sangkat Svay Pao', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': '# 79 Street 102, Phum 20uksaphea, Sangkat Svay Pao, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d1749351-Lux_Guest_house-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66