Meet the Province,here:pds:place:116w649u-df14051b8f2cdbd0ec164ae1bbf8baec,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Meet the Province, 080601 ល្វាឯម, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'ល្វាឯម', 'district': 'អរិយក្សត្រ', 'postalCode': '080601'}","{'lat': 11.57469, 'lng': 104.96573}","[{'lat': 11.5748, 'lng': 104.9658}]",11100,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11945958'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26456913'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855965627705'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://meettheprovince.com', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}]}, {'value': 'https://meettheprovince.com/homestay-phnom-penh', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 10:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T100000', 'duration': 'PT11H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kandal,11.573586,104.96503,11945958,Meet the Province,"Meet The Province is a family-owned business, providing travelers the best way to get immersed in the local culture of Cambodia. Together with my Nephew, I host tours from Phnom Penh to the hinterlands, providing travelers an opportunity to visit local produce, temples, prepare food and eat together while stay-over at our beautiful homestay. Joining us is a great way to contribute directly to our neighborhood and not some polished corporation. We seek travelers that are open-minded and not shy about traveling off the beaten track.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d11945958-Reviews-Meet_the_Province-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Tuol Meas Village, Lvea Aem', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Tuol Meas Village, Lvea Aem, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_