Mei Gui Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w63gg-6cacd81ada71429789c1b31ffbc3be5d,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Mei Gui Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ ស្ទឹងថ្មី, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ស្ទឹងថ្មី', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35418, 'lng': 103.84973}","[{'lat': 13.35424, 'lng': 103.84961}]",88201,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7039120'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855969983005'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.354152,103.8498,7039120,Mei Gui Guesthouse,"Property Information: Mei Gui Guesthouse is a clean home-run guesthouse, which is located on Sok San Street, the center of Siem Reap downtown. Guests can enjoy the convenience of the location, only 5 minutes walking to Old Market, Bar Street and Angkor Night Market. There are also many restaurants nearby. It is only 6 KM to the famous Angkor Wat. The property provides very budget accommodation, from US$ 2.5 per person per night. Guests can choose from Fan Room and Air-conditioning Room. Each room is with private bathroom. The beds in the guest house are large and comfortable. Free WiFi covers the guesthouse and it is free to use the computer in the common area. The property also provides bike hire, travel/guide services and airport pickup services.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7039120-Reviews-Mei_Gui_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '308, Group 8', 'street2': 'Village Stung Thmey, Sangkat Svay Dang Kum', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '1111', 'address_string': '308, Group 8 Village Stung Thmey, Sangkat Svay Dang Kum, Siem Reap 1111 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'leve