Mekhala Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w63u4-2d921768c72148e4a576a2935e2addd2,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Mekhala Restaurant, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.37722, 'lng': 103.84251}","[{'lat': 13.37715, 'lng': 103.84263}]",87467,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12926274'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85587206777'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.anjalihotel.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:00 - 23:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT17H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.377222,103.8425,12926274,Mekhala Restaurant,At Mekhala we raise high the culinary bar while keeping things cool and casual. Our menu mirrors classics from Cambodia that families would cook at home. For a generous meal full of flavor – not sophisticated but high quality and with a special note. The open kitchen makes the space as dynamic as the food. The 200 sqm A/C bar and lounge and its amazing terrace nested in our garden is the ideal place for relaxing and offers a perfect mixture of good music and unique cocktails.,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d12926274-Reviews-Mekhala_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '1705 Korean-Cambodian Friendship Road 30', 'street2': 'Krous Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': '1705 Korean-Cambodian Friendship Road 30 Krous Village, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cam