Mekong Bamboo Hut,here:pds:place:116w64up-715b1b4278ef4e00951fa216c55e847a,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Mekong Bamboo Hut, 030702 កោះសូទិន, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'city': 'កោះសូទិន', 'district': 'កោះសូទិន', 'postalCode': '030702'}","{'lat': 11.96492, 'lng': 105.45519}","[{'lat': 11.96488, 'lng': 105.45532}]",78037,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]","[{'id': '204-000', 'name': 'Southeast Asian', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3725835'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515905620'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g659642-d3725835-Reviews-Mekong_Bamboo_Hut-Kampong_Cham_Kampong_Cham_Province.ht', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kampong Cham,11.965422,105.45367,3725835,Mekong Bamboo Hut,"In a luxurious garden with plenty of fruit trees, Mekong Bamboo Hut Guesthouse offers an amazing way to discover Cambodia.In the island of koh Pene in a middle of the Mekong river front of Kampong Cham, cross the biggest bamboo brige of Asia and come discover a Khmer traditional life style. In our Guesthouse, guests sleep in a hut, using a hammock or a matress with mosquito net for 3$/night. The place is very relaxing with a platform overlooking the Mekong. We have a bar restaurant with homemade food. Nice beach for swimming on the dry season.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g659642-d3725835-Reviews-Mekong_Bamboo_Hut-Kampong_Cham_Kampong_Cham_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Phum Koh Chas', 'street2': 'Koh Pene Island', 'city': 'Kampong Cham', 'state': 'Kampong Cham Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '31000', 'address_string': 'Phum Koh Chas Koh Pene Island, Kampong Cham 31000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kam