Mekong Crossing Guesthouse Restaurant & Pub,here:pds:place:116w64up-8942af7601dc4860bf6b5ee6359ee5cb,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Mekong Crossing Guesthouse Restaurant & Pub, 030402 កំពង់ចាម, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'city': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'district': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'postalCode': '030402'}","{'lat': 11.98831, 'lng': 105.46658}","[{'lat': 11.98844, 'lng': 105.46662}]",25663,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8680507'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8684328'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517801788'}]}],Not Available,Kampong Cham,11.988414,105.46661,8680507,Mekong Crossing Guesthouse Restaurant & Pub,"Mekong Crossing Guesthouse Restaurant & Pub is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Kampong Cham, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Close to Wat Nokor (2.0 mi), a popular Kampong Cham landmark, Mekong Crossing Guesthouse Restaurant & Pub is a great destination for tourists.
Mekong Crossing Guesthouse Restaurant & Pub features a 24 hour front desk and baggage storage. In addition, as a valued Mekong Crossing Guesthouse Restaurant & Pub guest, you can enjoy an on-site restaurant that is available on-site. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
While you’re here, be sure to check out LBN Asian Restaurant, one of the southwestern restaurants that can be found in Kampong Cham, which is a short distance from Mekong Crossing Guesthouse Restaurant & Pub.
Should time allow, Ko Paen Bamboo Bridge and The French Tower are some popular attractions that are within walking distance.
Enjoy your stay in Kampong Cham!
