usiness', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,11,14
Mekong Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-5c183e979d9006ae057efdc25622bd3b,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Mekong Hotel, 030402 កំពង់ចាម, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'city': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'district': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'postalCode': '030402'}","{'lat': 11.99141, 'lng': 105.46539}","[{'lat': 11.9914, 'lng': 105.46553}]",25349,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]","[{'id': '204-000', 'name': 'Southeast Asian', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1580881'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2040550'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4132148'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85542941536'}, {'value': '+855884827749', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://mekongbamboohut.overblog.com', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}]}, {'value': 'http://reathatours.wordpress.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kampong Cham,11.99141,105.4654,1580881,Mekong Hotel,"Mekong Hotel is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Kampong Cham, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as a flat screen TV, a refrigerator, and air conditioning, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the hotel.
Mekong Hotel features a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and baggage storage, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts an on-site restaurant. If you are driving to Mekong Hotel, free parking is available.
Wat Nokor (1.9 mi), located nearby, makes Mekong Hotel a great place to stay for those interested in visiting this popular Kampong Cham landmark.
While you’re here, be sure to check out Madinina Pizza, one of the Italian restaurants that can be found in Kampong Cham, which is a short distance from Mekong Hotel.
Should time allow, Ko Paen Bamboo Bridge and The French Tower are some popular attractions that are within walking distance.
Enjoy your stay in Kampong Cham!
