Mekong Imperial Boutique Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w649g-c1bd31e8f6e84c3ead28fe7aedfd55de,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Mekong Imperial Boutique Guesthouse, តីរវិថី ព្រះស៊ីសុវត្ថិ 339, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'តីរវិថី ព្រះស៊ីសុវត្ថិ', 'postalCode': '120205', 'houseNumber': '339'}","{'lat': 11.56747, 'lng': 104.93118}","[{'lat': 11.56751, 'lng': 104.93125}]",73299,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2513888'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3947869'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592341732'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.55511,104.92454,3570930,Khmer Surin Boutique Guesthouse,"Looking for a place to stay in Phnom Penh? Then look no further than Khmer Surin Boutique Guesthouse, a romantic guest house that brings the best of Phnom Penh to your doorstep.
Khmer Surin Boutique Guesthouse offers guests an array of room amenities including air conditioning, a desk, and a mosquito net, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available.
The guest house offers a 24 hour front desk, 24 hour check-in, and baggage storage, to make your visit even more pleasant. The property also features breakfast. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
Nearby landmarks such as Bassac Lane (0.4 mi) and Bophana Center (0.5 mi) make Khmer Surin Boutique Guesthouse a great place to stay when visiting Phnom Penh.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the Italian restaurants, including Brooklyn Pizza & Bistro, Piccola Italia Da Luigi, and Oskar Bistro, all of which are a short distance from Khmer Surin Boutique Guesthouse.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum (0.6 mi), Royal Palace (0.7 mi), or Central Market (0.9 mi), which are popular attractions amongst tourists, and they are all within walking distance.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Khmer Surin Boutique Guesthouse as you experience everything Phnom Penh has to offer.
