Mekong Magic Cruise,here:pds:place:116w649g-a430915152e7f683a5eb3928fcdf21e4,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Mekong Magic Cruise, ផ្លូវ 3, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 3', 'postalCode': '120205'}","{'lat': 11.56807, 'lng': 104.93053}","[{'lat': 11.56803, 'lng': 104.9304}]",7240,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27100952'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85586359439'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://themekongmagic.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.555922,104.944435,27100952,Mekong Magic Cruise,"Embark on a Vibrant River Adventure with Mekong Magic Cruises in Phnom Penh! Enjoy unlimited BBQ, beers, and stunning views on our laid-back Mekong and Tonle Sap cruises. Perfect for fun gatherings or solo escapades, we offer an affordable, lively experience. Our cruises feature: Freeflow BBQ & Beers: Savor endless BBQ delights and cold beers as you cruise. Panoramic Views: Capture Phnom Penh's beauty from the vibrant waterways. Sunset Cruises: Watch the city light up at dusk from the best spot in town. Group Fun: Ideal for parties and celebrations with a unique twist. Easy Access: We pick you up within 3 km of the dock for a seamless start. Join Mekong Magic Cruises for an unforgettable day of fun, food, and fantastic sights.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d27100952-Reviews-Mekong_Magic_Cruise-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asi