Melo Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w649e-a118d2c83da84888971b33c2c18548db,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Melo Restaurant, ផ្លូវ 360, 120102 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 360', 'postalCode': '120102'}","{'lat': 11.54853, 'lng': 104.92645}","[{'lat': 11.5488, 'lng': 104.92641}]",22923,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855968746119'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.553148,104.92934,11750085,Namaste India Restaurant,"This intimate Indian eatery along the chic strip known as Bassac Lane has rebranded and updated its menu of delicious dishes from the north and south of the subcontinent. You’ll find the chef’s recommendations coincide with your all-time favourites such as lamb roghan josh, chicken tikka masala, palak paneer, aloo gobhi, saffron pilaf rice and cheese naan. Its not all gluttony, though – there are healthy plates like the detoxifying rice-daal combo of Ayurveda khichdi or the herb yoghurt-basted Hariyali chicken kebab. No apologies for the fact you’re probably salivating right now.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d11750085-Reviews-Namaste_India_Restaurant-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#15 Street 308 Tonle Bassac Corner', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12301', 'address_string': '#15 Street 308 Tonle Bassac Corner, Phnom Penh 12301 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@namasteindianfood.com,+855 15 332 288,https://www.namasteindianfood.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d11750085-Namaste_India_Restaurant-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#6 of 1,983 Places to Eat in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '1983', 'ranking': '6'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,1727,"{'1': '5', '2': '10', '3': '19', '4': '94', '5': '1599'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",744,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d11750085-m66827-Reviews-Namaste_India_Restaurant-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2300'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 10:00 - 23:00', 'Tuesday: 10:00 - 23:00', 'Wednesday: 10:00 - 23:00', 'Thursday: 10:00 - 23:00', 'Friday: 10:00 - 23:00', 'Saturday: 10:00 - 23:00', 'Sunday: 10:00 - 23:00']}","['Accepts Credit Cards', 'Accepts Mastercard', 'Accepts Visa', 'Delivery', 'Digital Payments', 'Free off-street parking', 'Free Wifi', 'Outdoor Seating', 'Reservations', 'Seating', 'Serves Alcohol', 'Street Parking', 'Table Service', 'Takeout', 'Wheelchair Accessible', 'Wine and Beer']","[{'name': 'indian', 'localized_name': 'Indian'}, {'name': 'asian', 'localized_name': 'Asian'}]",Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'restaurant', 'localized_name': 'Restaurant'}","[{'name': 'sit_down', 'localized_name': 'Sit down'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '94'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '487'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '202'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '304'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '552'}]","[{'award_type': 'Travelers Choice', 'year': '2023', 'images': {'tiny': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png', 'small': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png', 'large': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png'}, 'categories': [], 'display_name': 'Travelers Choice'}]",Not available,Not available,FALSE,20,14
Memoria Palace & Resort,here:pds:place:116w62cj-fc060861c7bd44a09f2290f3610552c8,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Memoria Palace & Resort, 230204 ប៉ៃលិន, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បៃលិន', 'city': 'ប៉ៃលិន', 'district': 'បរយ៉ាខា', 'postalCode': '230204'}","{'lat': 12.86353, 'lng': 102.56549}","[{'lat': 12.86366, 'lng': 102.56547}]",61356,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '700-7460-0115', 'name': 'Tourist Information'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2723060'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515430014'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.memoriapalace.com'}]}]",Not Available,Pailin,12.86307,102.56554,2723060,Memoria Palace & Resort,"Memoria Palace & Resort is an eco-tourism resort located in the foothills of the Cardamom Mountains of Pailin, Cambodia. The resort spans over 13 lush hectares and features 16 beautiful bungalows, 3 unique traditional style thatched eco-lodges, a hilltop saltwater swimming pool, open space restaurant & outdoor bar, and a large conference room. Memoria is a hidden gem with inviting appeal, magnificent views across the countryside, fresh clean air and an invigorating breeze coming off the mountains. Our location provides the perfect environment for a variety of retreats, peaceful relaxation, personal rejuvenation or adventurous outdoor activities. Overall Pailin is an ideal place to base yourself for sightseeing, cycling, hiking, trekking excursions and guided tours into the Cardamom Mountains, one of Southeast Asia's best preserved wilderness areas which hosts an abundance of unique species which are now endangered thoughout much of South East Asia.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g2040763-d2723060-Reviews-Memoria_Palace_Resort-Pailin_Pailin_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Highway 57', 'city': 'Pailin', 'state': 'Pailin Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02455', 'address_stri