Meng Cafe,here:pds:place:116w648e-5b12be7d7bed4b62acf21fb78748d0d5,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Meng Cafe, 080312 កណ្ដាលស្ទឹង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'កណ្ដាលស្ទឹង', 'district': 'ព្រែកស្លែង', 'postalCode': '080312'}","{'lat': 11.3655, 'lng': 104.90447}","[{'lat': 11.36537, 'lng': 104.90447}]",16562,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510982939'}]}],Not Available,Kandal,11.46727,104.92883,25631799,La table cafe,"Garden Cafe/ Bar/ Restaurant in the river border. Enjoy all our seat area, private salon in the garden or in the restaurant from the 2 seats tables to be Intime to 16 seats tables. Perfect for families, couple, big friends groups, sports team or more. Vegetarian friendly. Many dishes with organic flowers and aromatics herbs from our garden. Large varieties of house made products as syrups from our garden's flowers. ice cream, jam, even soon cake, vegan cake and infused local alcohol. We have more than 200 plants and trees species and more than 50 flowers species. If you love the green and nice oxygen we are definitely the place to be. We are organizing a tour to discover edibles flowers, medicinal plants from our garden""",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g729355-d25631799-Reviews-La_table_cafe-Ta_Khmau_Kandal_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#193 Prek kat', 'city': 'Ta Khmau', 'state': 'Kandal Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '#193 Prek kat, Ta Khmau Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Ta Khmau', 'location_id': '729355'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kandal Province', 'location_id': '2366665'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,+855 12 872 767,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g729355-d25631799-La_table_cafe-Ta_Khmau_Kandal_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not a