Mercenaries Wooden Sculpture,here:pds:place:116w635k-eba919351228466cb68c39701bac29c6,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Mercenaries Wooden Sculpture, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.1, 'lng': 103.2}","[{'lat': 13.09995, 'lng': 103.2005}]",12628,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '600-6600-0077', 'name': 'Home Improvement/Hardware Store'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85589776674'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.126471,103.21384,10047441,Wooden House,"Wooden House is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Battambang, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Room service, express check-in and check-out, and shops are some of the conveniences offered at this guest house. If you are driving to Wooden House, there is free public parking available nearby.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Battambang, Wooden House is located a short distance from White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (2.1 mi) and Ta Dumbong Statue (2.5 mi).
While in Battambang be sure to experience local ribs favorites at Jaan Bai Restaurant or Ambrosia Cafe.
Best of all, Wooden House makes it easy to experience some great Battambang attractions like Mrs. Bun Roeung's Ancient House, which is a popular history museum.
Enjoy your stay in Battambang!
