Meru Asia Retreat,here:pds:place:116w63u6-8c693d2a6df24a85976d666b9e212f01,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Meru Asia Retreat, 171211 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ទឹកវិល', 'postalCode': '171211'}","{'lat': 13.41747, 'lng': 103.83502}","[{'lat': 13.41748, 'lng': 103.83488}]",21875,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10467797'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570531270', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}, {'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}, {'value': '+85592983382'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.417447,103.8353,10467797,Meru Asia Retreat,"MERU - A UNIQUE, SPACIOUS AND TRANQUIL RETREAT Taste traditional village life while enjoying creature comforts in this beautifully restored wooden villa. Set on 1 acre of lush gardens on the edge of Angkor Wat, the property boasts an ideal location to base yourself to explore the temples. This is an experiential retreat that will not disappoint! From the moment you enter the grounds of Meru, you will experience a haven of serenity and relaxation. Wander through our lush, tropical garden, then select a nook to sit back, relax and listen to the soundscape of the local village, while sensing the historic and cultural atmosphere of Angkor. From the moment you enter the grounds of Meru, you will experience a haven of serenity and relaxation. Wander through our lush, tropical garden, then select a nook to sit back, relax and listen to the soundscape of the local village, while sensing the historic and cultural atmosphere of Angkor.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d10467797-Reviews-Meru_Asia_Retreat-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Meru Street', 'street2': 'Phum Qveen', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodi