Microlight Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w63gu-3e52ba6bd8f5f0125611abf5ea46396e,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Microlight Cambodia, 171206 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ជ្រាវ', 'postalCode': '171206'}","{'lat': 13.35385, 'lng': 103.90009}","[{'lat': 13.35383, 'lng': 103.90023}]",21976,"[{'id': '550-5510-0379', 'name': 'Outdoor Service', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7701255'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592533269'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.microlightcambodia.net'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.353894,103.89987,7701255,Microlight Cambodia,"Fly around the temples of Angkor, lush jungles, floating villages, and flooded forests in a Microlight Aircraft. Cambodia's incredible landscape is covered with unspoiled natural beauty, splendid rice fields, palm trees, countryside with mountains in the back ground, empty beaches, bustling markets, vibrant cities and the largest set of ancient temples in the world forming a harmonious whole. Above all this, its people, their charm and warm-hearted hospitality. Adventure the Ancient Kingdom from the Sky! Our office is based in Siem Reap. Please call us for more details.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d7701255-Reviews-Microlight_Cambodia-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road 6', 'street2': 'Jayavarman Airfield', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'National Road 6 Jayavarman Airfield, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,microlightcambodia@gmail.com,+855 92 533 269,http://www.microlightcambodia.net,https:/