Middle Ways - Day Tours,here:pds:place:116w63gg-c8304d3767e64d7687c41d5648934902,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Middle Ways - Day Tours, វិថី សាលាកម្រើក, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'វិថី សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34356, 'lng': 103.86169}","[{'lat': 13.34356, 'lng': 103.86168}]",115870,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7100156'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85586717751'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://middleways.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 20:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.34356,103.86169,7100156,Middle Ways - Day Tours,"Middle Ways is a social business based in Siem Reap. Our goal is to make you discover places off the beaten path and to show you the real face of Cambodia. With your help we work, via tourism development, to provide local people an access to fair works and bring sustainable solutions to the village communities that are part of our tours.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d7100156-Reviews-Middle_Ways_Day_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sala Kamraeuk', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '1710', 'address_string': 'Sala Kamraeuk, Siem Reap 1710 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,middlewaystravel@gmail.com,+855 86 717 751,http://middleways.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d7100156-Middle_Ways_Day_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_l