Miecafe Siem Reap,here:pds:place:116w648f-f38c65ee245d473c9ceabd19d2b62b64,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Miecafe Siem Reap, 080315 កណ្ដាលស្ទឹង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'កណ្ដាលស្ទឹង', 'district': 'សៀមរាប', 'postalCode': '080315'}","{'lat': 11.40124, 'lng': 104.86699}","[{'lat': 11.40137, 'lng': 104.86629}]",20574,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}, {'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510443377', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85512791371'}, {'value': '+85516211968', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}, {'value': '+85570969222', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85585812588', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}, {'value': '+85593218956', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1100-0010'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.miecafe-siemreap.com', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kandal,12.570423,104.81391,6486510,"Real, Rural, Romantic, Relax Home!!!","This is a rural and eco-friendly bungalow, traditionally designed by adding Eco-concept. All the authentic Cambodian houses are private and spacious for each couple or even family. it is full of romance of the countryside where it is hardly found in the city. Guests can enjoy house viewing the moon, the thousand stars at night. Moreover, experience the natural music performed by the cricket and the frog nearby. Just 6 km from downtown, but you can escape the crowd and seeing the different world of nature. With the main concept of community based development, we has employed staff from local village near by. They are very friendly, kind, and honest. If you decide to stay with us, you will feel that you have a second home and family in Cambodia. SURE ! I GUARANTEE! We don&#39;t offer standard service, but we do offer friendship Hospitality.
Thanks for reading!!!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/VacationRentalReview-g297390-d6486510-Real_Rural_Romantic_Relax_Home-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d6486510-Real_Rural_Romantic_Relax_Home-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},0,https://www.tripadvisor.com/VacationRentalReview-g297390-d6486510-m66827-Real_Rural_Romantic_Relax_Home-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'vr', 'localized_name': 'vacation rentals'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,11,7
