Minka,here:pds:place:116w63gf-1e76fb8ef871447b98092b2807a20956,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Minka, ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.34265, 'lng': 103.83539}","[{'lat': 13.34261, 'lng': 103.83542}]",27214,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'www': [{'value': 'http://www.minka-siemreap.com'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.344872,103.83521,9793223,Minka,"Finding an ideal guest house in Siem Reap does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Minka, a nice option for travelers like you.
Rooms at Minka provide air conditioning and a refrigerator, and guests can stay connected with free wifi.
You can also enjoy free breakfast while staying at Minka.
While staying at Minka, visitors can check out The Happy Ranch Horse Farm (0.6 mi) and ArtBox (1.3 mi), some of Siem Reap's top attractions.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of Siem Reap's popular dumplings  restaurants such as Marum, Khmer Kitchen Restaurant, and Spoons, all a short distance from Minka.
Minka puts the best of Siem Reap at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
