Miss Wong Battambang,here:pds:place:116w636s-b8e13d4e33524ef7b106b907882991c3,en,bar_pub,"{'label': 'Miss Wong Battambang, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10104, 'lng': 103.19848}","[{'lat': 13.10104, 'lng': 103.19848}]",12557,"[{'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '200-2000-0368', 'name': 'Cocktail Lounge'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15275575'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15277329'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592428332'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/misswongbattambang', 'categories': [{'id': '200-2000-0011'}]}, {'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/misswongbattambang', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 16:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T160000', 'duration': 'PT08H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Battambang,13.101039,103.19848,15277329,Miss Wong Battambang,"Miss Wong Cocktail Bar has been a mainstay in the Cambodian bar scene for a decade and has now opened a second establishment in the Sino-French heritage quarter of Battambang. For the past ten years Miss Wong has gained a reputation, not just in Cambodia but also internationally, as a sophisticated cocktail bar serving premium spirits, providing professional service with an elegantly designed décor. Unlike the 1930’s old Shanghai speakeasy themed Siem Reap establishment, Miss Wong Battambang is embracing a more Chinoiserie style. Open from 4pm to Midnight daily and serving innovative cocktails and handcrafted Dim Sum.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g303666-d15277329-Reviews-Miss_Wong_Battambang-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 2, Phasar Nat', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'Street 2, Phasar Nat, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,misswongcocktail@gmail.com,+855 92 428 332,https://www.facebook.com/misswongbattambang/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d15277329-Miss_Wong_Battambang-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#33 of 138 Places to Eat in Battambang', 'geo_location_name': 'Battambang', 'ranking_out_of': '138', 'ranking': '33'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,25,"{'1': '1', '2': '1', '3': '1', '4': '3', '5': '19'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}}",31,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g303666-d15277329-m66827-Reviews-Miss_Wong_Battambang-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1600'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '0000'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1600'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '0000'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1600'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '0000'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1600'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '0000'}}