Miss Wong Cocktail Bar,here:pds:place:116aabd1-aad4722be9ff00e32a7a0cf5eaa26853,en,Cocktail,"{'label': 'Miss Wong Cocktail Bar, ផ្លូវ 2 ធ្នូ, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 2 ធ្នូ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35533, 'lng': 103.85479}","[{'lat': 13.35538, 'lng': 103.85492}]",89953,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}, {'id': '200-2000-0368', 'name': 'Cocktail Lounge'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2221683'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592428332'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.misswong.net'}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011'}], 'text': ['Mon: 18:00 - 24:00', 'Tue-Sun: 00:00 - 01:00, 18:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T180000', 'duration': 'PT07H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}, {'start': 'T180000', 'duration': 'PT06H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.355278,103.854675,2221683,Miss Wong Cocktail Bar,"If beer girls, big-screen TVs and $3 pitchers aren’t your style, head a block north of Pub Street to Miss Wong for a taste of vintage 1930’s Shanghai. The cherry-red lanterns that dangles from the doorway beckons passers-by. Inside, slip into one of the intimate leather booths for cocktail made from top shelf liquor or sample the home-made Dim Sum. Miss Wong is open from 6pm until late into the night, & days a week.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d2221683-Reviews-Miss_Wong_Cocktail_Bar-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '26 Street', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': '26 Street, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality',