Mitt Café,here:pds:place:116w648f-956f40c6095042f9bf168ffb50d5c226,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Mitt Café, ផ្លូវជាតិ 63, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 63', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35831, 'lng': 103.85424}","[{'lat': 13.35835, 'lng': 103.85411}]",24553,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512618774'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.358044,103.85086,12606755,Brother Bong Cafe,"Brother Bong was founded by a young Cambodian couple with a passion for coffee. Bunthoeun is a Cambodian award-winning barista who has been behind the machine for over 5 years. The food is sourced locally and offers something for everyone, Khmer and International food. You will find something here even if you are Gluten free, Vegan or Vegetarian.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d12606755-Reviews-Brother_Bong_Cafe-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 20', 'street2': 'Wat Bo', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Street 20 Wat Bo, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,+855 10 600 230,https://www.facebook.com/Brother-Bong-Cafe-1671782333125954/?hc_ref=PAGES_TIMELINE&fref=nf,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12606755-Brother_Bong_Cafe-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#36 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '36'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/travel