Mlob Dong,here:pds:place:116w65rh-3f362a4e93cb4005a6ed9167d813b79d,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Mlob Dong, 100604 ក្រចេះ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ក្រចេះ', 'city': 'ក្រចេះ', 'district': 'អូរឫស្សី', 'postalCode': '100604'}","{'lat': 12.49603, 'lng': 106.03939}","[{'lat': 12.49608, 'lng': 106.03952}]",21643,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0006', 'name': 'Deli'}]","[{'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12478200'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855977166567'}]}],Not Available,Kratie,12.49585,106.03897,12478200,Mlob Dong,The M-Lob Dong is the oldest restaurant in Kratie Province and dates back to 1993. A little bit outside the city center you are seated in of the charming little gazebo overlooking the rice fields. The kitchen offers authentic and rare specialties from Cambodia and especially from Kratie Province. All the fruits and most of the vegetables are harvested in the organic garden next to the kitchen.,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g729351-d12478200-Reviews-Mlob_Dong-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sre Sdoa Village', 'street2': 'SangKaf O-Rusiy', 'city': 'Kratie', 'state': 'Kratie Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Sre Sdoa Village SangKaf O-Rusiy, Kratie Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kratie', 'location_id': '729351'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kratie Province', 'location_id': '2366668'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,vonnprum@gmail.com,+855 97 716 6567,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g729351-d12478200-Mlob_Dong-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '729351', 'ranking_string': '#6 of 17 Places to Eat in Kratie', 'geo_location_name': 'Kratie', 'ranking_out_of': '17', 'ranking': '6'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cd