Mom's Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w63u5-5138686f4f99417d9afd8dea960b2bb5,en,guest_house,"{'label': ""Mom's Guesthouse, វិថី វត្តបូ, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'វិថី វត្តបូ', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.36028, 'lng': 103.86162}","[{'lat': 13.36033, 'lng': 103.86149}]",23861,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '324857'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512630170'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.momguesthouse.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.360153,103.86195,324857,Mom's Guesthouse,"Amidst the region of the secret history of the temples of Angkor, Mom's Guesthouse is one of the few best family-run guesthouses currently operational in Siem Reap, Kingdom of Cambodia. Mom’s Guesthouse opened in 1992. It initially started with 15 Khmer traditional wooden rooms. Thanks to our hospitality and excellent service, Mom’s Guest House has become very popular for both local and international tourists. Our business is progressively growing. By early 2004, we were able to replace our wooden guesthouse with a brick building of 30 luxury rooms and March 2010 we built swimming pool.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d324857-Reviews-Mom_s_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#0099 Wat Bo Street', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '855', 'address_string': '#0099 Wat Bo Street, Siem Reap 855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,