Mondulkiri Café Restaurant & Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649g-58fe4fe17b0e477eb587a570cb8d0525,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Mondulkiri Café Restaurant & Hotel, ផ្លូវ ឧកញ៉ា ទ្រូង ចាង, 120204 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងរាំង', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ឧកញ៉ា ទ្រូង ចាង', 'postalCode': '120204'}","{'lat': 11.56621, 'lng': 104.92137}","[{'lat': 11.56608, 'lng': 104.92139}]",73978,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'www': [{'value': 'http://www.mondolkiri.fr/accueil.php'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.566037,104.91174,12646303,TCT Mondulkiri Express,"Look no further than TCT Mondulkiri express if you are travelling to Mondulkiri or Senomorom! We operate a daily transit from Phnom Penh to Mondulkiri (aka Senmonorom) and vice versa using luxury Toyota Ford transit. Passengers are provided a free WIFI, bottle of water and passenger insurance on board. Ticket fare is USD 10.00 and our ticket is available for online booking at tctmondulkiri.com",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d12646303-Reviews-TCT_Mondulkiri_Express-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12253', 'address_string': 'Phnom Penh 12253 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,tctmondulkiri@gmail.com,+855 17 737 878,http://www.tctmondulkiri.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d12646303-TCT_Mondulkiri_Express-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#109 of 190 Transportation in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '190', 'ranking': '109'}",3.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.5-66827-5.svg,8,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '2', '4': '5', '5': '0'}",Not avai