Mondulkiri Elephant & Wildlife Sanctuary,here:pds:place:116aabd1-e1c12287e2e001fd464cc68a9efc3e10,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Mondulkiri Elephant & Wildlife Sanctuary, 110504 សែនមនោរម្យ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'មណ្ឌលគីរី', 'city': 'សែនមនោរម្យ', 'district': 'រមនា', 'postalCode': '110504'}","{'lat': 12.45531, 'lng': 107.20509}","[{'lat': 12.45545, 'lng': 107.20512}]",122153,"[{'id': '550-5520-0210', 'name': 'Wildlife Refuge', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7715531'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855976591101'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.mondulkirisanctuary.org'}]}]",Not Available,Mondulkiri,12.45772,107.18714,7715531,LEAF Cambodia Mondulkiri Elephant & Wildlife Sanctuary,"The Mondulkiri Elephant & Wildlife Sanctuary is a nonprofit conservation & eco tourism project, developed by LEAF Cambodia, in cooperation with the local Bunong tribal communities in Mondulkiri. Available visits include elephant sanctuary day visit & 2 day visit with camping & jungle trekking, it is possible to join as a wildlife volunteer at the sanctuary. The wildlife sanctuary projects contribute to five important conservation goals: 1: To rescue & provide sanctuary for local working elephants currently used in logging, tourist rides and heavy farm work. 2:To develop Mondulkiri's first facility for the rescue and reintroduction of trafficked & captive wildlife. 3: To conserve & protect the area's beautiful community forests from logging and development. 4: To create sustainable livelihoods & improve the lives of poor communities, preserve the special culture of the Indigenous Bunong community. 5:To promote and demonstrate sustainable ecotourism, educate locals about long term conservation benefits.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g1893367-d7715531-Reviews-LEAF_Cambodia_Mondulkiri_Elephant_Wildlife_Sanctuary-Sen_Monorom_Mondulkiri_Prov.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Sen Monorom', 'state': 'Mondulkiri Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Sen Monorom Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Sen Monorom', 'location_id': '1893367'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Mondulkiri Province', 'location_id': '2366669'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@mondulkirisanctuary.org,+855 11 666 983,http://www.mondulkirisanctuary.org/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1893367-d7715531-LEAF_Cambodia_Mondulkiri_Elephant_Wildlife_Sanctuary-Sen_Monorom_Mondulkiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '1893367', 'ranking_string': '#5 of 16 Outdoor Activities in Sen Monorom', 'geo_location_name': 'Sen Monorom', 'ranking_out_of': '16', 'ranking': '5'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,328,"{'1': '10', '2': '6', '3': '12', '4': '51', '5': '249'}",Not available,355,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g1893367-d7715531-m66827-Reviews-LEAF_Cambodia_Mondulkiri_Elephant_Wildlife_Sanctuary-Sen_Monorom_Mondulkiri_Prov.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}, {'name': 'outdoor_activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours', 'localized_name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours'}]}, {'name': 'Outdoor Activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities', 'categories': [{'name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours', 'localized_name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '1'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '125'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '62'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '27'}, {'name': 'friend