Mondulkiri Gibbon & Wildlife Safari,here:pds:place:116w6hnn-411724ad62e2ae859d2540fe9ba15b7b,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Mondulkiri Gibbon & Wildlife Safari, ផ្លូវជាតិ 76, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 76'}","{'lat': 12.32841, 'lng': 107.14943}","[{'lat': 12.32841, 'lng': 107.14943}]",51940,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '20182049'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855978162770'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://trekking-cambodia.com'}]}]",Not Available,Mondulkiri,12.329146,107.14929,20182048,Mondulkiri Gibbon & Wildlife Safari,"Our Mondulkiri Gibbon and Wildlife Safari treks are located at Keo Seima Wildlife Sanctuary (KSWS) in eastern Cambodia’s Mondulkiri Province is home to the Jahoo Gibbon Camp, which lies in the core of the sanctuary in the Seima Forest. Covering some 2,000 km2 the KSWS is working with multiple partners to preserve this critically important habitat of endangered species.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g1893367-d20182048-Reviews-Mondulkiri_Gibbon_Wildlife_Safari-Sen_Monorom_Mondulkiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street2': '', 'city': 'Sen Monorom', 'state': 'Mondulkiri Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Sen Monorom Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Sen Monorom', 'location_id': '1893367'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Mondulkiri Province', 'location_id': '2366669'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,mondulkirigibbon@gmail.com,+855 97 816 2770,http://trekking-cambodia.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1893367-d20182048-Mondulkiri_Gibbon_Wildlife_Safari-Sen_Monorom_Mondulkiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '1893367', 'ranking_string': '#11 of 16 Outdoor Activities in Sen Monorom', 'geo_location_name': 'Sen Monorom', 'ranking_out_of': '16', 'ranking': '11'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,15,"{'1': '2', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '0', '5': '12'}",Not available,28,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g1893367-d20182048-m66827-Reviews-Mondulkiri_Gibbon_Wildlife_Safari-Sen_Monorom_Mondulkiri_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}, {'name': 'outdoor_activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Eco Tours', 'localized_name': 'Eco Tours'}, {'name': 'Sightseeing Tours', 'localized_name': 'Sightseeing Tours'}, {'name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours', 'localized_name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours'}]}, {'name': 'Outdoor Activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities', 'categories': [{'name': 'Eco Tours', 'localized_name': 'Eco Tours'}, {'name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours', 'localized_name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '9'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '3'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '1'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '2'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,31,11
Mondulkiri Project,here:pds:place:116w6hny-2d025c401c6f439db0ae50dfb5831d0b,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Mondulkiri Project, 110504 សែនមនោរម្យ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'មណ្ឌលគីរី', 'city': 'សែនមនោរម្យ', 'district': 'រមនា', 'postalCode': '110504'}","{'lat': 12.45373, 'lng': 107.17715}","[{'lat': 12.45375, 'lng': 107.17729}]",40559,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6032124'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855887669588'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.mondulkiriproject.org'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:30 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T083000', 'duration': 'PT08H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Mondulkiri,12.453697,107.17689,6032124,Mondulkiri Project,"The Mondulkiri Project is an Elephant Sanctuary with elephants who have been rescued and retired from working. We are a registered Cambodian NGO. We also protect a forested valley from logging and providing local employment opportunities for local Bunong hill tribes. Our one and two day elephant and jungle trek tours operate daily from 8.30am. You can walk with, feed, swim with and wash elephants at a waterfall in our protected forest. No elephant riding. Learn about Bunong hill tribe customs from our guides.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g1893367-d6032124-Reviews-Mondulkiri_Project-Sen_Monorom_Mondulkiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Tree Lodge Road', 'city': 'Sen Monorom', 'state': 'Mondulkiri Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '13000', 'address_string': 'Tree Lodge Road, Sen Monorom 13000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Sen Monorom', 'location_id': '1893367'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Mondulkiri Province', 'location_id': '2366669'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,mondulkiriproject@gmail.com,+855 88 766 9588,http://w