Monkey Island,here:pds:place:116w3ckw-eb8331e28e2349d7bfb54721228e8d24,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Monkey Island, 180405 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'កោះរុង', 'postalCode': '180405'}","{'lat': 10.6687, 'lng': 103.2749}","[{'lat': 10.66874, 'lng': 103.27477}]",117745,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2437395'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85581830991'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://monkeyisland-kohrong.com'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.668681,103.27497,2437395,Monkey Island,"Monkey Island has 20 hand crafted beach bungalows situated right on the white sand beach of Koh Rong. Each bungalow sleeps up to 4 people.Fall asleep and wake up with the sound of the waves lapping at your doorstep on one of the most pristine Islands of Cambodia - Koh Rong.We have a large selection of Thai and traditional Khmer meals, we also have daily specials and BBQ's.The bar/restaurant is situated right on the white sandy beach and enjoys a unique and uninterrupted view of the crystal clear, turquoise waters all the way to the horizon.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1808558-d2437395-Reviews-Monkey_Island-Koh_Rong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Koh Rong Beach', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Koh Rong', 'state': 'Koh Kong Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Koh Rong Beach, Koh Rong Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Koh Rong', 'location_id': '1808558'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Koh Kong Province', 'location_id': '2366667'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1808558-d2437395-Monkey_Island-Koh_Rong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '1808558', 'ranking_string': '#31 of 73 Specialty lodging in Koh Rong',