Montagne Boutique,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-3db042ab318d5c147e6c1eefa3167ab6,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Montagne Boutique, 070803 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់បាយ', 'postalCode': '070803'}","{'lat': 10.62664, 'lng': 104.18238}","[{'lat': 10.62665, 'lng': 104.18224}]",24160,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23515742'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516544460'}], 'www': [{'value': 'www.montagneboutique.asia'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.626625,104.182495,23515742,Montagne Boutique,"The hotel has 3 floors, 15 luxury rooms, a stair, and an elevator. Each room is equipped with modern furniture and furnishings, accompanied by a green garden and mountain views in all rooms, a swimming pool, and 24-hour reception. The building itself is designed in the fusion style of Khmer and European. All rooms are a new brand and are well-cleaned and gorgeous Montagne Boutique is​ the one of hotels located in the center area of the city along National Road.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d23515742-Reviews-Montagne_Boutique-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street #3, Kampong Bay Cherng, Sangkat Kampong Bay', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Street #3, Kampong Bay Cherng, Sangkat Kampong Bay, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d23515742-Montagne_Boutique-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#15 of 88 hotels in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_