Montange Guest House,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-a8ca801fb2074becbe6eb433c5c24b55,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Montange Guest House, ផ្លូវជាតិ 3, 070802 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'ក្រាំងអំពិល', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 3', 'postalCode': '070802'}","{'lat': 10.62463, 'lng': 104.18299}","[{'lat': 10.62461, 'lng': 104.18313}]",24316,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855964486886'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.609246,104.1826,7153866,Captain Chim's Guest House,"Welcome to the brand new Captain Chim's Guest House! - 4 Double Rooms (queen beds with fan) all en suite. - 4 Single Rooms (queen bed with fan) all en suite. - 4 Single Rooms (queen bed with A/C) all en suite. - 2 Dorms for 8 people (fan) All rooms includes: Laundry, bicycle and Wi-Fi. 24 hr Management Also we can arrange for you: excursion to the countryside of Kampot, Visas, Tickets, Kayak, bike hire.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d7153866-Reviews-Captain_Chim_s_Guest_House-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 119-121', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'No. 119-121, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d7153866-Captain_Chim_s_Guest_House-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#19 of 148 B&Bs / Inns in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '148', 'ranking': '19'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,96,"{'1': '3', '2': '7', '3': '12', '4': '37', '5