Montra Nivesha Residence,here:pds:place:116w63u5-ceafcb9798ee47d3a3775b14fe002f8c,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Montra Nivesha Residence, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37387, 'lng': 103.86282}","[{'lat': 13.37378, 'lng': 103.86272}]",22651,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '625431'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577681787'}], 'www': [{'value': 'www.montranivesha.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.373889,103.862854,625431,Montra Nivesha Residence,"Welcome to the sacred retreat of Montra Nivesha, the perfect blend of contemporary comfort and traditional Khmer design. The Hotel is 90% plastic-free, and a has purified drinking water tap in every room, as well as a unique gift given to every guest to minimise their environmental impact, and we have a very unique personal history and celebrity story. Lovingly finished in wood and elegantly decorated in exquisite local antiques, our sophisticated 5-star rooms combine traditional Khmer style, with superb modern amenities. Surrounded by lush gardens, 2 swimming pools, and tropical plants, it is an idyllic retreat from the bustle of Siem Reap beyond. Our famous Reahoo Restaurant offers exquisite authentic Royal Khmer cuisine, a superb vegetarian selection, and some classic international dishes. Our 5-star Sita Spa is an oasis of tranquility to relax, recharge and rejuvenate your body and mind. Cross the bridge from one world into Montra Nivesha - a hidden corner of Heaven on Earth",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d625431-Reviews-Montra_Nivesha_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#5, Krom 2, Phoum Mondol 3', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17251', 'address_string': '#5, Krom 2, Phoum Mondol 3, Siem Reap 17251 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,1.19E+12,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d625431-Montra_Nivesha_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#66 of 763 hotels in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '763', 'ranking': '66'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,833,"{'1': '9', '2': '5', '3': '21', '4': '148', '5': '650'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",876,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d625431-m66827-Reviews-Montra_Nivesha_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Restaurant', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Suites', 'Room 