Monysunita Angkor Home,here:pds:place:116w63gg-7ec3bafd65cd4529ae496a721148e715,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Monysunita Angkor Home, ផ្លូវ សម្តេចវិបុលបញ្ញា សុខ អាន, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សម្តេចវិបុលបញ្ញា សុខ អាន', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.3759, 'lng': 103.87031}","[{'lat': 13.37603, 'lng': 103.87031}]",21936,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12287353'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512784971'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.375829,103.87031,12287353,MonySunita Angkor Home,"Free Pick Up from Airport or Bus station! Guests at Monysunita Angkor Home will experience warm and friendly Cambodian hospitality and service (Temple Tour arrangement etc.). Monysunita Angkor Home is a modern, well appointed, secure and affordable family enterprise only a short inexpensive ‘tuk tuk’ drive (5Minutes) from the centre of Siem Reap and its pulsing market, restaurants and night life; and, very close to the famous Temple Complex. Staying with us, means that locals make direct income from your visit and tourism in Siem Reap and the surrounding province. This helps alleviate poverty in the community and gives opportunities to locals to live and work in dignity. A part of the total payment from guests goes directly to support the underprivileged community in the province. We welcome everyone to spend a lovely stay at Monysunita Angkor Home. All are welcome!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12287353-Reviews-MonySunita_Angkor_Home-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#60 Road', 'street2': 'Traing Village, Sangkat Slokram', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17251', 'address_string': '#60 Road Traing Village, Sangkat Slokram, Siem Reap 17251 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality'