Moringa Tree Maison,here:pds:place:116w63gv-5ba3c97c2ad350b96c7a7ec0f555b836,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Moringa Tree Maison, 170505 ប្រាសាទបាគង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'ប្រាសាទបាគង', 'district': 'កណ្ដែក', 'postalCode': '170505'}","{'lat': 13.35357, 'lng': 103.93261}","[{'lat': 13.35355, 'lng': 103.93247}]",20392,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27687288'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512890939'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/moringahomecambodia'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.353378,103.932785,27687288,Moringa Tree Maison,"Moringa Tree Maison Homestay is more than just a place to stay; it’s a home away from home where guests can immerse themselves in the rich culture and traditions of Cambodia. Our journey began with a simple mission: to provide a unique and authentic Cambodian experience while contributing to the sustainable development of our local community. Nestled in the heart of Siem Reap, our homestay is a testament to our commitment to preserving the environment and supporting the well-being of our neighbors.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g27691227-d27687288-Reviews-Moringa_Tree_Maison-Kandaek_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Trang Village', 'city': 'Kandaek', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Trang Village, Kandaek, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kandaek', 'location_id': '27691227'}, {'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,1.19E+12,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g27691227-d27687288-Moringa_Tree_Maison-Kandaek_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id':