Motel 7,here:pds:place:116aabd1-5b3dbbe9ad950872c8e53a71a1abc80a,en,motel,"{'label': 'Motel 7, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.60046, 'lng': 103.53055}","[{'lat': 10.6004, 'lng': 103.53043}]",133920,"[{'id': '500-5000-0054', 'name': 'Motel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2529781'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515207719'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://sihanoukville.info/motel-7'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.60044,103.53052,2529781,Motel 7,"Motel 7 is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Sihanoukville, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Guest rooms offer a refrigerator and air conditioning, and Motel 7 makes getting online easy as free internet access is available.
You can also take advantage of some of the amenities offered by the motel, including a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and 24 hour security. As an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
Nearby landmarks such as CJ Outlet and Jewelry Center (1.0 mi) and Wat Leu Temple (1.9 mi) make Motel 7 a great place to stay when visiting Sihanoukville.
While in Sihanoukville, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Motel 7, including The Big Easy (0.1 mi), Sandan (0.8 mi), and Nyam (0.2 mi).
If you are interested in exploring Sihanoukville, check out an ancient ruins, such as Wat Krom Temple.
Enjoy your stay in Sihanoukville!
