Motel Phnom Yaklom,here:pds:place:116w6kn5-504fac3343664ed6bb07ea2cb03ba7de,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Motel Phnom Yaklom, 160903 បានលុង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'រតនគីរី', 'city': 'បានលុង', 'district': 'យក្សឡោម', 'postalCode': '160903'}","{'lat': 13.73914, 'lng': 107.01687}","[{'lat': 13.73905, 'lng': 107.01677}]",108052,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1929054'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855978160345'}]}],Not Available,Ratanakiri,13.739802,107.01756,1929054,Motel Phnom Yaklom,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Banlung, Motel Phnom Yaklom is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as Motel Phnom Yaklom offers guests free wifi.
Plus, Motel Phnom Yaklom offers an on-site restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
While in Banlung, you may want to check out one of the nearby French restaurants, which include Banlung Kitchen and Balcony Pub.
If you are interested in exploring Banlung, check out a waterfall, such as Ka Chanh Waterfall.
Motel Phnom Yaklom is sure to make your visit to Banlung one worth remembering.
