Motherhome Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-3f7d0cd2c04f08b4673b85cb93730021,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Motherhome Guesthouse, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.3593, 'lng': 103.86229}","[{'lat': 13.35934, 'lng': 103.86216}]",23896,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1453433'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563760302'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/motherhomeaccommodation'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.359303,103.86228,1453433,MotherHome Guesthouse,"MotherHome Guesthouse is a modern luxury guest house which has high quality standard service with the unique Khmer hospitality you expect and deserve. Our fully modernized property which just opened on January 2009 comes with all the usual amenities as well as unlimited water/coffee/tea, free bikes, free internet, free pickup, and free breakfast. It is only a 10 minute walk to the Night Market and by bike, it is less than 5 minutes. Of course, tuk tuks are always an option as well. Run by Khmer family, it is a friendly place with a warm, cozy atmosphere and it will provide you with a memorable experience of Khmer hospitality .",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1453433-Reviews-MotherHome_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Wat Bo Street, Banteay Chas Village, Slor Kram Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '93017', 'address_string': 'Wat Bo Street, Banteay Chas Village, Slor Kram Commune, Siem Reap 93017 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not ava