My Parents Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-688fa9a576224dfdafce818a1cff4371,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'My Parents Guesthouse, ផ្លូវជាតិ 3, 070802 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'ក្រាំងអំពិល', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 3', 'postalCode': '070802'}","{'lat': 10.6243, 'lng': 104.18323}","[{'lat': 10.62432, 'lng': 104.18309}]",20215,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10055621'}]","[{'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/My-Parents-Guest-House-917696194947662', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.624295,104.18322,10055621,My Parents Guesthouse,"My Parents Guesthouse is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Kampot, offering a family-friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
My Parents Guesthouse is a family-friendly small hotel offering air conditioning, a desk, and a fireplace in the rooms, and it is easy to stay connected during your stay as free wifi is offered to guests.
The small hotel features a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and a sun terrace. Plus, guests can enjoy a free welcome drink, which has made this a popular choice among travelers visiting Kampot. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
While staying at My Parents Guesthouse, visitors can check out The Old Royal Cinema (1.0 mi), which is a popular Kampot attraction.
When you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out Tertulia Restaurant Kampot, Atelier Kampot, and The Fishmarket, which are some seafood restaurants that are popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.
During your visit, be sure to check out Farm Link (1.1 mi), which is a popular attraction within walking distance of the small hotel.
Enjoy your stay in Kampot!
