My Taste,here:pds:place:116w63gg-d5f84f2a84078212b0ccb7a253b02fbf,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'My Taste, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35355, 'lng': 103.8526}","[{'lat': 13.35342, 'lng': 103.85255}]",25066,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]","[{'id': '101-000', 'name': 'American', 'primary': True}, {'id': '301-000', 'name': 'French'}, {'id': '308-000', 'name': 'British Isles'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25275190'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517712223'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.35354,103.85259,25275190,My Taste,"At My Taste Restaurant, we introduce you to an incomparable breakfast, lunch, and dinner offering. For Breakfast, we attach particular importance to our breakfast, which we wish healthy, original, and varied. The fruit juices are 100% fresh fruit bios and done by the minute. 90% of the products used are local. A « health » corner is also at your disposal (gluten-free, lactose-free …) Lunch, we propose a complete offer, from light salads to more sophisticated dishes and Cambodian specialties. For dinner, depending on the chef’s inspiration and the season, starters, traditional or exotic dishes are suggested on the board. At any hour of the day, squeezed juices, cocktails, and other local beers can be enjoyed on the pool deck, inside our lobby, or in the restaurant itself.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d25275190-Reviews-My_Taste-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Steung Thmei', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Steung Thmei, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,ecom@phkachan.com,+855 17 712 223,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d25275190-My_Taste-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},3,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d25275190-m66827-Reviews-My_Taste-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2359'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Tuesday: Closed', 'Wednesday: Closed', 'Thursday: Closed', 'Friday: Closed', 'Saturday: Closed', 'Sunday: Closed']}",[],"[{'name': 'french', 'localized_name': 'French'}, {'name': 'american', 'localized_name': 'American'}, {'name': 'bar', 'localized_name': 'Bar'}, {'name': 'british', 'localized_name': 'British'}, {'name': 'pub', 'localized_name': 'Pub'}, {'name': 'diner', 'localized_name': 'Diner'}]",Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'restaurant', 'localized_name': 'Restaurant'}",Not available,Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,20,20
My Villa Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-8936cf33c7da083eacc4a3ac73433165,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'My Villa Guesthouse, ផ្លូវជាតិ 63, 171209 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សៀមរាប', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 63', 'postalCode': '171209'}","{'lat': 13.31933, 'lng': 103.85028}","[{'lat': 13.31934, 'lng': 103.85014}]",86786,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8493889'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855716791226'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://myvillasiemreap.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.319337,103.85017,8493889,My Villa Guesthouse,My Villa Guesthouse is a large converted Khmer family home. There are double rooms and a twin room which can be shared like a dorm. All rooms have en-suite bathrooms. There are balconies at both the front and the rear and also a roof terrace. Hammocks and soft furnishings are available to relax in and we have a bar. There is Free WIFI and a Free cuppa tea or coffee in the morning.,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d8493889-Reviews-My_Villa_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Route 63', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Route 63, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d8493889-My_Villa_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#388 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '388'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler