Myhouse Hillside Retreat,here:pds:place:116w3fhn-e547edc9a0144548825b6a4fa05537bb,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Myhouse Hillside Retreat, 220102 ដំណាក់ចង្អើរ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'ដំណាក់ចង្អើរ', 'district': 'ពងទឹក', 'postalCode': '220102'}","{'lat': 10.55152, 'lng': 104.34793}","[{'lat': 10.55142, 'lng': 104.34802}]",2084,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23735071'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3582995'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512916240'}, {'value': '+855977777938'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.551572,104.34789,3582995,MyHouse Hillside Retreat,"MyHouse Hillside Retreat (MyHouse) located on the splendid glen of Phnomvor Hill overlooking the chhak of Kep,Rabbit Island and Hatien-Mekong Delta (VietnamCoast). In among the tranquil surrounding of Phnomvors natural Environment (an Eco Tourist Zone) MyHouse allow all tourists to simply escape and enjoy comfort and relaxation in a natural untouched environment. Beyond its stunning location with a unique agriculture and historical landmarks, that brought MyHouse to one of world best taste Pepper's place known as The Kampot Pepper in MyHouse's compound. What make MyHouse unique is the combination of subdued comfort,serene space and distinctive details that not only make you feel indulgent beyond your imagination, but also makes you feel very much at home.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d3582995-Reviews-MyHouse_Hillside_Retreat-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Phnom Vor, An Tong Sar Village', 'street2': '1333 , Krong Keab', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07503', 'address_string': 'Phnom Vor, An Tong Sar Village 1333 , Krong Keab, Kep 07503 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep