Myproguide Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w643r-0d124b1a7118db20e593c095240e9316,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Myproguide Cambodia, 120907 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ពោធិ៍សែនជ័យ', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងធំ', 'postalCode': '120907'}","{'lat': 11.48096, 'lng': 104.75979}","[{'lat': 11.48109, 'lng': 104.75979}]",79172,"[{'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17454103'}]",[{'www': [{'value': 'https://www.myproguide.com'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 09:30 - 18:30'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T093000', 'duration': 'PT09H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.48106,104.75979,17454103,MyProGuide Cambodia,"MyProGuide is a professional tour guide center, connecting travelers and tour guides all around the world. You can find knowledgeable tour guides, customize private tours, or join group tours on MyProGuide website. The specialty is that we have tour guides speak multiple languages, and You can look through tour guide's introduction before you go. Experience local guiding tours with MyProGuide!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d17454103-Reviews-MyProGuide_Cambodia-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Phnom Penh', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12207', 'address_string': 'Phnom Penh, Siem Reap 12207 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,inasa.abiyani@myproguide.com,+62 853-1900-0228,https://www.myproguide.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d17454103-MyProGuide_Ca