Naang at Monsoon,here:pds:place:116aabd1-8e0f2919b6860f165aaf2d0159b659bd,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Naang at Monsoon, ផ្លូវ ឧកញ៉ា ជ្រុន យូហាក់, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ឧកញ៉ា ជ្រុន យូហាក់', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.55429, 'lng': 104.93196}","[{'lat': 11.55413, 'lng': 104.93193}]",23079,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]","[{'id': '800-078', 'name': 'Grill', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523922333'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://monsoonbassac.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.554213,104.93191,10664178,Monsoon Bassac Hotel,"If you’re looking for a romantic hotel in Phnom Penh, look no further than Monsoon Bassac Hotel.
While staying at Monsoon Bassac Hotel, visitors can check out Bassac Lane (0.2 mi) and Bophana Center (0.8 mi), some of Phnom Penh's top attractions.
Free wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at Monsoon Bassac Hotel offer air conditioning, a minibar, and a refrigerator.
During your stay, take advantage of some of the amenities offered, including a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and room service. Guests of Monsoon Bassac Hotel are also welcome to enjoy a pool and breakfast, located on site. For travelers arriving by car, free parking is available.
If you like seafood restaurants, Monsoon Bassac Hotel is conveniently located near Malis Cambodian Restaurant, Le Broken Plate, and Nesat Seafood House.
Looking to explore? Then look no further than Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum (1.0 mi), Royal Palace (0.6 mi), and Silver Pagoda (0.6 mi), which are some popular Phnom Penh attractions – all conveniently located within walking distance of the hotel.
The staff at Monsoon Bassac Hotel looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
