Naga Angkor Hostel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-5b5c3771e9420f813607d2cdd3bf6db7,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Naga Angkor Hostel, ផ្លូវ ផ្សាររាត្រីអង្គរ, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ផ្សាររាត្រីអង្គរ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35818, 'lng': 103.85303}","[{'lat': 13.35816, 'lng': 103.85317}]",24652,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1227789'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563968177'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.358235,103.85274,1227789,Naga Angkor Hostel,"Naga Angkor Hotel, located in the heart of Siem Reap and is a great budget hotel option. With basic but well decorated rooms, many with television, fridge and security safes, Naga Angkor Hotel is a great choice for the budget traveler that wants the comforts of a hotel at the price of a hostel. There is an active bar scene in our restaurant bar and delicious Khmer and international menu available for our guests. Our reception operates a full tour desk with multiple tour options for the famous Angkor Wat tours for our guests , onward travel, bus booking and visa services are also available. Rooms are supplied with a complimentary continental breakfast every morning, and there is a wide choice of room types, including twins with two double beds suitable for four people as two couples, or two singles, single or double occupancy double rooms, basic suite rooms suitable for budget business stays, and four four bed budget dorm rooms available for backpackers and budget conscious travelers. All of our rooms are provided with A/C, snuggly duvets and comfortable pillows. There is a full shop and cafe available on the ground floor level supplying all possible necessities. The hotel is located just a stones throw from the popular pub street area, but is far enough away for our guests not to be bothered with noise.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1227789-Reviews-Naga_Angkor_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '243 Samdach Tep Vong St', 'street2': 'Steng Thmey Village Sangkat Svay Dongkum, near Park Hyaat Hotel', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': '243 Samdach Tep Vong St Steng Thmey Village Sangkat Svay Dongkum, near Park Hyaat Hotel, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d1227789-Naga_Angkor_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#39 of 449 Specialty lodging in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '449', 'ranking': '39'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,279,"{'1': '12', '2': '8', '3': '30', '4': '73', '5': '156'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': 