"Naga House, Kampot",here:pds:place:116aabd1-c1a6dc30520402d36f02ac68e4378df3,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Naga House, Kampot, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.61834, 'lng': 104.16737}","[{'lat': 10.61829, 'lng': 104.16724}]",21433,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3308448'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512289916'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/pages/Naga-House/422600187790157', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.618569,104.16799,3308448,"Naga House, Kampot","Friendly riverside bar, guesthouse and restaurant. With great music, drinks, food and views. Hosting live music events with a warm and welcoming atmosphere. We have dorm beds, tree top and garden bungalows surrounded by native flowers and fruit trees in a natural, jungle setting. We can arrange tours and boat trips to the surrounding lakes, rivers, beaches, mountains and kampot pepper farms. Come to Naga House and take it easy by the river.Happy hour from 4-7pm 75c draft and cheap cocktails!!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d3308448-Reviews-Naga_House_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Teuk Chou Rd', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Teuk Chou Rd, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d3308448-Naga_Hou