Nagara Angkor Boutique Hotel,here:pds:place:116w63gg-4fff6095545547228669a6fcc43f5df5,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Nagara Angkor Boutique Hotel, ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35482, 'lng': 103.84859}","[{'lat': 13.35469, 'lng': 103.8486}]",25251,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7893022'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517676612', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85586665567'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.354821,103.84859,7893022,Nagara Angkor Boutique Hotel,"Situated in the exotic city of Siem Reap, Nagara Angkor has been designed to be a destination where all travellers from East and West come to pleasantly discover our services, beautiful and comfortable rooms, great food, and a tranquil swimming pool. The boutique is located just 10 minutes drive away from Siem Reap International Airport, and only a few minutes walking distance to the Old Market. Offering an outdoor pool, a terrace and a garden, Nagara Angkor Boutique is located in the heart of Siem Reap. The hotel boasts a restaurant and a bar. Free WiFi is available throughout the property. Nagara Angkor Boutique is a 0.6 km-walk from the vibrant Pub Street and 0.4 km from Angkor Night Market. The Angkor Wat temple complex is 7 km away from the property. Siem Reap - Angkor International Airport is 8 km away. The property provides complimentary airport and bus station pick-up service. Hotel Rooms: 36",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7893022-Reviews-Nagara_Angkor_Boutique_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Soksan Road, Stueng Thmey Village, Svay Dangkum Commune', 'street2': 'Close to pub-street, Old market & night markets', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': 'Soksan Road, Stueng Thmey Village, Svay Dangkum Commune Close to pub-street, Old market & night markets, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d7893022-Nagara_Angkor_Boutique_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#83 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '83'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,206,"{'1': '2', '2': '11', '3': '23', '4': '74', '5': '96'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",179,https://www.tripadv