Naia Resort - Otres II,here:pds:place:116w3ceu-5057c7693d884853888b637bd54242cb,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Naia Resort - Otres II, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.55854, 'lng': 103.55971}","[{'lat': 10.55849, 'lng': 103.55963}]",181266,"[{'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging', 'primary': True}, {'id': '550-5510-0205', 'name': 'Beach'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569337900'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://bit.ly/NaiaResortFB'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.560641,103.55934,9724803,Otres Resort,"Welcome to Otres Resort Hotel Opened in 2015, Otres Resort offers visitors to the Kingdom of Wonder a wonderful place to relax and chill like no-where else in Cambodia. The resorts’ design uses minimalist Scandinavian influences and Khmer traditional architecture to create light and comfortable environments. Adults and children alike can have fun and enjoy their holiday in large private areas, either air-conditioned indoors, or in the shade outdoors. Enjoy your breakfast, lunch or dinner at our River Side Restaurant or in your private lounge or sip on a beautiful cocktail as you watch the sun go down. We mix western with local cuisine, and combine modern with traditional dishes to give you a culinary experience you will not forget. Fresh and local ingredients are the cornerstone of our menu. During off-season the hotel may serve only breakfast and have limited menu for lunch and dinner. The pool is the centrepiece of our resort and a place where you can relax, read a book and have a drink. It has been designed with safety in mind and is child-friendly. The pool bar offers an extensive drinks menu; choose your favourite drink and enjoy it at the bar, in the pool or on one of the comfortable lounge chairs. When staying at Otres Resort, we want you to feel at home. Our team is dedicated to doing everything they can to ensure all your needs are looked after, so you have the most wonderful stay. Experience traditional Khmer hospitality in modern and bold surroundings, and create unforgettable memories for you and your family. We warmly invite you to come, stay and enjoy our unique resort.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d9724803-Reviews-Otres_Resort-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Marina Road', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Marina Road, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d9724803-Otres_Resort-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#17 of 283 hotels in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out_of': '283', 'ranking': '17'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,145,"{'1': '3', '2': '5', '3': '20', '4': '34', '5': '83'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized