Naki Suites at Silvertown,here:pds:place:116w649e-ab469ca6463c48a585dd6a59d85d2d1a,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Naki Suites at Silvertown, ផ្លូវ 400 1, 120102 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 400', 'postalCode': '120102', 'houseNumber': '1'}","{'lat': 11.54524, 'lng': 104.92604}","[{'lat': 11.54511, 'lng': 104.92606}]",22663,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,[],"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523959959'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.nakihospitality.com/silvertown'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.544828,104.92467,10756733,Naki Suites @ Silvertown,"Amongst the hotels in Phnom Penh, Naki Suites @ Silvertown stands out for its enviable position, Boeung Keng Kang 1, nearby Aeon Mall. We provide complimentary internet connection, tourist information, airport shuttle and housekeeping services. Every suite is fully furnished, equipped with a private kitchen, sunroom, safety deposit box, and minibar supplies. Our guests have access to the 13th floor rooftop, where there are facilities such as gym, Skybar and an infinity swimming pool with an amazing view of the city skyline. Our business center is equipped with multimedia technology, ideal for meetings and training courses. We are proud to be one of the best hotels that Cambodia has to offer in terms of service quality and location. The above are the reasons why our guests chose Naki Suites @ Silvertown as their home away from home.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d10756733-Reviews-Naki_Suites_Silvertown-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '251 Preah Trasak Paem St', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '251 Preah Trasak Paem St, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id':