Nakim's Tuk Tuk Tours,here:pds:place:116w636k-ffb64ba46ff2bd8ed27e4998fe6acde6,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': ""Nakim's Tuk Tuk Tours, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09421, 'lng': 103.20047}","[{'lat': 13.09417, 'lng': 103.20034}]",12327,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8872691'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855972999851'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.nakimstuktuktours.WordPress.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Battambang,13.094209,103.20045,8872691,Nakim's Tuk Tuk Tours,"Nakim offers tuk tuk tours around Battambang and the surrounding attractions including: Bamboo Train (also countryside, rice fields and small villages), Banan Temple, Ek Phnom Temple (both fantastic cultural heritage sites), Phnom Sampeau (Killing Caves, bat caves and sunset view from the top of the mountain), local produce tours (sticky rice bamboo cake, fish paste market, rice paper, rice wine).",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d8872691-Reviews-Nakim_s_Tuk_Tuk_Tours-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Battambang Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,nakimkhytuktuktours@gmail.com,+855 97 299 9851,http://www.nakimstuktuktours.WordPress.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d8872691-Nakim_s_Tuk_Tuk_Tours-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id