Nangkol Village,here:pds:place:116w649e-fb5c0030924d9fd9a187fedf69593cad,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Nangkol Village, ផ្លូវ 302 35, 120102 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 302', 'postalCode': '120102', 'houseNumber': '35'}","{'lat': 11.55298, 'lng': 104.92713}","[{'lat': 11.55312, 'lng': 104.92711}]",7067,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27124753'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598669779'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100083120387864&locale=fi_FI', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.552856,104.92456,27124753,Nangkol Village,"Nangkol Village Located in the heart of Phnom Penh in the bustling BKK1 area, Nangkol Village is a hostel offering a 3-star stay with the option of air-conditioned rooms featuring private bathrooms and wardrobes. Amenities include a shared lounge area, a separate library/working space for remote workers, terrace with a garden, a bar, and free WiFi throughout the property. Guests can enjoy a 24-hour front desk, airport transfers at an extra fee and room service. Nangkol also has a restaurant serving both Western and Asian cuisine with vegetarian options available and weekly specials on offer, open daily from 06:00-23:00. Recreational amenities include an outdoor swimming pool and loungers, a big screen TV, a pool table, and bike hire services. Nearby attractions include Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum (1.3 km), popular nightlife area Bassac Street (650m), Wat Phnom (3.1 km) and Aeon Mall Phnom Penh (1.5 km). The nearest airport is Phnom Penh International Airport, 9 km away.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d27124753-Reviews-Nangkol_Village-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No.35, Street 302', 