Naroth Beach Bungalow,here:pds:place:116w3cmj-98d8851de1044052a4f8d5cf214e3f82,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Naroth Beach Bungalow, 180405 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'កោះរុង', 'postalCode': '180405'}","{'lat': 10.74962, 'lng': 103.25497}","[{'lat': 10.7496, 'lng': 103.25483}]",88443,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0059', 'name': 'Holiday Park'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17661935'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85599558819'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/narothbeachbungalow', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.749689,103.256325,17661935,Naroth Beach Bungalow,"It is situated on the beachfront at Prek Svay village of the amazing Koh Rong Island. We are family-bungalow and half eco-friendly bungalow which is running by solar power for 18 hours per day and use bamboo straw for the drinks. We are dedicated to preserve the island’s ecosystem and try to maintain sustainable practices as much as we can. Since the electricity on the island is from diesel powered generators, we only run electricity for 6 hours per day. We have 10 private bungalows with fan. This place is considered as the paradise of relaxing place, a peaceful getaway and the best hand down spot. We do not provide party environment, but the best option for your escape from your everyday of stressful and tiring life. You could absorb fresh air here which is really good for your health and could not be found in the city. Specially, if you are looking forward to seeing sunrise from your bedroom and plankton at night, this must be your favorite spot. It must be a little bit tricky and far to come here, but it truly worth if you are looking for a quiet place.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1808558-d17661935-Reviews-Naroth_Beach_Bungalow-Koh_Rong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'N/A Prek Svay Village', 'city': 'Koh Rong', 'state': 'Koh Kong Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'N/A Prek Svay Village, Koh Rong Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Koh Rong', 'location_id': '1808558'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Koh Kong Province', 'location_id': '2366667'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1808558-d17661935-Naroth_Beach_Bungalow-Koh_Rong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '1808558', 'ranking_string': '#15 of 54 B&Bs / Inns in Koh Rong', 'geo_location_name': 'Koh Rong', 'ranking_out_of': '54', 'ranking': '15'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,9,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '1', '4': '0', '5': '7'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",37,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1808558-d17661935-m66827-Reviews-Naroth_Beach_Bungalow-Koh_Rong_Koh_Kong_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Beachfront', 'Suites', 'Restaurant', 'Pets Allowed', 'Free Wifi', 'Tennis Court', 'Laundry Service', 'Rooftop Terrace', 'Private Balcony', 'Private Beaches', 'Breakfast Available', 'Kids Stay Free', 'Badminton', 'BBQ Facilities', 'Blackout Curtains', 'Board Games / Puzzles', 'Canoeing', 'Clothes Rack', 'Coffee Shop', 'Desk', 'English', 'Entertainment Staff', 'First Aid Kit', '24-Hour Front Desk', 'Hiking', 'Khmer', 'Private Bathrooms', 'Strollers', 'Sun Deck