Natural Bungalows,here:pds:place:116aabd1-6dbcdc878a0705354d53bbe97b04eb8a,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Natural Bungalows, 070803 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់បាយ', 'postalCode': '070803'}","{'lat': 10.61486, 'lng': 104.17522}","[{'lat': 10.61492, 'lng': 104.17534}]",20492,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1838507'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512819081'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.614602,104.17472,1838507,Natural Bungalows,"Natural Bungalows is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Kampot, offering a family-friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Close to The Old Royal Cinema (0.6 mi), a popular Kampot landmark, Natural Bungalows is a great destination for tourists.
The rooms offer a minibar, air conditioning, and a seating area, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
Natural Bungalows features a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and room service. In addition, as a valued Natural Bungalows guest, you can enjoy an on-site restaurant that is available on-site. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
If you’re looking for an Asian restaurant, consider a visit to Epic Arts Cafe, Ecran Noodle and Dumpling House, or Rikitikitavi, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Natural Bungalows.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out a history museum, such as Kampot Museum.
Enjoy your stay in Kampot!
