New Apsara Guest House,here:pds:place:116d408k-757a277cc66d0fee24a5b121eaff81bf,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'New Apsara Guest House, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35728, 'lng': 103.85941}","[{'lat': 13.35715, 'lng': 103.85938}]",24269,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '600-6300-0066', 'name': 'Grocery'}, {'id': '600-6900-0247', 'name': 'Market'}]","[{'id': '101-003', 'name': 'American-Barbecue', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1635862'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563966087'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.35719,103.85939,1635862,New Apsara Guest House,"See why so many travelers make New Apsara Guest House their guest house of choice when visiting Siem Reap. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
New Apsara Guest House features a 24 hour front desk, 24 hour check-in, and room service, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts breakfast. If you are driving to New Apsara Guest House, parking is available.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Wat Preah Prom Rath (0.2 mi) and Viti's Tuk Tuk Driver (0.6 mi), guests of New Apsara Guest House can easily experience some of Siem Reap's most well known attractions.
When you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out Sam Khmer Noodles - Nom Banh Chok, Samuth Kheav BBQ, and Ashia Lounge, which are some seafood restaurants that are popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.
Plus, during your trip, don’t forget to check out some of the popular historic sites, such as Wat Thmey (Killing Fields), Angkor Thom, and Angkor Archaeological Park.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at New Apsara Guest House as you experience all of the things Siem Reap has to offer.
