New Home Hostel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-2487c8d02a530beb44ca34928012167d,en,hostel,"{'label': 'New Home Hostel, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36151, 'lng': 103.85341}","[{'lat': 13.36158, 'lng': 103.85329}]",24351,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7649811'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85595616268'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.newhomehostel.weebly.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.361521,103.85339,7649811,New Home Hostel,"The New Home Hostel is located in the heart of Siem Reap City. Offering 7 spacious and affordable rooms. These rooms are furnished with Flat Screen Tv, Hot and Cold Shower. Designed for tourist and backpackers, this hostel is very accessible to Siem Reap's Old Market, Night Market, Restaurants and bars at Pub Street by walking distance where one can indulge the fun side of Cambodia. New Home Hostel is 600 metres from the Royal Residence, 700 metres from Pub Street and 5.8 Km from Angkor Wat. Siem Reap - Angkor International Airport is 7 km away.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7649811-Reviews-New_Home_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#358 Taphul Street', 'street2': 'Taphul Village, Svay Dongkom Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '11231', 'address_string': '#358 Taphul Street Taphul Village, Svay Dongkom Commune, Siem Reap 11231 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d7649811-New_Home_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_