New Hope Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w63u5-c03a34d9615948eaa86394cdd474ee0e,en,tourist_attraction,"{'label': 'New Hope Cambodia, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.38019, 'lng': 103.86708}","[{'lat': 13.38032, 'lng': 103.8671}]",228748,"[{'id': '800-8200-0000', 'name': 'Education Facility', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0023', 'name': 'Tourist Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4582489'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517503123'}], 'www': [{'value': 'www.newhopecambodia.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.380245,103.8672,3836234,New Hope Cambodia Restaurant,"New Hope Cambodia runs the School House Cafe - a training establishment with the aim of providing a fantastic culinary experience to guests whilst giving unemployed and often uneducated Khmers valuable cooking and hospitality skills, and developing their confidence and employment opportunities. New Hope Cambodia is a grassroots Non-Government Organisation (NGO) with a mission to give children and youth free education, help them complete their studies and inspire a love of learning. The school provides free education, healthcare and family crisis care to over 600 children from the poorest areas of Siem Reap. Visitors and volunteers are welcome to experience the unique School House cafe, located on the school grounds, seven days per week (bookings are encouraged). Funds generated from the restaurant go directly to fund the New Hope Cambodia School Education program.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d3836234-Reviews-New_Hope_Cambodia_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Mondul 3 Village', 'street2': 'Slorkram Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17251', 'address_string': 'Mondul 3 Village Slorkram Commune, Siem Reap 17251 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,tours@newhopecambodia.com,+855 17 645 055,http://www.newhopecambodia.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d3836234-New_Hope_Cambodia_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#40 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '40'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,252,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '9', '4': '21', '5': '221'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",209,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d3836234-m66827-Reviews-New_Hope_Cambodia_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1600'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1600'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1600'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1600'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1600'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '1600'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2100'}}, {'ope