New Riverside Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w63u5-4e5a82caa8364b8caccc2255a3745b22,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'New Riverside Guesthouse, វិថី លោកតាណឺយ, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'វិថី លោកតាណឺយ', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35977, 'lng': 103.87207}","[{'lat': 13.35975, 'lng': 103.87221}]",23181,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12654863'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512941150'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.359747,103.87224,12654863,New Riverside Guesthouse,"Finding an ideal budget friendly guest house in Siem Reap does not have to be difficult. Welcome to New Riverside Guesthouse, a nice option for travelers like you.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as air conditioning, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the guest house.
New Riverside Guesthouse features a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and room service, to help make your stay more enjoyable. If you are driving to New Riverside Guesthouse, free parking is available.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Viti's Tuk Tuk Driver (0.9 mi) and Wat Preah Prom Rath (1.1 mi), guests of New Riverside Guesthouse can easily experience some of Siem Reap's most well known attractions.
If you like seafood restaurants, New Riverside Guesthouse is conveniently located near Samuth Kheav BBQ, Sam Khmer Noodles - Nom Banh Chok, and Ashia Lounge.
During your visit, be sure to check out Pub Street (1.2 mi), which is a popular attraction within walking distance of the guest house.
New Riverside Guesthouse puts the best of Siem Reap at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12654863-Reviews-New_Riverside_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Lork Tanoeuy Street', 'street2': 'Slorkramm Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Lork Tanoeuy Street Slorkramm Commune, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12654863-New_Riverside_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#367 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '367'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,1,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '1'}",{},0,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12654863-m66827-Reviews-New_Riverside_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Shuttle Bus Service', 'Room service', 'Free parking', 'Airport transportation', 'Free Wifi', 'Business center', 'Laundry Service', 'Concierge', 'Air conditioning', 'Family Rooms', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Safe', 'Housekeeping', 'ATM On Site', 'Baggage Storage', 'Bicycle Rental', 'Bottled Water', 'Car Hire', 'Express Check-in / Check-out', 'Convenience Store', 'Currency Exchange', 'English', '24-Hour Front Desk', 'Khmer', 'Massage', 'Newspaper', 'Private Check-in / Check-out', 'Shops', 'Street Parking', 'Thai']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'bb', 'localized_name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,['Hidden Gem'],[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name':