New World Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-6d2c7720dbfc4bf3a911622c7d31f589,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'New World Guesthouse, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.60685, 'lng': 104.17463}","[{'lat': 10.60691, 'lng': 104.17475}]",20173,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4406875'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Kampot,10.606873,104.17466,4406875,New World Guesthouse,"See why so many travelers make New World Guesthouse their guest house of choice when visiting Kampot. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
While staying at New World Guesthouse, visitors can check out The Old Royal Cinema (0.5 mi), which is a popular Kampot attraction.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as a flat screen TV and a desk.
Kampot has plenty of cafes. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Epic Arts Cafe, Simple Things, and Cafe Espresso Kampot, which are serving up some great dishes.
Kampot is also home to Kampot Art Gallery, a popular art gallery that is not too far from New World Guesthouse.
At New World Guesthouse, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Kampot.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d4406875-Reviews-New_World_Guesthouse-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Thvy Khang Tbong Village, Andong khmer Communce', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Thvy Khang Tbong Village, Andong khmer Communce, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d4406875-New_World_Guesthouse-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#75 of 148 B&Bs / Inns in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '148', 'ranking': '75'}",3,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.0-66827-5.svg,1,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '0', '5': '0'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss2.0.svg', 'value': '2.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}}",0,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d4406875-m66827-Reviews-New_World_Guesthouse-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Safe', 'Flatscreen TV', 'Bath / Shower', 'Bottled Water', 'Desk', 'English', 'French', 'Italian']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'bb', 'localized_name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,['Quaint'],[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Busi