"Nhumbai, the Village Experience",here:pds:place:116w63s9-f3016e16c0905d2bb44b2644d9c4942d,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Nhumbai, the Village Experience, 170706 ក្រឡាញ់, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'ក្រឡាញ់', 'district': 'សំបួរ', 'postalCode': '170706'}","{'lat': 13.48918, 'lng': 103.41352}","[{'lat': 13.48922, 'lng': 103.41365}]",60474,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11950171'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855976060770'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.nhumbai.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.489615,103.41275,11950171,"NhumBai, The Village Experience","Experience a day in a rural Cambodian village through walking, cycling or boating. Cultural Experience – Experience rice farming, learn traditional weaving, cook with the villagers, play traditional games and more. Have your photo taken in traditional Cambodian costume. Bicycle Experience – Cycle through the village, stopping off to learn about traditional rice noodles, rice wine and more.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d11950171-Reviews-NhumBai_The_Village_Experience-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Rural Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Rural Village, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@nhumbai.com,+855 97 606 0770,http://www.nhumbai.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d11950171-NhumBai_The_Village_Experience-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#410 of 1,339 Tours in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1339', 'ranking': '410'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,70,"{'1': '3', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '0', '5': '66'}",Not available,85,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d11950171-m66827-Reviews-NhumBai_The_Village_Experience-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Cultural Tours', 'localized_name': 'Cultural Tours'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '1'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '14'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '15'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '14'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '10'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,31,20
Nice Guest House,here:pds:place:116w649g-b622ce072d474af99a74630fb73d7b4f,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Nice Guest House, ផ្លូវ 198, 120308 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ប្រាំពីរ មករា', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងព្រលឹត', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 198', 'postalCode': '120308'}","{'lat': 11.56157, 'lng': 104.91839}","[{'lat': 11.56116, 'lng': 104.91839}]",5959,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1796711'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523211911'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.561561,104.91845,1796711,Nice Guest House,"Nice Guest House is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Phnom Penh, offering a family-friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Guest rooms offer a flat screen TV, air conditioning, and a desk, and Nice Guest House makes getting online easy as free wifi is available.
You can also take advantage of some of the amenities offered by the guest house, including 24 hour check-in, room service, and baggage storage. In addition, guests can enjoy an on-site restaurant during their visit. As an added convenience, there is parking available to guests.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Champey Academy of Arts (0.6 mi) and Wat Langka (0.9 mi), guests of Nice Guest House can easily experience some of Phnom Penh's most well known attractions.
Phnom Penh has plenty of Italian restaurants. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Brooklyn Pizza & Bistro, Piccola Italia Da Luigi, and Oskar Bistro, which are serving up some great dishes.
If you’re looking for something to do, Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum (0.9 mi), Royal Palace (0.8 mi), and Central Market (1.1 mi) are a nice way to spend some time, and they are all within walking distance of Nice Guest House.
Enjoy your stay in Phnom Penh!
