Night Top Star 7,here:pds:place:116w65rh-d97248ee7ff84f68a46d116d38ffc6f3,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Night Top Star 7, 100603 ក្រចេះ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ក្រចេះ', 'city': 'ក្រចេះ', 'district': 'ក្រចេះ', 'postalCode': '100603'}","{'lat': 12.4833, 'lng': 106.017}","[{'lat': 12.48345, 'lng': 106.01736}]",114401,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577959576'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.hengthom.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kratie,12.486624,106.01643,1236088,Oudom Sambath Hotel,"If you’re looking for a budget friendly hotel in Kratie , look no further than Oudom Sambath Hotel.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning and a refrigerator, and you can stay connected during your stay as Oudom Sambath Hotel offers guests free wifi.
The hotel features a concierge. Plus, Oudom Sambath Hotel offers an on-site restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
While staying in Kratie , you can check out a popular deli like Mlob Dong, which is serving up some great dishes.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out Phnom Sombok (0.0 mi), a popular attraction that is within walking distance of Oudom Sambath Hotel.
The staff at Oudom Sambath Hotel looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
