Nika's House,here:pds:place:116w63gg-3d732ac8ff5b4828bac8796ccc13b702,en,hostel,"{'label': ""Nika's House, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34833, 'lng': 103.85093}","[{'lat': 13.34832, 'lng': 103.85107}]",88064,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12381693'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570779767'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.nikashouse.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.348333,103.850945,12381693,Nika's House,"We’ve been trying to offer the best accommodation service which is run by our local family with great facilities, our onsite swimming pool is newly built and our restaurant which serves Khmer Authentic food with reasonable price. At Nika’s House, our guests will find a friendly environment with a lush garden, shared lounge which allowed everyone to experience local life with us, we have a room with balcony, garden view, pool view, and with a designated smoking area. Our rooms are equipped with air-conditioning, private bathroom, flat screen TV, with the fast speed WiFi. At Nika’s house we aim to offer the best service to our guests we can as we “our customer’s satisfaction is our happiness” Our guests can find us easily, just 900 meters southern of the old market, or it’s just 7-minute walk to town, it’s located in a safe and peaceful area. We are quite close to the World heritage site, and all the main attractions, Angkor Wat 7km, and the international airport is 8km from our property.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12381693-Reviews-Nika_s_House-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Smiling circuit', 'street2': 'Svay Dong Kom Commnune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia