Nirvana Bungalows,here:pds:place:116w3cky-b2be46a878af45999b6c16180dc15627,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Nirvana Bungalows, 180405 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'កោះរុង', 'postalCode': '180405'}","{'lat': 10.70212, 'lng': 103.31203}","[{'lat': 10.702, 'lng': 103.31198}]",93153,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17655714'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855968948420'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.nirvanabungalowskohrong.com'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.703618,103.31265,17655714,Nirvana Bungalows,"Nestled in a quiet jungle orchard, Nirvana Bungalows is just a quick stroll away from one of the most stunning beaches in the world, Coconut Beach, Koh Rong. Your Bungalow is equipped with 1 or 2 large double beds, fan(s), private bathroom and balcony. Coconut Beach is an idyllic island paradise with crystal clear blue ocean waters, silky white sand beaches and a tropical jungle wilderness.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1808558-d17655714-Reviews-Nirvana_Bungalows-Koh_Rong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Coconut Beach', 'city': 'Koh Rong', 'state': 'Koh Kong Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Coconut Beach, Koh Rong Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Koh Rong', 'location_id': '1808558'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Koh Kong Province', 'location_id': '2366667'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1808558-d17655714-Nirvana_Bungalows-Koh_Rong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '1808558', 'ranking_string': '#27 of 54 B&Bs / Inns in Koh Rong', 'geo_location_name': 'Koh Rong', 'ranking_out_of': '54', 'ranking': '27'}",3,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.0-66827-5.svg,2,"{