Nita Dream Villa,here:pds:place:116w63gg-238d3972b2a449a1a25c85795cbebffc,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Nita Dream Villa, 171206 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ជ្រាវ', 'postalCode': '171206'}","{'lat': 13.33719, 'lng': 103.87705}","[{'lat': 13.33706, 'lng': 103.87704}]",24883,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17353787'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85567346060'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.nitadreamvilla.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.337165,103.87705,17353787,Nita Dream Villa,"Our four villas have a modern design, all with private rooms and your own balcony overlooking our courtyard garden. Villas are equipped with a minibar and free fast WiFi. All villas come with air-conditioning, ceiling fans, a flat-screen TV, modern bathrooms with hot water and a separate lounge area. Enjoy sunset drinks from your balcony. Our villas also include slipper and toiletry",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d17353787-Reviews-Nita_Dream_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Tolaka Street', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': 'Tolaka Street, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d17353787-Nita_Dream_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},14,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d17353787-m66827-Reviews-Nita_Dream_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Interne