Nita by Vo Luxury Hotel,here:pds:place:116w63u5-3a8d07dd010748cb9ddbae05769e1659,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Nita by Vo Luxury Hotel, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.3822, 'lng': 103.86079}","[{'lat': 13.38207, 'lng': 103.86076}]",22139,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4945436'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515513518'}, {'value': '+85595888807'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.nitabyvo.com'}, {'value': 'www.nitabyvo.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.38264,103.86078,4945436,Nita by VO Hotel,"Nita by Vo Hotel, the awards winning luxury boutique hotel, located near the renowned 12th century ruins of Angkor, a UNESCO World Heritage site and in the Green Belt area of Siem Reap (on the edge of the Angkor Wat Forest). Nita by Vo, is a collection of the finest Siem Reap has to offer, from Hand Made Bricks, Terrazzo, natural Stone and fine Timber, to our organic handmade amenities and well trained Staff. At Nita by Vo, we work closely with the local communities in supporting their products. Our in room artwork is a showcase from local student artists who have captured the essence of the Khmer life, as they see it. All the Guest Room accessories are created and made in Siem Reap by local Artisans. Our ambition is that guests of Nita by Vo will collect meaningful experiences that remain in their hearts long after they leave us. More than building a very comfortable place to sleep in, we sincerely hope to create exceptional memories for every guest every single day.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d4945436-Reviews-Nita_by_VO_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sivutha Boulevard', 'street2': 'Road To Angkor Wat Temple', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17000', 'address_string': 'Sivutha Boulevard Road To Angkor Wat Temple, Siem Reap 17000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d4945436-Nita_by_VO_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#63 of 763 hotels in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '763', 'ranking': '63'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,904,"{'1': '2', '2': '2', '3': '3', '4': '43', '5': '854'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",901,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d4945436-m66827-Reviews-Nita_by_VO_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Room service', 