No One Love,here:pds:place:116w63jr-176d4295ddfd483da397da0f229f6de8,en,gallery,"{'label': 'No One Love, 010806 សិរីសោភ័ណ្ឌ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បន្ទាយមានជ័យ', 'city': 'សិរីសោភ័ណ្ឌ', 'district': 'ព្រះពន្លា', 'postalCode': '010806'}","{'lat': 13.5833, 'lng': 102.983}","[{'lat': 13.58327, 'lng': 102.983}]",110801,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578213886'}]}],Not Available,Banteay Meanchey,13.587435,102.96859,3446973,Botoum Hotel,"Botoum Hotel is an ideal spot from which to discover Banteay Meanchey. Situated only 00.00 Km from the city center, guests are well located to enjoy the town's attractions and activities. With its convenient location, the hotel offers easy access to the city's must-see destinations.At Botoum Hotel, the excellent service and superior facilities make for an unforgettable stay. While lodging at this wonderful property, guests can enjoy laundry service/dry cleaning, car park, Wi-Fi in public areas.Botoum Hotel is home to 24 bedrooms, all tastefully furnished to provide comforts such as complimentary bottled water, refrigerator, internet access - wireless (complimentary), shower, desk. Besides, the hotel's host of recreational offerings ensures you have plenty to do during your stay. Superb facilities and an excellent location make the Botoum Hotel the perfect base from which to enjoy your stay in Banteay Meanchey. Botoum Hotel has only one Location and No other Branch. Now we have serving breakfast and lunch.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1075851-d3446973-Reviews-Botoum_Hotel-Sisophon_Banteay_Meanchey_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Highway 5 / National Highway 6 Junction', 'city': 'Sisophon', 'state': 'Banteay Meanchey Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'National Highway 5 / National Highway 6 Junction, Sisophon Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Sisophon', 'locat