Noir Coffee 1928,here:pds:place:116w63u5-1d5318fa8fa64fdeb7e52e031ad0307a,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Noir Coffee 1928, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.36105, 'lng': 103.86058}","[{'lat': 13.36111, 'lng': 103.86045}]",23870,"[{'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12661669'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5973472'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85595545151'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT14H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.361035,103.86062,12661669,Noir Coffee 1928,"Speciality coffee doesn't just happen: it requires time, resources, dedication and an incredible team who cares about preserving quality from seed to sip. Noir Coffee fell in love with speciality coffee in Siem Reap, serve the best coffee lover. The process, and taste all serving locally roasted coffee and pastries baked each day, we're doing something that no one else has done before.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d12661669-Reviews-Noir_Coffee_1928-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Achar Sva St', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17251', 'address_string': 'Achar Sva St, Siem Reap 17251 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@noir-coffee.com,+855 95 545 151,http://www.noir-coffee.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12661669-Noir_Coffee_1928-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string