Nordic House,here:pds:place:116aabd1-3cba2bf002e9047f650feca662e504c4,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Nordic House, ផ្លូវ 138, 120402 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ទួលគោក', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារដេប៉ូទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 138', 'postalCode': '120402'}","{'lat': 11.56654, 'lng': 104.9061}","[{'lat': 11.56642, 'lng': 104.90611}]",4581,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1371777'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85585523998'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.nordic-cambodia.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.56639,104.90611,1371777,Nordic House,"Nordic House is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Phnom Penh, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
While staying at Nordic House, visitors can check out Champey Academy of Arts (1.4 mi) and Wat Langka (1.4 mi), some of Phnom Penh's top attractions.
Guest rooms offer air conditioning, and Nordic House makes getting online easy as free wifi is available.
In addition, guests can enjoy a lounge during their visit.
Travelers looking to enjoy some oyster can head to Romdeng, Topaz, or Oskar Bistro. Otherwise, you may want to check out a Mediterranean restaurant such as Casablanca restaurant, Terrazza, or Il Forno.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Bophana Center (1.2 mi) or Al-Serkal Mosque (1.0 mi), which are popular attractions amongst tourists, and they are all within walking distance.
Enjoy your stay in Phnom Penh!
