Number 9 Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-70f87658ed9e064bd142c1c4256d228a,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Number 9 Hotel, ផ្លូវ 258, 120207 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ចតុមុខ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 258', 'postalCode': '120207'}","{'lat': 11.55988, 'lng': 104.93398}","[{'lat': 11.55975, 'lng': 104.93398}]",59266,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2366014'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523984999'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.number9hotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.559892,104.933975,2366014,Number 9 Hotel,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Phnom Penh, Number 9 Hotel is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its proximity to great restaurants and attractions, Number 9 Hotel makes it easy to enjoy the best of Phnom Penh.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer a flat screen TV and air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as Number 9 Hotel offers guests free wifi.
Plus, Number 9 Hotel offers a rooftop pool and a lounge, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Silver Pagoda (0.2 mi) and Bassac Lane (0.6 mi), guests of Number 9 Hotel can easily experience some of Phnom Penh's most well known attractions.
Phnom Penh has plenty of seafood restaurants. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Malis Cambodian Restaurant, Le Broken Plate, and Nesat Seafood House, which are serving up some great dishes.
Looking to explore? Then look no further than Royal Palace (0.3 mi), which is a popular Phnom Penh attraction – and it is conveniently located within walking distance of the small hotel.
Number 9 Hotel is sure to make your visit to Phnom Penh one worth remembering.
