Nyny Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-4327eb9b7b504109ab0eb0125d8488b2,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Nyny Guesthouse, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60706, 'lng': 104.18383}","[{'lat': 10.60719, 'lng': 104.18379}]",19268,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2541631'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Kampot,10.607101,104.18382,2541631,NYNY Guesthouse,"NYNY Guesthouse is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Kampot, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
NYNY Guesthouse is a budget friendly guest house offering a refrigerator, a minibar, and air conditioning in the rooms, and it is easy to stay connected during your stay as free wifi is offered to guests.
The guest house features a 24 hour front desk, room service, and a concierge. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
Travelers looking to enjoy some hotpot can head to Veronica's Kitchen. Otherwise, you may want to check out a seafood restaurant such as Tertulia Restaurant Kampot, Atelier Kampot, or The Fishmarket.
Best of all, NYNY Guesthouse makes it easy to experience some great Kampot attractions like The Old Royal Cinema, which is a popular historic site.
Enjoy your stay in Kampot!
