O'Yes Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w649g-282771146b9541468a9317c2ac544aef,en,motel,"{'label': ""O'Yes Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 132, 120401 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ទួលគោក', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារដេប៉ូទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 132', 'postalCode': '120401'}","{'lat': 11.57336, 'lng': 104.90435}","[{'lat': 11.57331, 'lng': 104.90419}]",4430,"[{'id': '500-5000-0054', 'name': 'Motel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510887889'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.565726,104.89295,7986343,O'Yes Guesthouse,"Finding an ideal small hotel in Phnom Penh does not have to be difficult. Welcome to O'Yes Guesthouse, a nice option for travelers like you.
As your “home away from home,” the small hotel rooms offer air conditioning, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk and baggage storage while staying at O'Yes Guesthouse. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Phnom Penh, O'Yes Guesthouse is located a short distance from Wat Phnom (1.9 mi) and Central Market (1.9 mi).
Phnom Penh has plenty of cafes. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Cousin's Burger & Coffee, Daughters of Cambodia Visitor Centre Café, and Vibe Cafe, which are serving up some great dishes.
Should time allow, Mila Craft Workshop (Rubber stamp and Making Bath Bombs) is a popular attraction that is within walking distance.
O'Yes Guesthouse puts the best of Phnom Penh at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
