Oasis Garden Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-26be7761b2170040d9736899829f4639,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Oasis Garden Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 33 អេ, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 33 អេ', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.4899, 'lng': 104.32188}","[{'lat': 10.48992, 'lng': 104.32174}]",127756,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7077737'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855975357570'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://kepoasisgarden.wordpress.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.489913,104.32182,7077737,Oasis Garden GuestHouse,"Oasis Garden GuestHouse is located only a few steps from the pier to go to Rabbit Island, only 5 min by motorbike from the wonderful Kep Beach, and its famous Crab Market. A green oasis located at the foot of the Kep National Park, where you will have amazing walks in the green nature of Cambodia, discover the Saline Salt Production, the Fishermen Village or the plantation of the famous Kampot pepper, and a lot more ... Oasis Garden GuestHouse is a piece of heaven, located in the middle of a luxuriant vegetation of fruit trees and Cambodian nature. Providing a park of more than 5000 sq m, you may read in a hammock under the shadow of a tree, appreciate a moment of relaxation under our Sala, or take a break at the bar / restaurant to discover our homemade French pastries. Sandrine and Stéphane, the new owners, offer you individual bungalows totally revoved and 1 dorm with 3 single beds and 1 double bed at a reasonable price, including a welcome drink and in all the rooms warm water / air conditioner / free WiFi / water bottles available ... A relaxing spot, in the middle of a peaceful and wide tropical garden, ideal after visiting the crazy and crowded Cambodian towns.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d7077737-Reviews-Oasis_Garden_GuestHouse-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 33A Road', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07503', 'address_string': 'No. 33A Road, Kep 07503 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d7077737-Oasis_Garden_GuestHouse-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_string': '#7 of 48 Specialty lodging in Kep', 'geo_location_name': 'Kep', 'ranking_out_of': '48', 'ranking': '7'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,62,"{'1': '0', '2': '2', '3': '5', '4': '17', '5': '38'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",99,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d7077737-m66827-Reviews-Oasis_Garden_GuestHouse-Kep_Kep_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Public Wifi', 'Concierge', 'Shuttle Bus Service', 'Room service', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Airport transportation', 'Free Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Family Rooms', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Breakfast Available']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'other', 'localized_name': 'Specialty Lodging'}]",Not available,"['Business', 'Trendy']",[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '2'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '20'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '20'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '3'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '13'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,29,8
Obt Chiro Village Homestay,here:pds:place:116aabd1-4fe006baeab500bf4cc28782d14e7d72,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Obt Chiro Village Homestay, ផ្លូវ 308, 250604 ត្បូងឃ្មុំ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ត្បូងឃ្មុំ', 'city': 'ត្បូងឃ្មុំ', 'district': 'ជីរោទីមួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 308', 'postalCode': '250604'}","{'lat': 12.01399, 'lng': 105.49301}","[{'lat': 12.01388, 'lng': 105.49308}]",26467,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7618976'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517319194'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/obtchiro'}]}]",Not Available,Tboung Khmum,12.014153,105.4929,7618976,OBT Chiro Village Homestay,"Staying at OBT (Organisation for Basic Training) is an unforgettable experience for travellers who are interested in gaining a meaningful insight into Khmer rural life. Located in Chiro village, near Kampong Cham, you can stay in one of our private bungalows or a homestay with a lovely local family. This small village is side to Mekong River. We built school classes, organic farm and the purpose of this NGO and village is to teach children about english and lifestyle. All the money goes towards supporting our NGO school which provides English and Khmer classes to underprivileged local children. Accommodation price list: * Coconut bungalow: $20 per night (one bed). Includes private bungalow with bathroom (equipped with towel, shampoo, soap, toothbrush + toothpaste), double mattress, mosquito net, fan, hammock, water and bucket style shower. Banana et Papaya bungalows: $20 per night (one bed). Includes private bungalow with bathroom (equipped with towel, shampoo, soap, toothbrush + toothpaste), double mattress, mosquito net, fan, hammock, water and bucket style shower. Sky bungalow: $25 bungalow. Includes private bungalow with bathroom (equipped with towel, shampoo, soap, toothbrush + toothpaste), double mattress, mosquito net, fan, hammock, water and bucket style shower. Corn bungalow: 30$ per night up to 4 people (2 double beds). Includes private bungalow with bathroom (equipped with towel, shampoo, soap, toothbrush + toothpaste), double mattress, mosquito net, fan, hammock, water and bucket style shower. Jackfruit bungalow: 30$ per night up to 4 people (2 double beds). Includes private bungalow with bathroom (equipped with towel, shampoo, soap, toothbrush + toothpaste), double mattress, mosquito net, fan, hammock, water and bucket style shower. *Family homestay: $10/bed. Includes double mattress, mosquito net, fan, shared bathroom in a local families home. Food price list: - Breakfast $4/person - Lunch $6/person - Dinner $6/person - Drinks and snacks from 1$ to 2.5$",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g659642-d7618976-Reviews-OBT_Chiro_Village_Homestay-Kampong_Cham_Kampong_Cham_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Chirokrom 2, Chiro 1, Tbong Khmum', 'city': 'Kampong Cham', 'state': 'Kampong Cham Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Chirokrom 2, Chiro 1, Tbong Khmum, Kampong Cham Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampong Cham', 'location_id': '659642'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampong Cham Province', 'location_id': '2366656'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g659642-d7618976-OBT_Chiro_Village_Homestay-Kampong_Cham_Kampong_Cham_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '659642', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 15 B&Bs / Inns in Kampong Cham', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampong Cham', 'ranking_out_of': '15', 'ranking': '1'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,101,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '1', '4': '11', '5': '88'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sle