Ocean Box Cafe,here:pds:place:116httek-da80dbecf2cb0c81f7448d54316b6a1f,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Ocean Box Cafe, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.618, 'lng': 103.54697}","[{'lat': 10.61788, 'lng': 103.5469}]",87557,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0006', 'name': 'Deli'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '101-000', 'name': 'American'}, {'id': '800-057', 'name': 'Pizza'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10559288'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570357523'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT14H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Preah Sihanouk,10.617938,103.54694,10559288,Ocean Box Cafe,Ocean Box Cafe offers freshly baked pastries and cake throughout the day. We pride ourselves in our coffee bean quality. We want you to start your day of right with a freshly brewed cup of coffee. We love to see you smile while enjoying great foods and a cup of coffee. We hope to see your there someday and then everyday. We are apart of your life. #shareyourrmoments #oceanboxcafe,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g325573-d10559288-Reviews-Ocean_Box_Cafe-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Mitapheap Street', 'street2': 'Sangkat 4', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Mitapheap Street Sangkat 4, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,oceanboxcafe@gmai