Oh Neil's Riverside,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-df8e39a18fe846209d6fc7754aa7eb99,en,guest_house,"{'label': ""Oh Neil's Riverside, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.59667, 'lng': 104.18699}","[{'lat': 10.5968, 'lng': 104.18696}]",18486,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining'}, {'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel'}]","[{'id': '101-003', 'name': 'American-Barbecue', 'primary': True}, {'id': '800-078', 'name': 'Grill'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12141067'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855319253000'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.596669,104.18699,12141067,Oh Neil's Riverside,"Oh Neil's Riverside is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Kampot, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as The Old Royal Cinema (0.9 mi) and Farm Link (1.5 mi), guests of Oh Neil's Riverside can easily experience some of Kampot's most well known attractions.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as Oh Neil's Riverside offers guests free wifi.
The guest house features room service, baggage storage, and newspaper. Plus, Oh Neil's Riverside offers an on-site restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
Travelers looking to enjoy some tapas can head to Deva Cafe. Otherwise, you may want to check out an Asian restaurant such as Epic Arts Cafe, Ecran Noodle and Dumpling House, or Rikitikitavi.
Best of all, Oh Neil's Riverside makes it easy to experience some great Kampot attractions like Kampot Museum, which is a popular history museum.
Enjoy your stay in Kampot!
