Okay Guesthouse Phnom Penh,here:pds:place:116w649g-498e6be751b44273ba5cf20df283a05f,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Okay Guesthouse Phnom Penh, ផ្លូវ 258, 120207 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ចតុមុខ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 258', 'postalCode': '120207'}","{'lat': 11.55988, 'lng': 104.93426}","[{'lat': 11.55975, 'lng': 104.93426}]",73850,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '776406'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523986534', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}, {'value': '+85577519967'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.okay-guesthouse.com', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}, {'value': 'www.okay-guesthouse.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.559806,104.93426,776406,Okay Guesthouse,"Welcome to Okay Guesthouse Phnom Penh, your Phnom Penh “home away from home.” Okay Guesthouse Phnom Penh aims to make your visit as relaxing and enjoyable as possible, which is why so many guests continue to come back year after year.
Close to some of Phnom Penh's most popular landmarks, such as Silver Pagoda (0.3 mi) and Bassac Lane (0.6 mi), Okay Guesthouse Hotel is a great destination for tourists.
Rooms at Okay Guesthouse Phnom Penh offer air conditioning providing exceptional comfort and convenience, and guests can go online with free wifi.
A 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and baggage storage are some of the conveniences offered at this guest house. An on-site restaurant will also help to make your stay even more special.
Phnom Penh has plenty of cafes. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Cousin's Burger & Coffee, Daughters of Cambodia Visitor Centre Café, and Backyard Cafe, which are serving up some great dishes.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Royal Palace (0.4 mi), which is a popular attraction amongst tourists, and it is within walking distance.
Okay Guesthouse Phnom Penh puts the best of Phnom Penh at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
