Oko Gallery,here:pds:place:116w63gg-3ac49426584148fc8e16ab8dd26f500b,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Oko Gallery, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35494, 'lng': 103.85965}","[{'lat': 13.35482, 'lng': 103.85959}]",226668,"[{'id': '600-6600-0078', 'name': 'Home Decor Store', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511990068'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.353197,103.85439,1809213,Diwo Gallery,"Diwo Gallery 1 features a selection of the most refined Khmer statue and Buddha's.And displays home decor, books and a permanent exhibition of Thierry Diwo's photography. Located at 5 minutes from the center of Siem Reap the gallery has two terraces, and a nice garden.Diwo Gallery 2 is now open, located in the city center river side, next to the old market, between Monument Books and Ta Prohm Hotel. Sokha and Thierry welcome you warmly, they give intesting commentary. Free pick up by car possible",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d1809213-Reviews-Diwo_Gallery-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Tonle Sap Road and Town Center', 'street2': 'Wat Svay', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '855', 'address_string': 'Tonle Sap Road and Town Center Wat Svay, Siem Reap 855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@diwogallery.com,+855 92 930 799,http://www.diwogallery.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d1809213-Diwo_Gallery-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#79 of 200 things to do in Siem Reap', 'geo_location