Old Khmer Wooden House,here:pds:place:116aabd1-d8297eda77fb00e10d2dadb36d8766cc,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Old Khmer Wooden House, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36185, 'lng': 103.85327}","[{'lat': 13.36178, 'lng': 103.85323}]",24333,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510879771'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.363854,103.866196,8529695,Old Khmer Wooden House 2Beds & Breakfast,"House is my naturally of my old traditional Khmer wooden house in Cambodia. Unique and comfortable one in the middle of Siem Reap City. Family twin bed rooms, Living room, Balcony, Garden, Air-con, Fan and a very clean and good service. 

THE SPACE 
Whole traditional wooden House 
Private only 
Home service 
Quite location 
House designed 
An old but very clean and comfortable 
The middle of city 

GUEST ACCESS 
Market, shop, restaurant, near by 
Just 10 minutes by bike will arriving the pub street area 
Tuk Tuk, motor driver easy to find 

INTERACTION WITH GUESTS 
Staying at okHouseBiz BNB you will get warm relax with your private house and we FREE offer as 

Pick up 1 way from Airport to house (Flight info requirement) 
Welcome drink 
Local breakfast 
Tea, coffee &amp; milk making 
Drinking water (1 bottle each per day) 
Shower warm towel 
WiFi

THE NEIGHBORHOOD 
Neighbors around are friendly 
Smiling from local people for foreigner and every body 

GETTING AROUND 
House Address: MEN&#39;s Rd, Sangkat Slakram, Next to Men Resort &amp; Spa (100m). Pub Street is 1.6 km from the house, while Angkor Wat is 5 km away. The nearest airport is Siem Reap - Angkor International Airport, 8 km from the house.

HOUSE RULES
Keep silent 
No smoking inside the house 
No drug 
Not allow for pet or animal 
Clean 
Inform to the owner first before you need extra decor something in the house 

OTHER THINGS TO NOTE 
Turn off everything before go out side as window, door &amp; electricity. 
Breakfast arrange every morning at 7:30AM keep at your balcony. 
Extra bed charge 10 USD including breakfast. 
Lunch &amp; Dinner start from 10:00AM until 9:00PM. 
Tea, Coffee &amp; Water is free but in Mini bar is charge.
Late check is possible in case house available and charge 2USD per hour.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/VacationRentalReview-g297390-d8529695-Old_Khmer_Wooden_House_2Beds_Breakfast-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d8529695-Old_Khmer_Wooden_House_2Beds_Breakfast-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,7,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '7'}",{},4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/VacationRentalReview-g297390-d8529695-m66827-Old_Khmer_Wooden_House_2Beds_Breakfast-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'vr', 'localized_name': 'vacation rentals'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '1'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '1'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,29,20
Om Samol Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3fh7-970d6d8413994d998373c14627429186,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Om Samol Guesthouse, អេអេច123, 070202 ទឹកឈូរ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'ទឹកឈូរ', 'district': 'ជុំក្រៀល', 'street': 'អេអេច123', 'postalCode': '070202'}","{'lat': 10.60811, 'lng': 104.19518}","[{'lat': 10.60824, 'lng': 104.19515}]",18206,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3317799'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Kampot,10.608033,104.19519,3317799,Om Samol Guesthouse,"Finding an ideal small hotel in Kampot does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Om Samol Guesthouse, a nice option for travelers like you.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Kampot, Om Samol Guesthouse is located a short distance from The Old Royal Cinema (1.0 mi) and Farm Link (1.6 mi).
Guest rooms offer a refrigerator and air conditioning.
You can also take advantage of some of the amenities offered by the small hotel, including a 24 hour front desk and baggage storage.
While in Kampot be sure to experience local shawarma favorites at Aroma House.
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular history museums such as Kampot Museum.
Om Samol Guesthouse looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Kampot.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d3317799-Reviews-Om_Samol_Guesthouse-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Samrourng Village,Chum kril Commune,Teok Chhou District', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Samrourng Village,Chum kril Commune,Teok Chhou District, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d3317799-Om_Samol_Guesthouse-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#84 of 148 B&Bs / Inns in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '148', 'ranking': '84'}",1,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/1.0-66827-5.svg,1,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '0'}",{},1,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d3317799-m66827-Reviews-Om_Samol_Guesthouse-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Shuttle Bus Service', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Air conditioning', 'Refrigerator in room', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Safe', 'Baggage Storage', 'Bath / Shower', 'Complimentary Toiletries', '24-Hour Front Desk']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'bb', 'localized_name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,['Quaint'],[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '1'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",Not available,Not available,Not available,FALSE,1