Om Sweet Home,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-94a72f910f3546d28befba59b9a63738,it,accommodation,"{'label': 'Om Sweet Home, 070803 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់បាយ', 'postalCode': '070803'}","{'lat': 10.61729, 'lng': 104.17451}","[{'lat': 10.61725, 'lng': 104.17438}]",25498,"[{'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+855884391919'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://omsweethomerooms.wordpress.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.617864,104.17569,13005808,Om Sweet Home Rooms,"Om Sweet Home is a homestay run by an Italian family that welcomes you with great breakfasts and tasty Italian, Indian and Khmer homemade dishes. You can rent a scooter and enjoy the experience to explore Kampot and its beautiful countryside where you can see the best local spots: caves, nature, culture, food, hidden lakes where you can swim, pepper plantations and more! Om Sweet Home even offers amazing tours with specialized guides throughout Cambodia by booking directly the local buses with on-site pick-up with the possibility to move anywhere in Cambodia, Vietnam, Laos and Thailand. All this and more in Om Sweet Home where all the world is welcome!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d13005808-Reviews-Om_Sweet_Home_Rooms-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '735 Street', 'street2': 'Kampong Bay', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': '735 Street Kampong Bay, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d13005808-Om_Sweet_Home_Rooms-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=668