', 'Meeting rooms', 'Hot Tub', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Concierge', 'Banquet Room', 'Air conditioning', 'Family Rooms', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Accessible rooms', 'Refrigerator in room', 'Minibar', 'Conference Facilities', 'Safe', 'Swimup Bar', 'Flatscreen TV', 'Breakfast Buffet', 'Poolside Bar', 'Private Balcony', 'Butler Service', 'Outdoor pool', 'Breakfast Available', 'Parking', 'Free Shuttle or Taxi Services', 'Facilities for Disabled Guests', 'Housekeeping', 'Kids Club', 'Massage', 'Private Beaches', 'Beach Access']",Not available,Sokha Hotels & Resorts Group,Sokha Hotels & Resorts,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"['Park View', 'Bay View']",[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '85'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '828'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '87'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '376'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '255'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,23,15
On the Rocks,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-97cddc02cd084cc0a65a16097c39224c,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'On the Rocks, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.60673, 'lng': 103.52088}","[{'lat': 10.60686, 'lng': 103.52089}]",105167,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6278061'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510743397'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.606472,103.52086,6278061,On The Rocks,"On The Rocks is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Sihanoukville, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as On The Rocks offers guests free wifi.
Plus, On The Rocks offers an on-site restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as CJ Outlet and Jewelry Center (1.1 mi) and Wat Leu Temple (2.0 mi), guests of On The Rocks can easily experience some of Sihanoukville's most well known attractions.
If you’re looking for a Chinese restaurant, consider a visit to Treasure Island Seafood, Chhne Meas, or Pho Samaki, which are all conveniently located a short distance from On The Rocks.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Wat Krom Temple, which is a popular ancient ruins amongst tourists.
Enjoy your stay in Sihanoukville!
