On the Way Bar&Café,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-870afe087d5940c0a1fdf884c408b2cb,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'On the Way Bar&Café, ផ្លូវ ឯករាជ្យ, 180402 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ឯករាជ្យ', 'postalCode': '180402'}","{'lat': 10.62398, 'lng': 103.52357}","[{'lat': 10.62385, 'lng': 103.52354}]",87258,"[{'id': '200-2000-0368', 'name': 'Cocktail Lounge', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515966899'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.609427,103.51033,2198077,The Deck Tapas Bar,"The Deck Tapas Bar is situated on one of Cambodia's most beautiful beaches and enjoys spectacular 180° views of the Gulf and the pristine sand of Sokha Beach.An international tapas style cuisine is on offer as are sensational cocktails, wines from all over the world and the excellent service that only the Khmer people can offer. ""The Deck"" offers multi-seating and dining styles from lounges, tables, daybeds to laid back beach dining on the sand. Enjoy a luxurious private seafront view with international tapas dishes and specialised seafood tapas cuisine. Experience the al fresco style romantic ambience of the waves massaging the sand of Sokha Beach or dine indoors in air conditioned comfort.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g325573-d2198077-Reviews-The_Deck_Tapas_Bar-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sokha Beach Resort, Street 2 Thnou', 'street2': 'Sokha Beach Resort', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Sokha Beach Resort, Street 2 Thnou Sokha Beach Resort, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Co