Outback Bar & Bistro,here:pds:place:116d408k-8148428fb7f80c26b46c8dbb3b216c32,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Outback Bar & Bistro, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.60888, 'lng': 103.52244}","[{'lat': 10.60879, 'lng': 103.52234}]",87795,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '800-056', 'name': 'Steak House', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517678218'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.605348,103.52128,4402683,Bamboo Bar,"Welcome to Bamboo Bar on the cruise ship Sunny Boat! Large selection of cocktails, high-quality alcohol. Come aboard to a large three-deck comfortable boat and embark on a journey through the islands of the Siam Bay, Kingdom of Cambodia! Enjoy our various cocktails on the cruise boat Sunny Boat, floating with us on a sea cruise, with breakfast and lunch directly on the ship. You can sunbathe and relax on the upper deck with a glass of tropical cocktail, or another refreshing drink, ordering in Bamboo Bar. Take a swim in the bay of Koh Rong and Koh Rong Samloem, with colorful sandy beaches. In the cruise program: visiting three islands, a buffet, snorkeling, a foam party and Bamboo full cocktail bar all along the cruise trip. Tickets for the tour at a price only $ 27 for sale on the main pier of the city of Sihanoukville (Serendipity pier), and before sailing the boat (at 9:30 am). See you soon in Bamboo Bar!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g325573-d4402683-Reviews-Bamboo_Bar-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Serendipity Pier', 'street2': 'Main pier of the city', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Serendipity Pier Main pier of the city, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@bamboobar.ru,+855 68 686 975,http://www.bamboobar.ru,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d4402683-Bamboo_Bar-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#7 of 275 Places to Eat in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out_of': '275', 'ranking': '7'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,134,"{'1': '3', '2': '1', '3': '8', '4': '18', '5': '104'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",145,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g325573-d4402683-m66827-Reviews-Bamboo_Bar-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html#photos,$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2359'}}], 'weekd