Ou’Sinlair Waterfall or 7-level waterfall,Not available,Not available,tourist_attraction,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Ratanakiri,,,Not available,Not available,"Ou’Sinlair Waterfall is located in Lum Phat district, about 30km south-west of Banlung. There was no good road...",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://tourismcambodia.org/storage/uploads/contents/thumb/187-thumb245x150-shutterstock-1193171353.png,TRUE,42,19
Ox Cart Adventure Tours,here:pds:place:116w63gg-b6b36bd83001482caf6e75174319e817,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Ox Cart Adventure Tours, 171206 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ជ្រាវ', 'postalCode': '171206'}","{'lat': 13.3196, 'lng': 103.87456}","[{'lat': 13.31961, 'lng': 103.87442}]",113533,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7217678'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85589529696'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.oxcartadventuretours.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 05:00 - 18:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T050000', 'duration': 'PT13H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.319607,103.87445,7217678,Ox Cart Adventure Tours,"Our Ox Cart Adventures tours provide you with the opportunity to get a glimpse of the traditional way of life in Cambodia, learn about our culture and enjoy the company of friendly local villagers. Only a short trip (7km) from Siem Reap, Chreav village is a traditional and poor community situated in picturesque rice fields and surroundings. The villagers mainly rely on fishing and farming for survival. As we meander along small tracks through the village on an ox cart one of our professional guides will explain about the way of life in the village and Cambodian Culture. Through our tours we assist the local community by providing jobs and development support for the people most in need. The traditional ox cart has been an important feature in Cambodian culture for hundreds of years. By using these carts for our tours we also aim to stop them from disappearing and retain them in our culture. Contact us now to find out about the different tours and times we have available.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d7217678-Reviews-Ox_Cart_Adventure_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'stree