PS Coffee,here:pds:place:116w3fw2-444c8e6b38e44f4ab3c5cfb3d7ff1ce7,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'PS Coffee, 210107 ទ្រាំង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'តាកែវ', 'city': 'ទ្រាំង', 'district': 'ព្រៃស្លឹក', 'postalCode': '210107'}","{'lat': 10.90527, 'lng': 104.78335}","[{'lat': 10.90625, 'lng': 104.78302}]",11179,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855966363807'}]}],Not Available,Takeo,10.00541,105.74523,455150,Cai Rang Floating Market,"Mekong River CruiseCai - Rang Floating Market Tours - Touring a floating market in the Mekong Delta is a box that many travellers to Saigon wish to check, and none are bigger, or more popular than the Can Tho’s Cai Rang Floating Market.The Cai Rang Floating Market, the largest wholesale floating market in the Mekong Delta, starts around 04:00 and runs until 10:00, meaning that you’ll have to get an early start of the day if you want to visit.The market is about six kilometres from Can Tho, or about a 40-minute boat ride. While floating down the river, you get a glimpse of life along its shores. You’ll pass vibrantly painted boats anchored along the shore, merchant vessels carrying loads down the river and houses built on stilts over the water.Once you finally reach the market, it’s an impressive site. A stretch of boats selling all variety of goods lines the river.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303942-d455150-Reviews-Cai_Rang_Floating_Market-Can_Tho_Mekong_Delta.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '46 Hai Ba Trung', 'street2': 'Near Cai Rang Bridge', 'city': 'Can Tho', 'country': 'Vietnam', 'postalcode': '900000', 'address_string': '46 Hai Ba Trung Near Cai Rang Bridge, Can Tho 900000 Vietnam'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Can Tho', 'location_id': '303942'}, {'level': 'Region', 'name': 'Mekong Delta', 'location_id': '293927'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Vietnam', 'location_id': '293921'}]",Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh,N