Pages Rooms Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-3f861548804c0f2658bc3fc280a6c0a1,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Pages Rooms Hotel, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35473, 'lng': 103.85982}","[{'lat': 13.35472, 'lng': 103.85981}]",24456,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7211632'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592966812'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.pages-siemreap.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.354733,103.85982,7211632,Pages Rooms Hotel,"International with strong local roots. Natural. Serene. Welcoming. A unique multi-disciplinary meeting ground and experimental space, Pages Rooms & Café features quaint, quiet, and spacious accommodation that includes well-appointed guest rooms and apartments, office spaces, and a design area. Set in a building from the revival-era of Cambodian art and architecture, circa the mid-1960s – it has been deliberately kept authentic in feel, with only necessary mod-cons added; there is also a second modern design building, set back from the pool and tropical garden, where the guest rooms are located. Pages Rooms & Café is a multi-purpose space and a relaxing retreat from the vibrant surrounding town. Pages Rooms & Café is situated near the city centre, a cul de sac in Street 24, Wat Bo area on the east side of the Siem Reap River. The neighbourhood is quiet, yet close to amenities.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7211632-Reviews-Pages_Rooms_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 24', 'street2': 'Wat Bo', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Street 24 Wat Bo, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d7211632-Pages_Rooms_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#55 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '55'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,129,"{'1': '1', '2': '1', '3': '6', '4': '21', '5': '100'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",149,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7211632-m66827-Reviews-Pages_Rooms_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Restaurant', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Air conditioning', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Refrigerator in room', 'Minibar', 'Safe', 'Flatscreen TV', 'Outdoor 