Pailin City Hotel,here:pds:place:116w62bz-332c572b5b2b4780ad50f5700374adfd,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Pailin City Hotel, 230202 ប៉ៃលិន, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បៃលិន', 'city': 'ប៉ៃលិន', 'district': 'អូរតាវ៉ៅ', 'postalCode': '230202'}","{'lat': 12.83132, 'lng': 102.64139}","[{'lat': 12.83145, 'lng': 102.64139}]",55004,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10676874'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593356454'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/pailincityhotel'}]}]",Not Available,Pailin,12.830717,102.64139,10676874,Pailin City Hotel,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Pailin, Pailin City Hotel is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as a flat screen TV, a refrigerator, and air conditioning, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the hotel.
Pailin City Hotel features a 24 hour front desk, room service, and currency exchange, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts an on-site restaurant. If you are driving to Pailin City Hotel, free parking is available.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Phnom Yat, which is a popular  amongst tourists.
Whether you’re traveling for business, pleasure or both, Pailin City Hotel is sure to make your visit to Pailin one worth remembering.
