Palais Coffee,here:pds:place:116aabd1-eb0991e8ac8207515ce9a5cd3ef8b70b,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Palais Coffee, ផ្លូវ 2 ធ្នូ, 180403 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 2 ធ្នូ', 'postalCode': '180403'}","{'lat': 10.6108, 'lng': 103.5033}","[{'lat': 10.6109, 'lng': 103.5034}]",92227,"[{'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '600-6300-0244', 'name': 'Bakery & Baked Goods Store'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8355622'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85534933807'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.610476,103.50299,8355622,Palais Coffee,"Holiday Palace’s own quality coffee house, Palais Cafe, has established itself as the purveyor of the finest coffees, teas and frappes in Sihanoukville. Sink into one of our comfortable sofas in the comfort of an air-conditioned lounge or take a seat at one of our outdoor garden terrace tables near the resort entrance to enjoy a fully flavored hot or iced coffee or tea or fruit juice.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g325573-d8355622-Reviews-Palais_Coffee-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '2 Thnou Street, Independence Beach', 'street2': 'Holiday Palace Casino Resort', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': '2 Thnou Street, Independence Beach Holiday Palace Casino Resort, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,sihanoukville@holidaypalace.com,+855 34 933 807,http://www.holidaypalace.com/hotel-collection/holiday-palace-resort-sihanoukville/dining/palais-coffee.html,https