Palais Coffee Phnom Penh,here:pds:place:116w649f-4dbe06657db542bfa2101723a13fe9d2,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Palais Coffee Phnom Penh, មហាវិថី សហព័ន្ធរុស្ស៊ី, 120802 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'សែនសុខ', 'subdistrict': 'ទឹកថ្លា', 'street': 'មហាវិថី សហព័ន្ធរុស្ស៊ី', 'postalCode': '120802'}","{'lat': 11.56441, 'lng': 104.88662}","[{'lat': 11.56435, 'lng': 104.88666}]",2487,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85586900515'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.prudential.com.kh'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.563291,104.92013,293940,Phnom Penh,"Budget-minded travelers will appreciate Phnom Penh's reasonably priced hotel rooms. Explore the city's temples, palaces, and the remnants of its French colonial history. Just outside the city, the The Killing Fields (Choeung Ek) are a reminder of Cambodia's tragic past-- a somber contrast to the booming city of today.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Tourism-g293940-Phnom_Penh-Vacations.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '', 'street2': '', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Tourism-g293940-m66827-Phnom_Penh-Vacations.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'geographic', 'localized_name': 'Geographic'}","[{'name': 'city', 'localized_name': 'City'}]",Not available,Not available,[],Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,FALSE,20,14
