Palm House Boutique Resort,here:pds:place:116d408k-c692f28bc4cf0d8a55239cb74536fc9a,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Palm House Boutique Resort, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.47901, 'lng': 104.30713}","[{'lat': 10.47895, 'lng': 104.30701}]",7222,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8631892'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512607138'}, {'value': '+855318944999'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.479076,104.30726,8631892,Palm House Boutique Resort,"Palm House Property: It has built up since October 28th 2011, founder Mr. Palm House Boutique Resort opened its doors in 2011 and offers guests 15 rooms designed in traditional Khmer style, a lush garden, and large outdoor pool. The property also contains two indigenous style treehouses for sitting and relaxing and a variety of Apsara sculptures, artwork and paintings. Spacious air-conditioned rooms provide a flat-screen TV, free wi-fi, minibar and some have private terraces. Comfortable bathrooms come with a hairdryer, free toiletries and amenities for your comfort and convenience. A buffet breakfast is included in the price of your room and the in-house restaurant also serves European and Khmer traditional cuisine. Guests can enjoy a cocktail or a glass of wine at the bar day or night. Our property is a 5-minute walk from Kep Beach and only 300m from the Rabbit Island port. We offer free bicycle use for guests and can arrange tours for you, bus tickets, taxis, flight reservations, and shuttle services. Our front desk operates round-the-clock to assist you with your needs. We hope you enjoy your stay with us!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d8631892-Reviews-Palm_House_Boutique_Resort-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '33A Street', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07503', 'address_string': '33A Street, Kep 07503 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d8631892-Palm_House_Boutique_Resort-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_string': '#12 of 31 hotels in Kep', 'geo_location_name': 'Kep', 'ranking_out_of': '31', 'ranking': '12'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,68,"{'1': '4', '2': '6', '3': '12', '4': '12', '5': '34'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}}",156,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d8631892-m66827-Reviews-Palm_House_Boutique_Resort-Kep_Kep_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Spa', 'Wifi', 