Palmtown Café & Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-bbb10389e67e03598cdcb73bfb526660,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Palmtown Café & Restaurant, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60976, 'lng': 104.18328}","[{'lat': 10.60964, 'lng': 104.18321}]",19452,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25231714'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85599656289'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 09:00 - 22:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT13H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kampot,10.6107,104.209595,25231714,Palmtown Cafe & Restaurant,"Our Café & Restaurant is setup to offer local foods and drinks with specialty menu creations within local’ home chef cook experienced more than 20 years. We provide the privacy, peaceful and comfortable dining venue as preferred as individual seats indoor or outdoors. Dining huts along water canal and livestock fishes. Open sky designed seating spaces for groups booking. We are passionate about foods and beverages!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d25231714-Reviews-Palmtown_Cafe_Restaurant-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road 33, Chumkreil Village, Toekchhou', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'National Road 33, Chumkreil Village, Toekchhou, Kampot Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,chhonchhang168@gmail.com,+855 99 656 289,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d25231714-Palmtown_Cafe_R