Pao Angkor,here:pds:place:116w63u7-9488618e42045998b8a5c782ce401697,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Pao Angkor, 171205 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'នគរធំ', 'postalCode': '171205'}","{'lat': 13.40641, 'lng': 103.86675}","[{'lat': 13.40654, 'lng': 103.86675}]",19838,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15582969'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512784452'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://paoangkor.wixsite.com/angkorpaoguide'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.406446,103.866745,15582969,Pao Angkor,"Stretching over some 400 square kilometers, including forested area, Angkor Archaeological Park contains the magnificent remains of several capitals of the Khmer Empire of the 9th to the 15th centuries, including the largest pre-industrial city in the world. The most famous are the Temple of Angkor Wat and, at Angkor Thom, the Bayon Temple with its countless sculptural decorations.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d15582969-Reviews-Pao_Angkor-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,pao@paoangkor.com,+855 12 784 452,http://paoangkor.wixsite.com/angkorpaoguide,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d15582969-Pao_Angkor-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#298 of 1,339 Tours in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1339', 'ranking': '298'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,48,"{'1': '0', '2': '0',