Paradise Angkor Villa Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-13460c9fafe505e2e21f9d9f0051be19,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Paradise Angkor Villa Hotel, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.36615, 'lng': 103.87845}","[{'lat': 13.36602, 'lng': 103.87845}]",22196,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1232297'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563967222'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.366041,103.87845,1232297,Paradise Angkor Villa Hotel,"Paradise Angkor Villa Hotel is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Siem Reap, offering a family-friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Siem Reap, Paradise Angkor Villa Hotel is located a short distance from Viti's Tuk Tuk Driver (1.2 mi) and New Hope Cambodia (1.2 mi).
Rooms at Paradise Angkor Villa Hotel provide air conditioning, a minibar, and a kitchenette, and guests can stay connected with free wifi.
In addition, while staying at Paradise Angkor Villa Hotel guests have access to room service and a concierge. You can also enjoy a pool and free breakfast. Need a place to park? Free parking is available at Paradise Angkor Villa Hotel.
While visiting Siem Reap, you may want to try some crab at one of the nearby restaurants, such as Genevieve's Restaurant, Cuisine Wat Damnak, or Malis Restaurant Siem Reap.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out a government building, such as Royal Residence.
Enjoy your stay in Siem Reap!
