Paris Guesthouse 2,here:pds:place:116aabd1-ba94ea28e608072736d4e3aa0a8c3b0d,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Paris Guesthouse 2, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60812, 'lng': 104.18136}","[{'lat': 10.60811, 'lng': 104.18122}]",19562,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '14776252'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1812245'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9707596'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85589476645'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.pariskampot.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.609388,104.1815,9707596,Paris Guesthouse 2,"Welcome to Paris II Guesthouse &restaurant! Paris Guesthouse 2 is a very new and modern building just next to the bus station and not far to Paris Guesthouse. The rooms are all renovated and very clear. All the rooms are equiped of air conditional or fan, plasma TV, private bathroom with hot water, and some of the rooms (the big ones) poccess a private balcony. The basic room start at 6dollards with fan, to 30dollards for the bigest room with air co and 2double bed. Take a sit and enjoy the terrace with lunge music. Nice and friendly place to drink some ice tea or coffee, eat some khmer or western food or just take a breakfast! Home made fresh shake fruit, yoghurt and muesli for you! Kind regards, Sophea.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d9707596-Reviews-Paris_Guesthouse_2-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '38, Phum 1 Ousaphear', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '13205', 'address_string': '38, Phum 1 Ousaphear, Kampot 13205 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampo