Paris Hotel,here:pds:place:116w636s-1b3d80de6d9b47238f947a6053294877,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Paris Hotel, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10065, 'lng': 103.19744}","[{'lat': 13.10067, 'lng': 103.1973}]",12439,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2507436'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512530730'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.100661,103.19738,2507436,Paris Hotel,"Welcome to Paris Hotel, your Battambang “home away from home.” Paris Hotel aims to make your visit as relaxing and enjoyable as possible, which is why so many guests continue to come back year after year.
Nearby landmarks such as White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (0.1 mi) and Prasat Sneung (0.7 mi) make Paris Hotel a great place to stay when visiting Battambang.
Rooms at Paris Hotel offer air conditioning, a refrigerator, and a desk providing exceptional comfort and convenience, and guests can go online with free wifi.
A 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and baggage storage are some of the conveniences offered at this small hotel. If you are driving to Paris Hotel, parking is available.
While in Battambang be sure to experience local ribs favorites at Jaan Bai Restaurant or Ambrosia Cafe.
Looking for something to do in Battambang? HUMAN Gallery - Joseba Etxebarria Photography (0.2 mi) is a popular attraction that is within walking distance of Paris Hotel.
Paris Hotel puts the best of Battambang at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
