Park Inn Guest House & Bar,here:pds:place:116aabd1-8ce9d77f17cf0c495bec47c54438e555,en,bar_pub,"{'label': 'Park Inn Guest House & Bar, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.5869, 'lng': 104.16672}","[{'lat': 10.58691, 'lng': 104.16659}]",20206,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]","[{'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11971023'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570331199'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.586888,104.16674,11971023,Park Inn Guest House & Bar,"Park Inn Guest House & Bar, that now offers newly built dorm rooms this relaxed chilled bar and guest house is only 50 meters from Kampot river side on the Angkor road situated between Little Garden guest house and Monster Ink Tattoos. Open daily from 8am-12 midnight. Sopheap is not only a mixology wizard serving the best high end cocktails and mocktails in Kampot he also offers some of the best Italian coffees, frappes, and sparkling ice teas and deliouce Khmer food at the best prices in town. But dont take our word for it, why not come down and try it for your self.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d11971023-Reviews-Park_Inn_Guest_House_Bar-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '720 Angkor steet', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': '720 Angkor steet, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,sopheaps4106@gmail.com,+855 70 331 199,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d11971023-Park_Inn_Guest_House_Bar-Kampot_Kampot_Provi