I am a local Tour operator who provides you :
1. dolphins tour ( tuktuk drives you to 
    dolphins pool ) and Phnom Sambok
2.Mekong discovery trail tour by 
    scooter.
3. Countryside , plantations , the way 
     Cambodian live ( tuktuk or scooter) 
4.  dolphins tour and Kampi Mega 
    rapid (only dry season ). 
 All in English and French
5. Sell bus - van tickets to 
    + Phnom Penh 
     + Siem Reap
     + Laos 
      + more destinations 
