Passion Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w649e-4f16c66aa050454e93ba109164b39707,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Passion Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 430, 120110 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទួលទំពូងទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 430', 'postalCode': '120110'}","{'lat': 11.53427, 'lng': 104.91342}","[{'lat': 11.53422, 'lng': 104.91332}]",6548,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10047780'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598888869'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.534302,104.91336,10047780,Passion Guesthouse,"Looking for a place to stay in Phnom Penh? Then look no further than Passion Guesthouse, a guest house that brings the best of Phnom Penh to your doorstep.
Guest rooms offer air conditioning and a desk.
Nearby landmarks such as Bassac Lane (1.7 mi) and Champey Academy of Arts (2.3 mi) make Passion Guesthouse a great place to stay when visiting Phnom Penh.
While in Phnom Penh be sure to experience local schnitzel favorites at Connecting Hands Training Cafe, Jars of Clay, or La Croisette.
Best of all, Passion Guesthouse makes it easy to experience many great Phnom Penh attractions like Royal Palace, Choeung Ek Genocidal Center, and Wat Langka, which are some popular historic sites.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Passion Guesthouse as you experience everything Phnom Penh has to offer.
