Paul's Backpack Hostel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-3ccf270f8dc80186918007ca48c6c99f,en,hostel,"{'label': ""Paul's Backpack Hostel, ផ្លូវ 172, 120206 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 172', 'postalCode': '120206'}","{'lat': 11.56663, 'lng': 104.92703}","[{'lat': 11.56675, 'lng': 104.92699}]",6860,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8324018'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512237456'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.566671,104.927,8324018,Paul's Backpack Hostel,"Paul’s Backpack Hostel is where a social hub and a great place to stay to meet other travellers with a warm and welcoming atmosphere, Just a stone’s throw from the excitement and bustle of the heart of the city within a walking distance to Royal Palace, Silver Pagoda, Museum, Old market Wat Phnom, and Night Market. It’s the perfect base for exploring the city and relaxing afterwards.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d8324018-Reviews-Paul_s_Backpack_Hostel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '172 House 142 A7, Street', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '172 House 142 A7, Street, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d8324018-Paul_s_Backpack_Hostel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#154 of 351 Specialty lodging in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '351', 'ranking': '154'}",3,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.0-66827-5.svg,7,"{'1': '2', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '3', '5': '1'}","{'0': {'name': 'rat