Pavillon Indochine Hotel,here:pds:place:116w63u5-6bff46ed2b2f43a786beb538bf07f7c5,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Pavillon Indochine Hotel, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.38206, 'lng': 103.85963}","[{'lat': 13.38204, 'lng': 103.85977}]",22240,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '469306'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512849681'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.pavillon-indochine.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.382072,103.8596,469306,Pavillon Indochine Hotel,"An oasis of tranquillity and peace awaits you at the Pavillon Indochine Hotel. Our Hotel showcases a classic French and Khmer Colonial Style design, fusing effortlessly to capture the true essence of timeless elegance. We offer a unique location within Siem Reap, enabling us to provide guests with the perfect retreat to return to, after time spend discovering and exploring either the unforgettable Angkor Wat UNESCO World Heritage site, or the bustling excitement of Siem Reap City Central.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d469306-Reviews-Pavillon_Indochine_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Jean Commailles Road', 'street2': 'back road to Angkor wat', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Jean Commailles Road back road to Angkor wat, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d469306-Pavillon_Indochine_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390',