Pepper Guest House,here:pds:place:116aabd1-d1a05f147c8f0f18efe236bd719d9a56,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Pepper Guest House, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60751, 'lng': 104.18432}","[{'lat': 10.60738, 'lng': 104.18436}]",19241,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6919662'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Kampot,10.607428,104.18434,6919662,Pepper Guest House,"See why so many travelers make Pepper Guest House their guest house of choice when visiting Kampot. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Pepper Guest House is a guest house offering air conditioning in the rooms, and it is easy to stay connected during your stay as free wifi is offered to guests.
Plus, guests can enjoy an on-site restaurant, which has made this a popular choice among travelers visiting Kampot.
Given the close proximity to The Old Royal Cinema (0.2 mi), guests of Pepper Guest House can easily experience one of Kampot's most popular landmarks.
While in Kampot, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Pepper Guest House, including Rusty Keyhole (0.4 mi), Epic Arts Cafe (0.3 mi), and bARACA restaurant (0.3 mi).
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular art galleries such as Kampot Art Gallery.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Pepper Guest House as you experience all of the things Kampot has to offer.
