', 'Currency Exchange', 'Desk', 'Dining Area', 'Electric Kettle', 'English', 'Evening Entertainment', 'Extra Long Beds', 'Fireplace', 'First Aid Kit', 'Fishing', 'Foot Massage', 'Free Public Parking Nearby', 'Complimentary Instant Coffee', 'Complimentary Toiletries', 'Complimentary Welcome Drink', '24-Hour Front Desk', 'Full Body Massage', 'Hair Dryer', 'Hand Massage', 'Happy Hour', 'Head Massage', 'Hiking', 'Indoor Play Area for Children', 'Interconnected room(s) available', 'Iron', 'Ironing Service', 'Karaoke', 'Khmer', ""Kids' Meals"", 'Landmark View', 'Massage', 'Massage Chair', 'Mountain View', 'Neck Massage', 'Nightclub / DJ', 'Outdoor Dining Area', 'Patio', 'Picnic Area', 'Private Bathrooms', 'Private Check-in / Check-out', 'Seating Area', '24-Hour Security', 'Secured Parking', 'Separate Dining Area', 'Snack Bar', 'Sofa', 'Special Diet Menus', 'Sun Terrace', 'Taxi Service', 'Telephone', 'Tile / Marble Floor', 'Umbrella', 'VIP Room Facilities', 'Wake Up Service / Alarm Clock', 'Walk-in Shower', 'Walking Tours', 'Wardrobe / Closet', 'Water Park Off-site', 'Waterslide', 'Water Sport Equipment Rentals', 'Whirlpool Bathtub', 'Wine / Champagne', 'Photo Copier / Fax In Business Center', 'Beach Access']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"['Ocean View', 'City View']",[],Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,FALSE,11,6
Phka Chhouk Tep Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w636k-81bb7b4ac628492f95bc19242f25db5e,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Phka Chhouk Tep Guesthouse, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09258, 'lng': 103.20669}","[{'lat': 13.09263, 'lng': 103.20656}]",12821,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3320506'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Battambang,13.0926,103.207,3320506,Phka Chhouk Tep Guesthouse,"Welcome to Phka Chhouk Tep Guesthouse, your Battambang “home away from home.” Phka Chhouk Tep Guesthouse aims to make your visit as relaxing and enjoyable as possible, which is why so many guests continue to come back year after year.
Close to some of Battambang's most popular landmarks, such as Ta Dumbong Statue (0.2 mi) and Prasat Sneung (0.5 mi), Phka Chhouk Tep Guesthouse is a great destination for tourists.
The rooms offer a flat screen TV, air conditioning, and a desk, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
Phka Chhouk Tep Guesthouse features a concierge, room service, and baggage storage. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to parking.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the Asian restaurants, including Jaan Bai Restaurant, Smokin' Pot, and Nary Kitchen, all of which are a short distance from Phka Chhouk Tep Guesthouse.
If you are interested in exploring Battambang, check out one of the art galleries, such as HUMAN Gallery - Joseba Etxebarria Photography, ROMCHEIK 5 Art Space, and La Fabrik.
Phka Chhouk Tep Guesthouse puts the best of Battambang at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
