Phka Chouk Tep Hotel,here:pds:place:116w64up-76a4ec7cc33540d8b159ad306f49d075,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Phka Chouk Tep Hotel, 030402 កំពង់ចាម, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'city': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'district': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'postalCode': '030402'}","{'lat': 11.99415, 'lng': 105.46518}","[{'lat': 11.99403, 'lng': 105.46511}]",25146,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12632424'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Kampong Cham,11.994172,105.4652,12632424,Phka Chouk Tep Hotel,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Kampong Cham, Phka Chouk Tep Hotel is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its proximity to great restaurants and attractions, Phka Chouk Tep Hotel makes it easy to enjoy the best of Kampong Cham.
A 24 hour front desk and baggage storage are some of the conveniences offered at this small hotel. If you are driving to Phka Chouk Tep Hotel, free parking is available.
While staying at Phka Chouk Tep Hotel, visitors can check out Wat Nokor (1.8 mi), which is a popular Kampong Cham attraction.
While visiting Kampong Cham, you may want to try some burritos at one of the nearby restaurants, such as Destiny Coffee House.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out a , such as The French Tower.
Phka Chouk Tep Hotel is sure to make your visit to Kampong Cham one worth remembering.
