Phka Villa,here:pds:place:116aabd1-e710f247d17a0fc9a0657b9ca95ba537,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Phka Villa, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09853, 'lng': 103.20549}","[{'lat': 13.0984, 'lng': 103.20547}]",13041,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '300-000', 'name': 'European'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1586060'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2255393'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516575735', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85589969366', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}]}, {'value': '+855969733337'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.098672,103.20552,1586060,Phka Villa,"Phka Villa Hotel is owned and run by a local family. With its location in the heart of the city, guests readily savor easy access to various attractions. It is only a 10 minutes’ walk to Battambang Museum and Psar Nat shopping center, an hour from Sisophon City, and two hours from Piopet Border. Phka Villa Hotel is a fine retreat, offering a large outdoor swimming pool decked beautifully with cozy sun-loungers. Rooms are furnished in the Khmer tradition, unleashing a pure thrill of the local lifestyle. All guestrooms are set around the pool and equipped with two private verandas and a bathroom, as well as modern facilities including cable TV and Wi-Fi. The restaurant serves authentically local flavors, and the bar serves the self-acclaimed best cocktails in town. Other services include massage treatments, laundry, tours and ticketing, a city and airport shuttle, and around-the-clock front desk assistance.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d1586060-Reviews-Phka_Villa-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '5 Street 203, Romcheak', 'street2': 'Sangkat Ratanak', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': '5 Street 203, Romcheak Sangkat Ratanak, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d1586060-Phka_Villa-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#7 of 43 hotels in Battambang', 'geo_location_name': 'Battambang', 'ranking_out_of': '43', 'ranking': '7'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,467,"{'1': '12', '2': '23', '3': '68', '4': '151', '5': '213'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",199,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g30366