Phnom Pech Hotel,here:pds:place:116w61zk-4e0e6cffba4e47baa5f0abbba098f3a7,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Phnom Pech Hotel, ផ្លូវ 147, 150603 ពោធិ៍សាត់, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ពោធិ៍សាត់', 'city': 'ពោធិ៍សាត់', 'district': 'ផ្ទះព្រៃ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 147', 'postalCode': '150603'}","{'lat': 12.53522, 'lng': 103.91976}","[{'lat': 12.53517, 'lng': 103.91989}]",123443,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1832429'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85552951515'}]}],Not Available,Pursat,12.53527,103.9196,1832429,Phnom Pech Hotel,"Finding an ideal family-friendly small hotel in Pursat does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Phnom Pech Hotel, a nice option for travelers like you.
Rooms at Phnom Pech Hotel offer a minibar and air conditioning providing exceptional comfort and convenience, and guests can go online with free wifi.
A concierge and room service are some of the conveniences offered at this small hotel. An on-site restaurant will also help to make your stay even more special. If you are driving to Phnom Pech Hotel, free parking is available.
If you are looking for a good Asian restaurant, you may want to check out Pursat Pizza House while staying at Phnom Pech Hotel.
Phnom Pech Hotel looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Pursat.
