Phnom Penh Food Tours,here:pds:place:116w649g-7a06d5db87b210b442d1dc1b2e5187da,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Phnom Penh Food Tours, ផ្លូវ 15, 120211 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'វត្តភ្នំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 15', 'postalCode': '120211'}","{'lat': 11.57264, 'lng': 104.92604}","[{'lat': 11.57268, 'lng': 104.92617}]",6771,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13991033'}]",[{'www': [{'value': 'http://www.phnompenhfoodtours.com'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.572665,104.92613,13991033,Phnom Penh Food Tours,"Please make bookings directly through our site; our URL is our business name. Phnom Penh Food Tours lets you explore another side of this phenomenal city. You'll traverse vibrant local markets, hole-in-the-wall restaurants, and small street-side stands of the country's capital city, where popular dishes reflect the many influences that have shaped Cambodia's long and rich history.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d13991033-Reviews-Phnom_Penh_Food_Tours-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@phnompenhfoodtours.com,Not available,http://www.phnompenhfoodtours.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d13991033-Phnom_Penh_Food_Tours-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#11 of 71 Food &amp; Drink in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '71', 'ranking': '11'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,75,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '2', '4': '1', '5': '72'}",Not available,162,https://www.tripadvisor.com/A