Phnom Svay Hotel,here:pds:place:116w63jr-5a124220efce472c8638cd2ee4431826,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Phnom Svay Hotel, 010804 សិរីសោភ័ណ្ឌ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បន្ទាយមានជ័យ', 'city': 'សិរីសោភ័ណ្ឌ', 'district': 'អូរអំបិល', 'postalCode': '010804'}","{'lat': 13.58762, 'lng': 102.9677}","[{'lat': 13.58759, 'lng': 102.96756}]",62942,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8640129'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512639090'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.phnomsvayhotel.com/en-us'}]}]",Not Available,Banteay Meanchey,13.587711,102.968124,8640129,Phnom Svay Hotel,"Finding an ideal small hotel in Sisophon does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Phnom Svay Hotel, a nice option for travelers like you.
Free wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at Phnom Svay Hotel offer a minibar, air conditioning, and a desk.
During your stay, take advantage of some of the amenities offered, including room service and shops. Guests of Phnom Svay Hotel are also welcome to enjoy an on-site restaurant. For travelers arriving by car, free parking is available.
While you’re here, be sure to check out Kim Heng, one of the Asian restaurants that can be found in Sisophon, which is a short distance from Phnom Svay Hotel.
Phnom Svay Hotel looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Sisophon.
