Phteah Malis,here:pds:place:116w63u5-81a34158b90043edb611493a93b519ac,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Phteah Malis, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37768, 'lng': 103.86584}","[{'lat': 13.37771, 'lng': 103.86585}]",22118,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85585536600'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://abnb.me/MvRxqN9uuT'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.356299,103.85765,9716351,Malis Siem Reap,"Malis is a Khmer restaurant renowned for its innovative approach to blending traditional, contemporary, and authentic Cambodian cuisine. Located in front of Siem Reap River and 6 minutes away by walk from Pub Street, if you seek a tranquil escape and Cambodian dishes, Malis is the ideal destination. Our culinary creations are crafted by Luu Meng, Cambodia's esteemed masterchef, known for his culinary artistry showcased globally. We aim to safeguard the nation’s food heritage for years to come. Our restaurant presents two distinct menu: a breakfast menu and a lunch/dinner menu. ភោជនីយដ្ឋាន ម្លិះ ជាភោជនីដ្ឋានបែបខ្មែរ ដែលបានបញ្ចូលវប្បធម៌ សហសម័យ និងរសជាតិដើមបែបខ្មែរបញ្ចូលគ្នា។ ភោជនីយដ្ឋាននេះមានទីតាំងនៅតាមបណ្តោយមាត់ស្ទឹងសៀមរាប និងមានចម្ងាយត្រឹមតែ 6នាទីពី PUB STREET ប្រសិនបើលោកអ្នកធ្វើដំណើរដោយថ្មើរជើង។ ប្រសិនបើអ្នកកំពុងតែស្វែងរកម្ហូបខ្មែរដែលមានរសជាតិឆ្ងាញ់ និងបរិយាកាសស្ងប់ស្ងាត់ ភោជនីយដ្ឋាន ម្លិះ គឺជាជម្រើសដ៏ល្អបំផុតសម្រាប់លោកអ្នក។",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d9716351-Reviews-Malis_Siem_Reap-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Pokambor Avenue', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12131', 'address_string': 'Pokambor Avenue, Siem Reap 12131 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,reservation.malissr@thaliashospitality.com,+855 15 824 888,http://www.malis-restaurant.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d9716351-Malis_Siem_Reap-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#102 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '102'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,1679,"{'1': '41', '2': '64', '3': '146', '4': '327', '5': '1101'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}}",1507,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d9716351-m66827-Reviews-Malis_Siem_Reap-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$$$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0630'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0630'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0630'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0630'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0630'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0630'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0630'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2300'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 06:30 - 23:00', 'Tuesday: 06:30 - 23:00', 'Wednesday: 06:30 - 23:00', 'Thursday: 06:30 - 23:00', 'Friday: 06:30 - 23:00', 'Saturday: 06:30 - 23:00', 'Sunday: 06:30 - 23:00']}","['Accepts Credit Cards', 'Accepts Mastercard', 'Accepts Visa', 'Free Wifi', 'Full Bar', 'Highchairs Available', 'Live Music', 'Outdoor Seating', 'Private Dining', 'Reservations', 'Seating', 'Serves Alcohol', 'Street Parking', 'Table Service']","[{'name': 'asian', 'localized_name': 'Asian'}, {'name': 'cambodian', 'localized_name': 'Cambodian'}]",Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'restaurant', 'localized_name': 'Restaurant'}","[{'name': 'sit_down', 'localized_name': 'Sit down'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '43'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '675'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '54'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '285'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '381'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,11,20
Phum Steng Community,here:pds:place:116w63gy-97f05ac18852484e9ae6660cc6d9644d,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Phum Steng Community, 170501 ប្រាសាទបាគង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'ប្រាសាទបាគង', 'district': 'បាគង', 'postalCode': '170501'}","{'lat': 13.34943, 'lng': 103.99247}","[{'lat': 13.34941, 'lng': 103.99233}]",19296,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '800-064', 'name': 'International'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12562513'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512926391'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 11:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T110000', 'duration': 'PT11H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.349432,103.99252,12562513,Phum Steng Community,"Ms Rathana and Mr Sovann , the owners of Phum Steng Hut, a community support project, welcome you to their countryside restaurant. The Hut offers superlative traditional dishes at competitive prices in the countryside of Siem Reap. Set in a beautiful wooded area at the side of the Roluos river, phase 1 of The Hut offers discreet dining under the cover of ten wooden kjosh (Khmer gazebo). The kjosh, two of which overlook the river, surround a hectare of flower garden, sporting sunflowers, orchids, red cannas and more. The Hut also provides cooking classes and external catering services. All produce, used in the restaurants dishes, is grown locally without the use of chemicals and pesticides. The restaurant works with and supports the neighbouring farmers. Guests can also spend time learning and watching basket-weaving and silk spinning.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d12562513-Reviews-Phum_Steng_Community-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Off Route #6', 'street2': 'Steung Village, Prasat Bakong District', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '00000', 'address_string': 'Off Route #6 Steung Village, Prasat Bakong District, Siem Reap 00000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,sales@enkosabnb.com,+855 12 926 391,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12562513-Phum_Steng_Community-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#224 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '224'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,91,"{'1': '4', '2': '7', '3': '4', '4': '18', '5': '58'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",124,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d12562513-m66827-Reviews-Phum_Steng_Community-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '1100'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'ti