Phở Hoa Sen - Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w6497-467539dbc7b8485b996c4158b61e32c2,vi,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Phở Hoa Sen - Cambodia, ផ្លូវ 5, 120602 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'មានជ័យ', 'subdistrict': 'ចាក់អង្រែក្រោម', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 5', 'postalCode': '120602'}","{'lat': 11.51088, 'lng': 104.93428}","[{'lat': 11.51073, 'lng': 104.93429}]",19182,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '800-8700-0296', 'name': 'Clubhouse'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+855717345678'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://hoasenrestaurant.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.51127,104.93647,5602357,Cambodia Shooting Ranges Extreme Outdoor,"Greetings. There are two Cambodia Shooting Ranges Extreme Outdoor in Cambodia cities, Phnom Penh city and Siem Reap city. Those city have three different ranges Please, choose the city is more convenient for you contact us directly in order to receive complimentary like private Ride, Video services. All ranges offer different experiences and services. We are the original and the the number 1 Shooting Range Experience for a reason. Contacting your hotel will not help, for they will only want commission and / or send you with a different company or range.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d5602357-Reviews-Cambodia_Shooting_Ranges_Extreme_Outdoor-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No 326 Highway No 2', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': 'No 326 Highway No 2, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,CambodiaShootingRanges@Gmail.com,+855 78 777 908,http://cambodiashootingranges.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d5602357-Cambodia_Shooting