Pich Guest House,here:pds:place:116w649g-dd07767eb2be4bfbb0b06bf2b52ea4bf,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Pich Guest House, ផ្លូវ 19 79, 120203 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 19', 'postalCode': '120203', 'houseNumber': '79'}","{'lat': 11.5694, 'lng': 104.92563}","[{'lat': 11.56944, 'lng': 104.92576}]",6708,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2486910'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855766880000'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.57185,104.92495,2486910,Pich Guest House,"Looking for a place to stay in Phnom Penh? Then look no further than Pich Guest House, a budget friendly guest house that brings the best of Phnom Penh to your doorstep.
The guest house offers room service, to make your visit even more pleasant. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Sisowath Quay (0.3 mi) and Wat Ounalom (0.4 mi), guests of Pich Guest House can easily experience some of Phnom Penh's most well known attractions.
Phnom Penh has plenty of Italian restaurants. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Brooklyn Pizza & Bistro, Piccola Italia Da Luigi, and Oskar Bistro, which are serving up some great dishes.
Should time allow, Royal Palace and Cambodia Post Office are some popular attractions that are within walking distance.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Pich Guest House as you experience everything Phnom Penh has to offer.
