Pidoma Resort,here:pds:place:116w6hq8-e5a833127edb3cb66c3f3e947c93878f,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Pidoma Resort, 110504 សែនមនោរម្យ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'មណ្ឌលគីរី', 'city': 'សែនមនោរម្យ', 'district': 'រមនា', 'postalCode': '110504'}","{'lat': 12.43168, 'lng': 107.23202}","[{'lat': 12.43178, 'lng': 107.23211}]",125573,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '24174953'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598319600'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/pidomaresort'}]}]",Not Available,Mondulkiri,12.431033,107.2314,24174953,Pidoma Resort,"Pidoma Resort Pidoma Resorts located in the city of Romonea, krong Saen Monourom, Mondulkiri, the Kingdom of Cambodia, is the perfect base to explore and experience this famous historical city. The Resorts is situated only Seven kilometers away from world heritage site of Water Fall, and Seven kilometers from Markets. Pidoma Resorts is decorated with modern design and exhibit with traditional Phnong house historical antiques that helps you discover and experience the splendid wonders of Cambodia’s ancient heritage, background, finest architecture, and cultural legacy.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1893367-d24174953-Reviews-Pidoma_Resort-Sen_Monorom_Mondulkiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Dak Dam Road', 'city': 'Sen Monorom', 'state': 'Mondulkiri Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '110504', 'address_string': 'Dak Dam Road, Sen Monorom 110504 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Sen Monorom', 'location_id': '1893367'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Mondulkiri Province', 'location_id': '2366669'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1893367-d24174953-Pidoma_Resort-Sen_Monorom_Mondulkiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '1893367', 'ran