Pillar Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649d-f0a77f76294c42e9932fc17d370828e3,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Pillar Hotel, ផ្លូវ 1, 120211 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'វត្តភ្នំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 1', 'postalCode': '120211'}","{'lat': 11.57533, 'lng': 104.92671}","[{'lat': 11.57541, 'lng': 104.92682}]",72810,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3323903'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523986588'}, {'value': '+85560666482'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/Pillar-Hotel-1655335201344907', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.575373,104.92677,3323903,Pillar Hotel,"The PILLAR part of Hotels by Chhaisour(C) shows exquisite tastes in the interior as directed by the owner, inspired by internationally recognized interior designs. All hotels offer a perfect balance of style elements combined with modern amenities. The hotels are inspired by the Asian and European architectural treasures of 'The Strand Hotel' of Yangon, 'The Raffles Grand d'Angkor Cambodia"" & the 'Oriental Hotel' of Bangkok while still maintaining their originality. The Hotels owner recognizes the needs of the 21st century business traveler & offers free wi-fi, and an excellent 24 Hr concierge service in all Hotels.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d3323903-Reviews-Pillar_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 87, Sisovath Blvd', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '85523', 'address_string': 'No. 87, Sisovath Blvd, Phnom Penh 85523 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d3323