Piphub Thmey Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-c2ca7cd8990746c987d5894fdd32c6ed,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Piphub Thmey Guesthouse, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.60651, 'lng': 104.17479}","[{'lat': 10.60657, 'lng': 104.17491}]",20142,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9788754'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Kampot,10.60653,104.174835,9788754,Piphub Thmey Guesthouse,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Kampot, Piphub Thmey Guesthouse is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its budget friendly environment and proximity to great restaurants and attractions, Piphub Thmey Guesthouse makes it easy to enjoy the best of Kampot.
You can take advantage of some of the amenities offered by Piphub Thmey Guesthouse, including a 24 hour front desk, currency exchange, and baggage storage. As an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
Close to The Old Royal Cinema (0.5 mi), a popular Kampot landmark, Piphub Thmey Guesthouse is a great destination for tourists.
If you’re looking for a cafe, consider a visit to Epic Arts Cafe, Simple Things, or Cafe Espresso Kampot, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Piphub Thmey Guesthouse.
Should time allow, Farm Link is a popular attraction that is within walking distance.
Piphub Thmey Guesthouse is sure to make your visit to Kampot one worth remembering.
