Pippali Boutique Hotel,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-088497eccd0a4b23816bf356d4da0e49,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Pippali Boutique Hotel, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60033, 'lng': 104.18227}","[{'lat': 10.60031, 'lng': 104.18226}]",19119,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '301-000', 'name': 'French'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12820598'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13993463'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511274473'}, {'value': '+855976958582', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.pippalihotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.600427,104.18229,12820598,Pippali Boutique Hotel,"Pippali Boutique Hotel is ideally located along the riverside and a short walk from Kampot city centre. Enjoy the view of the Teuk Chhou River and the Bokor Mountain while relaxing in our beautiful garden or at the swimming pool. The large 8 rooms are tastefully furnished with some pieces designed by the owner’s brother, an architect, giving a unique and personal touch to the place. All rooms have a terrace or a balcony with a view on the garden and the overflowing seawater swimming pool, the only one in town.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d12820598-Reviews-Pippali_Boutique_Hotel-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 735 (Southern of Kampot Provincial Hall)', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Street 735 (Southern of Kampot Provincial Hall), Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}