Plumeria Hotel & Spa,here:pds:place:116w63u5-c74d82f4784aa10ecd3365ce3a12f6ac,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Plumeria Hotel & Spa, អេអេច21, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'អេអេច21', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36712, 'lng': 103.85}","[{'lat': 13.36701, 'lng': 103.84992}]",24152,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25316403'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598968088'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/plumeriahotelandspa'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.367202,103.85005,25316403,Plumeria Hotel & Spa,"Set in a quiet area in Salar Kanseng Village, Plumeria Hotel & Spa is a 7-minute walk from the Angkor National Museum. It boasts an outdoor swimming pool, pool-side bar and rooms with free WiFi. Plumeria Hotel & Spa is a 3-minute drive from the Old Market, Pub Street and Angkor Night Market. It is 5 km from Siem Reap International Airport and a 10-minute drive from Angkor Wat, a World Heritage site. The property offers complimentary pickup services from the airport, boat or bus station. Rooms are tastefully decorated with modern interiors. Each room is fully air conditioning and equipped with tea/coffee making facilities and a private bathroom. The front desk staff can assist guests with ticketing and car rental arrangements. Guests can indulge in a relaxing traditional massage on-site. A wide selection of Asian and Cambodian favourites as well as Western dishes are served at the restaurant. Refreshing cocktails and fine wines are served at the bar.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d25316403-Reviews-Plumeria_Hotel_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No.90, Street 06', 'street2': 'Phum Sala Kansieng', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'No.90, Street 06 Phum Sala Kansieng, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d25316403-Plumeria_Hotel_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#180 of 449 Specialty lodging in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '449', 'ranking': '180'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,4,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '0', '5': '3'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}}",23,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d25316403-m66827-Reviews-Plumeria_Hotel_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Kids Activities', 'Suites', 'Room service', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Spa', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Breakfast included', 'Dry Cleaning', 'Meeting rooms', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Business center', 'Fitness center', 'Laundry Service', 'Concierge', 'Air conditioning', 'Family Rooms', 'Minibar', 'Conference Facilities', 'Babysitting', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Safe', 'Rooftop Bar', 'Swimup Bar', 'Heated pool', 'Flatscreen TV', 'Rooftop Terrace', 'Private Balcony', 'Indoor pool', 'Adult pool', 'Outdoor pool', 'Private Pools