Poipet Resort Casino,here:pds:place:116aabd1-0925bbb8bd880fa2cdf0b95e070250ad,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Poipet Resort Casino, 010901 ប៉ោយប៉ែត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បន្ទាយមានជ័យ', 'city': 'ប៉ោយប៉ែត', 'district': 'ប៉ោយប៉ែត', 'postalCode': '010901'}","{'lat': 13.66098, 'lng': 102.55082}","[{'lat': 13.66108, 'lng': 102.55092}]",52223,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2411004'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85554967345'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.grandexclusive.net'}]}]",Not Available,Banteay Meanchey,13.660855,102.550964,2411004,Poipet Resort Casino,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Poipet, Poipet Resort Casino is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its budget friendly environment and proximity to great restaurants, Poipet Resort Casino makes it easy to enjoy the best of Poipet.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer a minibar, air conditioning, and a refrigerator, and you can stay connected during your stay as Poipet Resort Casino offers guests free wifi.
The hotel features a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and 24 hour check-in. Plus, Poipet Resort Casino offers a sauna and an on-site restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. For guests with a vehicle, parking is available.
Travelers looking for a place to eat close to Poipet Resort Casino can head to Destiny Café (1.2 mi) or Palm Coffee (0.9 mi), all of which are within walking distance.
Whether you’re traveling for business, pleasure or both, Poipet Resort Casino is sure to make your visit to Poipet one worth remembering.
