Por Long Guest House,here:pds:place:116w649e-158ca7a9692aadbae1cdcf7f4699e8bf,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Por Long Guest House, ផ្លូវ 310, 120106 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទួលស្វាយព្រៃទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 310', 'postalCode': '120106'}","{'lat': 11.55255, 'lng': 104.91056}","[{'lat': 11.55266, 'lng': 104.91065}]",5344,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27841423'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570848928'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.557424,104.91676,1629291,Tat Guest House,"Tat Guest House is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Phnom Penh, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Rooms at Tat Guest House provide a flat screen TV, and guests can stay connected with free wifi.
You can also enjoy an on-site restaurant while staying at Tat Guest House.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Phnom Penh, Tat Guest House is located a short distance from Champey Academy of Arts (0.9 mi) and Bassac Lane (0.9 mi).
While in Phnom Penh, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Tat Guest House, including Eclipse Sky Bar (0.2 mi), Romdeng (0.6 mi), and Friends the Restaurant (1.1 mi).
If you are interested in exploring Phnom Penh, check out one of the historic sites, such as Royal Palace, Choeung Ek Genocidal Center, and Wat Langka.
Enjoy your stay in Phnom Penh!
