Pou Restaurant and Bar,here:pds:place:116w63gg-399577b3424a45ee8b078c7a41965162,en,food_market_stall,"{'label': 'Pou Restaurant and Bar, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35142, 'lng': 103.86377}","[{'lat': 13.35143, 'lng': 103.86363}]",24467,"[{'id': '100-1000-0004', 'name': 'Food Market/Stall', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12360464'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512844469'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.pourestaurant.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT16H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.351419,103.86373,12360464,Pou Restaurant and Bar,"Pou Restaurant has developed a unique culinary view that great food should be fun yet sophisticated, innovative yet familiar and expressive. Pou Restaurant, which menu was one of simplicity with an injection of freshness and adventure. He is renowned for his innovative dishes featuring high-quality produce, beautiful herbs, and vegetables. This has allowed his out-of-the-box flavor combinations and artistic plating to present a far more approachable style with rustic dining. A laid back friendly kind of a guy, Chef says the two greatest things about his job are working with his awesome partner and team, plus mentoring young and upcoming chefs.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d12360464-Reviews-Pou_Restaurant_and_Bar-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'St. 27, Wat Bo Village', 'street2': 'In Front Of Angkor High School', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'St. 27, Wat Bo Village In Front Of Angkor High School, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,booking@pourestaurant.com,+855 12 844 469,http://www.pourestaurant.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12360464-Pou_Restaurant_and_Bar-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#53 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '53'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,521,"{'1': '6', '2': '3', '3': '19', '4': '42', '5': '451'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",528,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d12360464-m66827-Reviews-Pou_Restaurant_and_Bar-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 't