Prak Dara Guest House,here:pds:place:116w6kn4-a17850ca145d41678d33fd09aa406681,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Prak Dara Guest House, 160904 បានលុង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'រតនគីរី', 'city': 'បានលុង', 'district': 'បឹងកន្សែង', 'postalCode': '160904'}","{'lat': 13.74749, 'lng': 106.98235}","[{'lat': 13.74758, 'lng': 106.98245}]",152092,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3319912'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855756666068'}]}],Not Available,Ratanakiri,13.747477,106.98234,3319912,Prak Dara Guest House,"See why so many travelers make Prak Dara Guest House their small hotel of choice when visiting Banlung. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Prak Dara Guest House offers guests an array of room amenities including air conditioning and a desk, and getting online is possible, as free internet access is available.
The small hotel offers a 24 hour front desk, 24 hour check-in, and room service, to make your visit even more pleasant. The property also features a snack bar. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
While in Banlung, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Prak Dara Guest House, including Pteas Bay Khmer (0.0 mi), Cafe Alee (1.0 mi), and The Green Carrot restaurant & bar (0.9 mi).
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular waterfalls such as Ka Chanh Waterfall.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Prak Dara Guest House as you experience all of the things Banlung has to offer.
