Preah Vihea Hotel,here:pds:place:116w63u5-c0476fc2c747450dae89cb1e52056fe0,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Preah Vihea Hotel, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.35959, 'lng': 103.8803}","[{'lat': 13.35958, 'lng': 103.88044}]",22651,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '700-7400-0141', 'name': 'Business Services'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1874809'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512614214'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.359348,103.880356,1874809,Preah Vihea Hotel,"Finding an ideal budget friendly small hotel in Siem Reap does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Preah Vihea Hotel, a nice option for travelers like you.
Close to some of Siem Reap's most popular landmarks, such as Viti's Tuk Tuk Driver (1.4 mi) and Wat Preah Prom Rath (1.6 mi), Preah Vihea Hotel is a great destination for tourists.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as air conditioning, a refrigerator, and a desk, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the small hotel.
Preah Vihea Hotel features a concierge and room service, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts free breakfast. If you are driving to Preah Vihea Hotel, free parking is available.
If you like Korean restaurants, Preah Vihea Hotel is conveniently located near Daebak Korean BBQ, Jungle Camp, and Mango Day Restaurant.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Royal Residence, which is a popular government building amongst tourists.
Preah Vihea Hotel looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Siem Reap.
