Prey Inn,here:pds:place:116w649g-4392d7889f5c4d81bc3d40243abc971f,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Prey Inn, ផ្លូវ 58, 120703 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ឫស្សីកែវ', 'subdistrict': 'ឫស្សីកែវ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 58', 'postalCode': '120703'}","{'lat': 11.59382, 'lng': 104.90127}","[{'lat': 11.59396, 'lng': 104.90129}]",72612,"[{'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7129854'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510315353'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.593986,104.90156,7129854,Prey Inn,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Phnom Penh, Prey Inn is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its proximity to great restaurants and attractions, Prey Inn makes it easy to enjoy the best of Phnom Penh.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as a refrigerator, a minibar, and air conditioning, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the inn.
Prey Inn features a 24 hour front desk, room service, and currency exchange, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts a sauna. If you are driving to Prey Inn, free parking is available.
Close to some of Phnom Penh's most popular landmarks, such as Al-Serkal Mosque (1.3 mi) and Royal Railway Station (Phnom Penh) (1.8 mi), Prey Inn is a great destination for tourists.
While in Phnom Penh, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Prey Inn, including One More Restaurant (1.0 mi), Brown Coffee and Bakery TK Branch (1.1 mi), and Shabu Boo-tueng (0.7 mi).
If you are interested in exploring Phnom Penh, check out one of the art galleries, such as Din Art Gallery, Lotus Space, and Bong Bong Bong.
Prey Inn is sure to make your visit to Phnom Penh one worth remembering.
