Private Siem Reap Tour,here:pds:place:116w63u4-ca6a11b21428eac5f06992665884406b,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Private Siem Reap Tour, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.38989, 'lng': 103.8414}","[{'lat': 13.38976, 'lng': 103.84137}]",86055,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}, {'id': '400-4100-0041', 'name': 'Transportation Service'}, {'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10770870'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15336660'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563965555', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85599435858'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://lotusblancresort.com/private-tour', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}]}, {'value': 'http://privatesiemreaptour.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.389904,103.8414,15336660,Private Siem Reap Tour,"We are a team of licensed tour guides and drivers who have been working as professionals for many years in all tourism sites around the Angkor archaeological parks plus other sites across Cambodia. if you wish to have an enjoyable and unforgettable experience with an informative local tour guide, who is able to explain the history, art, culture and architecture of ancient temples or other tourism sites, we are your best choice. please let one of our teammates serve you to explore all the amazing temples and other historical sites during your trip to Cambodia.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g2366676-d15336660-Reviews-Private_Siem_Reap_Tour-Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Krous Village, Svay Dangkum Commune, Siem Reap, Cambodia', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'cou