Pub Street Villa,here:pds:place:116w63gg-59994de831a24adaa5e70588892e4948,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Pub Street Villa, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35666, 'lng': 103.85198}","[{'lat': 13.35671, 'lng': 103.85185}]",24853,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '20136337'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85586232289'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://pubstreetvilla.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.356574,103.85217,20136337,Pub Street Villa,"Pub Street Villa is very centrally located, providing stylish boutique Siem Reap accommodation. The Villa is located a short distance down Taphul Road, just two minutes walk from the Angkor Night Market, behind the famous Onederz Hostel. Set in a residential area, with garden, swimming pool and outdoor bar/dining area the property is one of the latest hidden jewels of Siem Reap. It offers both private rooms with ensuite and dormitory-style accommodation with detached bathrooms for groups on a small budget.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d20136337-Reviews-Pub_Street_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Lot #518 Taphul Road', 'street2': '(behind Onederz)', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17000', 'address_string': 'Lot #518 Taphul Road (behind Onederz), Siem Reap 17000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d20136337-Pub_Street_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not availa