Pulp Fiction Hostel,here:pds:place:116w3csk-08c7f1b511b14a34bfa21380fdb6929c,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Pulp Fiction Hostel, 180103 ព្រៃនប់, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រៃនប់', 'district': 'បិទត្រាំង', 'postalCode': '180103'}","{'lat': 10.59324, 'lng': 103.57522}","[{'lat': 10.59311, 'lng': 103.57522}]",84229,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15514757'}]",[{'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/PulpFictionOtres'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.593242,103.57522,15514757,Pulp Fiction Hostel,"Pure nature, far outside of Sihanoukville with all its hustle and bustle, on a 2 kilometer long, red dusty jungle slope, surrounded by miles of green fields and enclosed by an old stone wall. 10,000 square meters of nature, trees, jungle, shrubs, meadow and a huge lake where you can also fish. There are water buffalo, hummingbirds, fireflies, crickets. 10 Minutes to 'Otres Beach & Village'.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d15514757-Reviews-Pulp_Fiction_Hostel-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Otres Marina Rd', 'street2': 'leave the road at Sokimex Gas Station, follow the dirt road 2kms', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Otres Marina Rd leave the road at Sokimex Gas Station, follow the dirt road 2kms, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d15514757-Pulp_Fiction_Hostel-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#