Pursat Pizza House,here:pds:place:116aabd1-8f613f5e6c2501b4008c660105053f84,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Pursat Pizza House, 150603 ពោធិ៍សាត់, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ពោធិ៍សាត់', 'city': 'ពោធិ៍សាត់', 'district': 'ផ្ទះព្រៃ', 'postalCode': '150603'}","{'lat': 12.53746, 'lng': 103.91491}","[{'lat': 12.53751, 'lng': 103.91478}]",36727,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '101-000', 'name': 'American'}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '304-000', 'name': 'Italian'}, {'id': '800-057', 'name': 'Pizza'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6759711'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517519629'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/pursatpizzahouse'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT13H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Pursat,12.537452,103.91492,6759711,Pursat Pizza House,"Pursat Pizza House is the best restaurant family for western and Khmer food . We are the unique pizza here who make the fresh and delicious pizza that you could find in this area. You can offering any food that available in the menu but Pizza is the best. Our Pizza get the recipe and idea from friendship international volunteering in Pursat.( Non Organization). Those friends helping a lot my family to get an ideas set up very small business Pizza . To improving our cook and creativity for attractive customer...etc. The reason why I set up pizza business here : Because Pursat is the small town have no so many tourist, and foreigner , some of my friends come for working here as a volunteer , missionary , business and so on , and they missing their food as western food and family , countries, and other reason because I wanted to keep a good memory of loving friends , Feeling of love and sharing. I am missing all of my international friendship who came here and gave me a big warm hug with smiling on their faces and inspiring me to learn a lot from them. To get the idea want to help the poor children who learn English and computer at NGO to speaking English with foreigner when we have more tourist come to visit us. Those children will learn how to sharing culture from one person to other person. They would be very happy when they have more chance to speak English as the same as other language too. Student will learn how to share and love other people as the same as themselves. Pursat Pizza House is not the only restaurant to give you a food or drinks , but also to welcome you sharing history, culture,and general knowledge about real Khmer who live in this area. Moreover the tourist will get free information if they want to visit some attractive places and help them for reservation all kind of transportation if they want. Tourist will more understand about Cambodia especially Pursat town. Pursat Pizza House will provide you a lot more information when you are here . Please feel free to contact us. We will learn more from each other in the positive way. Thank you very much for your get involve and come to visit our place and buying our food and drinks. We wish you all very happiness and safe trip when you go everywhere around the world. Pursat Pizza House will give a good feeling with food and drinks and put the big smile on your face every time when you come here. Warmest Regard The manager team Sina",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g729356-d6759711-Reviews-Pursat_Pizza_House-Pursat_Pursat_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Pealnheak 1 Village', 'street2': 'Pteasprey Commune', 'city': 'Pursat', 'state': 'Pursat Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '15000', 'address_string': 'Pealnheak 1 Village Pteasprey Commune, Pursat 15000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Pursat', 'location_id': '729356'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Pursat Province', 'location_id': '2366674'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,ngin.sina@gmail.com,+855 17 519 629,http://www.facebook.com/pursatpizzahouse,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g729356-d6759711-Pursat_Pizza_House-Pursat_Pursat_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '729356', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 6 Places to Eat in Pursat', 'geo_location_name': 'Pursat', 'ranking_out_of': '6', 'ranking': '1'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,106,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '2', '4': '13', '5': '90'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",62,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g729356-d6759711-m66827-Reviews-Pursat_Pizza_House-Pursat_Pursat_Province.html#photos,$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2100'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2100'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 08:00 - 21:00', 'Tuesday: 08:00 - 21:00', 'Wednesday: 08:00 - 21:00', 'Thursday: 08:00 - 21:00', 'Friday: 08:00 - 21:00', 'Saturday: 08:00 - 21:00', 'Sunday: 08:00 - 21:00']}","['Cash Only', 'Delivery', 'Reservations', 'Seating', 'Serves Alcohol', 'Table Service', 'Takeout', 'Television', 'Wheelchair Accessible']","[{'name': 'italian', 'localized_name': 'Italian'}, {'name': 'pizza', 'localized_name': 'Pizza'}, {'name': 'asian', 'localized_name': 'Asian'}, {'name': 'cambodian', 'localized_name': 'Cambodian'}]",Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'restaurant', 'localized_name': 'Restaurant'}",Not available,Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '5'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '31'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '11'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '10'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '38'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,38,18
Pursat Riverside Hotel & Spa,here:pds:place:116w61zk-30ebada0435643ba9aa2b882e4099237,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Pursat Riverside Hotel & Spa, ផ្លូវ 147, 150603 ពោធិ៍សាត់, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ពោធិ៍សាត់', 'city': 'ពោធិ៍សាត់', 'district': 'ផ្ទះព្រៃ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 147', 'postalCode': '150603'}","{'lat': 12.5359, 'lng': 103.92028}","[{'lat': 12.53594, 'lng': 103.92015}]",123369,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6451061'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570537666'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.pursatriversidehotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Pursat,12.535738,103.92078,6451061,Pursat Riverside Hotel & Spa,"Pursat Riverside Hotel & Spa is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Pursat Town- Cambodia, offering a family-friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay. You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer a refrigerator and air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as Pursat Riverside Hotel & Spa offers guests free wifi. The hotel features a 24 hour Front desk, a concierge, Plus, Pursat Riverside Hotel & Spa offers a tropical pool and free buffet breakfast, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available. Travelers looking for Italian restaurants can head to Pursat Pizza House. Enjoy your stay in Pursat!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g729356-d6451061-Reviews-Pursat_Riverside_Hotel_Spa-Pursat_Pursat_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '101 Street', 'street2': 'Peal Nhek 1 Village', 'city': 'Pursat', 'state': 'Pursat Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '15000', 'address_string': '101 Street Peal Nhek 1 Village, Pursat 15000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Pursat', 'location_id': '729356'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Pursat Province', 'location_id': '2366674'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Camb