Q Travel Cambodia - Day Tours,here:pds:place:116w63u7-7a424b8860a84d398c0faae8b2c1319f,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Q Travel Cambodia - Day Tours, 171205 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'នគរធំ', 'postalCode': '171205'}","{'lat': 13.41197, 'lng': 103.86706}","[{'lat': 13.41184, 'lng': 103.86708}]",19416,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7917804'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855888487817'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.411914,103.86707,7917804,Q Travel Cambodia - Day Tours,"Q Travel Cambodia is a group of licensed tour guides, who offer private day tours and fun outings, to one of the World's great treasures; the historic temples of Angkor Wat and the Siem Reap region. We specialise in gay-friendly excursions. And we guarantee a good time. Our guides strive to enjoy every tour as much as our clients do. We promise to leave you smiling.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d7917804-Reviews-Q_Travel_Cambodia_Day_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,nilsareth@gmail.com,+855 88 848 7817,http://www.qtravelcambodia.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d7917804-Q_Travel_Cambodia_Day_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 83 Nightlife in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '83', 'ranking': '1'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,239,"{'1