Quad Adventure Cambodia Siem Reap,here:pds:place:116w63gg-dbef622bb60e47b9bc68f55fa70bba0f,en,tourist_attraction,"{'label': 'Quad Adventure Cambodia Siem Reap, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.34791, 'lng': 103.83794}","[{'lat': 13.34779, 'lng': 103.83791}]",227131,"[{'id': '300-3000-0023', 'name': 'Tourist Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1102505'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517784727'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.quad-adventure-cambodia.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 18:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT11H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.347906,103.83794,1102505,Quad Adventure Cambodia Siem Reap,"Explore the Cambodian countryside with our all-terrain vehicles... From the lush countryside to isolated villages, let Quad Adventure Cambodia take you for unforgettable memories! To avoid disappointment, please book directly with us through our reservation form online, you will receive very quickly a confirmation with a pick up time at your hotel or guest house.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d1102505-Reviews-Quad_Adventure_Cambodia_Siem_Reap-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'country road Laurent', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'country road Laurent, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@quad-adventure-cambodia.com,+855 17 784 727,http://www.quad-adventure-cambodia.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserRev