Queen na Guest House,here:pds:place:11650e51-ff6978090e2c8870f1f13790da99e2fa,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Queen na Guest House, ផ្លូវ អាប់ឌុលការីម, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ អាប់ឌុលការីម', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.55338, 'lng': 104.93035}","[{'lat': 11.55337, 'lng': 104.93054}]",74689,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3947875'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855234560011'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.553341,104.93063,3947875,Queen Na Guest House,"A beautiful Cambodian villa offering the the utmost in guest comfort and hospitality. Situated in a quiet area of Phnom Penh, but only minutes from the City Center, the Queen Na allows for a peaceful, undisturbed sleep in relaxing surroundings. We endeavor to make our guests feel at home at a realistic price.. Simply the best for less.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d3947875-Reviews-Queen_Na_Guest_House-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '18, Street 21, Tonle Bassac', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '18, Street 21, Tonle Bassac, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d3947875-Queen_Na_Guest_House-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#14 of 412 B&Bs / Inns in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '412', 'ranking': '14'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,78,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '19', '5': '59'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url