Queenco Hotel & Casino,here:pds:place:116httek-121b7b9916800d4fa25547a00d49fb99,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Queenco Hotel & Casino, ផ្លូវ ក្រុង, 180403 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ក្រុង', 'postalCode': '180403'}","{'lat': 10.63721, 'lng': 103.50172}","[{'lat': 10.63717, 'lng': 103.50185}]",101482,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2441631'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85534933733', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}, {'value': '+855967777865'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.queencoasia.com'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.637314,103.50139,2441631,Queenco Hotel & Casino,"Nestled on the immaculate shores of Victory Beach, the Queenco Hotel & Casino in Sihanoukville, Cambodia, offers you a luxurious seaside escape. Immerse yourself in the tranquility of the glistening waters and the soft, powdery sands as you bask under the warmth of the tropical sun. Allow the day to gently drift away as you indulge in a fine glass of wine on our beachfront terrace, where the vibrant hues of the setting sun paint the sky with natural splendor. Queenco Hotel & Casino is a haven of leisure, blending the thrill of gaming with the serene beauty of the oceanfront environment. This elegant retreat is conveniently situated just 17 km from Sihanoukville Airport, granting easy access to your dream vacation. For those arriving from farther afield, Phnom Penh International Airport is approximately 2 and a half hours away, making Queenco Hotel & Casino a worthwhile destination for international and local guests alike.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d2441631-Reviews-Queenco_Hotel_Casino-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street2': 'Victory Beach, Mohavithey Krong, District 3', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 's