Rac Central,here:pds:place:116w63u5-ceb4bbf2a4ff45c6b6f5adb99523f275,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Rac Central, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.38434, 'lng': 103.85189}","[{'lat': 13.38436, 'lng': 103.8519}]",22671,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '700-7200-0261', 'name': 'IT and Office Equipment Services'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'www': [{'value': 'http://www.webuynsale.com'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.354759,103.85256,9805808,Central Suite Residence,"Central Suite Residence boasts 32 luxurious rooms that are perfectly located on Sok San Road in the heart of Siem Reap. While the downtown district is literally but a few minutes walk away, the hotel still offers an oasis of calm, peace, and tranquility. Within a 20 minute drive to the world heritage site of Angkor Archaeological Park and with a myriad of bars, restaurants and shops nearby, you are never far from all Siem Reap has to offer.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d9805808-Reviews-Central_Suite_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sok San Road', 'street2': 'City Center, Old Market Area', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17000', 'address_string': 'Sok San Road City Center, Old Market Area, Siem Reap 17000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d9805808-Central_Suite_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#5 of 763 hotels in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_