Rainbow Bridge Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-3724eb45e53442f0bd46bd03190b6e22,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Rainbow Bridge Guesthouse, 070803 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់បាយ', 'postalCode': '070803'}","{'lat': 10.60952, 'lng': 104.17887}","[{'lat': 10.6094, 'lng': 104.17893}]",19875,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6733288'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517521665'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.609497,104.17888,6733288,Rainbow Bridge Guesthouse,"If you’re looking for a family-friendly guest house in Kampot, look no further than Rainbow Bridge Guesthouse.
The Old Royal Cinema (0.2 mi), located nearby, makes Rainbow Bridge Guesthouse a great place to stay for those interested in visiting this popular Kampot landmark.
Rooms at Rainbow Bridge Guesthouse provide a flat screen TV and air conditioning, and guests can stay connected with free internet access.
You can also enjoy a lounge while staying at Rainbow Bridge Guesthouse.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of Kampot's popular burritos restaurants such as Rusty Keyhole, Rikitikitavi, and Veronica's Kitchen, all a short distance from Rainbow Bridge Guesthouse.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out Farm Link (0.5 mi), a popular attraction that is within walking distance of Rainbow Bridge Guesthouse.
The staff at Rainbow Bridge Guesthouse looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
