Rainbow Guest House,here:pds:place:116aabd1-d63b983b65870586ad1e73288b10d862,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Rainbow Guest House, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36893, 'lng': 103.85002}","[{'lat': 13.36906, 'lng': 103.85005}]",24007,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10335376'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85587854144'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.368686,103.84996,10335376,Rainbow Guest House,"The Rainbow House provides a relaxing retreat in Siem Reap, just a 10-minute drive from Siem Reap International Airport. The hotel provides an airport pick-up service and Wi-Fi is available free of charge throughout the guesthouse. The guesthouse is located within an 8-minute drive of Night Market and Pub street. Angkor Wat Temple is located about 6 km away, while the Resident Royal Palace and Angkor National Museum is a 5-minute drive.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d10335376-Reviews-Rainbow_Guest_House-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'House Number #376, National Road 6, Salakanseng Village Svay Dangkom', 'street2': 'between the Goldiana Hotel and Siem Reap TAX branch', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'House Number #376, National Road 6, Salakanseng Village Svay Dangkom between the Goldiana Hotel and Siem Reap TAX branch, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d10335376-Rainbow_Guest_House-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province