Rainbow House Milk Green Tea,here:pds:place:116httek-286e4a500dc70de8101b5fa3f7234443,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Rainbow House Milk Green Tea, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09869, 'lng': 103.20247}","[{'lat': 13.09889, 'lng': 103.2025}]",12773,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593338910'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.rainbowcitytaxis.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.090002,103.19585,2617656,Green Mango Cafe and Bakery,"Try our signature Banana Bread French Toast with our Chorizo Sausage made in-house. Our contemporary coffee bar features lattes, cappuccinos and blended iced coffee. Cool off with a refreshing smoothie or fresh lime juice!A blend of American, Mexican, Italian and Khmer favorites comprise our lunch menu. Grab a boxed lunch for a day trip or bring in the whole family or office for a party. Free WiFi, air conditioning and delivery are available.Specialty brownies, cakes, cookies and muffins are made daily in our bakery. Purchase a loaf of white bread, whole grain rolls or herb foccacia to enjoy at home. Our Green Mango Pie is sure to be a favorite!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g303666-d2617656-Reviews-Green_Mango_Cafe_and_Bakery-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Battambang City, Street 135', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'Battambang City, Street 135, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,+855 17 315 450,http://greenmangocambodia.com/,https://www.tripadvi