Rainforest Hotel,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-722bb023f7535a76ca48b4485407d6f6,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Rainforest Hotel, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.63281, 'lng': 104.16082}","[{'lat': 10.63286, 'lng': 104.16095}]",24934,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,[],Not Available,Not Available,Kampot,10.62749,104.16338,26554401,Rainforest Hotel By NSUN,"Our brand new hotel is equipped with 36 luxurious rooms and 2 private villas. Our 4-star rooms provide the perfect blend of comfort and convenience with 24-hour service and lavish facilities. Whether you're seeking a luxurious night's rest or want to host an unforgettable meeting, our conference room, swimming pool, and other amenities will make your stay truly special. Experience the traditional Khmer hospitality and feel enveloped in comfort and style with every moment at Rainforest Hotel by NSUN.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d26554401-Reviews-Rainforest_Hotel_By_NSUN-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Tuek Chhu Rd', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '7454', 'address_string': 'Tuek Chhu Rd, Kampot 7454 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d26554401-Rainforest_Hotel_By_NSUN-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#10 of 88 hotels in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '88', 'ranking': '10'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,17,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '1',