Raingsey Bungalow,here:pds:place:116httek-edc891fc3481079b400d2c3ae4566ea4,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Raingsey Bungalow, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.49089, 'lng': 104.29321}","[{'lat': 10.49102, 'lng': 104.29319}]",7233,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11840138'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1834458'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85585560294'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://raingsey.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.490323,104.29331,1834458,Raingsey Bungalow,"Your home away from home. Raingsey Bungalow is nestled in the quiet coastal town of Kep in Cambodia and located just a stone's throw away from the famous Kep Crab Market and the seashores. If you are seeking the tranquility, relaxation and the beauty of a chic oasis, then look no further than Raingsey Bungalow! 9 private bungalows offer you total peace and privacy. Whilst relaxing on the front of balcony facing our charming swimming pool surrounded by bamboos and shaded by the palm trees, you will be able to truly enjoy every single moment here and be inspired from all the different sounds of nature. Being situated at the foot of Kep National Park, it will certainly make you feel as if you are in a dreamland and it allows you finding the true relaxation, enjoyment, and plenty of inspiration!!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d1834458-Reviews-Raingsey_Bungalow-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'NR33A', 'street2': 'Thmey Village, Prey Thom Commune, Crab Market', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07503', 'address_string': 'NR33A Thmey Village, Prey Thom Commune, Crab Market, Kep 07503 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'loc