Rainsey Angkor Art & Home,here:pds:place:116aabd1-dc217048a99f05e255ebbf5b2ed714da,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Rainsey Angkor Art & Home, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.35942, 'lng': 103.8828}","[{'lat': 13.35944, 'lng': 103.88266}]",22505,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9975762'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570875588'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.rainseyangkorartandhome.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.359429,103.88271,9975762,Rainsey Angkor Art & Home,"Rainsey Angkor Art & Home sells fast on our site. Set in Siem Reap in the Siem Reap Province Region, 3.1 km from Pub Street, Rainsey Angkro Art & Home boasts a hot tub and water sports facilities. Angkor Wat is 6 km away. Free WiFi is provided throughout the property. Featuring a terrace, all units are air conditioned and include a seating area with a satellite flat-screen TV and laptop. Some units have a dining.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d9975762-Reviews-Rainsey_Angkor_Art_Home-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Ousa Angkor Street', 'street2': 'National Road No.6, Phum Chong Kae Sou', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '10084', 'address_string': 'Ousa Angkor Street National Road No.6, Phum Chong Kae Sou, Siem Reap 10084 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d9975762-Rainsey_Angkor_Art_Home-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#190 of