': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'wellness_spas', 'localized_name': 'Spas & Wellness'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Spas & Wellness', 'localized_name': 'Spas & Wellness', 'categories': [{'name': 'Spas', 'localized_name': 'Spas'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '1'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,20,14
Raksa Bar & Bungalows,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-9a7e66e5fd3445dc84f56ff4c1023e68,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Raksa Bar & Bungalows, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.60675, 'lng': 103.52066}","[{'lat': 10.60688, 'lng': 103.52067}]",105161,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8139000'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+8558553494900'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.raksabar.webs.com'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.606563,103.52019,8139000,Raksa Bar & Bungalows,"Looking for a place to stay in Sihanoukville? Then look no further than Raksa Bar & Bungalows, a budget friendly guest house that brings the best of Sihanoukville to your doorstep.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as Raksa Bar & Bungalows offers guests free wifi.
The guest house features room service, baggage storage, and beach chairs. Plus, Raksa Bar & Bungalows offers a lounge, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
Close to some of Sihanoukville's most popular landmarks, such as CJ Outlet and Jewelry Center (1.1 mi) and Wat Krom Temple (1.6 mi), Raksa Bar & Bungalows is a great destination for tourists.
While in Sihanoukville, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Raksa Bar & Bungalows, including The Big Easy (0.3 mi), Sandan (0.9 mi), and Nyam (0.3 mi).
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out a waterfall, such as Kbal Chhay Waterfall.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Raksa Bar & Bungalows as you experience everything Sihanoukville has to offer.
