Raksmey Dara,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-0804b743fef7485e950b5240cc4479e8,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Raksmey Dara, 180402 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'ពីរ', 'postalCode': '180402'}","{'lat': 10.62423, 'lng': 103.52579}","[{'lat': 10.62431, 'lng': 103.52568}]",48613,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516455550'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.617666,103.495,782418,Independence Hotel by Dara,"Independence Hotel Resort & Spa is an oasis of calm and luxury in Sihanouk Ville, Kingdom of Cambodia - one of the finest locations in South East Asia. Unspoiled sands backed by lush vegetation encircle the hotel. The full delights of the resort, spa and private beach are ready for you to enjoy. Set in the charming tropical beauty of Cambodia's premier beach destination, with 35 hectares landscape and 300 meters of private beach, Independence Hotel Resort & Spa provides you a luxurious refuge that opens out onto breath taking panoramas. Provided 8 differences categories of 128 units, with 3 function rooms, 2 Restaurants and 2 bars. The Volley ball, sunset cruises and kids play-ground are available on the beach. Home of Jouvence Spa: Cambodia's Premier Spa",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d782418-Reviews-Independence_Hotel_by_Dara-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 2 Thnou', 'street2': 'Sangkat 3', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Street 2 Thnou Sangkat 3, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not