Raksmey Makara Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w614p-f8ef4753f46c414d8b19c61f92d44a43,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Raksmey Makara Guesthouse, ផ្លូវជាតិ 48, 090701 ខេមរភូមិន្ទ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កោះកុង', 'city': 'ខេមរភូមិន្ទ', 'district': 'ស្មាច់មានជ័យ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 48', 'postalCode': '090701'}","{'lat': 11.61541, 'lng': 103.00054}","[{'lat': 11.61528, 'lng': 103.00054}]",39732,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6161469'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855972449999'}]}],Not Available,Koh Kong,11.615562,103.00054,6161469,Raksmey Makara Guesthouse,"Finding an ideal guest house in Koh Kong does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Raksmey Makara Guesthouse, a nice option for travelers like you.
Rooms at Raksmey Makara Guesthouse offer a minibar and air conditioning providing exceptional comfort and convenience, and guests can go online with free wifi.
An on-site restaurant will also help to make your stay even more special.
Travelers looking to enjoy some fish and chips can head to Fat Sam's Restaurant and Bar. Otherwise, you may want to check out a pub such as Mumma Lucy's Restaurant and Bar or Stevie C's Sports Bar.
Looking to explore? Then look no further than Tatai Waterfall, which is a popular Koh Kong waterfall – and it is conveniently located a short distance from the guest house.
Raksmey Makara Guesthouse looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Koh Kong.
