Ramchang Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w636e-4387442672c84fa8a7749096a8fbced3,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Ramchang Guesthouse, 021401 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ទួលតាឯក', 'postalCode': '021401'}","{'lat': 13.10009, 'lng': 103.18019}","[{'lat': 13.10009, 'lng': 103.18033}]",10913,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6451041'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85589793339'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.ramchangguesthouse.com/en-us'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.100089,103.18013,6451041,Ramchang Guesthouse,"Ramchang Guesthouse is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Battambang, offering a family-friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, a refrigerator, and a seating area, and you can stay connected during your stay as Ramchang Guesthouse offers guests free wifi.
The guest house features a 24 hour front desk, room service, and a concierge. Plus, Ramchang Guesthouse offers a pool and an on-site restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Battambang, Ramchang Guesthouse is located a short distance from White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (1.2 mi) and Prasat Sneung (1.5 mi).
Travelers looking to enjoy some ribs can head to Jaan Bai Restaurant or Ambrosia Cafe. Otherwise, you may want to check out a pub such as Bar Ang Restaurant & Bar, Madison, or Pomme.
During your visit, be sure to check out HUMAN Gallery - Joseba Etxebarria Photography (1.2 mi), which is a popular attraction within walking distance of the guest house.
Enjoy your stay in Battambang!
