.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",61,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d6451041-m66827-Reviews-Ramchang_Guesthouse-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Free Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Air conditioning', 'Refrigerator in room', 'Outdoor pool', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Concierge', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Parking', 'Housekeeping', 'Baggage Storage', 'Bath / Shower', 'Bicycles Available', 'Bottled Water', 'Coffee Shop', 'English', 'Complimentary Toiletries', '24-Hour Front Desk', 'Khmer', 'Seating Area', '24-Hour Security', 'Shops']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'bb', 'localized_name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"['Family', 'Charming']",[],Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,FALSE,25,1
Ramo Resort,here:pds:place:116aabd1-90096943876c07d724e0a9ee40352c04,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Ramo Resort, 38, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'street': '38'}","{'lat': 10.61766, 'lng': 104.16748}","[{'lat': 10.61766, 'lng': 104.16748}]",25882,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9877200'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512738713'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.618022,104.16841,9877200,Ramo Resort,"Looking for a place to stay in Kampot? Then look no further than Ramo Resort, a romantic small hotel that brings the best of Kampot to your doorstep.
In addition, while staying at Ramo Resort guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and 24 hour check-in, and you can stay connected with free wifi. You can also enjoy a lounge while staying at Ramo Resort. Need a place to park? Free parking is available at Ramo Resort.
Close to The Old Royal Cinema (1.1 mi), a popular Kampot landmark, Ramo Resort is a great destination for tourists.
While in Kampot be sure to experience local ribs favorites at Rusty Keyhole or Rikitikitavi.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Farm Link (0.4 mi), which is a popular attraction amongst tourists, and it is within walking distance.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Ramo Resort as you experience everything Kampot has to offer.
