Ratanak City Restaurant and Hotel,here:pds:place:116w67kg-7f86d923840849439ca0d34477814740,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Ratanak City Restaurant and Hotel, 160904 បានលុង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'រតនគីរី', 'city': 'បានលុង', 'district': 'បឹងកន្សែង', 'postalCode': '160904'}","{'lat': 13.74206, 'lng': 106.9885}","[{'lat': 13.74219, 'lng': 106.98846}]",152041,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '700-7200-0253', 'name': 'Catering & Other Food Services'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512222828'}]}],Not Available,Ratanakiri,13.744247,106.98706,8674929,Ratanak City Hotel,"Finding an ideal budget friendly hotel in Banlung does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Ratanak City Hotel, a nice option for travelers like you.
Ratanak City Hotel offers guests an array of room amenities including air conditioning, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available.
The hotel offers a 24 hour front desk and baggage storage, to make your visit even more pleasant. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
If you like pubs, Ratanak City Hotel is conveniently located near Balcony Pub and Banlung Kitchen.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Ka Chanh Waterfall, which is a popular waterfall amongst tourists.
Ratanak City Hotel looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Banlung.
