Reahoo Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w63u5-dfcba33fbbd749faba281aecf1c77c3f,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Reahoo Restaurant, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37376, 'lng': 103.86303}","[{'lat': 13.37368, 'lng': 103.86314}]",22644,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '211-000', 'name': 'Indonesian'}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '304-000', 'name': 'Italian'}, {'id': '800-064', 'name': 'International'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12595334'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563760581'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.montranivesha.com/dine'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:00 - 23:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT17H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.373704,103.86311,12595334,Reahoo Restaurant,"For an unforgettable gastronomic experience, we invite you to discover the delights on offer at Reahoo Restaurant, home of authentic Khmer cuisine in sophisticated surroundings. The culinary team in the Reahoo kitchen are delighted to introduce you to the subtle balance of flavors the traditional art of Cambodian cooking has to offer. Sandwiched beyond the culinary giants of Thailand and Vietnam, it should come as no surprise that Cambodian cooking has many mouthwatering moments all of its own. We are dedicated to preserving authentic cooking methods, ingredients and presentation, as passed down from generation to generation. We are proud of our quality ingredients, which are exclusively fresh, organic and locally sourced. We can adapt our dishes to your liking and also offer a variety of set menus, international favorites, snacks and specialties from our grill.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d12595334-Reviews-Reahoo_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '5 Krom 2', 'street2': 'Near Angkor Wat Road', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17251', 'address_string': '5 Krom 2 Near Angkor Wat Road, Siem Reap 17251 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,reservations@montranivesha.com,+855 63 760 581,http://www.montranivesha.com/dine/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12595334-Reahoo_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#343 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '343'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,19,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '4', '5': '14'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",48,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d12595334-m66827-Reviews-Reahoo_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0600'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0600'