Reaksmey Battambang Hotel,here:pds:place:116w636e-918d872f5cce4fc98adb99132c7b0717,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Reaksmey Battambang Hotel, 021409 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'អូរចារ', 'postalCode': '021409'}","{'lat': 13.10533, 'lng': 103.18096}","[{'lat': 13.1052, 'lng': 103.18096}]",11358,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '400-4100-0041', 'name': 'Transportation Service'}, {'id': '700-7200-0328', 'name': 'B2B Sales & Services'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515878799'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.reaksmeybattambang.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.107049,103.18927,4403435,Reaksmey Battambang Hotel,"See why so many travelers make Reaksmey Battambang Hotel their hotel of choice when visiting Battambang. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a romantic setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Nearby landmarks such as White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (0.8 mi) and Battambang Crocodile Farm (1.5 mi) make Reaksmey Battambang Hotel a great place to stay when visiting Battambang.
Rooms at Reaksmey Battambang Hotel offer air conditioning, a refrigerator, and a fireplace providing exceptional comfort and convenience, and guests can go online with free wifi.
A 24 hour front desk, room service, and a concierge are some of the conveniences offered at this hotel. An on-site restaurant will also help to make your stay even more special. If you are driving to Reaksmey Battambang Hotel, parking is available.
During your visit, be sure to check out a popular Battambang bibimbap  restaurant such as Cafe Eden, which is a short distance from Reaksmey Battambang Hotel.
Battambang is also known for some great ancient ruins, including Prasat Sneung and Ek Phnom, which are not too far from Reaksmey Battambang Hotel.
At Reaksmey Battambang Hotel, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Battambang.
