Real Cambodia Tour,here:pds:place:116w636k-82b8634639a44fc9234b2c99a38b16de,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Real Cambodia Tour, 020809 សង្កែ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'សង្កែ', 'district': 'អូរដំបងពីរ', 'postalCode': '020809'}","{'lat': 13.07285, 'lng': 103.21628}","[{'lat': 13.07284, 'lng': 103.21614}]",12905,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8720430'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570854044'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://realcambodiatour.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:30 - 19:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T083000', 'duration': 'PT10H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Battambang,13.07285,103.21626,8720430,Real Cambodia Tour,Dear all Travellers You want to visit Battambang and Real Cambodia? My name is Savet a former of English teacher from 2010 to 2014 and graduated University in 2013 major of Human Resource Management. Now I work as a tour guide and Tuk Tuk driver base in Battambang. I would like to introduce my unique tour program if you have one day to visit Battambang. What makes us different? - We mix bike tour and Tuk Tuk tour in a day. - We do explore village life by bikes so this is the best way to know Real Cambodia. It is my own village where i was born so i will show you how we live and enjoy cycling around beautiful countryside. - We offer you a local lunch that will be prepared by my wife. - You will have a chance to meet friendly local people and they are so happy to meet you. - We are happy during the tour if you have more questions to ask.,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d8720430-Reviews-Real_Cambodia_Tour-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02201', 'address_string': 'Battambang 02201 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City'