Reasmey Cheanich Hotel,here:pds:place:116w64up-94a4aac510994d6fa387d535f6b6efdb,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Reasmey Cheanich Hotel, 030402 កំពង់ចាម, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'city': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'district': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'postalCode': '030402'}","{'lat': 11.99182, 'lng': 105.46234}","[{'lat': 11.99182, 'lng': 105.46234}]",25060,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6396235'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512358716'}], 'www': [{'value': 'Www.reasmeycheanich.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kampong Cham,11.991819,105.46234,6396235,Reasmey Cheanich Hotel,"See why so many travelers make Reasmey Cheanich Hotel their hotel of choice when visiting Kampong Cham. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a family-friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Wat Nokor (1.7 mi), located nearby, makes Reasmey Cheanich Hotel a great place to stay for those interested in visiting this popular Kampong Cham landmark.
Rooms at Reasmey Cheanich Hotel provide air conditioning and a desk, and guests can stay connected with free wifi.
In addition, while staying at Reasmey Cheanich Hotel guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, 24 hour check-in, and baggage storage. You can also enjoy an on-site restaurant. Need a place to park? Free parking is available at Reasmey Cheanich Hotel.
While staying in Kampong Cham, you can check out a popular seafood restaurant like K2 Seafood Buffer Restaurant, which is serving up some great dishes.
If you’re looking for something to do, Ko Paen Bamboo Bridge (0.9 mi) and The French Tower (1.0 mi) are a nice way to spend some time, and they are all within walking distance of Reasmey Cheanich Hotel.
At Reasmey Cheanich Hotel, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Kampong Cham.
