Red House,here:pds:place:116w64d5-089d51647ab54b469b522d81267b5bf8,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Red House, 121004 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ជ្រោយចង្វារ', 'subdistrict': 'កោះដាច់', 'postalCode': '121004'}","{'lat': 11.64528, 'lng': 104.92559}","[{'lat': 11.64533, 'lng': 104.92572}]",66407,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8817083'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855967360256'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.kohdachredhouse.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.645288,104.92561,8817083,Red House,"Sreypaou, Sengou and Stephan invite you to come and share their daily life on Silk Island (Koh Dach), only 10 km away from Phnom Penh. Our guesthouse nestled by the side of the Mekong will open for you the doors of the rich and true Cambodian rural life. You have the choice between 3 rooms with ensuite bathrooms wich allow us to welcome 8 people at the same time.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1200037-d8817083-Reviews-Red_House-Koh_Dach.html?m=66827,"{'street2': 'Chong Koh Commune', 'city': 'Koh Dach', 'state': 'Koh Dach', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Chong Koh Commune, Koh Dach Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Koh Dach', 'location_id': '1200037'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1200037-d8817083-Red_House-Koh_Dach.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '1200037', 'ranking_string': '#2 of 3 B&Bs / Inns in Koh Dach', 'geo_location_name': 'Koh Dach', 'ranking_out_of': '3', 'ranking': '2'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,29,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '1', '5': '28'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratin