Red Raid,here:pds:place:116w649e-0918cd965abb51df34e97c91eed3fef1,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Red Raid, ផ្លូវ 155 480, 120109 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទួលទំពូងទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 155', 'postalCode': '120109', 'houseNumber': '480'}","{'lat': 11.53634, 'lng': 104.91556}","[{'lat': 11.53634, 'lng': 104.91543}]",6616,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9824728'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577548232'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.motorcycletourscambodia.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sat: 08:00 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT09H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.534688,104.91802,9824728,Red Raid,"Red Raid Adventure Cambodia offers motorcyclists the adventure of a lifetime with unique tailor made guided or self-guided tours! Whether you're interested in carving through the deep jungle on a dirt bike, riding along the Mekong River, discovering the exotic Angkorian temples lost in the rainforest or cruising down the beautiful South on an Africa Twin or Mash Scrambler, it’s all possible! Our passionate team is dedicated to helping you discover the best of Cambodia, providing you with the ultimate tips on what equipment and expertise you need! Our tour guides are among the most experienced motorcycle riders in Cambodia and they will give you what you are looking for! Our bikes are meticulously maintained in our workshop in Phnom Penh. Just immerse yourself in one of the most wild environments and cultures in Asia and enjoy your adventure with us!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d9824728-Reviews-Red_Raid-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#48 Bis, Street 480', 'street2': 'Corner Street 155, near the Russian Market - Toul Tompoung', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12307', 'address_string': '#48 Bis, Street 480 Corner Street 155, near the Russian Market - Toul Tompoung, Phnom Penh 12307 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,motolandcambodia@gmail.com,+855 77 548 232,http://www.motorcycletourscambodia.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d9824728-Red_Raid-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#63 of 283 Tours in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '283', 'ranking': '63'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,71,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '3', '5': '67'}",Not available,96,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d9824728-m66827-Reviews-Red_Raid-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1700'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Tuesday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Wednesday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Thursday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Friday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Saturday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Sunday: Closed']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Private Tours', 'localized_name': 'Private Tours'}, {'name': 'City Tours', 'localiz