Redbuff Coffee House,here:pds:place:116w63gg-f77ae1ade6b046b4aaf33903fe7886a1,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Redbuff Coffee House, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35825, 'lng': 103.85846}","[{'lat': 13.35813, 'lng': 103.85841}]",24255,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570599191'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.37201,103.841255,9812840,RedBuff Coffee House,"RedBuff coffee house, is offering local ingredient cakes and freshly squeeze with no sugar added. We like to promote healthy eating and drinking, from our local seasonal fruits. We also offering organic salad grown ourself, with decent price offering to all customers. Our dessert & cakes are using fresh ingredients, ""no canned coconut milk"" , real fresh fruits & fresh ingredients.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d9812840-Reviews-RedBuff_Coffee_House-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National road 6', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'National road 6, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,RedBuffcoffeehouse@gmail.com,+855 92 595 981,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d9812840-RedBuff_Coffee_House-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#204 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '204'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,80,"{'1': '1