Ree Hotel,here:pds:place:116w63u4-5ccbe631dfed4cb9be04781d713a835d,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Ree Hotel, អេអេច21, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'អេអេច21', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.37603, 'lng': 103.83552}","[{'lat': 13.37592, 'lng': 103.83545}]",87577,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1171614'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563766888'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://reehotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.376261,103.83568,1171614,Ree Hotel,"Nestled within private gardens, Ree Hotel offers accommodation away from the hustle and bustle of Siem Reap. It offfers a year-round outdoor pool, barbecue and sun terrace. Guests can enjoy dining options at the on-site restaurants or have a drink at the bar. Free WiFi is available throughout the property and there is free parking on site. Ree Hotel is a 1.1 km drive from Cambodian Cultural Village and the vibrant Pub Street is located 3 km away. It is a 9 km-drive to Angkor Wat, while Angkor National Museum is 2.6 km from the property. The nearest airport is Siem Reap - Angkor International Airport, 5 km from the property. The property offers complimentary airport transfers upon request. Each room at this hotel is air conditioned and features a private terrace that opens up to views. Certain rooms have a seating area where you can relax and all rooms are fitted with a flat-screen satellite TV. You will find a kettle in the room. Rooms include a private bathroom equipped with a bath. Extras include bath robes, slippers and free toiletries. Guests can approach the 24-hour front desk for currency exchange, tour and ticketing services. Bike hire is available at this hotel and the area is popular for horse riding. The hotel also offers car hire. There are various dining options available at Ree Hotel. Orchid Coffee House serves up local Khmer, Asian and Western cuisine while lighter refreshments are offered at Carnation Lounge and the Palm Terrace.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1171614-Reviews-Ree_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road 6', 'street2': 'Kruos Village, Svay Dangkum Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '85563', 'address_string': 'National Road 6 Kruos Village, Svay Dangkum Commune, Siem Reap 85563 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d1171614-Ree_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#272 of 763 hotels in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '763', 'ranking': '272'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,221,"{'1': '5', '2': '11', '3': '32', '4': '95', '5': '78'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'n