Residence 22 Hotel,here:pds:place:116w63u5-a536d0ce5f9e6970424783eff3a4dcf3,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Residence 22 Hotel, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.38151, 'lng': 103.84342}","[{'lat': 13.38138, 'lng': 103.84339}]",86994,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26449032'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85599559566'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/residence22siemreap', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.381479,103.843414,26449032,Residence 22 Hotel,"Located in Siem Reap, a 18-minute walk from King's Road Angkor, Residence 22 provides accommodations with a garden, free private parking and a terrace. This 3-star hotel offers room service and a 24-hour front desk. Guests can enjoy pool views. Complete with a private bathroom equipped with a bidet and free toiletries, guest rooms at the hotel have a flat-screen TV and air conditioning, and certain rooms include a balcony. All rooms will provide guests with a fridge. Popular points of interest near Residence 22 include Preah Ang Chek Preah Ang Chom, Royal Residence and Angkor National Museum. The nearest airport is Siem Reap International Airport, 4.3 miles from the accommodation.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d26449032-Reviews-Residence_22_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Near Krous School', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '171202', 'address_string': 'Near Krous School, Siem Reap 171202 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'le