Restaurant Pierre Loti,here:pds:place:116aabd1-a2bec293315b0ad63c74bd79c66797c3,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Restaurant Pierre Loti, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37109, 'lng': 103.86383}","[{'lat': 13.37104, 'lng': 103.86396}]",22804,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-064', 'name': 'International'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5772738'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563963879'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.resortlavillaloti.com/en/la-villa-loti/restaurant-bar'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:30 - 21:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T063000', 'duration': 'PT15H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.371059,103.86391,5772738,Restaurant Pierre Loti,"Restaurant Pierre Loti is part of Resort La Villa Loti, quiet situated riverside. Our restaurant is semi open air and we serve breakfast, lunch and dinner. The kitchen is traditional Khmer and international. All our dishes are fresh and homemade. Off the menu we have regularly changing specials.If you have special requests, we will meet them as far as possible.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d5772738-Reviews-Restaurant_Pierre_Loti-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '225 River Road', 'street2': 'Trang Village, Sangkat Slor Kram', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '225 River Road Trang Village, Sangkat Slor Kram, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@resortla