Retreat Villa Boutique & Spa,here:pds:place:116aabd1-0fcf627c83050ecbb69a8e45e99628e5,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Retreat Villa Boutique & Spa, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.36267, 'lng': 103.86235}","[{'lat': 13.3627, 'lng': 103.86222}]",23608,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2572931'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577409241'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.362667,103.86236,2572931,Retreat Villa Boutique & Spa,"The Retreat Villa Boutique & Spa offer free pick up, late breakfast It is architecturally constructed from the fine teak wood and all rooms with its spaciously private balcony are carefully designed for the residential retreat atmosphere. With the limited number of rooms, this Boutique hotel will surely cater to the privacy of our guests. In addition, we provide the Remork, Tuk Tuk, service as a private transportation to and from the airport for the convenience of our customers while visiting Siem Reap and Angkor Wat",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d2572931-Reviews-Retreat_Villa_Boutique_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '0126 Wat Bo Rd.', 'street2': 'Slorkrame Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '063', 'address_string': '0126 Wat Bo Rd. Slorkrame Village, Siem Reap 063 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d2572931-Retreat_Villa_Boutique_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'g