Rith Serey Oudom,here:pds:place:116w65h2-cc66176fc5914ca5a03e1f15dcc684a6,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Rith Serey Oudom, 030404 កំពង់ចាម, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'city': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'district': 'វាលវង់', 'postalCode': '030404'}","{'lat': 11.99915, 'lng': 105.45009}","[{'lat': 11.99902, 'lng': 105.4501}]",23509,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855963600780'}]}],Not Available,Kampong Cham,12.375628,106.05773,2051626,Moha Oudom Hotel,"Please be advised Moha Oudom Hotel is under new management since March 2016. 24 hour security cameras have been installed and a security lockbox is located at reception. Moha Oudom is a Khmer style 40 room hotel located on the picturesque riverfront overlooking the Tonle Sap River (Mekong River). Enjoy spectacular river sunset views from our two large patio areas. Our rooms are varied and cater to all travellers. Choose from single, double or family rooms with either fan or airconditioning. All rooms feature windows, cable TV and en suite bathrooms with hot or cold showers. Wifi is available throughout the building. Here at Moha Oudom Hotel we can arrange local tours as well as bus tickets, bike rental and visa services. Khmer restaurants are located right next door and Western restaurants are just a 2 minute walk away. The local market (Psar Samaki) is just around the corner. ATMs are nearby. Walk or cycle along the shaded riverfront promenade.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g729351-d2051626-Reviews-Moha_Oudom_Hotel-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '437 Riverside Street', 'street2': 'Watt Village', 'city': 'Kratie', 'state': 'Kratie Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '437 Riverside Street Watt Village, Kratie Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kratie', 'location_id': '729351'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kratie Province', 'location_id': '2366668'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g729351-d2051626-Moha_Oudom_Hotel-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '729351', 'ranking_string': '#19 of 25 B&Bs / Inns in Kratie', 'geo_location_name': 'Kratie', 'ranking_out_of': '25', 'ranking': '19'}",2,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/2.0-66827-5.svg,76,"{'1': '33', '2': '18', '3': '12', '4': '7', '5': '6'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss2.5.svg', 'value': '2.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss2.5.svg', 'value': '2.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss2.0.svg', 'value': '2.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss2.5.svg', 'value': '2.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss2.0.svg', 'value': '2.0'}}",32,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g729351-d2051626-m66827-Reviews-Moha_Oudom_Hotel-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Parking', 'English', 'Italian', 'Khmer']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'bb', 'localized_name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"['Great View', 'Budget']",[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '3'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '30'}, {'