River Dolphin Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-0ab09855aff7029da5677faea40bee70,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'River Dolphin Hotel, 100604 ក្រចេះ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ក្រចេះ', 'city': 'ក្រចេះ', 'district': 'អូរឫស្សី', 'postalCode': '100604'}","{'lat': 12.49714, 'lng': 106.02754}","[{'lat': 12.49714, 'lng': 106.0274}]",114993,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6370350'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85572210570'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/hotelriverdolphin', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kratie,12.497139,106.027466,6370350,River Dolphin Hotel,"Full service western oriented hotel in Kratie opened in April 2014. Rooms cater from budget to mid-range. Only hotel swimming pool in Kratie Town. Located in a quieter area of Kratie about 2 km from the public market and riverside. Bar and restaurant serves Asian and western foods. A/C, flat screen TVs, balconies, free rides to and town center/river from 6 a.m. to 10 p.m. and pick-up from bus/minivan. Bike and motor rentals, workout room, 24-hr security/reception.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g729351-d6370350-Reviews-River_Dolphin_Hotel-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sangkat Orussey', 'city': 'Kratie', 'state': 'Kratie Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Sangkat Orussey, Kratie Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kratie', 'location_id': '729351'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kratie Province', 'location_id': '2366668'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g729351-d6370350-River_Dolphin_Hotel-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_loca