River Palace Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-9b3b51f2470d0c827025f315e2f4ebac,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'River Palace Hotel, 120210 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ស្រះចក', 'postalCode': '120210'}","{'lat': 11.58837, 'lng': 104.91895}","[{'lat': 11.5885, 'lng': 104.91891}]",72041,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2550126'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523988777'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.riverpalacehotel.asia'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.588253,104.91899,2550126,River Palace Hotel,"The River Palace Hotel is a four-star property with 59 spacious rooms and suites, offering contemporary comfort and modern amenities. The hotel features 25 city-view and 34 river-view rooms, all measuring 33 square meters and featuring flat-screen televisionss, complimentary Wi-Fi, walk-in showers and bathtubs. A sanctuary of calm in the heart of the lively Cambodian capital city, Phnom Penh, this hotel provides the ideal location for both business and leisure travelers seeking comfort, convenience and excellent value. And with facilities including the Riverview Restaurant, function rooms, fitness centre, lounge and a spa with the city's only traditional Hammam, guests have all their needs catered for.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d2550126-Reviews-River_Palace_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road No. 5', 'street2': 'Sangkat Sras Chork, Khan Duan Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'National Road No. 5 Sangkat Sras Chork, Khan Duan Penh, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-