River Village Manor,here:pds:place:116aabd1-9742a39be81200036d2eed25d55e168e,en,tourist-attraction,"{'label': 'River Village Manor, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37057, 'lng': 103.86469}","[{'lat': 13.37066, 'lng': 103.86459}]",22784,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1491112'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855962246573'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.370584,103.864685,1491112,River Village Manor,"Welcome to the River Village Manor, Siem Reap most charming guesthouse. Family Friendly and Family run, our lovely three-story guesthouse is located on the Siem Reap River, and is an easy 20-minute walk or 5-minute tuk-tuk ride along the tree-lined river into town, or a short 20-minute drive to Angkor Wat. Why not borrow one of our FREE bicycles? its a great way to view Siem Reap and the Temples of Angkor. We have 10 spacious suites for you to choose from. Each one includes an en-suite bathroom, some with large bathtubs, individual air conditioning, cable television, new 32"" flat-screen TVs, free FAST Wi-Fi and our famous complimentary full breakfast. All rooms are beautifully designed with original Khmer features which have been well maintained over the years, making River Village Manor unique and arguably one of the best preserved guesthouse in Siem Reap. Siem Reap as a wonderful, rewarding place to reside, and we'll happily assist you with whatever you need to make your visit unforgettable. With our combined experience in the hospitality business, and a love of meeting new people we'll help you make the most of your time in Siem Reap. We look forward to welcoming you to Siem Reap and the River Village Manor.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1491112-Reviews-River_Village_Manor-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'East River Road', 'street2': 'Slokrum Commune, Village Trang', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '0000', 'address_string': 'East River Road Slokrum Commune, Village Trang, Siem Reap 0000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d1491112-River_Village_Manor-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#31 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '31'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,330,"{'1': '2', '2': '6', '3': '5', '4': '38', '5': '279'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",210,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d