River-Star Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-8f2c36fcf5fb02db64fa62f70b33a4c1,en,hotel,"{'label': 'River-Star Hotel, ផ្លូវ 118, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 118', 'postalCode': '120205'}","{'lat': 11.57246, 'lng': 104.92905}","[{'lat': 11.57248, 'lng': 104.92904}]",72947,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '456211'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515727215'}, {'value': '+85586692337'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.572447,104.92905,456211,River-Star Hotel,"River-Star Hotel is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Phnom Penh, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Rooms at River Star Hotel provide air conditioning and a refrigerator, and guests can stay connected with free wifi.
In addition, while staying at River Star Hotel guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, room service, and baggage storage. You can also enjoy a lounge.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Sisowath Quay (0.1 mi) and Wat Ounalom (0.3 mi), guests of River-Star Hotel can easily experience some of Phnom Penh's most well known attractions.
Phnom Penh has plenty of Italian restaurants. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Brooklyn Pizza & Bistro, Piccola Italia Da Luigi, and Oskar Bistro, which are serving up some great dishes.
During your visit, be sure to check out popular attractions like Royal Palace (0.6 mi) and Cambodia Post Office (0.3 mi), which are all within walking distance of the hotel.
Enjoy your stay in Phnom Penh!
