Riverside Chaplin,here:pds:place:116w649k-1691dc0ee8e84be39f206faafdc37883,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Riverside Chaplin, 081104 តាខ្មៅ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'តាខ្មៅ', 'district': 'តាខ្មៅ', 'postalCode': '081104'}","{'lat': 11.47558, 'lng': 104.95304}","[{'lat': 11.47552, 'lng': 104.95292}]",14973,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516566784'}]}],Not Available,Kandal,11.531203,104.931175,25136272,"SUN & MOON, Riverside Hotel","SUN & MOON, Riverside Hotel Is a unique designed lifestyle ecosystem that integrates sophisticated, relaxing Wellness & Gym technologies with largescale events, meetings and shared offices spaces, and multi-cultural dining experiences that serve extensive, honest, and health-conscious international menus. Our innovative design is based on FENG SHUI and Italian mathematician Fibonacci’s inspired Golden Ratio 1.68. We’re a local hotel at heart but adhere to international standards to deliver exceptional culturally-infused hospitality, delivered with a personal touch. As an urban business hotel at heart, our various spaces are often alive with events and activities, with areas available to party, celebrate or relax. And we love to mark special occasions, so expect stylish celebrations for international and local festivals, such as New Year’s Eve and Khmer New Year. Be inspired by cutting‐edge designs. Sleep in style. Create magical memories with our tailored events solutions. Delve into local culture and heritage. Feast on delicious, nutritious food. Enjoy experiences individually crafted just for you. Celebrate a special occasion in style. Forge new business connections. Check‐in to your personal playground, embark on a holistic wellness journey, and find balance within. Find yourself at SUN & MOON, Riverside Hotel, where we personally guide you through your discovery throughout our newly-created ecosystem. “Be” at Cambodia’s leading new 5-star lifestyle hotel. “ADDING VALUE” We believe in “adding value” to everything we do to curate elevated experiences for each of our guests. We treat our team and their relatives like family to ensure they extend that hospitality to you. We offer personalised experiences to enhance your stay, whether it be for business or leisure. We provide services that promise to exceed your expectations. We help create Balance within.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d25136272-Reviews-SUN_MOON_Riverside_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Waterfront, Corner of Preah Monivong Bridge 93 & Preah Norodom Blvd,', 'street2': 'Village 10 Sangkat Tonle Bassac, Khan Chamkarmon', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12204', 'address_string': 'Waterfront, Corner of Preah Monivong Bridge 93 & Preah Norodom Blvd, Village 10 Sangkat Tonle Bassac, Khan Chamkarmon, Phnom Penh 12204 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,1.19E+12,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d25136272-SUN_MOON_Riverside_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#32 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '32'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,67,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '0', '4': '2', '5': '64'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler