Riverview Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649g-5a5922ada16d453c8972cc81caf9408a,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Riverview Hotel, ផ្លូវ 1, 120211 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'វត្តភ្នំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 1', 'postalCode': '120211'}","{'lat': 11.57558, 'lng': 104.92686}","[{'lat': 11.57549, 'lng': 104.92675}]",72777,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '456212'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512555788'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.575548,104.92683,456212,Riverview Hotel,"See why so many travelers make Riverview Hotel their hotel of choice when visiting Phnom Penh. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Rooms at Riverview Guesthouse Hotel provide air conditioning and a minibar, and guests can stay connected with free wifi.
In addition, while staying at Riverview Hotel guests have access to a concierge.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Sisowath Quay (0.4 mi) and Wat Ounalom (0.6 mi), guests of Riverview Hotel can easily experience some of Phnom Penh's most well known attractions.
Phnom Penh has plenty of barbeque restaurants. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Brooklyn Pizza & Bistro, Sikgaek Korea Restaurant, and Sovanna, which are serving up some great dishes.
During your visit, be sure to check out popular attractions like Royal Palace (0.9 mi) and Cambodia Post Office (0.1 mi), which are all within walking distance of the hotel.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Riverview Hotel as you experience all of the things Phnom Penh has to offer.
