Riviera Hotel & Resort Kep,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-36cf712574ee499ba4a1a498f8fc747c,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Riviera Hotel & Resort Kep, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.47752, 'lng': 104.30401}","[{'lat': 10.47763, 'lng': 104.30394}]",7551,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13207554'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855966153416'}]}],Not Available,Kep,10.47737,104.3041,13207554,Riviera Hotel & Resort Kep,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Kep, Riviera Hotel & Resort Kep is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its family-friendly environment and proximity to great restaurants and attractions, Riviera Hotel & Resort Kep makes it easy to enjoy the best of Kep.
The rooms offer air conditioning, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
Riviera Hotel & Resort Kep features baggage storage, sun umbrellas, and beach chairs. In addition, as a valued Riviera Hotel & Resort Kep guest, you can enjoy a pool and an on-site restaurant that are available on-site. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
Close to Patio (2.1 mi), a popular Kep landmark, Riviera Hotel & Resort Kep is a great destination for tourists.
While in Kep be sure to experience local fish and chips favorites at Sailing Club.
Kep is also home to Jasmine Valley Skate Bowl, a popular park that is not too far from Riviera Hotel & Resort Kep.
Riviera Hotel & Resort Kep is sure to make your visit to Kep one worth remembering.
