Romcheik 5 Art Space & Café,here:pds:place:116w636s-bca1c2cfbedf6900362f3dee64efcdcd,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Romcheik 5 Art Space & Café, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09939, 'lng': 103.20372}","[{'lat': 13.09926, 'lng': 103.2037}]",99789,"[{'id': '100-1000-0007', 'name': 'Cafeteria', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7802351'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592304210'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/countrysideartmuseum.org/?rf=429814983886501'}]}]","[{'text': ['Tue-Sun: 09:00 - 17:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT08H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Battambang,13.099339,103.203705,7802351,Romcheik 5 Art Space & Cafe,"ROMCHEIK 5 is nominated in the TOP 10 BEST INDEPENDENT Art spaces in S.E. Asia and N° 1 in Cambodia (The Guardian / November 2017) ! Romcheik 5 is the name of the neighbourhood of Battambang where, in 2012, 4 young artists have established their studios with the help of a donor. In 2015, this space has been extended with the construction of a building sheltering an art gallery and since October 2018 a real Museum with a permanent collection of their best artworks. On rooftop you will find a nice Café with a large scale of foods and drinks .The entrance to the all site is charged 5$ (discount 2 $ 50), to contribute to the maintenance of the premises and the purchase of artist materials.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d7802351-Reviews-Romcheik_5_Art_Space_Cafe-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '201A', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': '201A, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 