Romdoul Farm Residence,here:pds:place:116w64xq-77bdcc5339344a199415880c145bc1e3,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Romdoul Farm Residence, 060607 សន្ទុក, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ធំ', 'city': 'សន្ទុក', 'district': 'ប្រាសាទ', 'postalCode': '060607'}","{'lat': 12.55743, 'lng': 105.05785}","[{'lat': 12.5573, 'lng': 105.05784}]",53268,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8077915'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578653999'}]}],Not Available,Kampong Thom,12.557281,105.05862,8077915,Romdoul Farm Residence,"See why so many travelers make Romdoul Farm Residence their small hotel of choice when visiting Kampong Thom. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a budget friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Romdoul Farm Residence offers guests an array of room amenities including air conditioning, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available.
The small hotel offers a 24 hour front desk and a sun terrace, to make your visit even more pleasant. The property also features a pool and a lounge. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
While in Kampong Thom be sure to experience nearby barbeque restaurants such as Soban Teuk.
At Romdoul Farm Residence, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Kampong Thom.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1024989-d8077915-Reviews-Romdoul_Farm_Residence-Kampong_Thom_Kampong_Thom_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sampung Village, Prasat Commune, Santuk District', 'city': 'Kampong Thom', 'state': 'Kampong Thom Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '06207', 'address_string': 'Sampung Village, Prasat Commune, Santuk District, Kampong Thom 06207 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampong Thom', 'location_id': '1024989'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampong Thom Province', 'location_id': '2366663'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1024989-d8077915-Romdoul_Farm_Residence-Kampong_Thom_Kampong_Thom_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '1024989', 'ranking_string': '#8 of 12 B&Bs / Inns in Kampong Thom', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampong Thom', 'ranking_out_of': '12', 'ranking': '8'}",3,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.0-66827-5.svg,5,"{'1': '1', '2': '2', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '2'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss1.0.svg', 'value': '1.0'}}",6,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1024989-d8077915-m66827-Reviews-Romdoul_Farm_Residence-Kampong_Thom_Kampong_Thom_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Kids Activities', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Pets Allowed', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Business center', 'Pool', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Hot Tub', 'Tennis Court', 'Laundry Service', 'Air conditioning', 'Non-smoking hote