Rooms 101,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-539efe8869a883db0412b8f5b00f6461,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Rooms 101, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60785, 'lng': 104.18003}","[{'lat': 10.60787, 'lng': 104.18016}]",19682,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26499996'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516854100'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.607868,104.18014,26499996,Rooms 101,"Nestled in the heart of this bustling town of Kampot is a small guesthouse that is sure to capture your heart. This guesthouse is the perfect place to relax and unwind after a day of exploring all that Kampot has to offer. Feel right at home in this cozy retreat, with every room offering AC and private bathrooms with hot showers. Whether you're traveling for business or pleasure, our guesthouse is the perfect choice for your stay in Kampot. Please note, in order to keep costs low we do not have a staffed reception, so please tell us your approximate arrival time as soon as you can, thank you!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d26499996-Reviews-Rooms_101-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 710', 'street2': 'Coffee 101', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '070801', 'address_string': 'Street 710 Coffee 101, Kampot 070801 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d26499996-Rooms_101-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},0,https://www