Royal Angkor Resort & Spa,here:pds:place:116w63u4-784bbfdbaf144c449089cea27da35d2a,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Royal Angkor Resort & Spa, អេអេច21, 171210 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្រងែ', 'street': 'អេអេច21', 'postalCode': '171210'}","{'lat': 13.38016, 'lng': 103.82886}","[{'lat': 13.38005, 'lng': 103.82879}]",87103,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '583557'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563767555'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.royalangkorresort.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.380351,103.82899,583557,Royal Angkor Resort & Spa,"Royal Angkor Resort and Spa is conveniently perched along the gateway of some of the most significant archeological sites in SE-Asia, creating the ideal location to explore Cambodia's rich cultural inheritance. Tucked away from the hustle and noise of the city, Royal Angkor Resort is only minutes away from these iconic landmarks, providing unprecedented access to the legendary Angkor Wat, Angkor Thom and Bayon temples as well as the charming and historic town of Siem Reap. Stretching over two and a half hectares, this iconic Siem Reap hotel is jeweled with a beautiful tropical landscape and decorated with the most remarkable architecture, reminiscent of the early 20th century. From fine dining to traditional rooms and suites, Royal Angkor Resort & Spa combines ancient charm with modern-day leisure, creating the ultimate space to unwind and embrace the magical spirit of Cambodia.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d583557-Reviews-Royal_Angkor_Resort_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Road No.6 Phum Kasekam', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '93279', 'address_string': 'Road No.6 Phum Kasekam, Siem Reap 93279 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d583557-Royal_Angkor_Resort_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#123 of 763 hotels in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '763', 'ranking': '123'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,1301,"{'1': '4', '2': '12', '3': '85', '4': '362', '5': '838'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",875,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d583557-m66827-Reviews-Royal_Angkor_Resort_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Room service', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Business center', 'Fitness center', 'Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Suites', 'Shuttle Bus Service', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Wheelchair access', 'Spa', 'Airport 