Royal Archery Club,here:pds:place:116w63u5-dfc9832c8d3348528678c69b51da9fe4,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Royal Archery Club, 170501 ប្រាសាទបាគង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'ប្រាសាទបាគង', 'district': 'បាគង', 'postalCode': '170501'}","{'lat': 13.367, 'lng': 103.9963}","[{'lat': 13.36712, 'lng': 103.99637}]",17319,"[{'id': '550-5520-0000', 'name': 'Leisure', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11978755'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85585939441'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://royalarcheryclub.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 18:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT10H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.366937,103.99627,11978755,Royal Archery Club,"Relax and Release your stress! Whether you are brand new to archery or an avid competitor, Royal Archery Club offers a variety of archery programs that can help you develop or refine your archery skills. Royal Archery Club programs are designed to teach you the fundamentals of archery and assist you in progressing through various achievement levels all the way from a beginner to an Olympian! Whatever your interest in archery, Royal Archery Club has a program for you! To learn more about Cambodian Archery program",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g18653437-d11978755-Reviews-Royal_Archery_Club-Prasat_Bakong_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 6 By the river, Off Route', 'street2': 'Steung Village', 'city': 'Prasat Bakong', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17351', 'address_string': '# 6 By the river, Off Route Steung Village, Prasat Bakong 17351 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Prasat Bakong', 'location_id': '18653437'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh