Royal Inn,here:pds:place:116aabd1-a109cc7cb58403572f48827efff4118d,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Royal Inn, ផ្លូវ 3, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 3', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.55606, 'lng': 104.93321}","[{'lat': 11.5561, 'lng': 104.93308}]",59222,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1158546'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1440419'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523214824'}, {'value': '+85523360026'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.royal-inn.net'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.55192,104.9322,1440419,Royal Inn,"The new Royal Inn Phnom Penh hotel now offers a range of simple, newly built and elegantly furnished rooms and suites, designed to bring affordable comfort and convenience to business and leisure visitors. The Royal Inn is conveniently located close to the Phnom Penh Center and just minutes from the Royal Palace, close to tourist sites, business centers, shopping and restaurants.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d1440419-Reviews-Royal_Inn-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '128D8, Sothearos Blvd', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': '128D8, Sothearos Blvd, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d1440419-Royal_Inn-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#195 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '195'}",3.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.5-66827-5.svg,143,"{'1': '17', '2': '17',