Royal Mayura Resort Hotel,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-5423ba95658b96bdc5015f13eca78f33,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Royal Mayura Resort Hotel, ផ្លូវ 33 អេ, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 33 អេ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.49197, 'lng': 104.29137}","[{'lat': 10.49195, 'lng': 104.29123}]",7311,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '21505682'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855979113333'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.royalmayuraresorthotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.49202,104.29174,21505682,Royal Mayura Resort Hotel,"Located barely 160 kilometers from Phnom Penh, Royal Mayura Resort Hotel provides a tranquil getaway in the seaside town of Kep. With the forested hillsides of the Kep national Park as backdrop, Royal Mayura spreads over vast grassy grounds and offers the perfect setting for family relaxation among tropical shaded gardens. It is the ideal spot for a brief escapade or a longer luxurious vacation. The resort has an open-air restaurant/bar open every day from 6:30am to 10pm, serving Khmer specialties and western favorites. Other amenities include 2 swimming pools, gym, playground and family room. The spacious and well equipped meeting room provides a venue suitable for business meetings, conferences, and staff retreats.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d21505682-Reviews-Royal_Mayura_Resort_Hotel-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 33A National Road', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07503', 'address_string': '# 33A National Road, Kep 07503 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not availabl