Rustic Restaurant,here:pds:place:116aabd1-c9b6b765b009066612d231574665a50e,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Rustic Restaurant, ផ្លូវ 322, 120102 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 322', 'postalCode': '120102'}","{'lat': 11.55076, 'lng': 104.92406}","[{'lat': 11.55071, 'lng': 104.92406}]",23279,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '800-078', 'name': 'Grill', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593531626'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.553148,104.92934,11750085,Namaste India Restaurant,"This intimate Indian eatery along the chic strip known as Bassac Lane has rebranded and updated its menu of delicious dishes from the north and south of the subcontinent. You’ll find the chef’s recommendations coincide with your all-time favourites such as lamb roghan josh, chicken tikka masala, palak paneer, aloo gobhi, saffron pilaf rice and cheese naan. Its not all gluttony, though – there are healthy plates like the detoxifying rice-daal combo of Ayurveda khichdi or the herb yoghurt-basted Hariyali chicken kebab. No apologies for the fact you’re probably salivating right now.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d11750085-Reviews-Namaste_India_Restaurant-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#15 Street 308 Tonle Bassac Corner', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12301', 'address_string': '#15 Street 308 Tonle Bassac Corner, Phnom Penh 12301 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@namasteindianfood.com,+855 15 332 288,https://www.namasteindianfood.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d11750085-Namaste_India_Restaurant-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#6 