Rusty Bike Adventure,here:pds:place:116w63gg-47cb88a8e4b24c6387a6eb396a2dd8e1,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Rusty Bike Adventure, ផ្លូវជាតិ 63, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 63', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34907, 'lng': 103.85234}","[{'lat': 13.34913, 'lng': 103.85246}]",88236,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15736180'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512800710'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.rustybikeadventure.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 09:00 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT08H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.349121,103.85244,15736180,Rusty Bike Adventure,"Welcome to Rusty Bike Adventure, Cambodia. Based in Siem Reap. With over 17 years experience of dirt bike tours throughout Cambodia, we are your number 1 choice for a truly epic experience on 2 wheels. Whether you are a beginner or advanced rider we will cater for your needs with a selection of bikes on offer and a huge selection of trails to choose from. See the real Cambodia.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d15736180-Reviews-Rusty_Bike_Adventure-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Road 63', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Road 63, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@rustybikeadventure.com,+855 12 800 710,http://www.rustybikeadventure.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d15736180-Rusty_Bike_Adventure-Siem_R