S-Susheel Mart Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w6499-9145500aba4f4be5a1ffec9f2c9c1d71,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'S-Susheel Mart Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ អ, 120909 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ពោធិ៍សែនជ័យ', 'subdistrict': 'ចោមចៅ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ អ', 'postalCode': '120909'}","{'lat': 11.54806, 'lng': 104.83329}","[{'lat': 11.54807, 'lng': 104.83316}]",4013,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11953670'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523901056'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.548064,104.83334,11953670,S-Susheel Mart Guesthouse,"Featuring free WiFi, S-Susheel Mart Guesthouse offers accommodation in Khŭm Kakab, 9 km from Phnom Penh. Every room at this guest house is air conditioned and features a TV with cable channels. Some rooms include a seating area to relax in after a busy day. You will find a kettle in the room. Every room includes a private bathroom fitted with a shower. There is free shuttle service at the property. Phnom Penh International Airport is 1 km from the property. This property is also rated for the best value in Phnom Penh! Guests are getting more for their money when compared to other properties in this city. We speak your language!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d11953670-Reviews-S_Susheel_Mart_Guesthouse-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 39 Pochengtong, New Town Sangkat Chaom Chao', 'street2': 'Khan Posenchey, Phnom Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'No. 39 Pochengtong, New Town Sangkat Chaom Chao Khan Posenchey, Phnom Penh, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d11953670-S_Susheel_Mart_Guesthouse