SS Hotel & Residence,here:pds:place:116w3cse-e96001188ea11a8541e4a457c557a7a7,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'SS Hotel & Residence, 180403 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បី', 'postalCode': '180403'}","{'lat': 10.64386, 'lng': 103.50162}","[{'lat': 10.64385, 'lng': 103.50149}]",100750,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23102095'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85587626162'}], 'www': [{'value': 'www.sshotelcambodia.com'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.643861,103.50163,23102095,SS Hotel & Residence,"Oops! just moments from a secluded beach with serene views over a sparkling deck, all 41 rooms and suites blend organically with the lush tropical landscape and awaken true feelings of escape. Tranquility and refinement capture the essence of a luxury beach residence, where comfortable furnishings crafted from natural materials combine with neutral color shades, subtle Sihanouk Ville influences and natural light to infuse a timeless elegance. Every element of SS Hotel & Residence accommodations immerses the guest in the soothing ambiance of a sea views retreat with floor-to-ceiling windows opening on to the private sanctuary of a verdant garden terrace featured, relaxed outdoor seating and a daybed space.w We are located in New Beach, 200 meters from the beach, in Sihanouk’s III Commune and district. Pick up great souvenirs and treasures at nearby restaurants, mall and open-air markets. And, New Beach’s fantastic restaurant and nightlife. Our garden-filled offers plenty of spots to be gathering and play, and an equal number of intimates’ spaces to escape to your own private sanctuary.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d23102095-Reviews-SS_Hotel_Residence-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 128', 'street2': 'III Village, III Commune, Next to One Lion Circle', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Street 128 III Village, III Commune, Next to One Lion Circle, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d23102095-SS_Hotel_Residence-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#38 of 283 hotels in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out_of': '283', 'ranking': '38'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,10,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '9'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",32,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d23102095-m66827-Reviews-SS_Hotel_Residence-Sihanoukville