Sa Sa Bassac,here:pds:place:116w649e-5988326ecdb4432ea6cfd56f08aad4e3,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Sa Sa Bassac, ផ្លូវ 3, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 3', 'postalCode': '120205'}","{'lat': 11.56713, 'lng': 104.93086}","[{'lat': 11.56707, 'lng': 104.93072}]",7276,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'www': [{'value': 'http://www.sasabassac.com'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.552989,104.929726,10791662,Bassac Lane,"Situated in leafy Tonle Bassac, the once sleepy residential lane has been developed into a wonderfully exciting drinking, dining and retail phenomenon attracting expats, local Khmer and tourists alike every day of the week. No trip to Phnom Penh is complete without at least one visit to the boutiques and one night enjoying the bars and restaurants of Bassac Lane. Seibur - aperitif room Cicada - classic cocktail bar The Library - daiquiri bar Meat & Drink - bar • grill • conservatory Trove - gifts & homewares Harry's - antique shop & martini bar Hangar 44 - custom motorbike showroom & bar Paperdoll - clothing & accessories Dollshouse - hair salon Masamune - eatery D.Wilkins - leather goods maker Enter Bassac Lane from street 308 which comes off Norodom Boulevard (Malis restaurant is on the corner). There is a paid parking site opposite Seibur where you can park your car, bicycle or motorbike, remember to get a ticket.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d10791662-Reviews-Bassac_Lane-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Bassac Lane, St.308', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '120121', 'address_string': 'Bassac Lane, St.308, Phnom Penh 120121 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,bassaclane@gmail.com,Not available,http://www.facebook.com/bassaclanephnompenh,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d10791662-Bassac_Lane-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#7 of 164 things to do in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '164', 'ranking': '7'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,173,"{'1': '2', '2': '3', '3': '13', '4': '55', '5': '100'}",Not available,147,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d10791662-m66827-Reviews-Bassac_Lane-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1700'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '0000'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1700'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '0000'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1700'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '0000'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1700'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '0000'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1700'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '0000'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '1700'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '0000'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '1700'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '0000'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 17:00 - 00:00', 'Tuesday: 17:00 - 00:00', 'Wednesday: 17:00 - 00:00', 'Thursday: 17:00 - 00:00', 'Friday: 17:00 - 00:00', 'Saturday: 17:00 - 00:00', 'Sunday: 17:00 - 00:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'landmarks', 'localized_name': 'Sights & Landmarks'}, {'name': 'attractions', 'localized_name': 'Attractions'}, {'name': 'other', 'localized_name': 'Other'}]","[{'name': 'Sights & Landmarks', 'localized_name': 'Sights & Landmarks', 'categories': [{'name': 'Neighborhoods', 'localized_name': 'Neighborhoods'}]}, {'name': 'Other', 'localized_name': 'Other', 'categories': [{'name': 'Neighborhoods', 'localized_name': 'Neighborhoods'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '6'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '52'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '18'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '15'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '45'}]","[{'award_type': 'Travelers Choice', 'year': '2023', 'images': {'tiny': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png', 'small': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png', 'large': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png'}, 'categories': [], 'display_name': 'Travelers Choice'}]",Not available,Not available,FALSE,24,14
Sabai Adventures Cambodia - Day Tours,here:pds:place:116aabd1-4f5b8973ec290443ff6e3f92be5b7801,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Sabai Adventures Cambodia - Day Tours, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37403, 'lng': 103.87381}","[{'lat': 13.37406, 'lng': 103.87395}]",21842,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3735535'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855883723121'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.sabaiadventurescambodia.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.373953,103.873726,3735535,Sabai Adventures Cambodia - Day Tours,"Sabai Adventures is an excellent way to experience the beauty, history and tranquility of Cambodia on guided tours. Join us on one of our journeys as you drive a moto or tour in a vintage military jeep. Visit traditional villages seldom seen by foreigners, explore ancient temples, pass along rice fields and see a fascinating rural culture. Join the Sabai Culture tours, an enriching program that takes you to experience the historic heritage of art, technology and spirituality of the ancient empire. Visit a traditional Khmer martial art school, see stone masons working on carvings for the temples, learn about Buddhism from a monk or see young dancers being trained in the historic royal performance. A truly unique experience of a lifetime!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d3735535-Reviews-Sabai_Adventures_Cambodia_Day_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Group 7, Beoung Dounpa Village', 'street2': 'Slorkram', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '088', 'address_string': 'Group 7, Beoung Dounpa Village Slorkram, Siem Reap 088 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,sabaiadventurescambodia@gmail.com,+855 88 372 3121,http://www.sabaiadventurescambodia.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d3735535-Sabai_Adventures_Cambodia_Day_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#238 of 1,339 Tours in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1339', 'ranking': '238'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,192,"{'1': '1', '2': '1', '3': '2', '4': '9', '5': '179'}",Not available,150,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d3735535-m66827-Reviews-Sabai_Adventures_Cambodia_Day_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'City Tours', 'localized_name': 'City Tours'}, {'name': 'Historical & Heritage Tours', 'localized_name': 'Historical & Heritage Tours'}, {'name': 'Motorcycle Tours', 'localized_name': 'Motorcycle Tours'}, {'name': 'Cultural Tours', 'localized_name': 'Cultural Tours'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '88'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '21'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '7'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '61'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,31,20
Sabara Cooking Class & Culinary Experience,here:pds:place:116w63u4-20b05b4983054a34a35559a7b3ea9bfb,en,park_recreation_area,"{'label': 'Sabara Cooking Class & Culinary Experience, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.373, 'lng': 103.8324}","[{'lat': 13.37306, 'lng': 103.83228}]",229856,"[{'id': '800-8200-0000', 'name': 'Education Facility', 'primary': True}, {'id': '550-5510-0202', 'name': 'Park-Recreation Area'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563766227'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.sabaraangkorresort.com/experian_/cook-class-based-on-authentic-flavor-of-khmer-and-enjoy-your-food-after-class/?fbclid=IwAR1B5FkT5KNXz5wDyytyEXt6-CvjwoHPo_z6Zw7HQRhCwPyGReW9iiwOmfw'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.372965,103.8323,12981462,Sabara Angkor Resort & Spa,"Located merely 15 minute from the world re-known Angkor Complex, Sabara Angkor Resort & Spa is situated in the tranquil part of Siem Reap away from the bustling downtown area, while remaining very accessible to any part of the city within 10 minute ride. The epitome of Khmer luxury comfort, guest rooms and suites receive warm sunlight all year round and command magnificent swimming pool views surrounded by leafy garden. Intelligently designed, marrying traditional elements with convenient state-of-the-art technology and Sabara personal touch service, guests are guaranteed a memorable stay. Sabara Angkor Resort & Spa’s uniqueness—Cambodian Owned and Run, Personal Touch Service, Tranquil Location and Cambodian Inspired Design, Community Support, Eco-Friendly, 24Hrs Reception and Security, Concierge Service and Nightly Turn Down Service.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12981462-Reviews-Sabara_Angkor_Resort_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sfpda Road', 'street2': 'Phum Krous, Sangkat Svay Dangkum', 'city': 'Siem Reap', '