Sabay Beach Kampot,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-433f2429088a4afd8be962086f0d0fba,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Sabay Beach Kampot, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.59884, 'lng': 104.18409}","[{'lat': 10.59895, 'lng': 104.18417}]",18871,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12071669'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855314179304'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.sabaybeach.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.598877,104.18412,12071669,Sabay Beach Kampot,"Sabay Beach: Tranquil riverside retreat in Kampot with scenic sunset views over Bokor National Park. A small selection of nine rooms is available, some riverside, others in an organic mango garden. Choose modern air-con or rustic wooden charm, each with a King Size Bed and private bathroom. Unique French architect-designed treehouses, European-Asian fusion cuisine from a menu entirely created by French chefs in our restaurant, and signature cocktails made with different Kampot peppers. Enjoy fresh dishes and attentive service from our Cambodian Front Of House team. Positioned upstream from town, Sabay Beach invites you to swim in a pollution-free environment. Reception can arrange Tuktuks to town or taxis to Phnom Penh Airport. Escape to Sabay Beach: Unparalleled service, stunning views, and lush surroundings. Book your retreat for nature's embrace with unmatched hospitality. Sabay Beach, Refined by Nature.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d12071669-Reviews-Sabay_Beach_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Riverside Road', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Riverside Road, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province