Sabay Beach Restaurant and Cocktail Bar,here:pds:place:116aabd1-a3901046378308efa96da2a85c949bd3,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Sabay Beach Restaurant and Cocktail Bar, 070203 ទឹកឈូរ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'ទឹកឈូរ', 'district': 'កំពង់ក្រែង', 'postalCode': '070203'}","{'lat': 10.67251, 'lng': 104.16562}","[{'lat': 10.67254, 'lng': 104.16575}]",21225,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '300-000', 'name': 'European'}, {'id': '800-066', 'name': 'Fusion'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15811064'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855314179304'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.sabaybeach.com', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:30 - 20:30'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T073000', 'duration': 'PT13H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kampot,10.672456,104.16509,15811064,Sabay Beach Restaurant and Cocktail Bar,"The Sabay Beach Restaurant and Cocktail Bar is on the Praek Tuek Chhu River with its terraces overlooking the river and offering stunning sunset views over the Bokor National Park. Restaurant is located 6 km outside of Kampot, on the riverside road, north of the town center. Cocktails, shakes, syrups and infused spirits are all hand-crafted and the Cuisine uses only the freshest ingredients coming daily from the market. Truly one of a kind in Kampot.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d15811064-Reviews-Sabay_Beach_Restaurant_and_Cocktail_Bar-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Andoung Chi Meun, Kampong Kraeng, Tuek Chhou', 'street2': 'Riverside Road', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Andoung Chi Meun, 