Sakal Bungalows,here:pds:place:116aabd1-7de1f8038cd402be13fd9c422ae7d972,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Sakal Bungalows, 180403 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បី', 'postalCode': '180403'}","{'lat': 10.63332, 'lng': 103.50163}","[{'lat': 10.63345, 'lng': 103.50168}]",101908,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2291247'}]",[{'www': [{'value': 'http://www.sakalbungalows.com'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.633293,103.50161,2291247,Sakal Bungalows,"Sakal Bungalows is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Sihanoukville, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Sihanoukville, Sakal Bungalows is located a short distance from Wat Leu Temple (1.4 mi) and CJ Outlet and Jewelry Center (1.9 mi).
Rooms at Sakal Bungalows provide air conditioning, and guests can stay connected with free internet access.
You can also enjoy an on-site restaurant while staying at Sakal Bungalows.
Travelers looking to enjoy some tapas can head to Lemongrass Restaurant or ""The Deck"" Tapas Bar. Otherwise, you may want to check out a Mexican restaurant such as The Big Easy or Maybe Later.
If you’re looking for something to do, Wat Krom Temple (0.7 mi) is a nice way to spend some time, and it is within walking distance of Sakal Bungalows.
Enjoy your stay in Sihanoukville!
