Sakura Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w648f-daf98934d440457c8871751e85c9852c,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Sakura Guesthouse, 080315 កណ្ដាលស្ទឹង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'កណ្ដាលស្ទឹង', 'district': 'សៀមរាប', 'postalCode': '080315'}","{'lat': 11.40124, 'lng': 104.86699}","[{'lat': 11.40137, 'lng': 104.86629}]",20574,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '700-7200-0328', 'name': 'B2B Sales & Services'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512963404'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.sakuravillageguesthouse.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kandal,11.477722,104.94729,4876018,Monorom Guesthouse,"If you’re looking for a hotel in Ta Khmao, look no further than Monorom Guesthouse.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as Monorom Guesthouse offers guests free wifi.
The hotel features a 24 hour front desk and baggage storage.
While staying in Ta Khmao, you can check out a popular Asian restaurant like LoveSG Cafe, which is serving up some great dishes.
The staff at Monorom Guesthouse looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
