Sala Russey,here:pds:place:116w63uk-3a2ce0b10dcb46b5b0de72d8de9b695f,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Sala Russey, 171205 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'នគរធំ', 'postalCode': '171205'}","{'lat': 13.43316, 'lng': 103.90683}","[{'lat': 13.43319, 'lng': 103.90697}]",14622,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-061', 'name': 'Breakfast'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13625777'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85561777879'}, {'value': '+85568777879'}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:30 - 16:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T073000', 'duration': 'PT08H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.433122,103.906624,13625777,Sala Russey,"Sala Russey is a Cambodian destination restaurant, catering to high-end upmarket tourists. Located on the banks of the ancient man-made lake at Srah Srang, Angkor Thom, was originally a large traditional wooden house, which has now been converted into a clean, comfortable high class modern air-conditioned and open-air dining facility. It still retains the old world charm and culture and is set in a verdant garden. The cuisine is essentially Cambodian with dishes being chosen which are compatible with a wide variety of foreign tastes. All ingredients are locally sourced, cooked and served by local staff, ensuring service with a smile in addition to supporting the Angkor Thom community.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d13625777-Reviews-Sala_Russey-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street2': 'Srah Srang Village, Angkor Thom Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17255', 'address_string': 'Srah Srang Village, Angkor Thom Commune, Siem Reap 17255 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,contact@salarussey.com,+855 68 777 879,http://www.salarussey.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d13625777-Sala_Russey-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#201 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '201'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,79,"{'1': '2', '2': '3', '3': '7', '4': '11', '5': '56'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",79,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d13625777-m66827-Reviews-Sala_Russey-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1600'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1600'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1600'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1600'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1600'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1600'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '1600'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 07:30 - 16:00', 'Tuesday: 07:30 - 16:00', 'We