Salita Hotel,here:pds:place:11652caf-17a5c5f3515704238254c2f80812b5a4,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Salita Hotel, ផ្លូវ 143 70, 120104 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 143', 'postalCode': '120104', 'houseNumber': '70'}","{'lat': 11.55057, 'lng': 104.91585}","[{'lat': 11.55057, 'lng': 104.91599}]",5960,"[{'id': '550-5510-0206', 'name': 'Recreation Center', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523221777'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.554273,104.91602,1953194,Salita Hotel,"Welcome to Salita Hotel Phnom Penh, a brand new hotel that is designed to accommodate guests from all parts of the world. If you are looking for a comfortable home away from home, it's a reasonable choice. The 10-story hotel has 62 tasteful rooms with a panoramic city view. Salita Hotel is surrounded by many locals attraction such as: Historical Independent Monument, Olympic Stadium, S-21, and Russian Market; we are 5 mins from these locations. Start your day with complimentary coffee shop and a newspaper in our lobby with free Wi-Fi and join us at full breakfast buffet. Whether for business or pleasure, our friendly and proficient staff take pride in anticipating and satisfying your needs.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d1953194-Reviews-Salita_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#70, St European Union', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '00855', 'address_string': '#70, St European Union, Phnom Penh 00855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d1953194-Salita_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#103 of 528 hotels