Sam So Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-165b6a6c2e540a60d628a403aefb5046,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Sam So Guesthouse, វិថី វត្តបូ, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'វិថី វត្តបូ', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35803, 'lng': 103.86069}","[{'lat': 13.35808, 'lng': 103.86056}]",24116,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1891666'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512602956'}, {'value': '+85512630590', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.samsoguesthouse.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.357889,103.86103,1891666,Sam So Guesthouse,"Sam So Guesthouse is located in the center of Siem Reap city, Cambodia. It is a very nice place to stay, great atmosphere. Located about 15 minutes from Siem Reap International Airport, Sam So Guesthouse is about a 10-minute walk to the Old Market, the Night Market and Pub Street, as well as a scenic 10-minute drive to the world famous Angkor Wat. It has 19 rooms. Every room has private bathroom (with hot water), mini-fridge, cable TV, and free Internet service (with a wireless connection) and free pick-up from airport, bus station and pier. Free Breakfast with tea and coffee.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1891666-Reviews-Sam_So_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Wat Bo Rd #0164, Wat Bo village', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17000', 'address_string': 'Wat Bo Rd #0164, Wat Bo village, Siem Reap 17000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d1891666-Sam_So_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#35 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '35'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,366,"{'1': '3', '2': '8', '3': '20', '4': '83', '5': '252'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",98,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1891666-m66827-Reviews-Sam_So_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Free parking', 'Airport transportation', 'Laundry Service', 'Air conditioning', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Bath / Shower', 'Bottled Water', 'Breakfast included', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Refrigerator in room', 'Babysitting', 'Parking', 'Baggage Storage', 'Bicycle Rental', 'Car Hire', 'Currency Exchange', 'English', '24-Hour Front Desk', 'Khmer', 'Massage', 'Val