Sam Tuk Tuk & Tours,here:pds:place:116w63u7-62a493414a8349819faede5e56c36ada,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Sam Tuk Tuk & Tours, 171205 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'នគរធំ', 'postalCode': '171205'}","{'lat': 13.41292, 'lng': 103.86385}","[{'lat': 13.41293, 'lng': 103.86399}]",19620,"[{'id': '400-4100-0041', 'name': 'Transportation Service', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3139344'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512275851'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.samtuktuktours.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.412931,103.86396,3139344,SAM TUK TUK & TOURS,"My name is Sam and I've been a professional tour organizer, as well as a/c car & van taxi driver, for many years, around Angkor Wat, Siem Reap, and beyond in Cambodia. Our tour company can arrange the professional English speaking license taxi, van, and tuktuk drivers with many years of experience. Also we have many professional certified tour guides as well (license from the Ministry of Tourism), to explain the rich history, art, culture, and architecture of the ancient temples as well as daily lives of Cambodian people. (Because the driver are not allowed to enter in the sites and explain the history of the temples) The most interesting sites, around the Angkor and surrounding area, are Angkor Wat, Angkor Thom, Bayon, Ta Prohm ( Tomb Raider), Beng Melea (Indiana Jone's temple), Tonle Sap Lake (floating village & flooding forest), Phnom Kulen waterfalls, Koh Ker, and Preah Vihear, and Banteay Srei temple. So if you need any help organizing a tour while you're in Siem Reap, Cambodia, for 1,2,3,4 or even 5 days, with license a/c car & van with drivers, tuktuk drivers, certified tour guides, accommodation, bus-boat tickets, please don't hesitate, I want to make sure and help you get the most out of your holidays and have a memorable time visiting my country. There are a few circuits of temples, a small, big, and also an outer temples outlining those circuits, as well as farther out temples. Also there's a countryside tour and taking boat trip to visit fishing community such as floating village, high (6-10 meters high wood & bamboo skyscraper), stilted house and canoeing through flooded forest on the great lake of Tonle Sap Lake, (biggest freshwater lake in Southeast Asia). ***Recommended: Have a buffet dinner, while watching Cambodia apsara traditional dance show. Nice to wine and dine after a long day of temples touring.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d3139344-Reviews-SAM_TUK_TUK_TOURS-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17000', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap 17000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,samtuktuk123@gmail.com,+855 12 275 851,http://www.samtuktuktours.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d3139344-SAM_TUK_TUK_TOURS-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#66 of 754 Transportation in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '754', 'ranking': '66'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,648,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '3', '4': '38', '5': '606'}",Not available,328,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d3139344-m66827-Reviews-SAM_TUK_TUK_TOURS-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 3, '