Samanea Beach Resort & Spa,here:pds:place:116w3f5v-b4d1a45398244daf8b34467cf7777b8a,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Samanea Beach Resort & Spa, ផ្លូវ 33 អេ, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 33 អេ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.50783, 'lng': 104.29018}","[{'lat': 10.50778, 'lng': 104.29031}]",6468,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7791903'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855882400600'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.samanea-resort.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.508389,104.28863,7791903,Samanea Beach Resort & Spa,"Samanea Beach Resort is a little paradise in the middle of 5 HA Botanical Park along the seashore of Kep the favorite destination Cambodia during the 50s and the 60s, and next to our protected mangrove forest. Enjoy the infinity pool of 300M2 with integrated Jacuzzi or the private seafront, sipping a cocktail and listening to the parrots while looking at the stunning sunset on the Bay of Thailand and the Bokor Mountain. All of the 12 rooms and suites have a private terrace with nice garden or infinity pool view. Above the standard facilities, the hotel also offers free high speed WIFI, accessible all over the domain. Enjoy your dinner at our restaurant with its panoramic roof terrace and the wonderful views or just have a romantic dinner in the mangrove forest or on the private waterfront area. To visit the city and the surroundings, Samanea's team organize your visit. Take a Tuk-tuk, a moto or a bike, Samanea adjust your trip at your wishes.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d7791903-Reviews-Samanea_Beach_Resort_Spa-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Kep Road 33A', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '220201', 'address_string': 'Kep Road 33A, Kep 220201 C