Sambath Residence,here:pds:place:116aabd1-bf1c84d425420dbbf6f3dbaa25670ffe,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Sambath Residence, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.37513, 'lng': 103.84127}","[{'lat': 13.37506, 'lng': 103.84139}]",87695,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10673563'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563766295'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.37516,103.84122,10673563,Sambath Residence,"An intimate retreat on a peaceful oasis, Sambath Residence, We design the local style while offering a modern luxurious accommodation, spa and dining. It is set for refined enchantment and relaxation in the rich culture and heritage land of the Kingdom. Sambath Residence will be sure to make your stay a memorable one with personal touch of real Khmer hospitality. Located close by Angkor Wat, Angkor Thom and Tonlé Sap Lake, it's an ideal base to explore the wonders of the region. Siem Reap's lively markets, galleries and thriving restaurant and nightlife scene are also just moments away. Sambath Residence features 16 spacious deluxe with the uniquely design concepts. The hotel's peaceful gardens, an inviting swimming pool and a luxury spa service are the perfect place to relax at the end of an action-packed day.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d10673563-Reviews-Sambath_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Korean Road', 'street2': '150 m from National Road #6', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Korean Road 150 m from National Road #6, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level