Sambo Sambath Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-dd85a5d6d32345ad99286d4e1b26326c,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Sambo Sambath Guesthouse, អេអេច123, 070803 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់បាយ', 'street': 'អេអេច123', 'postalCode': '070803'}","{'lat': 10.61486, 'lng': 104.17803}","[{'lat': 10.61498, 'lng': 104.17797}]",20217,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3209218'}]",Not Available,Not Available,Kampot,10.614898,104.17801,3209218,Sambo Sambath Guesthouse,"If you’re looking for a guest house in Kampot, look no further than Sambo Sambath Guesthouse.
Given the close proximity to The Old Royal Cinema (0.4 mi), guests of Sambo Sambath Guesthouse can easily experience one of Kampot's most popular landmarks.
Rooms at Sambo Sambath Guesthouse provide a minibar, and guests can stay connected with wifi.
While in Kampot, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Sambo Sambath Guesthouse, including Rusty Keyhole (0.5 mi), Epic Arts Cafe (0.5 mi), and bARACA restaurant (0.6 mi).
Kampot is also home to Kampot Art Gallery, a popular art gallery that is not too far from Sambo Sambath Guesthouse.
The staff at Sambo Sambath Guesthouse looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
