Sambor Village,here:pds:place:116w6686-ad233ab5f130432b822b0182ce5bfd2c,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Sambor Village, 060801 ស្ទឹងសែន, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ធំ', 'city': 'ស្ទឹងសែន', 'district': 'ដំរីជាន់ខ្លា', 'postalCode': '060801'}","{'lat': 12.71086, 'lng': 104.89522}","[{'lat': 12.71098, 'lng': 104.89527}]",73741,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1599613'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85562961391'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://samborvillage.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kampong Thom,12.710623,104.8951,1599613,Sambor Village,"Ideally located on the bank of the Stung Seng River, Sambor Village is the perfect place to discover the rural Cambodian life in complete comfort. At only 600 meters from the Phnom Penh - Siem Reap national road, refresh yourself in our salted water pool after a bicycle ride in the villages and rice paddies. Our restaurant serves both Cambodian classics and international cuisine.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1024989-d1599613-Reviews-Sambor_Village-Kampong_Thom_Kampong_Thom_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Democrat Street (Brochea Thebatey)', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Kampong Thom', 'state': 'Kampong Thom Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Democrat Street (Brochea Thebatey), Kampong Thom Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampong Thom', 'location_id': '1024989'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampong Thom Province', 'location_id': '2366663'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1024989-d1599613-Sambor_Village-Kampong_Thom_Kampong_Thom_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '1024989', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 7 hotels in Kampong Thom', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampong Thom', 'ranking_out_of': '7', 'ranking': '1'}",4,https://www.tri