Samon's Village,here:pds:place:116aabd1-3c988e06677502266162478359f6adc2,en,accommodation,"{'label': ""Samon's Village, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.6204, 'lng': 104.16654}","[{'lat': 10.62035, 'lng': 104.16641}]",25687,"[{'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23897612'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2422608'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855964266663'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.620651,104.167175,2422608,Samon's Village,Here at Samon's Village we strive to give you a truly authentic Khmer experience. Our aim is first and foremost to promote and share Khmer culture. Our relaxing atmosphere will help you find the space to unwind and really feel the pulse of Khmer life. Our village has been built and designed to recreate the feeling of a Khmer village from the past. Each of our bungalows is unique and built entirely from locally sourced materials using traditional techniques. Our kitchen uses only local sourced produce and organic free-range meats to prepare delicious typical Khmer home food. We have regular music and dance events to share our artistic traditions with you. You will have the opportunity to experience our tours or activities and have an authentic insight of Khmer daily life. In doing this we hope to reinforce our cultural identity while giving you an opportunity to experience Khmer life first hand. You won't find a better place to experience the joyous and peaceful philosophy of the small towns and villages that define this country.,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d2422608-Reviews-Samon_s_Village-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Touk Chou Rd', 'street2': 