Sangker Gallery,here:pds:place:116aabd1-cf39e52fbdd706d00de08219c2e2d376,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Sangker Gallery, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.0995, 'lng': 103.19827}","[{'lat': 13.09951, 'lng': 103.19821}]",248489,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515454717'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://sangkergallery.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.099994,103.20189,4003647,Sangker Villa,"Welcome to YOUR home away from home, welcome to OUR home! Sangker Villa is a Guest House with 8 rooms where you can feel absolutely at home! We would be delighted to help you organize your stay here and give you the best advice possible for you to enjoy discovering Battambang and its surroundings. You can relax in our salt water pool, have a drink at our bar and enjoy our lovely breakfast with fresh, home-made bread. Welcome home! Our Guest house offers 8 rooms in a ""modern-khmer'' style. Five STANDARD rooms on the ground floor and three rooms upstairs, including one standard room, one DELUXE room and one DELUXE with BALCONY. In our villa you can enjoy the warm and friendly atmosphere at the bar overlooking the pool. We serve iced tea, homemade YAO sorbets made at Sangker Villa homemade lemonade, espresso coffee, draft beers, plenty of cocktails, French and Australian wines, We also serve snacks on request: tuna sandwiches, pasta salad, vegetarian tabbouleh, omelet ..",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d4003647-Reviews-Sangker_Villa-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '4 Street 200, Phum Rumcheck', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': '4 Street 200, Phum Rumcheck, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id'