Sanloem Dive Center,here:pds:place:116w3ckn-e80389e113ac1c7d4bde657f741d5367,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Sanloem Dive Center, 180405 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'កោះរុង', 'postalCode': '180405'}","{'lat': 10.5746, 'lng': 103.31405}","[{'lat': 10.57472, 'lng': 103.31411}]",112610,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '16819122'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855882598185'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.sanloemdivecenter.com'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.574636,103.31407,16819122,Sanloem Dive Center,"Come and spend a day or more on our boat guided by an experience Instructor or Dive Master. The day starts at 9.30am in the dive center getting you checked in and equipped for the day. Around 10am, our boat is ready to go to the first dive site. After the first dive or snorkelling session, you can relax over lunch until it's time to get ready for the second spot. The return is around 3pm.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g2054864-d16819122-Reviews-Sanloem_Dive_Center-Koh_Rong_Sanloem_Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Sihanoukville, Koh Rong Sanloem Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Koh Rong Sanloem', 'location_id': '2054864'}, {'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,sanloemdivecenter@gmail.com,+855 88 259 8185,https://www.sanloemdivecenter.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g2054864-d16819122-Sanloem_Dive_Center-Koh_Rong_Sanloem_Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '2054864', 'ranking_