Santepheap Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w6686-d527040de111487bad410b91d5b12c04,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Santepheap Guesthouse, 060803 ស្ទឹងសែន, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ធំ', 'city': 'ស្ទឹងសែន', 'district': 'កំពង់រទេះ', 'postalCode': '060803'}","{'lat': 12.71133, 'lng': 104.89172}","[{'lat': 12.71146, 'lng': 104.89172}]",73578,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12375943'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512935536'}]}],Not Available,Kampong Thom,12.711203,104.89173,12375943,Santepheap Guesthouse,"Finding an ideal guest house in Kampong Thom does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Santepheap Guesthouse, a nice option for travelers like you.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as a flat screen TV, a refrigerator, and a desk, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the guest house.
Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
When you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out The Third Place Coffee, which is a pub that is popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.
Santepheap Guesthouse puts the best of Kampong Thom at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
