Saravoan Kep Hotel,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-7a3bcd9e8eab49ce8984b09903d156a3,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Saravoan Kep Hotel, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.48035, 'lng': 104.2929}","[{'lat': 10.48048, 'lng': 104.29285}]",8070,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2408730'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855366393909', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85569300128'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://saravoankep.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.479852,104.29229,2408730,Saravoan Kep Hotel,"Offering rooms with sea view, Saravoan-Kep Hotel is just in front of Kep Beach. This hillside property features an outdoor pool, a coffee shop, a bar and free WiFi throughout the hotel. Fitted with stone walls, the air-conditioned rooms have cable TV. Each room has a private bathroom with a hot shower. Saravoan-Kep Hotel is just 100 meters from National Road 33. It is within walking distances from seafood restaurants, pharmacy, ATM machine and bus station. Guests can enjoy a relaxing massage, or take a dip in the pool, which overlooks the sea. The hotel offers tour bookings and motorbike rentals. The in-house coffee shop and bar overlooks the beach and nearby islands. It offers room service and take-away.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d2408730-Reviews-Saravoan_Kep_Hotel-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Kep Beach Road', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '22102', 'address_string': 'Kep Beach Road, Kep 22102 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '29393