Scodo,here:pds:place:116w649g-a391d1f0660745409a8b17109a4464e3,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Scodo, ផ្លូវ 178 33, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 178', 'postalCode': '120205', 'houseNumber': '33'}","{'lat': 11.56648, 'lng': 104.92945}","[{'lat': 11.56635, 'lng': 104.9295}]",7124,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13446754'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85561767977', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85570932265'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100068196166020&sk=about&locale=zh_CN', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.566584,104.93002,13446754,Scodo,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Phnom Penh, Scodo Boutique Hotel is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its boutique environment and proximity to great restaurants and attractions, Scodo Boutique Hotel makes it easy to enjoy the best of Phnom Penh.
Guest rooms offer air conditioning, and Scodo Boutique Hotel makes getting online easy as free wifi is available.
You can also take advantage of some of the amenities offered by the guest house, including baggage storage. In addition, guests can enjoy a pool and a lounge during their visit. As an added convenience, there is free public parking available nearby.
Close to some of Phnom Penh's most popular landmarks, such as Champey Academy of Arts (0.1 mi) and Wat Ounalom (0.4 mi), Scodo Boutique Hotel is a great destination for tourists.
Phnom Penh has plenty of sushi restaurants. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Shabu Shabu, Hachi, and The Sushi Bar Phnom Penh, which are serving up some great dishes.
Best of all, Scodo Boutique Hotel makes it easy to experience some great Phnom Penh attractions like Royal Palace Park, which is a popular park.
Scodo Boutique Hotel is sure to make your visit to Phnom Penh one worth remembering.
