Sea House Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3ckw-aa971e43a9104c94af64135ef959f471,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Sea House Guesthouse, 180405 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'កោះរុង', 'postalCode': '180405'}","{'lat': 10.66698, 'lng': 103.27355}","[{'lat': 10.66704, 'lng': 103.27343}]",97357,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7295083'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516295333'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.666861,103.27378,7295083,Sea House Guesthouse,"Finding an ideal budget friendly guest house in Koh Rong does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Sea House Guesthouse, a nice option for travelers like you.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer a mosquito net and a seating area, bringing comfort and convenience to your visit.
The guest house features currency exchange. Plus, Sea House Guesthouse offers a lounge, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day.
When you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out Da Matti?, which is a Mediterranean restaurant that is popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.
If you’re looking for something to do, Koh Rong (0.2 mi) is a nice way to spend some time, and it is within walking distance of Sea House Guesthouse.
Sea House Guesthouse puts the best of Koh Rong at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
