 'localized_name': 'Asian'}, {'name': 'bangladeshi', 'localized_name': 'Bangladeshi'}, {'name': 'arabic', 'localized_name': 'Arabic'}]",Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'restaurant', 'localized_name': 'Restaurant'}",Not available,Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '1'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '1'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,25,15
Sea View Villa,here:pds:place:116aabd1-616ef312617200d063c2ef9f13485c8f,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Sea View Villa, ផ្លូវ ឯករាជ្យ, 180402 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ឯករាជ្យ', 'postalCode': '180402'}","{'lat': 10.6238, 'lng': 103.52426}","[{'lat': 10.62367, 'lng': 103.52422}]",48767,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '681329'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592759753'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.sihanoukville-hotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.623972,103.5243,681329,Sea View Villa,"New Sea View Villa is a friendly, family run Sihanoukville hotel that offers a relaxed atmosphere whilst maintaining a consistently high standard. Our tastefully decorated rooms are clean and well maintained as well as stylish and affordable. Just a thirty metre walk from Sihanoukville's popular Serendipity Beach we are in an ideal location for everybody.All of our rooms have en- suite bathrooms with hot water and range from standard fan rooms to deluxe A/C family rooms with flat screen TV, fridge and coffee making facilities.The hotel offers a games room with pool table, table football and a wide selection of board games suitable for everyone. Furthermore we have free wi fi throughout the hotel and can offer a wider range of services such as laundry, bus and boat tours and Island bookings.Our leafy courtyard restaurant caters for all tastes. We have an extensive breakfast and lunch menu featuring homemade smoothies and cakes. Our evening menu is amongst the best in the area offering tasty homemade cuisine and a great range of delicious desserts, classic cocktails and an international wine menu.All rooms at New Sea View Villa are tastefully decorated to a high standard and are furnished with locally made furniture and art work. Each room offer sprung mattresses, mosquito protection, en suite bathrooms with hot water power showers and either fan or air conditioning. Our superior rooms offer, flat screen TVs, fridges, baths and coffee and tea making facilities. We have an in house team of cleaners that provide a professional, daily cleaning service, new towels and linen are provided every three days or upon requestNew Sea View Villa boasts a comfortable and inviting restaurant, situated at the front of the hotel. We have a varied breakfast and lunch menu. Our leafy courtyard setting is an ideal place to sit back and enjoy your meal. For dinner there is a great range of tasty, homemade, food that is amongst the areas finest. Our delicious desserts are prepared daily by our excellent kitchen team. A range of classic cocktails and an international wine menu compliment the menu perfectly.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d681329-Reviews-Sea_View_Villa-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '2 Sangkat', 'street2': 'Khan Mittapheap', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': '2 Sangkat Khan Mittapheap, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d681329-Sea_View_Villa-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#37 of 283 hotels in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out_of': '283', 'ranking': '37'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,115,"{'1': '7', '2': '11', '3': '21', '4': '36', '5': '40'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://s