Sebana Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116httek-07982921f7ac06c3fe5c1e29364b18ad,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Sebana Guesthouse, 070802 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'ក្រាំងអំពិល', 'postalCode': '070802'}","{'lat': 10.61093, 'lng': 104.18183}","[{'lat': 10.61084, 'lng': 104.18173}]",19651,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7119917'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85513590522'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.sebanaguesthouse.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.611172,104.182106,7119917,Sebana Guesthouse,"Sebana Guesthouse is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Kampot, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Given the close proximity to The Old Royal Cinema (0.2 mi), guests of Sebana Guesthouse can easily experience one of Kampot's most popular landmarks.
Sebana Guesthouse offers guests an array of room amenities including air conditioning, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available.
The guest house offers a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and baggage storage, to make your visit even more pleasant. The property also features breakfast. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
While in Kampot, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Sebana Guesthouse, including Rusty Keyhole (0.3 mi), Epic Arts Cafe (0.2 mi), and bARACA restaurant (0.3 mi).
If you are looking for something to do in the area, Farm Link (0.7 mi) is a popular attraction that is within walking distance of Sebana Guesthouse.
Enjoy your stay in Kampot!
