See Siem Reap Tours,here:pds:place:116w63u7-d1ecde30d665490980d379bd068594a1,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'See Siem Reap Tours, 171205 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'នគរធំ', 'postalCode': '171205'}","{'lat': 13.41181, 'lng': 103.86423}","[{'lat': 13.41181, 'lng': 103.86409}]",19665,"[{'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3347674'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512793908'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.seesiemreaptours.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.411814,103.86419,3347674,See Siem Reap Tours,"I am Darith a licensed professional tour guide and transport coordinator, with years of experiences in welcoming English-speaking visitors in Siem Reap, Cambodia. My services include custom-made guide tour of the Angkor temples,as well as cruises around the floating villages, excursions to countryside and more remote temples sites. I can assist individual travelers and group of all sites and I aim to offer my guests high-quality services at reasonable rates. I",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d3347674-Reviews-See_Siem_Reap_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,+855 12 793 908,http://www.seesiemreaptours.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d3347674-See_Siem_Reap_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#176 of 1,339 Tours in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem R