Sen Han Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649f-7ee465f0c00b45f0917ffeba80449b16,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Sen Han Hotel, ផ្លូវ 313, 120408 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ទួលគោក', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកក់ទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 313', 'postalCode': '120408'}","{'lat': 11.5747, 'lng': 104.89239}","[{'lat': 11.57479, 'lng': 104.89229}]",3177,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5886084'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593541111'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://senhanhotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.57475,104.89233,5886084,Sen Han Hotel,"Offering an outdoor pool and a spa and wellness centre, Sen Han Hotel is a 4-star hotel offering a relaxing stay in Phnom Penh. It is located about 6 km from the Mekong River and 1 km from Samaki market. Free Wi-Fi access is available.The rooms are beautifully decorated and equipped with a flat-screen TV, air conditioning and a private balcony. There is also an electric kettle, a laptop safe and a minibar. Featuring a shower, the private bathrooms also come with a hairdryer and free toiletries.At Sen Han Hotel you will find a la carte restaurant offering a selection of Asian and Western food. Local specialities are also served. The hotel's Sky Bar is located on the 10th floor and offers drinks throughout the day.Guests can work out at the fitness centre or visit the tour desk for more information on the surroundings. There is also a billiard table.The hotel is located about 2.5 km from PP Railway Station and 2.9 km from Olympic Stadium. Phnom Penh International Airport is 6 km away, while Wat Phnom mountain is situated 5 km away. The property offers free parking.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d5886084-Reviews-Sen_Han_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 98, St. 600 corner St. 313', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '13253', 'address_string': 'No. 98, St. 600 corner St. 313, Phnom Penh 13253 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d5886084-Sen_Han_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#208 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '208'}",3.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.5-66827-5.svg,52,"{'1': '4', '2': '3', '3': '15', '4': '20', '5': '10'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}}",77,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d5886084-m66827-Reviews-Sen_Han_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Suites', 'Room service', 'Free Internet', 'Restaurant', 'Spa', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Breakfast included', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Fitness center', 'Laundry Service', 'Free parking', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Airport transpo