Sen Monorom Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-b1de3cd9795c43228ae69d5e0b6befa4,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Sen Monorom Guesthouse, 070803 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់បាយ', 'postalCode': '070803'}","{'lat': 10.61096, 'lng': 104.18086}","[{'lat': 10.61083, 'lng': 104.18081}]",19748,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3208938'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512650330'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.611108,104.18092,3208938,Sen Monorom Guesthouse,"If you’re looking for a budget friendly guest house in Kampot, look no further than Sen Monorom Guesthouse.
The Old Royal Cinema (0.1 mi), located nearby, makes Sen Monorom Guesthouse a great place to stay for those interested in visiting this popular Kampot landmark.
Sen Monorom Guesthouse offers guests an array of room amenities including air conditioning, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available.
The guest house offers a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and currency exchange, to make your visit even more pleasant. The property also features a lounge. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free public parking available nearby.
If you’re looking for a sushi restaurant, consider a visit to Flowers Nanobrewery or Rainbow Bridge Japanese Restaurant, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Sen Monorom Guesthouse.
Looking for something to do in Kampot? Farm Link (0.6 mi) is a popular attraction that is within walking distance of Sen Monorom Guesthouse.
The staff at Sen Monorom Guesthouse looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d3208938-Reviews-Sen_Monorom_Guesthouse-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '1 Ousaphea, Kampong Bay', 'street2': 'Kampong bay Village, Kampong bay Commune', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': '1 Ousaphea, Kampong Bay Kampong bay Village, Kampong bay Commune, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d3208938-Sen_Monorom_Guesthouse-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#59 of 148 B&Bs / Inns in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '148', 'ranking': '59'}",3.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.5-66827-5.svg,7,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '2', '4': '3', '5': '1'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratin