Seng Chhay Heng Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w614p-ac6dd4cbab434f3d95cdf66463e124c8,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Seng Chhay Heng Guesthouse, 090401 មណ្ឌលសីមា, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កោះកុង', 'city': 'មណ្ឌលសីមា', 'district': 'បាក់ខ្លង', 'postalCode': '090401'}","{'lat': 11.57257, 'lng': 102.9508}","[{'lat': 11.57251, 'lng': 102.95068}]",44388,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9464657'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512465768'}]}],Not Available,Koh Kong,11.572555,102.950935,9464657,Seng Chhay Heng Guesthouse,"Seng Chhay Heng Guesthouse is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Koh Kong, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Seng Chhay Heng Guesthouse is a small hotel offering a flat screen TV, air conditioning, and a desk in the rooms, and it is easy to stay connected during your stay as free wifi is offered to guests.
The small hotel features a 24 hour front desk and shops. For guests with a vehicle, parking is available.
If you are looking for a nearby place to eat, Seng Chhay Heng Guesthouse is within walking distance of Hula Hula Beach Bar (1.1 mi), a popular restaurant in the area.
Enjoy your stay in Koh Kong!
