Seng Hout Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-da02cdcc8215082e3973c785fe1b57e2,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Seng Hout Hotel, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10248, 'lng': 103.19869}","[{'lat': 13.10235, 'lng': 103.19867}]",12667,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1396848'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512530327'}, {'value': '+85517853012'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.senghouthotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.102383,103.19868,1396848,Seng Hout Hotel,"Seng Hout hotel is located in the heart of Battambang city. Our hotel was built in 2008. Our room... There are beautifully appointed rooms with cable televisions, air conditioners, refrigerators, hot and cold water. Seng Hout hotel is in a safe, quiet area closed to Psar Nat Market and cafe area. You can easily access to the internet with free wifi. Additionally, rooms are designed with a spacious space to ​overlook the city and the garden terrace. You can relax and see the spectacular sunset as you enjoy a drink on the rooftop of the hotel with the views over the city of the surrounding mountains.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d1396848-Reviews-Seng_Hout_Hotel-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '02 #1008b Road', 'street2': 'North of Psar Nat Market 50m', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': '02 #1008b Road North of Psar Nat Market 50m, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not av