Seng Live Angkor Guest House,here:pds:place:116w63gu-ccd3b0b3f9354edb88db6a9de3058cf8,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Seng Live Angkor Guest House, ផ្លូវ ស៊ាងណាំ, 171206 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ជ្រាវ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ស៊ាងណាំ', 'postalCode': '171206'}","{'lat': 13.35587, 'lng': 103.89175}","[{'lat': 13.35586, 'lng': 103.89189}]",22272,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4412973'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593303003'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.355863,103.89183,4412973,Seng Live Angkor Guest House,"Finding an ideal romantic small hotel in Siem Reap does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Seng Live Angkor Guest House, a nice option for travelers like you.
Seng Live Angkor Guest House offers guests an array of room amenities including air conditioning and a refrigerator, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available.
The small hotel offers a 24 hour front desk, baggage storage, and currency exchange, to make your visit even more pleasant.
While staying at Seng Live Angkor Guest House, visitors can check out Wat Bo Temple (2.2 mi) and Viti's Tuk Tuk Driver (2.2 mi), some of Siem Reap's top attractions.
While visiting Siem Reap, you may want to try some yakitori at one of the nearby restaurants, such as The Hashi.
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular ancient ruins such as Angkor Wat, Ta Prohm, and Bayon Temple.
Seng Live Angkor Guest House puts the best of Siem Reap at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
