Serenite Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-da40635d6c6e06435ed185f2baea9a59,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Serenite Guesthouse, វិថី សាលាកម្រើក, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'វិថី សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35001, 'lng': 103.85848}","[{'lat': 13.34999, 'lng': 103.85834}]",116510,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3544626'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855885815052'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.sereniteguesthousesiemreap.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.350048,103.85892,3544626,Serenite Guesthouse,"Serenite Guesthouse has two beautifully decorated rooms and a garden to welcome you in the center of Siem Reap. We are well located, in front of a Khmer market and near the Wat Damnak temple. We are 5-10 minutes away by foot from the touristic center of Siem Reap.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d3544626-Reviews-Serenite_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Wat Damnak Village Sangkat Salakomreouk', 'street2': 'House N°107', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': 'Wat Damnak Village Sangkat Salakomreouk House N°107, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d3544626-Serenite_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#26 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '26'}",5,https://www.tripadviso