Shaly Boutique Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649e-0bde7e874fc64e8f9a362ac9ddd4da73,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Shaly Boutique Hotel, ផ្លូវ សុភមង្គល, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សុភមង្គល', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.54994, 'lng': 104.93879}","[{'lat': 11.55007, 'lng': 104.93862}]",22256,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7289386'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855968888076'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.549983,104.93874,7289386,Shaly Boutique Hotel,"Strategically located in Phnom Penh, Shaly Boutique Hotel offers modern and comfy accommodation with free WiFi access in its public areas. Operating a 24-hour front desk, it features a business center and free parking on site. The hotel is just 15 minutes walk to Royal Palace, National Museum and only 15 minutes with Tuk Tuk drive to Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum and Russian market. Riverfront Park, Night Market and Wat Phnom park just 2.5 Km away, while Phnom Penh International Airport is accessible only 25 minutes with car. Fitted with tiled flooring, air-conditioned rooms include a wardrobe, in-room safe, a desk and a flat-screen TV with cable channels. Electric kettle and minibar are also provided. Offering shower facility, the en suite bathroom also comes with a bathtub, hairdryer, bathrobes and free toiletries. At Shaly Boutique Hotel, guests can approach the friendly staff for assistance with luggage storage, laundry services and tour arrangements. Bicycle and car rentals are available, while airport transfers can be provided at a surcharge. A tasty selection of local and western food are served at the restaurant, while a variety of drinks are offered at the bar. Guest also can enjoy the cocktail with a very nice Phnom Penh night view from Shaly Sky Bar.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d7289386-Reviews-Shaly_Boutique_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'A27-A28 , La Seine', 'street2': 'Koh Pich', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'A27-A28 , La Seine Koh Pich, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d7289386-Shaly_Boutique_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#158 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '158'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,23,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '5', '5': '17'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",78,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d7289386-m66827-Reviews-Shaly_Boutique_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', '