Shang Hai Guest House,here:pds:place:116w636s-29bdcae732b7427f8864fca7a1be8cd3,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Shang Hai Guest House, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10624, 'lng': 103.19616}","[{'lat': 13.10616, 'lng': 103.19605}]",12692,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3320507'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592999970'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.106202,103.196106,3320507,Shang Hai Guest House,"Shang Hai Guest House is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Battambang, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Close to some of Battambang's most popular landmarks, such as White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (0.4 mi) and Battambang Crocodile Farm (1.2 mi), Shang Hai Guest House is a great destination for tourists.
The rooms offer air conditioning and a refrigerator, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
Shang Hai Guest House features a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and room service. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the wine bars, including VINTAGE and Libations Bar, all of which are a short distance from Shang Hai Guest House.
If you are interested in exploring Battambang, check out one of the ancient ruins, such as Prasat Sneung and Ek Phnom.
Enjoy your stay in Battambang!
