Shihai Group Tour,here:pds:place:116w63u4-88850eda516ab03e546c97c3f2791326,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Shihai Group Tour, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36525, 'lng': 103.8411}","[{'lat': 13.36525, 'lng': 103.8411}]",87848,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}, {'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27416437'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27416456'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27416461'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27422161'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+8551081612727', 'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85595612727'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://shihaigrouptours.com'}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '300-3000-0000'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT24H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.361668,103.843506,6986216,Karma Group,"Nestled within private leafy gardens and peaceful environment, Model Temple Resort & Spa offers spacious contemporary-style rooms and suites away from the hustle and bustle of Siem Reap. It features two outdoor swimming pools and spa facilities. Guests can enjoy meals at the in-house restaurant or have a drink at the bar. Free WiFi is available throughout the property. The resort provides guests the opportunity to experience Siem Reap in an authentic setting, surrounded by rice paddies, palm trees and the lush scenery of Cambodian country side. With a team committed to deliver the best service and assistance 24/7. Model Temple Resort & Spa welcomes families, couples, solo travelers and groups that are looking for a genuine and memorable travel experience. Whether you’re looking for great food, a relaxing massage and wellness treatment, a swim and sauna, or afternoon drink after visiting the Angkor Temples, Resort offers it all.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d6986216-Reviews-Karma_Group-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Bakheng Road', 'street2': 'Svay Dangkum Commune, Siem Reap City', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '171202', 'address_string': 'Bakheng Road Svay Dangkum Commune, Siem Reap City, Siem Reap 171202 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d6986216-Karma_Group-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#65 of 763 hotels in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '763', 'ranking': '65'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,1408,"{'1': '4', '2': '8', '3': '25', '4': '107', '5': '1264'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name'