Shinta Mani Wild - Bensley Collection,here:pds:place:116w3czt-120a320662ceda8acedc311de0bcfcb5,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Shinta Mani Wild - Bensley Collection, 180302 កំពង់សីលា, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'កំពង់សីលា', 'district': 'កំពងសីលា', 'postalCode': '180302'}","{'lat': 11.18971, 'lng': 103.93728}","[{'lat': 11.18976, 'lng': 103.93741}]",55149,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15791874'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85587656152'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://shintamani.com/wild'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,11.189465,103.93664,15791874,Shinta Mani Wild - Bensley Collection,"Set along 1.5 kilometers of river and waterfalls, Bensley has set out to create his most ambitious luxury camp project to date. 15 tents 100sqm, custom designed tents are perched over the swift moving waters and waterfalls, providing a view and experience unlike any other resort in Asia. Each tent has been meticulously designed to invoke the feeling of what it would have been like to be on a luxur",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g16701391-d15791874-Reviews-Shinta_Mani_Wild_Bensley_Collection-Ou_Bak_Roteh_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Prey Praseth Village', 'city': 'Ou Bak Roteh', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '855', 'address_string': 'Prey Praseth Village, Ou Bak Roteh 855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Ou Bak Roteh', 'location_id': '16701391'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g16701391-d15791874-Shinta_Mani_Wild_Bensley_Collection-Ou_Bak_Roteh_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '16701391', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 1 hotels i