Shintana Saya Residence,here:pds:place:116w63u5-a7d1c3ef21a64919adc508206fedc3c1,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Shintana Saya Residence, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.38258, 'lng': 103.85126}","[{'lat': 13.38271, 'lng': 103.85128}]",86909,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12164351'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563769099'}, {'value': '+855977820888'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.shintanasayasiemreap.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.382454,103.85124,12164351,Shintana Saya Residence,"Shintana Saya Residence is an upscale unique property in Siem Reap, well designed, hip and tasteful. Enjoy the comfort and quiet of 9 rooms and suites, a swimming pool, a rooftop terrace with a stunning views of Bakheng mountain and an all-day dining restaurant and bar where traditional Khmer design meets modern luxury with different styles. Surrounding by lush tropical garden, beautiful layout, very chic with a serene and relaxing atmosphere. The location is about 8 minutes Remork-Tuk Tuk drives from town in the direction of the magnificent temple of Angkor Wat.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12164351-Reviews-Shintana_Saya_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 30, Phum Veal', 'street2': 'Sangkat Kouk Chak', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17253', 'address_string': 'Street 30, Phum Veal Sangkat Kouk Chak, Siem Reap 17253 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,