Siem Reap Angkor Travel and Tour,here:pds:place:116aabd1-b65f6232d41705db81072ecd1e817fec,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Siem Reap Angkor Travel and Tour, ផ្លូវខេត្ត 2អេសអ3, 171209 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សៀមរាប', 'street': 'ផ្លូវខេត្ត 2អេសអ3', 'postalCode': '171209'}","{'lat': 13.3339, 'lng': 103.85115}","[{'lat': 13.33403, 'lng': 103.85114}]",87470,"[{'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6665741'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517650808'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.bestangkortour.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.333755,103.85115,6665741,Siem Reap Angkor Travel and Tour,"I am a local tour company base in Cambodia and can arrange the best tours in Cambodia. I have many years of experience as a tour guide and have a lot of knowledge about all the important tourist attractions. Because I know each place very well I can tell interesting and funny stories as well as historic facts. I find it very important that guests feel comfortable and trust me so that their experience will be wonderful and they will have a good memory of my country. I am at the disposal of my guests and can help anywhere they like, from taking pictures to giving recommendations for places to visit that are not well known by tourists. Some of the many adventures that we can have on a tour are visiting the amazing temples of Angkor, the countryside, local villages, ox’s cart riding, quad bike tour, art tour and visiting remote temples off the beaten track. I hope to give my guests a memorable and enjoyable experience.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d6665741-Reviews-Siem_Reap_Angkor_Travel_and_Tour-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@siemreapangkortravelandtour.com,+855 17 650 808,http://www.bestangkortour.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d6665741-Siem_Reap_Angkor_Travel_and_Tour-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#169 of 1,339 Tours in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1339', 'ranking': '169'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,141,"{'1': '0', '2': '2', '3': '1', '4': '8', '5': '130'}",Not available,207,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d6665741-m66827-Reviews-Siem_Reap_Angkor_Travel_and_Tour-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2359'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Tuesday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Wednesday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Thursday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Friday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Saturday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Sunday: 00:00 - 23:59']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sight