Siem Reap Bike Tour,here:pds:place:116w63u7-727e468b7809b9b3ebf507c8a74b7f54,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Siem Reap Bike Tour, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.40495, 'lng': 103.85816}","[{'lat': 13.40501, 'lng': 103.85829}]",20655,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '14077343'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569811680'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://siemreapbiketour.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT09H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.404918,103.8581,14077343,Siem Reap Bike Tour,"Who We Are? We are local tour operator, well-selected licensed tour guide by Ministry Of Tourism. We started the tour operator since 2015, our guide has been trained with great interpersonal skill and long experience in the tourism industry. It has been our pleasure to spend valuable time with visitors from all over the world, sharing our knowledge of our famous sites and personal experiences of living within the Angkor Archeological Park, a United Nations World Heritage Site. And as much as we have enjoyed speaking of the history of the Angkor Civilization and its temples, we have equally found pleasure in coming to know the people we have driven and their stories from so many countries. For every of our tour destination, our desire is to help the tourism discover the real surface of Siem Reap, both touristic and the non-touristic area, close to local people. We are always ready to introduce our beautiful province. The travelers will get to know more about Siem Reap",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d14077343-Reviews-Siem_Reap_Bike_Tour-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,siemreapbiketour99@gmail.com,+855 69 811 680,http://siemreapbiketour.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d14077343-Siem_Reap_Bike_Tour-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#82 of 557 Outdoor Activities in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '557', 'ranking': '82'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,68,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '2', '5': '66'}",Not available,170,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d14077343-m66827-Reviews-Siem_Reap_Bike_Tour-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '1700'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Tuesday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Wednesday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Thursday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Friday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Saturday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Sunday: 08:00 - 17:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}, {'name': 'outdoor_activities', 'loca