Siem Reap Garden Inn,here:pds:place:116aabd1-bd4eadfba97a0d75cbe2eda317a5c03e,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Siem Reap Garden Inn, ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35454, 'lng': 103.84834}","[{'lat': 13.35467, 'lng': 103.84833}]",25292,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1837139'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563965992'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.siemreapgardeninn.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.35465,103.84833,1837139,Siem Reap Garden Inn,"	Siem Reap Garden Inn is the small boutique hotel situated 700 metres from Central markets and Pub Street. 400 metres to Night market; situated in quiet area with beautiful carved wooden staircase leads to 14 modern rooms with; Hair dryver, 32""Plasma TV"", Mini Bar & Refrigerator, Air condition, Hot and Cold showers, Writing desk, Slippers, Bath & Face towels, Comb, Toothbrush and Toothpaste. Classic Swimming Pool (Install March 2012) surrounded by vast tropical gardens. Hotel offers free Bicycles, Internet access, Tuk Tuk to City center, Coffee & Tea, Pick up at Airport, Bus or Boat station is available subject to booking. 24 hours Reception and Security, Tour packaging program available throughout Cambodia, Massage service available.The hotel is Australian owned and managed with no single supplement.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1837139-Reviews-Siem_Reap_Garden_Inn-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sok San Road', 'street2': 'Steoung Thmey Village, Sangkat Svay Dangkum,', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '00855', 'address_string': 'Sok San Road Steoung Thmey Village, Sangkat Svay Dangkum,, Siem Reap 00855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipali