Siem Reap Homestay,here:pds:place:116w63u5-bb78ce7c19cd4fa9bf8992ff2c9d2bb5,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Siem Reap Homestay, អេអេច21, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'អេអេច21', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.37224, 'lng': 103.84167}","[{'lat': 13.37213, 'lng': 103.8416}]",24397,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2225969'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511574343'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://countrysidecookingclass.com/tours.html'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.372184,103.84163,2225969,Siem Reap Homestay,"Siem Reap Homestay is a truly local homestay. A beautiful traditional wooden house in a small village close to Siem Reap city. Only just 12-minutes by Tuk-Tuk drive. You will experience the real Cambodian Culture, Live like local in sustainable ecological way. Your stay is direct support to our local family and community. Daily observing and sharing local activities and experiences. Come as our guest and leave as our friend. Mosquitos Net, Pillows, Blankets, Bath towels, Storage room, Mineral drinking water, Bicycles. Village Activities: - Rice planting OR Harvesting depend on season. Learn crafting and cooking with villagers. This unique stay will remain engraved in your memories forever. Our traditional Khmer food served here will fit your senses. The unique setting and real Khmer people will make your travel experience unforgettable. The guests can enjoy chilling out at our hammock in a very tranquil natural environment with mango trees, organic fruits, vegetable garden & lotus.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d2225969-Reviews-Siem_Reap_Homestay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '6 National Road, near West Baray', 'street2': 'West of Siem Reap Town 11km', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 