Siem Reap Nightlife Tours,here:pds:place:116w63gg-bec713749ffaf32b31f68e4080585682,en,Nightlife-Entertainment,"{'label': 'Siem Reap Nightlife Tours, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35418, 'lng': 103.85487}","[{'lat': 13.35413, 'lng': 103.85489}]",24852,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11802373'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855977776977'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://siemreapnightlifetour.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.354078,103.85169,11949032,Golden Temple Boutique,"“Service with a Smile” is one cornerstone principle of this newly opened property. Building on the successes of it's sister hotels, the boutique offers excellent services in addition to an amazing central location, just few minutes away from downtown Siem Reap. The Golden Temple Boutique with it's hand-crafted stonework décor throughout the rooms, spa, and restaurant exemplifies the attention to detail. Innovative use of non-slip tread plate materials create novel and unique designs throughout the ground floor area, making this property somewhat different. The Boutique offers professional spa, a relaxation pool, extensive bar and high quality restaurant. The restaurant serves both Western and local gastronomic delights to a very high standard. All rooms are air-conditioned and offer flat-screen TVs with satellite channels and many modern comforts. Each room has en-suite shower room with quality fittings.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d11949032-Reviews-Golden_Temple_Boutique-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Night Market Road', 'street2': 'Stueng Thmei', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Night Market Road Stueng Thmei, Siem Reap 17252 Cam