Siem Reap Residence,here:pds:place:116w63u5-503fd1fdac644879802e3780e73611fc,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Siem Reap Residence, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37314, 'lng': 103.86873}","[{'lat': 13.37325, 'lng': 103.86865}]",22279,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,[],[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592899966'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.38052,103.84907,11094412,DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence,"See why so many travelers make DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence their hotel of choice when visiting Siem Reap. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a charming setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Rooms at DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence offer air conditioning, a refrigerator, and a minibar providing exceptional comfort and convenience.
Room service is one of the conveniences offered at this hotel. Breakfast will also help to make your stay even more special. If you are driving to DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence, free parking is available.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Seng English Speaking Tuk Tuk & Car Driver (0.7 mi) and Friendly Tuk Tuk Driver (1.0 mi), guests of DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence can easily experience some of Siem Reap's most well known attractions.
If you like steakhouses, DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence is conveniently located near Grill Wine Cafe, Damnak Steakhouse, and Tell Steak House.
If you’re looking for something to do, Wat Thmey (Killing Fields) (0.8 mi) is a nice way to spend some time, and it is within walking distance of DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at DDG Retreat Siem Reap Residence as you experience all of the things Siem Reap has to offer.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d11094412-Reviews-DDG_Retreat_Siem_Reap_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Pub Street 45', 'street2': 'Teaksen Tboung Village Sangkat Kouk Chak next to Phasaar Daem Kralanh market', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17253', 'address_string': 'Pub Street 45 Teaksen Tboung Village Sangkat Kouk Chak next to Phasaar Daem Kralanh market, Siem Reap 17253 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d11094412-DDG_Retreat_Siem_Reap_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#308 of 763 hotels in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '763', 'ranking': '308'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,48,"{'1': '3', '2': '1', '3': '1', '4': '4', '5': '39'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name