Siem Reap Tour Guide Travel,here:pds:place:116w63u3-38504b5575d093564d1ef6a0107e1ccc,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Siem Reap Tour Guide Travel, 171211 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ទឹកវិល', 'postalCode': '171211'}","{'lat': 13.41269, 'lng': 103.79076}","[{'lat': 13.41263, 'lng': 103.79064}]",85368,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27237536'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578689898'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://siemreaptourguidetravel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.412654,103.79067,27237536,Siem Reap Tour Guide Travel,"Greeting Siem Reap Tour Guide Travel Welcome to Siem Reap Tour Guide Travel, your gateway to the timeless wonders of Cambodia’s ancient temples. Nestled in the heart of this land of antiquity, we take pride in being the premier travel agency dedicated to unveiling the stunning treasures that have graced Siem Reap since the 9th century. The legacy of Angkor Wat temples, spanning over ten centuries, continues to captivate the imagination of all who step into the former empire, offering a mesmerizing journey through time. As natives of the UNESCO town of Siem Reap, our roots run deep in the rich soil of this historical city. Having explored and expanded our knowledge in the bustling capital of Phnom Penh, we returned to our homeland, driven by a passion to share the marvels of Angkor Temples with the world. Siem Reap is not just a destination for us; it is our motherland, where we were born, raised, and where our dreams have taken shape.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g12591811-d27237536-Reviews-Siem_Reap_Tour_Guide_Travel-Svay_Dangkum_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Svay Dangkum', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Svay Dangkum', 'location_id': '12591811'}, {'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,siemreaptourguidetravel@gmail.com,+855 78 689 898,https://siemreaptourguidetravel.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g12591811-d27237536-Siem_Reap_Tour_Guide_Travel-Svay_Dangkum_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '12591811', 'ranking_string': '#15 of 50 Tours in Svay Dangkum', 'geo_location_name': 'Svay Dangkum', 'ranking_out_of': '50', 'ranking': '15'}",0,Not available,2,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g12591811-d27237536-m66827-Reviews-Siem_Reap_Tour_Guide_Travel-Svay_Dangkum_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Private Tours', 'localized_name': 'Private Tours'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,31,20
