Siem Reap Travellers Inn,here:pds:place:116aabd1-8f146bfa98140c67e2febf1cf00d77bf,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Siem Reap Travellers Inn, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34855, 'lng': 103.85191}","[{'lat': 13.34843, 'lng': 103.85198}]",88171,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2525483'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511899893', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85512899893'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.348492,103.85195,2525483,Siem Reap Travellers Inn,"Welcome to Travellers Inn Please enjoy the affordable Healthy foods of a organic breakfast that we collect from local market farmed by villager in the Natural way( no chemical ) , comfortable rooms and warm hearted service. Cozy elegant rooms with balcony and free internet access are waiting for you to indulge in. You will love it! Travellers Inn is located in central of Siem Reap city in natural and relaxed area surrounding of a Khmer countryside atmosphere. Free pick up service from the Airport and welcome drink is a part of our extensive service. Travellers Inn has five luxurious double rooms and one Twin room of a charming atmosphere. All rooms are elegantly decorated, comfortably furnished,opened to welcome all of our happy guests.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d2525483-Reviews-Siem_Reap_Travellers_Inn-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 683 Street. 63 Vihear Chen Village, Svay Dongkum Commune', 'street2': '500 meters from Old Market, along front river', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': '# 683 Street. 63 Vihear Chen Village, Svay Dongkum Commune 500 meters from Old Market, along front river, Siem