Siemreap Green Residence,here:pds:place:116w63u5-02435a166222efab4ae778b50b4b408b,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Siemreap Green Residence, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.38033, 'lng': 103.84508}","[{'lat': 13.3802, 'lng': 103.84506}]",87131,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27702424'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511912902'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.379125,103.84591,19597838,Siemreap Vasinh Residence,"Siemreap Vasinh Residence combines the rich in culture and experiences of Siem Reap with luxury accommodation and service excellence. Conveniently located in the edge City of Siem Reap, and just 9 minutes away from the temple complex, 8 minutes from the Siem Reap International Airport in the vibrant of Kok Chak Village areas, Vasinh Residence is a leisurely travel by Remork or Car just takes 5 minutes from the French-Colonial buildings of the Old Market area, the bustling Night Market, and the vibrant bars and restaurants of Pub Street. Additionally, it is just 1 hour and 55km drive from the New Siem Reap Angkor International Airport. With its magnificent entrance portico, outdoor swimming pool, and restaurant areas, the ground floor is dominated by a restaurant and swimming pool and accompanying dining and bar area. This space has been an inspired design, complemented by a lush tropical garden.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d19597838-Reviews-Siemreap_Vasinh_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'South of Street 30', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17253', 'address_string': 'South of Street 30, Siem Reap 17253 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Provinc