Simon Salon,here:pds:place:116w63gg-61f7e9a1b7e845d394b09f613485e53e,en,barber,"{'label': 'Simon Salon, 171210 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្រងែ', 'postalCode': '171210'}","{'lat': 13.38443, 'lng': 103.81622}","[{'lat': 13.38441, 'lng': 103.81625}]",86335,"[{'id': '600-6950-0399', 'name': 'Barber', 'primary': True}, {'id': '600-6950-0401', 'name': 'Hair Salon'}, {'id': '700-7400-0292', 'name': 'Wellness Center & Services'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592630882'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.362588,103.8557,11743988,Sister Beauty Salon & Spa,"Sister Beauty is an exciting new and fresh full service salon concept. We offer wonderful manicure and pedicure with the latest styles, all the spa services you crave and outstanding high quality hair styling with cutting, colouring highlights to have you looking better than you can imagine. Khmer Canadian owned and operated, Sister Beauty brings a blend of western and traditional styles to the trendiest hair salon in Siem Reap. Let the pampering begin by calling us to schedule an appointment with our friendly staff or walk in and select from our many menu options. We use only the finest western imported products.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d11743988-Reviews-Sister_Beauty_Salon_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No.54 Sivatha Boulevard', 'street2': ""Infront of Memoire d'Angkor Boutique Hotel"", 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': ""No.54 Sivatha Boulevard Infront of Memoire d'Angkor Boutique Hotel, Siem Reap Cambodia""}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@sisterbeautysalon.com,+855 69 369 888,http://