Simon's II Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116cad3f-64b2a2200ac1ee3b11fe379f952975fb,en,guest_house,"{'label': ""Simon's II Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 93 10, 120706 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ឫស្សីកែវ', 'subdistrict': 'ទួលសង្កែ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 93', 'postalCode': '120706', 'houseNumber': '10'}","{'lat': 11.59316, 'lng': 104.91647}","[{'lat': 11.59316, 'lng': 104.91633}]",6363,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1549661'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512608892'}, {'value': '+85512815533', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0000'}]}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.580451,104.9224,2688030,Happiness Guesthouse II,"Looking for a place to stay in Phnom Penh? Then look no further than Happiness Guesthouse II, a guest house that brings the best of Phnom Penh to your doorstep.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer air conditioning, bringing comfort and convenience to your visit.
The guest house features a 24 hour front desk and baggage storage. For guests with a vehicle, there is free public parking available nearby.
Nearby landmarks such as Sisowath Quay (0.8 mi) and Wat Ounalom (1.0 mi) make Happiness Guesthouse II a great place to stay when visiting Phnom Penh.
If you’re looking for a Mediterranean restaurant, consider a visit to Casablanca restaurant, Terrazza, or Il Forno, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Happiness Guesthouse II.
Should time allow, Cambodia Post Office is a popular attraction that is within walking distance.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Happiness Guesthouse II as you experience everything Phnom Penh has to offer.
