Skybar,here:pds:place:116w3ckw-64e30a2556574df184c233f0fcbf9df4,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Skybar, 180405 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'កោះរុង', 'postalCode': '180405'}","{'lat': 10.66671, 'lng': 103.27309}","[{'lat': 10.66665, 'lng': 103.27321}]",97391,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8656794'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85581715650'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.6669,103.27274,8656794,Skybar,"Welcome to Skybar, Koh Rong island, Cambodia The Skybar is a beautiful establishment located on the hill of the charming Koh Toch village, on Koh Rong island, away from Sihanoukville in the south of Cambodia. Skybar provides you the most beautiful view of the island and various services such as a restaurant, accommodation in typical bungalows and dorms, pool table and games, excursions, private area, themed nights and much more. Skybar is also the 1st lounge and cocktail bar on Koh Rong, proposing you a large choice of various refreshments of which several are home made. Our bungalows are made to welcome up to 4 guests with their own sanitaries, balcony, mosquito net, king bed and fans. These bungalows are perfect for families, friends groups, couples, etc. Our dorm is made to welcome up to 6 guests. The restaurant proposes you various excellent Khmer and Western food, from breakfast to dinner. Everyday our friendly team is looking after your well being. Don't miss the sunrise that will fill your day with beautiful colors. join us in the stars Skybar",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1808558-d8656794-Reviews-Skybar-Koh_Rong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Koh Rong', 'state': 'Koh Kong Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Koh Rong Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Island', 'name': 'Koh Rong', 'location_id': '1808558'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Koh Kong Province', 'location_id': '2366667'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1808558-d8656794-Skybar-Koh_Rong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '1808558', 'ranking_string': '#13 of 54 B&Bs / Inns in Koh Rong', 'geo_location_name': 'Koh Rong', 'ranking_out_of': '54', 'ranking': '13'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,52,"{'1': '8', '2': '4', '3': '2', '4': '12', '5': '26'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}}",45,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1808558-d8656794-m66827-Reviews-Skybar-Koh_Rong_Koh_Kong_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Suites', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Public Wifi', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Pets Allowed', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Business center', 'Laundry Service', 'Family Rooms', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Rooftop Bar', 'Bre