:00 - 23:30', 'Tuesday: 09:00 - 23:30', 'Wednesday: 09:00 - 23:30', 'Thursday: 09:00 - 23:30', 'Friday: 09:00 - 23:30', 'Saturday: 09:00 - 23:30', 'Sunday: 09:00 - 23:30']}","['Cash Only', 'Free Wifi', 'Outdoor Seating', 'Seating', 'Takeout', 'Wheelchair Accessible']","[{'name': 'cafe', 'localized_name': 'Cafe'}]",Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'restaurant', 'localized_name': 'Restaurant'}","[{'name': 'sit_down', 'localized_name': 'Sit down'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '11'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '416'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '130'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '188'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '250'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,20,20
Sla Boutique Hostel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-00bdd2d1da5e0c285279583487c29d48,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Sla Boutique Hostel, ផ្លូវ ឧកញ៉ា កេត, 120203 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ឧកញ៉ា កេត', 'postalCode': '120203'}","{'lat': 11.56562, 'lng': 104.92487}","[{'lat': 11.56548, 'lng': 104.9249}]",6628,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '400-4100-0041', 'name': 'Transportation Service'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7077065'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523997515'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.slahostel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.565503,104.92493,7077065,SLA Boutique Hostel,"Our hostel has been closed from operations. Sla Boutique Hostel is a modern hostel nestled conveniently in the center of Phnom Penh city that offers travelers a place to unwind and meet people in a community environment that is clean, friendly, and affordable. Although our street is nice and quiet, it's just one block away from a vibrant neighborhood filled with restaurants, clubs, street food vendors, and bars. It is also close to the city's major attractions. We at Sla take pride in our cleanliness. Our hostel offers four different types of rooms, all modern-day style, and totaling 48 beds. There are 1) girl dorm rooms 2) boy dorm rooms 3) co-ed dorm rooms and 4) private double rooms with shared bathrooms. All rooms are equipped with air conditioning, hot water shower, personal lockers, bed curtains, bed light and bed cabinet. We have 24-hour front desk services, TV and free WI-FI in the communal area. Our kitchen is equipped with a gas stove, microwave, refrigerator, and cookware.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d7077065-Reviews-SLA_Boutique_Hostel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#15, Street 174', 'street2': 'Phsar Thmey III', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '#15, Street 174 Phsar Thmey III, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d7077065-SLA_Boutique_Hostel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#4 of 351 Specialty lodging in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '351', 'ranking': '4'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,301,"{'1': '3', '2': '2', '3': '10', '4': '59', '5': '227'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",143,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d7077065-m66827-Reviews-SLA_Boutique_Hostel-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Kitchenette', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'A