Slek Morn Restaurant & Bar - Siem Reap,here:pds:place:116aabd1-921f341d77e60ff1e3103044a3002526,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Slek Morn Restaurant & Bar - Siem Reap, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.36812, 'lng': 103.86096}","[{'lat': 13.36814, 'lng': 103.86082}]",23257,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '101-003', 'name': 'American-Barbecue', 'primary': True}, {'id': '800-078', 'name': 'Grill'}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515620555'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.358942,103.85753,7260612,Embassy Restaurant,"An exclusive fine dining experience unparalleled in Siem Reap and headed by our own local legend, Culinary Director Kimsan Pol. Her experience has taken her to different continents and under the mentoring of a Michelin starred Chef. She brings with her to Embassy Restaurant a five-star quality, ""Active"" seasonal Khmer gastronomy menu that's monthly changed. Our exclusive venue is staffed with specially selected employees where guests can savor skillfully prepared masterpieces from the multiple-course set menu paired with a selection of wines.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d7260612-Reviews-Embassy_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Corner Street 5 Sangkat', 'street2': 'Mondul 1 Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17253', 'address_string': 'Corner Street 5 Sangkat Mondul 1 Village, Siem Reap 17253 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,contact@embassy-restaurant.com,+855 89 282 911,http://www.embas