Smokin' Pot Streetfood & Cookery School,here:pds:place:116w636s-2d813aef35d14cc884ebb8494b772207,en,restaurant,"{'label': ""Smokin' Pot Streetfood & Cookery School, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10013, 'lng': 103.19937}","[{'lat': 13.10015, 'lng': 103.19926}]",12580,"[{'id': '800-8200-0000', 'name': 'Education Facility', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '600-6900-0247', 'name': 'Market'}]","[{'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512821400'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://smokin-pot.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.10312,103.199265,1219850,Smokin' Pot,"*WE NOW HAVE A NEW LISTING FOR OUR COOKING SCHOOL* Please search Smokin' Pot Cooking School to book and review classes. Smokin' Pot Cooking school and restaurant of Khmer and Thai food has been operating since 2000. Why not join the locals in the mood for good-value Khmer food and come find the newly located Smokin' Pot food stall on the riverside night market in Battambang. With a range of authentic Khmer cuisines to try, with vegetarian and vegan options available too, there's something for everyone. We also offer a variety of fresh fruit shakes for you to enjoy on these hot evenings. So whether you are passing by or checking out the local Night Market, come and try our authentic Khmer dishes for yourself!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g303666-d1219850-Reviews-Smokin_Pot-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 1.5 Street', 'street2': 'Next to Ganesha Family Guesthouse', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'No. 1.5 Street Next to Ganesha Family Guesthouse, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, 