Snooze Capsule Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w63gg-5e60cce9456745a3b0d9c460fbc56358,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Snooze Capsule Cambodia, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34486, 'lng': 103.85719}","[{'lat': 13.3445, 'lng': 103.85691}]",88538,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578937329'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.snoozecaps.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.342192,103.8595,9882991,Journey Cambodia,"JOURNEY CAMBODIA is a distinguished tour operator headquartered in Siem Reap, Cambodia. With almost a decade of experience in the industry, JOURNEY CAMBODIA is committed to delivering exceptional and memorable experiences, ensuring the highest standards of quality through our deep local knowledge. Our extensive experience and passion enable us to take immense pride in showcasing Cambodia's rich cultural heritage, traditions, and hidden gems while demonstrating our distinctive ability to create unique and unforgettable experiences.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d9882991-Reviews-Journey_Cambodia-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@journeycambodia.com,+855 12 334 657,http://journeycambodia.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d9882991-Journey_Cambodia-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 1,339 Tours in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1339', 'ranking': '1'}",5,https