Snooze Hostel & Skybar,here:pds:place:116aabd1-8394d6d1d57408104f3c54d2c5c70212,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Snooze Hostel & Skybar, ផ្លូវជាតិ 63, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 63', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35605, 'lng': 103.85398}","[{'lat': 13.35607, 'lng': 103.85384}]",24759,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9974841'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578937329'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.snoozecaps.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.356066,103.85387,9974841,Snooze Hostel & Skybar,"Snooze Capsule is a simple hostel inspired by the modular capsule concept, decorated with modern funky decor set in a local Cambodian Angkor essence. Located just 1 min away from Pub Street & Night Market, Siem Reap with heaps of Bars & Restaurants in the vicinity. Slightly away from the hustle and buzz of loud music and noise of Pub Street. Sky Bar overlooks the city center which offers humble food and drinks. Meet other like minded travelers, travel buddies and share stories . Chat to our wonderful Cambodian staff about local places, recommendations, sights and attractions. Walk ins & Day use are always welcome. We love to show you what Siem Reap has to offer, the Angkor - Cambodian culture, lifestyle, eco tours and activities, staff & traveller picks and special deals as well as bus tickets or other transportation within Cambodia or to other countries in our region. ​ 10% of our profits goes to local charity organisations. New Owner from 01 Oct 2018",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d9974841-Reviews-Snooze_Hostel_Skybar-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '25 Sivutha Blvd', 'street2': 'Mondul I Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17355', 'address_string': '25 Sivutha Blvd Mondul I Village, Siem Reap 17355 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d9974841-Snooze_Hostel_Skybar-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#33 of 449 Specialty lodging in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '449', 'ranking': '33'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,256,"{'1': '9', '2': '6', '3': '18', '4': '55', '5': '168'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",104,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d9974841-m66827-Reviews-Snooze_Hostel_Skybar-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Non-smoking room