Socheata Beauty Salon,here:pds:place:116w3fw2-389a30e921ed493792cf348190048486,en,barber,"{'label': 'Socheata Beauty Salon, 211003 ដូនកែវ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'តាកែវ', 'city': 'ដូនកែវ', 'district': 'រកាក្រៅ', 'postalCode': '211003'}","{'lat': 10.98221, 'lng': 104.77983}","[{'lat': 10.98221, 'lng': 104.77982}]",69028,"[{'id': '600-6950-0399', 'name': 'Barber', 'primary': True}, {'id': '600-6950-0000', 'name': 'Hair & Beauty'}, {'id': '600-6950-0401', 'name': 'Hair Salon'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512649858'}]}],Not Available,Takeo,11.566885,104.93107,6848726,Bodia Beauty Care Riverside,"Bodia Cambodian Apothecary’s slogan is, ""The first premium cosmetic brand made in Cambodia."" Our main values are: 1. Proudly made in Cambodia: We established the first factory in Phnom Penh, Cambodia. 2. Social responsibility: We believe in social impact by securing local partnerships with NGOs, local farmers, and artisans. 3. Quality pride: We are proud to be the first local company to apply EU standards and strict controls. 4. Cambodian Apothecary: Everything we make is handcrafted using only the finest ingredients found in Cambodian rich, natural landscape. Our recipes are based on centuries-old remedies and beauty secrets that Cambodians have turned to again and again for relaxation, comfort, and pleasure. We work directly with local farmers in accordance with fair trade values to ensure the country's best, most effective products.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d6848726-Reviews-Bodia_Beauty_Care_Riverside-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 10 Street 178', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '# 10 Street 178, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,contact@bodia.com,+855 77 554 092,htt