Sok Phen Homestay,here:pds:place:116w63u7-a9d7773b72ab49baa5bbc61bd0e2d1b6,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Sok Phen Homestay, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35233, 'lng': 103.86103}","[{'lat': 13.3522, 'lng': 103.86098}]",116815,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11880305'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578338770'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/sokpenhomestay'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.35226,103.86101,11880305,Sok Phen Homestay,"See why so many travelers make Sok Phen Homestay their guest house of choice when visiting Siem Reap. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a budget friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Close to some of Siem Reap's most popular landmarks, such as Wat Preah Prom Rath (0.3 mi) and Viti's Tuk Tuk Driver (1.0 mi), Sok Phen Homestay is a great destination for tourists.
Rooms at Sok Phen Homestay provide a refrigerator, a desk, and a mosquito net.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the seafood restaurants, including Sam Khmer Noodles - Nom Banh Chok, Samuth Kheav BBQ, and Ashia Lounge, all of which are a short distance from Sok Phen Homestay.
Should time allow, Pub Street is a popular attraction that is within walking distance.
At Sok Phen Homestay, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Siem Reap.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d11880305-Reviews-Sok_Phen_Homestay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '30th Street Wat Kauk Chok road', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '30th Street Wat Kauk Chok road, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d11880305-Sok_Phen_Homestay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#208 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '208'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,13,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '1', '5': '11'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",12,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hot