Sokchea Chantha Guest House,here:pds:place:116w6686-e935c40cd79b474f8703c44e8be73e71,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Sokchea Chantha Guest House, 060801 ស្ទឹងសែន, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ធំ', 'city': 'ស្ទឹងសែន', 'district': 'ដំរីជាន់ខ្លា', 'postalCode': '060801'}","{'lat': 12.70125, 'lng': 104.89195}","[{'lat': 12.70112, 'lng': 104.89199}]",72652,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8477722'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85595660606'}]}],Not Available,Kampong Thom,12.701223,104.89196,8477722,Sokchea Chantha Guest House,"See why so many travelers make Sokchea Chantha Guest House their small hotel of choice when visiting Kampong Thom. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Guest rooms offer a flat screen TV, air conditioning, and a desk, and Sokchea Chantha Guest House makes getting online easy as free wifi is available.
You can also take advantage of some of the amenities offered by the small hotel, including room service, currency exchange, and baggage storage. As an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
Guests of Sokchea Chantha Guest House can find some great restaurants a short walk from the small hotel, including Arunras Hotel (0.7 mi), Love Cafe & Pizza (0.7 mi), and Sambor Village Restaurant and Bar (0.7 mi).
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Sokchea Chantha Guest House as you experience all of the things Kampong Thom has to offer.
