Sokha Palace Siem Reap Hotel,here:pds:place:116w63jr-bf361cc59eeb4391ac32361f3bb4da2c,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Sokha Palace Siem Reap Hotel, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37694, 'lng': 103.87528}","[{'lat': 13.37681, 'lng': 103.87528}]",21493,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]","[{'id': '203-026', 'name': 'Japanese - Sushi', 'primary': True}, {'id': '203-000', 'name': 'Japanese'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13117098'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13569063'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '14182509'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563961999'}, {'value': '+855966161789', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}, {'value': '+855966262096', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.sokhahotels.com.kh/palace-siemreap', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 10:30 - 23:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T103000', 'duration': 'PT12H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.378497,103.87388,13117098,Sokha Palace Siem Reap Hotel,Sokha Palace Siem Reap Hotel is an unrivaled luxurious hotel with the grandeur of an elegant lobby combined with the finest Angkor sculptural carpentry and stone craftsmanship. The setting offers the authenticity of traditional Cambodian design infused with fresh modern features and 4-star facilities creating a unique space in Siem Reap. The location is conveniently close to the famed Temples of Angkor only minutes from the resort’s entrance and 60 minutes away from Siem Reap Angkor International Airport while just 10 minutes outside of Siem Reap city center. The resort’s location provides its distinguished guests the tranquility of a true resort atmosphere while being a neighbor to the Angkor Tourist & Cultural Complex and close to attractions and entertainment areas like Pub Street and the Old Market.,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d13117098-Reviews-Sokha_Palace_Siem_Reap_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Road 60', 'street2': 'Angkor Cultural and Tourism Complex', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Road 60 Angkor Cultural and Tourism Complex, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d13117098-Sokha_Palace_Siem_Reap_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#121 of 763 hotels in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '763', 'ranking': '121'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,137,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '3', '4': '8', '5': '125'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rati