Sokha Siem Reap Resort & Convention Center,here:pds:place:116w63u5-7878c861abb740869bb098c1986712ac,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Sokha Siem Reap Resort & Convention Center, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37694, 'lng': 103.87827}","[{'lat': 13.37681, 'lng': 103.87827}]",21282,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10342572'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563961999'}, {'value': '+855966161789'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://sokhahotels.com/siemreap'}, {'value': 'https://www.sokhahotels.com.kh/siemreap', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.377191,103.878265,10342572,Sokha Siem Reap Resort & Convention Center,"Sokha Siem Reap Resort & Convention Center is the perfect combination of luxury and tranquility set amidst lush tropical gardens. The setting offers the authenticity of traditional Cambodian design infused with fresh modern features and 5-star facilities creating a unique space in Siem Reap. The location convenience with the famed Temples of Angkor is located only minutes from the resort entrance, 60 minutes from Siem Reap Angkor International Airport, and 10 minutes outside of the city center. This central location offers the opportunity for guests to enjoy a secluded and peaceful visit which still offers direct and easy access to the Angkor Tourist & Cultural Complex and city center locations such as Pub Street and Old Market.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d10342572-Reviews-Sokha_Siem_Reap_Resort_Convention_Center-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#Road 60, Angkor Cultural & Tourism Complex Junction', 'street2': 'Phum Trang, Sangkat Slorkram', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalco