Sokhalay Angkor Inn,here:pds:place:116w63u4-57a7bf78f5d5aefddb656c4d9dd88324,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Sokhalay Angkor Inn, 171210 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្រងែ', 'postalCode': '171210'}","{'lat': 13.38196, 'lng': 103.83089}","[{'lat': 13.38208, 'lng': 103.83095}]",86907,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23026008'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27094220'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563968222'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.sokhalayangkor.com/accommodation/sokhalay-angkor-villa-resort'}, {'value': 'https://www.sokhalayangkor.com/properties/sokhalay-angkor-inn'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.378879,103.83176,2255604,Sokhalay Angkor Villa Resort,"Sokhalay Angkor Villa Resort offers an ultimate relaxation and rejuvenation experience. With its key location, guests can conveniently access to the city's must-see destinations. Siem Reap Airport, the Pub Street and the famous UNESCO site Angkor Wat can be reached within short drive. At Sokhalay Angkor Villa Resort, all rooms are beautifully furnished and equipped with standard amenities. Experience the resort's spa and fitness center where guests are able to relax and enjoy the landscape of tropical atmosphere. To ensure that guests are having a pleasant time during the stay, the resort also offers recreational facilities such as swimming pool, library, including day trip. Guests can opt for other leisure activities such as jogging. Offering comfortable stay with top-class facilities, Sokhalay Angkor Villa Resort is a perfect venue to spend the unforgettable stay in Siem Reap.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d2255604-Reviews-Sokhalay_Angkor_Villa_Resort-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road No. 6', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'add