Sokkhak Boutique Resort & Spa,here:pds:place:116aabd1-0949a1305acd00ab81dc06c206d95a4b,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Sokkhak Boutique Resort & Spa, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.37931, 'lng': 103.85667}","[{'lat': 13.37929, 'lng': 103.85681}]",87300,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7060448'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563765660'}, {'value': '+85592765697'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.sokkhak-boutiqueresort.com'}, {'value': 'www.sokkhak-boutiqueresort.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.379322,103.85664,7060448,Sokkhak Boutique Resort & Spa,"Welcome to Sokkhak Boutique Resort & spa! Our elegant and secluded haven is the perfect escape – a tranquil oasis of fragrant tropical blooms and lush greenery laced around 12 spacious, luxurious suites, a sophisticated dining villa and a large saltwater pool. Located on the quiet and peaceful northern edges of Siem Reap town, we are less than a 10-minute drive or tuk-tuk trip from the gates of the Angkor Archaeological Park and the magnificent temple of Angkor Wat – making us the ideal base for you to explore the ancient ruins of the Khmer empire. Inspired by the magnificent Angkorian temples that sit on our doorstep, the design of our property beautifully blends the old with the new. Through our exquisite collection of antiques, we nod to our ancient ancestors of the Khmer Empire, yet through our striking collection of modern paintings and sophisticated architecture, we provide a platform for the country’s exciting, young contemporary artists.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7060448-Reviews-Sokkhak_Boutique_Resort_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Kok Chork Village, Trorpeang Ses Commune, Wat Thmey', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': 'Kok Chork Village, Trorpeang Ses Commune, Wat Thmey, Siem Reap 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d7060448-Sokkhak_Boutique_Resort_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#16 of 763 hotels in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '763', 'ranking': '16'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,1146,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '5', '4': '13', '5': '1128'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",1237,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7060448-m66827-Reviews-Sokkhak_Boutique_Resort_Spa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Re