Sol Chheng Guest House & Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w6kn4-c7c25fb1eecc4f2395b9c424773f0089,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Sol Chheng Guest House & Restaurant, 160904 បានលុង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'រតនគីរី', 'city': 'បានលុង', 'district': 'បឹងកន្សែង', 'postalCode': '160904'}","{'lat': 13.74313, 'lng': 106.98366}","[{'lat': 13.74316, 'lng': 106.98379}]",11967,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7733327'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85575974444'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.solchheng.com'}]}]",Not Available,Ratanakiri,13.743069,106.983444,7733327,Sol Chheng Guest House & Restaurant,"Sol Chheng Guest House & Restaurant is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Banlung, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
As your “home away from home,” the small hotel rooms offer a refrigerator, air conditioning, and a desk, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, room service, and a concierge while staying at Sol Chheng Guest House & Restaurant. In addition, Sol Chheng Guest House & Restaurant offers a hot tub and an on-site restaurant, which will help make your Banlung trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of Banlung's popular pubs such as Balcony Pub and Banlung Kitchen, all a short distance from Sol Chheng Guest House & Restaurant.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out a waterfall, such as Ka Chanh Waterfall.
Enjoy your stay in Banlung!
