Solar Cafe,here:pds:place:116w6686-a49d62b5ecb44f8aaeb0bb96d38d3765,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Solar Cafe, 060802 ស្ទឹងសែន, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ធំ', 'city': 'ស្ទឹងសែន', 'district': 'កំពង់ធំ', 'postalCode': '060802'}","{'lat': 12.71046, 'lng': 104.88873}","[{'lat': 12.71033, 'lng': 104.88873}]",18616,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '800-078', 'name': 'Grill'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5768033'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85560337777'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.khmerhomestaybaray.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kampong Thom,12.71162,104.888695,5768033,Solar Cafe,"The Cafe is located between Phnom Penh and Siem Reap along National Highway 6. It's an idea place to stop for a delicious and hearty meal when travelling between Phnom Penh and Siem Reap.Surrounding the cafe is vast rice fields. This Cafe provides fresh and home style Cambodian cuisine and Cambodian fusion food, drinks (beer, soft drinks and coffee/tea) There is also a Craft shop besides the Cafe selling woodwork, hand made crafts, hand made bags and hand woven scarfs.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g1024989-d5768033-Reviews-Solar_Cafe-Kampong_Thom_Kampong_Thom_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 6 National Road', 'street2': 'Somrong Village Baray Commune, Baray District', 'city': 'Kampong Thom', 'state': 'Kampong Thom Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '06453', 'address_string': 'No. 6 National Road Somrong Village Baray Commune, Baray District, Kampong Thom 06453 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampong Thom', 'location_id': '1024989'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampong Thom Province', 'location_id': '2366663'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,khmervillagehomestay@gmail.com,+855 60 337 777,http://w