Somatepy Boutique Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-03b49aadd6260d328dcf071e829881e0,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Somatepy Boutique Hotel, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.37677, 'lng': 103.84049}","[{'lat': 13.37677, 'lng': 103.84049}]",87510,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26791827'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6876158'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563963856'}, {'value': '+85595258766', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}, {'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.376973,103.84116,26791805,Somatepy Boutique Hotel,"Located in Phumĭ Thnál, 2.7 miles from King's Road Angkor, Somatepy Boutique Hotel provides accommodations with an outdoor swimming pool, free private parking, a garden and a terrace. With a restaurant, the 3-star hotel has air-conditioned rooms with free WiFi, each with a private bathroom. The property has room service, a 24-hour front desk and currency exchange for guests. At the hotel, all rooms come with a desk. Each room comes with a safety deposit box, while selected rooms will provide you with a balcony. At Somatepy Boutique Hotel all rooms have bed linen and towels. The accommodation offers an American or Asian breakfast. The area is popular for cycling, and bike rental and car rental are available at Somatepy Boutique Hotel. Angkor Wat is 3.7 miles from the hotel, while Cambodian Cultural Village is one mile away. The nearest airport is Siem Reap-Angkor International Airport, 35 miles from Somatepy Boutique Hotel.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d26791805-Reviews-Somatepy_Boutique_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Krous Village Road', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Krous Village Road, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d26791805-Somatepy_Boutique_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},0,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d26791805-m66827-Reviews-Somatepy_Boutique_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,[],Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,11,20
