Somerset Norodom Phnom Penh,here:pds:place:116w649e-8646af5434cd4272a7690415b4a82d56,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Somerset Norodom Phnom Penh, ផ្លូវ 41, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 41', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.53584, 'lng': 104.92665}","[{'lat': 11.53593, 'lng': 104.92664}]",21810,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15037896'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523926868'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.discoverasr.com/en/somerset-serviced-residence/cambodia/somerset-norodom-phnom-penh', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.535892,104.92678,15037896,Somerset Norodom Phnom Penh,"Located within a mixed-use development, the serviced residence is a modern building, housing 175 units that come in various sizes. Ranging from cleverly designed studio apartments to truly spacious three-bedroom apartments, it is suitable for both corporate and leisure purposes. Each serviced apartment is fitted with a fully-equipped modern kitchenette, separate sleeping corner or room and an en-suite bathroom. Somerset guests will also gain full access to the residence’s comprehensive facilities such as the on-site gymnasium, swimming pool, residence lounge and a sauna. With its stylish design, modern diverse amenities, central location and exceptional service, Somerset Norodom Phnom Penh is the perfect choice for both business & leisure travellers who seek serviced apartments in Phnom Penh.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d15037896-Reviews-Somerset_Norodom_Phnom_Penh-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '41 No. 2 - 6, Street', 'street2': 'Sangkat Tonle Bassac, Khan Chamkamorn', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12101', 'address_string': '41 No. 2 - 6, Street Sangka