Sompili Dthan,here:pds:place:116w63gg-3adbf79223defb681fbeefac8ab508b3,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Sompili Dthan, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35524, 'lng': 103.88636}","[{'lat': 13.35512, 'lng': 103.88628}]",225317,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26987574'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578515456'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 18:00 - 23:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T180000', 'duration': 'PT05H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.355249,103.88636,26987574,Sompili Dthan,"Sompoli Dthan is the Khmer shadow puppet show, That Call ""LKHO SBEK THOM"" Only Reamke, which is the Khmer version of Ramayana, it is originates from the Indian, is performed in Sbek Thom and “lakhaon Khol”. Sbek Thom are performances could only take place on specific occasions three or four time a year, such as the Khmer new year, the king’s Birthday, the veneration of famous people, abbots and well-known monks, and other villages ceremonies. One more thing that call “Sbek Touch” is type of shadow theater, it also has something the same and differences from Sbek Thom, the difference is that the size is smaller and moveable, but we use to show the same story and it cloud performance in another stories as well. It performs only behind the screen. It can perform all kind of stories and it is a form to very entertaining and funny.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d26987574-Reviews-Sompili_Dthan-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Krovat Krong, National Highway 6', 'street2': 'Krovat Krong, National Highway 6, Krong Siem Reap', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '171201', 'address_string': 'Krovat Krong, National Highway 6 Krova