Sorya Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-8466657d48a40fdb7f22fd1d5a31a7fe,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Sorya Guesthouse, 100603 ក្រចេះ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ក្រចេះ', 'city': 'ក្រចេះ', 'district': 'ក្រចេះ', 'postalCode': '100603'}","{'lat': 12.49249, 'lng': 106.01592}","[{'lat': 12.49251, 'lng': 106.01578}]",113959,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel'}]","[{'id': '800-057', 'name': 'Pizza', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '19857436'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7607036'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510285656'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://petescafekratie.com', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}]}, {'value': 'https://soryaguesthouse.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT14H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kratie,12.492495,106.01584,19857436,Sorya Guesthouse,"Sorya Guesthouse is a thirteen room guesthouse on the Mekong River in Kratie, Cambodia. With a retro/vintage airline theme and Kratie’s best sunset views, Sorya Guesthouse has clean comfortable accommodation to suit all travellers, with First Class (river view balcony, breakfast), Business Class (garden view balcony), Premium Economy and Economy (3-bed dorm) rooms. All rooms have air-con and hot water showers. The guesthouse is part of the Sorya Kayaking Adventures family which has been running kayak trips on the Mekong since 2012 (rated as a top Thing To Do in Kratie), before adding Pete’s Café Restaurant & Bar (aka Sorya Cafe) in late 2015, and Sorya Guesthouse in mid 2019.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g729351-d19857436-Reviews-Sorya_Guesthouse-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'North end of Riverside Road, between Street 1 & 2', 'street2': '(above SunnyMart)', 'city': 'Kratie', 'state': 'Kratie Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'North end of Riverside Road, between Street 1 & 2 (above SunnyMart), Kratie Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kratie', 'location_id': '729351'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kratie Province', 'location_id': '2366668'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g729351-d19857436-Sorya_Guesthouse-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '729351', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 13 Specialty lodging in Kratie', 'geo_location_name': 'Kratie', 'ranking_out_of': '13', 'ranking': '1'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,30,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '0', '4': '2', '5': '27'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",21,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g729351-d19857436-m66827-Reviews-Sorya_Guesthouse-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Restaurant', 'Free Wifi', 'Bath / Shower', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service