Sorya Kayaking Adventures,here:pds:place:116aabd1-6e682b92bc640f75e53afd076a53ae58,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Sorya Kayaking Adventures, 100603 ក្រចេះ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ក្រចេះ', 'city': 'ក្រចេះ', 'district': 'ក្រចេះ', 'postalCode': '100603'}","{'lat': 12.49238, 'lng': 106.0159}","[{'lat': 12.4924, 'lng': 106.01576}]",162045,"[{'id': '550-5510-0379', 'name': 'Outdoor Service', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4036871'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510285656'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.soryakayaking.com'}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '550-5510-0379'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT14H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kratie,12.492372,106.015915,4036871,Sorya Kayaking Adventures,"Sorya Kayaking Adventures provides half day kayaking trips to see the endangered Irrawaddy dolphins in the Mekong River. With a mid-paddle break on a sand island for some snacks and a swim in the river, not to mention the untouched nature and large variety of bird life along the way, these trips let you experience Cambodia in a unique and eco-friendly way.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g729351-d4036871-Reviews-Sorya_Kayaking_Adventures-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Riverside road', 'street2': 'between Street 1 & 2, above SunnyMart', 'city': 'Kratie', 'state': 'Kratie Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '10109', 'address_string': 'Riverside road between Street 1 & 2, above SunnyMart, Kratie 10109 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kratie', 'location_id': '729351'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kratie Province', 'location_id': '2366668'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@soryakayaking.com,+855 10 285 656,http://www.soryak