Soryatra House,here:pds:place:116w63gg-eb6a63598c454dfcb84ee535ca789e9b,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Soryatra House, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35944, 'lng': 103.85263}","[{'lat': 13.35938, 'lng': 103.85275}]",24577,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '14886205'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85587771388'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/soryatrahouse'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.359408,103.852684,14886205,Soryatra House,"A two story loft in the ideal location of central town. Walking distance to Pub Street, the Night Market and Old town but in a secluded, quiet cul de sac. The living room area has a double height ceiling and the bedroom is spacious and quiet with your own PRIVATE BATHROOM. Free airport pick up and any of your tour or 'get around' information provided.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d14886205-Reviews-Soryatra_House-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Angkor Night Market', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '1710', 'address_string': 'Angkor Night Market, Siem Reap 1710 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d14886205-Soryatra_House-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#312 of 449 Specialty lodging in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '449', 'ranking': '312'}",0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},1,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d14886205-m66827-Reviews-Soryatra_House-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Shuttle Bus Service', 'Free Internet', 'Kitchenette', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Business center', 'Free parking', 'Pets Allowed', 'Parking', 'Electric vehicle charging station', 'Express Check-in / Check-out', 'English', 'Free Private Parking Nearby', 'Free Public Parking Nearby', 'Private Check-in / Check-out']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'other', 'localized_name': 'Specialty Lodging'}]",Not available,['Quaint'],[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,16,20
Sosoro Museum,here:pds:place:116w649g-e358a2885303caa1549540f37864da49,en,museum,"{'label': 'Sosoro Museum, ផ្លូវ 106, 120211 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'វត្តភ្នំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 106', 'postalCode': '120211'}","{'lat': 11.57425, 'lng': 104.92545}","[{'lat': 11.57412, 'lng': 104.92547}]",6724,"[{'id': '300-3100-0028', 'name': 'History Museum', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3100-0000', 'name': 'Museum'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17622404'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512901542'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://sosoro.nbc.gov.kh'}]}]","[{'text': ['Tue-Sun: 09:00 - 18:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT09H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.574368,104.92544,17622404,Sosoro Museum,"The Preah Srey Içanavarman Museum of Economy and Money (SOSORO), located in the heart of the old colonial district of Phnom Penh, recounts nearly 2,000 years of Cambodia's history, from the Funan era to the present day, through the Angkorian Empire and the Cold War, demonstrating the very close interconnection that exists between political changes, social changes, geopolitics, and economic and monetary developments. Established and fully financed by the National Bank of Cambodia, the SOSORO Museum relies on a modern scenography combining ancient artifacts and interactive technologies, such as touch screens and educational games. Open to the public since 2019, its permanent exhibition is suitable for all ages.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d17622404-Reviews-Sosoro_Museum-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#16 106 Preah Moha Ksatreiyani Kossamak Avenue', 'street2': 'Sangkat Wat Phnom, Khan Daun Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12202', 'address_string': '#16 106 Preah Moha Ksatreiyani Kossamak Avenue Sangkat 