Sovann Kep View Resort,here:pds:place:116w3f5v-f9a704955f5046b6add5f20d3d3b700c,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Sovann Kep View Resort, ផ្លូវ 33 អេ, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 33 អេ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.50636, 'lng': 104.28963}","[{'lat': 10.50631, 'lng': 104.28976}]",6594,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13978098'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26640060'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855717171671'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/sovannkepviewresort/?refsrc=https%3A%2F%2Fm.facebook.com%2F548090702791984%2F&paipv=0&eav=AfaGYFhh9ceS_JF3tOULHL4agBSW5n6DqTELQlIjODB-ZqKfN6l4vjYJ43K0ZfXjcrk&_rdr', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.50644,104.2894,26640060,Sovann Kep View Resort,"Located in Kep, 16 miles from Kampot Pagoda, Sovann Kep View Resort has accommodations with a garden, free private parking, a terrace and a restaurant. With a bar, the 3-star hotel has air-conditioned rooms with free WiFi, each with a private bathroom. The property provides room service, a 24-hour front desk and currency exchange for guests. All rooms come with a fridge, minibar, an electric tea pot, a shower, free toiletries and a desk. The rooms feature a closet. The hotel has a playground. You can play pool at Sovann Kep View Resort, and bike rental and car rental are available. Kep Jetty is 4.2 miles from the accommodation, while Wat Samathi Pagoda is 6.2 miles from the property. The nearest airport is Sihanouk International, 65 miles from Sovann Kep View Resort, and the property offers a paid airport shuttle service.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d26640060-Reviews-Sovann_Kep_View_Resort-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 33A', 'street2': 'Thmey Village, Prey Thom District', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '22101', 'address_string': 'Street 33A Thmey Village, Prey Thom District, Kep 22101 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d26640060-Sovann_Kep_View_Resort-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},6,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d26640060-m66827-Reviews-Sovann_Kep_View_Resort-Kep_Kep_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,[],Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,11,8
Sovann Phum Hotel,here:pds:place:116w64mt-c81cbd94815242e689d8cd24537dee12,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Sovann Phum Hotel, 040802 កំពង់ឆ្នាំង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ឆ្នាំង', 'city': 'កំពង់ឆ្នាំង', 'district': 'កំពង់ឆ្នាំង', 'postalCode': '040802'}","{'lat': 12.24806, 'lng': 104.67062}","[{'lat': 12.24795, 'lng': 104.67069}]",67603,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1897390'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85526989333'}]}],Not Available,Kampong Chhnang,12.248414,104.670395,1897390,Sovann Phum Hotel,"Looking for a place to stay in Kampong Chhnang? Then look no further than Sovann Phum Hotel, a budget friendly small hotel that brings the best of Kampong Chhnang to your doorstep.
As your “home away from home,” the small hotel rooms offer air conditioning, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, room service, and a concierge while staying at Sovann Phum Hotel. In addition, Sovann Phum Hotel offers an on-site restaurant, which will help make your Kampong Chhnang trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
For those interested in checking out Ondong Rossey (2.4 mi) while visiting Kampong Chhnang, Sovann Phum Hotel is a short distance away.
If you’re looking for something to do, Cambodia’s Kampong Chhnang floating village (0.0 mi) is a nice way to spend some time, and it is within walking distance of Sovann Phum Hotel.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Sovann Phum Hotel as you experience everything Kampong Chhnang has to offer.
