Guest rooms offer a refrigerator, a seating area, and a desk, and Sovannphoum Guesthouse makes getting online easy as free wifi is available.
In addition, guests can enjoy an on-site restaurant during their visit. As an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
If you are looking for some good spots to eat nearby, you may want to check out Sophary Restaurant (0.0 mi) or Aquapool'Co (0.0 mi), all of which are within walking distance of Sovannphoum Guesthouse.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Sovannphoum Guesthouse as you experience everything Sihanoukville has to offer.
