Sre Thmey Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649g-bfb5055df68c40b69a3e6e6e5a129d40,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Sre Thmey Hotel, ផ្លូវ ទន្លេសាប, 121001 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ជ្រោយចង្វារ', 'subdistrict': 'ជ្រោយចង្វារ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ទន្លេសាប', 'postalCode': '121001'}","{'lat': 11.58767, 'lng': 104.92826}","[{'lat': 11.58782, 'lng': 104.92862}]",71558,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2529795'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511733388'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.587775,104.92906,2529795,Sre Thmey Hotel,"See why so many travelers make Sre Thmey Hotel their hotel of choice when visiting Phnom Penh. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a budget friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Phnom Penh, Sre Thmey Hotel is located a short distance from Wat Ounalom (1.3 mi) and Champey Academy of Arts (1.6 mi).
Guest rooms offer air conditioning and a minibar, and Sre Thmey Hotel makes getting online easy as free wifi is available.
You can also take advantage of some of the amenities offered by the hotel, including room service.
While in Phnom Penh, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Sre Thmey Hotel, including Bopha Phnom Penh - Titanic Restaurant (0.9 mi), Chinese House (0.7 mi), and Oskar Bistro (1.0 mi).
If you are interested in exploring Phnom Penh, check out a castle, such as Royal Palace.
At Sre Thmey Hotel, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Phnom Penh.
