Srey Lin Frog Shop,here:pds:place:116w64mt-23959c30622b4ea4afc5a67255aa87b0,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Srey Lin Frog Shop, 040802 កំពង់ឆ្នាំង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ឆ្នាំង', 'city': 'កំពង់ឆ្នាំង', 'district': 'កំពង់ឆ្នាំង', 'postalCode': '040802'}","{'lat': 12.24836, 'lng': 104.67303}","[{'lat': 12.24849, 'lng': 104.67303}]",67353,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855967070657'}]}],Not Available,Kampong Chhnang,13.376142,103.8334,1127698,Lin Ratanak Angkor Hotel,"Lin Ratanak Angkor Hotel Situated along the enhancing National Road 06 and the closest to local market(Samaki Market), Lin Ratanak Angkor Hotel offers an ideal urban getaway in the heritage land of ancient city. Choose a relaxing home-from-home at Lin Ratanak Angkor Hotel just 15 minutes' drive from Siem Reap International Airport and we provide the free transfer to town 5 minutes' drive to Pub Street and old market area. This affordable Four Star Rating Hotel features 100 room accommodations with complimentary WiFi connection throughout the hotel, ambient dining options, elegant swimming and leisure facilities that satisfy the needs of both business and leisure travelers. The Lin Ratanak Angkor Hotel adds the most preferred services including baby siting, concierge service, on-call medical treatment, and the traditional show set by the pool pavilion that inspire your accommodation an ease. From the minute you step inside the bright, welcoming lobby of Lin Ratanak Angkor Hotel, you will feel at home and experience with the service and hospitality of Cambodians.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1127698-Reviews-Lin_Ratanak_Angkor_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '06 National Road', 'street2': 'Phum Banteay Chas Khum Slorkram', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'add