Star Hotel BTB,here:pds:place:116w636s-1d4979c81f9b4c4e8e97988e46019763,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Star Hotel BTB, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10575, 'lng': 103.19699}","[{'lat': 13.10571, 'lng': 103.19682}]",12731,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,[],[{'phone': [{'value': '+85553953522'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.105653,103.19707,1022812,Star Hotel,"See why so many travelers make Star Hotel their hotel of choice when visiting Battambang. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a family-friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as air conditioning, a refrigerator, and a desk, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the hotel.
Star Hotel features a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and baggage storage, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts a lounge. If you are driving to Star Hotel, parking is available.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (0.4 mi) and Prasat Sneung (1.1 mi), guests of Star Hotel can easily experience some of Battambang's most well known attractions.
While visiting Battambang, you may want to try some crab at one of the nearby restaurants, such as Jaan Bai Restaurant or White Rose.
If you are interested in exploring Battambang, check out a history museum, such as Mrs. Bun Roeung's Ancient House.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at Star Hotel as you experience all of the things Battambang has to offer.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d1022812-Reviews-Star_Hotel-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'St. Lark A, Group.12, Preakmohatep', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '021410', 'address_string': 'St. Lark A, Group.12, Preakmohatep, Battambang 021410 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d1022812-Star_Hotel-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#9 of 43 hotels in Battambang', 'geo_location_name': 'Battambang', 'ranking_out_of': '43', 'ranking': '9'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,236,"{'1': '6', '2': '15', '3': '42', '4': '117', '5': '56'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}}",64,https://www