Star Villa Guest House,here:pds:place:116w636s-1d74b20806464d3db66dfc3875fd2b76,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Star Villa Guest House, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09638, 'lng': 103.2022}","[{'lat': 13.09639, 'lng': 103.20206}]",12612,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3319994'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6440551'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512434422'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.096022,103.20234,3319994,Star Villa Guest House,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Battambang, Star Villa Guest House is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its proximity to great restaurants and attractions, Star Villa Guest House makes it easy to enjoy the best of Battambang.
Star Villa Guest House offers guests an array of room amenities including air conditioning, a refrigerator, and a desk, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available.
The guest house offers a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and baggage storage, to make your visit even more pleasant. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Battambang, Star Villa Guest House is located a short distance from White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (0.4 mi) and Prasat Sneung (0.4 mi).
While in Battambang, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Star Villa Guest House, including Jaan Bai Restaurant (0.4 mi), Smokin' Pot (0.3 mi), and Nary Kitchen (0.6 mi).
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular art galleries such as HUMAN Gallery - Joseba Etxebarria Photography, ROMCHEIK 5 Art Space, and La Fabrik.
Star Villa Guest House is sure to make your visit to Battambang one worth remembering.
