Free wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at Star Wood Inn offer air conditioning, a desk, and a fireplace.
During your stay, take advantage of some of the amenities offered, including a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and room service. Guests of Star Wood Inn are also welcome to enjoy an on-site restaurant. For travelers arriving by car, free parking is available.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Phnom Penh, Star Wood Inn is located a short distance from Wat Langka (0.5 mi) and Bassac Lane (0.9 mi).
If you like Mediterranean restaurants, Star Wood Inn is conveniently located near Casablanca restaurant, Terrazza, and Il Forno.
Best of all, Star Wood Inn makes it easy to experience many great Phnom Penh attractions like Central Market, Silver Pagoda, and Royal Railway Station (Phnom Penh), which are some popular architectural buildings.
Enjoy your stay in Phnom Penh!
