Stay Inn Hostel,here:pds:place:116w649e-8cd9d55442be46f1bd819b60f469bc18,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Stay Inn Hostel, ផ្លូវ 368 17c, 120104 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 368', 'postalCode': '120104', 'houseNumber': '17c'}","{'lat': 11.54745, 'lng': 104.92043}","[{'lat': 11.54732, 'lng': 104.92044}]",6547,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '19858040'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855969560201'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://stay-inn.today'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.547339,104.91843,19858040,Stay Inn Hostel,"The new hostel in the heart of the city will surprise you with its cleanliness and hospitality. Located in a traditional Khmer house, the hostel can offer you 3 dormitory rooms and one separate double room. The staff of the hostel speaks English and Russian. On the ground floor there is a bar where you can have a famous local beer in the evening or enjoy breakfast in the morning.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d19858040-Reviews-Stay_Inn_Hostel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '17C, Street 368, Sangkat Boeung Keng Kang III, Khan Chamkar Morn', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12304', 'address_string': '17C, Street 368, Sangkat Boeung Keng Kang III, Khan Chamkar Morn, Phnom Penh 12304 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d19858040-Stay_Inn_Hostel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#72 of 351 Specialty lodging in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '351', 'ranking': '72'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,4,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '0', '5': '3'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss2.0.svg', 'value': '2.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss2.0.svg', 'value': '2.0'}}",47,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d19858040-m66827-Reviews-Stay_Inn_Hostel-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Breakfast included']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'other', 'localized_name': 'Specialty Lodging'}]",Not available,"['Quaint', 'Budget']",[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '1'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '2'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,29,14
Stay Sweet,here:pds:place:116w6499-d24ef9583054843dabf89fb350c8e6cf,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Stay Sweet, ផ្លូវ 19, 120909 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ពោធិ៍សែនជ័យ', 'subdistrict': 'ចោមចៅ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 19', 'postalCode': '120909'}","{'lat': 11.52401, 'lng': 104.85345}","[{'lat': 11.524, 'lng': 104.85324}]",5013,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26430831'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512292221'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/p/STAY-CAF%C3%89-100075952611836/?paipv=0&eav=AfalsU6uhyqIbg-561IEscqK57zUfCG6AEkV3TDBxtRJ-_TCA6BRkh7mWsLwmyWUXOc&_rdr'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.523927,104.85322,26430831,Stay Sweet,"Hello my name is Panha (pronounce like panya) and I wish to give you a warm welcome to my 3 bed homestay property is called STAY SWEET. It is my vision to give each guest a very comfortable welcome to the local khmer experience. I hope to welcome to you so that you enjoy your stay here in Cambodia. I operate a neighbourhood coffee shop with local Cambodian food on the ground floor with cosy sofas and local art and a small natural front garden space with natural light to relax in. The property is in a quiet neighborhood just 3.1 miles from Killing Fields of Choeung Ek. (10min tuktuk). We have fast WiFi so you may work here also with homemade organic coffee or fresh smoothie. We try to be eco friendly. We do not use plastic container, we use rice, taro straw, ceramic cups. You can refill water here for free with your own bottle even if you are not customer. Each bedroom has a private bathroom and shower, air conditioning, a flat-screen TV and a fridge. The daily breakfast offers American, Asian or vegetarian options. A terrace can be found at the family stay, along with a shared lounge. Tuol Sleng (S21) Genocide Museum is 4.4 miles away, while Vattanac Capital is 5.2 miles from the property. Phnom Penh International airport is, 5 miles from the accommodation and only if you need, I am happy to pick you up from the airport and back for a lower fee than local taxi services. Welcome to Cambodia!! Look forward to having you stay here. Arkoun (Or kun) - thank you and kind regards, Panha",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d26430831-Reviews-Stay_Sweet-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'St 3A, Concrete Road', 'street2': '#3', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': 'St 3A, Concrete Road #3, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d26430831-Stay_Sweet-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#124 of 412 B&Bs / Inns in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '412', 'ranking': '124'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,1,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '1'}",{},0,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d26430831-m66827-Reviews-Stay_Sweet-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,[],Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'bb', 'localized_name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,['Quaint'],[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '1'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,16,14
Stay in Kampot,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-b9d886c398c74859b65bcff8fd8a03d5,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Stay in Kampot, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.60792, 'lng': 104.17541}","[{'lat': 10.60793, 'lng': 104.17542}]",26334,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12233861'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855972030289'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.60792,104.17541,12233861,Stay in Kampot,"A quirky town house home offering bed & breakfast, close to Kampot's Old French Bridge. Guest rooms are all individually decorated, have western style bathrooms and large comfortable beds and guests can enjoy the breezy rooftop terrace, with river and mountain views. The hosts are a friendly British couple who hope to offer you a relaxed & comfortable stay.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d12233861-Reviews-Stay_in_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '24 Dragon Street', 'street2': 'near the Old Bridge', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '13205', 'address_string': '24 Dragon Street near the Old Bridge, Kampot 13205 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d12233861-Stay_in_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#21 of 148 B&Bs / Inns in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '148', 'ranking': '21'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler