Steng Toch Homestay & Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w63vm-1bf22319f63a31672fae1152505725f7,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Steng Toch Homestay & Restaurant, 170901 បន្ទាយស្រី, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'បន្ទាយស្រី', 'district': 'ខ្នារសណ្ដាយ', 'postalCode': '170901'}","{'lat': 13.59889, 'lng': 103.94653}","[{'lat': 13.59902, 'lng': 103.94649}]",10662,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '205-000', 'name': 'Thai'}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '21088971'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855962992222'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.stengtoch.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 10:00 - 20:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T100000', 'duration': 'PT10H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.598979,103.9465,21088971,Steng Toch Homestay & Restaurant,"Steng Toch in Khmer language means “Small River”. It is located in front of Beong Chhuk (Lotus Lake) in Bonteay Srei district, Siem Reap province. Surrounded by nature, it is a fantastic place to have city escape and attach yourself to the sense of nature with good food, nice coffee, attractive cultural site, and comfortable beds. We have varieties of facilities such as standard room, camping, restaurant, bar, floating hut and other attractions around our place. If you are looking for a refreshing place to visit in Siem Reap, this is for you.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d21088971-Reviews-Steng_Toch_Homestay_Restaurant-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Beong Chhuk, Banteay Srei', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Beong Chhuk, Banteay Srei, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Provi