Street Three Eatery Kratie,here:pds:place:116w65rh-3b1c76fa22a57aee15839c5b6b1133ab,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Street Three Eatery Kratie, 100603 ក្រចេះ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ក្រចេះ', 'city': 'ក្រចេះ', 'district': 'ក្រចេះ', 'postalCode': '100603'}","{'lat': 12.49061, 'lng': 106.01617}","[{'lat': 12.49074, 'lng': 106.01615}]",114052,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '150-000', 'name': 'Australian'}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '24876077'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85581271503'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://web.facebook.com/streetthreekratie'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sat: 08:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT13H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}]}]",Kratie,12.490596,106.01617,24876077,Street Three Eatery Kratie,"OPEN AUGUST 2022 Welcome to Street Three Restaurant & Bar Kratie. We're a local fusion restaurant located on Street 3, a block from the beautiful Mekong River. We serve a range of Khmer food, fusion food & western dishes. Our menu has been carefully created as a collaboration of community understanding, our team and a mission to showcase this incredible little pocket of Cambodia. To maintain a wholesome and nourishing experience, we pride ourselves in maintaining a house made and locally sourced menu. We've minimised imported products and turned to our local surrounds to bring street three to Kratie. We do not use any MSG throughout our menu We look forward to welcoming you",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g729351-d24876077-Reviews-Street_Three_Eatery_Kratie-Kratie_Kratie_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Rue N.03', 'city': 'Kratie', 'state': '