Studio's Mymusic,here:pds:place:116w62vw-bea49a0a2c2c40548cb7281df0cc3e27,en,gallery,"{'label': ""Studio's Mymusic, 010903 ប៉ោយប៉ែត, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បន្ទាយមានជ័យ', 'city': 'ប៉ោយប៉ែត', 'district': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '010903'}","{'lat': 13.6453, 'lng': 102.57301}","[{'lat': 13.64537, 'lng': 102.57289}]",155495,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,Not Available,Not Available,Banteay Meanchey,13.35703,103.85594,17796053,Open Studio Cambodia,"Open Studio Cambodia is an artist collective based in Siem Reap comprised of seven contemporary Cambodian artists and its founder, paper cutaway artist, Lauren Iida (Seattle, USA). Open Studio Cambodia provides mentorship, marketing, art supplies, and domestic and international exhibition opportunities to its members and collaborates with a network of artists and arts organizations to promote the rising contemporary art scene in Cambodia as a whole. We also offer events, contemporary art tours, and art-making workshops at our Siem Reap, Cambodia studio and around the country. Our physical location is temporarily closed due to the pandemic. Please visit our EXHIBITIONS page to see our work or shop online. Free domestic shipping and affordable international shipping available.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d17796053-Reviews-Open_Studio_Cambodia-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '655 Central Market St.', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': '655 Central Market St., Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,openstudiocambodia@gmail.com,+855 99 482 638,http://www.openstudiocambo