Stung Sangka Hotel,here:pds:place:116w636k-ef82379cced5415f9118f407a3501b61,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Stung Sangka Hotel, ផ្លូវជាតិ 5, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 5', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.10648, 'lng': 103.19918}","[{'lat': 13.10635, 'lng': 103.19915}]",12970,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1401805'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85553953495'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.stungsangkehotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.106885,103.19925,1401805,Stung Sangka Hotel,"See why so many travelers make Stung Sangka Hotel their hotel of choice when visiting Battambang. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Close to some of Battambang's most popular landmarks, such as White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (0.4 mi) and Battambang Crocodile Farm (1.0 mi), Stung Sangka Hotel is a great destination for tourists.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as air conditioning, a refrigerator, and a minibar, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the hotel.
Stung Sangka Hotel features room service, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts a pool and free breakfast. If you are driving to Stung Sangka Hotel, free parking is available.
Travelers looking to enjoy some bibimbap  can head to Cafe Eden. Otherwise, you may want to check out an Asian restaurant such as Jaan Bai Restaurant, Smokin' Pot, or Nary Kitchen.
Battambang is also home to Ta Dumbong Statue, a popular  that is not too far from Stung Sangka Hotel.
At Stung Sangka Hotel, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Battambang.
