Sugarshack Battambang,here:pds:place:116w636m-c11f72864d3241aa9f0a3d8813f7038b,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Sugarshack Battambang, 020801 សង្កែ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'សង្កែ', 'district': 'អន្លង់វិល', 'postalCode': '020801'}","{'lat': 13.08103, 'lng': 103.23201}","[{'lat': 13.08107, 'lng': 103.23188}]",96509,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+855976299724'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.069043,103.21731,2073065,Bamboo Train,"Welcome to Bamboo train (Ou Dambong Village)!

Bamboo train mean norry or nori ( French word for lorry) is an improvised rail vehicle from Cambodia. Lonely Planet describes it as “Cambodia’s bamboo train”. Originally conceived as a logistical fix during the United Nations Transitional Authority of Cambodia period, the original “bamboo train” was a lorry system that operated on Cambodia’s rarely used northern rail line.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d2073065-Reviews-Bamboo_Train-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Battambang Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,http://battambangtourtravelblog.wordpress.com/bamboo-train/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d2073065-Bamboo_Train-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#4 of 23 Transportation in Battambang', 'geo_location_name': 'Battambang', 'ranking_out_of': '23', 'ranking': '4'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,2866,"{'1': '134', '2': '161', '3': '411', '4': '965', '5': '1195'}",Not available,1507,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d2073065-m66827-Reviews-Bamboo_Train-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'transportation', 'localized_name': 'Transportation'}, {'name': 'attractions', 'localized_name': 'Attractions'}]","[{'name': 'Transportation', 'localized_name': 'Transportation', 'categories': [{'name': 'Railways', 'localized_name': 'Railways'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'valu