Summer Bay Beach Club & Cabins,here:pds:place:116w3csj-c70dcc0a65a471c100e2e7a7179efd0b,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Summer Bay Beach Club & Cabins, 180108 ព្រៃនប់, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រៃនប់', 'district': 'រាម', 'postalCode': '180108'}","{'lat': 10.5526, 'lng': 103.60349}","[{'lat': 10.55269, 'lng': 103.60359}]",49406,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26865903'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85586999182'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://bayoflights-entertainment.com'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.551786,103.6027,26865903,"Summer Bay Beach Club & Cabins, Sihanoukville","Your Ultimate Beach Escape Anchored within the Bay of Lights mega development just 20 minutes from Sihanoukville, the Ream city resort offers direct access to a private beach, an all-day beach club, and a wide range of accommodation and leisure options to suit travelers and guests. Choose from cozy beachfront or garden view cabins, each providing a unique and comfortable Sihanoukville experience. Whether seeking a romantic weekend getaway or fun family retreat, Summer Bay Beach Club & Cabins is your perfect beach retreat in Southern Cambodia. Immerse yourself with breathtaking sea views, the stunning Koh Rong Islands, or bask in the serenity of our pristine beach and gardens. Let the rhythm of the waves soothe your soul as you soak up the sun and create memories that will last a lifetime. Discover a serene coastal retreat where the hassle of travel melts away, and unmatched relaxation awaits.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g3183832-d26865903-Reviews-Summer_Bay_Beach_Club_Cabins_Sihanoukville-Ream_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Chhne Ream Blvd', 'city': 'Ream', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '180108', 'address_string': 'Chhne Ream Blvd, Ream 180108 Cambodia'}","[{'level':