Sun Bear Bungalow,here:pds:place:116d408k-5ec8292e38bd069cec094fcdcea848de,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Sun Bear Bungalow, 090701 ខេមរភូមិន្ទ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កោះកុង', 'city': 'ខេមរភូមិន្ទ', 'district': 'ស្មាច់មានជ័យ', 'postalCode': '090701'}","{'lat': 11.6175, 'lng': 102.981}","[{'lat': 11.6174, 'lng': 102.98111}]",158405,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516638001'}]}],Not Available,Koh Kong,11.631638,102.98733,1420375,Oasis Bungalow Resort,"See why so many travelers make Oasis Bungalow Resort their small hotel of choice when visiting Koh Kong. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a family-friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Rooms at Oasis Bungalow Resort provide air conditioning, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
In addition, Oasis Bungalow Resort offers a pool and an on-site restaurant, which will help make your Koh Kong trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
While you’re here, be sure to check out Whisper Bar, one of the Indian restaurants that can be found in Koh Kong, which is a short distance from Oasis Bungalow Hotel.
If you are interested in exploring Koh Kong, check out a waterfall, such as Tatai Waterfall.
At Oasis Bungalow Resort, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Koh Kong.
