Sun Sengky Guest House,here:pds:place:116httek-e40926dc42fa0dd13e59365e25906947,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Sun Sengky Guest House, ផ្លូវជាតិ 63, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 63', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35516, 'lng': 103.85385}","[{'lat': 13.35518, 'lng': 103.85371}]",88653,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '613058'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512630943', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}, {'value': '+85563964034'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.35517,103.85378,613058,Sun Sengky Guest House,"If you’re looking for a guest house in Siem Reap, look no further than Sun Sengky Guest House.
Close to some of Siem Reap's most popular landmarks, such as Wat Preah Prom Rath (0.3 mi) and The Happy Ranch Horse Farm (0.9 mi), Sun Sengky Guest House is a great destination for tourists.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer a refrigerator and a desk, and you can stay connected during your stay as Sun Sengky Guest House offers guests free wifi.
The guest house features a 24 hour front desk, baggage storage, and currency exchange. For guests with a vehicle, parking is available.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of Siem Reap's popular dumplings  restaurants such as Marum, Khmer Kitchen Restaurant, and Spoons, all a short distance from Sun Sengky Guest House.
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular art galleries such as Angkor Artwork E&T Stocker, Theam's House, and Jayav Art.
The staff at Sun Sengky Guest House looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
