Sun Sothy Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w63gf-e03d2ba4e3f44a50abfd80d36a916ede,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Sun Sothy Guesthouse, ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.34147, 'lng': 103.8235}","[{'lat': 13.3416, 'lng': 103.82351}]",85035,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2622970'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85517799943', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}, {'value': '+855636903974'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.341371,103.823494,2622970,Sun Sothy Guesthouse,"We are a small and friendly family run guesthouse located 3 kilometers from the center of Siem Reap. Experience the village life of Kontrohk community and enjoy the relaxation after a busy day full of exciting unforgettable impressions in and around Siem Reap. Let us be your home away from home! Comfortable rooms with all necessary facilities like minibar, cable tv, fan, free wireless lan, private bathroom and your own seating accommodation with view to the garden are awaiting you. Enjoy the refreshing swimming pool, a good breakfast, have a seat in our pavilion or just go for a walk and experience the friendliness of people in this village. Our own restaurant is offering Khmer Food as well as western dishes. And if you like to try some local specialties: Just ask us!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d2622970-Reviews-Sun_Sothy_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Kontrohk community', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '767946', 'address_string': 'Kontrohk community, Siem Reap 767946 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'le