Sun and Moon Urban Hot,here:pds:place:11664263-c3391b7b124e2f41952fb5c75d4a2f35,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Sun and Moon Urban Hot, ផ្លូវ 122 68, 120401 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ទួលគោក', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារដេប៉ូទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 122', 'postalCode': '120401', 'houseNumber': '68'}","{'lat': 11.56805, 'lng': 104.9043}","[{'lat': 11.56819, 'lng': 104.90428}]",4383,"[{'id': '550-5510-0206', 'name': 'Recreation Center', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523961888'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.570472,104.92722,8649383,"SUN & MOON, Urban Hotel","SUN & MOON, Urban Hotel is a modern, affordable design hotel located in the vibrant heart of Phnom Penh, Cambodia. Walking distance from the city's landmarks and tourist attractions, the hotel is located in a emblematic old quarter of Cambodia's capital, a few hundred meters from the busy and eclectic riverside. SUN & MOON, Urban Hotel recognizes the need for a shift in the approach to Cambodian Hospitality and aims to create a ""product"" responding to the ""needs & wants"" of increasingly demanding customers, through creating environments and services guided by modern and international standards. SUN & MOON, Urban Hotel provides affordable modern lifestyle hotel, designed with functionality and comfort to support a frenetic lifestyle of modern citizens and travellers. SUN & MOON, Urban Hotel offers high-quality facilities accompanied by exemplary personal service. Different from competition through ""all in one"" solution, where offers several amenities to its costumers such as: gym, spa, steam, sauna and Jacuzzi, swimming pool, roof top bar, meeting room and parking.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d8649383-Reviews-SUN_MOON_Urban_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '1 #68, Corner of Street 136 And 15, Phsar Kandal', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12204', 'address_string': '1 #68, Corner of Street 136 And 15, Phsar Kandal, Phnom Penh 12204 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d8649383-SUN_MOON_Urban_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#30 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '30'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,1091,"{'1': '19', '2': '21', '3': '56', '4': '258', '5': '738'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",1210,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d8649383-m66827-Reviews-SUN_MOON_Urban_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Suites', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Wheelchair access', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Spa', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Dry Clean