Sunny Guest House,here:pds:place:116811f2-2dc5e4e7a367320adcd55ba9bf7848aa,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Sunny Guest House, ផ្លូវ 351 353, 121202 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ច្បារអំពៅ', 'subdistrict': 'ច្បារអំពៅទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 351', 'postalCode': '121202', 'houseNumber': '353'}","{'lat': 11.53703, 'lng': 104.94157}","[{'lat': 11.53708, 'lng': 104.9417}]",20911,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1235084'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512842036'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.53022,104.92301,10783975,139 Guest House,"See why so many travelers make 139 Guest House their guest house of choice when visiting Phnom Penh. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a family-friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
While staying at 139 Guest House, visitors can check out Central Market (1.3 mi) and Wat Langka (1.3 mi), some of Phnom Penh's top attractions.
139 Guest House offers guests an array of room amenities including a flat screen TV, a desk, and an additional bathroom, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available.
The guest house offers a 24 hour front desk, 24 hour check-in, and room service, to make your visit even more pleasant. The property also features a sauna and an on-site restaurant. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of Phnom Penh's popular dim sum restaurants such as La Coupole, Sam Doo, and Yi Sang Restaurant Sothearos, all a short distance from 139 Guest House.
Should time allow, Supreme Court is a popular government building that is relatively easy to get to.
At 139 Guest House, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Phnom Penh.
