Sunset Lounge,here:pds:place:116aabd1-e45322eca65f073879e7eafda568f744,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Sunset Lounge, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.58669, 'lng': 103.54196}","[{'lat': 10.5866, 'lng': 103.54186}]",50413,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5961484'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855977340486'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.sunsetlounge-guesthouse.com'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.58671,103.54198,5961484,Sunset Lounge,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Sihanoukville, SunsetLounge Guesthouse is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its romantic environment and proximity to great restaurants, SunsetLounge Guesthouse makes it easy to enjoy the best of Sihanoukville.
Rooms at SunsetLounge Guesthouse offer air conditioning and a refrigerator providing exceptional comfort and convenience, and guests can go online with free wifi.
An on-site restaurant will also help to make your stay even more special. If you are driving to SunsetLounge Guesthouse, free parking is available.
CJ Outlet and Jewelry Center (2.6 mi), located nearby, makes SunsetLounge Guesthouse a great place to stay for those interested in visiting this popular Sihanoukville landmark.
Travelers looking to enjoy some tempura can head to Nyam or Tamu. Otherwise, you may want to check out a barbeque restaurant such as Happy Pop Pizza, Ali Baba, or Sunshine Cafe.
SunsetLounge Guesthouse is sure to make your visit to Sihanoukville one worth remembering.
