Sunset Spot & Picnic Tours,here:pds:place:116httek-b8c14db152980789d1867be26deaf4d7,en,park_recreation_area,"{'label': 'Sunset Spot & Picnic Tours, ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267, 170612 ពួក, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'ពួក', 'district': 'សំរោងយា', 'street': 'ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267', 'postalCode': '170612'}","{'lat': 13.40857, 'lng': 103.73311}","[{'lat': 13.40859, 'lng': 103.73325}]",238676,"[{'id': '550-5510-0202', 'name': 'Park-Recreation Area', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512221672'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.sunset-picnic.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.424683,103.78474,2252245,West Baray,"A giant reservoir constructed during the Khmer Empire, measuring 8km long by 2.1km wide (or almost 2,300 Wembley Stadium football pitches). Its purpose at the time it was constructed is still not clear, and the original hypothesis, that it was used for irrigation, no longer holds much water. In the centre, is an island with the West Mebon temple. A great spot for walks, or a short boat ride out to the island. You can also hire hammocks for about a dollar, and picnic on the freshly prepared food sold from about a dozen stalls.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d2252245-Reviews-West_Baray-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d2252245-West_Baray-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#78 of 200 things to do in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '200', 'ranking': '78'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,92,"{'1': '1', '2': '5', '3': '19', '4': '40', '5': '27'}",Not available,104,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d2252245-m66827-Reviews-West_Baray-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'nature_parks', 'localized_name': 'Nature & Parks'}, {'name': 'attractions', 'localized_name': 'Attractions'}]","[{'name': 'Nature & Parks', 'localized_name': 'Nature & Parks', 'categories': [{'name': 'Bodies of Water', 'localized_name': 'Bodies of Water'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '1'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '16'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '13'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '16'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '25'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,36,20
Sunset View Guest House,here:pds:place:116w63gg-d2204eaa244f5cd8bdeb790065b163a0,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Sunset View Guest House, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34671, 'lng': 103.85237}","[{'lat': 13.34684, 'lng': 103.85237}]",88137,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25558134'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511400683'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://sunsetviewguesthouse.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.346484,103.8524,25558134,Sunset View Guest House,"Sunset View Guest House is a comfortable, welcoming and relaxing place to stay. Welcome to our guesthouse! We are proud to be an LGBTQ-friendly establishment and we welcome all guests. The guesthouse features a spacious rooftop with views, free parking for motorbikes and high speed Wi-Fi. A quiet location around 10 minutes walk from popular attractions such as the Old Market and Pub Street. With easy access to the town and many different options for dining. If you don’t want to travel far, our on-site bar and restaurant offers a wide choice to suit everyone. For site seeing, we are ideally positioned a short drive to most major attractions in the area such as Angkor Wat. Tuk Tuk, motorcycle hire or private drivers can easily be arranged.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d25558134-Reviews-Sunset_View_Guest_House-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Wat Svay Rd', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Wat Svay Rd, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 