Suorkear Inn,here:pds:place:116w63u4-628a02f3358949e4a49f0b5fcfac1d41,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Suorkear Inn, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.37907, 'lng': 103.8345}","[{'lat': 13.37894, 'lng': 103.83448}]",87236,"[{'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7289487'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563765835'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.379074,103.83397,7289487,Suorkear Inn,"Suorkear Inn is a clean, comfortable and relaxing accommodation that offers value for the money. Though it is ideally located in the heart of Siem Reap town, you won't feel and hear it as it is tucked-in a quiet part of the town area. Just 50 meters and a 5-minute walk to the town center, pub street and Central and Old Markets. A 20 minute drive to Tonle Sap Lake and Floating Village, and 20 minutes from Siem Reap international airport as well as the the Angkor Wat Complex. Suorkear Inn has 15 rooms with modern facilities, with either balcony or a lounge area for relaxation. A reception area, restaurant and bar complete the public areas of the Inn. Free WIFI in all the rooms and public spaces to make sure all guests are connected with their family and friends. Group or individual customized tours services are also available. Our staff will be more than happy to help you plan for your itinerary and offer suggestions for a more memorable experience. A percentage of the hotel's daily room revenue goes to the village's foundation to support the children's activities. .",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7289487-Reviews-Suorkear_Inn-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Angkor Night Market Street, City Center', 'street2': '5 Minutes Walk from Old Market, Put Street.', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '855', 'address_string': 'Angkor Night Market Street, City Center 5 Minutes Walk from Old Market, Put Street., Siem Reap 855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d7289487-Suorkear_Inn-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#297 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '297'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,10,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '3', '4': '4', '5': '3'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",43,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7289487-m66827-Reviews-Suorkear_Inn-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Suites', 'Room service', 'Free Internet', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Breakfast included', 'Laundry Service', 'Concierge', 'Air conditioning', 'Smoking r