Sup Otres Beach,here:pds:place:116w3csh-f3e0995e32a19de715ce92a2380371fb,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Sup Otres Beach, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.55865, 'lng': 103.55939}","[{'lat': 10.55871, 'lng': 103.55951}]",85746,"[{'id': '800-8600-0197', 'name': 'Sports Activities', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13198607'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855963228276'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.sup-otres-beach.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 18:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT10H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Preah Sihanouk,10.558558,103.55923,13198607,SUP Otres Beach,"Boat Tours to the Islands, Snorkeling, Stand Up Paddleboarding (SUP), Glowing Plankton, Kayaking, and Yoga - we’ve got it all! Our multi-activity adventures will be the highlight of your vacation. Join our SUP Island Tour for snorkeling, paddleboarding into the sunset, a picnic on the boat, and then an unforgettable swim with the magical glowing plankton. SUP is easy to learn and lessons are always provided. Great for beginners and families with children. We ensure optimum comfort, enjoyment, and safety! All tours are with a small group, friendly guide, and top-quality equipment, including life vests and new full face masks for snorkeling. Try SUP Yoga! Enjoy a gentle yoga practice on the calm morning sea - unique in Cambodia. Classes are relaxing and beginner-friendly. SUP and kayak rentals are also offered by the hour. We are passionate about creating unique and memorable experiences - come out for a trip beyond the ordinary! Guides francophones et anglophones!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g325573-d13198607-Reviews-SUP_Otres_Beach-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street2': 'Otres Beach', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Otres Beach, Sihanoukville Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,supotresbeach@gmail.com,+855 96 322 8276,http://www.sup-otres-beach.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d13198607-SUP_Otres_Beach-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#4 of 57 Tours in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out_of': '57', 'ranking': '4'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,104,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '1', '5': '103'}",Not available,121,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g325573-d13198607-m66827-Reviews-SUP_Otres_Beach-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '1800'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 08:00 - 18:00', 'Tuesday: 08:00 - 18:00', 'Wednesday: 08:00 - 18:00', 'Thursday: 08:00 - 18:00', 'Friday: 08:00 - 18:00', 'Saturday: 08:00 - 18:00', 'Sunday: 08:00 - 18:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'boat_tours_water_sports', 'localized_name': 'Boat Tours & Water Sports'}, {'name': 'outdoor_activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities'}, {'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Boat Tours', 'localized_name': 'Boat Tours'}, {'name': 'Scuba & Snorkeling', 'localized_name': 'Scuba & Snorkeling'}, {'name': 'Private Tours', 'localized_name': 'Private Tours'}, {'name': 'Stand-Up Paddleboarding', 'localized_name': 'Stand-Up Paddleboarding'}, {'name': 'Night Tours', 'localized_name': 'Night Tours'}]}, {'name': 'Boat Tours & Water Sports', 'localized_name': 'Boat Tours & Water Sports', 'categories': [{'name': 'Boat Tours', 'localized_name': 'Boat Tours'}, {'name': 'Scuba & Snorkeling', 'localized_name': 'Scuba & Snorkeling'}, {'name': 'Stand-Up Paddleboarding', 'localized_name': 'Stand-Up Paddleboarding'}]}, {'name': 'Outdoor Activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities', 'categories': [{'name': 'Boat Tours', 'localized_name': 'Boat Tours'}, {'name': 'Scuba & Snorkeling', 'localized_name': 'Scuba & Snorkeling'}, {'name': 'Stand-Up Paddleboarding', 'localized_name': 'Stand-Up Paddleboarding'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '52'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '18'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '16'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '16'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,31,15
Surmetta Inn,here:pds:place:116aabd1-1db7525d2e670d2ec90069761b4d3c0b,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Surmetta Inn, ផ្លូវ ផ្សាររាត្រីអង្គរ, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ផ្សាររាត្រីអង្គរ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35221, 'lng': 103.85088}","[{'lat': 13.35226, 'lng': 103.85075}]",88228,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7621482'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855967980837'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.352231,103.85082,7621482,Surmetta Inn,"Surmetta Inn provides free Wi-Fi access throughout the property and offers complimentary usage of the business centre. It is conveniently within 8 km from Angkor Wat Temple, a UNESCO World Heritage Site. The inn is just a 5-minute walk to the famous Pub Street and Old Market. The Royal Palace, Angkor National Museum and Phsar Leu Market are within a 10-minute drive away. Siem Reap International Airport is 8 km away. The inn provides a free one-way pick up service from Siem Reap International Airport, Borei Siengnam Bus Station or Tonle Sap Ferry Dock. Fitted with tiled flooring, air-conditioned rooms are furnished with a cable TV and seating area. Tea/coffee making facilities are also included. The en suite bathroom comes with a shower and free toiletries. Surmetta Inn offers luggage storage, laundry and massage services at a surcharge. Guests may rent a bicycle/car to explore the area, or approach the tour desk for sightseeing tours on a Tuk Tuk and travel arrangements.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7621482-Reviews-Surmetta_Inn-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Phoum Steung Thmey, Svay Dangkum', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Phoum Steung Thmey, Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', '