Svaychek Organic Farm Shop,here:pds:place:116w63uf-84b97f12d6ba4bf5ac38cd893d88db35,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Svaychek Organic Farm Shop, 171002 អង្គរធំ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'អង្គរធំ', 'district': 'លាងដៃ', 'postalCode': '171002'}","{'lat': 13.51931, 'lng': 103.84121}","[{'lat': 13.51928, 'lng': 103.84108}]",17829,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17549020'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512613502'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.svaychekorganicfarm.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Wed, Fri-Sun: 07:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT15H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.519328,103.84128,17549020,SvayChek Organic Farm SHOP,"We are an organic restaurant and organic produce shop where you can find locally grown, pesticide-free vegetables and fruits. Fresh vegetables and fruits are delivered daily from our own sustainable eco-friendly farm located 20 km north of Siem Reap. Come taste dried organic fruits produced in our own factory. We invite you to try our farm-to-table salad bar and healthy smoothies!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d17549020-Reviews-SvayChek_Organic_Farm_SHOP-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#639,Central Market street,Kandal village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': '#639,Central Market street,Kandal village, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phn