Sweet Song,here:pds:place:116w649d-44b5d64794b7482a9b3c9dcf44400928,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Sweet Song, ផ្លូវ 656, 120406 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ទួលគោក', 'subdistrict': 'ទឹកល្អក់ទី បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 656', 'postalCode': '120406'}","{'lat': 11.55281, 'lng': 104.89002}","[{'lat': 11.5528, 'lng': 104.89002}]",3286,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598627920'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.538429,104.91933,14046890,"Sweet Lab, Boulangerie","Sweet Lab is a French bakery, pastry and coffee shop in Toul Tom Poung. Breads, croissants, macarons, breakfast, sandwiches, traditional french pastries, birthday cakes and much more. Sweet Lab gives you a taste of France while producing and managing ethically. The two french chefs, trained at Institut Paul Bocuse, share their passion with the customers by giving them a french experience about bakery, using french products and ""savoir-faire"" to provide the best bread in Phnom Penh, with quality as their primary goal. Come have a sweet moment at Sweet Lab !",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d14046890-Reviews-Sweet_Lab_Boulangerie-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '250L Saint 460', 'street2': 'In front of Climb Gym', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12310', 'address_string': '250L Saint 460 In front of Climb Gym, Phnom Penh 12310 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info.thesweetlab@gmail.com,+855 69 974 811,https://www.facebook.com/SweetLabPP,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d14046890-Sweet_Lab_Boulangerie-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#328 of 1,983 Places to Eat in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'rankin