TTC Hotel Premium - Angkor,here:pds:place:116w63u4-b94011d1bd8f3e389a2b45af301a6c5e,en,hotel,"{'label': 'TTC Hotel Premium - Angkor, អេអេច21, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'អេអេច21', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.37528, 'lng': 103.83588}","[{'lat': 13.37539, 'lng': 103.83595}]",87661,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '14910848'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563966569'}, {'value': '+85593480069'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://ttchotels.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.375132,103.83578,14910848,TTC Hotel Premium - Angkor,"Boasting a bar, TTC Hotel Premium-Angkor is set in Siem Reap, 2.3 km from Pub Street. The property is around 2.6 km from King's Road Angkor and 5 km from Angkor Wat. Kravan Temple is a 7-minute walk away. At the hotel, each room is fitted with a desk. TTC Hotel Premium-Angkor offers certain rooms with pool views, and all rooms come with a private bathroom. At the accommodation each room is equipped with air conditioning and a flat-screen TV. A buffet breakfast is served each morning at the property. Staff are always available to help at the reception. Popular points of interest near TTC Hotel Premium-Angkor include Cambodian Cultural Village, Lucky Mall Siem Reap and The Happy Ranch Horse Farm. The nearest airport is Siem Reap - Angkor International Airport, 5 km from the property.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d14910848-Reviews-TTC_Hotel_Premium_Angkor-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road # 6', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17355', 'address_string': 'National Road # 6, Siem Reap 17355 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Provin