Taiming Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649e-ea07b8730b55455a9b611f83e4681644,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Taiming Hotel, ផ្លូវ 41, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 41', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.53589, 'lng': 104.9287}","[{'lat': 11.53593, 'lng': 104.92883}]",21672,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '621599'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523219568'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.taiminghotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.535875,104.92868,621599,Taiming Hotel,"A GREAT URBAN HOTEL Perfectly nestled in heart of the most exclusive of Phnom Penh city, TAIMING Hotel offers leisure and business travelers the utmost in convenience and comfort. Adjacent to banks, administrations of government and foreign embassies, a stay in TAIMING Hotel is unrivaled as far as safety is concerned. A pursuit of excellence in service is our passion. Leaving the bustling city behind, here in TAIMING Hotel, amiable Khmer hospitality and grace awaits you. Whether for business or a cultural visit, our staff is committed to provide you a warm personalized service.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d621599-Reviews-Taiming_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 281 Norodom Blvd', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'No. 281 Norodom Blvd, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d621599-Taiming_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#212 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', '