Taj Mahal,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-0714951f0e204a3a9b224512515c2820,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Taj Mahal, អូអ៊ែល-3, 070803 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់បាយ', 'street': 'អូអ៊ែល-3', 'postalCode': '070803'}","{'lat': 10.60976, 'lng': 104.17818}","[{'lat': 10.6097, 'lng': 104.17806}]",26004,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '202-000', 'name': 'Indian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '208-000', 'name': 'Pakistani'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13168358'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85581813081'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/TajMahal.Restaurant'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 11:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T110000', 'duration': 'PT11H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kampot,10.609727,104.17813,13168358,Taj Mahal,"A meal at the Taj Mahal Restaurant ‎Halal. inspires interactive dining. Here is a priceless range of all finger licking indian Pakistani Vegetarian & non vegetation dishes. Most favourite haunt of both expiates & tourist curry lovers, due to its Fresh, Hygienic & Authentic Preparation. Used high quality authentic Indian Pakistani spices that make all the visitors have to the delicious food with Unforgettable Taste , - Served with your Choice of 1 Plain Naan or 1 Steamed Rice, Veg Salad, Pickles and Gourmet Chutneys . - we use purified water and Ice, We also take care of your health, ✅ Pure ice ✅ no glutamate (msg) ✅ filtered water✅ western standard",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d13168358-Reviews-Taj_Mahal-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No 19E1, Street 722, South Of Durian Roundabout', 'street2': 'Between Virak-buntham Express Tour & Travel And Champa Express Co; Ltd', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'No 19E1, Street 722, South Of Durian R