Tasom Guesthouse Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w63u5-67bd36440e9e492186d6a7a575bf5098,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Tasom Guesthouse Cambodia, អេអេច21, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'អេអេច21', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36386, 'lng': 103.85445}","[{'lat': 13.36398, 'lng': 103.85452}]",24082,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512830170'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.tasomguesthouse.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.359951,103.86225,1022254,Babel Guesthouse,"Babel Guesthouse is an Eco-friendly guesthouse in the heart of Siem Reap. The open air bar & restaurant is surrounded by a tropical shaded garden, and in the backyard there is a swimming pool with relaxing atmosphere. We offer you minimalistic, comfortable spacious and clean rooms. All the rooms are air-conditioned with private bathrooms. Norwegian owned and managed, located in the charming Wat-Bo area of Siem Reap, only 15 minutes away from the majestic temples of Angkor Wat. The wonderful staff at Babel Guesthouse possess great local knowledge that we are more than happy to share with you to make your stay in Siem Reap memorable. Our local drivers and guides have worked for Babel Guesthouse for many years, and we can assure you they will be there for you, wherever you would like to go and whatever you would like to do during your stay at Babel. Babel Guesthouse is run with an active focus on Responsible Tourism. We constantly seek to provide benefits from the tourism industry to the local community in Siem Reap, and we are doing our best to cause as little damage as possible to the area in which we operate. They all receive plenty of training, good working conditions, fair salaries and flexible working hours to enable the staff to continue their education. We buy our food for the restaurant at the local market, and we support good projects in town that actively focus on Responsible Tourism. We at Babel Guesthouse are looking forward to give you memories for life!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d1022254-Reviews-Babel_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '738 Wat Bo Road', 'street2': 'Salakamroeuk', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': '738 Wat Bo Road Salakamroeuk, Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d1022254-Babel_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#14 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '14'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,892,"{'1': '8', '2': '12', '3': '37', '4': '154', '5': '681'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg'