Taste of Asia,here:pds:place:116w63u6-95061b71846a44df8ac2343f9599a3c2,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Taste of Asia, 171211 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ទឹកវិល', 'postalCode': '171211'}","{'lat': 13.40631, 'lng': 103.81401}","[{'lat': 13.40621, 'lng': 103.8141}]",84183,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '201-000', 'name': 'Chinese'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13003738'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516882108'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.sajibumi.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 06:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T060000', 'duration': 'PT18H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.406387,103.81393,13003738,Taste of Asia,"Asian Fusion experience! Ranging from local favorite, to China, Malay, Singaporean, and Thai taste, we offer you an Asian Sampler. Our customers’ favorite includes our traditional Amok, Hainanese Chicken Rice, Thai flavor Tom Yum Kung and steamy hot Wonton Soup. All of our dishes are prepared from a selection of the fines quality and freshest ingredients sourced locally by our Cambodian chef",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d13003738-Reviews-Taste_of_Asia-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Nr6', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17262', 'address_string': 'Nr6, Siem Reap 17262 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,+855 16 882 108,http://www.sajibumi.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d13003738-Taste_of_Asia-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_loca