Tasty Day,here:pds:place:643y1fn9-25c47332e8e641dab581435e8dc57db3,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Tasty Day, 021401 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ទួលតាឯក', 'postalCode': '021401'}","{'lat': 13.09982, 'lng': 103.19383}","[{'lat': 13.09975, 'lng': 103.19382}]",12066,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,Not Available,Not Available,Battambang,13.101062,103.19892,2457247,Soksabike,"Soksabike is a social enterprise focusing on community development, vocational training school, and environmental protection in Battambang, Cambodia. As the first bicycle tour operator in Battambang, we have been offering people from all around the world an insight into the traditional livelihoods of the Cambodian countryside for over seven years. We place an emphasis on educating guests in the realities of life in rural Cambodia, and ensure that your visit makes a positive impact on the local communities. Plus your tour fee goes towards supporting the local families you visit on the tour and for vocational training for local university students. We believe touring Cambodia by bicycle provides a richer, personal and more interactive experience for visitors. Be sure to check out what happens on a Soksabike tour!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d2457247-Reviews-Soksabike-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 1 1/2', 'street2': 'near Psar Nath', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'Street 1 1/2 near Psar Nath, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@soksabike.com,+855 12 542 019,http://www.soksabike.co