Tattoo Guest House,here:pds:place:116w649e-642e3a1fee3e482780146e41565365dd,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Tattoo Guest House, ផ្លូវ 125, 120308 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ប្រាំពីរ មករា', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងព្រលឹត', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 125', 'postalCode': '120308'}","{'lat': 11.5566, 'lng': 104.91691}","[{'lat': 11.5566, 'lng': 104.91679}]",5891,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3680644'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85599801000'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.556622,104.91688,3680644,Tattoo Guest House,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Phnom Penh, Tattoo Guest House is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its budget friendly environment and proximity to great restaurants and attractions, Tattoo Guest House makes it easy to enjoy the best of Phnom Penh.
Tattoo Guest House features a 24 hour front desk. Plus, guests can enjoy an on-site restaurant, which has made this a popular choice among travelers visiting Phnom Penh. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Phnom Penh, Tattoo Guest House is located a short distance from Wat Langka (0.5 mi) and Bassac Lane (0.9 mi).
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the wine bars, including Khema Pasteur, Bouchon wine bar, and Il Forno, all of which are a short distance from Tattoo Guest House.
Should time allow, Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum, Royal Palace, and Central Market are some popular attractions that are within walking distance.
Tattoo Guest House is sure to make your visit to Phnom Penh one worth remembering.
