Templation Hotel,here:pds:place:116httek-76869d2697bb03f5dbcd0ebff37a8bdd,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Templation Hotel, 171205 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'នគរធំ', 'postalCode': '171205'}","{'lat': 13.38158, 'lng': 103.86791}","[{'lat': 13.38145, 'lng': 103.86786}]",21650,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9463888'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512233350'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.templation.asia'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.381897,103.86729,9463888,Templation Hotel,"Water and foliage have been the inspiration behind all our projects, from our very first, the Pavilion, in 2006. When we first saw the land we would eventually build Templation on, we were immediately inspired by this pocket of untouched natural landscape. Working closely with architects Ivan Tizianel and Lisa Ros from ASMA, Templation’s design revolved around recreating an echo of the waterways and reservoirs that once fed the ancient city of Angkor. Only clearing the dense underbrush, while preserving the native trees and plants; Templation’s suites, pools and features were explicitly designed to harmonise with the landscape that first inspired us. Secluded and exclusive, Templation is a retreat of winding paths and private villas scattered amongst a botanical park and landscaped pool, bordering the entrance to Angkor.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d9463888-Reviews-Templation_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Rok Rak Street, Modul 3', 'street2': 'Phum Sla Kram', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17100', 'address_string': 'Rok Rak Street, Modul 3 Phum Sla Kram, Siem Reap 17100 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'P