Terres Rouges Lodge,here:pds:place:116aabd1-2946b6707aff0f8f76cf1c0b1e9581a0,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Terres Rouges Lodge, 160904 បានលុង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'រតនគីរី', 'city': 'បានលុង', 'district': 'បឹងកន្សែង', 'postalCode': '160904'}","{'lat': 13.74928, 'lng': 106.98502}","[{'lat': 13.74924, 'lng': 106.9849}]",152428,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '300-000', 'name': 'European'}, {'id': '301-000', 'name': 'French'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1386368'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3974110'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512770650'}, {'value': '+85512965165', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.ratanakiri-lodge.com'}]}]",Not Available,Ratanakiri,13.749516,106.98525,1386368,Terres Rouges Lodge,"You contemplate a visit to Cambodia but you want to stay off the beaten track ?Welcome to Terres Rouges Lodge.If you want your visit to be unforgettable, Terres Rouges Lodge is the place you are looking for.After long excursions, you will be able to dive in our pool, wander in our landscaped garden or rest in rooms that are superbly decorated.You will also find it pleasant to have a drink in our bar (‘the best bar in the middle of nowhere’ according to Time Magazine) and to dine in our fine restaurant.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1584758-d1386368-Reviews-Terres_Rouges_Lodge-Banlung_Ratanakiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Boueng Kansaign Road', 'street2': 'Boeung Kan Siang Lake', 'city': 'Banlung', 'state': 'Ratanakiri Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '16452', 'address_string': 'Boueng Kansaign Road Boeung Kan Siang Lake, Banlung 16452 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Banlung', 'location_id': '1584758'