Thansur Sokha Hotel,here:pds:place:116w3cuq-3d89a7afddf441c39a85dcc2b5d5096c,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Thansur Sokha Hotel, 070209 ទឹកឈូរ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'ទឹកឈូរ', 'district': 'ព្រែកត្នោត', 'postalCode': '070209'}","{'lat': 10.63014, 'lng': 104.01783}","[{'lat': 10.63052, 'lng': 104.01813}]",37972,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+855336838888'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.sokhahotels.com/kampot'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.636111,104.01806,3553332,Thansur Sokha Hotel - Kampot,"Thansur Sokha Hotel, located in Bokor Mountain, Kampot, is a popular choice for travelers. The resort is 45 minutes drive from Kampot town and 170 minutes away from Phnom Penh and can be easily accessed from the airport. With its convenient location, the hotel offers easy access to the city's must-see destinations. Sokha Thansur Hotel also offers many facilities to enrich your stay in Kampot. Free Wi-Fi in all rooms, 24-hour security, chapel, convenience store, and daily housekeeping are just a few of the facilities that set Sokha Thansur Hotel apart from other hotels in the city. The hotel features 564 beautifully appointed guest rooms, All rooms are comfortable served with world-class service, many of which include closet, complimentary tea, towels, and slippers. The hotel offers an excellent variety of recreational facilities, including boats, hiking trails, water park, Enjoy unparalleled services and a truly prestigious address at the Thansur Sokha Hotel.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d3553332-Reviews-Thansur_Sokha_Hotel_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road 32', 'street2': 'Bokor Mountain', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '855', 'address_string': 'National Road 32 Bokor Mountain, Kampot