The Adventure Bike,here:pds:place:116w636k-0de39046f6082cb9006c3f81f43b865d,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'The Adventure Bike, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09378, 'lng': 103.20061}","[{'lat': 13.09374, 'lng': 103.20048}]",12315,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12971239'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85589747717'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.theadventurebike.org'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Fri: 07:30 - 19:30', 'Sat, Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T073000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR'}, {'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:SA,SU'}]}]",Battambang,13.093769,103.20056,12971239,The Adventure Bike,"Discovery life in the countryside and unseen nature in Battambang Cambodia. Life is very different between City and Countryside or between countries to other countries. But we are Human Animal and living in the same world and same planet and moreover, Battambang is so beautiful and has a lot of things to see. For example Cultural Temple ( Unique in Cambodia ), Bamboo sticky rice, Killing field ( 100008 were killed), Local rice wine, and Ricepaper and more, more. The Adventure Bike will bring you to see all of these things and show around the countryside and also our custom, culture, and traditional Cambodian. We are happy to show you about the beauty of Battambang And let’s give us a chance to do it. We are looking to see you!!! Kindly regards, Mr. Sothea Lim (GM) The Adventure Bike Team",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d12971239-Reviews-The_Adventure_Bike-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Ba