The Artist Residence,here:pds:place:116aabd1-a2307bb6a1fa068fa8e72b2ec8714172,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'The Artist Residence, ផ្លូវ 178 69, 120206 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 178', 'postalCode': '120206', 'houseNumber': '69'}","{'lat': 11.56579, 'lng': 104.92746}","[{'lat': 11.56566, 'lng': 104.92751}]",6909,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6432277'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523213930'}, {'value': '+85587911929', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://artistresidencephnompenh.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.565629,104.92761,6432277,The Artist Residence,"The Artist Residence is an intimate residence ideally situated for those looking for a safe quiet space in the heart of bustling Phnom Penh. Set in a converted shop house with touches that evoke the period building's original French 1960s ambiance, Artist Residence is a cozy haven for those who want to relax yet be within walking distance of many Phnom Penh's best restaurants, cafes, eateries and local markets. Nestled on a quiet leafy street between the National Museum and The University of Fine Arts, Artist Residence is a few walk to the Royal Palace, the Riverside as well as Wat Botum and Wat Ounalom, two of Phnom Penh’s most venerable pagodas.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d6432277-Reviews-The_Artist_Residence-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#69, Street 178, Sangkat Chey Chumnas Khan Daun Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12206', 'address_string': '#69, Street 178, Sangkat Che