The Bale Phnom Penh,here:pds:place:116w64d7-a7eabc1ede0e49cb8b2c2ae09ef65d02,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'The Bale Phnom Penh, 121005 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ជ្រោយចង្វារ', 'subdistrict': 'បាក់ខែង', 'postalCode': '121005'}","{'lat': 11.68785, 'lng': 104.92561}","[{'lat': 11.68785, 'lng': 104.92561}]",62616,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13008993'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523900425'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.thebalephnompenh.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}, {'value': 'https://www.thebalephnompenh.com/?utm_source=TAhotelwebsite', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.687649,104.9263,13008993,The Bale Phnom Penh,"The Balé Phnom Penh hotel is a unique, elegant and very high-end collection of 18 large, private, sumptuous suites, showcasing the best of modern Asian architecture and design and gourmet cuisine. The resort stands on the banks of the majestic Mekong River, with breathtaking views across the dazzling waters. You arrive in great style, sweeping down a dramatic corridor, past a serene Buddha and along a pink palimanan sandstone walkway across a black-bottomed infinity pond. Around the property are lemongrass and spider lilies, fragrant frangipani trees and vivid-green Lee Kuan Yew plants. Swim in the cool riverside pool, relax with a sublime treatment in the intimate spa, and dine by candlelight on fine cuisine under the tropical stars. The Balé Phnom Penh sets a new luxury benchmark for South East Asia.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d13008993-Reviews-The_Bale_Phnom_Penh-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road 6A', 'street2': 'Bridge No. 8, Bak Khaeng', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'National Road 6A Bridge No. 8, Bak Khaeng, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d13008993-The_Bale_Phnom_Penh-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#36 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '36'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,129,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '7', '4': '13', '5': '108'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",361,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d13008993-m66827-Reviews-The_Bale_Phnom_Penh-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Suites', 'Room service', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Dry Cleaning', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Fitness center', 'Laundry Service', 'Concierge', 'Banquet Room', 'Air conditioning', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Minibar', 'Safe', 'Outdoor pool', 'Housekeeping', 'Bathrobes', 'Blackout Curtains', 'Bottled Water', 'Complimentary Instant Coffee', 'Ironing Service', 'Pool / Beach Towels', 'Pool with View', '24-Hour Security', 'Sun Umbrellas', 'Wheelchair access', 'Meeting rooms', 'Family Rooms', 'Refrigerator in room', 'Conference Facilities', 'Babysitting', 'Butler Service', 'Breakfast Available', 'Baggage Storage', 'BBQ Facilities', 'Bicycle Rental', 'Breakfast in the Room', 'Bridal Suite', 'Coffee Shop', 'Complimentary Tea', 'Currency Exchange', 'Evening Entertainment', 'Complimentary Welcome Drink', '24-Hour Front Desk', 'Outdoor Furniture', 'Secured Parking', 'Shared Lounge / TV Area', 'Soundproof Rooms', 'Sun Deck', 'Sun Terrace', 'Wine / Champagne']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"['Hidden Gem', 'Boutique']",[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '7'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '51'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '10'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '19'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '15'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,11,14
The Battambang Bike,here:pds:place:116aabd1-aaa26880778408419e271034ff5ecd11,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'The Battambang Bike, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.09884, 'lng': 103.19741}","[{'lat': 13.09882, 'lng': 103.19755}]",12323,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3555624'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85595578878'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://thebattambangbike.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 20:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Battambang,13.098826,103.1975,3555624,The Battambang Bike,"The Battambang Bike offer tours of downtown Battambang's art and architecture, custom tours, bike rentals and repairs, and Saturday Fun Rides. Our signature CITY TOUR OF BATTAMBANG will leave you in love with this gorgeous city. Hop on one of our bikes and let our guide take you on an interactive tour of Battambang's historical downtown, with rich explanations of the area's history and dynamic contemporary arts' scene, Cambodian culture, and urban planning. We also have EVENING TOURS, departing daily at 4:00pm, which show off the wonders of Battambang’s activity and architecture as the sun is setting. We will take you to one of the tallest buildings in town for a bird’s eye view, a visit to a wat at sunset, and stops at locals’ favorite exercise spots and restaurants, which are especially popular around dusk.Or join us for a FREE SATURDAY FUN RIDE. Whether we are exploring Battambang’s religious buildings, heading out to the old airport to learn from the city’s only BMX teacher, or training for a longer road race, we always have fun and get great exercise.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d3555624-Reviews-The_Battambang_Bike-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'St 2.5', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02360', 'address_string': 'St 2.5, Battambang 02360 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@thebattambangbike.com,+855 95 578 878,http://thebattambangbike.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d3555624-The_Battambang_Bike-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#12 of 39 Outdoor Activities in Battambang', 'geo_location_name': 'Battambang', 'ranking_out_of': '39', 'ranking': '12'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,75,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '5', '5': '70'}",Not available,120,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d3555624-m66827-Reviews-The_Battambang_Bike-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2000'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 08:00 - 20:00', 'Tuesday: 08:00 - 20:00', 'Wednesday: 08:00 - 20:00', 'Thursday: 08:00 - 20:00', 'Friday: 08:00 - 20:00', 'Saturday: 08:00 - 20:00', 'Sunday: 08:00 - 20:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}, {'name': 'outdoor_activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Cultural Tours', 'localized_name': 'Cultural Tours'}, {'name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours', 'localized_name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours'}, {'name': 'City Tours', 'localized_name': 'City Tours'}, {'name': 'Bike Tours', 'localized_name': 'Bike Tours'}]}, {'name': 'Outdoor Activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities', 'categories': [{'name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours', 'localized_name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours'}, {'name': 'Bike Tours', 'localized_name': 'Bike Tours'}]}]",Not available,Not available,"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '19'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '14'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '13'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '23'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,31,1
The Beach House,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-0bea32b4829c4be5bbb1288b4eb1c0a7,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'The Beach House, ផ្លូវ 33 អេ, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 33 អេ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.47925, 'lng': 104.29544}","[{'lat': 10.47926, 'lng': 104.29558}]",7975,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1734395'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25413089'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4843632'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512712750'}, {'value': '+85598733123'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.thebeachhousekep.com'}, {'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100069015651603'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.479456,104.29471,1734395,The Beach House,"See why so many travelers make The Beach House their small hotel of choice when visiting Kep. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a charming setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
For those interested in checking out Patio (2.4 mi) while visiting Kep, The Beach House Hotel is a short distance away.
As your “home away from home,” the small hotel rooms offer a flat screen TV, a refrigerator, and air conditioning, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
Guests have access to beach chairs, a sun terrace, and express check-in and check-out while staying at The Beach House. In addition, The Beach House Hotel offers a pool and a lounge, which will help make your Kep trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
If you like barbeque restaurants, The Beach House Hotel is conveniently located near The Waterfront Beach Club and Lounge Bar.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out a , such as Crab Statue.
At The Beach House, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Kep.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d1734395-Reviews-The_Beach_House-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Kep Beach, #33A', 'street2': 'Phum Thmey, Prey Thom', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07503', 'address_string': 'Kep Beach, #33A Phum Thmey, Prey Thom, Kep 07503 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d1734395-The_Beach_House-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_string': '#6 of 71 B&Bs / Inns in Kep', 'geo_location_name': 'Kep', 'ranking_out_of': '71', 'ranking': '6'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,217,"{'1': '7', '2': '5', '3': '35', '4': '76', '5': '94'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",135,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d173439