nternet', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Pets Allowed', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Breakfast Available', 'Housekeeping', 'Bath / Shower', 'Bicycle Rental', 'Bidet', 'Dining Area', 'Electric Kettle', 'English', 'Evening Entertainment', 'Khmer', 'Kitchenware', 'Nightclub / DJ', 'Patio', 'Private Bathrooms', 'Seating Area', 'Sofa']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'other', 'localized_name': 'Specialty Lodging'}]",Not available,['Quaint'],[],Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,FALSE,29,6
The Beige,here:pds:place:116w63uf-a23309392f594932a63e451edf245663,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'The Beige, 171002 អង្គរធំ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'អង្គរធំ', 'district': 'លាងដៃ', 'postalCode': '171002'}","{'lat': 13.50048, 'lng': 103.83041}","[{'lat': 13.4993, 'lng': 103.82969}]",19151,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577420461'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://the-beige.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.505049,103.828186,12364146,THE BEIGE,"The Beige is a luxury tent resort located in the lush environs of Angkor. This ideal day we offer will be greeted in this way. Ensconced in a region replete with UNESCO World Heritage Sites like Angkor Wat, this resort evokes a feel for the finest of Khmer history. The space On a sprawling expanse totalling ten hectares, there are only Ten guest rooms. Our tent fabric resembles the sailcloth of a yacht – unyielding in wind, though lightweight and durable. Breezes pass softly through the open interior, as relaxing reminders of nature all around. Guest access In a completely private setting, enjoy an Angkor all of your own. Interaction with guests Guests are our valued friends, and even family. The attentive stuff will make your stay to a pleasant and comfortable experience. The neighborhood 13 minutes to Angkor Thom ruins Private picnic within 15 minutes Access to the airport is smooth for 19 minutes to the airport The Angkor Group is a very large remains with more than 1000 ruins. Drivers are essential for sightseeing. Our drivers will help you on your journey.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12364146-Reviews-THE_BEIGE-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Svay Chek Road', 'street2': 'Svay Chek Commune, Angkor Thom', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17604', 'address_string': 'Svay Chek Road Svay Chek Commune, Angkor Thom, Siem Reap 17604 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12364146-THE_BEIGE-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#148 of 763 hotels in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '763', 'ranking': '148'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,148,"{'1': '1', '2': '1', '3': '7', '4': '9', '5': '130'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",460,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12364146-m66827-Reviews-THE_BEIGE-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$$$$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Suites', 'Room service', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Spa', 'Airport transport