The Billabong Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-cfd48f806f7e41408451fc7a083c9ca4,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'The Billabong Guesthouse, អេអេច123, 070803 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់បាយ', 'street': 'អេអេច123', 'postalCode': '070803'}","{'lat': 10.61552, 'lng': 104.17882}","[{'lat': 10.6154, 'lng': 104.17888}]",20173,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10786797'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855967672977'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.615456,104.17885,10786797,The Billabong Guesthouse,"The Billabong Guesthouse is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Kampot, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
For those interested in checking out The Old Royal Cinema (0.5 mi) while visiting Kampot, The Billabong Guesthouse is a short distance away.
Guest rooms offer air conditioning, and The Billabong Guesthouse makes getting online easy as free wifi is available.
You can also take advantage of some of the amenities offered by the small hotel, including a 24 hour front desk, room service, and baggage storage. In addition, guests can enjoy a pool and an on-site restaurant during their visit. As an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
Kampot has plenty of Asian restaurants. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Epic Arts Cafe, Ecran Noodle and Dumpling House, and Rikitikitavi, which are serving up some great dishes.
Should time allow, Farm Link is a popular attraction that is within walking distance.
Enjoy your stay in Kampot!
