The Blanc Residence,here:pds:place:116w63gg-c7f55cdb2ece40fdb4903e78de66e523,en,hostel,"{'label': 'The Blanc Residence, ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35481, 'lng': 103.84852}","[{'lat': 13.35468, 'lng': 103.84853}]",88109,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7078603'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563765723', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85570751166'}], 'www': [{'value': 'www.theblancresidence.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.354735,103.84853,7078603,The Blanc Residence,"The Blanc Residence 3* is a Siem Reap Budget Hotel and located right in the center of Siem Reap, within walking distance to major attractions, shopping, and the Pub Street Nightlife. Managed by the former Angkor Pal Boutique Hotel Team, it offers all the services you expect from a star-class hotel and much more… Excursions to Angkor Wat, Prek Toal Bird Sanctuary, Phnom Kulen National Park and Tonle Sap’s Floating Villages can be booked right at our travel desk. Relax after sightseeing & a night out at our private pool, enjoy refreshing cocktails and light snacks at the poolside bar or discover the secrets of the delicious Khmer Cuisine with the help of the in-house Madam Ya Cooking Classes. FREE Airport Transfer for 3 nights+ bookings Monthly rates available on request Siem Reap For Digital Nomads The Blanc Residence offers ideal accommodation for Digital Nomads, Travel Bloggers, Video Bloggers, and Digital Nomads in general. Ample working space in the rooms and the pool.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7078603-Reviews-The_Blanc_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sok San Road', 'street2': 'Steung Thmey', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Sok San Road Steung Thmey, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,1.19E+12,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d7078603-The_Blanc_Residence-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#27 of 449 Specialty lodging in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '449', 'ranking': '27'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,332,"{'1': '8', '2': '7', '3': '28', '4': '103', '5': '186'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",394,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7078603-m66827-Reviews-T