The Boarding House,here:pds:place:116w3cth-0cd3631a0397ffdd173262cdd534cf75,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'The Boarding House, 180202 ស្ទឹងហាវ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ស្ទឹងហាវ', 'district': 'អូរត្រេះ', 'postalCode': '180202'}","{'lat': 10.72564, 'lng': 103.56521}","[{'lat': 10.7255, 'lng': 103.56523}]",93225,"[{'id': '500-5100-0056', 'name': 'Campground', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12217052'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516822422'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.wix.com/beachboardinghouse/mysite'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.725934,103.5651,12217052,The Boarding House,"We offer a variety of rooms from simple double fan rooms, to air-con stone cottages to fantastic sea-view bungalows. We have a gorgeous location directly on the beach looking out over the bay. All rooms are on the beach and some have a sea view. Our breakfast menu consists of 'Full English' or a variation of the items included i.e. toast, eggs, bacon, sausage etc or muesli or sandwiches. We serve breakfast all day. In the evenings we serve a family-style meal. We will always try to tailor our meals to guests' dietary requirements and requests as much as possible. We have a fully functioning beach bar serving cold soft drinks, beers, smoothies, juices & cocktails. Throughout the day guests often chill out on beanbags, in hammocks or at the bar. The water is extremely shallow in the bay so it's perfect for kids, or big kids playing frisbe etc. In night time it's a perfect place to splash around and see the plankton, which is especially good due to no light pollution.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d12217052-Reviews-The_Boarding_House-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Steung Hav Port Road', 'street2': 'Kampenh', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Steung Hav Port Road