The Bright LOTUS,here:pds:place:116w649g-07ab1b131eb44169a8a644c138b6a71c,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'The Bright LOTUS, ផ្លូវ 3, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 3', 'postalCode': '120205'}","{'lat': 11.56673, 'lng': 104.931}","[{'lat': 11.56668, 'lng': 104.93087}]",7292,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3307847'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '456199'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512676682'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.566695,104.93092,456199,The Bright Lotus,"Finding an ideal budget friendly guest house in Phnom Penh does not have to be difficult. Welcome to The Bright Lotus, a nice option for travelers like you.
For those interested in checking out popular landmarks while visiting Phnom Penh, The Bright Lotus is located a short distance from Wat Ounalom (0.1 mi) and Champey Academy of Arts (0.3 mi).
Free wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at The Bright Lotus offer air conditioning, a seating area, and a desk.
During your stay, take advantage of some of the amenities offered, including a 24 hour front desk, baggage storage, and newspaper. Guests of The Bright Lotus are also welcome to enjoy an on-site restaurant. For travelers arriving by car, there is free public parking available nearby.
Phnom Penh has plenty of barbeque restaurants. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Brooklyn Pizza & Bistro, Sikgaek Korea Restaurant, and Sovanna, which are serving up some great dishes.
During your visit, be sure to check out Royal Palace (0.2 mi), which is a popular attraction within walking distance of the guest house.
The Bright Lotus looks forward to welcoming you on your visit to Phnom Penh.
