The Bunong Elephant Project,here:pds:place:116w6hq9-163a0afbd7d343bf852069871ab354d0,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'The Bunong Elephant Project, ផ្លូវជាតិ 76, 110502 សែនមនោរម្យ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'មណ្ឌលគីរី', 'city': 'សែនមនោរម្យ', 'district': 'សុខដុម', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 76', 'postalCode': '110502'}","{'lat': 12.45899, 'lng': 107.18653}","[{'lat': 12.45908, 'lng': 107.18664}]",40589,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511694131'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://bunongelephantproject.org'}]}]",Not Available,Mondulkiri,12.451695,107.17821,3965757,Elephant Valley Project,"The Elephant Valley Project is an elephant sanctuary in Mondulkiri Province, Cambodia. Here we rescue and retire captive working Asian elephants and slowly rehabilitate them back to their natural habitat within our 1200 hectare grounds. If you are heading to Cambodia and have some free time then it is well worth heading over to us and checking out our herd of elephants. Day trips usually involve two walks through the forest learning about these amazing creatures, with a buffet lunch overlooking the forest canopy.Please be aware that we don't ride elephants, as we consider it 'unnecessary'. Accommodation is also available for people who are staying two or more days.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g1893367-d3965757-Reviews-Elephant_Valley_Project-Sen_Monorom_Mondulkiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street2': 'Doem Sroel Village', 'city': 'Sen Monorom', 'state': 'Mondulkiri Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Doem Sroel Village, Sen Monorom Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Sen Monorom', 'location_id': '1893367'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Mondulkiri Province', 'location_id': '2366669'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,evpbookings@gmail.com,+855 99 696 041,http://www.el