The Cashew Nut Villa.,here:pds:place:116aabd1-aeb335ef2bc60fc970ce22e1c71f01a6,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'The Cashew Nut Villa., ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវខេត្ត 267', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.34924, 'lng': 103.84931}","[{'lat': 13.34915, 'lng': 103.84941}]",87942,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2157580'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510338080'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.349208,103.84935,2157580,The Cashew Nut Villa.,"The Trip Advisor award winning Cashew Nut Guest house is situated only a short 10 minute walk away from the lively markets and the restaurant/bar scene, making it the perfect place to base yourself during your stay in Siem Reap. Our newly refurnished, spotlessly clean, 10 room guest house has been designed to meet all travelers needs and requirements to ensure you don't have anything to worry about during your stay. Steve, the owner, has a wealth of information and advice about traveling throughout the region which he is more than happy to share with fellow travelers. There is something for everyone at the Cashew Nut Guest House which promises 5 Star service at a budget price.Tours available with trusted drivers at affordable prices offering great value for money.All our rooms are have en-suite bathrooms.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d2157580-Reviews-The_Cashew_Nut_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Psaar Krom Road', 'street2': 'Vahear Cham Village, Svay Dankum Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Psaar Krom Road Vahear Cham Village, Svay Dankum Commune, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'na