The Columns,here:pds:place:116aabd1-2073e543658c0d737e959937b3dddf8d,en,hotel,"{'label': 'The Columns, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60695, 'lng': 104.18082}","[{'lat': 10.60682, 'lng': 104.18087}]",19561,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2342824'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592128300'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.the-columns.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.606852,104.18086,2342824,The Columns,The Columns is located on a quiet tree-lined street in the heart of old town Kampot. Our historic French Colonial houses have been restored to their original charm but with the addition of modern functionality and comforts. The relaxing atmosphere and central location make for an ideal place to stay while exploring the town and its surroundings.,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d2342824-Reviews-The_Columns-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '37 Phoum 1 Ouksophear', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': '37 Phoum 1 Ouksophear, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d2342824-The_Columns-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#5 of 88 hotels in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '88', 'ranking': '5'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,375,"{'1': '1', '2': '3', '3': '27', '4': '105', '5': '239'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', '