The Courtyard Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-965f7f058a1801ce5da124dbaaa17cfa,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'The Courtyard Guesthouse, 160904 បានលុង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'រតនគីរី', 'city': 'បានលុង', 'district': 'បឹងកន្សែង', 'postalCode': '160904'}","{'lat': 13.74565, 'lng': 106.97252}","[{'lat': 13.74566, 'lng': 106.97266}]",108739,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13625282'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8796730'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855968840007'}]}],Not Available,Ratanakiri,13.745654,106.97244,8796730,The Courtyard Guesthouse,"Banlung Hill Top House & Trekking has changed its location and now is located at the hill top in Phum Svay Village, Sangkat Beong Kanseng, Banlung City, Ratanakiri province and far about ~1.8 km away from Banlung Circle. Banlung Hill Top House & Trekking is in the category of the innovation, and accommodation. Now we have bungalow s, Things to do, as well as the attractions of Hilltop Observatory, sunset and sunrise watching, places to eat, see sunset views, view mountain landscape, meeting locals, sharing life stories and more. For the trip to the location of Banlung Hill Too House &Trek, it is easy because it is not necessary to walk across the river or take a boat. For parking, tourists can park directly at the location. For accommodation, The Courtyard has three different types of rooms, bungalow with hot shower, balcony for sunrise and sunset with panoramic hill view and standard rooms with private bathroom and garden view. To access The Courtyard Guest House is free of charge.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1584758-d8796730-Reviews-The_Courtyard_Guesthouse-Banlung_Ratanakiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '29 Street', 'street2': 'Roat To Thouy Tom Village', 'city': 'Banlung', 'state': 'Ratanakiri Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '16453', 'address