The Cruise - Kampot,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-4408227d435c9d3c1db76f625ea56b3d,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'The Cruise - Kampot, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60747, 'lng': 104.18107}","[{'lat': 10.60734, 'lng': 104.18111}]",19561,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '101-002', 'name': 'American - Southwestern', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian'}, {'id': '800-080', 'name': 'Soup'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26721155'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515200045'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61551719447569'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 02:00, 07:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT19H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kampot,10.607452,104.18108,26721155,The Cruise - Kampot,"A very long story of our place you will see and imagine whenever you are here. We run this restaurant for affordable local people and welcome tourism from all over the world. The first international seaport of Cambodia (1841–1860) Upon his arrival on the throne in 1840, Khmer King Ang Duong constructed a road from his capital of Oudong to Kampot and opened Kampot as the only international seaport of Cambodia. Import and exports grew quickly in the hands of the Anglo-Chinese merchants of Singapore, turning a neighborhood of the city into the Chinese Kampot. French missionary Father Hestret founded the first Catholic Church in Kampot at that time and received the visit of French explorer Henri Mouhot.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d26721155-Reviews-The_Cruise_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street2': 'In front of white peacock 2000 roundabout', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07402', 'address_string': 'In front of white peacock 2000 roundabout, Kampot 07402 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,thecruisekampot@gmail.com,+855 15 200 045,http://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61551719447569,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d26721155-The_Cruise_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#58 of 174 Places to Eat in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '174', 'ranking': '58'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,6,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '6'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",72,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608455-d26721155-m66827-Reviews-The_Cruise_Kampot-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html#photos,$$ - $$$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '0200'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '0200'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '0200'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '0200'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '0200'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': 