The Draft Bar Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w63gg-47c3830337434d3cbe53ffc79aafefad,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'The Draft Bar Cambodia, ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35469, 'lng': 103.85047}","[{'lat': 13.35472, 'lng': 103.85047}]",25125,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]","[{'id': '800-078', 'name': 'Grill', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512304656'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.355567,103.85415,11880648,The Christa Restaurant & Bar,"Welcome to the new Christa Restaurant and Bar at a new location with the same exceptional menu and professional staff. The new Christa is a three-story full restaurant and bar only minutes away from the Night Market, the Old Market and Pub Street. The second and third floors offer open seating for views of old Siem Reap and people watching! Fun and family friendly environment where all can enjoy a good meal without all the hassles and distracting sounds of the markets and Pub Street. See you soon!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d11880648-Reviews-The_Christa_Restaurant_Bar-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street No. 7 Phum Mundul1 sangkat svay dangkum', 'street2': 'Phum Mundul1 Sangkat Svay Dangkum Krong', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '16980', 'address_string': 'Street No. 7 Phum Mundul1 sangkat svay dangkum Phum Mundul1 Sangkat Svay Dangkum Krong, Siem Reap 16980 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,thechrista.cambodia@gmail.com,+85