The Easy Panda Hostel,here:pds:place:116w3csh-f13b156cc3b048fdbff4a453d3cfa3cc,en,hostel,"{'label': 'The Easy Panda Hostel, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.58082, 'lng': 103.54574}","[{'lat': 10.5809, 'lng': 103.54585}]",87349,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13834371'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598900707'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.580777,103.54568,13834371,The Easy Panda Hostel,"The Easy Panda is perfect for a chilled, good vibes getaway. With 8 private bungalows & 1 6 bed dorm we are located on the most beautiful white sand beach, you will wake up to the most breathtaking view & sleep to the sounds of the waves. The Easy Panda serves delicious Cambodian and Western dishes. Serving some of the best cocktails in town!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d13834371-Reviews-The_Easy_Panda_Hostel-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '1 Otres Marina Road', 'street2': '4th building down from the archway of Otres 1', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': '1 Otres Marina Road 4th building down from the archway of Otres 1, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d13834371-The_Easy_Panda_Hostel-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#81 of 277 Specialty lodging in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out_o