The Eighty8 Phnom Penh,here:pds:place:116w649g-df2fd6a0c13447f7ac76ebf8c8eeceec,en,hostel,"{'label': 'The Eighty8 Phnom Penh, ផ្លូវ ផ្សារដែក, 120210 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ស្រះចក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ផ្សារដែក', 'postalCode': '120210'}","{'lat': 11.57797, 'lng': 104.91943}","[{'lat': 11.57817, 'lng': 104.9194}]",6134,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,[],"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523982440'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.88backpackers.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.578094,104.91947,2086545,The Eighty8 Phnom Penh,"The Eighty8 Collective hostel is an oasis within the heart of a bustling Phnom Penh with a swimming pool for that much needed cooling dip. We are not only a fun social hostel, but also a great place to chill out, relax, meet fellow travelers or make new friends, and of course, we can party too.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d2086545-Reviews-The_Eighty8_Phnom_Penh-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '98, Street 88', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12202', 'address_string': '98, Street 88, Phnom Penh 12202 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d2086545-The_Eighty8_Phnom_Penh-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#5 of 351 Specialty lodging in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '351', 'ranking': '5'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,894,"{'1': '41', '2': '45', '3': '108', '4': '251', '5': '449'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/trave