The Embassy Bar Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w649g-49dc75192ea54ed094906a77c3c5c2ac,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'The Embassy Bar Cambodia, ផ្លូវ 51, 120203 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 51', 'postalCode': '120203'}","{'lat': 11.56693, 'lng': 104.92341}","[{'lat': 11.56692, 'lng': 104.92334}]",73793,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '101-000', 'name': 'American', 'primary': True}, {'id': '800-078', 'name': 'Grill'}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570268060'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.554547,104.92841,300152,Embassy Place Apartments,"Embassy Place Serviced Apartments are located in the very center of Phnom Penh, very near to best restaurants, coffee houses, major business locations, foreign embassies, shopping and entertainment outlets and touristic attractions. Embassy Place Apartments is nestled among a unique green tropical environment with beautifully landscaped garden, its own large outside area, a cozy and ambient environment for guests to relax and enjoy while on business or vacation in Cambodia. Daily newspapers, maid, dry cleaning and laundry services and facilities are available and our courteous staff can also attend to all your special requirements to ensure your comfortable stay in the Cambodia. Residential serviced apartment units range from 1 bedroom with 90 square meters in size to 3 bedroom units up to 160 square meters. Embassy Place Apartments offers a high level of security, privacy and confidentiality 24 hours a day. Embassy Place is ideal for business travelers, for long time staying expats and for tourists. Families and kids especially will enjoy large private green area, private pool, calm environment and high security.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d300152-Reviews-Embassy_Place_Apartments-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '147 Norodom Boulevard', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12302', 'address_string': '147 Norodom Boulevard, Phnom Penh 12302 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d300152-Embassy_Place_Apartments-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#196 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '196'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,29,"{'1': '4', '2': '0', '3': '4', '4': '9', '5': '12'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}}",110,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d300152-m66827-Reviews-Embassy_Place_Apartments-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Suites', 'Free Internet', 'Kitchenette', 'Wifi', 'Dry Cleaning', 'Fitness center', 'Laundry Service', 'Concierge', 'Family Rooms', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Microwave', 'Refrigerator in room', 'Shuttle Bus Service', 'Free parking', 'Pets Allowed', 'Airport transportation', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Air conditioning', 'Self-Serve Laundry', 'Babysitting', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Safe', 'Outdoor pool', 'Parking', 'Baggage Storage', 'Bath / Shower', 'BBQ Facilities', 'Bottled Water', '24-Hour Check-in', 'Desk', 'English', 'Free Private Parking Nearby', 'Complimentary Toiletries', 'French', '24-Hour Front Desk', 'Ironing Service', 'Khmer', 'Kitchenware', 'Newspaper', 'Russian', 'Seating Area', '24-Hour Security', 'Sofa', 'Sun Terrace', 'Telephone']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"['Family', 'Romantic']",[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '6'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '3'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '15'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '3'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,20,14
The Fin Inn,here:pds:place:116aabd1-a86cbe650ca20b5cd7dcb92e29a6fd3f,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'The Fin Inn, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.36569, 'lng': 103.8767}","[{'lat': 13.36582, 'lng': 103.87672}]",22354,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12030405'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512460036'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.thefininn.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.365706,103.87671,12030405,The Fin Inn,"See why so many travelers make The Fin Inn their bed and breakfast of choice when visiting Siem Reap. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a budget friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
Close to some of Siem Reap's most popular landmarks, such as Viti's Tuk Tuk Driver (1.1 mi) and New Hope Cambodia (1.2 mi), The Fin Inn is a great destination for tourists.
Rooms at The Fin Inn offer a kitchenette providing exceptional comfort and convenience, and guests can go online with free wifi.
Room service is one of the conveniences offered at this bed and breakfast. A pool and free breakfast will also help to make your stay even more special.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the Asian restaurants, including Chanrey Tree, Genevieve's Restaurant, and Marum, all of which are a short distance from The Fin Inn.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out a garden, such as Angkor Wat Putt.
At The Fin Inn, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Siem Reap.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12030405-Reviews-The_Fin_Inn-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#0112', 'street2': 'Chong Kaosou, Slor Kram', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '00855', 'address_string': '#0112 Chong Kaosou, Slor Kram, Siem Reap 00855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12030405-The_Fin_Inn-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#209 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '209'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,12,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '0', '4': '1', '5': '10'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",7,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12030405-m66827-Reviews-The_Fin_Inn-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Suites', 'Free Internet', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Breakfast included', 'Business center', 'Air conditioning', 'Kids Activities', 'Shuttle Bus Servi