The Flex Hostel,here:pds:place:116w63gg-af815fd0d0523cbe32504a4cf933eb26,en,hostel,"{'label': 'The Flex Hostel, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35325, 'lng': 103.86153}","[{'lat': 13.35312, 'lng': 103.86153}]",24463,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25369432'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593369028'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.353148,103.86153,25369432,The Flex Hostel,"Located in What Bo Area, The Flex Hostel has free bikes, garden, bar, and free WiFi throughout the property. The property is around 6.3 km from Angkor Wat, a 16-minute walk from Royal Residence and 2.1 km from Angkor National Museum. Guests can enjoy garden views.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d25369432-Reviews-The_Flex_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 26, Krong Siem Reap', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': 'Street 26, Krong Siem Reap, Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d25369432-The_Flex_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#297 of 449 Specialty lodging in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '449', 'ranking': '297'}",3,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.0-66827-5.svg,2,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '1'}",{},26,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d25369432-m66827-Reviews-The_Flex_