The Funky Village,here:pds:place:116aabd1-9fa1148fa6ac0874eef720b547180f96,en,hostel,"{'label': 'The Funky Village, ច្រកផ្លូវ ហ្វាំងគី, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ច្រកផ្លូវ ហ្វាំងគី', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.3582, 'lng': 103.85071}","[{'lat': 13.3582, 'lng': 103.85071}]",24819,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23135339'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7600022'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8342562'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563965960', 'categories': [{'id': '200-2000-0011'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}, {'value': '+85569239721'}, {'value': '+855967521040', 'categories': [{'id': '200-2000-0011'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://funkyflashpacker.com/food-drinks', 'categories': [{'id': '200-2000-0011'}]}, {'value': 'http://www.funkyflashpacker.com', 'categories': [{'id': '200-2000-0011'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}, {'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/thefunkyvillagesiemreap', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '200-2000-0011'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.358201,103.850716,7600022,The Funky Village,"The Funky Village was the largest party hostel in Cambodia and has the only 24-hour bar, restaurant, and reception for any hostel in Cambodia. We have approximately 200 beds with varying room types including private rooms and shared dorms. We are located just a few minutes’ walk from all the popular attractions including the famous Pub Street, night market area, and we are just a short distance from the UNESCO Angkor Archaeological Park, air-port, and bus stations. We have female and mixed dorms available which come with large oversized beds, backpack-sized lockable storage, personal reading lamps, international plug sockets, 24-hour air-conditioning, 24-hour instant hot water in our rainforest showers, free 24-hour in-room Wi-Fi, and individual unique artwork. We have a range of rooms available including single, double, twin, quad, and deluxe rooms. All rooms come with a private en-suite bathroom, room safe, desk and chairs, wardrobe, and multiple international power points. We have both fan only and air-conditioned rooms available. All rooms come with free 24-hour in-room Wi-Fi. On top of this, we have three bars including two rooftop bars and one pool bar. We serve food and drinks 24 hours a day. Our extensive food menu includes Western, Cambodian, Mexican, and International cuisine. We also have a full range of drinks available including local and international beers, spirits, cocktails, shooters, energy drinks, soft drinks, and fruit juices and shakes. We also have a full range of coffee available including espressos, lattes, cappuccinos, and more. Our kitchen follows HACCP hygiene standards, and our executive chef is Australian with over 20 years’ international kitchen experience. Moreover, we also have an air-conditioned and sound-proofed night club next to our Sky Bar. Moreover, we have a 4m cinema screen playing the latest blockbuster movies and all major sporting events from around the world. We also have a full-sized pool table and two beer pong tables. In the centre of Funky Flashpacker we have a large LED-lit pool with a waterfall, pool games, volleyball, and floating bean bags. Our pool is the location for our popular pool parties where we regularly have live international DJs and artists performing. Our reception features 24-hour check-in, mini-shop, ATM, currency exchange, and you can arrange tickets for all the popular attractions in Siem Reap and surrounding areas, as well as transportation to your next destination. We have a full range of tours available including our popular shared tours of the Angkor Wat complex, floating villages, and other places to see in and around Siem Reap. All our tickets and tours are covered by our “Funky Guarantee”. No other business in Cambodia offers the same guarantee that we do. We have regular discounts and special offers on drinks, food, and accommodation. We have a different event each night of the week, and we have monthly and annual events. We love a party, and regularly host pool parties throughout the day. If you require a pick-up from the airport or bus station, please email us directly with the date, time of arrival, and flight or bus details.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7600022-Reviews-The_Funky_Village-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '319 Funky Lane', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': '319 Funky Lane, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d7600022-The_Funky_Village-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#9 of 449 Specialty lodging in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '449', 'ranking': '9'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,3190,"{'1': '30', '2': '36', '3': '68', '4': '222', '5': '2834'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'r