The Gateway Residency,here:pds:place:116w63gg-ea248183029b4c08abee4f0b3c76a80b,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'The Gateway Residency, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35036, 'lng': 103.85543}","[{'lat': 13.35041, 'lng': 103.8553}]",88600,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5085063'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855964636343'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.350363,103.85544,5085063,The Gateway Residency,"We The Gateway Residency very close to Pub street, Night Market, Old Market, Angkor International Trade Center and hard Rock Cafe. 7 Km from Siem Reap International Airport, 7 Km to World Heritage Site housing the impressive Angkor Wat temple complex. Once you have booked with us we will help you in getting your stay organized. Please let us know what you like to see and how do you like to travel further. We supply you with bus tickets as required. we offer you a free pick up from the Airport / bus station if you stay more than 3 nights. also we offer following services: Laundry services, Tuk Tuk arrangements, Taxi car arrangements, Tour arrangements, Flight tickets, Bus tickets, Boat tickets, Visa arrangements, Bicycle rentals, Motor bike rentals, Entertainment tickets, Massage services, Business information and services, Airport pick and drop and many more.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d5085063-Reviews-The_Gateway_Residency-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Road Wat Domnak', 'street2': 'Wat Damnak Village, Sala Kamroek Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': 'Road Wat Domnak Wat Damnak Village, Sala Kamroek Commune, Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name':