The Globalhub,here:pds:place:116w63gg-26a6009aad7c4f18b5c86e6be95a609c,en,coffee,"{'label': 'The Globalhub, ផ្លូវ ផ្សារកណ្ដាល, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ផ្សារកណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35721, 'lng': 103.85563}","[{'lat': 13.35708, 'lng': 103.85561}]",24544,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]","[{'id': '101-000', 'name': 'American', 'primary': True}, {'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17780338'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855963072829'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.globalteer.org/theglobalhub'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sat: 07:30 - 16:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T073000', 'duration': 'PT08H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.357134,103.85562,17780338,The Globalhub,"The Globalhub Cafe is a social enterprise supporting responsible and sustainable Globalteer projects in Cambodia. At the globalhub cafe we aim to spread awareness on the causes supported by different organisations doing great work in empowering Cambodia, over a coffee and delicious food! All the proceeds from the cafe are invested in our local staff and the Globalteer projects we support.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d17780338-Reviews-The_Globalhub-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'House P3, Central Market Street', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'House P3, Central Market Street, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,theglobalhub@globalteer.org,+85