The Green Carrot,here:pds:place:116httek-a6e800eb3b6703b46bd9d3474c6a19f0,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'The Green Carrot, 160902 បានលុង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'រតនគីរី', 'city': 'បានលុង', 'district': 'ឡាបានសៀក', 'postalCode': '160902'}","{'lat': 13.7384, 'lng': 106.99199}","[{'lat': 13.73838, 'lng': 106.99185}]",11032,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '300-000', 'name': 'European'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7654499'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855719293278'}, {'value': '+85598909453'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/The-Green-Carrot-Restaurant-Bar-568259043694681?_rdc=1&_rdr'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Fri: 08:30 - 22:30', 'Sat: 08:00 - 22:30', 'Sun: 09:00 - 22:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T083000', 'duration': 'PT14H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR'}, {'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT14H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:SA'}, {'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT13H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:SU'}]}]",Ratanakiri,13.738386,106.991875,7654499,The Green Carrot,"The Green Carrot Restaurant& Bar offers a freshly well-prepared meals in town. All our meals are MSG free, we have a Large menu selection on Local dishes, BBQ, Asian, Western and European foods. We have been serving meals in Banlung since 2011 and have many options on fast foods, fingure foods, very healthy salad, freshly home-made pizzas. Fresh fruit juices, smoothies fresh fruit drinks, shakes,ice-cream, local coffee and Many many kind of alcohol Drinks, cocktails, beers, draft beer for $0,50 and local fruit wine, khmer whisky two for one price and Laos beer. We have Happy Hours daily all cocktail is just $2 . We are ready to welcome you to our restuarant in Banlung and you will enjoy All your meals here with us for sure!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g1584758-d7654499-Reviews-The_Green_Carrot-Banlung_Ratanakiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 78A', 'street2': 'Corner of Street 62', 'city': 'Banlung', 'state': 'Ratanakiri Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '855', 'address_string': 'Street 78A Corner of Street 62, Banlung 855 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Banlung', 'location_id': '1584758'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Ratanakiri Province', 'location_id': '608457'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,seayeen@live.co.uk,+855 71 929 3278,https://www.facebook.com/The-Green-Carrot-Restaurant-Bar-568259043694681?_rdc=1&_rdr,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1584758-d7654499-The_Green_Carrot-Banlung_Ratanakiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '1584758', 'ranking_string': '#2 of 16 Places to Eat in Banlung', 'geo_location_name': 'Banlung', 'ranking_out_of': '16', 'ranking': '2'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,134,"{'1': '1', '2': '1', '3': '10', '4': '24', '5': '98'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",49,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g1584758-d7654499-m66827-Reviews-The_Green_Carrot-Banlung_Ratanakiri_Province.html#photos,$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2230'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0830'}, 'close': {'day