The Green Home,here:pds:place:116w63gg-540930655a0046ad866129fb7f6e4a81,en,hostel,"{'label': 'The Green Home, 171209 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សៀមរាប', 'postalCode': '171209'}","{'lat': 13.31599, 'lng': 103.84768}","[{'lat': 13.31611, 'lng': 103.84762}]",86390,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10328398'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593585862'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.thegreenhome.org'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.316049,103.84756,10328398,The Green Home,"Surrounded by paddyfields, our homestay is tranquil, yet it is only 5km away from Siemreap Town. We have a simple restaurant providing breakfast, lunch and dinner. Our tuk tuk drivers are locally based in the village so it is fast to arrange one for you at affordable rate. We also have bicycles for rental. We have 6 rooms, 3 upstairs with fans and 3 downstairs with air-conditioning. We have three modern toilets and our family member speaks good English. The surrounding areas of interest includes an ancient ruin near Wat Athwear, Lotus farm, port to Tonle Sap Lake and local market. We also provide guided tours to see The Lake, Angkor and Mountain. Being a nature lover we run specialised trips to see Dolphins, Elephants and also visit traditional Tribes villages.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d10328398-Reviews-The_Green_Home-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Po Banteaychey Village', 'street2': 'Po Meanchey Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': 'Po Banteaychey Village Po Meanchey Village, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d10328398-The_Green_Home-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#176 of 449 Specialty lodging in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '449', 'ranking': '176'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,9,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '2', '5': '6'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",19,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d10328398-m66827-Reviews-The_Green_Home-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,"['Internet', 'Kids Activities', 'Free Internet', 'Restaurant', 'Kitchenette', 'Wifi', 'Paid Wifi', 'Paid Internet', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Free airport transportation', 'Room service', 'Free parking', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Airport transportation', 'Dry Cleaning', 'Meeting rooms', 'Concierge', 'Air conditioning', 'Family Rooms', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Safe', 'Breakfast Available', 'Housekeeping', 'Bath / Shower', 'Bicycle Rental', 'Bicycle Tours', 'Bottled Water', 'Breakfast in the Room', 'Express Check-in / Che