The Green House,here:pds:place:116w649e-312a409b6dc241ed87686032f109b25c,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'The Green House, ផ្លូវ 488 48, 120112 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារដើមថ្កូវ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 488', 'postalCode': '120112', 'houseNumber': '48'}","{'lat': 11.53393, 'lng': 104.91766}","[{'lat': 11.53408, 'lng': 104.91761}]",22293,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2044118'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523217998'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.533881,104.91748,2044118,The Green House,"If you’re looking for a budget friendly hotel in Phnom Penh, look no further than The Green House.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Bassac Lane (1.5 mi) and Silver Pagoda (2.2 mi), guests of The Green House can easily experience some of Phnom Penh's most well known attractions.
Free wifi is offered to guests, and rooms at The Green House offer air conditioning and a minibar.
If you like seafood restaurants, The Green House is conveniently located near Malis Cambodian Restaurant, Le Broken Plate, and Nesat Seafood House.
Best of all, The Green House makes it easy to experience some great Phnom Penh attractions like Supreme Court, which is a popular government building.
The staff at The Green House looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
