The Green Star Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w63gf-1108738d0e9842728fdf8e9952b3045f,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'The Green Star Restaurant, ផ្លូវខេត្ត 2632, 171209 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សៀមរាប', 'street': 'ផ្លូវខេត្ត 2632', 'postalCode': '171209'}","{'lat': 13.33187, 'lng': 103.84254}","[{'lat': 13.33203, 'lng': 103.84216}]",27605,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569390388'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://thegreenoasis.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.349899,103.84041,12842405,Green Amazon Residence Hotel,Experience the Life of Siem Reap City! We will help you experience Siem Reap life in its true sense. From living among the residents to eating authentic delicacies you are sure to walk home with memories and wonderful moments. Surrounded by scenic beauty and attractive tourist attractions we make it convenient for you to visit all the beautiful places with our in-house guide. We can also help you arrange transport facilities for an easier commute to nearby places.,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12842405-Reviews-Green_Amazon_Residence_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Bijou Bypass Road', 'street2': 'Phum Thmei', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Bijou Bypass Road Phum Thmei, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12842405-Green_Amazon_Residence_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#43