The Happy House Zone,here:pds:place:116aabd1-e6a7e31de4eb09d0f7f4a0596bbe3a54,en,hostel,"{'label': 'The Happy House Zone, ផ្លូវ 172 19, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 172', 'postalCode': '120205', 'houseNumber': '19'}","{'lat': 11.56734, 'lng': 104.92857}","[{'lat': 11.56721, 'lng': 104.92861}]",7027,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9785463'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855963333288'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.567052,104.92667,9785463,The Happy House Zone,"The Happy House Zone is in the center of Phnom Penh. It is only 5 minutes from Riverside and 10 minutes away from the Royal Palace. Central Market is 10 minutes away. There are many types of dormitory for you to choose. You can relax in the common room, complete with pool table and catch up with friends and family over the internet. Free Wi-Fi is available.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d9785463-Reviews-The_Happy_House_Zone-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#122, Street 19, corner Street 172', 'street2': 'close to river side and Royal Palace', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '#122, Street 19, corner Street 172 close to river side and Royal Palace, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d9785463-The_Happy_House_Zone-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#28 of 351 Specialty lodging in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '351', 'ranking': '28'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,257,"{'1':