The Hidden Oasis Bungalows,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-f7b1f3238d8e4829a4ea3ed11839d4ac,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'The Hidden Oasis Bungalows, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.59505, 'lng': 104.15915}","[{'lat': 10.59492, 'lng': 104.15914}]",21272,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '16740834'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512318560'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/The-Hidden-Oasis-Bungalows-322866978550101', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.595543,104.15917,16740834,The Hidden Oasis Bungalows,"The Hidden Oasis Bungalows-Located in Kampot, The Hidden Oasis Bungalows provides a garden and terrace with hot water bath, fridge and mini-bar, 1 or 2 beds, and private balconies. Small restaurant in the front. On International Village road, less than 10 minutes out of town towards SihanoukVille, around Bohemiaz Resort and The Orchid Bokor Boutique.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d16740834-Reviews-The_Hidden_Oasis_Bungalows-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'International Village Road', 'street2': 'Angdong Khmer Village', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'International Village Road Angdong Khmer Village, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d16740834-The_Hidden_Oasis_Bungalows-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '