The Hideaway,here:pds:place:116w3fhd-e7dc48d7914d48938614112ef1234182,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'The Hideaway, 070203 ទឹកឈូរ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'ទឹកឈូរ', 'district': 'កំពង់ក្រែង', 'postalCode': '070203'}","{'lat': 10.64812, 'lng': 104.17252}","[{'lat': 10.64824, 'lng': 104.17258}]",22805,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House'}]","[{'id': '101-000', 'name': 'American', 'primary': True}, {'id': '102-000', 'name': 'Mexican'}, {'id': '308-000', 'name': 'British Isles'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17607173'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25149963'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25161829'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516367304'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/hideawaykampot/?_rdc=1&_rdr', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011'}], 'text': ['Tue-Sun: 16:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T160000', 'duration': 'PT05H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kampot,10.647933,104.17224,17607173,The Hideaway,"Located on Kampot river, The Hideaway is a guesthouse restaurant and bar, surrounded by nature and with beautiful sunset views. We offer hot shower fan and a/c bungalows, and ac dorm beds. Our kitchen serves a variety of western comfort food dishes with vegan, veggie and meat options. We are equipped with a high dive into the river, spring boards and a Russian swing. This family run business was established in 2018 and in 2022 all of our rooms have been renovated to meet your needs. Enjoy the beautiful sunset in our fully equipped bar with frozen cocktails, cold fresh beer and fresh fruit juice. Our friendly staff can help you organise tours and plan your onward travel. We welcome you to join us and make yourself at home.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g19820308-d17607173-Reviews-The_Hideaway-Makprang_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Red Road', 'city': 'Makprang', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Red Road, Makprang 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Makprang', 'location_id': '19820308'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g19820308-d17607173-The_Hideaway-Makprang_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '19820308', 'ranking_string': '#2 of 6 Specialty lodging in Makprang', 'geo_location_name': 'Makprang', 'ranking_out_of': '6', 'ranking': '2'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,11,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '0', '5': '10'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",12,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g19820308-d17607173-m66827-Reviews-The_Hideaway-Makprang_Kampot_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Shuttle Bus Service', 'F