The Hive,here:pds:place:116aabd1-03efd97fea220ed4c7c5662f41de4e62,en,coffee,"{'label': 'The Hive, ផ្លូវ ផ្សារកណ្ដាល, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ផ្សារកណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35686, 'lng': 103.85739}","[{'lat': 13.35677, 'lng': 103.85737}]",24448,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}, {'id': '600-6300-0064', 'name': 'Food/Beverage Specialty Store'}]","[{'id': '150-000', 'name': 'Australian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4559229'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855765555437'}, {'value': '+855977633484'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/thehive.siemreap', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 18:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT11H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.356783,103.85739,4559229,The Hive,"Known for its superb coffee and a distinctly inner city vibe, The Hive is a bustling social hub for expats and tourists alike. Since its conception in 2013, this Australian owned, locally managed cafe has cemented itself as Siem Reap favourite. If you're a coffee lover, a brunch goer, a juice detoxer, or simply looking for a touch of home, The Hive awaits.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d4559229-Reviews-The_Hive-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '631 Psar Kandal Street', 'street2': 'behind Riviera Hotel', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '631 Psar Kandal Street behind Riviera Hotel, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'loca