The Kampot Pepper Shop,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-97cb03b0538b4db49fe764f4eda5411f,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'The Kampot Pepper Shop, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60759, 'lng': 104.18035}","[{'lat': 10.60757, 'lng': 104.18022}]",26093,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0006', 'name': 'Deli'}, {'id': '600-6300-0067', 'name': 'Specialty Food Store'}, {'id': '600-6900-0103', 'name': 'Gift, Antique & Art'}]","[{'id': '800-075', 'name': 'Seafood', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian'}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '300-000', 'name': 'European'}, {'id': '800-064', 'name': 'International'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10819469'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15668350'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27726969'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512691379', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0006'}, {'id': '600-6300-0067'}, {'id': '600-6900-0103'}]}, {'value': '+85587548900'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.botree.asia', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0006'}, {'id': '600-6300-0067'}, {'id': '600-6900-0103'}]}, {'value': 'https://www.kampotseafoodpepperrestaurant-cookingclass.com', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '600-6900-0103'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 20:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}, {'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 10:00 - 23:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T100000', 'duration': 'PT13H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kampot,10.607884,104.180435,10819469,The Kampot Pepper Shop,"The Kampot Pepper Shop specialises in selling and educating people about the King of Spices, Kampot Pepper. We sell Black, Red and White peppercorns, salted pepper, Fleur de Sel and more, and are happy to explain the story and history behind the world's best pepper. Used by top chefs the world over, Kampot Pepper is the only pepper to be awarded PGI (Protected Geographic Indication) Status, recognised by the EU.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g608455-d10819469-Reviews-The_Kampot_Pepper_Shop-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Old Market Street', 'street2': 'Kampong Bay', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07453', 'address_string': 'Old Market Street Kampong Bay, Kampot 07453 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,pepper@botree.asia,+855 12 691 379,http://www.botree.asia,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d10819469-The_Kampot_Pepper_Shop-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#4 of 11 Shopping in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '11', 'ranking': '4'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,46,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '5', '5': '39'}",Not available,74,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g608455-d10819469-m66827-Reviews-The_Kampot_Pepper_Shop-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2000'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '08