The Khemara Battambang I Hotel,here:pds:place:116w636s-1c7a8b47938e4fb49ef48f5741695910,en,hotel,"{'label': 'The Khemara Battambang I Hotel, 021405 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្លាកែត', 'postalCode': '021405'}","{'lat': 13.11594, 'lng': 103.20302}","[{'lat': 13.11592, 'lng': 103.20316}]",13943,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1166587'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85553737878'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.khemarahotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.116004,103.2027,1166587,The Khemara Battambang I Hotel,"The Khemara Battambang I Hotel is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Battambang, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Nearby landmarks such as Battambang Crocodile Farm (0.4 mi) and White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (1.1 mi) make The Khemara Battambang I Hotel a great place to stay when visiting Battambang.
The rooms offer a minibar, air conditioning, and a refrigerator, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
The Khemara Battambang I Hotel features a 24 hour front desk, room service, and a sun terrace. In addition, as a valued The Khemara Battambang I Hotel guest, you can enjoy a pool and free breakfast that are available on-site. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
Battambang has plenty of wine bars. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like VINTAGE and Libations Bar, which are serving up some great dishes.
Looking to explore? Then look no further than HUMAN Gallery - Joseba Etxebarria Photography (1.2 mi), which is a popular Battambang attraction – and it is conveniently located within walking distance of the hotel.
Enjoy your stay in Battambang!
