The Little Red Fox Espresso,here:pds:place:116aabd1-d63b1f276d1200ad6d6d7496572c083c,en,coffee,"{'label': 'The Little Red Fox Espresso, ផ្លូវ ហាប់ កួន, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ហាប់ កួន', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35741, 'lng': 103.85662}","[{'lat': 13.35728, 'lng': 103.8566}]",24457,"[{'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7205637'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516669724'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.thelittleredfoxespresso.com'}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1100-0010'}], 'text': ['Mon, Tue, Thu-Sun: 07:00 - 19:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.357332,103.85661,7205637,The Little Red Fox Espresso,"The Little Red Fox Espresso is all about the coffee. The concept is simple; a well made espresso embodies the pure essence of coffee. Australian owned & Cambodian run The Fox strongly believes in creating a unique atmosphere. It's one of those characteristic little places where local Cambodian art and music are celebrated and social responsibility comes first. Featuring a variety of brewing techniques complemented by a delicious foxy menu its no wonder this cafe has quickly become one of the favourite spots in town for both locals and expats. Don't be surprised if you often hear ""See you at the Fox'! The Little Red Fox Espresso - Honest Coffee",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d7205637-Reviews-The_Little_Red_Fox_Espresso-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '593 Hap Guan St', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': '593 Hap Guan St, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'le