The Living Room,here:pds:place:116w3csh-f2f3dda409cd4c2ba8e9dff42ac5a499,en,hostel,"{'label': 'The Living Room, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.56704, 'lng': 103.56075}","[{'lat': 10.56697, 'lng': 103.56063}]",85632,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7361916'}]",[{'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/otreslivingroom'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.567004,103.56069,7361916,The Living Room,"The Living Room has a chill, homey vibe featuring a unique bar with a high, sweeping roof nestled in the trees of the peaceful Otres Village. Accommodation includes large, 2-story cottages with an upstairs sleeping loft and a downstairs living room. We've added new bungalows this year that are single story and all rooms include bathrooms. Hot shower available. A spacious dorm is also available with a special bed/meal/drink deal. The restaurant specializes in Western home-cooked food, featuring specials throughout the week like Chicken and Dumplings or Moroccan Meatballs. Relax in a hammock and try one of our delicious specialty cocktails like a Passion Fruit Margarita or a Moscow-ccino. Around the corner from the famous Otres Market and the estuary where you can rent a kayak and paddle through the mangroves, we are just a 15 minute walk from the beach. With a lot of new, exciting development this season, there is a lot to do- visit an absinthe distillery, go fishing, paintball, enjoy weekly bar trivia, lots of parties, horse riding, and more.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d7361916-Reviews-The_Living_Room-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '4 Sangkat', 'street2': 'Otres Village', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': '4 Sangkat Otres Village, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d7361916-The_Living_Room-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#44 of 277 Specialty lodging in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out_of': '277', 'ranking': '44'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,24,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '2', '4': '1', '5': '20'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",69,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d7361916-m66827-Reviews-The_Living_Room-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Suites', 'Free Internet', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Fre