The Lodger Siem Reap,here:pds:place:116aabd1-7196475a721906dd0b6ce9900db30ab5,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'The Lodger Siem Reap, 171206 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ជ្រាវ', 'postalCode': '171206'}","{'lat': 13.33419, 'lng': 103.87074}","[{'lat': 13.3343, 'lng': 103.87082}]",25545,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11947877'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855965592157'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.334109,103.87068,11947877,The Lodger Siem Reap,"The Lodger is located in the country side of Siem Reap, Cambodia; only 4 kilometres away from the city (about 10 minutes). The surrounding areas are rich with nature and farm lands, bringing you a true sense of calm and of what Cambodia has to offer. The Lodger is best suited for groups of friends, as well as families who seek to enjoy a more peaceful environment.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d11947877-Reviews-The_Lodger_Siem_Reap-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Sala Kamreuk Road', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17355', 'address_string': 'Sala Kamreuk Road, Siem Reap 17355 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d11947877-The_Lodger_Siem_Reap-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#206 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '206'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,12,"{'1': '0', '2': '0',