The Lonely Tree Cafe,here:pds:place:116aabd1-2016f5310bab0d20460a6d9bfa9df3ca,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'The Lonely Tree Cafe, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.0998, 'lng': 103.19785}","[{'lat': 13.09982, 'lng': 103.19771}]",12423,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]","[{'id': '311-034', 'name': 'Spanish - Tapas', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian'}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '300-000', 'name': 'European'}, {'id': '800-066', 'name': 'Fusion'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4174610'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510553755'}, {'value': '+85553953123'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.thelonelytreecafe.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 10:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T100000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Battambang,13.099809,103.19779,4174610,The Lonely Tree Cafe,"The Lonely Tree Café is a social enterprise with the goal to obtain profits to help finance the social projects of the Apostolic Prefecture of Battambang. The projects we support cover a wide range of humanitarian aid including education, support for the disabled, healthcare and preservation of Cambodian cultural heritage. At the Lonely Tree Café we give employment to underprivileged and disabled people: the staff consist of vulnerable youth and most of the products sold in the Lonely Tree Store are crafted by people with physical disabilities who are in permanent need.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g303666-d4174610-Reviews-The_Lonely_Tree_Cafe-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 56, Street 2.5', 'street2': '20 ousaphea Village, Svaypoa Commune, Batttambang', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'No. 56, Street 2.5 20 ousaphea Village, Svaypoa Commune, Batttambang, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,thelonelytreecafe@gmail.com,+855 10 553 755,http://www.thelonelytreecafe.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d4174610-The_Lonely_Tree_Cafe-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#9 of 138 Places to Eat in Battambang', 'geo_location_name': 'Battambang', 'ranking_out_of': '138', 'ranking': '9'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,468,"{'1': '8', '2': '10', '3': '31', '4': '92', '5': '327'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",186,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g303666-d4174610-m66827-Reviews-The_Lonely_Tree_Cafe-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html#photos,$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1000'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2200'}}, {'open': {'day': 5,