The Moon Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w62cn-7256055e14ba498886b78962a5af418c,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'The Moon Restaurant, 230201 ប៉ៃលិន, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បៃលិន', 'city': 'ប៉ៃលិន', 'district': 'ប៉ៃលិន', 'postalCode': '230201'}","{'lat': 12.84059, 'lng': 102.60739}","[{'lat': 12.84063, 'lng': 102.60751}]",6107,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512444263'}]}],Not Available,Pailin,12.86307,102.56554,2723060,Memoria Palace & Resort,"Memoria Palace & Resort is an eco-tourism resort located in the foothills of the Cardamom Mountains of Pailin, Cambodia. The resort spans over 13 lush hectares and features 16 beautiful bungalows, 3 unique traditional style thatched eco-lodges, a hilltop saltwater swimming pool, open space restaurant & outdoor bar, and a large conference room. Memoria is a hidden gem with inviting appeal, magnificent views across the countryside, fresh clean air and an invigorating breeze coming off the mountains. Our location provides the perfect environment for a variety of retreats, peaceful relaxation, personal rejuvenation or adventurous outdoor activities. Overall Pailin is an ideal place to base yourself for sightseeing, cycling, hiking, trekking excursions and guided tours into the Cardamom Mountains, one of Southeast Asia's best preserved wilderness areas which hosts an abundance of unique species which are now endangered thoughout much of South East Asia.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g2040763-d2723060-Reviews-Memoria_Palace_Resort-Pailin_Pailin_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Highway 57', 'city': 'Pailin', 'state': 'Pailin Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02455', 'address_string': 'National Highway 57, Pailin 02455 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Pailin', 'location_id': '2040763'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Pailin Province', 'location_id': '2366671'}, {'le