The One by Nika,here:pds:place:116w63gg-5da26217d42108cb044384564e4a5d15,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'The One by Nika, ផ្លូវ 7 មករ, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 7 មករ', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35199, 'lng': 103.85936}","[{'lat': 13.35187, 'lng': 103.85931}]",24721,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27190201'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592938686'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://theonebynika.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.352077,103.8594,27190201,The One By Nika,"Welcome to The One by Nika, a cozy and friendly Bed and Breakfast located in the vibrant heart of Siem Reap. This small, family-run B&B offers a simple yet comfortable stay, with 15 clean and quiet rooms that ensure a restful night's sleep for every guest.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d27190201-Reviews-The_One_By_Nika-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '617, 7 Makara Street', 'street2': 'Wat Bo Village', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': '617, 7 Makara Street Wat Bo Village, Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d27190201-The_One_By_Nika-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#263 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '263'}",5,https://w