The Peace House,here:pds:place:116w63u6-f5fa52b2c72fd467a92822545025b566,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'The Peace House, 171211 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ទឹកវិល', 'postalCode': '171211'}","{'lat': 13.41149, 'lng': 103.80179}","[{'lat': 13.41136, 'lng': 103.8018}]",83619,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '20888515'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569777767'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/peacehousesiemreap'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.41159,103.8018,20888515,The Peace House,"Enjoy the bliss of The Peace House in the outskirt of Siem Reap, ideally located only 4km away from Angkor Wat temple. Relax in this calm, blissful space, with garden view. There are 6 private bedrooms next to one another; 3 double beds and 3 twins overlooking the garden. And, there are two other Private Villas as well. There is spacious garden where you can enjoy outdoor dining from breakfast 7am to lunch and dinner till 10pm, serving typical Khmer food highly recommended by all local customers.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d20888515-Reviews-The_Peace_House-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road 6', 'street2': 'Siem Reap International Airport', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'National Road 6 Siem Reap International Airport, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d20888515-The_Peace_House-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not