The Peak at Shangri-la,here:pds:place:116w649d-a178f93d6f96476f8ade83b77a73bfc8,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'The Peak at Shangri-la, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.55, 'lng': 104.93613}","[{'lat': 11.54987, 'lng': 104.93613}]",22427,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85597313589'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.thepeakcambodia.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.559049,104.9345,5813574,Japanese Noodle Bar  Shangri-La,"Japanese Noodle Bar ""Shangri-La"" is speciality restaurant of Ramen.The Ramen is original flavor from Hokkaido, Japan.You can taste a full-fledged soup stewed politely.Let's try the specialty taste!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d5813574-Reviews-Japanese_Noodle_Bar_Shangri_La-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 477 Sisovath Street,Chaktomuk Commune', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '# 477 Sisovath Street,Chaktomuk Commune, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,ppshangrila@gmail.com,+855 77 773 022,http://www.facebook.com/ramen.shangrila/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d5813574-Japanese_Noodle_Bar_Shangri_La-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#297 of 1,983 Places to Eat in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '1983', 'ranking': '297'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,37,"{'1': '2', '2': '1', '3': '1', '4': '19', '5': '14'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://s