The Peninsula Phnom Penh,here:pds:place:116w649g-4dde3f2713e6a03d3c089e8788b071d8,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'The Peninsula Phnom Penh, ផ្លូវ កែវចិន្តា, 121001 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ជ្រោយចង្វារ', 'subdistrict': 'ជ្រោយចង្វារ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ កែវចិន្តា', 'postalCode': '121001'}","{'lat': 11.58912, 'lng': 104.92941}","[{'lat': 11.58899, 'lng': 104.92937}]",71355,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '24834646'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570911222'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://thepeninsula-cambodia.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.589197,104.92944,24834646,The Peninsula Phnom Penh,"Located in Phnom Penh, with a short distance from Embassies and Financial district area, The Peninsula Phnom Penh offers accommodations with complimentary Wi-Fi throughout, shared lounge Clubhouse and free private indoor parking on site. Boasting floor-to-ceiling windows overlooking skyscrapers and the Mekong and Tonle Sap Rivers, all rooms are equipped with a complete range of in-room facilities. Each unit is highly secured by a key card access system and the room temperature can be adjusted by guests individually. The flat-screen TV offers cable channels and Video on Demand for guests' enjoyment. A living room and a fully-fitted kitchen are available in every room types. Extras include an electric kettle, coffee/tea facilities and free bottles of water. The private bathroom comes with either a shower or a bathtub and is equipped with premium organic and made in Cambodia amenities, including dental kits. Our rooftop Infinity Pool has one of the nicest views in Phnom Penh, and designed for indulgence and casual swimming. The sunbathing terrace is a perfect place for guests who simply love to get tanned. A hot tub and a kid’s pool are also available. The fitness with sauna is open daily for 24 hours and features several professional grade machines to keep guests healthy during their stay. Friendly staff are standby at the front desk throughout the day and night to assist all guests whenever possible. Surcharged airport shuttle services can be arranged upon request. The hotel allows easy access to transportation services to get around Phnom Pen. Several shopping centers and recreational attractions are located within a short distance. The Phnom Penh International Airport is 14 km respectively from The Peninsula Phnom Penh.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d24834646-Reviews-The_Peninsula_Phnom_Penh-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 3G, Keo Chenda St', 'street2': 'Sangkat Chroy Changvar, Khan Chroy Changvar', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'No. 3G, Keo Chenda St Sangkat Chroy Changvar, Khan Chroy Changvar, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d24834646-The_Peninsula_Phnom_Penh-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '1'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,1008,"{'1': '0', '2': '4', '3': '4', '4': '6', '5': '995'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'locali