The Plantation,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-758a33fd32144469a317437611d70201,en,hostel,"{'label': 'The Plantation, 070804 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'អណ្ដូងខ្មែរ', 'postalCode': '070804'}","{'lat': 10.60247, 'lng': 104.17566}","[{'lat': 10.60241, 'lng': 104.17555}]",19877,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10621507'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570438567'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.602605,104.17596,10621507,The Plantation,"As a crow flies, The Plantation is only 5 minutes from downtown. It is surrounded by many trees and flowers. The property is in a very peaceful setting in a quite area with a Volleyball Court and Boules. Rooms are housed in two dormitory buildings, one is a Khmer-style house while the other is made entirely out of bamboo. The property has 5 shared bathrooms that include shower facilities.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d10621507-Reviews-The_Plantation-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Thvi Kanng Tbong', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '13205', 'address_string': 'Thvi Kanng Tbong, Kampot 13205 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d10621507-The_Plantation-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#27 of 115 Specialty lodging in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '115', 'ranking': '27'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,24,"