The Playroom,here:pds:place:116w649g-8273fab25741757036b05f54b29f7b5a,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'The Playroom, ផ្លូវ 524, 120407 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ទួលគោក', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកក់ទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 524', 'postalCode': '120407'}","{'lat': 11.58161, 'lng': 104.90107}","[{'lat': 11.58148, 'lng': 104.9011}]",4310,"[{'id': '550-5520-0000', 'name': 'Leisure', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23837725'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570302525'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/theplayroomkh'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 11:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T110000', 'duration': 'PT13H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.5819,104.900986,23837725,The Playroom,"The playroom is set over 3 floors and covers 900m2. This is your ultimate indoor entertainment center which includes coffee shop, restaurant, bar, and games like archery, axe throwing, foot pool, pool, beerpong, and many more!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d23837725-Reviews-The_Playroom-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#9 St 287', 'street2': 'Tuol Kork', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '#9 St 287 Tuol Kork, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,theplayroomkh@gmail.com,+855 70 302 525,http://www.facebook.com/theplayroomkh,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d23837725-The_Playroom-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#21 of 50 Fun &amp; Games in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '50', 'ranking': '21'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,3,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '0',