The Pudding Club,here:pds:place:116w63gg-be10447896240caee270bd495bac4252,en,coffee,"{'label': 'The Pudding Club, ច្រកផ្លូវ ហ្វាំងគី, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ច្រកផ្លូវ ហ្វាំងគី', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35601, 'lng': 103.85021}","[{'lat': 13.35599, 'lng': 103.85035}]",88330,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]","[{'id': '308-000', 'name': 'British Isles', 'primary': True}, {'id': '800-064', 'name': 'International'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25570575'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516722353'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.thepuddingclub.asia'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon: 17:00 - 23:00', 'Tue-Sat: 14:00 - 23:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T170000', 'duration': 'PT06H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO'}, {'start': 'T140000', 'duration': 'PT09H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.355991,103.85032,25570575,The Pudding Club,"Creative, inspired, and heartwarming. Our desserts are meticulously crafted in-house, from homemade classics, to modern twists on old favourites. Our gin selection is engineered to complement the wide range of flavour profiles from around the world. Funky Milkshakes, freakshakes and floats, alongside our uniquely designed Mocktails provide taste sensations for all ages. Add in our contemporary twist on a traditional English afternoon cream tea, and the Pudding Club represents a bucket list staple whilst enjoying your time in Siem Reap.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d25570575-Reviews-The_Pudding_Club-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '533 Funky Lane', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': '533 Funky Lane, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': '