The Rooftop Cafe Canteen,here:pds:place:116w636s-9e6890fd90da4dc5a8acaa406aef7806,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'The Rooftop Cafe Canteen, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09939, 'lng': 103.20368}","[{'lat': 13.09926, 'lng': 103.20366}]",99791,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '19500660'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85595521432'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/romcheik5rooftop'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 10:00 - 18:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T100000', 'duration': 'PT08H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Battambang,13.099354,103.203674,19500660,The Rooftop Cafe Canteen,"Located on the rooftop of Romcheik 5 Artspace, it is the ideal place to eat & drink while recovering from your emotions after visiting the museum and art galleries . Open from 10 to 17 h for brunch , lunch or afternoon tea, we promise the nice view with fresh air. We believe that the combination of authentic art, beautiful space and high quality food & beverage could create an authentic experience. With the act of environment care, we use bamboo straw and reusable glass instead of the plastic.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g303666-d19500660-Reviews-The_Rooftop_Cafe_Canteen-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 201A', 'street2': 'The Rooftop Café Canteen', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02353', 'address_string': 'Street 201A The Rooftop Café Canteen, Battambang 02353 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang 