The Safari,here:pds:place:116w3fq1-827672c067a14e8fb20c40f090ff7612,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'The Safari, 070706 ជុំគីរី, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'ជុំគីរី', 'district': 'ស្រែសំរោង', 'postalCode': '070706'}","{'lat': 10.9244, 'lng': 104.49814}","[{'lat': 10.92441, 'lng': 104.498}]",25113,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}, {'id': '500-5100-0056', 'name': 'Campground'}, {'id': '700-7200-0324', 'name': 'Apartment/Flat Rental'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15668593'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85587888880', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0000'}, {'id': '500-5100-0056'}, {'id': '700-7200-0324'}]}, {'value': '+85598778970'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/thesafariglamping/?ref=page_internal', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.924396,104.498146,15668593,The Safari Resort,"Designer Vireak Chandara discovered the paradise ""Mlech Dam"" in 2018 – a breathtaking spot with a ring of mountains and a lake. Inspired, he created The Safari, an exclusive campsite with unique lotus tents (launched in 2019). The love for nature resonated with guests, and Dara envisioned an evolution. He craved to offer on-site accommodations while maintaining a natural connection. The answer? Diamond-shaped cabins, mirror the tents but with added comfort. Over two years, Dara and his wife transformed the site. Challenges were met, and ten magnificent diamond cabins rose. The Safari boasts a one-of-a-kind design, with meticulous attention to detail both inside and out. As a dedicated artist, Dara is constantly refining the décor and crafting exciting outdoor activities. The Safari is an ongoing masterpiece, a testament to Dara's vision. Experience tranquility embraced by the brilliance of a diamond. The Safari is just 100km away from Phnom Penh via NR3 and NR45.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d15668593-Reviews-The_Safari_Resort-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Romlech Dam Path', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07201', 'address_string': 'Romlech Dam Path, Kampot 07201 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,1.19E+12,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d15668593-The_Safari_Resort-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#18 of 88 hotels in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '88', 'ranking': '18'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,9,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '2', '5': '7'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",41,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d15668593-m66827-Reviews-The_Safari_Resort-Kampot_Kampot_Province.ht