The Sanctuary Villa Battambang,here:pds:place:116w636s-05ebc0256b884c87ab8b30925b0f9900,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'The Sanctuary Villa Battambang, 021404 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ចម្ការសំរោង', 'postalCode': '021404'}","{'lat': 13.11231, 'lng': 103.20121}","[{'lat': 13.11244, 'lng': 103.20124}]",13538,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1766117'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512226505'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.112297,103.20121,1766117,The Sanctuary Villa,"The Sanctuary Villa, Battambang Town, Cambodia Nested in a lushly green, peaceful, and strategically located within the charming town area of Battambang, The Sanctuary is truly a great base for travelers who wish to explore this local town and its surrounding attractions. The Sanctuary only offers ten unique and individual tropical villas for single, double, triple or family occupies to ensure utmost comfort and privacy of our guests.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d1766117-Reviews-The_Sanctuary_Villa-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 413 Tea Cham Rath Street', 'street2': 'Phum Chrey Kong, Sangkat Slaket, 250 M from Battambang Boat Pier', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'No. 413 Tea Cham Rath Street Phum Chrey Kong, Sangkat Slaket, 250 M from Battambang Boat Pier, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d1766117-The_Sanctuary_Villa-Battamban