The Sangkum Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-b6c914fe443c0b022903150699d2dd7b,en,hotel,"{'label': 'The Sangkum Hotel, ផ្លូវ ព្រះបុទុមសូរិយាវង្ស, 120210 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ស្រះចក', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ព្រះបុទុមសូរិយាវង្ស', 'postalCode': '120210'}","{'lat': 11.58004, 'lng': 104.91762}","[{'lat': 11.58006, 'lng': 104.91782}]",72897,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3635685'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855962860106'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.580173,104.91761,3635685,The Sangkum Hotel,"The Sangkum is a boutique hotel conveniently located in a residential area which used to be the old french colonial heart of Phnom Penh during the protectorate. A quiet area close to Wat Phnom, the French embassy and Calmette hospital. Main touristic attractions are within 5 minutes drive by tuk tuk. The villa is inspired from the Sangkum era. We have 12 spacious and comfortable rooms, with a luxurious garden and a swimming pool perfectly spotted to cool down after a tough working day or a sightseeingtrip in the heat of Phnom Penh. Out of sight from the street, the garden and the swimming pool offer you a private and calm area. The restaurant is entirely outdoor and is directly linked with the garden, the patio and its bar, creating a large and cool open space. Our dedicated staff will take care of all your needs and make your stay an unforgettable moment during your trip in Cambodia.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d3635685-Reviews-The_Sangkum_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '75 35a Street', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '75 35a Street, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country'