The School of Art,here:pds:place:116w649f-592f662548764de0a2775d67a768f78a,en,gallery,"{'label': 'The School of Art, 120406 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ទួលគោក', 'subdistrict': 'ទឹកល្អក់ទី បី', 'postalCode': '120406'}","{'lat': 11.56082, 'lng': 104.89123}","[{'lat': 11.56095, 'lng': 104.89122}]",3061,"[{'id': '600-6900-0096', 'name': 'Specialty Store', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593709997'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.564992,104.927216,6560759,Champey Academy of Arts,"Champey Academy of Arts is a non-profit art professional school in Phnom Penh working to preserve, protect and promote Cambodian Culture. The school is earning fund from its welcome service and a small souvenir shop in order to give scholarship for children from poor families and/or from disadvantaged living condition to have chances to learn and experience their culture. This school currentlyl gives 5 classes: 1) Cambodian Traditional Dance; 2) Cambodian Traditional Music; 3) Cambodian Traditional CHAPEY DANGWENG (Cambodian Traditional musical instrument similarly to western guitar); 4) Cambodian Traditional Painting; 5) Comtemporary Art. Welcome Service: The guest relation team will give their warm welcome to any single guest with brief history and orientation about Khmer traditional dance and some fun facts about this country culture for suggested donation $3 - $5 per guest. Champey Souvenir Shop: In it, there are many unique products related to this country culture and daily which mostly cannot be found in wherelse in the city. This shop also sells the art work done its art class students for motivation and benefit of their study.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d6560759-Reviews-Champey_Academy_of_Arts-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '1E0Z, Street 19Z', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '1E0Z, Street 19Z, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@champeyacademy.org,+855 23 555 2057,http://www.champeyacademy.org,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d6560759-Champey_Academy_of_Arts-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#6 of 49 Classes &amp; Workshops in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '49', 'ranking': '6'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,80,"{'1': '0', '2': '1', '3': '0', '4': '10', '5': '69'}",Not available,135,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d6560759-m66827-Reviews-Champey_Academy_of_Arts-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1100'}}, {'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '1330'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1100'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '1330'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1100'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '1330'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1100'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '1330'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1100'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '1330'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0730'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1100'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '1330'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1700'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 07:30 - 11:00,  13:30 - 17:00', 'Tuesday: 07:30 - 11:00,  13:30 - 17:00', 'Wednesday: 07:30 - 11:00,  13:30 - 17:00', 'Thursday: 07:30 - 11:00,  13:30 - 17:00', 'Friday: 07:30 - 11:00,  13:30 - 17: