The Shade Hostel,here:pds:place:116w649e-39f9c1e334ed41329e7fe972d828fa9a,en,hostel,"{'label': 'The Shade Hostel, ផ្លូវ 310 113, 120104 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 310', 'postalCode': '120104', 'houseNumber': '113'}","{'lat': 11.55104, 'lng': 104.92028}","[{'lat': 11.5509, 'lng': 104.92028}]",6403,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12848345'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578325788'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.550996,104.91785,12848345,The Shade Hostel,"The Shade Hostel, a family-run hostel located in Beungkengkorng area, the prime area in Phnom Penh, Cambodia offers travelers comfortable clean beds in a safe environment. It is located in a convenient business zone with shops, restaurants and expatriate offices all in walking distances. We have two mixed dorm rooms, and a private room, all with secured luggage lockers and space.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d12848345-Reviews-The_Shade_Hostel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '113 125a, Street', 'street2': '30 meters north of corner St 310 / St 113), Beungkengkorng 2, Chamkamon', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '113 125a, Street 30 meters north of corner St 310 / St 113), Beungkengkorng 2, Chamkamon, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d12848345-The_Shade_Hostel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#77 of 351 Specialty lodging in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '351', 'ranking': '77'}",5,https://www.trip