The Shape Coffee,here:pds:place:116w63gg-19a2e55c50e44951a03ca3bbd80a4cd9,en,coffee,"{'label': 'The Shape Coffee, វិថី វត្តបូ, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'street': 'វិថី វត្តបូ', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35404, 'lng': 103.85869}","[{'lat': 13.35398, 'lng': 103.85881}]",24594,"[{'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15247674'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515876545'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 21:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT14H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.354035,103.85869,15247674,The Shape Coffee,"The Shape Coffee front to find where the locals choose to dine whatever the time of day. Whether you are yearning for your first coffee after an early morning dip in the ocean, a light lunch after a morning with the kids at the beach or an affordable way to dine as the sun sets The Shape Coffee Manly has the quality of food and service to improve your day.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d15247674-Reviews-The_Shape_Coffee-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 26, Watbo Village, Sangkat Sala Kamrouek,', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': 'Street 26, Watbo Village, Sangkat Sala Kamrouek,, Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@theshape-coffee.com,+855 15 876 545,http://www.theshape-coffee.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d15247674-The_Shape_Coffee-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_locati