The Share Phnom Penh Hostel,here:pds:place:116w649g-2b6dd3f866034e798b6230e4b888813d,en,hostel,"{'label': 'The Share Phnom Penh Hostel, ផ្លូវ 19, 120208 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ជ័យជំនះ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 19', 'postalCode': '120208'}","{'lat': 11.5645, 'lng': 104.92758}","[{'lat': 11.56456, 'lng': 104.92773}]",6929,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11718652'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85570303086'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.563291,104.92013,293940,Phnom Penh,"Budget-minded travelers will appreciate Phnom Penh's reasonably priced hotel rooms. Explore the city's temples, palaces, and the remnants of its French colonial history. Just outside the city, the The Killing Fields (Choeung Ek) are a reminder of Cambodia's tragic past-- a somber contrast to the booming city of today.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Tourism-g293940-Phnom_Penh-Vacations.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '', 'street2': '', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Tourism-g293940-m66827-Phnom_Penh-Vacations.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'geographic', 'localized_name': 'Geographic'}","[{'name': 'city', 'localized_name': 'City'}]",Not available,Not available,[],Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,FALSE,29,14
The Sharx Pub,here:pds:place:116w636s-3e9c2c16c6634f299bacb9708ef9c3c9,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'The Sharx Pub, 021410 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ស្វាយប៉ោ', 'postalCode': '021410'}","{'lat': 13.09343, 'lng': 103.19609}","[{'lat': 13.09347, 'lng': 103.19622}]",11877,"[{'id': '200-2000-0306', 'name': 'Adult Entertainment', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515858580'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.099809,103.19779,4174610,The Lonely Tree Cafe,"The Lonely Tree Café is a social enterprise with the goal to obtain profits to help finance the social projects of the Apostolic Prefecture of Battambang. The projects we support cover a wide range of humanitarian aid including education, support for the disabled, healthcare and preservation of Cambodian cultural heritage. At the Lonely Tree Café we give employment to underprivileged and disabled people: the staff consist of vulnerable youth and most of the products sold in the Lonely Tree Store are crafted by people with physical disabilities who are in permanent need.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g303666-d4174610-Reviews-The_Lonely_Tree_Cafe-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 56, Street 2.5', 'street2': '20 ousaphea Village, Svaypoa Commune, Batttambang', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'No. 56, Street 2.5 20 ousaphea Village, Svaypoa Commune, Batttambang, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,thelonelytreecafe@gmail.com,+855 10 553 755,http://www.thelon