The Siem Reap Chilled Backpacker,here:pds:place:116w63gu-58606631e8a24e4c833a2a8b36f63cb6,en,hostel,"{'label': 'The Siem Reap Chilled Backpacker, 170505 ប្រាសាទបាគង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'ប្រាសាទបាគង', 'district': 'កណ្ដែក', 'postalCode': '170505'}","{'lat': 13.33684, 'lng': 103.91041}","[{'lat': 13.33684, 'lng': 103.91028}]",23089,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515533789'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.chilledbackpacker.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.339893,103.89824,1893399,Siem Reap Tour Guide,"Siem Reap Tour Guide is an experienced local owned tour guide team based in Angkor Wat Cambodia and we are celebrating 20 years in travel industry. We are specialized in offering a private Angkor customized tours and shared small group Angkor Wat tours ( 4 up to 12 pax ) with professional Cambodia tour guide and safe driver transportation services ( Minibus /Minivan /SUV /4WD /Car/Jeep/Bike/Tuk Tuk ) for the Siem Reap Angkor region tours, countryside tours, remote sites such as ( Phnom Kulen, Khbal Spean, Bantey Srei, Beng Mealea, Koh Ker, Sambor Prey Kuk, Bantey Chhmar, Preah Khan Kompong Svay, Preah Vihear ), floating/fishing village on the Great Tonle Sap Lake ( Kompong Khleang & Kampong Phluk ), Battambang tours, Mekong Dolphin tours, Phnom Penh tours, Beaches & Island tours and around Cambodia.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d1893399-Reviews-Siem_Reap_Tour_Guide-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Chea Sim Road', 'street2': 'Chreav Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17256', 'address_string': 'Chea Sim Road Chreav Commune, Siem Reap 17256 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'l