The Small Hotel,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-801c4fadd3c3449faa57c5456afadeaa,en,hotel,"{'label': 'The Small Hotel, 180402 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'ពីរ', 'postalCode': '180402'}","{'lat': 10.62251, 'lng': 103.52472}","[{'lat': 10.62258, 'lng': 103.52484}]",48830,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1930033'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510488499'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/people/The-Small-Hotel-Sihanoukville/100057346394619'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.622573,103.52482,1930033,The Small Hotel,"Finding an ideal romantic small hotel in Sihanoukville does not have to be difficult. Welcome to The Small Hotel, a nice option for travelers like you.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer a flat screen TV, air conditioning, and a minibar, and you can stay connected during your stay as The Small Hotel offers guests free wifi.
The small hotel features a 24 hour front desk, currency exchange, and baggage storage. Plus, The Small Hotel offers an on-site restaurant, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
Nearby landmarks such as CJ Outlet and Jewelry Center (0.2 mi) and Wat Leu Temple (0.9 mi) make The Small Hotel a great place to stay when visiting Sihanoukville.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the sushi restaurants, including Sushi×Bar SHIN Sihanoukville, Samurai Japanese Restaurant & Bar, and Japanese Restaurant Yuyutei, all of which are a short distance from The Small Hotel.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out an ancient ruins, such as Wat Krom Temple.
The Small Hotel puts the best of Sihanoukville at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
