The Snowbell Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649e-5f473d5801f84494b24a14cc3fa5b925,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'The Snowbell Hotel, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.552, 'lng': 104.93677}","[{'lat': 11.55213, 'lng': 104.9368}]",22569,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '14969283'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510666820'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/pages/category/Hotel-Resort/The-Snowbell-Hotel-at-The-Bridge-SoHo-391606411770503'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.551921,104.93675,14969283,The Snowbell Hotel,"The Snowbell Hotel is the result of joint efforts by three young professionals - a designer, a financier and a hospitality professor, who have worked for the entire year of 2018 in bringing pieces of hand-sketch into reality. The hotel occupies a total of two high floors(28th and 29th) within the landmark Bridge SOHO tower, making it one of the best in Phnom Penh, Cambodia, for a bird’s eye view of the capital city, and Mekong river. The building also comprises of the highest swimming pool in the country. Located on the 39th floor, it is the perfect one to cool down and relax after a day out. Of course, all guests will have free access to the pool. All rooms are from hand-sketch designs, with a minimalist concept, Nordic-style and a huge emphasis on quality interior materials. The three material elements defining the interior are wood, marble and rough linen, while the three immaterial ones are light, void and view. Apart from the sky gym, sauna and pool, there is an award-winning restaurant and sky garden, Collin's Skybar, to have breakfast and all-day ala-carte menu to dine at. Guests will find embassies, government organisations and casinos sit in harmony next to each other and all beneath his feet, with local attractions such as the Royal Palace, Independence Monument, the Genocide Museum all a stone's throw away.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d14969283-Reviews-The_Snowbell_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '78 Were Street 29th Floor', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '78 Were Street 29th Floor, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d14969283-The_Snowbell_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#120 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '120'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,36,"{'1': '2', '2': '1', '3': '0', '4': '2', '5': '31'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",89,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g