The Stage 1960s,here:pds:place:116w63gg-932c424ed15d416ab0018e0200d3260b,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'The Stage 1960s, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34201, 'lng': 103.84556}","[{'lat': 13.34194, 'lng': 103.84568}]",26534,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '200-2000-0368', 'name': 'Cocktail Lounge'}]","[{'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian'}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '301-000', 'name': 'French'}, {'id': '800-056', 'name': 'Steak House'}, {'id': '800-078', 'name': 'Grill'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '14985639'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569261888'}, {'value': '+85569271888'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.thestage1960s.com'}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1000-0001'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sat: 18:00 - 22:30', 'Sun: 09:00 - 22:30'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T180000', 'duration': 'PT04H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}, {'start': 'T090000', 'duration': 'PT13H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.342123,103.84571,14985639,The Stage 1960s,"Designed with collaboration from the Michelin Star Chef, each dish is meticulously crafted following to a significant history of Cambodian culture. The dining journey is completely personalized to feast your senses. GREATEST EXPERIENCE happened by plan! We wish to offer you the journey to discover a forgotten legendary of Khmer Cuisine. We are striving to achieve a fond memorable experience of your Six Senses, by beginning with oldies 60s music entertainment both in English & Khmer, touching with the scenery and ambiance of fine-dining restaurant setting, smelling the freshness of authentic herbs and ingredients, tasting the natural, organic and creative dishes of our chef, listening to the story of each dishes and story of which villager produces the different food products, seeing the performances of our talents team serving each dishes at your table, and share the technique of how food was just cooking.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g12591811-d14985639-Reviews-The_Stage_1960s-Svay_Dangkum_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Psar Kraoum Road', 'street2': 'Vihea Chin Village', 'city': 'Svay Dangkum', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Psar Kraoum Road Vihea Chin Village, Svay Dangkum, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Svay Dangkum', 'location_id': '12591811'}, {'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,experience@thestage1960s.com,+855 69 261 888,http://www.thestage1960s.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g12591811-d14985639-The_Stage_1960s-Svay_Dangkum_Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '12591811', 'ranking_string': '#2 of 25 Places to Eat in Svay Dangkum', 'geo_location_name': 'Svay Dangkum', 'ranking_out_of': '25', 'ranking': '2'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,35,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '35'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",82,https://www.tripa