The Strand,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-a5285bd8c469493d9e3ad75570f95099,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'The Strand, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.49178, 'lng': 104.28952}","[{'lat': 10.49178, 'lng': 104.28966}]",7482,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '800-075', 'name': 'Seafood', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian'}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-066', 'name': 'Fusion'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5566311'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578333686'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.knaibangchatt.com/dining/the-strand'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT15H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kep,10.491779,104.28934,5566311,The Strand,"Incorporating our earth-to-plate concept, The Strand provides healthy and delicious cuisine from fresh and local produce, including the abundant fish, crab, and seafood that is collected daily from the surrounding ocean, and organic vegetables from our very own gardens.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g608456-d5566311-Reviews-The_Strand-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Phum Thmey - Crab Market', 'street2': 'Knai Bang Chatt', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07503', 'address_string': 'Phum Thmey - Crab Market Knai Bang Chatt, Kep 07503 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@knaibangchatt.com,+855 78 333 686,http://www.knaibangchatt.com/dining/the-strand/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d5566311-The_Strand-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_loc