The Street Latte,here:pds:place:116w631x-2460d1d095af448fb147956cef9411ed,en,coffee,"{'label': 'The Street Latte, 020701 រតនមណ្ឌល, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'រតនមណ្ឌល', 'district': 'ស្ដៅ', 'postalCode': '020701'}","{'lat': 12.92157, 'lng': 102.99734}","[{'lat': 12.92182, 'lng': 102.99794}]",17202,"[{'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85587777479'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.358309,103.856804,16814708,The Twizt - Lifestyle Hostel & Hotel,"THE TWIZT LIFESTYLE HOSTEL & HOTEL Ideally centered in the heart of Siem Reap’s bustling walking street of 16th Avenue, The Twizt is characterized as a “flashpacking hostel” featuring astonishing and modern interior design, perfect for generation Z. At Twizt, life is all FUN! Stay in for great food and drinks to get the chance to socialize with like-minded peeps around Siem Reap’s largest AKAS Bar featuring the infinity swimming pool and a tropical beach located on the rooftop overlooking the horizon of the Cambodia’s historical city.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d16814708-Reviews-The_Twizt_Lifestyle_Hostel_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '16th Avenue', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '16th Avenue, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d16814708-The_Twizt_Lifestyle_Hostel_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#2 of 449 Specialty lodging in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '449', 'rank