The Two Bedroom,here:pds:place:116w63u5-37d95dd89ba84dbb802fb1f7ced19fbc,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'The Two Bedroom, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.36227, 'lng': 103.87787}","[{'lat': 13.3624, 'lng': 103.8779}]",22574,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15693006'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512730051'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://thetwobedroom.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.362309,103.87788,15693006,The Two Bedroom,"THE TWO BEDROOM STUDIO is a match and perfect for responsible guests on a budget who are traveling by themselves! ROOM 1&2: This is the compact studio. It has a double bed, it’s own bathroom, kitchen. At living area - a single bed can use as sofa and daybed allows an extra people can accommodate comfortable at night. A desk and chair can be a small office for work.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d15693006-Reviews-The_Two_Bedroom-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '108, Chong Kaosou Village', 'street2': 'Slarkram Communue', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17251', 'address_string': '108, Chong Kaosou Village Slarkram Communue, Siem Reap 17251 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d15693006-The_Two_Bedroom-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#391 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '391'}",4,https: