The Victory Gate,here:pds:place:116aabd1-66151b6db26f062e38eb4ae1e76cce70,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'The Victory Gate, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.42734, 'lng': 103.85962}","[{'lat': 13.42734, 'lng': 103.85948}]",19045,"[{'id': '300-3000-0025', 'name': 'Historical Monument', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1603629'}]",Not Available,"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 05:00 - 18:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T050000', 'duration': 'PT13H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.42734,103.85953,1603629,The Victory Gate,"Since Angkor was the first temple in Cambodia to be inscribed as UNESCO world heritage site in 1992, Angkor became major tourist attraction then Angkor became the most visited and written about temple in Cambodia. Angkor Archaeological Park contains dozen of magnificent temples include Angkor Wat, Angkor Thom, the Bayon Temple with its countless sculptural decorations. Siem Reap is a gateway to Angkor, The place where you will spend entire nights while visit the Angkor. Angkor Gate was created to bring you to the world heritage site by develop tour programs to suite all kind of travel including Cambodia Angkor Tours, Cambodia Adventure Tours, Cambodia Eco tours and much more different style of travel. Tour length is flexible in according to your time base.We provide the best solution in room reservation and tour arrangement throughout Cambodia, Thailand, Vietnam and Laos with very competitive service and rate. We provide you FREE travel information for the countries.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d1603629-Reviews-The_Victory_Gate-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Victory Way', 'street2': 'Angkor Archaeological Park', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Victory Way Angkor Archaeological Park, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d1603629-The_Victory_Gate-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#19 of 200 things to do in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '200', 'ranking': '19'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,534,"{'1': '0', '2': '3', '3': '26', '4': '179', '5': '326'}",Not available,479,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d1603629-m66827-Reviews-The_Victory_Gate-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1800'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0500'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '1800'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 05:00 - 18:00', 'Tuesday: 05:00 - 18:00', 'Wednesday: 05:00 - 18:00', 'Thursday: 05:00 - 18:00', 'Friday: 05:00 - 18:00', 'Saturday: 05:00 - 18:00', 'Sunday: 05:00 - 18:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'landmarks', 'localized_name': 'Sights & Landmarks'}, {'name': 'attractions', 'localized_name': 'Attractions'}]","[{'name': 'Sights & Landm