The Vine Retreat,here:pds:place:116w3fhn-f512a493657f4145aab031ada5b64630,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'The Vine Retreat, 220102 ដំណាក់ចង្អើរ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'ដំណាក់ចង្អើរ', 'district': 'ពងទឹក', 'postalCode': '220102'}","{'lat': 10.56634, 'lng': 104.36015}","[{'lat': 10.56643, 'lng': 104.36004}]",4104,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+855366333383'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.thevineretreat.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.52621,104.35242,1568780,The Vine Retreat,"The Vine Retreat is an eco-conscious yoga retreat centre and guesthouse with an organic garden and pepper farm in Kep, Cambodia. Set on 30 acres of peaceful natural countryside, surrounded by lush green mountains, it's the perfect place for relaxation and rejuvenation. Chill out by our salt water swimming pool, indulge in healthy, fresh, organic food directly from our gardens (we cater to meat eaters and vegetarians) or take a bike ride to explore the local villages. We also have a fully equipped yoga studio which fits up to 25 people. We rent our whole facility for exclusive use for yoga retreat. Please contact us for more information.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d1568780-Reviews-The_Vine_Retreat-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Pepper Road', 'street2': 'Phnom Voar', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07503', 'address_string': 'Pepper Road Phnom Voar, Kep 07503 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d1568780-The_Vine_Retreat-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_loc