The for Life Coffee,here:pds:place:116w3gpp-a87022d66e164dc2a851a5fb089a16d1,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'The for Life Coffee, 200701 ស្វាយរៀង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ស្វាយរៀង', 'city': 'ស្វាយរៀង', 'district': 'ស្វាយរៀង', 'postalCode': '200701'}","{'lat': 11.09077, 'lng': 105.79503}","[{'lat': 11.09073, 'lng': 105.79516}]",50846,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510701199'}]}],Not Available,Svay Rieng,10.787325,106.67755,451031,Ramana Saigon Hotel,"Ramana Hotel Saigon is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Ho Chi Minh City, offering a family-friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer a minibar and air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as Ramana Hotel Saigon offers guests free wifi.
The hotel features a concierge and room service. Plus, Ramana Hotel Saigon offers a pool and a lounge, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available.
Nearby landmarks such as The Venerable Thich Quang Duc Monument (1.6 mi) and Benthanh Street Food Market (1.7 mi) make Ramana Hotel Saigon a great place to stay when visiting Ho Chi Minh City.
Travelers looking to enjoy some dim sum can head to Li Bai Chinese Restaurant, Crystal Jade Palace, or Ocean Palace. Otherwise, you may want to check out a cafe such as L'Usine, The Workshop, or Journeys Sandwich Cafe.
During your visit, be sure to check out War Remnants Museum (1.1 mi), which is a popular attraction within walking distance of the hotel.
Enjoy your stay in Ho Chi Minh City!
