-Ho_Chi_Minh_City.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Restaurant', 'Business center', 'Fitness center', 'Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Free Wifi', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Spa', 'Airport transportation', 'Dry Cleaning', 'Meeting rooms', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Concierge', 'Banquet Room', 'Air conditioning', 'Conference Facilities', 'Safe', 'Flatscreen TV', 'Breakfast Buffet', 'Doorperson', '24-Hour Front Desk', 'Massage', 'Vietnamese', 'Suites', 'Room service', 'Free parking', 'Wheelchair access', 'Wifi', 'Family Rooms', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Minibar', 'Outdoor pool']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"['Quiet', 'Family']",[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '42'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '60'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '34'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '47'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '46'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,38,22
Theam's Gallery,here:pds:place:116aabd1-f65ce3bf54240ae8c7f4be57250d4827,en,gallery,"{'label': ""Theam's Gallery, 171203 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'គោកចក', 'postalCode': '171203'}","{'lat': 13.38479, 'lng': 103.85232}","[{'lat': 13.38477, 'lng': 103.85246}]",229960,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2100150'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578208161'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.theamsgallery.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 18:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT10H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.384801,103.85237,2100150,Theam's Gallery,"Located a mere 10 minutes from the majestic temples of Angkor, Theam’s Gallery (formely Theam's House Gallery) is the home-cum-gallery of Master Cambodian Artist, Lim Muy Theam. As you step from one breath-taking pavilion to the next, you experience a sanctuary of serenity and a true visual feast. This lush space invites you to explore and immerse yourself in Khmer culture at its very best through Theam’s impressive private collection of local artefacts. Witness young apprentice artisans painting, sculpting and lacquering, while discovering the colourful contemporary creations of Theam himself. The gallery features a professionally curated showroom exhibiting all artwork conceived and produced onsite. This exquisite visual arts space gives visitors an authentic insight into the distinctive world of Cambodian art. Located in the tropical courtyard, Theam’s Café & Lounge serves a selection of coffee and fresh juice daily.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d2100150-Reviews-Theam_s_Gallery-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Road 30', 'street2': '100m after MOK NEAK high school,', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Provinc