Thmorda Crab House Restaurant & Bar,here:pds:place:116w614n-ebc38b03beb74b52ab3cf7c5cd2c0389,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Thmorda Crab House Restaurant & Bar, 090401 មណ្ឌលសីមា, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កោះកុង', 'city': 'មណ្ឌលសីមា', 'district': 'បាក់ខ្លង', 'postalCode': '090401'}","{'lat': 11.63036, 'lng': 102.95549}","[{'lat': 11.63035, 'lng': 102.95535}]",44885,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '800-075', 'name': 'Seafood', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593343421'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://blogger-general-tverleng.blogspot.com/2019/01/welcome-to-thmorda-crab-house-restaurant.html'}]}]",Not Available,Koh Kong,11.630803,102.95572,3479029,Thmorda Riverside Resort,"﻿The resort sits on an exclusive property, with impressive rock formations (Thmorda means rocks in Cambodian language) and outstanding natural beauty overlooking the Kah Bpow River surrounded by mountains and small islands. ​We are located 10 minutes drive from Koh Kong town center and 15 minutes from the Thai Border ""Baan Hat Lek"". ﻿﻿Our restaurant ""Thmorda Crab House"", built entirely on stilts with private huts offers authentic Thai food and seafood dishes fresh off the boat from daily catches from the fisherman in the Gulf of Thailand. ​Chill-out and cool down at our ""Blue Bar"" with refreshing fresh fruit frappes, cocktails or local beer. It is the perfect base to explore the local attractions or simply relax after a long journey. Take a dip in the river, kayaking or take a ride on one of our bicycles for nearby expeditions. Trips can be arranged to visit the mangrove forest at Peam Krasop Wildlife Sanctuary, Koh Kong Island, Tatai River & Waterfall, Kah Bpow Waterfall or to see the fireflies in the evenings by the mangrove forest just in front of our resort.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1532269-d3479029-Reviews-Thmorda_Riverside_Resort-Koh_Kong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '169 Neang Kok Village', 'street2': 'Pak Klong Commune, Mondolsima District', 'city': 'Koh Kong', 'state': 'Koh Kong Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '90105', 'address_string': '169 Neang Kok Village Pak Klong Commune, Mondolsima District, Koh Kong 90105 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Koh Kong', 'location_id': '1532269'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Koh Kong Province', 'location_id': '2366667'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1532269-d3479029-Thmorda_Riverside_Resort-Koh_Kong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '1532269', 'ranking_string': '#2 of 22 B&Bs / Inns in Koh Kong', 'geo_location_name': 'Koh Kong', 'ranking_out_of': '22', 'ranking': '2'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,96,"{'1': '3', '2': '7', '3': '8', '4': '15', '5': '63'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",206,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1532269-d3479029-m6