Tiki Club,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-0494838046b94efd853eb72db510ecba,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Tiki Club, 180403 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បី', 'postalCode': '180403'}","{'lat': 10.63131, 'lng': 103.50271}","[{'lat': 10.6314, 'lng': 103.50261}]",102147,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10377437'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855969236582'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/TikiClubKHM/timeline'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.631316,103.5027,10377437,Tiki Club,"Tiki Club is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Sihanoukville, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Nearby landmarks such as Wat Leu Temple (1.3 mi) and CJ Outlet and Jewelry Center (1.8 mi) make Tiki Club a great place to stay when visiting Sihanoukville.
Rooms at Tiki Club offer extra long beds, a seating area, and a mosquito net providing exceptional comfort and convenience, and guests can go online with free wifi.
A 24 hour front desk and executive lounge access are some of the conveniences offered at this guest house. An on-site restaurant will also help to make your stay even more special. If you are driving to Tiki Club, parking is available.
While in Sihanoukville be sure to experience local crab favorites at Lemongrass Restaurant, ""The Deck"" Tapas Bar, or Outback Bar & Bistro.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Wat Krom Temple (0.6 mi), which is a popular attraction amongst tourists, and it is within walking distance.
Enjoy your stay in Sihanoukville!
