Tin-Tin Cafe & Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w63gg-cfdac1319baa4c31b6683a98122e594b,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Tin-Tin Cafe & Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35486, 'lng': 103.85116}","[{'lat': 13.35473, 'lng': 103.85117}]",25061,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85510897603'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.354669,103.85158,7306615,Tin-Tin Irish Cafe and Guesthouse,"Centrally located in Siem Reap, Tin Tin Irish Cafe & Guest House offers homely and peaceful accommodation within a 2-minute walk from Siem Reap Night Market and the famous Pub Street. we provides free WiFi access throughout the property. Simply furnished, rooms come with air conditioning, a desk, a flat-screen cable TV and tiled flooring. Guests have access to either a shared or private bathroom with shower facility and free toiletries. Staff at Tin Tin Irish Cafe & Guest House can assist with laundry services, ticketing and tour arrangements. Guests enjoy daily housekeeping service and free parking facility on site. The in-house restaurant serves a delectable spread of Khmer and Western dishes. A variety of customised cocktails and coffee choices are offered at the bar. Tin Tin Guest House is about 3 km from the Royal Garden. Siem Reap International Airport and the iconic Angkor Wat Temple are within 7 km away. We speak your language!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7306615-Reviews-Tin_Tin_Irish_Cafe_and_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'no 428 Sok San Street, Block', 'street2': 'right across the street from Happy Herb Pizza, behind Same Same Bar on Soksan Road', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'no 428 Sok San Street, Block right across the street from Happy Herb Pizza, behind Same Same Bar on Soksan Road, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d7306615-Tin_Tin_Irish_Cafe_and_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#199 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '199'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,27,"{'1': '0', '2': '2', '3': '3', '4': '5', '5': '17'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",6,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d7306615-m66827-Reviews-Tin_Tin_Irish_Cafe_and_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap