Tours by Jeeps,here:pds:place:116w63gg-9e8c7e29f1b156168c799b9e7eee1fa8,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Tours by Jeeps, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.34882, 'lng': 103.85655}","[{'lat': 13.34878, 'lng': 103.85667}]",116341,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '15096626'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593921775'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.toursbyjeeps.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT09H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.348808,103.856575,15096626,Tours By Jeeps,"Cambodia’s original Jeep Tour Company, offering adventure seeking travellers some of the most unforgettable experience by getting further off the beaten track in Siem Reap. Our jeep tours & vehicles are inspected daily to ensure your safety, and our jeep is designed and modified with your comfort in mind. Our friendly, professional tour guides and office staff are handpicked for their knowledge of the area, their fun and unique personalities, and their commitment to providing exceptional customer service.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d15096626-Reviews-Tours_By_Jeeps-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Bamboo Street', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': 'Bamboo Street, Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@toursbyjeeps.com,+855 93 921 775,http://www.toursbyjeeps.com/,https://www.tripadviso