Toyoko Inn with Dara,here:pds:place:116aabd1-6415318ceb4704b01a6eb25325e1ac65,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Toyoko Inn with Dara, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.55175, 'lng': 104.93817}","[{'lat': 11.55188, 'lng': 104.93818}]",74415,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8130951'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523991045'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.551702,104.93816,8130951,Toyoko Inn with Dara,"Toyoko Inn Phnom Penh is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Phnom Penh, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Toyoko Inn Phnom Penh offers guests an array of room amenities including a refrigerator and air conditioning, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available.
The hotel offers a 24 hour front desk, baggage storage, and newspaper, to make your visit even more pleasant. The property also features breakfast. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
Close to some of Phnom Penh's most popular landmarks, such as Bassac Lane (0.6 mi) and Champey Academy of Arts (1.2 mi), Toyoko Inn Phnom Penh is a great destination for tourists.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the cafes, including Cousin's Burger & Coffee, Daughters of Cambodia Visitor Centre Café, and Backyard Cafe, all of which are a short distance from Toyoko Inn Phnom Penh.
Plus, during your trip, don’t forget to check out some of the popular historic sites, such as Royal Palace, Choeung Ek Genocidal Center, and Wat Langka.
Enjoy your stay in Phnom Penh!
