Trailblazers Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w649f-badc31ef237a426585faa05440712c46,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Trailblazers Cambodia, ផ្លូវ 608, 120408 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ទួលគោក', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកក់ទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 608', 'postalCode': '120408'}","{'lat': 11.5722, 'lng': 104.89408}","[{'lat': 11.57203, 'lng': 104.8941}]",3304,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592865252'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.587,104.899,305386,Holiday Villa Phnom Penh,"Welcome to Holiday Villa Phnom Penh, your Phnom Penh “home away from home.” Holiday Villa Phnom Penh aims to make your visit as relaxing and enjoyable as possible, which is why so many guests continue to come back year after year.
Nearby landmarks such as Cambodia Post Office (2.0 mi) and Sisowath Quay (2.4 mi) make Holiday Villa Phnom Penh Hotel a great place to stay when visiting Phnom Penh.
Guests have access to room service while staying at Holiday Villa Phnom Penh Hotel. In addition, Holiday Villa Phnom Penh Hotel offers a fitness center and free breakfast, which will help make your Phnom Penh trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
When you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out Cousin's Burger & Coffee, Daughters of Cambodia Visitor Centre Café, and Backyard Cafe, which are some cafes that are popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.
Looking for something to do in Phnom Penh? Wat Phnom (0.4 mi), Al-Serkal Mosque (1.1 mi), and Mila Craft Workshop (Rubber stamp and Making Bath Bombs) (1.1 mi) are some popular attractions that are within walking distance of Holiday Villa Phnom Penh Hotel.
Holiday Villa Phnom Penh puts the best of Phnom Penh at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
