Tribe Phnom Penh Post Office Square,here:pds:place:116w649g-1aae3fbe9264591446b3942bef127987,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Tribe Phnom Penh Post Office Square, ផ្លូវ 92, 120211 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'វត្តភ្នំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 92', 'postalCode': '120211'}","{'lat': 11.57692, 'lng': 104.9254}","[{'lat': 11.57679, 'lng': 104.92544}]",72735,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '24193192'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523965500'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://all.accor.com/hotel/B5M5/index.en.shtml'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.57682,104.92543,24193192,TRIBE Phnom Penh Post Office Square,"Welcome to Tribe Phnom Penh Post Office Square where we offer guest experiences that matter the most. With 260 smart rooms, collaborative work spaces and a lively social hub, Tribe Phnom Penh is designed for the tech savy, urban traveller to live, work and play. Located 1 hour from the Phnom Penh International Airport, Tribe Phnom Penh is situated on the north side of Mekong River, offering spectacular views of the city surrounded by magnetic nightlife. Walking distance from popular tourist attractions.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d24193192-Reviews-TRIBE_Phnom_Penh_Post_Office_Square-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No 47 Corner St 01 And St 94', 'street2': 'Village 9 Sangat Wat Phnom, Khan Daun Penh', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12202', 'address_string': 'No 47 Corner St 01 And St 94 Village 9 Sangat Wat Phnom, Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh 12202 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d24193192-TRIBE_Phnom_Penh_Post