Triple A Adventures Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w6649-bd4ff2169c4c4296b54bc97115babe29,en,leisure_outdoor,"{'label': 'Triple A Adventures Cambodia, 170404 សូត្រនិគម, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សូត្រនិគម', 'district': 'កំពង់ឃ្លាំង', 'postalCode': '170404'}","{'lat': 13.13491, 'lng': 104.12343}","[{'lat': 13.13486, 'lng': 104.12357}]",44925,"[{'id': '550-5510-0379', 'name': 'Outdoor Service', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}, {'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3659942'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855888366004'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://tripleacambodia.com/siem-reap-floating-village-countryside-day-tour'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.134945,104.12336,3659942,Triple A Adventures Cambodia,"We created our 1-day trip because we think there are not enough options for visitors to explore our beautiful region. Not only we’ll take you to Kompong Khleang, a community-owned floating village that kept its authenticity, but we’ll also take you for lunch with friendly locals and cycling around Siem Reap’s stunning countryside.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d3659942-Reviews-Triple_A_Adventures_Cambodia-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,tripleacambodia@gmail.com,+855 88 836 6004,http://tripleacambodia.com/siem-reap-floating-village-countryside-day-tour,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d3659942-Triple_A_Adventures_Cambodia-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_s