Trusty Tuk Tuk,here:pds:place:116w63gu-0bc03c4bce37b5f32f42c419497a8fab,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Trusty Tuk Tuk, ផ្លូវ ខ្នារចាស់, 171206 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ជ្រាវ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ខ្នារចាស់', 'postalCode': '171206'}","{'lat': 13.33987, 'lng': 103.89643}","[{'lat': 13.33984, 'lng': 103.89657}]",116239,"[{'id': '400-4100-0041', 'name': 'Transportation Service', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10836525'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85581553978'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.trustytuktuk.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.339835,103.89655,10836525,Trusty Tuk Tuk,"Hello! I am Lee, owner of Trusty TukTuk. I am a friendly driver and tour guide in my home town of Siem Reap. I speak fluent English and Have knowledge as professional tour guide and driver since 2006, so I have great knowledge and experience in giving tours. On a tour with me, I can make sure you beat the crowds and see the best sights at the right times. I am flexible, reliable and can show you more about modern life in Cambodia like local food, drink and daily lives of our people. During 2006, I was studying in high school and working as a motorbike driver to earn money to study. Early that year I met Mr Frank from The Netherlands, he donated a second hand tuktuk to me so I have been working as a tuktuk driver since then. My service is flexible and I can pick you up and drop you off anywhere you like. I have cold water in the tuktuk if you need it. Finally I would like to thank you for reading my story and I wish to hear from you soon. Thank you very much! Lee.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d10836525-Reviews-Trusty_Tuk_Tuk-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Cheasim Road, Chnar Chas village, Siem Reap Cambodia', 'street2': 'Cheasim Road', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17550', 'address_string': 'Cheasim Road, Chnar Chas village, Siem Reap Cambodia Cheasim Road, Siem Reap 17550 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,sokly_coco@yahoo.com,+855 81 553 978,http://www.trustytuktuk.com/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d10836525-Trusty_Tuk_Tuk-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#11 of 754 Transportation in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '754', 'ranking': '11'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,298,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '3', '5': '294'}",Not available,515,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d10836525-m66827-Reviews-Trusty_Tuk_Tuk-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2359'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0000'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '2359'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Tuesday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Wednesday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Thursday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Friday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Saturday: 00:00 - 23:59', 'Sunday: 00:00 - 23:59']}",Not availabl