Tuk Tuk Hostel & Cafe,here:pds:place:116aabd1-1111def597080dacdbd18ca28b4d1fa0,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Tuk Tuk Hostel & Cafe, ផ្លូវ 113, 120103 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 113', 'postalCode': '120103'}","{'lat': 11.55424, 'lng': 104.91791}","[{'lat': 11.55424, 'lng': 104.91779}]",6058,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8652808'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592250440'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/TukTukHostelCafePhnomPenh'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.554227,104.91787,8652808,Tuk Tuk Hostel & Cafe,"For a traveler who wants to absorb the local culture sounds and taste, Tuk Tuk Hostel is the perfect accommodation. We offer guests spacious clean dorms complete with air conditioning and free WiFi throughout the property. Our friendly English speaking staff often helps out with directions and bookings for tours and tickets. The hostel also has a cafe and bar that serves great local food and ice cold drinks for those who need to wind down after soaking the hot Cambodian sun. Tuk Tuk Hostel is walking distance from the S21 Genocide Museum. The hostel is also not too far from other attractions such as the Royal Palace, National Museum and the Independence Monument We have 24 beds space at our hostel with two separate dorms. One all female dorm and 1 mixed dorm room. Both have balconies overlooking the Phnom Penh skyline. Price starts at USD 7 per night/bed. Type of room - female dorm bed, male dorm bed and mixed dorm bed, private room as well.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d8652808-Reviews-Tuk_Tuk_Hostel_Cafe-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No 66B St 113, corner 278, Sangkat BKK II', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': 'No 66B St 113, corner 278, Sangkat BKK II, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d8652808-Tuk_Tuk_Hostel_Cafe-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#46 of 351 Specialty lodging in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '351', 'ranking': '46'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,29,"{'1': '0', '2': '3', '3': '4', '4': '9', '5': '13'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss2.5.svg', 'value': '2.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}}",66,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d8652808-m66827-Reviews-Tuk_Tuk_Hostel_Cafe-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Restaurant', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Breakfast included', 'Laundry Service', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Shuttle Bus Service', 'Free parking', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Airport transportation', 'Dry Cleaning', 'Concierge', 'Air conditioning',