Tuktuk To Angkor Wat,here:pds:place:116w63uh-f854278ff297ef736644c851ba46dd58,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Tuktuk To Angkor Wat, ផ្លូវ សម្តេចវិបុលបញ្ញា សុខ អាន, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សម្តេចវិបុលបញ្ញា សុខ អាន', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.37626, 'lng': 103.88786}","[{'lat': 13.37613, 'lng': 103.88786}]",20682,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12483000'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85595214142'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/Greencambodiatours?mibextid=ZbWKwL'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.376284,103.88786,12483000,TukTuk To Angkor Wat,"Green Cambodia Tours, Sightseeing Tour, Things to do in Siem Reap, Cambodia. Hello dear Value clients. My name is Vicheth Sorn (Alibaba Angkor) And I'm be a Tuk-Tuk driver in Siem Reap for more than 11years. A Tuk-Tuk is like motorized rick-shaw. It's very comfortable and popular transportation for traveling around the Angkor area: Free air-con! I know all places in Siem Reap Province and its surrounding areas. I can organize any type of tours for you (half day / full day / multi-day / Bus, Airport, Baot pick-up) or if you have any ideas about what you like to do Please just let me know . I don't just drive the Tuk-Tuk and I also have car with air conditioning that can make the long way tours are more comfortable. I can explain to you with basic detail about all Of the interesting place around Cambodia Fully by experience and Angkor Photography Tours is based in Siem Reap offering instructional. Book now for you safe, cheap price and happy tour in Siem Reap Angkor Cambodia. Thanks you",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d12483000-Reviews-TukTuk_To_Angkor_Wat-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'countr