Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum,here:pds:place:116w649g-84862383b783b4e3418535f0f09c5632,en,museum,"{'label': 'Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum, ផ្លូវ តេជោដំឌិន, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ តេជោដំឌិន', 'postalCode': '120205'}","{'lat': 11.569, 'lng': 104.93012}","[{'lat': 11.56887, 'lng': 104.93015}]",7196,"[{'id': '300-3100-0028', 'name': 'History Museum', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23885407'}]",[{'www': [{'value': 'https://tuolsleng.gov.kh'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.5491,104.91767,324063,Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum,"The Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum is the memorial site of the S-21 interrogation and detention center of the Khmer Rouge regime. Located in the heart of Phnom Penh, it preserves a tragic period in history with the aim to encourage visitors to be messengers of peace. Tuol Sleng Genocide Museum is the memorial site of “Security Office 21” (S-21) of Democratic Kampuchea (also known as the Khmer Rouge regime) and located in what was then the abandoned city of Phnom Penh, whose citizens had been evacuated on 17 April 1975. S-21 served as the central hub of a vast prison system throughout the country and was used throughout the period as a secret facility for the detention, interrogation, torture and extermination of those deemed “political enemies” of the regime. Due to a policy of guilt-by-association, at times whole families were detained at the center. Only 12 former inmates survived the opening of S-21 when Phnom Penh was liberated. Four of them were children.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d324063-Reviews-Tuol_Sleng_Genocide_Museum-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Corner of Street 113 & St 350', 'street2': 'History Museum', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12304', 'address_string': 'Corner of Street 113 & St 350 History Museum, Phnom Penh 12304 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,tuolslengmuseum.info@gmail.com,+855 23 655 5395,http://tuolsleng.gov.kh,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d324063-Tuol_Sleng_Genocide_Museum-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 164 things to do in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '164', 'ranking': '1'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,12925,"{'1': '45', '2': '101', '3': '718', '4': '3402', '5': '8659'}",Not available,6753,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d324063-m66827-Reviews-Tuol_Sleng_Genocide_Museum-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 7, 'time': '1700'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Tuesday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Wednesday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Thursday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Friday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Saturday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Sunday: 08:00 - 17:00']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'museums', 'localized_name': 'Museums'}, {'name': 'attractions', 'localized_name': 'Attractions'}]","[{'name': 'Museums', 'localized_name': 'Museums', 'categories': [{'name': 'History Museums', 'localized_name': 'History Museums'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'busin