Tusita Fine Dining,here:pds:place:116w63u5-febd5ad5a08c4f30bcae6f47b43d0a93,en,Fine Dining,"{'label': 'Tusita Fine Dining, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35983, 'lng': 103.86759}","[{'lat': 13.35984, 'lng': 103.86773}]",90224,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '19244714'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515437222'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.thetusita.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sat: 11:30 - 15:00, 18:30 - 23:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T113000', 'duration': 'PT03H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}, {'start': 'T183000', 'duration': 'PT04H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.359813,103.8672,19244714,Tusita Fine Dining,"Tusita is a work of art. Uniquely created to represent the Khmer heritage through 3 senses; Taste, Sight, Touch. We have partnered up with Michelin star chef Emmanuel Stroobants with the aim to put Cambodian cuisine on the International stage. By combining the best of local Khmer cuisine with western modern cooking techniques, these creations will highlight the intricacies of Khmer cuisine.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d19244714-Reviews-Tusita_Fine_Dining-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Road 6', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Road 6, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@thetusita.com,+855 15 437 222,