Twin Home Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-4d93774e251c4012a2b155d98a84f3f1,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Twin Home Guesthouse, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60683, 'lng': 104.17933}","[{'lat': 10.60683, 'lng': 104.17933}]",19704,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '13338373'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855967791212'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.606829,104.17933,13338373,Twin Home Guesthouse,"Finding an ideal budget friendly guest house in Kampot does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Twin Home Guesthouse, a nice option for travelers like you.
As your “home away from home,” the guest house rooms offer air conditioning, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, a picnic area, and a sun terrace while staying at Twin Home Guesthouse. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
While staying at Twin Home Guesthouse, visitors can check out The Old Royal Cinema (0.2 mi), which is a popular Kampot attraction.
If you’re looking for a sushi restaurant, consider a visit to Flowers Nanobrewery or Rainbow Bridge Japanese Restaurant, which are all conveniently located a short distance from Twin Home Guesthouse.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out Farm Link (0.7 mi), a popular attraction that is within walking distance of Twin Home Guesthouse.
Twin Home Guesthouse puts the best of Kampot at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
