Two Dragons Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116d408k-7b1433d2980103f396c29dd981cb1f8f,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Two Dragons Guesthouse, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35917, 'lng': 103.86156}","[{'lat': 13.3593, 'lng': 103.86161}]",23958,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '626053'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563965107'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://twodragons-asia.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.359259,103.861595,626053,Two Dragons Guesthouse,"Welcome to the legendary Two Dragons Guesthouse, one of the best budget guest houses in Siem Reap, giving warm hospitality, great food and providing travellers with first class service since 2004. We are located near the scenic and historical Siem Reap river, only a short stroll to the quaint Old Town Market, and enjoy easy access to the Angkor Park area and Pub Street. Most of Cambodia's world-famous temples are quickly accessible, only a very short ride away, by bicycle, tuk tuk or taxi. We can provide tour guides and transport in a flexible and customized manner for you and your travelling companions. Many travellers extend their stay having experienced the cozy ambience, excellent food and convenient location, at prices which many consider to be unbeatable value. Book now, and let us be your home-from-home for your unforgettable adventure in this Kingdom of Wonder!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d626053-Reviews-Two_Dragons_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#110 Wat Bo Village', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': '#110 Wat Bo Village, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', '