Two Moons Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-9f03f55d703306f4b85724d770edf557,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Two Moons Hotel, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60049, 'lng': 104.18333}","[{'lat': 10.60062, 'lng': 104.18332}]",19019,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]","[{'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '800-064', 'name': 'International'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12803572'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5606826'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5998973'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85533932857', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}, {'value': '+85577324889'}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.6004,104.18268,5606826,Two Moons Hotel,"Set in a tranquil location to a backdrop of river and mountain views makes Two Moons the perfect choice for a relaxing stay yet only minutes to the center of town. The hotel is located on the main riverside street and the heart of Kampot province, yet far enough to benefit of the calm and tranquility of nature. Turn left and walk 200m and you are in a local fishing village with its early morning seafood market; a colorful display of large and small fishing boats on the go in an area primarily populated by Cambodian’s belonging to the ethnic group known as Cham, a reference to an ancient empire of warriors. Turn right and stroll along the beautifully upgraded riverside promenade, passing the newly built governors mansion and in to town just a ten minute walk away. We offer twenty rooms in total with a wide variety of accommodation options including wooden bungalows, a traditional Khmer wooden house and a fourteen up market hotel rooms with views over the river.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d5606826-Reviews-Two_Moons_Hotel-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Riverside Road', 'street2': 'Near the Aquatic Center and the Fish Market, Sungkat Kompong Kandal', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07000', 'address_string': 'Riverside Road Near the Aquatic Center and the Fish Market, Sungkat Kompong Kandal, Kampot 07000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d5606826-Two_Moons_Hotel-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#8 of 88 hotels in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '88', 'ranking': '8'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,372,"{'1': '17', '2': '24', '3': '43', '4': '111', '5': '177'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cle