Two Wheels Only Private Day Tours,here:pds:place:116w649e-0bef788ea85e40008a583367993169c9,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Two Wheels Only Private Day Tours, ផ្លូវ 368 34l, 120104 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'បឹងកេងកងទី បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 368', 'postalCode': '120104', 'houseNumber': '34l'}","{'lat': 11.54714, 'lng': 104.91916}","[{'lat': 11.54728, 'lng': 104.91916}]",6429,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2213190'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512200513'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.twocambodia.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.5472,104.91667,2213190,Two Wheels Only Private Day Tours,"Private Motorcycle Tours around Cambodia's many temples and beautiful nature reserves and countryside. 1 day tours running regularly. Two Wheels Only mototrcycle shop offers personal guided tours tailored to your desires with experienced guides who know many places the guide books never mention. Motorcycle Rentals from small scooters to full-on and off-road bikes, repairs, servicing, sales and accessories. Go to places cars cannot reach and visit local communities producing stone carvings, silks, weaves, coffee, rubber, palm oils, etc.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d2213190-Reviews-Two_Wheels_Only_Private_Day_Tours-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '34L Streeet 368', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '2305', 'address_string': '34L Streeet 368, Phnom Penh 2305 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@twocambodia.com,+855 12 200 513,http://www.twocambodia.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d2213190-Two_Wheels_Only_Private_Day_Tours-Phnom_Penh.html?m=