Uncle's House,here:pds:place:116aabd1-735c5f1663fb073fd97038b9dc8eebb0,en,hostel,"{'label': ""Uncle's House, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.34509, 'lng': 103.84544}","[{'lat': 13.34504, 'lng': 103.84557}]",87376,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10501381'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85511345673'}, {'value': '+85511686758', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}, {'value': '+85593713714'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/unclehouse.sr', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.345113,103.84539,10501381,Uncle's House,"Chum Reap Sour! welcome to our Uncle's House We are a simple but comfortable budget accommodation for all types of travelers. Volunteers, foreign teachers, and backpackers whether you are looking for a long stay or just an overnight stop, you are all welcome to stay with our family! Shared Room Vs. Private Rooms One more than special, we offer long stay and monthly stay for teachers and volunteers with including electric, water, wifi high speed, parking in the lowest and BIGGest Saver HERE.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d10501381-Reviews-Uncle_s_House-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Kraoum Rd', 'street2': 'Group 2, Vihear Chen', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Kraoum Rd Group 2, Vihear Chen, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripad