Ung-D Hotel,here:pds:place:116aabd1-c979b0df2d770c15e0fefc8c6ed7213a,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Ung-D Hotel, 171206 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ជ្រាវ', 'postalCode': '171206'}","{'lat': 13.35243, 'lng': 103.8861}","[{'lat': 13.35233, 'lng': 103.88619}]",131465,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12031380'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516514044'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.352525,103.886,12031380,Ung-D Hotel,"We believe there are as many ways to enjoy travelling as there are travelers.This is why we’ve created a boutique hotel designed for each of our guests to live a different, unique and personal experience. Deeply rooted in Khmer culture, yet fully embracing the comfort and style of the XXI century, our luxurious rooms are designed as living spaces. They are an invitation for our guests.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12031380-Reviews-Ung_D_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Krowat Krong Road', 'street2': 'Kna Tmey', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Krowat Krong Road Kna Tmey, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12031380-Ung_D_Hotel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#153 of 763 hotels in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '763', 'ranking': '153'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-