Unity Hostel,here:pds:place:116w63gg-6177947218eb4def805ab2d60144ff99,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Unity Hostel, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35168, 'lng': 103.85513}","[{'lat': 13.35181, 'lng': 103.85508}]",25043,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17384359'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512832877'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/unityhostelsiemreap', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.351783,103.85509,17384359,Unity Hostel,"Unity Hostel is a boutique themed minimalist accommodation that is superbly located in a peaceful area (2 minutes away from Pub Street). We offer both private rooms and dorms with comfortable beds, strong showers and free high-speed WiFi. There is also an abundance of chill-out places to meet new people. And to top it all off, we offer free flow of coffee/tea and 24-hour use of pantry facilities.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d17384359-Reviews-Unity_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '01-13 Wat Damnak Road', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17254', 'address_string': '01-13 Wat Damnak Road, Siem Reap 17254 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d17384359-Unity_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#123 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name'