Up by KVL,here:pds:place:116aabd1-0aa240011e7303932730b4c0807373b5,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Up by KVL, ផ្លូវ 1, 120211 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'វត្តភ្នំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 1', 'postalCode': '120211'}","{'lat': 11.57434, 'lng': 104.92769}","[{'lat': 11.57434, 'lng': 104.92769}]",6968,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011', 'name': 'Bar or Pub'}]","[{'id': '800-074', 'name': 'Brewpub', 'primary': True}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '24122988'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6585866'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855888936661'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.hotelkvl.com/dining/up-by-kvl', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011'}]}]}]","[{'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '200-2000-0011'}], 'text': ['Mon-Sun: 16:00 - 24:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T160000', 'duration': 'PT08H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.57434,104.92769,24122988,Up by KVL,"When the sun goes down, step into Up by KVL; a chic urban bar offering contemporary cocktails, cosmopolitan western and Asian bar snacks, and nightly DJs. Set around a shimmering feature pool, Up by KVL is a buzzing meeting place where both hotel guests and Phnom Penh residents enjoy sweeping views across the Tonle Sap, as well as a cool riverfront breeze. With live music at weekends, sundown sessions, and guest bartenders, Up by KVL is the most vibrant rooftop bar in the city.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d24122988-Reviews-Up_by_KVL-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '379 Preah Sisowath Quay', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '379 Preah Sisowath Quay, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Pe