Urban Forage,here:pds:place:116aabd1-82517c9e26f602c73422b7a5f272c46c,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Urban Forage, ផ្លូវ សម្តេច ព្រះ សុគន្ធ មានបុណ្យ, 120203 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សម្តេច ព្រះ សុគន្ធ មានបុណ្យ', 'postalCode': '120203'}","{'lat': 11.56498, 'lng': 104.9248}","[{'lat': 11.56478, 'lng': 104.92485}]",6624,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4312190'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855885644740'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.urbanforage.co'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.564717,104.92455,4312190,Urban Forage,"Indulge in a culinary adventure unlike any other with our award-winning food and art tours. With over a decade of experience, we are the first of our kind in the country, offering a unique blend of gastronomy and urban art in the vibrant cities of Phnom Penh and Siem Reap. From savoring delicious local dishes to discovering stunning murals and graffiti, our tours showcase the best of Cambodia's food and street art scene. We were voted as the most unique tour operator in Asia and recently won the best food tour in Cambodia at the Asia Prestige Awards. Join us for an unforgettable adventure that will satisfy your taste buds and feed your artistic soul!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d4312190-Reviews-Urban_Forage-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@urbanforage.co,+855 88 564 4740,http://www.urbanforage.co,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d4312190-Urban_Forage-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': 