VM Hotel,here:pds:place:116w6498-9a37aa6d3f3b3dc4db3043ed3c59564f,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'VM Hotel, 120905 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ពោធិ៍សែនជ័យ', 'subdistrict': 'កំបូល', 'postalCode': '120905'}","{'lat': 11.53878, 'lng': 104.78723}","[{'lat': 11.5388, 'lng': 104.78737}]",74211,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25395239'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855712060111'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100088095906006'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.539269,104.7871,25395239,VM Hotel,"VM Hotel, Phnom Penh’s newest accommodation option, is set to open in May 2023 within close proximity of the city’s international airport. Travelers arriving or departing the Cambodian capital can now stay in the luxurious surrounds of this business class hotel with just 134 rooms, located just minutes from Phnom Penh International Airport. VM Hotel extends from the sixth to the ninth floors of the commercial, mixed-use development site known as CG Fortune Center. In addition to the hotel, the center also incorporates a shopping and lifestyle mall, commercial offices, and 154 units of an apartment block. The CG Fortune Center is destined to be a premium shopping precinct with numerous dining and lifestyle options to complement those within the hotel. VM Hotel is situated on the main access road from the airport to the city center, which is located just 15 minutes away. It is also close to golf courses, the University of Phnom Penh, hospitals, suburban factories, and several bustling local markets. The expressway to the coastal resort destination of Sihanoukville is located within 15 minutes of the property. Some of Phnom Penh’s leading tourist and leisure attractions are located just minutes away from the hotel. Hotel guests can retreat to the tranquility of the hotel after a busy day of sightseeing attractions in a city once referred to as the ‘Paris of the East’. These include the Royal Palace and Silver Pagoda, Wat Phnom, the Central Market, Wat Phnom, the Mekong and Tonle Sap Rivers, and the bustling riverfront. Many hotel rooms and suites offer panoramic views over the airport, while effective soundproofing provides a quiet and peaceful rest for guests. The hotel is perfect for both business and leisure travelers and especially for those who need to stay close to the airport. A meeting room that can accommodate 20 guests is available within the hotel. All rooms and suites feature plush bedding, flat-screen televisions, and complimentary wi-fi throughout the hotel. Guests can work out daily in the gym from 6.30 a.m. to 8 p.m., or relax beside the outdoor swimming pool. After a long day of work or sightseeing in the capital, hotel guests can unwind with a refreshing drink and meal in the hotel’s vibrant restaurant. It offers an enticing selection of local, Asian, and international dining delights, complemented by a comprehensive range of beverages. Those planning an intimate event or meeting can convene in the hotel’s meeting rooms. Other dining options include 24-hour room service or sampling the exciting array of outlets in the adjoining shopping mall. Current tenants include Starbucks, KFC, Shoo Loong Kan Hotpot, Da Tang Restaurant, Potato Corner, and Chrizt Ben Bread & Café, with more to open in the near future. Lucky Supermarket and MR DIY are anchor tenants and where hotel guests can stock up on personal requirements. The development is owned by Continent Crown Investment Management Co. Ltd., a multinational corporation focused on real estate development and investment.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d25395239-Reviews-VM_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 1679 Russian Boulevard', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '120912', 'address_string': 'No. 1679 Russian Boulevard, Phnom Penh 120912 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d25395239-VM_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#102 of 412 B&Bs / Inns in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '412', 'ranking': '102'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,5,"{'1': '0', '2': '2', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '3'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",31,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d25395239-m66827-Reviews-VM_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Shuttle Bus Service', 'Suites', 'Room service', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Airport transportation', 'Free Wifi', 'Meeting rooms', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Business center', 'Laundry Service', 'Air conditioning', 'Smoking rooms available', 'Conference Facilities', 'Safe', 'Flatscreen TV', 'Breakfast Available', 'Houseke