Vakara Hotel Kep,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-f0861a986be26d36e3ef733f7f99f513,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Vakara Hotel Kep, 220201 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'កែប', 'postalCode': '220201'}","{'lat': 10.48962, 'lng': 104.3133}","[{'lat': 10.48952, 'lng': 104.31339}]",5867,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23850411'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85561506363'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.vakarahotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.489685,104.31323,23850411,Vakara Hotel Kep,"The perfect family getaway at Vakara Hotel Kep. A contemporary luxury Resort-style Hotel boasting the charm and splendor of a tropical hillside resort, Vakara Hotel Kep is submerged in an environment of lavish greenery and natural overlooking the magnificent Bay and Beautiful Kep National Park. The Resort hosts 77 rooms, including 14 tropical Bungalows, with 34m long swimming pools and a large garden setting. The resort offers superior services including complimentary use of fitness facility, Steam, Sauna, and free wi-fi for all guests. There are a number of nearby beaches and tourist places to visit during the day while our Kiri Terrace and pool bar is available for relaxation. From the hotel, Guest can take pleasure touring the city's top attractions such as Kep Beach, Angkul Beach, Kep National Park, Independent Monument, Kep Market, Crab Market, ride a motorbike to the limestone caves. Guests can take a day trip to Bokor Mountain, visit Kompot's old temples, and caves, or take a boat to Rabbit Island and learn Cambodian fishing techniques. Location & Access: In the heart of Kep, Kingdom of Cambodia Sea side: 0.8km Kep Beach: 2 km Angkol Beach: 3km Crab Market: 3 km Pier to Rabbit Island: 1km Kep Mark market: 1 km",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d23850411-Reviews-Vakara_Hotel_Kep-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 30m 2319', 'city': 'Kep', 'state': 'Kep Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '220201', 'address_string': 'Street 30m 2319, Kep 220201 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kep', 'location_id': '608456'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kep Province', 'location_id': '2366666'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608456-d23850411-Vakara_Hotel_Kep-Kep_Kep_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608456', 'ranking_string': '#7 of 31 hotels in Kep', 'geo_location_name': 'Kep', 'ranking_out_of': '31', 'ranking': '7'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,51,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '5', '5': '45'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",312,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608456-d23850411-m66827-Reviews-Vakara_Hotel_Kep-Kep_Kep_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Kids Activities', 'Free parking', 'Restaurant', 'Free Wifi', 'Breakfast included', 'Fitness 