Van Song Villa,here:pds:place:116w63gg-4fe8591c95984e5aa8fb0d9f04319c83,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Van Song Villa, ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ សុខសាន្ត', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35438, 'lng': 103.8474}","[{'lat': 13.35427, 'lng': 103.84748}]",25374,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '8396986'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563965992'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.354389,103.8474,8396986,Van Song  Villa,"Van Song Villa is located in the central district of Siem Reap, offers and features simple and modern accommodation with air-con, tea/coffee maker in room, hot and cool shower, 32-inch flat screen cable TVs, hairdryer, free toiletries, slippers, business center, and free WiFi access throughout the property. It features an outdoor pool, 24-hour front desk and free parking on site. The Villa is just 600 meters from Angkor Night Market and 700 meters from the bustling Pub Street and Old Market. The UNESCO World Heritage Site of Angkor Wat is 6.5 km away, while Siem Reap International Airport is accessible with a 7 km drive with our free transfer. Offering city or Street views, rooms come with Air-con, tiled flooring, and seating area. Guests have access to a shared or private bathroom with shower facility. A daily housekeeping service is provided. At Van Song Villa, the staff can assist with bicycle/car rentals, luggage storage, and currency exchange and laundry services. Ticketing and tour activities can also be arranged, while airport transfers and shuttle services are available at a surcharge. The in-house restaurant serves a tasty selection of local, Asian and Continental cuisine. Special diet meals can be prepared upon request, while a variety of drinks are offered at the poolside bar as well as view of greenery garden.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d8396986-Reviews-Van_Song_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '# 50 Sok San Road, Svay Dangkum Commune', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': '# 50 Sok San Road, Svay Dangkum Commune, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d8396986-Van_Song_Villa-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#132 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '132'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,96,"{'1': '5', '2': '3', '3': '9', '4': '28', '5': '51'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.c