Vanden's Kampot Tuk-Tuk Tours,here:pds:place:116w3fhd-730c51c633fab22a3bf7e5c433cc0260,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': ""Vanden's Kampot Tuk-Tuk Tours, 070203 ទឹកឈូរ, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'ទឹកឈូរ', 'district': 'កំពង់ក្រែង', 'postalCode': '070203'}","{'lat': 10.64433, 'lng': 104.17347}","[{'lat': 10.64436, 'lng': 104.1736}]",22296,"[{'id': '400-4100-0041', 'name': 'Transportation Service', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27506448'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855963027735'}]}],"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:00 - 22:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT14H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Kampot,10.643999,104.171974,27506448,Vanden's Kampot Tuk-tuk Tours,"I enjoy providing Tuk Tuk tours in and around Kampot. Pepper plantations, waterfalls, salt fields, kayak trips, bat caves, homestays or just a tour of my beautiful Kampot town! I have worked as a Tuk Tuk driver for more than 10 years, aswell as western hospitality. I can also organise Homestays for you and your family here in Kampot. Nothing is too small or too big! Please ask :)",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g608455-d27506448-Reviews-Vanden_s_Kampot_Tuk_tuk_Tours-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Kampot Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,vandenkampot@gmail.com,+855 96 302 7735,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d27506448-Vanden_s_Kampot_Tuk_tuk_Tours-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#15 of 26 Transportation in K