Vanna Hill Resort,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-69629226becb4ea491d398532c6134a7,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Vanna Hill Resort, ផ្លូវ 33 អេ, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 33 អេ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.48618, 'lng': 104.2927}","[{'lat': 10.48622, 'lng': 104.29283}]",7626,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512755038'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.vannahillresort.asia'}]}]",Not Available,Kep,10.489568,104.29443,1573393,Vanna Hill Resort,"Finding an ideal romantic hotel in Kep does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Vanna Hill Resort, a nice option for travelers like you.
As your “home away from home,” the hotel rooms offer a flat screen TV, a minibar, and a refrigerator, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
Guests have access to baggage storage, express check-in and check-out, and 24 hour security while staying at Vanna Hill Hotel. In addition, Vanna Hill Resort offers a pool and free breakfast, which will help make your Kep trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
For those interested in checking out Patio (2.0 mi) while visiting Kep, Vanna Hill Resort is a short distance away.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of Kep's popular shrimp restaurants such as Sailing Club, Kimly Restaurant, and Holy Crab, all a short distance from Vanna Hill Resort.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Crab Statue (0.9 mi) or Jasmine Valley Skate Bowl (0.9 mi), which are popular attractions amongst tourists, and they are all within walking distance.
Vanna Hill Resort puts the best of Kep at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
