Vannys Homestay Battambang,here:pds:place:116w636s-91c512774abb3766ebc338d1a0889ceb,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Vannys Homestay Battambang, 021404 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'ចម្ការសំរោង', 'postalCode': '021404'}","{'lat': 13.11329, 'lng': 103.20832}","[{'lat': 13.11329, 'lng': 103.20832}]",97579,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26856610'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85598555543'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://homestaycambodia.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.113642,103.206474,26856610,Vannys Homestay Battambang,"How about local living experience with my family in Battambang. We’re offering accommodations, foods and drinks, I am sure you will love it. We’re a local family live in Battambang since Pol Pot error ends. My dad, who survived after the war in 1975 till 1979 can share his experiences during that war. He is one of the luckiest who survived during this awful time, now you can have chance to talk to him and he will reveal what was happening than. Our accommodations is very basic, we lives at wooden house, there is a kitchen, three bathrooms, good shower , a place where you can hang out for a coffee, tea and snacks, we would like to offer you cooking our traditional foods too, We have a lovely neighborhood, there are coffee stand, secondary school, old temple, clinics near by. Some farms around it, especially close to the city about 10 minutes by walk to the city.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d26856610-Reviews-Vannys_Homestay_Battambang-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '387 Street 513', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '021404', 'address_string': '387 Street 513, Battambang 02