Velkommen Guesthouse Phnom Penh,here:pds:place:116aabd1-248d4bdabb7909d5afe6537742f9e14a,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Velkommen Guesthouse Phnom Penh, ផ្លូវ 144, 120205 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 144', 'postalCode': '120205'}","{'lat': 11.5704, 'lng': 104.92943}","[{'lat': 11.57053, 'lng': 104.92939}]",7126,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel'}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2079823'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2450322'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27456333'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85577757701'}, {'value': '+85587753364', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0055'}]}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.570443,104.92941,2079823,Velkommen Guesthouse,"Finding an ideal family-friendly guest house in Phnom Penh does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Velkommen Guesthouse, a nice option for travelers like you.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as air conditioning, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the guest house.
Velkommen Guesthouse features a 24 hour front desk, express check-in and check-out, and baggage storage, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts a lounge. If you are driving to Velkommen Guesthouse Hotel, there is free public parking available nearby.
While staying at Velkommen Guesthouse, visitors can check out Sisowath Quay (0.0 mi) and Wat Ounalom (0.2 mi), some of Phnom Penh's top attractions.
While in Phnom Penh, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Velkommen Guesthouse, including Romdeng (0.6 mi), Friends the Restaurant (0.3 mi), and Eclipse Sky Bar (1.1 mi).
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Royal Palace (0.5 mi) or Cambodia Post Office (0.4 mi), which are popular attractions amongst tourists, and they are all within walking distance.
Velkommen Guesthouse puts the best of Phnom Penh at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
