For those interested in checking out The Old Royal Cinema (0.2 mi) while visiting Kampot, Vibola Guesthouse is a short distance away.
The rooms offer air conditioning, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
In addition, as a valued Vibola Guesthouse guest, you can enjoy a pool that is available on-site. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
If you like cafes, Vibola Guesthouse is conveniently located near Epic Arts Cafe, Simple Things, and Cafe Espresso Kampot.
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Farm Link (0.8 mi), which is a popular attraction amongst tourists, and it is within walking distance.
The staff at Vibola Guesthouse looks forward to serving you during your upcoming visit.
