Victoria Boutique Hotel,here:pds:place:116daadf-45c652c61714cfc5d6ac875273514e47,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Victoria Boutique Hotel, ផ្លូវ អេ 1 2, 120705 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ឫស្សីកែវ', 'subdistrict': 'ច្រាំងចម្រេះទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ អេ 1', 'postalCode': '120705', 'houseNumber': '2'}","{'lat': 11.6234, 'lng': 104.89857}","[{'lat': 11.62332, 'lng': 104.89846}]",70105,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7204767'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523933666'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.578008,104.9214,479813,Casa Boutique Hotel,"Finding an ideal boutique hotel in Phnom Penh does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Casa Boutique Hotel, a nice option for travelers like you.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as air conditioning and a minibar, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the hotel.
Casa Boutique Hotel features a concierge and room service, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts a rooftop pool and a lounge. If you are driving to Casa Boutique Hotel, free parking is available.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Sisowath Quay (0.8 mi) and Wat Ounalom (0.9 mi), guests of Casa Boutique Hotel can easily experience some of Phnom Penh's most well known attractions.
While in Phnom Penh, you may want to check out some of the restaurants that are a short walk away from Casa Boutique Hotel, including Romdeng (0.9 mi), Friends the Restaurant (0.9 mi), and FCC Phnom Penh Restaurant & Bar (1.0 mi).
If you’re looking for things to do, you can check out Royal Palace (1.2 mi) or Cambodia Post Office (0.3 mi), which are popular attractions amongst tourists, and they are all within walking distance.
Casa Boutique Hotel puts the best of Phnom Penh at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
