Victoria Hotel,here:pds:place:116w636e-bdfe95028bdd436d9c8a90b2bba557b3,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Victoria Hotel, 021409 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'អូរចារ', 'postalCode': '021409'}","{'lat': 13.10726, 'lng': 103.17703}","[{'lat': 13.10727, 'lng': 103.17717}]",11194,"[{'id': '500-5000-0000', 'name': 'Hotel/Motel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1453431'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85553730364'}]}],Not Available,Battambang,13.107262,103.17702,1453431,Victoria Hotel,"Victoria Hotel is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Battambang, offering a family-friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Rooms at Victoria Hotel offer air conditioning providing exceptional comfort and convenience, and guests can go online with free wifi.
A 24 hour front desk, room service, and baggage storage are some of the conveniences offered at this inn. An on-site restaurant will also help to make your stay even more special. If you are driving to Victoria Hotel, free parking is available.
Nearby landmarks such as White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (1.5 mi) and Prasat Sneung (1.9 mi) make Victoria Hotel a great place to stay when visiting Battambang.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of Battambang's popular ribs restaurants such as Jaan Bai Restaurant and Ambrosia Cafe, all a short distance from Victoria Hotel.
During your visit, be sure to check out a popular  like Ta Dumbong Statue, which is a short distance from the inn.
Enjoy your stay in Battambang!
