Villa Borann Boutique Hotel,here:pds:place:116httek-52bee54c83ac050c9614d0d0cc9ffc36,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Villa Borann Boutique Hotel, ផ្លូវ ព្រះអង្គយុគន្ធរ, 120207 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ចតុមុខ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ព្រះអង្គយុគន្ធរ', 'postalCode': '120207'}","{'lat': 11.55816, 'lng': 104.9303}","[{'lat': 11.55821, 'lng': 104.93044}]",74235,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3910195'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523211518'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/hotel.villaborann/?locale=sw_KE', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.5582,104.9304,3910195,Villa Borann Boutique Hotel,"Located 450 m from Independence Monument, Villa Borann offers accommodations in Phnom Penh. It features an outdoor swimming pool and guests can enjoy meals at the in-house restaurant or have a drink at the bar. Free WiFi is available throughout the property. it is 600 m to Wat Langka and Wat Botum Park. The Royal Palace and Chaktomouk Conference Hall 2 are 1 km away, while the National Museum is 1.6 km away. Phnom Penh International Airport is 11.2 km from the property. Airport transfers are available at additional charges. Fitted with a balcony offering views of the garden/pool, air-conditioned rooms are equipped with a personal safe, a flat-screen cable TV with DVD player, seating area and tea/coffee making facilities. En suite bathrooms come with hot and cold shower, along with free toiletries.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d3910195-Reviews-Villa_Borann_Boutique_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '235A Street 19', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12007', 'address_string': '235A Street 19, Phnom Penh 12007 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d3910195-Villa_Borann_Boutique_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#16 of 412 B&Bs / Inns in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '412', 'ranking': '16'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,203,"{'1': '9', '2': '14', '3': '31', '4': '67', '5': '82'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",104,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d3910195-m66827-Reviews-Villa_Borann_Boutique_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Internet', 'Free Internet', 'Free Wifi', 'Pool', 'Bar/Lounge', 'Public Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Air conditioning', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Refrigerator in room', 'Minibar', 'Flatscreen TV', 'Outdoor pool', 'Room service', 'Restaurant', 'Airport transportation', 'Wifi', 'Breakfast included', 'Concierge']",Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'bb', 'localized_name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"['Mid-range', 'Family']",[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '7'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '72'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '23'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '45'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '35'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,25,14
Villa Dani,here:pds:place:116w63gu-911462f1de1a4866abca2067df6c4a1a,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Villa Dani, 171206 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ជ្រាវ', 'postalCode': '171206'}","{'lat': 13.32393, 'lng': 103.89963}","[{'lat': 13.32392, 'lng': 103.89977}]",114589,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4340874'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512964599'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.villadani-siemreap.com'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.323936,103.899605,4340874,Villa Dani,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Siem Reap, Villa Dani is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as air conditioning.
Villa Dani features baggage storage, outdoor furniture, and a sun terrace, to help make your stay more enjoyable.
Best of all, Villa Dani makes it easy to experience many great Siem Reap attractions like Escape Break, Cambodia War Remnant Museum, and Angkor Panorama Museum, which are some popular history museums.
Villa Dani is sure to make your visit to Siem Reap one worth remembering.
