Villa Grange,here:pds:place:116w649g-8cc5bdd0881440d4b79312ec6203c0af,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Villa Grange, 120207 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ចតុមុខ', 'postalCode': '120207'}","{'lat': 11.5602, 'lng': 104.93046}","[{'lat': 11.56018, 'lng': 104.93046}]",7283,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '10404115'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855972602305'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.560198,104.93046,10404115,Villa Grange,"Welcome to the Villa Grange – a truly boutique hotel right in the most vibrant heart of Phnom Penh. Tucked away on 244 Street, we’re right by the city’s cosmopolitan café strip boasting chic boutiques, funky art galleries, record shops, fabulous restaurants and even Phnom Penh’s famous Belgian chocolate shop. What’s more Villa Grange’s location “a hidden gem” between the Royal Palace and the alluring Wat Botum Pagoda” - offers our guests a tranquil and peaceful place to escape from the hustle and bustle of Cambodia’s buzzing capital, to rest and relax in our fabulous new rooms or simply layout with a refreshing drink and dip in the pool. Villa Grange is best loved as a welcoming and friendly place where staff and management welcome our diverse guests from around the world and ensure that you will be very comfortable and well looked after. Staff will be more than happy to suggest great ideas for you stay including booking shows and visits to local attractions",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d10404115-Reviews-Villa_Grange-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '5 74 Street 244 Chatomuk', 'street2': 'Building 5', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12101', 'address_string': '5 74 Street 244 Chatomuk Building 5, Phnom Penh 12101 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'P