Villa Pich Boutique,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-c448466f127f8802c731a1f383584403,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Villa Pich Boutique, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60679, 'lng': 104.19167}","[{'lat': 10.60687, 'lng': 104.19156}]",18483,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '27978429'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85578348814'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61555966566458&sk', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Kampot,10.614512,104.1976,23326708,Kampot Sweet Boutique,"Nestled within lush green gardens, Kampot Sweet Boutique offers accommodation away from the hustle and bustle of Kampot. The outdoor swimming pool as well aspool bar is accessible. Guests can enjoy a meal at the in-house restaurant. A continental breakfast is available daily at Sweet Restaurant. All units are equipped with private balcony, pool view & pool access, air conditioning, a flat-screen TV with setline, a fridge, a kettle, a shower, a hairdryer and a desk. At the hotel each room includes a wardrobe and a private bathroom. Every effort is made to make guests feel comfortable. To do so, the property provides the best in services and amenities. Top features of the property include free Wi-Fi in all rooms, 24-hour security, daily housekeeping, Just a short ride 1km to Kampot Provincial Museum, while Kampot Night Market is 1.8 km away. The nearest airport is Sihanoukville International, 60 km from the hotel, and the property offers a paid airport shuttle service.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d23326708-Reviews-Kampot_Sweet_Boutique-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Trapeang Thum, Tek Chhou', 'city': 'Kampot', 'state': 'Kampot Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '07416', 'address_string': 'Trapeang Thum, Tek Chhou, Kampot 07416 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampot', 'location_id': '608455'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampot Province', 'location_id': '2366664'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,1.19E+12,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g608455-d23326708-Kampot_Sweet_Boutique-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '608455', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 88 hotels in Kampot', 'geo_location_name': 'Kampot', 'ranking_out_of': '88', 'ranking': '1'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,76,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '8', '5': '69'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",199,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g608455-d23326708-m66827-Reviews-Kampot_Sweet_Boutique-Kampot_Kampot_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Kids Activities', 'Shuttle Bus Service', 'Suites', 'Room service', 'Free parking', 'Wheelchair access', 'Restaurant', 'Bar/Lou