Villa Sovann,here:pds:place:116w3cse-7037959c11be440e9febe4f8893d605d,en,bed_and_breakfast,"{'label': 'Villa Sovann, ផ្លូវ ក្រុង, 180403 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បី', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ក្រុង', 'postalCode': '180403'}","{'lat': 10.63858, 'lng': 103.50226}","[{'lat': 10.63858, 'lng': 103.50212}]",132553,"[{'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6555122'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855969179103'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://villasovann.wix.com/villa-sovann'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.638575,103.50221,6555122,Villa Sovann,"Located on Victory Beach in Sihanoukville, the ""Villa Sovann"" 200 sqm features a large private garden only at 50m away from the sandy beach.The villa has 3 air-condioned bedrooms all facing the sea, 2 bathrooms, 1 equipped kitchen and a spacious livingroom with a large outdoor terrace surrounded by a green tropical vegetation.The house is fully furnished for a perfect relaxing stay.The ""Villa Sovann"" offering also many services about trips, restaurants and car or motorbike renting.Local restaurants and a Casino a 2min walk.The house is in a safe complex.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d6555122-Reviews-Villa_Sovann-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street Vithei Krong', 'street2': 'Victory Beach', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': 'Street Vithei Krong Victory Beach, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserRev