Visal Sak Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3f5t-c8cd205fe70943198819bad973aee094,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Visal Sak Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 33 អេ, 220202 កែប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កែប', 'city': 'កែប', 'district': 'ព្រៃធំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 33 អេ', 'postalCode': '220202'}","{'lat': 10.49814, 'lng': 104.28975}","[{'lat': 10.49809, 'lng': 104.28962}]",7046,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3313927'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85581330178'}]}],Not Available,Kep,10.498217,104.289986,3313927,Visal Sak Guesthouse,"Visal Sak Guesthouse is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Kep, offering a family-friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
While staying at Visal Sak Guesthouse, visitors can check out Patio (2.1 mi), which is a popular Kep attraction.
Visal Sak Guesthouse offers guests an array of room amenities including a flat screen TV, air conditioning, and a desk, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available.
The guest house offers 24 hour check-in, room service, and 24 hour security, to make your visit even more pleasant. The property also features an on-site restaurant. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
During your visit, be sure to check out a popular Kep tempura restaurant such as Holy Crab, which is a short distance from Visal Sak Guesthouse.
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular monuments and statues such as Crab Statue.
Enjoy your stay in Kep!
