Visal Tuk-Tuk Tours in Phnom Penh,here:pds:place:116w649g-bf63203f6ee943298462101a33db6b70,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Visal Tuk-Tuk Tours in Phnom Penh, ផ្លូវ 19, 120208 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ជ័យជំនះ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 19', 'postalCode': '120208'}","{'lat': 11.56266, 'lng': 104.92842}","[{'lat': 11.56269, 'lng': 104.92852}]",7034,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}, {'id': '700-7400-0133', 'name': 'Travel Agent/Ticketing'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '16658126'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593343009'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/pages/category/Tour-Agency/Visal-Tuk-Tuk-Tours-in-Phnom-Penh-108949603262571'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.5625,104.92865,16658126,Visal Tuk-Tuk Tours in Phnom Penh,"Hello, my name is Visal and I am an experienced Tuk Tuk driver and guide in Phnom Penh. I know all the tourist attractions to visit and can explain about them. As a born and bred local I can give you an insight into local Cambodian lifestyle, food and culture. You want the freedom on your holiday to do what you want and see the sights you want to see? My Tuk Tuk service offers set tours or customised tours of your choice with personalised pick-up and drop off to and from the airport or bus stations for an extra charge. My open air Tuk Tuk is perfect for touring in hot weather. So if you are looking for a local tour guide who can take you to all the sights and explain the history in a friendly and relaxed way please contact me to make a tour reservation. Thankyou for your interest. I look forward to you touring with me. Visal",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d16658126-Reviews-Visal_Tuk_Tuk_Tours_in_Phnom_Penh-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '150 Preah Ang Yukanthor Street', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string