Vken Coffee,here:pds:place:116w64ur-f044bb4aeb2a4ca8aac001b8b0eae4b9,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Vken Coffee, 030404 កំពង់ចាម, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'city': 'កំពង់ចាម', 'district': 'វាលវង់', 'postalCode': '030404'}","{'lat': 11.98957, 'lng': 105.46269}","[{'lat': 11.98957, 'lng': 105.46269}]",25245,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]",Not available,Not Available,Not Available,Not Available,Kampong Cham,11.989387,105.46278,2713194,Hao An Restaurant,"HAO AN Restaurant is located in the centre of Kampong Cham City. HAO AN is refer to a Chinese name with the meaning of Grand, Heroic, Safe and Peace. It's a well-known restaurant here for we open business for more than 20 years! Here we offer variety services such as Breakfast, Brunch, Lunch and Dinner with mixing of Khmer, Chinese and Europe Cuisine in our menu. In addition, there is also family Suki Soup in the evening. With many tables and rooms options, include outdoor seats, indoor seats, large aircon rooms and individual VIP rooms, meeting rooms, we try our best to fulfill your need. And lastly, we accept table reservations and delivery around Kampong Cham City.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g659642-d2713194-Reviews-Hao_An_Restaurant-Kampong_Cham_Kampong_Cham_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Preah Monivong Boulevard', 'city': 'Kampong Cham', 'state': 'Kampong Cham Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Preah Monivong Boulevard, Kampong Cham Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Kampong Cham', 'location_id': '659642'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Kampong Cham Province', 'location_id': '2366656'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,+855 17 366 616,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g659642-d2713194-Hao_An_Restaurant-Kampong_Cham_Kampong_Cham_Province.html?m=66827,"{'g