Votey Bormey,here:pds:place:116w63uh-9d8931549cd9ed7e082863a5e3a03cfe,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Votey Bormey, ផ្លូវជាតិ 67, 170509 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'អំពិល', 'street': 'ផ្លូវជាតិ 67', 'postalCode': '170509'}","{'lat': 13.3778, 'lng': 103.92225}","[{'lat': 13.3778, 'lng': 103.92225}]",18465,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]","[{'id': '200-000', 'name': 'Asian', 'primary': True}, {'id': '205-000', 'name': 'Thai'}, {'id': '256-000', 'name': 'Cambodian'}, {'id': '800-080', 'name': 'Soup'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23596049'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855714703927'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/VoteyBormeyRestaurant'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 23:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT16H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.3778,103.92225,23596049,Votey Bormey,"Small local restaurant owned by Rom and Lyna Piseth— their second strong restaurant! They serve classic, well-executed Khmer/Cambodian and Thai dishes-- sausage balls, seafood dishes, soups, noodles, stir-fries with rice, fresh fruit shakes and specialty coffees. All ingredients are fresh, including pickled peppers and sauces. Cozy restaurant with inside and outside (covered) seating and friendly service. Cash only (KHR, USD). ... This business is going strong in 2021! All kitchen staff are vaccinated. Located midway between Angkor Wat, Bayon Temple (to the west) and Chaw Srei Vibol Temple (to the east) at the corner of NR 67 and Rd. No. 60 (north side). English friendly establishment, with translated menu and local guide who can help you plan your activities and trip. NOTE: Coordinates are 13.3778000, 103.9222513",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d23596049-Reviews-Votey_Bormey-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '67 National Rd and Road Number 60', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': '67 National Rd and Road Number 60, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,+855 71 470 3927,http://www.facebook.com/VoteyBormeyRestaurant,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d23596049-Votey_Bormey-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#617 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '617'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,4,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '0', '5': '4'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",47,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d23596049-m66827-Reviews-Votey_Bormey-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0700'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '2300'}}, {'open': {'day': 7, 'time': '0700