Vuthy Angkor Transportation,here:pds:place:116w63u4-0055285e7da3e8879913a7b69bf8e4b0,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Vuthy Angkor Transportation, ផ្លូវខេត្ត 2អេសអ3, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវខេត្ត 2អេសអ3', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36992, 'lng': 103.83896}","[{'lat': 13.36992, 'lng': 103.8391}]",87854,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '26792086'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569479077'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://vuthyangkortransportation.com'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 00:00 - 23:30'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T000000', 'duration': 'PT23H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.369906,103.83886,26792086,Vuthy Angkor Transportation,"Hello I'm Vuthy! It's great to meet you, I am an English Speaking Tuk Tuk driver, I have experience as a Tuk Tuk and Car driver in Siem Reap for almost 10 years. I could taking you to the visit magnificent temples of Angkor or providing insights into the local culture and cuisine. If you have any questions or need information or assistance, feel free to ask me. I want you to know more about our country. I look forward to serving you here in Siem Reap, Angkor Cambodia. Best Regards, vuthyangkor222@gmail.com",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d26792086-Reviews-Vuthy_Angkor_Transportation-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,vuthyangkor222@gmail.com,+855 69 479 077,https://vu