Vy Chhe Hotel,here:pds:place:116w636s-ac1b3da83bee43a0bdbb5795a8208806,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Vy Chhe Hotel, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09865, 'lng': 103.20051}","[{'lat': 13.09867, 'lng': 103.20037}]",12592,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2521375'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85553953898'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.vychhehotel.com'}]}]",Not Available,Battambang,13.098664,103.200424,2521375,VY CHHE Hotel,"See why so many travelers make VY CHHE Hotel their hotel of choice when visiting Battambang. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a budget friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
While staying at VY CHHE Hotel, visitors can check out White Elephant Pagoda (Wat Tahm-rai-saw) (0.2 mi) and Prasat Sneung (0.6 mi), some of Battambang's top attractions.
As your “home away from home,” the hotel rooms offer a flat screen TV, air conditioning, and a minibar, and getting online is easy, with free wifi available.
Guests have access to a 24 hour front desk, a concierge, and 24 hour check-in while staying at VY CHHE Hotel. In addition, VY CHHE Hotel offers free instant coffee, which will help make your Battambang trip additionally gratifying. And, as an added convenience, there is free parking available to guests.
Travelers looking to enjoy some tapas can head to The Lonely Tree Cafe or VINTAGE. Otherwise, you may want to check out an Asian restaurant such as Jaan Bai Restaurant, Smokin' Pot, or Nary Kitchen.
If you are interested in exploring Battambang, check out one of the art museums, such as ROMCHEIK 5 Art Space and Tep Kao Sol Loeum Lorn Gallery.
At VY CHHE Hotel, your comfort and satisfaction come first, and they look forward to welcoming you to Battambang.
