Wai Hong Angkor Guest House,here:pds:place:116aabd1-c92bdd93bc3c07d89c9dffb57c772f9c,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Wai Hong Angkor Guest House, ផ្លូវ បាខែង, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ បាខែង', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36361, 'lng': 103.85053}","[{'lat': 13.36349, 'lng': 103.85055}]",24393,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12171415'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '20955164'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6216063'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85516558867', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}, {'value': '+85578400500'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.36538,103.85238,6216063,Wai Hong Angkor Guest House,"Finding an ideal luxury guest house in Siem Reap does not have to be difficult. Welcome to Wai Hong Angkor Guest House, a nice option for travelers like you.
You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer a refrigerator, air conditioning, and a minibar, and you can stay connected during your stay as Wai Hong Angkor Guest House offers guests free wifi.
The guest house features a 24 hour front desk and baggage storage.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Seng English Speaking Tuk Tuk & Car Driver (0.4 mi) and Friendly Tuk Tuk Driver (0.5 mi), guests of Wai Hong Angkor Guest House can easily experience some of Siem Reap's most well known attractions.
Siem Reap has plenty of French restaurants. So when you’re here, be sure to check out popular spots like Georges French Restaurant Siem Reap, Olive Cuisine de Saison, and Damnak Lounge Fine Dining, which are serving up some great dishes.
There is no shortage of things to do in the area: explore popular architectural buildings such as Banteay Samre, Banteay Kdei, and Ta Som.
Wai Hong Angkor Guest House puts the best of Siem Reap at your fingertips, making your stay both relaxing and enjoyable.
