Wat Banan Temple,here:pds:place:116w633e-60613142bb494466b66288cbba2f89e5,en,historical_monument,"{'label': 'Wat Banan Temple, 020102 បាណន់, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាណន់', 'district': 'កន្ទីពីរ', 'postalCode': '020102'}","{'lat': 12.95162, 'lng': 103.14123}","[{'lat': 12.95172, 'lng': 103.14134}]",113103,"[{'id': '300-3200-0000', 'name': 'Religious Place', 'primary': True}, {'id': '300-3000-0025', 'name': 'Historical Monument'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2665043'}]",Not Available,"[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 07:00 - 19:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T070000', 'duration': 'PT12H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Battambang,12.951098,103.13999,2665043,Wat Banan Temple,"Wat Banan temple away from Battambang city about 25km. It’s a 358-stone-step climb up Phnom Banan to reach Prasat Banan, but the incredible views across surrounding countryside from the top are worth it. Udayadityavarman II, son of Suryavarman I, built Prasat Banan in the 11th century; some locals claim the five-tower layout here was the inspiration for Angkor Wat, although this seems optimistic.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g303666-d2665043-Reviews-Wat_Banan_Temple-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Banan Hill', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': 'Banan Hill, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d2665043-Wat_Banan_Temple-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '303666', 'ranking_string': '#4 of 35 things to do i