Wat Else Cafe,here:pds:place:116w63gg-0a631e266fe044c4ae532cc40f8b9961,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Wat Else Cafe, ច្រកផ្លូវ ហ្វាំងគី, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ច្រកផ្លូវ ហ្វាំងគី', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35492, 'lng': 103.85012}","[{'lat': 13.35498, 'lng': 103.85}]",88273,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}]","[{'id': '800-064', 'name': 'International', 'primary': True}, {'id': '206-000', 'name': 'Vietnamese'}, {'id': '301-000', 'name': 'French'}, {'id': '311-000', 'name': 'Spanish'}, {'id': '800-083', 'name': 'Natural/Healthy'}]","[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '17599485'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85593572620'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.facebook.com/Wat-Else-Caf%C3%A9-443431309538152'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon, Tue, Thu-Sat: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Sun: 10:00 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT09H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,TH,FR,SA'}, {'start': 'T100000', 'duration': 'PT07H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:SU'}]}]",Siem Reap,13.354955,103.850044,17599485,Wat Else Cafe,"Since 2019. Relax, elegant and very reasonable prices - café / coffee shop in town. Homemade Food selection with large variety of Sandwiches including our delicious Vietnamese Banh Mi, but also multiple choices of Salads, fresh Pastries, Smoothie Bowls made with our Granola, Yogurts and much more... We also purpose a large choice of hot/ice Drinks with unique Coffees, Smoothies, and Juices. We make everything with fresh ingredients, passion and love, having the intention to bring happiness to every single guest with unique tastes. Let’s make your day beautiful by enjoying healthy foods, listening to chilled music, having fun with board games or just having a talk with your best friends enjoying a yummy Espresso, Cappuccino or Affogato.. We hope to see you very soon! Wat Else Café #coffee #ecofriendly #sandwich #breakfast #brunch #lunch #baguette #bestcoffee #watelse #café #tasty #bestdeals #hiddengem #bestinsiemreap #salads #AngkorWat #banhmi #best #coffeeshop #goodvibes",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g297390-d17599485-Reviews-Wat_Else_Cafe-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Funky Lane', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': 'Funky Lane, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,watelsesiemreap@gmail.com,+855 93 572 620,http://www.facebook.com/Wat-Else-Caf%C3%A9-443431309538152/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d17599485-Wat_Else_Cafe-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#127 of 1,292 Places to Eat in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '1292', 'ranking': '127'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,66,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '1', '4': '5', '5': '60'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_food', 'localized_name': 'Food', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_atmosphere', 'localized_name': 'Atmosphere', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",129,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g29