Wat Svai,here:pds:place:116w63u5-6861f2895ef64d86847e16284354516c,en,temple,"{'label': 'Wat Svai, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.36153, 'lng': 103.86114}","[{'lat': 13.36166, 'lng': 103.86117}]",23790,"[{'id': '300-3200-0031', 'name': 'Temple', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,Not Available,Not Available,Siem Reap,13.356683,103.85162,13200534,Angkor Wat Shared Tours,"For over 2 decades Angkor Wat Shared Tours has been one of the leading travel agencies in Siem Reap. Our guided tours are expertly crafted by local travel expert Siv Dara to provide you with an adventure you’ll remember forever. Our English-speaking and knowledgeable tour guides are here to help you learn the rich history of the Angkor Wat Temples, explore the beautiful waterfalls of the Phnom Kulen Mountain, and discover the true heart of Cambodia. We're excited for your journey with us! If you have any questions, feel free to contact us.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g297390-d13200534-Reviews-Angkor_Wat_Shared_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Taphul Road', 'street2': 'Just right behind the night market', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17252', 'address_string': 'Taphul Road Just right behind the night market, Siem Reap 17252 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,info@angkorwatsharedtours.com,+855 77 249 444,http://www.angkorwatsharedtours.com,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d13200534-Angkor_Wat_Shared_Tours-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#3 of 1,339 Tours in Siem R