Wat Trat,here:pds:place:116w62vt-107b9c9a951248a8a3ca5b5f39e429c3,en,temple,"{'label': 'Wat Trat, 021403 បាត់ដំបង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'city': 'បាត់ដំបង', 'district': 'រតនៈ', 'postalCode': '021403'}","{'lat': 13.09103, 'lng': 103.21302}","[{'lat': 13.09107, 'lng': 103.21289}]",98316,"[{'id': '300-3200-0031', 'name': 'Temple', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,Not Available,Not Available,Battambang,13.071915,103.20181,2542877,Maisons Wat Kor,"Our vision is to position MAISONS WAT KOR, BATTAMBANG as the premier destination where guests experience the harmonious blend of Cambodia's serene countryside, eco-conscious practices, and rich Khmer heritage. We aspire to be recognized as a beacon of sustainable tourism, offering a haven of tranquility and cultural immersion for discerning travelers seeking authentic experiences. Our goal is to foster local talent and expertise in the hospitality industry, empowering village communities to directly benefit from our presence. By providing training, employment opportunities, and support for local businesses, we aim to contribute to the sustainable development of the community while delivering exceptional experiences to our guests.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g303666-d2542877-Reviews-Maisons_Wat_Kor-Battambang_Battambang_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#221, Street 800', 'street2': 'Wat Kor Ancient Village', 'city': 'Battambang', 'state': 'Battambang Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '02000', 'address_string': '#221, Street 800 Wat Kor Ancient Village, Battambang 02000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Battambang', 'location_id': '303666'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Battambang Province', 'location_id': '2366626'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,1.19E+12,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g303666-d2542877-Maisons_Wat_Kor-Battambang_B