Watery Fowls Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w63u5-245a6a5f65494347b5bff683cd3ad834,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Watery Fowls Guesthouse, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.36761, 'lng': 103.85157}","[{'lat': 13.36772, 'lng': 103.85165}]",23994,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3381675'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569371426'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.36766,103.85161,3381675,Watery Fowls Guesthouse,"We only have four rooms so we are more a homestay than a guesthouse. There is a big guest lounge and a balcony. We do our best to keep the place spotless. Watery Fowls is quiet and peaceful but only 5 minutes to the town centre and easy access to Angkor Wat. We are opposite Abacus Restaurant - the best French restaurant in town.All rooms are air-con with bathroom, 32"" TV with 92 channels, minibar, desk and chair.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d3381675-Reviews-Watery_Fowls_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'House 6, Group 7, Sala Kanseng', 'street2': 'Svay Dungkhom', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'House 6, Group 7, Sala Kanseng Svay Dungkhom, Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d3381675-Watery_Fowls_Guesthouse-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#335 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '335'}",5,https: