Wau Restaurant Siemreap,here:pds:place:116w63u5-d146650804244e9d8f00f98ca420ec68,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'Wau Restaurant Siemreap, ផ្លូវ ស្ទឹងថ្មី, 171202 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្វាយដង្គំ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ស្ទឹងថ្មី', 'postalCode': '171202'}","{'lat': 13.35393, 'lng': 103.8493}","[{'lat': 13.35387, 'lng': 103.84942}]",25273,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}]","[{'id': '209-000', 'name': 'Malaysian', 'primary': True}]",Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512558820'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.363545,103.86083,297390,Siem Reap,"When the morning light washes over the overgrown temples and ruins of Angkor Wat, a simple Siem Reap sunrise becomes a profound event. The ancient structures are contained within one of the largest religious complexes in the world. The complex and the 12th century Angkor Thom royal city are considered the main reasons to visit Siem Reap. Get a lesson in national history at the Cambodian Cultural Village, and a lesson in bargaining at the Angkor Night Market, a bonanza of  shopping stalls, food vendors, and bars.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Tourism-g297390-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province-Vacations.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '', 'street2': '', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Tourism-g297390-m66827-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province-Vacations.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'geographic', 'localized_name': 'Geographic'}","[{'name': 'municipality', 'localized_name': 'Municipality'}]",Not available,Not available,[],Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,FALSE,20,20
