Wedding Magazine Cambodia,here:pds:place:116d408k-fd741af4152906564552a2f86b8949e8,en,gallery,"{'label': 'Wedding Magazine Cambodia, ផ្លូវ 168, 120301 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ប្រាំពីរ មករា', 'subdistrict': 'អូរឫស្សីទី មួយ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 168', 'postalCode': '120301'}","{'lat': 11.56424, 'lng': 104.91743}","[{'lat': 11.56435, 'lng': 104.91733}]",5827,"[{'id': '300-3000-0024', 'name': 'Gallery', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+85589853333'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://weddingmagazinecambodia.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.563291,104.92013,293940,Phnom Penh,"Budget-minded travelers will appreciate Phnom Penh's reasonably priced hotel rooms. Explore the city's temples, palaces, and the remnants of its French colonial history. Just outside the city, the The Killing Fields (Choeung Ek) are a reminder of Cambodia's tragic past-- a somber contrast to the booming city of today.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Tourism-g293940-Phnom_Penh-Vacations.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '', 'street2': '', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Tourism-g293940-m66827-Phnom_Penh-Vacations.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'geographic', 'localized_name': 'Geographic'}","[{'name': 'city', 'localized_name': 'City'}]",Not available,Not available,[],Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,FALSE,24,14
Wei Si Deng Hotel & Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w649u-1e94e1b0283d4f24bf0a4819e7c48fa5,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Wei Si Deng Hotel & Restaurant, 080601 ល្វាឯម, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កណ្ដាល', 'city': 'ល្វាឯម', 'district': 'អរិយក្សត្រ', 'postalCode': '080601'}","{'lat': 11.57386, 'lng': 104.97986}","[{'lat': 11.57374, 'lng': 104.97979}]",55030,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2031814'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523212247'}]}],Not Available,Kandal,11.574083,104.98003,2031814,Wei Si Deng Hotel & Restaurant,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Phnom Penh, NaNa Hotel & Caffe Restaurant is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation.
Guest rooms offer amenities such as air conditioning, and guests can go online with free wifi offered by the hotel.
NaNa Hotel & Caffe Restaurant features a 24 hour front desk, room service, and a concierge, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts an on-site restaurant. If you are driving to NaNa Hotel & Caffe Restaurant, free parking is available.
Plus, during your trip, don't forget to check out a park, such as Royal Palace Park.
Whether you’re traveling for business, pleasure or both, NaNa Hotel & Caffe Restaurant is sure to make your visit to Phnom Penh one worth remembering.
",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d2031814-Reviews-Wei_Si_Deng_Hotel_Restaurant-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 154, Sangkat Phsarthmey III', 'street2': 'Khan Daun', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': 'Street 154, Sangkat Phsarthmey III Khan Daun, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d2031814-Wei_Si_Deng_Hotel_Restaurant-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#299 of 528 hotels in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '528', 'ranking': '299'}",3,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/3.0-66827-5.svg,83,"{'1': '8', '2': '12', '3': '33', '4': '25', '5': '5'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.5.svg', 'value': '3.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss3.0.svg', 'value': '3.0'}}",64,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d2031814-m66827-Reviews-Wei_Si_Deng_Hotel_R