White Pigeon Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3fh6-f48bcd14fc724a979fa69c1d3cee5fb0,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'White Pigeon Guesthouse, 070801 កំពត, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កំពត', 'city': 'កំពត', 'district': 'កំពង់កណ្ដាល', 'postalCode': '070801'}","{'lat': 10.60752, 'lng': 104.18176}","[{'lat': 10.60743, 'lng': 104.18166}]",19495,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '7023904'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512945576'}]}],Not Available,Kampot,10.607522,104.18175,7023904,White Pigeon Guesthouse,"Everyone needs a place to lay their weary head. For travelers visiting Kampot, White Pigeon Guesthouse is an excellent choice for rest and rejuvenation. Well-known for its romantic environment and proximity to great restaurants and attractions, White Pigeon Guesthouse makes it easy to enjoy the best of Kampot.
White Pigeon Guesthouse offers guests an array of room amenities including air conditioning, a desk, and a seating area, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available.
The guest house offers baggage storage, to make your visit even more pleasant. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
Close to The Old Royal Cinema (0.1 mi), a popular Kampot landmark, White Pigeon Guesthouse is a great destination for tourists.
During your visit, be sure to check out one of Kampot's popular falafel restaurants such as Simple Things, Cafe Espresso Kampot, and Aroma House, all a short distance from White Pigeon Guesthouse.
If you are interested in exploring Kampot, check out a history museum, such as Kampot Museum.
White Pigeon Guesthouse is sure to make your visit to Kampot one worth remembering.
