White Rabbit Hostel,here:pds:place:116w63gg-56cd96e3f60b437aafb1fa5d91dd9cfb,en,hostel,"{'label': 'White Rabbit Hostel, 171204 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សាលាកម្រើក', 'postalCode': '171204'}","{'lat': 13.35345, 'lng': 103.86031}","[{'lat': 13.35332, 'lng': 103.86026}]",24531,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12861914'}, {'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '21240115'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85563963961'}, {'value': '+85587482270'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/WhiteRabbitHostelSiemReap'}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.353446,103.86031,12861914,White Rabbit Hostel,"Welcome to wonderland. You’re looking for a unique experience? A way to escape reality? You’ve come to the right place! Just a 10 min walk away from Pub Street and the famous old market, in the heart of Siem Reap we offer one of the biggest Hostel Pools, with a length of 21 meters. Our reception is open 24/7 so we make sure you can check-in at any time. We run our pub crawls three times a week and our Bar and Restaurant is open from 8am - 11pm every day where music is played and friends are made! Opened in August 2017 by a German backpacker, a line of Art runs throughout the whole hostel. We are an Alice in Wonderland themed boutique hostel, each of our rooms is designed and decorated in a different style. We offer a mixture of dormitories and private rooms. Join us for an amazing time in Siem Reap! :)",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12861914-Reviews-White_Rabbit_Hostel-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Street 26', 'street2': 'Wat Bo', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': 'Street 26 Wat Bo, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'