White Restaurant,here:pds:place:116w649d-68bea8eee80f43e0bf066ba427574b53,en,casual_dining,"{'label': 'White Restaurant, 120909 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ពោធិ៍សែនជ័យ', 'subdistrict': 'ចោមចៅ', 'postalCode': '120909'}","{'lat': 11.53187, 'lng': 104.8615}","[{'lat': 11.53186, 'lng': 104.86164}]",4014,"[{'id': '100-1000-0001', 'name': 'Casual Dining', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '600-6300-0244', 'name': 'Bakery & Baked Goods Store'}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85569506081'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.530693,104.84603,26552751,Nimith Hotel And Restaurant,"Nimith Hotel & Restaurant established in 2023, located on Veng Sreng Street, close to Phnom Penh International Airport, just 2.5 km away and only 5 minutes spend, from the hotel to Royal Palace, only 9 km away and takes 15 minutes.The hotel has 19 rooms, all of rooms which have beautiful carpets, a luxurious elevator, and comfortable restaurant with delicious Khmer, Asian cuisine and Europe’s Foods. Nearby the hotel are entertainment clubs, shopping malls, special economic zones, expressways and an international airport. The hotel also has 2 meeting rooms and organizes trips for national and international guests to visit some of the city’s and rural tourist destinations.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d26552751-Reviews-Nimith_Hotel_And_Restaurant-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Veng Sreng Blvd, Phnom Penh, Cambodia', 'street2': 'No. 35e', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '120910', 'address_string': 'Veng Sreng Blvd, Phnom Penh, Cambodia No. 35e, Phnom Penh 120910 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g