White River Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116httek-902051bd309605fc88966841ed052e89,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'White River Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 178, 120206 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 178', 'postalCode': '120206'}","{'lat': 11.56592, 'lng': 104.92789}","[{'lat': 11.56581, 'lng': 104.92793}]",6956,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '4685817'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523990576'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.565849,104.927864,4685817,White River guesthouse,"White River Guest House is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Phnom Penh, offering a budget friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Given the close proximity of popular landmarks, such as Champey Academy of Arts (0.1 mi) and Wat Ounalom (0.2 mi), guests of White River Guest House can easily experience some of Phnom Penh's most well known attractions.
White River Guest House features a 24 hour front desk, to help make your stay more enjoyable. The property also boasts a lounge. If you are driving to White River Guest House, free parking is available.
When you’re feeling hungry, be sure to check out Brooklyn Pizza & Bistro, Piccola Italia Da Luigi, and Oskar Bistro, which are some Italian restaurants that are popular with locals and out-of-towners alike.
Should time allow, Royal Palace is a popular attraction that is within walking distance.
Enjoy your stay in Phnom Penh!
