White River II Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116aabd1-0607e77c8c02047bbd41a24c4f59e15b,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'White River II Guesthouse, ផ្លូវ 172, 120206 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដូនពេញ', 'subdistrict': 'ផ្សារកណ្ដាលទី ពីរ', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 172', 'postalCode': '120206'}","{'lat': 11.56677, 'lng': 104.92652}","[{'lat': 11.56664, 'lng': 104.92655}]",6804,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel'}, {'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '6764582'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523220680'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.566704,104.92653,6764582,White River II Guesthouse,"See why so many travelers make White River II Guesthouse their guest house of choice when visiting Phnom Penh. Providing an ideal mix of value, comfort and convenience, it offers a budget friendly setting with an array of amenities designed for travelers like you.
The rooms offer air conditioning, and getting online is possible, as free wifi is available, allowing you to rest and refresh with ease.
White River II Guesthouse features a 24 hour front desk, room service, and newspaper. In addition, as a valued White River II Guesthouse guest, you can enjoy a lounge that is available on-site. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
Nearby landmarks such as Champey Academy of Arts (0.1 mi) and Wat Ounalom (0.3 mi) make White River II Guesthouse a great place to stay when visiting Phnom Penh.
If you like Italian restaurants, White River II Guesthouse is conveniently located near Brooklyn Pizza & Bistro, Piccola Italia Da Luigi, and Oskar Bistro.
Looking to explore? Then look no further than Royal Palace (0.4 mi), which is a popular Phnom Penh attraction – and it is conveniently located within walking distance of the guest house.
We’re sure you’ll enjoy your stay at White River II Guesthouse as you experience all of the things Phnom Penh has to offer.
