Wildlife Alliance,here:pds:place:116w6482-4a694d248ac94c05897acbf59c979cec,en,landmark_attraction,"{'label': 'Wildlife Alliance, 210815 បាទី, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'តាកែវ', 'city': 'បាទី', 'district': 'ត្រពាំងសាប', 'postalCode': '210815'}","{'lat': 11.30419, 'lng': 104.79154}","[{'lat': 11.30432, 'lng': 104.79155}]",61992,"[{'id': '300-3000-0000', 'name': 'Landmark-Attraction', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '5580929'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85595970175'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.wildlifealliance.org/wildlife-phnom-tamao'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sat: 08:00 - 17:00'], 'isOpen': False, 'structured': [{'start': 'T080000', 'duration': 'PT09H00M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA'}]}]",Takeo,11.302797,104.79151,5580929,Wildlife Alliance,"Wildlife Alliance offers an exclusive Behind the Scenes tour at Cambodia’s biggest wildlife sanctuary, Phnom Tamao Wildlife Rescue Centre ! Book a tour to access all areas, including the elephant meadow, tiger den, and nursery section. Meet the animals and the keepers who care for them around the clock. Highlights include walking with female ambassador elephant Lucky, watching male elephant Chhouk get his prosthetic shoe changed, up close encounters with tigers, and entering the enclosure to hand feed and play with baby monkeys! The cost is a tax-deductible donation and 100% of profits support wildlife rescue, rehabilitation, care and release in Cambodia! We look forward to introducing you to our animals!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d5580929-Reviews-Wildlife_Alliance-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '9AB, St21', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': 'Chamkarmon District', 'address_string': '9AB, St21, Phnom Penh Chamkarmon District Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,wildlifetourspt@wildlifealliance.org,+855 95 970 175,http://www.wildlifealliance.org/wildlife-phnom-tamao/,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d5580929-Wildlife_Alliance-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#3 of 131 Outdoor Activities in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '131', 'ranking': '3'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,341,"{'1': '0', '2': '3', '3': '1', '4': '7', '5': '330'}",Not available,526,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attraction_Review-g293940-d5580929-m66827-Reviews-Wildlife_Alliance-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,Not available,"{'periods': [{'open': {'day': 1, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 1, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 2, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 2, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 3, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 3, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 4, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 4, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 5, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 5, 'time': '1700'}}, {'open': {'day': 6, 'time': '0800'}, 'close': {'day': 6, 'time': '1700'}}], 'weekday_text': ['Monday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Tuesday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Wednesday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Thursday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Friday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Saturday: 08:00 - 17:00', 'Sunday: Closed']}",Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'attraction', 'localized_name': 'Attraction'}","[{'name': 'sightseeing_tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours'}, {'name': 'activities', 'localized_name': 'Activities'}, {'name': 'outdoor_activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities'}]","[{'name': 'Tours', 'localized_name': 'Tours', 'categories': [{'name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours', 'localized_name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours'}]}, {'name': 'Outdoor Activities', 'localized_name': 'Outdoor Activities', 'categories': [{'name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours', 'localized_name': 'Nature & Wildlife Tours'}]}]",Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '1'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '130'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '68'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '56'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '40'}]","[{'award_type': 'Travelers Choice', 'year': '2024', 'images': {'tiny': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2024_L.png', 'small': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2024_L.png', 'large': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2024_L.png'}, 'categories': [], 'display_name': 'Travelers Choice'}, {'award_type': 'Travelers Choice', 'year': '2023', 'images': {'tiny': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png', 'small': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png', 'large': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/travelers_choice/widgets/tchotel_2023_L.png'}, 'categories': [], 'display_name': 'Travelers Choice'}]",Not available,Not available,FALSE,31,23
William's Houses,here:pds:place:116w664r-6cbe3e3c0e31f38d25ce03022c796c04,en,hotel,"{'label': ""William's Houses, 171201 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា"", 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'ស្លក្រាម', 'postalCode': '171201'}","{'lat': 13.36264, 'lng': 103.8758}","[{'lat': 13.36262, 'lng': 103.87594}]",22680,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '23887041'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85512557553'}]}],Not Available,Siem Reap,13.362637,103.87583,23887041,William's Houses,"William is a the name given to our first child who was still born. ""William Koy"" is his name and through this special hotel, named in his memory, we aim to support the children of Siem Reap, Cambodia. William Houses is privately owned by Khmer family with 6 contemporary design rooms located 20minutes from World largest Monuments Angkor Wat and 5minutes walk to one of the biggest local Market Phsa Leu and 10minutes by tuk tuk to night market and old market. The rooms are designed and tailors made to an impeccable standard, our interior design combines sustainably sourced native timber and floor tiles features with locally handmade soft furnishings to create a place of serene, laid back luxury.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d23887041-Reviews-William_s_Houses-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'National Road 6, psa leu, Slar Kram commune', 'street2': ""William's Houses"", 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17251', 'address_string': ""National Road 6, psa leu, Slar Kram commune William's Houses, Siem Reap 17251 Cambodia""}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not availab