Wish You Were Here. Guesthouse & Bar,here:pds:place:116w3csh-cb0c5c7b0e6b4d0f8b53903b942c8b03,en,hostel,"{'label': 'Wish You Were Here. Guesthouse & Bar, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.57793, 'lng': 103.54816}","[{'lat': 10.57785, 'lng': 103.54805}]",87066,"[{'id': '500-5100-0055', 'name': 'Hostel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '2548943'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855972415884'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.wishotres.com'}]}]",Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.577956,103.5482,2548943,Wish You Were Here... Guesthouse & Bar,"Wish Otres Beach offers clean & comfortable backpacker accomodation at affordable prices... For the budget concious, we offer dorm beds with fan & a personal locker for your belongings... Relax in the hanging chairs or up on the balcony… have a beer with your mates or sip on one of our tasty cocktails as you watch an amazing cambodian sunset over Otres Beach... Our Dorms have their own chillout area with an amazing view up on the balcony & are located above the bar & restaurant area. We also offer twin rooms with two single beds. Doubles & bungalows all have double beds, - all with shared bathroom. Our bungalows also have personal lockers & private balconies. Double Room with Private Bathroom & Hot Water available. We have 24hr Security, Free Wi-Fi, Laundry service, Secure Bag Storage, Mosquito Net, Towel & Blanket provided for all guests… Wish Sunday Sessions… Live Music every Sunday, 75c Beer, Cocktail & Food specials All Day... Our Tasty menu is available from 7.30am - 10pm with a mix of Western/Khmer food at great prices. Food Specials every night! Authentic homestyle Sri-Lankan Curry night every Thursday night. Our awesome kitchen staff do their best to make your stay with us as memorable as possible!! During your stay at Wish, our friendly staff will answer any questions you have about Cambodia or what to do whilst on Otres Beach & around Sihanoukville. Visit Ream National Park, Waterfalls, or take a Boat trip to Koh Rong, Koh Ta Kiev or one of the many islands off the coast… Also, it's possible to book buses & visas with us to your next destination… tuk-tuk ride to the bus station included!! We suggest spending a couple of days relaxing on the beach and you will see why so many never want to leave…",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d2548943-Reviews-Wish_You_Were_Here_Guesthouse_Bar-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '4 Sangkat', 'street2': 'Otres Beach', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': '4 Sangkat Otres Beach, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d2548943-Wish_You_Were_Here_Guesthouse_Bar-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '325573', 'ranking_string': '#25 of 277 Specialty lodging in Sihanoukville', 'geo_location_name': 'Sihanoukville', 'ranking_out_of': '277', 'ranking': '25'}",4,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.0-66827-5.svg,259,"{'1': '28', '2': '22', '3': '24', '4': '41', '5': '144'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.t