Woori Cafe,here:pds:place:116w6496-a8e5a5522d89e22382cfcd868c1f17c7,en,coffee,"{'label': 'Woori Cafe, ផ្លូវ ព្រៃសរ 20, 120504 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ដង្កោរ', 'subdistrict': 'ព្រៃស', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ ព្រៃសរ', 'postalCode': '120504', 'houseNumber': '20'}","{'lat': 11.49403, 'lng': 104.85888}","[{'lat': 11.49389, 'lng': 104.85888}]",56918,"[{'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '25181759'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855969888061'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/wooricaferestaurant'}]}]","[{'text': ['Mon-Sun: 08:30 - 19:00'], 'isOpen': True, 'structured': [{'start': 'T083000', 'duration': 'PT10H30M', 'recurrence': 'FREQ:DAILY;BYDAY:MO,TU,WE,TH,FR,SA,SU'}]}]",Phnom Penh,11.49207,104.86225,25181759,Woori Cafe,"Hello, travelers and customers. Our cafe serves various coffees and drinks performed by certified barista and Korean food made by Korean chef. Our barista composes the machine setting every single day ^_^. We have various coffees (our signature coffee is Dangona Latte offered as same price as cafe latte), fruit/chocolate/green tea based lattes (try our signature drink, Green Cara Latte), sodas and smoothies. We also serve Korean foods with fresh ingredients by our Korean chef. Try our various Kimbap, Tteokbboki, Korean style Corndogs (sausage, mozzarella, etc.), Korean ramen, etc. You can also eat and buy Kimchi (again, lol) made by Korean chef. We also provide Food Panda, Nham24 delivery service. If you visit near Prey Sa area in Phnom Penh, stop by!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Restaurant_Review-g293940-d25181759-Reviews-Woori_Cafe-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Prey Sa Street', 'street2': 'Borey Tv Star 20 Houses', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'address_string': 'Prey Sa Street Borey Tv Star 20 Houses, Phnom Penh Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'n