Yazhou Foryou Hotel,here:pds:place:116w649e-3e98f69e5e30473285f93c74bf899aea,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Yazhou Foryou Hotel, ផ្លូវ កោះពេជ្យ, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ កោះពេជ្យ', 'postalCode': '120101'}","{'lat': 11.54397, 'lng': 104.93823}","[{'lat': 11.54427, 'lng': 104.93811}]",21749,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '11848390'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+85523921999'}]}],Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.54441,104.93849,11848390,Yazhou Foryou Hotel,"Yazhou Foryou Hotel, Phnom Penh was located in the Diamond Island of Capital Phnom Penh of Cambodia. Diamond Island was a sand island previously in Phnom Penh beside Mekong River. As the economic blooms and foreign investment attracting, Diamond Island became a modern area which became a modern area in the city, and the cover area is 3% of the total City’s cover area. Authority has planed to develop the island to be a complex center which contain real estate, golf, catering, shopping, landscaping, upscale neighborhoods and international conference center. Yazhou Foryou Hotel has different category types of garden theme rooms, and will be grand open in the early of 2016. Address: Koh Pich, No.A47,A48,A49, Sangkat Tonle Bassac , Khan Chamkamorn Phnom Penh, Cambodia.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d11848390-Reviews-Yazhou_Foryou_Hotel-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Koh Pich St', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '91999', 'address_string': 'Koh Pich St, Phnom Penh 91999 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d11848390-Yazhou_