Yeak Loam Hotel,here:pds:place:116httek-c6d3f2d925f20cdaa133336f634d3b9d,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Yeak Loam Hotel, ផ្លូវ 78 ប៊ី, 160904 បានលុង, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'រតនគីរី', 'city': 'បានលុង', 'district': 'បឹងកន្សែង', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 78 ប៊ី', 'postalCode': '160904'}","{'lat': 13.74081, 'lng': 106.98935}","[{'lat': 13.74078, 'lng': 106.98922}]",151991,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010', 'name': 'Coffee Shop'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '9765700'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515974975'}, {'value': '+85575974975', 'categories': [{'id': '100-1000-0000'}, {'id': '100-1100-0010'}, {'id': '500-5100-0000'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/yeakloamhotel', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}]}]}]",Not Available,Ratanakiri,13.740783,106.989235,9765700,Yeak Loam Hotel,"Yeakloam Hotel is located in a central of Banlung city with 9 stories which guests can view all part of city. The hotel has fully of leisure facilities such as Pool, Restaurant, Sky Bar, and Massage. On the other hand, it is just 6 km away distance from the famous attraction Yeakloam lake. Yeakloam Hotel takes its inspiration from Khmer culture and from the lively and generous spirit of the Khmer people. Our property was designed and conceptualized as a hotel that makes things simple for our guests. Our experienced staff will be happy to welcome you and help you with any requests that you might have in order to make your time with us as enjoyable and comfortable as possible. Yeakloam Hotel will delight any couple wishing to escape for a romantic getaway. In addition some of our room options will be particularly attractive to families. Our goal is to create a relaxing and comfortable environment that will result in a memorable stay.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g6387419-d9765700-Reviews-Yeak_Loam_Hotel-Krong_Ban_Lung_Ratanakiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '#1-167, Street 29', 'street2': 'Ou Kan Saeng', 'city': 'Krong Ban Lung', 'state': 'Ratanakiri Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '16452', 'address_string': '#1-167, Street 29 Ou Kan Saeng, Krong Ban Lung 16452 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Krong Ban Lung', 'location_id': '6387419'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Ratanakiri Province', 'location_id': '608457'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g6387419-d9765700-Yeak_Loam_Hotel-Krong_Ban_Lung_Ratanakiri_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '6387419', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 6 hotels in Krong Ban Lung', 'geo_location_name': 'Krong Ban Lung', 'ranking_out_of': '6', 'ranking': '1'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,22,"{'1': '1', '2': '0', '3': '2', '4': '7', '5': '12'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}}",89,https://www.tripadvis