Yi Family Homestay,here:pds:place:116w63gg-506abbe2c764498e954d5d2c400ec54f,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Yi Family Homestay, 171209 សៀមរាប, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'សៀមរាម', 'city': 'សៀមរាប', 'district': 'សៀមរាប', 'postalCode': '171209'}","{'lat': 13.31572, 'lng': 103.84811}","[{'lat': 13.31573, 'lng': 103.84797}]",86423,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '12370441'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85592822424'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.yifamilyhomestays.com', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5100-0057'}]}]}]",Not Available,Siem Reap,13.3159,103.84806,12370441,Yi Family Homestay,"Welcome to Yi Family Homestay & Bungalows Our Homestay opened its gate in 2017 with the goal of immersing visitors in a village atmosphere just minutes from Siem Reap town and Angkor Wat. We offer hygienic, secure and private accommodations for all guests, including children and pets. Accomodations range from stilt cottages, studio-sized apartments (most with kitchenettes), and cozier budget units in our traditional family home. Our homestay is also a permaculture farm operated by three generations of the Yi family. We have livestock, fruit trees, vegetable gardens and an abundance of foliage, which enhances the natural ambience as well as guests‘ privacy. Our focus on sustainable living – through solar energy, recycling and composting – demonstrates our commitment to protecting the natural treasures of Siem Reap. Our intimate knowledge of the province – and affinity with local communities – ensures we deliver time- and cost-saving services to every guest, while opening fresh pathways to the indelible spirit of one of the world’s most transformative destinations.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12370441-Reviews-Yi_Family_Homestay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'No. 174 Street 63', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '17259', 'address_string': 'No. 174 Street 63, Siem Reap 17259 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d12370441-Yi_Family_Homestay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '297390', 'ranking_string': '#173 of 644 B&Bs / Inns in Siem Reap', 'geo_location_name': 'Siem Reap', 'ranking_out_of': '644', 'ranking': '173'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/5.0-66827-5.svg,18,"{'1': '0', '2': '0', '3': '0', '4': '3', '5': '15'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss5.0.svg', 'value': '5.0'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",90,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g297390-d12370441-m66827-Reviews-Yi_Family_Homestay-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Free parking', 'Wheelchair access'