Ying Apartment & Coffee House,here:pds:place:116w649g-1f5cd1227e4c404f9a8e9de043652e70,en,accommodation,"{'label': 'Ying Apartment & Coffee House, 120706 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ឫស្សីកែវ', 'subdistrict': 'ទួលសង្កែ', 'postalCode': '120706'}","{'lat': 11.59044, 'lng': 104.90592}","[{'lat': 11.59044, 'lng': 104.90595}]",72636,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0000', 'name': 'Lodging'}]",Not available,Not Available,"[{'phone': [{'value': '+855966566665'}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://www.ying-apartment.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.588477,104.90069,12730987,Ying Apartments&Hotel,"Ying Apartments&Hotel is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Phnom Penh, offering many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay.
Nearby landmarks such as Cambodia Post Office (1.9 mi) and Sisowath Quay (2.3 mi) make Ying Apartments&Hotel a great place to stay when visiting Phnom Penh.
The small hotel offers a 24 hour front desk, to make your visit even more pleasant. The property also features a lounge. Guests arriving by vehicle have access to free parking.
While you’re here, be sure to check out some of the Italian restaurants, including Oskar Bistro, Terrazza, and Limoncello Pizzeria & Restaurant, all of which are a short distance from Ying Apartments&Hotel.
Plus, during your trip, don’t forget to check out some of the popular monuments and statues, such as Statue of King Father Norodom Sihanouk, Independence Monument, and Cambodia-Vietnam Friendship Monument.
Enjoy your stay in Phnom Penh!
