Yk Art House,here:pds:place:116aabd1-fd76a1421258036492482360d5fc3799,en,hotel,"{'label': 'Yk Art House, ផ្លូវ 830 13A, 120101 ភ្នំពេញ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'city': 'ភ្នំពេញ', 'district': 'ចម្ការមោន', 'subdistrict': 'ទន្លេបាសាក់', 'street': 'ផ្លូវ 830', 'postalCode': '120101', 'houseNumber': '13A'}","{'lat': 11.55076, 'lng': 104.93081}","[{'lat': 11.55064, 'lng': 104.93079}]",59306,"[{'id': '500-5000-0053', 'name': 'Hotel', 'primary': True}, {'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House'}, {'id': '500-5100-0058', 'name': 'Bed and Breakfast'}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '1939800'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+85561828577'}, {'value': '+85570740051', 'categories': [{'id': '500-5000-0053'}, {'id': '500-5100-0058'}]}], 'www': [{'value': 'http://ykarthouse.com'}]}]",Not Available,Phnom Penh,11.550718,104.93076,1939800,YK Art House,"Welcome to YK Art House, a small hotel in Phnom Penh that is your very special hideaway while travelling through Cambodia’s capital. After a day exploring this bustling city you can retreat to an oasis of tranquility and friendliness. You’ll enjoy our secluded setting, clean accommodation and amenities such as swimming pool, art gallery, pool table, and bar. The rooms are decorated simply and practically, with a desk in each room and good Wifi. Your stay supports Seametrey Children's Village, located an hour away from Phnom Penh.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d1939800-Reviews-YK_Art_House-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '830 13 a Street', 'street2': 'Sangkat Tonle Bassac', 'city': 'Phnom Penh', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '12000', 'address_string': '830 13 a Street Sangkat Tonle Bassac, Phnom Penh 12000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Phnom Penh', 'location_id': '293940'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g293940-d1939800-YK_Art_House-Phnom_Penh.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '293940', 'ranking_string': '#3 of 412 B&Bs / Inns in Phnom Penh', 'geo_location_name': 'Phnom Penh', 'ranking_out_of': '412', 'ranking': '3'}",4.5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/traveler/4.5-66827-5.svg,326,"{'1': '1', '2': '5', '3': '16', '4': '64', '5': '240'}","{'0': {'name': 'rate_sleep', 'localized_name': 'Sleep Quality', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '1': {'name': 'rate_location', 'localized_name': 'Location', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.0.svg', 'value': '4.0'}, '2': {'name': 'rate_room', 'localized_name': 'Rooms', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '3': {'name': 'rate_service', 'localized_name': 'Service', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '4': {'name': 'rate_value', 'localized_name': 'Value', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}, '5': {'name': 'rate_cleanliness', 'localized_name': 'Cleanliness', 'rating_image_url': 'https://static.tacdn.com/img2/ratings/traveler/ss4.5.svg', 'value': '4.5'}}",158,https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g293940-d1939800-m66827-Reviews-YK_Art_House-Phnom_Penh.html#photos,$,Not available,"['Pool', 'Internet', 'Suites', 'Free Internet', 'Wifi', 'Public Wifi', 'Free Wifi', 'Non-smoking rooms', 'Laundry Service', 'Air conditioning', 'Family Rooms', 'Multilingual Staff', 'Outdoor pool', 'Housekeeping', 'Baggage Storage', 'Bottled Water', 'Restaurant', 'Airport transportation', 'Concierge', 'Refrigerator in room', 'Non-smoking hotel', 'Breakfast Available', 'Bicycle Rental', 'Billiards', 'Car Hire', 'Desk', 'English', 'Game Room', 'Ironing Service', 'Khmer', 'Outdoor Furniture', 'Pool / Beach Towels', 'Shared Lounge / TV Area', 'S