Young Wild & Free,here:pds:place:116w611y-0556f97a31d64127b4998f3ff854fcf2,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Young Wild & Free, 090401 មណ្ឌលសីមា, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'កោះកុង', 'city': 'មណ្ឌលសីមា', 'district': 'បាក់ខ្លង', 'postalCode': '090401'}","{'lat': 11.57672, 'lng': 102.94613}","[{'lat': 11.57668, 'lng': 102.946}]",44936,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '20878639'}]","[{'phone': [{'value': '+855965602759'}], 'www': [{'value': 'https://www.facebook.com/YWFKH'}]}]",Not Available,Koh Kong,11.576806,102.94636,20878639,Young Wild & Free,"We are the ""Young Wild and Free"" beach huts, bar and restaurant, created by young spirited nomads for like-minded spirits. We offer you a lost paradise where you can enjoy the freedom. and wake up the wilderness in you. Nestle in our cozy beach huts with a sea view, sip away on our yummy cocktails by the beach and sate your hunger with our delicious daily menu made with fresh local products!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g1532269-d20878639-Reviews-Young_Wild_Free-Koh_Kong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': 'Pak Khlang Beach', 'city': 'Koh Kong', 'state': 'Koh Kong Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '09000', 'address_string': 'Pak Khlang Beach, Koh Kong 09000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Koh Kong', 'location_id': '1532269'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Koh Kong Province', 'location_id': '2366667'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g1532269-d20878639-Young_Wild_Free-Koh_Kong_Koh_Kong_Province.html?m=66827,"{'geo_location_id': '1532269', 'ranking_string': '#1 of 23 Specialty lodging in Koh Kong', 'geo_location_name': 'Koh Kong', 'ranking_out_of': '23', 'ranking': '1'}",5,https://www.tripadvisor.com/img/cdsi/img2/ratings/trav