Zana Beach Guesthouse,here:pds:place:116w3cs7-f5a1164dfad44a9ca169b3dabab433db,en,guest_house,"{'label': 'Zana Beach Guesthouse, 180404 ព្រះសីហនុ, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'city': 'ព្រះសីហនុ', 'district': 'បួន', 'postalCode': '180404'}","{'lat': 10.60815, 'lng': 103.52631}","[{'lat': 10.60806, 'lng': 103.52621}]",105114,"[{'id': '500-5100-0057', 'name': 'Guest House', 'primary': True}]",Not available,"[{'supplier': {'id': 'tripadvisor'}, 'id': '3587668'}]",[{'phone': [{'value': '+855346669777'}]}],Not Available,Preah Sihanouk,10.608239,103.52641,3587668,Zana Beach Guesthouse,"Newly open hotel in early of October 2012 located in Famous Kandal Street only 5 minutes walk to popular Occheuteal Beach. Hotel is 30 minutes drive from Sihanoukville Airport, and 60 Km to Bokor Hill Station. Offering 24-Hour front desk, Restaurant, Tours Desk, Ticket Service, Car Parking onside, Massage and Laundry Service. All rooms come with Air-conditioning or Fan feature with a private en-suite bathroom, cable TV, writing desk, large window and terrace with seating area.Restaurant serves selection of Cambodian Cuisine and Western Dish with Seafood, Room service also provided.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g325573-d3587668-Reviews-Zana_Beach_Guesthouse-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukville_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '4 Kakda Street, Group 15, Village', 'city': 'Sihanoukville', 'state': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '18000', 'address_string': '4 Kakda Street, Group 15, Village, Sihanoukville 18000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Sihanoukville', 'location_id': '325573'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Sihanoukville Province', 'location_id': '3698381'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g325573-d3587668-Zana_Beach_Guesthouse-Sihanoukville_Sihanoukvil