Zara Coffee Cambodia,here:pds:place:116w61zk-81aa3ec38d1147ad9b49dd6d4d457855,en,restaurant,"{'label': 'Zara Coffee Cambodia, 150603 ពោធិ៍សាត់, កម្ពុជា', 'countryCode': 'KHM', 'countryName': 'កម្ពុជា', 'county': 'ពោធិ៍សាត់', 'city': 'ពោធិ៍សាត់', 'district': 'ផ្ទះព្រៃ', 'postalCode': '150603'}","{'lat': 12.53345, 'lng': 103.91796}","[{'lat': 12.5334, 'lng': 103.91809}]",36688,"[{'id': '100-1000-0000', 'name': 'Restaurant', 'primary': True}]",Not available,Not Available,[{'phone': [{'value': '+85515796000'}]}],Not Available,Pursat,12.535738,103.92078,6451061,Pursat Riverside Hotel & Spa,"Pursat Riverside Hotel & Spa is an excellent choice for travelers visiting Pursat Town- Cambodia, offering a family-friendly environment alongside many helpful amenities designed to enhance your stay. You’ll enjoy relaxing rooms that offer a refrigerator and air conditioning, and you can stay connected during your stay as Pursat Riverside Hotel & Spa offers guests free wifi. The hotel features a 24 hour Front desk, a concierge, Plus, Pursat Riverside Hotel & Spa offers a tropical pool and free buffet breakfast, providing a pleasant respite from your busy day. For guests with a vehicle, free parking is available. Travelers looking for Italian restaurants can head to Pursat Pizza House. Enjoy your stay in Pursat!",https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g729356-d6451061-Reviews-Pursat_Riverside_Hotel_Spa-Pursat_Pursat_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '101 Street', 'street2': 'Peal Nhek 1 Village', 'city': 'Pursat', 'state': 'Pursat Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '15000', 'address_string': '101 Street Peal Nhek 1 Village, Pursat 15000 Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'City', 'name': 'Pursat', 'location_id': '729356'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Pursat Province', 'location_id': '2366674'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g729356-d6451061-Pursa