Villa is located near with Angkor Panorama Museum, Grace Village Church, Two Pursat Pagodas and famous Angkor Wat.

We recommend downloading and installing the PassApp Cambodia application. This is a cheap tuk tuk and car taxi service. 
Tuk Tuk for 4 pax is $18 around Angkor and extra charges $10 for Banteay Srei. 
Tuk Tuk to Old Market or Pub Street is $4 one way.",https://www.tripadvisor.com/VacationRentalReview-g297390-d19457792-Somealea_Villa_5_room-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,"{'street1': '', 'street2': '', 'city': 'Siem Reap', 'state': 'Siem Reap Province', 'country': 'Cambodia', 'postalcode': '', 'address_string': 'Siem Reap Cambodia'}","[{'level': 'Municipality', 'name': 'Siem Reap', 'location_id': '297390'}, {'level': 'Province', 'name': 'Siem Reap Province', 'location_id': '2366676'}, {'level': 'Country', 'name': 'Cambodia', 'location_id': '293939'}]",Asia/Phnom_Penh,Not available,Not available,Not available,https://www.tripadvisor.com/UserReview-g297390-d19457792-Somealea_Villa_5_room-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html?m=66827,Not available,0,Not available,Not available,Not available,{},0,https://www.tripadvisor.com/VacationRentalReview-g297390-d19457792-m66827-Somealea_Villa_5_room-Siem_Reap_Siem_Reap_Province.html#photos,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,Not available,"{'name': 'hotel', 'localized_name': 'Hotel'}","[{'name': 'vr', 'localized_name': 'vacation rentals'}]",Not available,Not available,[],"[{'name': 'business', 'localized_name': 'Business', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'couples', 'localized_name': 'Couples', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'solo', 'localized_name': 'Solo travel', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'family', 'localized_name': 'Family', 'value': '0'}, {'name': 'friends', 'localized_name': 'Friends getaway', 'value': '0'}]",[],Not available,Not available,FALSE,38,0
